w a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cycle or discard another card, scry 1.\\nCycling {U} ({U}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Flying\\n{3}{R}: Destroy target artifact. Hoard-Smelter Dragon gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that artifact's mana value.", 'Flying\\n{3}{W}{W}: Return Eternal Dragon from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only during your upkeep.\\nPlainscycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Search your library for a Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Flying\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gets +1/+0 until end of turn.\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gains first strike until end of turn.\\n{R}: Skyship Stalker gains haste until end of turn.', "Focus Beam — At the beginning of your upkeep, roll a d4. Scry X, where X is the result.\\nPerfect Illumination — Whenever you roll a die's highest natural result, draw a card.", "Goad all creatures you don't control. (Until your next turn, those creatures attack each combat if able and attack a player other than you if able.)", 'Grasslands enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}, Sacrifice Grasslands: Search your library for a Forest or Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Gruul Turf enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Gruul Turf enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {R}{G}.", 'Halimar Depths enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Halimar Depths enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library, then put them back in any order.\\n{T}: Add {U}.', 'Haste\\nAs long as Anger is in your graveyard and you control a Mountain, creatures you control have haste.', 'Haste\\nLieutenant — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control your commander, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying. That token gains haste until end of turn.', 'Haste\\n{R}, {T}: Exile target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Izzet Chemister: Cast any n