rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Because the “search” requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\'t have to find the card if you don\'t want to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The ability can be used on any player\'s attacking creatures. This includes your own and creatures in an attack you are not involved in (for multiplayer games)."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are multiple attacks in a turn, then you have to pay for each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there is more than one Propaganda on the battlefield, the cost is cumulative.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Paying this cost is not an instant or any other kind of ability, it is an additional cost on the declaration of the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The payment is made during the declare attackers step at the same time you are declaring the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'The additional mana is not an ability of the land and is not something the land can produce.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The timestamp for the "in your graveyard" ability is set at the time that this card goes to your graveyard, regardless of whether you control a Mountain at that time.\'}]', "[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'You do not have to find a plains or forest card if you do not want to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2005-08-01\', \'text\': \'A creature is "enchanted" if it has any Auras attached to it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': "You must target six different creatures. If you can\'t, you can\'t cast Hex. If some of the creatures become illegal targets before the spell resolves, Hex will still destroy the rest of them."}]', "[{'date': '2006-09-25', 'text': 'The token is put onto the battlefield under the control of the player who controls the enchanted creature, not the player who controls Verdant Embrace.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "At the time the last ability resolves, you\'ll get to play the card if a player who is currently your opponent, or a player who was your opponent at the time they left the game, has been dealt 7 damage over the course of the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "It doesn\'t matter how the opponent was dealt damage or by whom, as long as the total damage is 7 or more. You don\'t specify an opponent when you activate the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2007-10-01\', \'text\': "You\'ll get to play the card even if Spinerock Knoll wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the 7 damage was dealt."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads “[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped,” and they now have hideaway 4.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "“Hideaway N” means “When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains ‘The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\'”"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'Cycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with cycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "The cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. If the triggered ability doesn\'t resolve (due to being countered with Stifle, for example, or if all its targets have become illegal), the cycling ability will still resolve and you\'ll draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'When you cycle this card, first the cycling ability goes on the stack, then the triggered ability goes on the stack on top of it. The triggered ability will resolve before you draw a card from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can cycle this card even if there are no targets for the triggered ability. That\'s because the cycling ability itself has no targets."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': \'If this spell is copied, the copy will have the same mode as the original.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "While the spell is on the stack, treat it as though its only text is the chosen mode. The other two modes are treated as though they don\'t exist. You don\'t choose targets for those modes."}, {\'date\': \'2008-10-01\', \'text\': "You can choose a mode only if you can choose legal targets for that mode. If you can\'t choose legal targets for any of the modes, you can\'t cast the spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is a form of cycling. Any ability that triggers on a card being cycled also triggers on Plainscycling this card. Any ability that stops a cycling ability from being activated also stops Plainscycling from being activated.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Plainscycling is an activated ability. Effects that interact with activated abilities (such as Stifle or Rings of Brighthearth) will interact with Plainscycling. Effects that interact with spells (such as Remove Soul or Faerie Tauntings) will not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Unlike the normal cycling ability, Plainscycling doesn\'t allow you to draw a card. Instead, it lets you search your library for a Plains card. After you find a Plains card in your library, you reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'You can choose to find any card with the Plains land type, including nonbasic lands. You can also choose not to find a card, even if there is a Plains card in your library.\'}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'multiple instances of lifelink on the same creature are redundant. If a creature with multiple instances of lifelink deals damage, its controller still only gains life equal to the damage dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2010-03-01', 'text': 'The value of X is determined as Chain Reaction resolves.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "At the beginning of your upkeep, all delayed triggered abilities created by rebound effects trigger. You may handle them in any order. If you want to cast a card this way, you do so as part of the resolution of its delayed triggered ability. Timing restrictions based on the card\'s type (if it\'s a sorcery) are ignored. Other restrictions are not (such as the one from Rule of Law)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': \'If a replacement effect would cause a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand to be put somewhere else instead of your graveyard (such as Leyline of the Void might), you choose whether to apply the rebound effect or the other effect as the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If a spell with rebound that you cast from your hand doesn\'t resolve for any reason (due being countered by a spell like Cancel, or because all of its targets are illegal), rebound has no effect. The spell is simply put into your graveyard. You won\'t get to cast it again next turn."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If the targeted player doesn\'t sacrifice a creature (because the player didn\'t control any creatures or due to Tajuru Preserver, perhaps), you gain no life."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you are unable to cast a card from exile this way, or you choose not to, nothing happens when the delayed triggered ability resolves. The card remains exiled for the rest of the game, and you won\'t get another chance to cast the card. The same is true if the ability is countered (due to Stifle, perhaps)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a card from exile this way, it will go to your graveyard when it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won\'t go back to exile."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with rebound from anywhere other than your hand (such as from your graveyard due to Sins of the Past, from your library due to cascade, or from your opponent\'s hand due to Sen Triplets), rebound won\'t have any effect. If you do cast it from your hand, rebound will work regardless of whether you paid its mana cost (for example, if you cast it from your hand due to Maelstrom Archangel)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with rebound from your hand and it resolves, it isn\'t put into your graveyard. Rather, it\'s exiled directly from the stack. Effects that care about cards being put into your graveyard won\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "Rebound will have no effect on copies of spells because you don\'t cast them from your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2010-06-15\', \'text\': "The sacrificed creature\'s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its toughness."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', "[{'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'If you choose to find only one basic land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "The second ability destroys each creature that\'s tapped at the time it resolves, including creatures you control. If Sunblast Angel has become tapped by the time its ability resolves, it will be destroyed too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a permanent includes {X}, that X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-01\', \'text\': "If the targeted artifact is an illegal target by the time the activated ability resolves, the ability doesn\'t resolve. Hoard-Smelter Dragon won\'t get the bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If the activated ability resolves but the targeted artifact isn\'t destroyed (perhaps because it has indestructible or it regenerates), Hoard-Smelter Dragon will still get the bonus."}]', "[{'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'The second ability triggers and resolves during the declare attackers step. The target permanent will be destroyed before blockers are declared.'}, {'date': '2011-01-01', 'text': 'You may target any permanent with the triggered ability, not just one controlled by the defending player. If no other player controls a permanent, you must target one of your own.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'As long as the card remains exiled, you may still play it, even if Fiend of the Shadows leaves the battlefield or changes controllers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'If this creature deals combat damage to multiple players simultaneously, perhaps because some combat damage was redirected, its ability will trigger for each of those players.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'Playing a card exiled with Fiend of the Shadows follows all the normal rules for playing that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all timing restrictions, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "You may only play the card, meaning play it as a land or cast it as a spell. It\'s not in your hand. You can\'t discard it, activate its cycling abilities, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If you have fewer than four cards in your library, you\'ll look at all the cards there and put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The creature that entered the battlefield deals damage equal to its current power to the targeted permanent or player. If it\'s no longer on the battlefield, its last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "Warstorm Surge is the source of the ability, but the creature is the source of the damage. The ability couldn\'t target a creature with protection from red, for example. It could target a creature with protection from creatures, but all the damage would be prevented. Since damage is dealt by the creature, abilities like lifelink, deathtouch and infect are taken into account, even if the creature has left the battlefield by the time it deals damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-07-01\', \'text\': "Magmaquake doesn\'t target any creature or planeswalker. For example, it will deal damage to a creature without flying that has hexproof."}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'All Rats you control have deathtouch while Ogre Slumlord is on the battlefield, not just the ones created by Ogre Slumlord.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent\'s life total can\'t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won\'t gain any life."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The extort ability doesn\'t target any player."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "This is not the same as hexproof. If, for example, you target one of your opponent\'s creatures, your opponents won\'t be able to target their own creature with spells or abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Shielding Plax tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Abilities that Slivers grant, as well as power/toughness boosts, are cumulative. However, for some abilities, like flying, having more than one instance of the ability doesn\'t provide any additional benefit."}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "If the creature type of a Sliver changes so it\'s no longer a Sliver, it will no longer be affected by its own ability. Its ability will continue to affect other Sliver creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If the permanent is still a legal target but is not destroyed (perhaps because it regenerated or has indestructible), its controller still gets the Beast token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Beast Within tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates a Beast token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create a Beast token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won\'t trigger if that creature isn\'t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Monstrous isn\'t an ability that a creature has. It\'s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it will continue to be monstrous."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can\'t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You can activate Prognostic Sphinx\'s ability even if it\'s already tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can\'t be both black and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-07\', \'text\': "Necromantic Selection doesn\'t overwrite any of the creature\'s colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another creature type."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'An activated ability appears in the form “Cost: Effect.”\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Notably, turning a face-down creature face up isn\'t an activated ability. If you manifest a Dragon creature card or cast a Dragon creature card face down using the morph ability, you can\'t use mana generated by the last ability to turn that card face up."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The mana generated by the last ability can\'t be spent to activate abilities of Dragon sources that aren\'t on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "You can use mana generated by the last ability to pay an alternative cost (such as a dash cost) or an additional cost to cast a Dragon spell. It\'s not limited to paying just that spell\'s mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'Each Siege will have one of the two listed abilities, depending on your choice as it enters the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "Each of the last two abilities is linked to the first ability. They each refer only to the choice made as a result of the first ability. If a permanent enters the battlefield as a copy of one of the Sieges, its controller will make a new choice for that Siege. Which ability the copy has won\'t depend on the choice made for the original permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'If a noncreature card is manifested and then leaves the battlefield while face down, the “Dragons” ability will trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card using the “Khans” ability, you may play that land only if you have any available land plays. Normally, this means you can play the land only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': "The card exiled by the “Khans” ability is exiled face up. Playing a card exiled with the “Khans” ability follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if it\'s a creature card, you can cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2014-11-24\', \'text\': \'The words “Khans” and “Dragons” are anchor words, connecting your choice to the appropriate ability. Anchor words are a new rules concept. “[Anchor word] — [Ability]” means “As long as you chose [anchor word] as this permanent entered the battlefield, this permanent has [ability].” Notably, the anchor word “Dragons” has no connection to the creature type Dragon.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t play will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'Playing a card this way follows the normal rules for playing the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Under normal circumstances, you can play a land card exiled with Commune with Lava only if you haven\'t played a land yet that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Dragonlord\'s Servant can\'t reduce the colored mana requirement of a Dragon spell you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "If there are any additional costs to cast a Dragon spell, apply those before applying Dragonlord\'s Servant and any other cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': \'The ability can apply to alternative costs to cast a Dragon spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "The mana produced by Haven of the Spirit Dragon\'s second ability can be used to pay for any additional or alternative costs (such as dash costs) involved in casting a Dragon creature spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "This mana won\'t empty from your mana pool as steps and phases end for the remainder of the turn even if Savage Ventmaw leaves the battlefield during the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-02-25\', \'text\': "Thunderbreak Regent\'s ability will resolve before the spell or ability that caused it to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A land that becomes a creature may be affected by “summoning sickness.” You can\'t attack with it or use any of its {T} abilities (including its mana abilities) unless it began your most recent turn on the battlefield under your control. Note that summoning sickness cares about when that permanent came under your control, not when it became a creature nor when it entered the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "An ability that turns a land into a creature also sets that creature\'s power and toughness. If the land was already a creature (for example, if it was the target of a spell with awaken), this will overwrite the previous effect that set its power and toughness. Effects that modify its power or toughness will continue to apply no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for counters that change its power or toughness (such as +1/+1 counters) and effects that switch its power and toughness. For example, if Lumbering Falls has been made a 0/0 creature with three +1/+1 counters on it, activating its last ability will turn it into a 6/6 creature that\'s still a land."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'This land is colorless until the last ability gives it colors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "When a land becomes a creature, that doesn\'t count as having a creature enter the battlefield. The permanent was already on the battlefield; it only changed its types. Abilities that trigger whenever a creature enters the battlefield won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t cast will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'Casting a card this way follows the normal rules for casting the card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if one of the cards is a creature card, you can cast that card only during your main phase while the stack is empty.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Exiling all the cards from your library this way won\'t cause you to lose the game. You\'ll lose only if you attempt to draw a card from an empty library."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery card this way, it will go to your graveyard after it resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered. It won\'t return to exile."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The cards are exiled face up.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you activate Gryff\'s Boon\'s last ability and the target creature becomes an illegal target in response, the ability doesn\'t resolve and Gryff\'s Boon remains in your graveyard."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Forest or Plains is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Fortified Village, you may reveal the other land to have Fortified Village enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Fortified Village onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Fortified Village itself is neither a Forest nor a Plains, even though it produces green and white mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Fortified Village."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Mountain or Forest is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Game Trail, you may reveal the other land to have Game Trail enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Game Trail onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Game Trail itself is neither a Mountain nor a Forest, even though it produces red and green mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Game Trail."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If a Plains or Island is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Port Town, you may reveal the other land to have Port Town enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Port Town onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Port Town itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, even though it produces white and blue mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Canopy Vista from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Port Town."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an Island or Swamp is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as Choked Estuary, you may reveal the other land to have Choked Estuary enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to put Choked Estuary onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Lands don\'t have a subtype just because they can produce mana of the corresponding color. Choked Estuary itself is neither an Island nor a Swamp, even though it produces blue and black mana, so you can\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land. For example, you could reveal Prairie Stream from the Battle for Zendikar set to satisfy the ability of Choked Estuary."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': "The enchanted land retains any other abilities it has. Activating one of the land\'s activated abilities won\'t cause the other(s) to be activated."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'At the time the permanent becomes enchanted, Imprisoned in the Moon causes it to lose all abilities except the noted mana ability. Any abilities the permanent gains after that point will work normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "Becoming a land may cause other Auras to become illegally attached. These are put into their owner\'s graveyard, and any Equipment attached to the land become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Counters on the land remain on it even if they don\'t do anything."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If the enchanted permanent is a land and has land types, it retains those types even though it loses any intrinsic mana abilities associated with them. For example, a Plains enchanted by Imprisoned in the Moon is still a Plains, but it can\'t tap for {W}, only for {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If you remove Imprisoned in the Moon from a planeswalker after tapping it for mana, you can still activate a loyalty ability of that planeswalker even though it\'s tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'The permanent will keep any supertypes it previously had. Notably, if Imprisoned in the Moon is enchanting a legendary permanent, that permanent will continue to be legendary.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If more than one player discards a card with madness simultaneously, the player whose turn it is puts their madness abilities onto the stack first, then each other player does the same in turn order. The last one put onto the stack resolves first, and a spell cast this way will resolve before resolving the next madness ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "When you activate Geier Reach Sanitarium\'s last ability, first each player draws a card. Then the player whose turn it is selects a card from their hand and sets it aside without revealing it; proceeding in turn order, each other player does the same. Then the cards that were set aside are discarded at once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Abilities that trigger whenever you “become the monarch” trigger only if you aren\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. “At the beginning of the monarch\'s end step, that player draws a card” and “Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch.”"}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "The last ability of Skyline Despot checks to see if you\'re the monarch as your upkeep begins. If you\'re not, the ability won\'t trigger at all. You won\'t be able to do anything that would make you the monarch during your upkeep in time to have that ability trigger. The ability will also check to see if you\'re the monarch as it tries to resolve. If you\'re not the monarch at that time, the ability will have no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Artifact tokens that are sacrificed or destroyed are put into their owner\'s graveyard before ceasing to exist. If you controlled the token, Marionette Master\'s last ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Fabricate doesn\'t cause the creature with the ability to enter the battlefield with +1/+1 counters already on it. For example, Weaponcraft Enthusiast will enter the battlefield as a 0/1 creature, then its fabricate ability goes on the stack. Players may take actions (such as casting instants) while the ability is waiting to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master and an artifact you control are put into a graveyard at the same time, Marionette Master\'s ability triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If Marionette Master\'s power is negative, the target opponent doesn\'t lose (or gain) life."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put +1/+1 counters on the creature for any reason as fabricate resolves (for instance, if it\'s no longer on the battlefield), you just create Servo tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The amount of life lost is determined as Marionette Master\'s last ability resolves. If Marionette Master is no longer on the battlefield, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much life is lost."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You choose whether to put +1/+1 counters on the creature or create Servo tokens as the fabricate ability is resolving. No player may take actions between the time you choose and the time that counters are added or tokens are created.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'A permanent with more than one type may be chosen as either of the types or both. For example, an artifact creature may be chosen as the artifact, the creature, or both. Choosing the same permanent twice this way has the same result as choosing it once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Cataclysmic Gearhulk will be sacrificed to its own ability if you don\'t choose it as your artifact or your creature."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'First the player whose turn it is chooses permanents they control, then each other player in turn order does the same. Each player will know the choices made by players who chose before them. All of the unchosen nonland permanents are then sacrificed simultaneously.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control any permanents of one of the types, you\'ll still choose the permanents of the types you do control."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Lands can\'t be chosen and won\'t be sacrificed, even if they have other types (such as an artifact land)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gonti doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the card remains exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast that card (and spend mana as though it were mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can\'t look at or cast the card, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless. Snow mana is not a type of mana. Gonti, Lord of Luxury won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell\'s first effect won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'re done casting your free spell. They\'re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Effects that allow you to "cast" a card don\\\'t allow you to play a land card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If you control no creatures with power greater than 0 as Rishkar\'s Expertise resolves, you draw no cards, but you may cast a card with mana value 5 or less from your hand without paying its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "The greatest power among creatures you control is determined as Rishkar\'s Expertise resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While you\'re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner\'s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can\'t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "You may cast one of the cards drawn by Rishkar\'s Expertise\'s first effect while performing its second effect."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Explore\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Explore resolves; Explore fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps a land you\'ll play later."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Explore when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw a card when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Explores in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Urban Evolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If the creature exiled with Vanish into Memory isn\'t a creature card (for example, a crewed Vehicle), that card will still be returned to the battlefield, but not as a creature. Since the card returned to the battlefield has no toughness, you discard no cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If the creature exiled with Vanish into Memory never returns to the battlefield (because it was a token creature, for example), you don\'t discard any cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Vanish into Memory cares about the creature\'s power just before it left the battlefield and its toughness just after it returns to the battlefield. For example, if you target a 2/2 creature with two +1/+1 counters on it, you\'ll draw four cards, then when it returns to the battlefield without any counters on it, you\'ll discard two cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Phantasmal Image enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If Phantasmal Image somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, Phantasmal Image can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is a token, Phantasmal Image copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Phantasmal Image is not a token in this case.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Phantasmal Image), then Phantasmal Image enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Phantasmal Image copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below) and it gains the Illusion creature type and the triggered ability. It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'The Illusion creature type and the triggered ability that Phantasmal Image gains as part of its copy effect are both copiable values that other effects may copy.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers whenever you discard a card doesn\'t give you permission to discard cards. You\'ll need another effect that instructs or allows you to discard them."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers whenever you “cycle or discard” a card triggers only once if you cycle a card. The ability “Whenever you discard a card” is functionally identical to this ability; cycling is mentioned for clarity.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'If a player discards a card during their cleanup step due to having too many cards in hand, any appropriate abilities that trigger on discarding that card trigger. If this happens, those triggered abilities are put onto the stack and players receive priority in that cleanup step to cast spells or activate abilities (normally, no players may take actions during a cleanup step). Another cleanup step is created following that one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'For each card with eternalize, a corresponding game play supplement token can be found in some Hour of Devastation booster packs. These supplements are not required to play with cards with eternalize; you can use the same items to represent an eternalized token as you would any other token.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If a creature card with eternalize is put into your graveyard during your main phase, you\'ll have priority immediately afterward. You can activate its eternalize ability before any player can try to exile it, such as with Crook of Condemnation, if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If the card copied by the token had any “when [this permanent] enters the battlefield” abilities, then the token also has those abilities and will trigger them when it\'s created. Similarly, any “as [this permanent] enters the battlefield” or “[this permanent] enters the battlefield with” abilities that the token has copied will also work."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated an eternalize ability, the card is immediately exiled. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "The token copies exactly what was printed on the original card and nothing else, except the characteristics specifically modified by eternalize. It doesn\'t copy any information about the object the card was before it was put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The token is a Zombie in addition to its other types and is black instead of its other colors. Its base power and toughness are 4/4. It has no mana cost, and thus its mana value is 0. These are copiable values of the token that other effects may copy.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Use Champion of Wits\'s power as the first ability resolves to determine if you want to use the ability and how many cards you draw if you do. If you use the ability, you discard two cards regardless of how many cards you draw. If Champion of Wits leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, use its last known power."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "A player is attacking another player if they control a creature that\'s attacking that player. If no creatures are attacking the enchanted player as a Curse\'s ability resolves (most likely because they\'ve left the battlefield), only the Curse\'s controller performs its actions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Each Curse\'s ability triggers only once, no matter how many creatures are attacking the enchanted player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you enchant yourself with one of these Curses, you\'ll get its effects whenever another player attacks you."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "The triggered ability of these Curses won\'t trigger if only a planeswalker controlled by the enchanted player is attacked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Creatures that enter the battlefield after Disrupt Decorum resolves won\'t be goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you reveal your entire library and reveal fewer than X creature cards of the chosen type, you\'ll put the cards of the chosen type that you did reveal onto the battlefield and shuffle your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose multiple creature types, such as “Cat Warrior.” A Cat Warrior is both a Cat and a Warrior. It\'s affected by anything that affects either type and unaffected by things that affect non-Cat or non-Warrior creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You must choose an existing creature type, such as Vampire or Cat. Card types such as “artifact” can\'t be chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'"Artifact" isn\\\'t a creature type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "Compare the revealed cards to the creature as it last existed before it died, not to the creature card as it exists in its owner\'s graveyard, to determine which one you put into your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If Heirloom Blade leaves the battlefield at the same time that the equipped creature dies, its triggered ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature has no creature type, no card can share a creature type with it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t reveal a creature card that shares a type with the creature that died, you\'ll just reveal and randomize your library."}, {\'date\': \'2017-08-25\', \'text\': "You\'ll reveal cards until you find one that shares at least one creature type with the creature that died. For example, if a Cat Wizard dies, you\'ll stop if you reveal a Human Wizard or Cat Soldier."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Hostage Taker has received errata to prevent it from targeting itself. The correct Oracle wording appears above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield. You can\'t cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If it\'s still in exile, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Hostage Taker\'s owner leaves the game while the card is still exiled and another player owns that card, the exiled card will return to the battlefield under its owner\'s control. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spell or permanent cards you control from Hostage Taker\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the exiled card, it\'s considered a new object. You\'ll control that spell and the permanent that spell becomes even if Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If Rile targets a creature with 1 toughness, that creature won\'t be destroyed until after you\'ve drawn a card. Its abilities may affect that draw or trigger on that draw if appropriate."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'If the damage that would be dealt by Rile is prevented, the creature still gains trample until end of turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Rile resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t draw a card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a Dragon entering the battlefield causes Scourge of Valkas\'s ability to trigger but leaves the battlefield before that ability resolves, that Dragon still deals damage."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'The amount of damage dealt by the Dragon that entered the battlefield is based on the number of Dragons you control when the ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If some of the creatures or players are illegal targets as Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability tries to resolve, the original division of damage still applies and the damage that would have been dealt to the illegal targets is lost. It won\'t be dealt instead to a legal target."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "You choose how many targets Bogardan Hellkite\'s triggered ability has and how the damage is divided as you put the ability onto the stack. Each target must receive at least 1 damage."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Nimbus Maze\'s last two abilities check the subtypes of lands you control, not their names. You can activate the appropriate abilities as long as you control a land with the corresponding subtype, Plains or Island. Most nonbasic lands don\'t have basic land types, even if they produce colored mana. For example, Nimbus Maze itself is neither a Plains nor an Island, while Hallowed Fountain is both."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "A permanent is any object on the battlefield, including tokens and lands. Spells and emblems aren\'t permanents."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Ascend on a permanent isn\'t a triggered ability and doesn\'t use the stack. Players can respond to a spell that will give you your tenth permanent, but they can\'t respond to getting the city\'s blessing once you control that tenth permanent. This means that if your tenth permanent is a land you play, players can\'t respond before you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing until it resolves. Players may respond to that spell by trying to change whether you get the city\'s blessing."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you control ten permanents but don\'t control a permanent or resolving spell with ascend, you don\'t get the city\'s blessing. For example, if you control ten permanents, lose control of one, then cast Golden Demise, you won\'t have the city\'s blessing and the spell will affect creatures you control."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If your tenth permanent enters the battlefield and then a permanent leaves the battlefield immediately afterwards (most likely due to the “Legend Rule” or due to being a creature with 0 toughness), you get the city\'s blessing before it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Once you have the city\'s blessing, you have it for the rest of the game, even if you lose control of some or all of your permanents. The city\'s blessing isn\'t a permanent itself and can\'t be removed by any effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If Dead Man\'s Chest and the enchanted creature are both put into graveyards at the same time, the last ability of Dead Man\'s Chest still triggers."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "If you gain control of the enchanted creature, Dead Man\'s Chest will be put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Dead Man\'s Chest\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "The effect of Dead Man\'s Chest doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "To determine how many cards to exile, use the enchanted creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "You are a creature\'s owner if the card representing it began the game in your deck, or if it\'s a token that entered the battlefield under your control. If Dead Man\'s Chest enchants a creature that you own but an opponent controls, you\'ll exile cards from your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "The effect of Dire Fleet Daredevil doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Riverwise Augur\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "Any of the cards you don\'t cast will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'The last ability of Izzet Chemister only lets you cast cards exiled by that card. If Izzet Chemister leaves the battlefield before you activate that ability, the exiled cards are lost forever.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You cast the exiled cards one at a time in any order. Later spells can target ones you cast earlier. None of the spells resolve until after you\'re done casting them all."}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You must cast any of the exiled cards you wish to cast while Izzet Chemister\'s last ability is resolving. You can\'t cast them later in the turn. A sorcery cast this way will be cast at a time you normally wouldn\'t be able to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Rancor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so it won\'t be put into a graveyard from the battlefield and its ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': \'If another creature dies at the same time as Murder of Crows, its last ability triggers.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "You can\'t do anything in between drawing a card and discarding a card, including casting or cycling the card you drew."}]', "[{'date': '2018-03-16', 'text': 'You draw three cards and put two cards back all while Brainstorm is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Dark-Dweller Oracle doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the exiled card, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You can sacrifice Dark-Dweller Oracle to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor has indestructible, lethal damage and effects that try to destroy it simply have no effect. Totem armor won\'t do anything because it won\'t have to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor would be destroyed by multiple state-based actions at the same time (most likely because a creature with deathtouch has dealt damage to that creature greater than or equal to its toughness) totem armor\'s effect will replace all of them and save the creature."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If a permanent you control is enchanted with multiple Auras that have totem armor, and the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, one of those Auras is destroyed instead — but only one of them. You choose which one because you control the enchanted permanent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability (such as Akroma\'s Vengeance) would destroy both an Aura with totem armor and the permanent it\'s enchanting at the same time, totem armor\'s effect will save the enchanted permanent from being destroyed. Instead, the spell or ability will destroy the Aura in two different ways at the same time, but the result is the same as destroying it once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability says that it would “destroy” a permanent enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, that spell or ability is what causes the Aura to be destroyed instead. Totem armor doesn\'t destroy the Aura; rather, it changes the effects of the spell or ability. On the other hand, if a spell or ability deals lethal damage to a creature enchanted with an Aura that has totem armor, the game rules regarding lethal damage cause the Aura to be destroyed, not that spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor has no effect if the enchanted permanent is put into a graveyard for any other reason, such as if it\'s sacrificed, if the “legend rule” applies to it, or if its toughness is 0 or less."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is applied no matter why the enchanted permanent would be destroyed: because it\'s been dealt lethal damage, or because it\'s being affected by an effect that says to “destroy” it (such as Putrefy). In either case, all damage is removed from the permanent and the Aura is destroyed instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is mandatory. If the enchanted permanent would be destroyed, you must remove all damage from it (if it has any) and destroy the Aura that has totem armor instead."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Totem armor\'s effect is not regeneration. Specifically, if totem armor\'s effect is applied, the enchanted permanent does not become tapped and is not removed from combat as a result. Effects that say the enchanted permanent can\'t be regenerated (as Putrefy does) won\'t prevent totem armor\'s effect from being applied."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves, you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your upkeep begins, Colossal Majesty\'s ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The creature with power 4 or greater that you control as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves doesn\'t have to be the same creature with power 4 or greater that was under your control as the ability triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You draw only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control your commander as the lieutenant ability resolves, you won\'t get its effect."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you have multiple commanders, you need to control only one for the lieutenant effect to happen.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'The lieutenant effect happens only once each combat, even if you somehow control multiple commanders (perhaps because you have two commanders with a partner ability from the Battlebond™ set).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apex of Power doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an effect copies Apex of Power, the copy wasn\'t cast at all, so you won\'t add ten mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the opponent exiles their entire library without exiling an instant or sorcery card, that player stops exiling cards, and the exiled cards are put into their library in a random order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the exiled instant or sorcery card, it\'s put on the bottom of that library with the other cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you wish to cast the exiled card, you must cast it while Chaos Wand\\\'s ability is resolving. You can\\\'t cast it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn\\\'t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as "Cast this spell only during combat") are enforced.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The opponent stops exiling cards as soon as they exile any instant or sorcery card. You don\'t choose which card type to look for."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "As Plaguecrafter\'s ability resolves, first the player whose turn it is chooses a creature or planeswalker they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen permanents are sacrificed at the same time. Next, each player in the same order who couldn\'t sacrifice a permanent chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then the chosen cards are discarded at the same time."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Each player chooses a permanent to sacrifice from among the creatures and planeswalkers they control. You don\'t choose which type of permanent any other player has to sacrifice."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Plaguecrafter can be the creature its controller sacrifices for its own ability. Don\'t be like Plaguecrafter; always wear personal protective equipment when performing dangerous work."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "A card\'s spectacle cost is the same no matter how much life your opponents lost or how many opponents lost life."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play a card exiled this way, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if an opponent loses life and later that turn leaves the game, you can cast a spell for its spectacle cost. (If a player leaves the game during their turn, that turn continues without an active player.)\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Light Up the Stage doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Spectacle doesn\'t change when you can cast the card. For example, you can\'t cast a sorcery with spectacle during an opponent\'s turn unless another effect allows you to do so, even if that player has lost life this turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as a spectacle cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'Damage dealt to a player causes that player to lose that much life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, if an opponent loses life during your turn and then leaves the game, you can play cards exiled with Theater of Horrors.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Theater of Horrors doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards during your turn. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}]', "[{'date': '2019-05-03', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'Throes of Chaos does nothing as it resolves. All of its chaos happens before it resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "When a spell you cast with retrace resolves or is countered, it\'s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Colossus Hammer can be attached to a creature that didn\'t have flying to begin with. It just won\'t lose flying."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'If an ability of the equipped creature states that it has flying "as long as" a particular condition is true, that condition becoming true will not cause that creature to gain flying. For example, if the equipped creature "has flying as long as it\\\'s attacking," it will not gain flying, even if it attacks after Colossus Hammer becomes attached to it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': \'If the equipped creature gains flying after Colossus Hammer became attached to it, it will keep flying.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If you cast Ignite the Future from a zone other than a graveyard, you must pay the mana cost or an alternative cost for each spell cast this way. If you cast Ignite the Future from a graveyard, you may choose to cast each spell for its mana cost, an alternative cost, or without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs and not pay that cost. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Momentous Fall, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play some or all of the exiled cards, those cards remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Ignite the Future doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "An adventurer card is a creature card in every zone except the stack, as well as while on the stack if not cast as an Adventure. Ignore its alternative characteristics in those cases. For example, while it\'s in your graveyard, Giant Killer is a white creature card whose mana value is 1. It can\'t be the target of the triggered ability of Mystic Sanctuary."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting a card as an Adventure isn\'t casting it for an alternative cost. Effects that allow you to cast a spell for an alternative cost or without paying its mana cost may allow you to apply those to the Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If a spell is cast as an Adventure, its controller exiles it instead of putting it into its owner\'s graveyard as it resolves. For as long as it remains exiled, that player may cast it as a creature spell. If an Adventure spell leaves the stack in any way other than resolving (most likely by being countered or by failing to resolve because its targets have all become illegal), that card won\'t be exiled and the spell\'s controller won\'t be able to cast it as a creature later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an adventurer card ends up in exile for any other reason than by exiling itself while resolving, it won\'t give you permission to cast it as a creature spell."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an effect copies an Adventure spell, that copy is exiled as it resolves. It ceases to exist as a state-based action; it\'s not possible to cast the copy as a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose the alternative Adventure name. Consider only the alternative characteristics to determine whether that is an appropriate name to choose.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If an object becomes a copy of an object that has an Adventure, the copy also has an Adventure. If it changes zones, it will either cease to exist (if it\'s a token) or cease to be a copy (if it\'s a nontoken permanent), and so you won\'t be able to cast it as an Adventure."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you cast an adventurer card as an Adventure, use only its alternative characteristics to determine whether it\'s legal to cast that spell. For example, if Giant Killer is exiled with the last ability of Vivien, Champion of the Wilds, you can\'t cast it as Chop Down."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "When casting a spell as an Adventure, use the alternative characteristics and ignore all of the card\'s normal characteristics. The spell\'s color, mana cost, mana value, and so on are determined by only those alternative characteristics. If the spell leaves the stack, it immediately resumes using its normal characteristics."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions for the creature spell you cast from exile. Normally, you\'ll be able to cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until the damage is removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a creature may become lethal if Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to it during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Festive Funeral, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the affected creature gains an ability after Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to it, it will keep that ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the creature Kenrith\'s Transformation would enchant is an illegal target by the time the Aura spell resolves, the entire spell doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation may enchant a permanent that is only temporarily a creature, such as Enchanted Carriage. If this happens, the Aura\'s effect causes the enchanted permanent to remain a green Elk creature even after the temporary effect expires."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation overwrites all colors and creature types the enchanted creature has. It\'s just a green Elk. The creature keeps any supertypes (such as legendary) it has, but loses any other card types it has (such as artifact)."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Kenrith\'s Transformation overwrites all previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Kenrith\'s Transformation becomes attached to a creature will overwrite this effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Opportunistic Dragon leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, your opponent keeps control of their Human or artifact, it doesn\'t lose any abilities, and it can still attack or block as normal. You don\'t gain control of it at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If another player gains control of the permanent Opportunistic Dragon has kidnapped, that permanent doesn\'t regain its abilities and still can\'t attack or block."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If the stolen permanent normally has any abilities that would trigger when Opportunistic Dragon dies, those abilities won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Opportunistic Dragon\'s effect doesn\'t expire if another player gains control of it or if it loses all abilities. The effect only expires once it\'s no longer on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted by Chittering Witch\'s triggered ability."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can sacrifice Chittering Witch to pay the cost of its last ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The control-change effect of Piper of the Swarm\'s last ability lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn\'t expire if Piper of the Swarm leaves the battlefield. In a multiplayer game, it does expire if you leave the game."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a creature becomes the target of a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a spell targets Tectonic Giant more than once, its ability triggers only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card that you chose, it remains in exile with the card you didn\'t choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t play it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "Tectonic Giant doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "You choose which of the exiled cards you\'ll be able to play while the ability is resolving. You can\'t wait to pick one later. The other card remains in exile."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of double strike on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain double strike."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Being goaded more than once by the same player is redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents who hasn\'t goaded it. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped or having come under that player\'s control that turn), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "If a goaded creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than a player who goaded it if able. It the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack an opposing planeswalker (controlled by any opponent) or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'If you goad a creature you control, it must attack and it must attack a player rather than a planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Psychic Impetus causes you to scry 2, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Shiny Impetus causes you to create a Treasure token, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "A planeswalker with indestructible still loses loyalty counters as it\'s dealt damage and will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard if its loyalty reaches 0."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The set of permanents affected by Heroic Intervention is determined as the spell resolves. Permanents you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain hexproof and indestructible."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "A battle with indestructible still loses defense counters as it\'s dealt damage. If it\'s a Siege, it will still be exiled when the last defense counter is removed from it, and its controller may still cast it transformed without paying its mana cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If a creature is entering the battlefield under your control, consider static abilities to determine whether its power is 4 or greater. Spells, activated abilities, and triggered abilities can\'t be used to raise the creature\'s power in time to have Garruk\'s Uprising\'s last ability trigger or to lower it in time to stop it from triggering."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater immediately after Garruk\'s Uprising enters the battlefield, its first ability won\'t trigger. If you don\'t control one as the ability resolves, you don\'t draw a card. They don\'t have to be the same creature both times, however."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once the last ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has triggered, lowering the power of the creature won\'t stop you from drawing a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The first ability of Garruk\'s Uprising has you draw just one card, no matter how many creatures you control with power 4 or greater."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Obsessive Stitcher can\'t be the target of its last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You draw a card and discard a card all while Obsessive Stitcher\'s first ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "After you draw cards while Shamanic Revelation is resolving, nothing else can happen before you gain the appropriate amount of life. Notably, abilities that trigger when you draw cards won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'ve gained life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Because targets are chosen before costs are paid, Doomed Necromancer can\'t be the target of its own ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have three cards in hand when instructed to discard three cards, you discard your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Use the sacrificed creature\'s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how many cards you draw."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You draw and discard cards all while Greater Good\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Masterwork of Ingenuity enters the battlefield unattached. It doesn\'t enter attached to the same creature as the Equipment it copies."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Once the equip {0} ability is activated, causing Puresteel Paladin to leave the battlefield or causing its controller to control fewer than three artifacts won\'t stop the equip ability from resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You may still activate the Equipment\'s other equip abilities if you wish."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "As Victimize resolves, you must sacrifice a creature if able. You can\'t change your mind and choose not to sacrifice anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the targeted creature cards is an illegal target (for instance, because it has left your graveyard before Victimize resolves), you\'ll still sacrifice a creature and put the other card onto the battlefield. If both are illegal targets, Victimize won\'t resolve. You won\'t sacrifice a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The creature you sacrifice isn\'t chosen until Victimize resolves. You can\'t return the creature you sacrifice because it will still be on the battlefield at the time targets are chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "You must choose two targets. You can\'t cast Victimize targeting only one creature card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Angelic Gift tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Commander\'s Sphere\'s first ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile. They can\'t be cast on later turns, even if Etali attacks again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature cast this way can\'t attack during the same combat as Etali, even if it has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If an exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast any of the exiled cards, you do so as part of the resolution of the triggered ability. You can\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing permissions based on a card\'s type are ignored, and the spells resolve before blockers are declared."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you cast more than one of the exiled cards, you choose the order in which to cast them. A spell you cast this way can be the target of a later spell you cast this way. However, permanent spells cast this way won\'t resolve until you\'re done casting spells, so the permanents they become can\'t be the target of spells cast this way. For example, if you exile Twincast and Lightning Strike, you can cast Lightning Strike and then cast Twincast targeting it; but if you exile a creature card and an Aura card, you can\'t cast that Aura targeting that creature."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Etali\'s ability are exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the creature\'s power is negative, you still add its power and toughness to determine how much life is lost. If that total is negative, its controller doesn\'t gain or lose any life. For example, Phthisis destroying a -1/3 creature would cause a loss of 2 life. Pthisis destroying a -4/3 creature would cause no loss of life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Phthisis tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. No player loses life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "As the second triggered ability resolves, you must cast the card if able. You must do so even if it requires targets and the only legal targets are ones that you really don\'t want to target. Timing permissions based on the card\'s type are ignored."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a “suspended card,” that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” such as with suspend, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that causes you to cast the card when the last time counter is removed. If you cast a creature spell this way, it gains haste until you lose control of that creature (or, in rare cases, you lose control of the creature spell while it\'s on the stack)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You are never forced to activate mana abilities to pay costs, so if there is a mandatory additional mana cost (such as from Thalia, Guardian of Thraben), you can decline to activate mana abilities to pay for it and hence fail to cast the suspended card, leaving it in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Mulldrifter\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Mulldrifter."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you pay the evoke cost, you can have Shriekmaw\'s own triggered ability resolve before the evoke triggered ability. You can cast spells after that ability resolves but before you have to sacrifice Shriekmaw."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an evoke cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined by only its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast that spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'“Flashback [cost]” means “You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost” and “If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack.”\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Paying for echo is always optional. When the echo triggered ability resolves, if you can\'t pay the echo cost or choose not to, you sacrifice that permanent."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Your permanent\'s echo ability will trigger at the beginning of your upkeep if it entered the battlefield since the beginning of your last upkeep, or if you gained control of it since the beginning of your last upkeep."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions. For example, Wild-Magic Sorcerer\'s mana value is always 4."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Due to a recent rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "However, if you cast a spell from exile and then later that turn Wild-Magic Sorcerer comes under your control, Wild-Mage Sorcerer won\'t give cascade to any other spell you cast from exile that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Wild-Magic Sorcerer, the first spell you cast from exile will have that many instances of cascade, each of which will trigger separately.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If, while resolving the cascade ability from the first spell you cast from exile in a turn, you cascade into a second Wild-Magic Sorcerer, the spell will not cascade again.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The first spell you cast from exile each turn will have cascade, even if it\'s not the first spell you\'ve cast that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "All creatures are chosen and sacrificed before the die is rolled. You don\'t get to see what the result of the die roll is before choosing which creature to sacrifice."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player sacrifices their commander this way, they won\'t be able to choose whether to put it into the command zone until after Danse Macabre has finished resolving. Notably, this means that the sacrificed commander is a legal choice for the spell\'s controller to return to the battlefield. If they choose it this way, it will stay on the battlefield under their control."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Starting with you and continuing in turn order, each player will choose which creature they will sacrifice. They will know the choices made by players before them in this order when they make that choice. The creatures are all sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You add only the toughness of the creature you sacrificed this way, not the toughness of any creatures your opponent sacrificed. If you didn\'t sacrifice a creature this way, you will still roll a d20, but you will not add anything to the roll."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "As Nihiloor\'s first triggered ability resolves, you choose up to one creature for each opponent, and tap them all at the same time. Then, a separate triggered ability is put on the stack for each creature you tapped this way. Those abilities are placed on the stack in the order you choose. If tapping those creature caused any other abilities you control to trigger, those are also placed on the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Both the tapped creature\'s power and the target creature\'s power are checked both as you put the ability on the stack and as the ability resolves in order to make sure the target is legal."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Nihiloor leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves or before its reflexive triggered abilities resolve, then you won\'t gain control of any creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a creature you tapped for Nihiloor\'s ability is somehow no longer tapped as the reflexive triggered ability resolves, that ability will still resolve and you will still gain control of the target as long as it has less power than the creature you tapped."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the tapped creature is no longer on the battlefield as the trigger resolves, use its last existence on the battlefield to determine whether the target is still legal as the ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "As the enters-the-battlefield ability is resolving, any targets that couldn\'t be legally attached to the creature enchanted by Mantle of the Ancients stay in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Mantle of the Ancients becomes attached to a different creature in response to its enters-the-battlefield ability, the creature it\\\'s attached to as that ability is resolving is the "enchanted creature," even though you used the original enchanted creature to choose targets. This means some of those targets may become illegal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Mantle of the Ancients leaves the battlefield before its enters-the-battlefield ability resolves, the last permanent it was attached to before leaving the battlefield is the "enchanted creature" (even if that permanent is no longer a creature).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Mantle of the Ancients has received an update to its Oracle text. The official text is listed above. Specifically, you may only choose Aura and Equipment cards in your graveyard that could be legally attached to the creature enchanted by Mantle of the Ancients.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Assigning the creature\'s damage as though it weren\'t blocked is all or nothing. You can\'t use this effect to assign some of the creature\'s damage to a blocking creature and the rest to the defending player or planeswalker."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Even if it assigns damage as though it were not blocked, it will still receive damage from creatures that are blocking it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Bag of Devouring\'s first ability is a triggered ability that happens when you sacrifice permanents, but you can\'t just sacrifice permanents whenever you want. You need to have some other means to do so, such as activating Bag of Devouring\'s second ability."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the card you sacrifice isn\'t still in the graveyard as the first ability resolves, it won\'t be exiled. It won\'t be a card exiled with Bag of Devouring for the third ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Belt of Giant Strength will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify the equipped creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Cards you don\'t cast this way, including any exiled land cards, will remain in exile indefinitely."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards exiled with Fevered Suspicion as it is resolving. If you choose not to cast them, you cannot cast them later.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You may cast the exiled cards in any order, not just the order they were exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Casting Ride the Avalanche doesn\'t require a target. As you put the delayed triggered ability on the stack after casting your next spell, you choose the target creature, if any."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Copies of Hellish Rebuke that weren\'t cast will give opponents permanents the ability, but that ability won\'t do anything because no player cast that copy of Hellish Rebuke."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a player casts more than one Hellish Rebuke in a turn, permanents will gain multiple instances of the triggered ability. Each will trigger and resolve separately. For instance, if you cast Hellish Rebuke twice, each permanent which damaged you will cause its controller to lose 4 life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes another player to gain control of Hellish Rebuke while it is on the stack, permanents controlled by the opponents of that player will gain the ability (probably including permanents you control). However, you\'re still the player that cast Hellish Rebuke, so the ability will trigger whenever one of those permanents deals damage to you, not the player who controlled Hellish Rebuke as it resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If more than one player casts Hellish Rebuke in a turn, some permanents will gain multiple instances of the triggered ability that refer to different players. Each will trigger only for the player who cast the Hellish Rebuke that granted it the ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "When the triggered ability that Hellish Rebuke grants permanents resolves, if that permanent\'s controller can\'t sacrifice it, they will still lose 2 life. Similarly, if they can\'t lose life, they will still sacrifice the permanent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Despite that fact that it can produce mana as it resolves, Klauth\'s triggered ability is not a mana ability because its trigger condition wasn\'t the activation or resolution of an activated mana ability. This means that it uses the stack and can be responded to. Notably, players can respond by destroying attacking creatures to reduce the amount of mana produced."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dragonborn Champion\'s last ability only triggers if 5 or more damage is dealt by the same source at the same time. If a source deals 3 damage to a player and then later deals 2 more damage to the same player, this will not cause the ability to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Galea, Kindler of Hope doesn\'t change when you can cast Aura and Equipment spells. Normally, this means during your main phase when the stack is empty, although flash may change this."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, you can\'t look at the new top card until you finish doing so. This means that if you cast a spell from the top of your library, you can\'t look at the next card until you\'re done paying for that spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can look at the top card of your library whenever you want (with one restriction; see below), even if you don\'t have priority. This action doesn\'t use the stack. Knowing what that card is becomes part of the information you have access to, just like you can look at the cards in your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for the spell, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Catti-brie of Mithral Hall has no counters, you can still activate the last ability. This won\'t deal any damage, but it will count as targeting something for abilities like that of Fey Steed."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a blocking creature is destroyed due to damage dealt this way, the creature it was blocking is still considered blocked. Unless the attacking creature has trample, it won\'t deal any damage to the player or planeswalker it is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you choose both modes, the effects will happen in the listed order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Storvald\'s triggered ability will overwrite any previous effects that set the creature\'s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify that creature\'s power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can choose the same creature as the target for both modes if you wanted to—I don\'t know . . . give it a small taste of phenomenal cosmic power before shrinking it so it could live in an itty-bitty living space?"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the creature you exile is actually a land card that was animated, you won\'t be able to play the land card from exile."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You must still follow all normal timing rules for casting the spell.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If the equipped creature isn\'t on the battlefield as the triggered ability resolves but it had lifelink when it left the battlefield, you will gain life."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Use the equipped creature\'s power as the triggered ability resolves to determine how much damage is dealt. If the equipped creature is no longer on the battlefield at that time, use its power as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you control an opponent\'s Share the Spoils and that player loses the game, Share the Spoils leaves the game with them and the first ability won\'t trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Once Share the Spoils leaves the battlefield, players may no longer play the exiled cards. If Share the Spoils is destroyed and somehow returns to the battlefield, it\'s a new object with no memory of the previously exiled cards."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Once a player plays a land or casts a spell from among the exiled cards, they can\'t play any more of those cards that turn. That is, it\'s one land or one spell, not one of each."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Playing a card this way follows all the normal timing rules for that card. For example, if you play a land this way, you may do so only during your main phase while the stack is empty and only if you havem\'t yet played a land (unless another effect allows you to play additional lands)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Lorcan\'s last ability affects all Warlocks you control, not only ones he collected from an opponent\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Lorcan, Warlock Collector\'s second ability looks only at the type the card has in the graveyard, not the type it had in any other zone. For example, animated lands dying won\'t cause the ability to trigger. The opposite is also true. For example, if a creature that was cast as an Adventure is countered, it\'s a creature card in the graveyard and the triggered ability will trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Minn\'s last ability uses the Illusion\'s power the last time it existed on the battlefield to determine what cards you may put onto the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve announced that you\'re casting Klauth\'s Will, players can\'t take any actions until you\'ve finished doing so. Notably, opponents can\'t try to remove your commander to change how many modes you may choose."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "The commander you control doesn\'t have to be your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Whether or not you control a commander is determined only once, as you choose the modes for this spell. If you somehow lose control of that commander before you finish casting the spell (perhaps because you sacrifice it to activate a mana ability), it won\'t change the number of modes chosen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Wulfgar of Icewind Dale\'s last ability affects only triggered abilities with conditions that are directly related to attacking, such as “whenever this creature attacks” or “whenever you attack with one or more creatures.” It does not affect triggered abilities with other trigger conditions, such as “whenever this creature becomes tapped.”"}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Wulfgar\'s last ability will cause its melee ability to trigger an additional time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A token copy of Radiant Solar entering the battlefield will cause its own ability to trigger, but not that of any other Radiant Solars.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Sefris of the Hidden Ways\' first ability looks only at the type the card has in the graveyard, not the type it had in any other zone. For example, animated lands dying won\'t cause the ability to trigger. The opposite is also true. For example, if a creature that was cast as an Adventure is countered, it\'s a creature card in the graveyard and the first ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Sefris of the Hidden Ways must be on the battlefield for its first ability to trigger. It does not trigger when Sefris goes to the graveyard from the battlefield, even if other creature cards also went to the graveyard at the same time.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Thorough Investigation\'s first ability can trigger only once per combat, no matter how many creatures you attack with."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Unblocked creatures with double strike deal damage twice, which will cause Midnight Pathlighter\'s last ability to trigger twice."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'A player may only have one dungeon in the command zone at a time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choosing the dungeon or room to venture into is part of resolving the venture into the dungeon keyword action. Once that choice is made, players may not respond until after the appropriate room ability has triggered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Dungeon cards are not part of a player\'s deck or sideboard. In both constructed and limited formats, players can use any dungeon card when they venture into the dungeon."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dungeons are removed from the game as a state-based action.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a creature has a characteristic-defining ability that sets its power and/or toughness loses that ability, the power and/or toughness (as appropriate) become 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you somehow venture into the dungeon while a room\'s ability is on the stack, you will continue on in the dungeon. If you\'re already in the last room, complete that dungeon and start a new one."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you target an Aura with Immovable Rod\'s last ability, it will lose its enchant ability and be put into its owner\'s graveyard because it can\'t legally enchant anything. An Equipment that loses its abilities loses its equip ability, so you won\'t be able to move it that way, but it will stay attached to the creature it\'s equipping, if any."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Moving into a dungeon room will cause its room ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Once you resolve the last room ability of a dungeon, that dungeon is now completed and is removed from the game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Some abilities still work even if they have been removed. Specifically, static abilities that change an object\'s types or change an object\'s colors will still apply even if those abilities are lost."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The player venturing into the dungeon chooses which dungeon they will venture into. They may choose a dungeon that they have already completed this game.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "To venture into the dungeon, a player moves their venture marker into the next room of the dungeon they are currently in. If they aren\'t currently in a dungeon, that player instead chooses a dungeon card from outside the game, puts it into the command zone, and moves their venture marker onto the first room."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'You can only move forward (well, downward) in a dungeon, never backwards or sideways.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Although the token created by the triggered ability is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when the token enters the battlefield. Any “As [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[This creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist. When the card returns to the battlefield, it will be a new object with no connection to the card that was exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If Phantom Steed leaves the battlefield before its ability resolves, the target creature won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If Phantom Steed somehow exiles a noncreature card, such as an animated land, it will still create a copy of that card when it attacks. It enters the battlefield tapped and will be sacrificed at the end of combat. However, it is not attacking and it is not an Illusion.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield. Phantom Steed\'s last ability won\'t create any tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Phantom Steed has received a nonfunctional update to its wording. The printed card refers to the “exiled creature.” The corrected text (“exiled card”) is included above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You declare which player or planeswalker the token is attacking as you put it onto the battlefield. It doesn\'t have to be the same player or planeswalker Phantom Steed is attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers when a creature becomes monstrous won\'t trigger if that creature isn\'t on the battlefield when its monstrosity ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Monstrous isn\'t an ability that a creature has. It\'s just something true about that creature. If the creature stops being a creature or loses its abilities, it will continue to be monstrous."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Once a creature becomes monstrous, it can\'t become monstrous again. If the creature is already monstrous when the monstrosity ability resolves, nothing happens. However, because rolling the d8 is part of the cost of activating the ability, if you don\'t like what you rolled and have another {6} handy, you can respond to the ability by activating the ability again. Good luck!"}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Clay Golem\'s first ability even after it has become monstrous. It won\'t become monstrous again and you won\'t put any counters on it, but you will roll a die to activate the ability, which may cause abilities of other permanents to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Any die roll that is ignored, such as from Pixie Guide\'s effect, will not cause the Perfect Illumination ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you roll a natural 4 while resolving the Focus Beam ability, you will scry before you draw a card for the Perfect Illumination ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you\'re instructed to roll multiple dice (with one exception, see below) and more than one shows the highest natural result, the Perfect Illumination ability will trigger that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ignored roll effectively never happens. No abilities will trigger because of an ignored roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature block and you choose for that creature to block, its controller can choose to pay that cost or not. If that player doesn\'t pay that cost, you must propose a new set of blocking creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you roll doubles, ignore one of the rolls and use the result of the other.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "When choosing blocks for creatures you don\'t control, you must still make legal choices. For example, you can\'t choose to have a creature without flying or reach block a creature with flying."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Even if you reveal the entire library this way, putting it on the bottom in a random order doesn\'t count as “shuffling” the library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If you do not have a creature card in your library with mana value equal to the result, you will reveal your entire library and then put the entire library back in a random order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If that permanent\'s owner has fewer than X cards in their library, put the permanent on the bottom of its owner\'s library."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If Maddening Hex is attached to your only opponent, it stays attached to that player as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'If the equipped creature takes lethal damage at the same time that it deals combat damage, it will die before the counters on it can be doubled. However, you will still roll a d12, which may cause abilities of other permanents to trigger.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'To double the number of +1/+1 counters on a permanent, count the number of +1/+1 counters that are currently on that permanent and put that many more on it. Any replacement effects that change this number will apply accordingly.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "You roll a d20 as well as your opponents. If you had a higher result than all of your opponents, Chaos Dragon won\'t have any restrictions on who it may attack."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An ability that tells you to roll a die will also specify what to do with the result of that roll. Most often, this is in the form of a “results table” in the card text.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'An effect that says “choose a target, then roll a d20” or similar still uses the normal process of putting an ability on the stack and resolving it. Choosing targets is part of putting the ability on the stack and rolling the d20 happens later, as the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice are identified by the number of faces each one has. For example, a d20 is a twenty-sided die.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Dice used must have equally likely outcomes and the roll must be fair. Although physical dice are recommended, digital substitutes are allowed, provided they have the same number of equally likely outcomes as specified in the original roll instruction.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some abilities, like that of Pixie Guide and Barbarian Class, replace rolling a die with rolling extra dice and ignoring the lowest roll. The ignored rolls are not considered for the effect that instructed you to roll a die, and do not cause abilities to trigger. For all intents and purposes, once you determine which dice count, any extra dice were never rolled.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects instruct you to roll again. This uses the same number and type of dice as the original roll, and that roll will use the same set of possible outcomes.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Some effects may modify the result of a die roll. This may be part of the instruction to roll a die or it may come from other cards. Anything that references the “result” of a die roll is looking for the result after these modifications. Anything that is looking for the “natural result” is looking for the number shown on the face of the die before these modifications.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The instruction to roll a die and the effect that occurs because of the result are all part of the same ability. Players do not get the chance to respond to the ability after knowing the result of the roll.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Tournament events have more specific rules regarding dice and die-rolling. For more information, please see the most recent version of the Magic Tournament Rules at https://wpn.wizards.com/en/document/magic-gathering-tournament-rules.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'While playing Planechase, rolling the planar die will cause any ability that triggers whenever a player rolls one or more dice to trigger. However, any effect that refers to a numerical result will ignore the rolling of the planar die.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'An attacking or blocking creature that phases out is removed from combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Any continuous effects with a “for as long as” duration, such as that of Mind Flayer, ignore phased-out objects. If ignoring those objects causes the effect\'s conditions to no longer be met, the duration will expire."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'As a creature is phased out, Auras and Equipment attached to it (including Robe of Stars) also phase out at the same time. Those Auras and Equipment will phase in attached to the creature they were attached to when they phased out.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Choices made for permanents as they entered the battlefield are remembered when they phase in.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If an opponent gains control of one of your creatures, that creature phases out, and the duration of the control-change effect expires before it phases back in, that creature phases in under your control as that opponent\'s next untap step begins. If they leave the game before their next untap step, it phases in as the next untap step begins after their turn would have begun."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Notably, this means you cannot equip Robe of Stars to another creature while it is phased out. If you activate the Astral Projection ability of an attached Robe of Stars in response to the equip ability, Robe of Stars will be phased out before the equip ability resolves and will not be moved.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Permanents phase back in during their controller\'s untap step, immediately before that player untaps their permanents. Creatures that phase in this way are able to attack and pay a cost of {T} during that turn. If a permanent had counters on it when it phased out, it will have those counters when it phases back in."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phased out permanents are treated as though they don\'t exist. They can\'t be the target of spells or abilities, their static abilities have no effect on the game, their triggered abilities can\'t trigger, they can\'t attack or block, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "Phasing out doesn\'t cause any “leaves the battlefield” abilities to trigger. Similarly, phasing in won\'t cause any “enters the battlefield” abilities to trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'Each Rod of Absorption tracks the cards it has exiled separately. If Rod of Absorption is destroyed and then later brought back to the battlefield, it will not be able to access any of the cards that it had exiled before.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If a spell is countered or it never resolves, Rod of Absorption will not exile it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If multiple Rods of Absorption are on the battlefield at the same time, any player casting an instant or sorcery spell will cause all of them to trigger. As the spell resolves, its controller will choose which of the Rods gets to exile it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "When Rod of Absorption\'s last ability resolves, you cast as many spells with total mana value X or less from among the exiled cards as you would like in any order you choose. Cards not cast this way will remain in exile indefinitely."}]', "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'Players make their choices in turn order and get to know what choices were made before theirs. They may choose an artifact or an enchantment that was already chosen by another player. Once all players have made their choices, the permanents are destroyed simultaneously.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'The Pact Boon ability triggers whenever you play any cards from exile, not just those exiled with the Mystic Arcanum ability.'}, {'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You must still pay all costs and follow all timing rules for cards played with the Mystic Arcanum ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-07-23', 'text': 'You may put an Aura card onto the battlefield attached to the equipped creature if it could legally be attached to that creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \' Any player who has controlled a permanent with a hideaway ability since a card was exiled with it may look at that card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'"Hideaway N" means "When this permanent enters the battlefield, look at the top N cards of your library. Exile one of them face down and put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. The exiled card gains \\\'The player who controls the permanent that exiled this card may look at this card in the exile zone.\\\'"\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Hideaway now causes you to put the rest of the cards on the bottom of your library in a random order instead of any order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'Previously, permanents with hideaway entered the battlefield tapped. This ability has been removed from the definition of hideaway. Older cards have received errata to have an additional paragraph that reads "[This permanent] enters the battlefield tapped," and they now have hideaway 4.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "A noncreature permanent that becomes a creature can attack, and its {T} abilities can be activated, only if its controller has continuously controlled that permanent since the beginning of their most recent turn. It doesn\'t matter how long the permanent has been a creature. Notably, if you turn Mishra\'s Factory into a creature on the turn it entered the battlefield, you won\'t be able to then activate its first or last abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': "After it becomes a creature, Mishra\'s Factory will still have all its abilities."}]', "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'Use the power of the creature from when it was last on the battlefield to determine how much life is gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2022-12-08', 'text': 'You may find a basic Forest or any land card with the land type Forest.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]']
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Agonie des Chaos\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nZurückverfolgen (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Länderkarte abwirfst.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532744&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca58d7c-95d9-429a-b7ba-eded5f523262\', \'multiverseId\': 532744}, \'multiverseid\': 532744}, {\'name\': \'Aguijonazos del caos\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nDesandar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta de tierra además de pagar sus otros costes.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e31382b-5f26-4cae-8cb7-70e0a767ac9c\', \'multiverseId\': 532955}, \'multiverseid\': 532955}, {\'name\': \'Affres du chaos\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nPistage (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte de terrain en plus de payer ses autres coûts.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533166&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee0ec09d-e848-4f81-b86d-9a83fc6e58cf\', \'multiverseId\': 533166}, \'multiverseid\': 533166}, {\'name\': \'In Preda al Caos\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nRievocare (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero scartando una carta terra oltre a pagare gli altri suoi costi.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'787e805c-a12b-4639-b2ea-8e182fcbba61\', \'multiverseId\': 533377}, \'multiverseid\': 533377}, {\'name\': \'混沌の辛苦\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\n回顧（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えて土地・カード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8810b52-7626-4481-8e15-bea270be7711\', \'multiverseId\': 533588}, \'multiverseid\': 533588}, {\'name\': \'Aflição do Caos\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nRetraçar (Você pode conjurar este card do seu cemitério descartando um card de terreno além de pagar seus outros custos.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'baae24c5-7562-486a-83a4-5ad35833ab1c\', \'multiverseId\': 533799}, \'multiverseid\': 533799}, {\'name\': \'Спазмы Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Каскад (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгоните не являющуюся землей и стоящую меньше карту. Вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите изгнанные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nВозвращение (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища, сбросив карту земли в дополнение к оплате других ее стоимостей.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10baed6c-f5e3-42e4-8ba8-608b330a4168\', \'multiverseId\': 534010}, \'multiverseid\': 534010}, {\'name\': \'混沌苦痛\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\\n追溯（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用并额外弃一张地牌。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2278d99a-ffa4-4dab-9248-108f84b76d97\', \'multiverseId\': 534221}, \'multiverseid\': 534221}, {\'name\': \'混沌苦痛\', \'text\': \'傾曳（當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張費用比此咒語低的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所放逐的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。）\\n追溯（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，但必須支付其所需費用並額外棄一張地牌。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f0cd4d3-570e-4e93-ae67-852b29b2334a\', \'multiverseId\': 534432}, \'multiverseid\': 534432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett aus Bant\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Lege eine Kreatur deiner Wahl unter die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\\n• Neutralisiere einen Spontanzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bant ist eine Welt, in der Tod und Chaos keinerlei Macht haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532776&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9ac3d50-2aef-453d-ba23-fc5aa797ceac\', \'multiverseId\': 532776}, \'multiverseid\': 532776}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto bantiano\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Pon la criatura objetivo en el fondo de la biblioteca de su propietario.\\n• Contrarresta el hechizo instantáneo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant es un mundo donde la muerte y el caos no tienen lugar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d769d8f8-aa2a-42f3-a23f-d462ce30ffd9\', \'multiverseId\': 532987}, \'multiverseid\': 532987}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Bant\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Mettez une créature ciblée au-dessous de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire.\\n• Contrecarrez un sort d\'éphémère ciblé.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Bant est un monde où la mort et le chaos n\'ont pas prise.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533198&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e782c7c-2f7b-46b3-a740-43f5048a47a6\', \'multiverseId\': 533198}, \'multiverseid\': 533198}, {\'name\': \'Monile di Bant\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Metti una creatura bersaglio in fondo al grimorio del suo proprietario.\\n• Neutralizza una magia istantaneo bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Bant è un mondo in cui morte e caos non hanno alcun potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e348c3e-e14e-48c1-a5ec-8bfecded05d7\', \'multiverseId\': 533409}, \'multiverseid\': 533409}, {\'name\': \'バントの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番下に置く。\\n• インスタント・呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'バントは死と混沌の支配が及ばない世界。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b137c4e5-12f3-46b6-9413-0e94896514b1\', \'multiverseId\': 533620}, \'multiverseid\': 533620}, {\'name\': \'Medalhão de Bant\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Coloque a criatura alvo no fundo do grimório de seu dono.\\n• Anule a mágica instantânea alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Bant é um mundo onde a morte e o caos não têm vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96922dd-bfff-4645-a0f4-5a0966f4d97a\', \'multiverseId\': 533831}, \'multiverseid\': 533831}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Бэнта\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Положите целевое существо в низ библиотеки его владельца.\\n• Отмените целевое мгновенное заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Бэнт — это мир, над которым не властны смерть и хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4ac72b-c76a-4ce2-a0dc-b64a651e631b\', \'multiverseId\': 534042}, \'multiverseid\': 534042}, {\'name\': \'班特护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•将目标生物置于其拥有者的牌库底。\\n•反击目标瞬间咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'班特这世界几乎和死亡与混沌无缘。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b36f27a9-580c-4d60-ba93-0c6a052f896e\', \'multiverseId\': 534253}, \'multiverseid\': 534253}, {\'name\': \'班特護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•消滅目標神器。\\n•將目標生物置於其擁有者的牌庫底。\\n•反擊目標瞬間咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'班特這世界幾乎和死亡與混沌無緣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6145930c-67c3-47ad-afba-c57c1f8349ed\', \'multiverseId\': 534464}, \'multiverseid\': 534464}]', '[{\'name\': \'Anschwellender Kriegssturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Lausche dem Grollen! Spüre den Donner! Der Immersturm brüllt mit jedem Blitz seine Zustimmung heraus!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532747&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70cbce67-f0e4-4cb1-a579-577ed6afaa73\', \'multiverseId\': 532747}, \'multiverseid\': 532747}, {\'name\': \'Oleada de tormenta de guerra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Escuchen el rugido! ¡Sientan el trueno! ¡Immersturm grita su aprobación con cada relámpago!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af0d644-9120-4c5e-99c1-fb5be8e92e9c\', \'multiverseId\': 532958}, \'multiverseid\': 532958}, {\'name\': "Déferlement de l\'orage de guerre", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, elle inflige à n\'importe quelle cible un nombre de blessures égal à sa force.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Écoutez son grondement ! Ressentez son tonnerre ! L\'Immersturm crie son approbation avec chacun de ses éclairs ! »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533169&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a7379a-1f75-4f30-a2c8-4d093db09f44\', \'multiverseId\': 533169}, \'multiverseid\': 533169}, {\'name\': \'Scarica di Guerratempesta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, infligge danno pari alla sua forza a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ascoltate il rombo! Sentite il tuono! L\\\'Immersturm urla la sua approvazione con ogni fulmine!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64265b1f-242b-4452-b28b-ccadac853f5f\', \'multiverseId\': 533380}, \'multiverseid\': 533380}, {\'name\': \'戦嵐のうねり\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その戦場に出たクリーチャーは、それに、自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「この叫びを聞け！雷を感じよ！イマースタームは稲妻で応え叫んでいるぞ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'750281ae-e67e-44f3-8f28-5c5b44841ba4\', \'multiverseId\': 533591}, \'multiverseid\': 533591}, {\'name\': \'Surto da Tempestade Bélica\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, ela causa dano igual ao seu poder a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Ouçam o rugido! Sintam o trovão! O Immersturm manifesta sua aprovação com cada relâmpago!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb7123d9-ae4b-4654-9eb0-31f4afe71adf\', \'multiverseId\': 533802}, \'multiverseid\': 533802}, {\'name\': \'Всплеск Бури Войны\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, оно наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Слушайте его рев! Прочувствуйте его гром! Каждым ударом молнии Иммерштурм выражает свое одобрение!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5159b7b-518c-4dc3-9cc6-2d7168043e8f\', \'multiverseId\': 534013}, \'multiverseid\': 534013}, {\'name\': \'暴战翻腾\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，它对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「听听这吼声！感受这雷鸣！无尽风暴的每声雷击都是在催促我们！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc0b2058-4203-4131-bc2c-9fdc899835e4\', \'multiverseId\': 534224}, \'multiverseid\': 534224}, {\'name\': \'暴戰翻騰\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，它對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於前者的力量。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「聽聽這吼聲！感受這雷鳴！無盡風暴的每聲雷擊都是在催促我們！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dc24983-b739-41f7-8d22-ea5572529d67\', \'multiverseId\': 534435}, \'multiverseid\': 534435}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532795&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b2fcac0-77ff-465f-a125-2a4f12b9c53c\', \'multiverseId\': 532795}, \'multiverseid\': 532795}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e173493-8ed6-47fe-9be9-71e887cd5611\', \'multiverseId\': 533006}, \'multiverseid\': 533006}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24b170b4-4ff8-404a-92f0-2230960ec09b\', \'multiverseId\': 533217}, \'multiverseid\': 533217}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Arcano\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Al principio era una semplice goccia d\'acqua. Lo Specchio Magico la cristallizzò in qualcosa di molto più grande.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1820ee-a020-48d1-aa58-7f2b8bff8484\', \'multiverseId\': 533428}, \'multiverseid\': 533428}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982abeeb-09ab-48a4-8746-6ddbd7824b3a\', \'multiverseId\': 533639}, \'multiverseid\': 533639}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': "Começou como uma simples gota d\'água. O Espelho Mágico a cristalizou em algo muito maior.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee0df0d-b4a2-4bcc-bcf7-f57cbd31dff9\', \'multiverseId\': 533850}, \'multiverseid\': 533850}, {\'name\': \'Магическая Печать\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва это была простая капля воды. Волшебное Зеркало превратило ее в нечто большее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5c4f15-d778-499f-ad2a-4b3b9be8fe16\', \'multiverseId\': 534061}, \'multiverseid\': 534061}, {\'name\': \'秘法印记\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明镜将之晶化为更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddc16b5c-1fa1-429a-89a9-0bddd2ea0a86\', \'multiverseId\': 534272}, \'multiverseid\': 534272}, {\'name\': \'秘法印記\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明鏡將之晶化為更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6d84be-4d3b-4ea2-b379-0bff2a270edb\', \'multiverseId\': 534483}, \'multiverseid\': 534483}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W8 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem anderen Ergebnis aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Träume einen lernenden Geist berühren, kann man mit einem Anfall von Inspiration rechnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67aad268-7652-470b-863b-69e34160f8ef\', \'multiverseId\': 531973}, \'multiverseid\': 531973}, {\'name\': \'Reto arcano\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d8 y elige un resultado. Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a ese resultado. Luego puedes lanzar desde tu mano un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná menor o igual al otro resultado sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Bien entrada la noche, cuando los sueños tocan una mente estudiosa, florece la inspiración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c26c85f-1381-41e5-b660-f103ccef9286\', \'multiverseId\': 532027}, \'multiverseid\': 532027}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre arcanique\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d8 et choisissez un résultat. Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à ce résultat. Puis vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à l\'autre résultat depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ce n\'est que tard le soir, quand les rêves frôlent l\'esprit studieux, que l\'inspiration frappe.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532081&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e8bd61f-92f1-4e21-afbb-793a4843f1ec\', \'multiverseId\': 532081}, \'multiverseid\': 532081}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Arcana\', \'text\': "Tira due d8 e scegli un risultato. Pesca carte pari a quel risultato. Poi puoi lanciare dalla tua mano una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore all\'altro risultato senza pagare il suo costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Nel cuore della notte, quando i sogni bussano alla porta della mente, gli studiosi sono colpiti da lampi di genio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a14d63-a0ea-4a22-ad08-e8b0fd998288\', \'multiverseId\': 532135}, \'multiverseid\': 532135}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の挑戦\', \'text\': \'２個のd8を振り、出目１つを選ぶ。その出目に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたはあなたの手札にありマナ総量がもう１つの出目以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'夜更けの夢が勤勉な心に触れるとき、霊感の発作が襲う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8e26a4-3a3f-415e-b9c1-02e0a103609b\', \'multiverseId\': 532189}, \'multiverseid\': 532189}, {\'name\': \'Empreitada Arcana\', \'text\': \'Role dois d8 e escolha um resultado. Compre uma quantidade de cards igual àquele resultado. Em seguida, você pode conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço de sua mão com valor de mana igual ou inferior ao outro resultado sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O verdadeiro golpe de inspiração vem tarde da noite, quando os sonhos penetram na mente estudiosa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3d15a07-3b90-437f-ad07-fa9436492382\', \'multiverseId\': 532243}, \'multiverseid\': 532243}, {\'name\': \'Волшебное Предприятие\', \'text\': \'Бросьте два d8 и выберите один результат. Возьмите количество карт, равное тому результату. Затем вы можете разыграть из вашей руки мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства с мановой ценностью, не превышающей другой результат, без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Поздно ночью, когда грезы проникают в любознательный ум, случаются приступы озарения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48798895-e530-49d0-b609-cd0a759c0004\', \'multiverseId\': 532297}, \'multiverseid\': 532297}, {\'name\': \'秘法勇进\', \'text\': \'掷两颗d8并选择一个掷骰结果。抓数量等同于该掷骰结果的牌。然后你可以从你手上施放一个瞬间或法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用，但其法术力值须等于或小于另一个掷骰结果。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'夜深人静时，当勤学思绪触碰梦乡，灵感随之迸发。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea30fe84-18fd-4a0f-a145-346a602ae74b\', \'multiverseId\': 532351}, \'multiverseid\': 532351}, {\'name\': \'秘法勇進\', \'text\': \'擲兩顆d8並選擇一個擲骰結果。抽數量等同於該擲骰結果的牌。然後你可以從你手上施放一個瞬間或巫術咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用，但其魔法力值須等於或小於另一個擲骰結果。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'夜深人靜時，當勤學思緒觸碰夢鄉，靈感隨之迸發。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'378ca985-7802-4a4e-8600-69401b785e5c\', \'multiverseId\': 532405}, \'multiverseid\': 532405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W8 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Ziehe entsprechend viele Karten. Dann kannst du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich dem anderen Ergebnis aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine bzw. ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531559&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'353d627b-6e16-437d-9734-d6a3129b1451\', \'multiverseId\': 531559}, \'multiverseid\': 531559}, {\'name\': \'Reto arcano\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d8 y elige un resultado. Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a ese resultado. Luego puedes lanzar desde tu mano un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná menor o igual al otro resultado sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2eb9f75-070f-4374-a170-a68afedf1a60\', \'multiverseId\': 531615}, \'multiverseid\': 531615}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre arcanique\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d8 et choisissez un résultat. Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à ce résultat. Puis vous pouvez lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à l\'autre résultat depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531671&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b60007-461f-4952-9c84-3611fed3330d\', \'multiverseId\': 531671}, \'multiverseid\': 531671}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Arcana\', \'text\': "Tira due d8 e scegli un risultato. Pesca carte pari a quel risultato. Poi puoi lanciare dalla tua mano una magia istantaneo o stregoneria con valore di mana pari o inferiore all\'altro risultato senza pagare il suo costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8fa452-7818-42da-a04a-299c087fc0d6\', \'multiverseId\': 531727}, \'multiverseid\': 531727}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の挑戦\', \'text\': \'d8を２回振り、出目１つを選ぶ。その出目に等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、あなたはあなたの手札にありマナ総量がもう１つの出目以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c12850-b46f-4ffe-9586-0ea271f1fad5\', \'multiverseId\': 531783}, \'multiverseid\': 531783}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschfahle Reiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Aschfahle Reiterin ins Spiel kommt oder stirbt, schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Archon\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Opfergabe, um sie bei ihrer Ankunft zu beschwichtigen. Eine weitere, um ihre Abreise zu zelebrieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532773&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d886570d-aaa8-48cd-a570-46c59acec25c\', \'multiverseId\': 532773}, \'multiverseid\': 532773}, {\'name\': \'Jinete cinérea\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Jinete cinérea entre al campo de batalla o muera, exilia el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Una ofrenda para aplacarla a su llegada. Otra para celebrar su partida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f48f0579-cc34-4c46-ac31-29a008165d86\', \'multiverseId\': 532984}, \'multiverseid\': 532984}, {\'name\': \'Cavalière cendreuse\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Cavalière cendreuse arrive sur le champ de bataille ou meurt, exilez un permanent ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : archonte\', \'flavor\': "Une offrande pour l\'apaiser à son arrivée. Une autre pour célébrer son départ.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533195&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'968940d5-7605-4927-998a-fb3b45390e37\', \'multiverseId\': 533195}, \'multiverseid\': 533195}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcatrice Cinerea\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Cavalcatrice Cinerea entra nel campo di battaglia o muore, esilia un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': "Un\'offerta per compiacerla al suo arrivo. Un\'altra per celebrare la sua partenza.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec880df0-cde9-4730-a1aa-72e85dede39e\', \'multiverseId\': 533406}, \'multiverseid\': 533406}, {\'name\': \'灰燼の乗り手\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n灰燼の乗り手が戦場に出たか死亡したとき、パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 執政官\', \'flavor\': \'到着時に彼女をなだめるために奉納物をひとつ捧げ、そしてその出立を祝うためにもう一つ捧げる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec9a4fdd-fb20-4233-af25-9c3a6e4e809c\', \'multiverseId\': 533617}, \'multiverseid\': 533617}, {\'name\': \'Ginete Cinzento\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Ginete Cinzento entrar no campo de batalha ou morrer, exile a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Arconte\', \'flavor\': \'Uma oferenda para aplacá-lo em sua chegada. Outra para celebrar sua partida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73e079c3-7409-4ecc-b4f0-c4cb059fc6af\', \'multiverseId\': 533828}, \'multiverseid\': 533828}, {\'name\': \'Пепельная Наездница\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Пепельная Наездница выходит на поле битвы или умирает, изгоните целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Архонт\', \'flavor\': \'Одно подношение — чтобы умилостивить ее, когда она появляется. Второе — чтобы отпраздновать, когда она ушла.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a44cbff9-d013-490c-b3f6-4ebbaf8aeb8d\', \'multiverseId\': 534039}, \'multiverseid\': 534039}, {\'name\': \'灰灭骑兵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当灰灭骑兵进战场或死去时，放逐目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～统领\', \'flavor\': \'一份献礼用于在她到来时讨其欢心，另一份则用于在她离去时欢庆无休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbbaebe-1861-4341-aecb-72bcb840e657\', \'multiverseId\': 534250}, \'multiverseid\': 534250}, {\'name\': \'灰滅騎兵\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當灰滅騎兵進戰場或死去時，放逐目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～統領\', \'flavor\': \'一份獻禮用於在她到來時討其歡心，另一份則用於在她離去時歡慶無休。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da9caafb-a13e-451c-a415-b1d5d4005862\', \'multiverseId\': 534461}, \'multiverseid\': 534461}]', '[{\'name\': \'Atarka die Weltenschmelzerin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Drache, den du kontrollierst, angreift, erhält er Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'„Ihr Hunger kennt keine Grenzen. Unkontrolliert würde sie sich an ganz Tarkir laben."\\n—Yasova Drachenklaue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532774&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2b67db-1b2c-438c-9331-4eb9666049c4\', \'multiverseId\': 532774}, \'multiverseid\': 532774}, {\'name\': \'Atarka, el Ocaso del Mundo\', \'text\': \'Vuela, arrolla.\\nSiempre que un Dragón que controlas ataque, gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Su apetito no conoce límites. Si nadie la controlara, devoraría todo Tarkir".\\n—Yasova Garradragón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54bf934f-ad32-40de-be1f-5e1f62f0cb6e\', \'multiverseId\': 532985}, \'multiverseid\': 532985}, {\'name\': \'Atarka, broyeuse de monde\', \'text\': "Vol, piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un dragon que vous contrôlez attaque, il acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': "« Son appétit est sans limite. Si l\'on n\'y veillait pas, il ne resterait plus rien sur Tarkir. »\\n—Yasova Griffedragon", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533196&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900ea307-0b82-4713-81ce-bd3d7eb01e75\', \'multiverseId\': 533196}, \'multiverseid\': 533196}, {\'name\': \'Atarka, Dissolutrice del Mondo\', \'text\': \'Volare, travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta un Drago che controlli attacca, ha doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"La sua fame non conosce limiti. Se non la tenessimo sotto controllo, divorerebbe l\\\'intero Tarkir."\\n—Yasova Artiglio di Drago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e022b3a-06c5-4824-9b85-e468f89eeb45\', \'multiverseId\': 533407}, \'multiverseid\': 533407}, {\'name\': \'世界を溶かすもの、アタルカ\', \'text\': \'飛行、トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしているドラゴン１体が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「彼女の空腹は満たされることはありません。放置すれば、タルキールのすべてを喰らい尽くすでしょう。」\\n――龍爪のヤソヴァ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11fc969e-1e25-4b09-9f2c-853a339cab21\', \'multiverseId\': 533618}, \'multiverseid\': 533618}, {\'name\': \'Atarka, Dissolvedora de Mundos\', \'text\': \'Voar, atropelar\\nToda vez que um Dragão que você controla ataca, ele ganha golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'"A fome dela não tem limite. Se não for contida, ela devorará toda Tarkir."\\n— Yasova Garra de Dragão\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16e991d1-b0c0-4979-9dd3-e7fcec094250\', \'multiverseId\': 533829}, \'multiverseid\': 533829}, {\'name\': \'Атарка, Плавительница Мира\', \'text\': \'Полет, Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Дракон под вашим контролем атакует, он получает Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'«Ее голод не знает пределов. Если не остановить ее, она сожрет весь Таркир».\\n— Ясва Коготь Дракона\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'129754d1-a7f6-4481-b28c-e8b28176c961\', \'multiverseId\': 534040}, \'multiverseid\': 534040}, {\'name\': \'灭世龙王安塔卡\', \'text\': \'飞行，践踏\\n每当一个由你操控的龙攻击时，它获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'「她的饥饿没有限度。若放任不管，她会吃掉鞑契全境。」\\n～龙爪娅绍娃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b9786c-dfee-4e43-ba4e-d17c42c4f02a\', \'multiverseId\': 534251}, \'multiverseid\': 534251}, {\'name\': \'滅世龍王安塔卡\', \'text\': \'飛行，踐踏\\n每當一個由你操控的龍攻擊時，它獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'「她的飢餓沒有限度。若放任不管，她會吃掉韃契全境。」\\n～龍爪婭紹娃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af50a0e0-b53c-4364-b317-bee4c67a0888\', \'multiverseId\': 534462}, \'multiverseid\': 534462}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aus und vorbei\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist, ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich kam auf der Suche nach einer Herausforderung. Alles, was ich fand, warst du."\\n—Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e69ca9-49f7-4118-8751-2e137a95f0b5\', \'multiverseId\': 532793}, \'multiverseid\': 532793}, {\'name\': \'Fin absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vine en busca de un desafío... pero solo te he encontrado a ti".\\n—Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da9b0fdf-036f-40ce-af31-7db5f9ce323d\', \'multiverseId\': 533004}, \'multiverseid\': 533004}, {\'name\': \'Destruction totale\', \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent non-terrain ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Je venais en quête de défi. Mais je n\'ai trouvé que toi. »\\n—Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ea013dc-fd1f-4055-85c0-7c2945bbef0d\', \'multiverseId\': 533215}, \'multiverseid\': 533215}, {\'name\': \'Fine Assoluta\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente non terra bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono giunto in cerca di una sfida, ma non ho trovato che te."\\n—Zurgo, khan dei Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c5b5445-2efc-4e17-8cba-4a5e9bd0346e\', \'multiverseId\': 533426}, \'multiverseid\': 533426}, {\'name\': \'完全なる終わり\', \'text\': \'土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「俺は挑戦を求めて来たというのに。ここにいたのはお前だけというわけか。」\\n――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1881e94-86a6-4224-ada5-4dcf79e3cda0\', \'multiverseId\': 533637}, \'multiverseid\': 533637}, {\'name\': \'Fim Absoluto\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo não de terreno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu vim em busca de um desafio. Tudo o que encontrei foi você."\\n— Zurgo, khan dos mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6d6b5ce-fc9c-4f1d-b7c0-73cd038f70f9\', \'multiverseId\': 533848}, \'multiverseid\': 533848}, {\'name\': \'Окончательная Погибель\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой не являющийся землей перманент.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я пришел, чтобы найти достойного противника. А нашел только тебя».\\n— Зурго, хан Марду\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0199dec3-b86c-4128-aa14-9eccd6523e38\', \'multiverseId\': 534059}, \'multiverseid\': 534059}, {\'name\': \'彻底终结\', \'text\': \'放逐目标非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我来寻求挑战。可我只找到了你。」\\n～玛尔都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b20e65-82ab-48a7-a166-f2d486e77c21\', \'multiverseId\': 534270}, \'multiverseid\': 534270}, {\'name\': \'徹底終結\', \'text\': \'放逐目標非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「我來尋求挑戰。可我只找到了你。」\\n～瑪爾都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cb95a3-1f48-452a-ba95-4240fbe2a0ef\', \'multiverseId\': 534481}, \'multiverseid\': 534481}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgestoßener Drachenmeister\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du sechs oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Diese Welt wird von ihren rechtmäßigen Herrschern regiert werden und nicht von diesen widerlichen Kreaturen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532722&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42879cc5-a353-479c-a1b7-6d73323630ce\', \'multiverseId\': 532722}, \'multiverseid\': 532722}, {\'name\': \'Paria maestro de dragones\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas seis o más tierras, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será gobernado por sus legítimos soberanos, no por esos farsantes espantosos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'559fac27-dc9e-4ded-8448-fb08705276c4\', \'multiverseId\': 532933}, \'multiverseid\': 532933}, {\'name\': \'Proscrite maître-dragon\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez au moins six terrains, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce monde sera dirigé par ses souverains légitimes, pas par ces imposteurs monstrueux. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533144&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81f2acd9-cb91-4311-b337-c06747ab285f\', \'multiverseId\': 533144}, \'multiverseid\': 533144}, {\'name\': \'Dragoniere Reietto\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli sei o più terre, crea una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Questo mondo sarà governato dai suoi legittimi sovrani, non da questi ripugnanti usurpatori."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ebeb76a-b225-4a68-86cd-bf420a33a9cf\', \'multiverseId\': 533355}, \'multiverseid\': 533355}, {\'name\': \'竜使いののけ者\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが６つ以上の土地をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「この世界は、あの醜悪な詐称者どもによってではなく、正当なる支配者に統治されるであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533566&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b103abad-8ae4-42f1-9993-3272636f6d92\', \'multiverseId\': 533566}, \'multiverseid\': 533566}, {\'name\': \'Pária Mestre de Dragões\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar seis ou mais terrenos, crie uma ficha de criatura Dragão vermelha 5/5 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Este mundo será governado por seus legítimos soberanos, e não por esses impostores horrendos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b11d60c-2826-4c32-b7ee-860ba625abf3\', \'multiverseId\': 533777}, \'multiverseid\': 533777}, {\'name\': \'Изгнанный Повелитель Драконов\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если под вашим контролем есть не менее шести земель, создайте одну фишку существа 5/5 красный Дракон с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«В нашем мире воцарятся его законные повелители, а не эти отвратительные самозванцы».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2330aac-0ed9-41f0-9451-4e3524a71f75\', \'multiverseId\': 533988}, \'multiverseid\': 533988}, {\'name\': \'受逐召龙师\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你操控六个或更多地，则派出一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「这个世界将由适格的君王所统治，而不是这些丑陋的觊觎者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c3b843-ff74-4597-a46c-bc99e4993372\', \'multiverseId\': 534199}, \'multiverseid\': 534199}, {\'name\': \'受逐召龍師\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若你操控六個或更多地，則派出一個5/5紅色，具飛行異能的龍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「這個世界將由適格的君王所統治，而不是這些醜陋的覬覦者。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae34d90-681a-406a-9cf9-b9f722443a62\', \'multiverseId\': 534410}, \'multiverseid\': 534410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausschlachten\', \'text\': \'Bestimme zwei Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Opfere eine Kreatur. Falls du dies tust, bringe die bestimmten Karten getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Stirb. Und wisse, dass dein erbärmliches Leben mir zu großem Vorteil gereicht."\\n—Zul Ashur, Lichfürst\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532710&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84bc840a-8860-425a-9a94-326e32532d36\', \'multiverseId\': 532710}, \'multiverseid\': 532710}, {\'name\': \'Victimar\', \'text\': \'Elige dos cartas de criatura objetivo en tu cementerio. Sacrifica una criatura. Si lo haces, regresa al campo de batalla las cartas elegidas giradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Muere. Pero muere sabiendo que tu patética vida supondrá un gran botín para mí".\\n—Zul Ashur, señor liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c1fd0bc-2584-41bc-804a-dd6f76535955\', \'multiverseId\': 532921}, \'multiverseid\': 532921}, {\'name\': \'Brimades\', \'text\': \'Choisissez deux cartes de créature ciblées dans votre cimetière. Sacrifiez une créature. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez, engagées, les cartes choisies sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Meurs. Mais meurs en sachant que ta misérable existence me rapportera une belle récompense. »\\n—Zul Ashur, seigneur liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533132&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5c02d98-bd7f-461a-8991-dcee84530299\', \'multiverseId\': 533132}, \'multiverseid\': 533132}, {\'name\': \'Vessare\', \'text\': \'Scegli due carte creatura bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Sacrifica una creatura. Se lo fai, rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpate le carte scelte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Morirai, ma con la consapevolezza che la tua patetica vita mi varrà un grande tesoro."\\n—Zul Ashur, signore dei lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a26bca1-d18d-423f-8e3b-d2f8128dbcd1\', \'multiverseId\': 533343}, \'multiverseid\': 533343}, {\'name\': \'犠牲\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード２枚を対象とする。クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。そうしたなら、対象としたそれらのカードをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「死ぬがいい。お前の惨めな命でも、私に大いなる恵みを与えることを知りながらな。」\\n――死者の王、ザル・アシュール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee771ff3-477d-4ee2-b929-2a8f9724be03\', \'multiverseId\': 533554}, \'multiverseid\': 533554}, {\'name\': \'Vitimar\', \'text\': \'Escolha dois cards de criatura alvo em seu cemitério. Sacrifique uma criatura. Se fizer isso, devolva os cards escolhidos ao campo de batalha virados.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Morra. Mas morra sabendo que sua vida patética me proverá uma grande dádiva."\\n— Zul Ashur, senhor lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d835cd23-70f2-48cc-aa8d-f0f0ff7af6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 533765}, \'multiverseid\': 533765}, {\'name\': \'Превращение в Жертву\', \'text\': \'Выберите две целевые карты существ на вашем кладбище. Пожертвуйте существо. Если вы это делаете, верните выбранные карты на поле битвы повернутыми.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Умри. Но, умирая, знай, что твоя жалкая жизнь обернется для меня великой наградой».\\n— Зул Ашур, лорд-лич\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e43c06-2d66-44db-a965-81b94a9a7038\', \'multiverseId\': 533976}, \'multiverseid\': 533976}, {\'name\': \'生体活祭\', \'text\': \'选择两张目标在你坟墓场中的生物牌。牺牲一个生物。如果你如此作，则将所选之牌横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「去死吧。知道你这悲惨的一生能为我换回莫大回报，你也死得明白。」\\n～巫妖领主祝亚许\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1961e406-5a5e-48f8-b193-a1b1d1629a92\', \'multiverseId\': 534187}, \'multiverseid\': 534187}, {\'name\': \'生體活祭\', \'text\': \'選擇兩張目標在你墳墓場中的生物牌。犧牲一個生物。如果你如此作，則將所選之的牌橫置移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「去死吧。知道你這悲慘的一生能為我換回莫大回報，你也死得明白。」\\n～巫妖領主祝亞許\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72a87472-ea6e-4c41-a9c8-d5bb573d3eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 534398}, \'multiverseid\': 534398}]', '[{\'name\': \'Azorius-Kanzlei\', \'text\': \'Die Azorius-Kanzlei kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Azorius-Kanzlei ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532822&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d19eca8b-a427-4cd6-b4aa-27fc10a8f9c7\', \'multiverseId\': 532822}, \'multiverseid\': 532822}, {\'name\': \'Tribunal azorio\', \'text\': \'El Tribunal azorio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Tribunal azorio entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17609b7c-b3c1-481b-8c3c-65ecf46a853c\', \'multiverseId\': 533033}, \'multiverseid\': 533033}, {\'name\': "Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius", \'text\': "La Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Cour de la chancellerie d\'Azorius arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533244&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a031c0ce-df40-4cb8-b533-d7c62c5fc7de\', \'multiverseId\': 533244}, \'multiverseid\': 533244}, {\'name\': \'Cancelleria Azorius\', \'text\': \'La Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Cancelleria Azorius entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1e0f98b-a714-40f2-8453-a26c4f59c3bd\', \'multiverseId\': 533455}, \'multiverseid\': 533455}, {\'name\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁\', \'text\': \'アゾリウスの大法官庁はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nアゾリウスの大法官庁が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c45ed5-0047-4c1e-bbf8-4b7a17424ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 533666}, \'multiverseid\': 533666}, {\'name\': \'Chancelaria Azorius\', \'text\': \'Chancelaria Azorius entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Chancelaria Azorius entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc098f82-d357-4902-95f5-5abb27c3b343\', \'multiverseId\': 533877}, \'multiverseid\': 533877}, {\'name\': \'Архив Азориусов\', \'text\': \'Архив Азориусов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Архив Азориусов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534088&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b577a20-05bd-48cb-8253-fae1b76146e5\', \'multiverseId\': 534088}, \'multiverseid\': 534088}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立衡平法院\', \'text\': \'俄佐立衡平法院须横置进战场。\\n当俄佐立衡平法院进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dca99867-68b2-4256-b833-bfd620c701d0\', \'multiverseId\': 534299}, \'multiverseid\': 534299}, {\'name\': \'俄佐立衡平法院\', \'text\': \'俄佐立衡平法院須橫置進戰場。\\n當俄佐立衡平法院進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23f6cdf6-bba2-4ddd-93bd-08df38f47616\', \'multiverseId\': 534510}, \'multiverseid\': 534510}]', "[{'name': 'Basiliskenhalsband', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Todesberührung und Lebensverknüpfung.\\nAusrüsten {2}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': 'Während ihrer endlosen Reisen haben die Magier der Karawane aus Goma Fada gelernt, wie man sowohl Tod als auch Leben zügelt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532797&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e4210f3-c31c-4108-9090-89b5f8c7074a', 'multiverseId': 532797}, 'multiverseid': 532797}, {'name': 'Correa de basilisco', 'text': 'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de toque mortal y vínculo vital.\\nEquipar {2}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': 'Durante sus interminables viajes, los magos de la caravana Goma Fada aprendieron maneras de aprovechar tanto la vida como la muerte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533008&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '178a061f-0299-4ee4-af8c-de4d798fb46a', 'multiverseId': 533008}, 'multiverseid': 533008}, {'name': 'Collier de basilic', 'text': 'La créature équipée a le contact mortel et le lien de vie.\\nÉquipement {2}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': 'Pendant leurs voyages interminables, les mages de la caravane de Goma Fada ont appris comment apprivoiser la vie et la mort.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533219&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7066f919-4562-4d5d-98b2-b3ec03ce26ea', 'multiverseId': 533219}, 'multiverseid': 533219}, {'name': 'Collare del Basilisco', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata ha legame vitale e tocco letale.\\nEquipaggiare {2}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': 'Nel corso dei loro viaggi senza fine, i maghi della carovana di Goma Fada hanno appreso molte tecniche per imbrigliare tanto la vita quanto la morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533430&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5aaeac13-5f47-4bb4-9413-a3eb93e2f348', 'multiverseId': 533430}, 'multiverseid': 533430}, {'name': 'バジリスクの首輪', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは接死と絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{2}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': 'ゴーマ・ファーダの魔道士たちは、終わり無き旅の中で、生と死の両方を操る術を学んだ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533641&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f614279a-6fb8-45da-a942-54a9a503323b', 'multiverseId': 533641}, 'multiverseid': 533641}, {'name': 'Colar de Basilisco', 'text': 'A criatura equipada tem toque mortífero e vínculo com a vida.\\nEquipar {2}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': 'Durante suas viagens intermináveis, os magos da caravana de Goma Fada aprenderam modos de controlar tanto a vida como a morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533852&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8ff52ca-8fff-4db0-a87e-5df30d437213', 'multiverseId': 533852}, 'multiverseid': 533852}, {'name': 'Василисковый Ошейник', 'text': 'Снаряженное существо имеет Смертельное касание и Цепь жизни.\\nСнарядить {2}', 'type': 'Артефакт — Снаряжение', 'flavor': 'Во время своих бесконечных странствий маги Гома-Фадского каравана научились обуздывать и жизнь, и смерть.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534063&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0509121f-bd6e-4b62-99e1-1f3491a3abbd', 'multiverseId': 534063}, 'multiverseid': 534063}, {'name': '蜥怪颈环', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物具有死触与系命异能。\\n佩带{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '在无尽头的旅程中，哥马法达商队的法师学到了各种运用生命与死亡的方法。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534274&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce18ac07-3145-4eb0-b041-1648570ce79c', 'multiverseId': 534274}, 'multiverseid': 534274}, {'name': '蜥怪頸環', 'text': '佩帶此武具的生物具有死觸與繫命異能。\\n佩帶{2}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '在無盡頭的旅程中，哥馬法達商隊的法師學到了各種運用生命與死亡的方法。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534485&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '103009e5-6915-42df-a906-01331862abc3', 'multiverseId': 534485}, 'multiverseid': 534485}]", '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nähere dich meinem Turm auf Knien oder verlasse ihn als Asche im Wind."\\n—Gadwick der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00cd2a17-c01d-47e5-8056-db22f64921d1\', \'multiverseId\': 532828}, \'multiverseid\': 532828}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"O hincas la rodilla frente a mi torre o te alejarás de ella como cenizas en el viento".\\n—Gadwick, el Marchito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a19616-e215-4a0c-942f-1856eb1fdd17\', \'multiverseId\': 533039}, \'multiverseid\': 533039}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Approchez de ma tour un genou à terre, ou quittez-la en cendres au gré du vent. »\\n—Gadwick, le Brisquard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533250&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4a93ab7-b75b-4b97-ac21-5f767ccf50ad\', \'multiverseId\': 533250}, \'multiverseid\': 533250}, {\'name\': \'Torre di Comando\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Avvicinati in ginocchio alla mia torre o la abbandonerai come cenere al vento."\\n—Gadwick, il Rugoso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'263e7b95-94bc-4202-adc6-eb358e8865ff\', \'multiverseId\': 533461}, \'multiverseid\': 533461}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「この塔に近付くものはひざまずくがよい。さもなければ灰になり、風に乗って去ることになる。」\\n――老いたる者、ガドウィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3056cd6a-03b3-4513-97a2-ba75e56734b3\', \'multiverseId\': 533672}, \'multiverseid\': 533672}, {\'name\': \'Torre de Comando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Ou você dobra os joelhos perante minha torre ou vai embora como cinzas levadas pelo vento."\\n— Gadwick, o Enrugado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3de6f864-47d4-4bef-9708-7cba8811ab27\', \'multiverseId\': 533883}, \'multiverseid\': 533883}, {\'name\': \'Командная Башня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Преклони колено, подойдя к моей башне, или же ветер развеет твой пепел».\\n— Гэдвик, Умудренный\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5615c84c-8c4a-4f01-92e9-34414570898a\', \'multiverseId\': 534094}, \'multiverseid\': 534094}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「近我高塔者，须诚心屈膝求见，否则便会化作轻烟飘去。」\\n～老年法师盖威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2669e8d-5e8d-4a95-8b14-f4dfc5cbca47\', \'multiverseId\': 534305}, \'multiverseid\': 534305}, {\'name\': \'指揮塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「近我高塔者，須誠心屈膝求見，否則便會化作輕煙飄去。」\\n～老年法師蓋威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca68007e-e150-4372-9685-80a2011af300\', \'multiverseId\': 534516}, \'multiverseid\': 534516}]', "[{'name': 'Befestigtes Dorf', 'text': 'Sowie das Befestigte Dorf ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Wald- oder Ebene-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt das Befestigte Dorf getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532837&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82fbf154-6ae9-40de-862a-f76fb7e51726', 'multiverseId': 532837}, 'multiverseid': 532837}, {'name': 'Aldea fortificada', 'text': 'En cuanto la Aldea fortificada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Bosque o Llanura de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Aldea fortificada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533048&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e95ac0c-4140-4b6c-b5a5-5f33d1162c5c', 'multiverseId': 533048}, 'multiverseid': 533048}, {'name': 'Village fortifié', 'text': 'Au moment où le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de forêt ou de plaine de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Village fortifié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533259&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e43032d9-93f8-4f22-8151-43f9a28e1b98', 'multiverseId': 533259}, 'multiverseid': 533259}, {'name': 'Villaggio Fortificato', 'text': 'Mentre il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Foresta o Pianura dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, il Villaggio Fortificato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533470&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b325ec5a-b9c5-4cd0-b75b-c899efc8764f', 'multiverseId': 533470}, 'multiverseid': 533470}, {'name': '要塞化した村', 'text': '要塞化した村が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり森か平地であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、要塞化した村はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533681&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f564e96-f5d9-4433-a4d7-958d91735e83', 'multiverseId': 533681}, 'multiverseid': 533681}, {'name': 'Aldeia Fortificada', 'text': 'Conforme Aldeia Fortificada entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Floresta ou Planície de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Aldeia Fortificada entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533892&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f15b600-727a-4670-8559-d4da9b6e2d23', 'multiverseId': 533892}, 'multiverseid': 533892}, {'name': 'Укрепленная Деревня', 'text': 'При выходе Укрепленной Деревни на поле битвы вы можете показать карту Леса или Равнины из вашей руки. Если вы этого не делаете, Укрепленная Деревня выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534103&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51c67b8c-15cf-40d0-a1a9-c8f3480d61a1', 'multiverseId': 534103}, 'multiverseid': 534103}, {'name': '筑防村庄', 'text': '于筑防村庄进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张树林或平原牌。如果你未如此作，则筑防村庄须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534314&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a8939e83-231f-4a26-ba33-d816bea4769f', 'multiverseId': 534314}, 'multiverseid': 534314}, {'name': '築防村莊', 'text': '於築防村莊進戰場時，你可以從你手上展示一張樹林或平原牌。如果你未如此作，則築防村莊須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{W}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534525&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49b39047-a0e8-472b-af9d-2893f94e6b51', 'multiverseId': 534525}, 'multiverseid': 534525}]", '[{\'name\': \'Behemoth-Vorschlaghammer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+2, hat Lebensverknüpfung und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Wer hätte schon erwartet, dass diejenigen, die die großen Gargantuas verehren, eine raffinierte Waffe wählen würden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532778&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66369ad8-87bc-461d-8ec4-741381fd023d\', \'multiverseId\': 532778}, \'multiverseid\': 532778}, {\'name\': \'Maza de behemot\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+2 y tiene las habilidades de arrollar y vínculo vital.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'No puedes esperar que los que adoran a las grandes gargantúas luchen con un arma sutil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a061810-6454-487c-8446-867d54fc1c20\', \'multiverseId\': 532989}, \'multiverseid\': 532989}, {\'name\': \'Frappe-devant béhémoth\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +2/+2 et a le piétinement et le lien de vie.\\nÉquipement {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "On ne pouvait pas s\'attendre à ce que les adorateurs des grands gargantuesques utilisent une arme subtile.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533200&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc75770a-e37d-4651-80a4-6e0bbefba3cf\', \'multiverseId\': 533200}, \'multiverseid\': 533200}, {\'name\': \'Maglio del Behemoth\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+2 e ha travolgere e legame vitale.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Difficilmente ci si aspetta che coloro che venerano enormi mastodonti possano combattere con armi sottili e leggere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42cccef4-762a-4c39-94b3-7e1097c28a30\', \'multiverseId\': 533411}, \'multiverseid\': 533411}, {\'name\': \'ビヒモスの大鎚\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受けトランプルと絆魂を持つ。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'偉大なるガルガンチュアンを崇拝する者が、薄っぺらな武器で戦うと考えるのは無理がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37a48324-5015-4436-b52c-1cad2758d026\', \'multiverseId\': 533622}, \'multiverseid\': 533622}, {\'name\': \'Martelo Behemoth\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+2 e tem atropelar e vínculo com a vida.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que veneram os grandes gargantuas não poderiam lutar com uma arma sutil.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'187d3b4a-af1d-4ae6-a803-64650b91ee4a\', \'multiverseId\': 533833}, \'multiverseid\': 533833}, {\'name\': \'Молот Чудищ\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+2 и имеет Пробивной удар и Цепь жизни.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Почитателей великих исполинов вряд ли можно представить с менее внушительным оружием в руках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2205e33f-fb71-4ee1-9039-7daa98ffab32\', \'multiverseId\': 534044}, \'multiverseid\': 534044}, {\'name\': \'贝西摩斯锤\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有践踏与系命异能。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'崇敬巨兽者不太可能会使用飘忽不定的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b40df139-014f-41ac-a3f9-b8d6a7778292\', \'multiverseId\': 534255}, \'multiverseid\': 534255}, {\'name\': \'貝西摩斯鎚\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+2且具有踐踏與繫命異能。\\n佩帶{3}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'崇敬巨獸者不太可能會使用飄忽不定的武器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8dc7867-8e96-43e2-969e-ff69e0886851\', \'multiverseId\': 534466}, \'multiverseid\': 534466}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinschienen des Blitzes\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Blitz in die Klippen einschlug, wurde Erz zu Eisen, Eisen zu Stahl und Stahl zu Beinschienen. Der Blitz blieb für immer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2292c3d4-85a2-40c3-9520-3e4a74bcc521\', \'multiverseId\': 534563}, \'multiverseid\': 534563}, {\'name\': \'Grebas relámpago\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que el relámpago golpeó los acantilados, el mineral se transformó en hierro, el hierro se convirtió en acero y el acero se convirtió en grebas. El relámpago nunca se fue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e60c355-25f6-4f4e-bdf5-cb6384ed1ad6\', \'multiverseId\': 534565}, \'multiverseid\': 534565}, {\'name\': "Jambières d\'éclair", \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la célérité et le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'éclair frappa les falaises, le minerai devint du fer, le fer de l\'acier, et l\'acier, des jambières. Jamais l\'éclair ne partit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534567&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f337511e-acb6-413f-893b-e4e89eb28d73\', \'multiverseId\': 534567}, \'multiverseid\': 534567}, {\'name\': \'Schinieri dei Fulmini\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha rapidità e velo. (Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità.)\\nEquipaggiare {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Dopo che il fulmine colpì i dirupi, il minerale divenne ferro, il ferro divenne acciaio e l\'acciaio divenne uno schiniere. Il fulmine non se ne andò mai.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e9942ff-0ead-4711-a71c-cc67a83996c7\', \'multiverseId\': 534569}, \'multiverseid\': 534569}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のすね当て\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻が崖を打った後、鉱石は鉄となり、鉄は鋼となり、鋼はすね当てとなった。稲妻はそこに残ったままだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4261eced-220a-4421-a801-c495c5f55283\', \'multiverseId\': 534571}, \'multiverseid\': 534571}, {\'name\': \'Grevas Faiscantes\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem manto e ímpeto. (Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que o relâmpago atingiu os penhascos, o minério fez-se ferro, o ferro fez-se aço e o aço fez-se grevas. E o relâmpago jamais as deixou.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c307b5f3-aa2d-4823-bd30-fa5209e01f0a\', \'multiverseId\': 534573}, \'multiverseid\': 534573}, {\'name\': \'Поножи Молний\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Ускорение и Пелену. (Оно не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей.)\\nСнарядить {0}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'После того как в утес ударила молния, из руды выплавили железо, из железа изготовили сталь, из стали выковали поножи. А молния никуда не делась.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efa58eb4-0f6e-43e9-96c0-8e231ecc44ab\', \'multiverseId\': 534575}, \'multiverseid\': 534575}, {\'name\': \'迅雷护胫\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有敏捷与帷幕异能。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{0}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'闪电击中山崖后，矿石成铁，铁成钢，钢成护胫。迅雷长存其间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdc17980-edd8-4b7d-b878-b7621c31874e\', \'multiverseId\': 534577}, \'multiverseid\': 534577}, {\'name\': \'迅雷護脛\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有敏捷和帷幕異能。（它不能成為咒語或異能的目標。）\\n佩帶{0}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'閃電擊中山崖後，礦石成鐵，鐵成鋼，鋼成護脛。迅雷長存其間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ec3cd94-3bcb-4b3b-800e-3fa40630960b\', \'multiverseId\': 534579}, \'multiverseid\': 534579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerung des Außenpostens\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Belagerung des Außenpostens ins Spiel kommt, wähle Khane oder Drachen.\\n• Khane — Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schickst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du sie spielen.\\n• Drachen — Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, das Spiel verlässt, fügt die Belagerung des Außenpostens einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532733&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b4569c5-e970-421f-9081-aefac8a923f9\', \'multiverseId\': 532733}, \'multiverseid\': 532733}, {\'name\': \'Asedio al destacamento\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Asedio al destacamento entre al campo de batalla, elige kans o dragones.\\n• Kans — Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\n• Dragones — Siempre que una criatura que controlas deje el campo de batalla, el Asedio al destacamento hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68290a75-c3aa-4e8f-9e74-ec5bf2554c3b\', \'multiverseId\': 532944}, \'multiverseid\': 532944}, {\'name\': "Siège de l\'avant-poste", \'text\': "Au moment où le Siège de l\'avant-poste arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez Khans ou Dragons.\\n• Khans — Au début de votre entretien, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\n• Dragons — À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez quitte le champ de bataille, le Siège de l\'avant-poste inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c1cef9e-597d-4584-8216-54b875ffc7b7\', \'multiverseId\': 533155}, \'multiverseid\': 533155}, {\'name\': "Assedio dell\'Avamposto", \'text\': "Mentre l\'Assedio dell\'Avamposto entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli Khan o Draghi.\\n• Khan — All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\\n• Draghi — Ogniqualvolta una creatura che controlli lascia il campo di battaglia, l\'Assedio dell\'Avamposto infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6e5f91d-d9fe-4cb6-a5fb-4a357e8a09fb\', \'multiverseId\': 533366}, \'multiverseid\': 533366}, {\'name\': \'前哨地の包囲\', \'text\': \'前哨地の包囲が戦場に出るに際し、カンか龍かを選ぶ。\\n• カン ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n• 龍 ― あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が戦場を離れるたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。前哨地の包囲はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a85c205-ef9a-4817-a410-5c1396b6bdc0\', \'multiverseId\': 533577}, \'multiverseid\': 533577}, {\'name\': \'Cerco ao Posto Avançado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cerco ao Posto Avançado entra no campo de batalha, escolha Khans ou Dragões.\\n• Khans — No início de sua manutenção, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você poderá jogar aquele card.\\n• Dragões — Toda vez que uma criatura que você controla deixa o campo de batalha, Cerco ao Posto Avançado causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'742ab5a0-913f-4aa5-a621-3576d94e7500\', \'multiverseId\': 533788}, \'multiverseid\': 533788}, {\'name\': \'Осада Аванпоста\', \'text\': \'При выходе Осады Аванпоста на поле битвы выберите Ханов или Драконов.\\n• Ханы — В начале вашего шага поддержки изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыграть ту карту.\\n• Драконы — Каждый раз, когда существо под вашим контролем покидает поле битвы, Осада Аванпоста наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3fd111-b928-4f9b-a7e3-275e8208db4b\', \'multiverseId\': 533999}, \'multiverseid\': 533999}, {\'name\': \'围攻哨站\', \'text\': \'于围攻哨站进战场时，选择可汗或龙王。\\n•可汗～在你的维持开始时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\\n•龙王～每当一个由你操控的生物离开战场时，围攻哨站对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab8132b1-b6d6-457a-8abb-4b85abd790c3\', \'multiverseId\': 534210}, \'multiverseid\': 534210}, {\'name\': \'圍攻哨站\', \'text\': \'於圍攻哨站進戰場時，選擇可汗或龍王。\\n• 可汗～在你的維持開始時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。直到回合結束，你可以使用該牌。\\n•龍王～每當一個由你操控的生物離開戰場時，圍攻哨站對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07c93c43-7545-4ace-9ab1-23724b385188\', \'multiverseId\': 534421}, \'multiverseid\': 534421}]', "[{'name': 'Beschützendes Plax', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Beschützende Plax ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532790&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6014c9a-2538-41a8-9b0c-2402bff5633a', 'multiverseId': 532790}, 'multiverseid': 532790}, {'name': 'Plax protectora', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando la Plax protectora entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533001&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6bce4478-cb5a-457c-bcb9-c47d28a65cd7', 'multiverseId': 533001}, 'multiverseid': 533001}, {'name': 'Plax de blindage', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Plax de blindage arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533212&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25ceea88-dfd4-4d55-b032-0325944e7297', 'multiverseId': 533212}, 'multiverseid': 533212}, {'name': 'Plax Difensivo', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Plax Difensivo entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533423&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cc445c1-88fd-498c-893f-2dd3b7919412', 'multiverseId': 533423}, 'multiverseid': 533423}, {'name': '遮蔽する粘体', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n遮蔽する粘体が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533634&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '92eb93e4-3889-4026-9341-2ccfe4f0e76b', 'multiverseId': 533634}, 'multiverseid': 533634}, {'name': 'Plax Protetor', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Plax Protetor entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nA criatura encantada não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades controladas por seus oponentes.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533845&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5cd83a7-5293-49a7-8c18-55226800526b', 'multiverseId': 533845}, 'multiverseid': 533845}, {'name': 'Защищающий Плакс', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Защищающий Плакс выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nЗачарованное существо не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534056&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc6a8c11-9a68-4a66-90a1-871f43a47150', 'multiverseId': 534056}, 'multiverseid': 534056}, {'name': '咒护板', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当咒护板进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534267&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1511f360-259b-4799-9fb5-34b2ab1694d0', 'multiverseId': 534267}, 'multiverseid': 534267}, {'name': '咒護板', 'text': '結附於生物\\n當咒護板進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n所結附的生物不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534478&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83dd41d7-7185-4446-9a8e-dd51d527e32c', 'multiverseId': 534478}, 'multiverseid': 534478}]", '[{\'name\': \'Besitzergreifender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Besitzergreifende Drache ins Spiel kommt, bestimme einen Menschen oder ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, den bzw. das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Solange der Besitzergreifende Drache im Spiel bleibt, kontrollierst du die bestimmte bleibende Karte. Sie verliert alle Fähigkeiten und kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532732&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9f8f7b-e0fe-4f40-bad8-4f5ca6d54d18\', \'multiverseId\': 532732}, \'multiverseid\': 532732}, {\'name\': \'Dragona oportunista\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Dragona oportunista entre al campo de batalla, elige un Humano o artefacto objetivo que controla un oponente. Mientras la Dragona oportunista permanezca en el campo de batalla, gana el control de ese permanente. Pierde todas las habilidades y no puede atacar ni bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06498861-22e6-4472-924a-be79631009ee\', \'multiverseId\': 532943}, \'multiverseid\': 532943}, {\'name\': \'Dragon opportuniste\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dragon opportuniste arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un humain ciblé ou un artefact ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Tant que le Dragon opportuniste reste sur le champ de bataille, acquérez le contrôle de ce permanent, il perd toutes ses capacités et il ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb1b3e5e-3d3c-4ef4-8831-f52d83302427\', \'multiverseId\': 533154}, \'multiverseid\': 533154}, {\'name\': \'Drago Opportunista\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Opportunista entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un Umano o un artefatto bersaglio controllato da un avversario. Fintanto che il Drago Opportunista rimane sul campo di battaglia, prendi il controllo di quel permanente, che perde tutte le sue abilità e non può attaccare o bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a684b549-275e-4cd7-91c3-5412cd7435e9\', \'multiverseId\': 533365}, \'multiverseid\': 533365}, {\'name\': \'日和見ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n日和見ドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている人間やアーティファクトのうち１つを対象とする。日和見ドラゴンが戦場に残り続けているかぎり、あなたはそのパーマネントのコントロールを得て、それはすべての能力を失い、それでは攻撃もブロックもできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daac3ed7-e13d-41fe-a4ed-12d2f49564cd\', \'multiverseId\': 533576}, \'multiverseid\': 533576}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Oportunista\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão Oportunista entrar no campo de batalha, escolha o Humano ou artefato alvo que um oponente controla. Enquanto Dragão Oportunista permanecer no campo de batalha, ganhe o controle daquela permanente. Ela perde todas as habilidades e não pode atacar nem bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72432546-f133-475c-9e0d-8f109778fae2\', \'multiverseId\': 533787}, \'multiverseid\': 533787}, {\'name\': \'Меркантильный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Меркантильный Дракон выходит на поле битвы, выберите целевого Человека или артефакт под контролем оппонента. До тех пор, пока Меркантильный Дракон остается на поле битвы, получите контроль над тем перманентом, он теряет все способности и не может атаковать и блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e40de7b-4ae6-4b5a-aa46-9fa5b0ac104a\', \'multiverseId\': 533998}, \'multiverseid\': 533998}, {\'name\': \'守成巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当守成巨龙进战场时，选择目标由对手操控的人类或神器。对该永久物而言，于守成巨龙仍在战场上的时段内，你获得它的操控权、它失去所有异能且它不能进行攻击或阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd73740f-40f0-4e69-8652-d1787665b667\', \'multiverseId\': 534209}, \'multiverseid\': 534209}, {\'name\': \'守成巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當守成巨龍進戰場時，選擇目標由對手操控的人類或神器。對該永久物而言，於守成巨龍仍在戰場上的時段內，你獲得它的操控權、它失去所有異能且它不能進行攻擊或阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a588bab2-1008-45bc-b2e6-fc7cbafa6e61\', \'multiverseId\': 534420}, \'multiverseid\': 534420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beute teilen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Beute teilen ins Spiel kommt oder ein Gegner die Partie verliert, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil.\\nJeder Spieler kann in seinem Zug von den mit Beute teilen ins Exil geschickten Karten ein Land spielen oder einen Zauberspruch wirken, und um ihn zu wirken kann er Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Wenn er dies tut, schicke die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531579&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60353123-ec87-4a9f-b951-c0ca5f10ac55\', \'multiverseId\': 531579}, \'multiverseid\': 531579}, {\'name\': \'Compartir el botín\', \'text\': \'Cuando Compartir el botín entre al campo de batalla o un oponente pierda el juego, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador.\\nDurante el turno de cada jugador, ese jugador puede jugar una tierra o lanzar un hechizo de entre las cartas exiliadas con Compartir el botín y puede usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar ese hechizo. Cuando lo haga, exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3629aa72-c83e-4192-8e54-9fb154285d95\', \'multiverseId\': 531635}, \'multiverseid\': 531635}, {\'name\': \'Partage du butin\', \'text\': "Quand le Partage du butin arrive sur le champ de bataille ou quand un adversaire perd la partie, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur.\\nPendant le tour de chaque joueur, ce joueur peut jouer un terrain ou lancer un sort parmi les cartes exilées par le Partage du butin, et il peut dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort. Quand il fait ainsi, exilez la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531691&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0313ab-28b2-4741-8a8e-19fc3a8a0687\', \'multiverseId\': 531691}, \'multiverseid\': 531691}, {\'name\': \'Condividere il Bottino\', \'text\': \'Quando Condividere il Bottino entra nel campo di battaglia o un avversario perde la partita, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore.\\nDurante il turno di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore può giocare una terra o lanciare una magia scelta tra le carte esiliate con Condividere il Bottino e può spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia. Quando lo fa, esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5771762a-db75-4a7f-88d8-c0ada88970ee\', \'multiverseId\': 531747}, \'multiverseid\': 531747}, {\'name\': \'戦利品の山分け\', \'text\': \'戦利品の山分けが戦場に出るか、対戦相手１人がこのゲームに敗北したとき、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをそれぞれ追放する。\\n各プレイヤーのターン中に、そのプレイヤーは、戦利品の山分けによって追放されているカードのうち、土地１つをプレイするか呪文１つを唱えてもよい。そのプレイヤーは、その呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしたとき、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1da6649-c3e7-40f2-aef2-d9413f530dfd\', \'multiverseId\': 531803}, \'multiverseid\': 531803}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beute teilen\', \'text\': \'Wenn Beute teilen ins Spiel kommt oder ein Gegner die Partie verliert, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil.\\nJeder Spieler kann in seinem Zug von den mit Beute teilen ins Exil geschickten Karten ein Land spielen oder einen Zauberspruch wirken, und um ihn zu wirken kann er Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Wenn er dies tut, schicke die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9afbecd5-9574-4c3e-bf43-1c139810bacd\', \'multiverseId\': 531993}, \'multiverseid\': 531993}, {\'name\': \'Compartir el botín\', \'text\': \'Cuando Compartir el botín entre al campo de batalla o un oponente pierda el juego, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador.\\nDurante el turno de cada jugador, ese jugador puede jugar una tierra o lanzar un hechizo de entre las cartas exiliadas con Compartir el botín y puede usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar ese hechizo. Cuando lo haga, exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acaceb72-849a-4406-9776-55faff3ae13f\', \'multiverseId\': 532047}, \'multiverseid\': 532047}, {\'name\': \'Partage du butin\', \'text\': "Quand le Partage du butin arrive sur le champ de bataille ou quand un adversaire perd la partie, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur.\\nPendant le tour de chaque joueur, ce joueur peut jouer un terrain ou lancer un sort parmi les cartes exilées par le Partage du butin, et il peut dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort. Quand il fait ainsi, exilez la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d4384b1-a2a1-4d6d-a92c-9c43e95eedb4\', \'multiverseId\': 532101}, \'multiverseid\': 532101}, {\'name\': \'Condividere il Bottino\', \'text\': \'Quando Condividere il Bottino entra nel campo di battaglia o un avversario perde la partita, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore.\\nDurante il turno di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore può giocare una terra o lanciare una magia scelta tra le carte esiliate con Condividere il Bottino e può spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia. Quando lo fa, esilia la prima carta del suo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'736fe524-1530-440e-b76f-5134d229cd8f\', \'multiverseId\': 532155}, \'multiverseid\': 532155}, {\'name\': \'戦利品の山分け\', \'text\': \'戦利品の山分けが戦場に出るか、対戦相手１人がこのゲームに敗北したとき、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚をそれぞれ追放する。\\n各プレイヤーのターン中に、そのプレイヤーは、戦利品の山分けによって追放されているカードのうち、土地１つをプレイするか呪文１つを唱えてもよい。そのプレイヤーは、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。そのプレイヤーがそうしたとき、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4087f133-071a-4b52-a506-5705c91e6d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 532209}, \'multiverseid\': 532209}, {\'name\': \'Partilhar os Despojos\', \'text\': \'Quando Partilhar os Despojos entrar no campo de batalha ou um oponente perder o jogo, exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador.\\nDurante o turno de cada jogador, aquele jogador pode jogar um terreno ou conjurar uma mágica dentre aqueles cards exilados com Partilhar os Despojos, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar a mágica. Quando ele fizer isso, exile o card do topo do grimório dele.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eed33923-e3b1-41bf-9b93-3552c91f95b5\', \'multiverseId\': 532263}, \'multiverseid\': 532263}, {\'name\': \'Дележ Добычи\', \'text\': \'Когда Дележ Добычи выходит на поле битвы или оппонент проигрывает партию, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого игрока.\\nВо время хода каждого игрока тот игрок может разыграть одну землю или заклинание, находящиеся среди изгнанных Дележом Добычи карт, и может тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого цвета. Когда он это делает, изгоните верхнюю карту его библиотеки.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9a1732a-1140-496d-841a-a120ab00b819\', \'multiverseId\': 532317}, \'multiverseid\': 532317}, {\'name\': \'分享战利品\', \'text\': \'当分享战利品进战场或任一对手输掉这盘游戏时，放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌。\\n每位牌手于自己的回合中，可以从以分享战利品放逐的牌之中使用一个地或施放一个咒语，且其可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。当他如此作时，放逐其牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72b91623-ef2f-4cd5-baf2-40b64c04ef3d\', \'multiverseId\': 532371}, \'multiverseid\': 532371}, {\'name\': \'分享戰利品\', \'text\': \'當分享戰利品進戰場或任一對手輸掉這盤遊戲時，放逐每位玩家的牌庫頂牌。\\n每位玩家於自己的回合中，可以從以分享戰利品放逐的牌之中使用一個地或施放一個咒語，且其可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。當他如此作時，放逐其牌庫頂牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e684384-66f3-468d-834c-decc9bd4e59b\', \'multiverseId\': 532425}, \'multiverseid\': 532425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzolldrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Blutzolldrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Gegner deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu, es sei denn, der Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verbundenheit eines Ritters zu seinem Reittier hat seine Grenzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532718&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aec48309-8404-4a1e-9cd9-0460be0dfff7\', \'multiverseId\': 532718}, \'multiverseid\': 532718}, {\'name\': \'Dragón exigente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón exigente entre al campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo a menos que ese jugador sacrifique una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'El afecto de un caballero por su montura tiene sus límites.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a92445a-b750-4d6e-895a-f4d8a2a83a0f\', \'multiverseId\': 532929}, \'multiverseid\': 532929}, {\'name\': \'Dragon exigeant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Dragon exigeant arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures à un adversaire ciblé à moins que ce joueur ne sacrifie une créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "La dévotion d\'un chevalier envers sa monture a ses limites.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533140&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbfb770-6ee5-47d0-bfc3-c67dcb9aa3ac\', \'multiverseId\': 533140}, \'multiverseid\': 533140}, {\'name\': \'Drago Rapace\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Rapace entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni a un avversario bersaglio a meno che quel giocatore non sacrifichi una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'La devozione di un cavaliere per il suo destriero ha i suoi limiti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a3a4ca-af93-4d1d-9851-6b61495b8d26\', \'multiverseId\': 533351}, \'multiverseid\': 533351}, {\'name\': \'厄介なドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n厄介なドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、これはそのプレイヤーに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'騎士の馬への愛情はその程度だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cb19ec4-6291-45d9-a01e-490148f21ee2\', \'multiverseId\': 533562}, \'multiverseid\': 533562}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Reivindicativo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão Reivindicativo entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 5 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo, a menos que aquele jogador sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Até mesmo a devoção de um cavaleiro a seu corcel tem um limite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938b36c2-8c20-4d68-acce-acec68b6efbc\', \'multiverseId\': 533773}, \'multiverseid\': 533773}, {\'name\': \'Требовательный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Требовательный Дракон выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 5 повреждений целевому оппоненту, если только тот игрок не пожертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'У привязанности рыцаря к своему скакуну есть границы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533984&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3932fca-e3ef-45ec-864d-9ef68a64ca6a\', \'multiverseId\': 533984}, \'multiverseid\': 533984}, {\'name\': \'索祭巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当索祭巨龙进战场时，除非目标对手牺牲一个生物，否则它对该牌手造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'骑士与爱马之间的不渝忠诚也只能到此为止。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2425ce61-45be-4532-b984-972cdd1f387f\', \'multiverseId\': 534195}, \'multiverseid\': 534195}, {\'name\': \'索祭巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當索祭巨龍進戰場時，除非目標對手犧牲一個生物，否則它對該玩家造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'騎士與愛馬之間的不渝忠誠也只能到此為止。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061a6fc1-2c97-4eed-9dc4-89bddcc59174\', \'multiverseId\': 534406}, \'multiverseid\': 534406}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blätterdach-Panorama\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {W}.)\\nDas Blätterdach-Panorama kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wald, Ebene\', \'flavor\': \'Der Kontinent Murasa liegt unter einem dichten Blätterdach verborgen, die Vegetation so verwachsen, dass seine Einwohner niemals den Boden erblicken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2de4a682-4a15-4193-8179-73ac4ee321ec\', \'multiverseId\': 532825}, \'multiverseid\': 532825}, {\'name\': \'Panorámica de la enramada\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {G} o {W}.)\\nLa Panorámica de la enramada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Bosque llanura\', \'flavor\': \'El continente de Murasa se oculta bajo una espesa capa de vegetación. Las enormes ramas que lo cubren están tan enredadas que algunos de sus habitantes jamás llegan a ver el suelo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4938d61-c5a2-4af6-a14b-a2f82b005fde\', \'multiverseId\': 533036}, \'multiverseid\': 533036}, {\'name\': \'Vue de la canopée\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {W}.)\\nLa Vue de la canopée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : forêt et plaine\', \'flavor\': "Le continent de Murasa est protégé par une épaisse couche de végétation, dont les énormes branches s\'enchevêtrent si étroitement que certains habitants ne voient jamais le sol.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533247&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'792efb4e-54f0-4041-b7ae-3acdbe654452\', \'multiverseId\': 533247}, \'multiverseid\': 533247}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Fronde\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {G} o {W}.)\\nIl Panorama di Fronde entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Foresta Pianura\', \'flavor\': \'Il continente di Murasa giace sotto una coltre di fitta vegetazione, dagli enormi rami aggrovigliati così strettamente che alcuni dei suoi abitanti non vedono mai il suolo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c617fa5d-dadb-40eb-84e1-5267682ef6d5\', \'multiverseId\': 533458}, \'multiverseid\': 533458}, {\'name\': \'梢の眺望\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{G}か{W}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、梢の眺望はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 森・平地\', \'flavor\': \'ムラーサ大陸は密生する植生に覆われている。巨大な木々の曲がりくねった枝が稠密に重なっており、ここに住む人々の中には、地面を見たことのない者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43cf3ba4-4c6a-4bca-aaaa-5b12e4a017dc\', \'multiverseId\': 533669}, \'multiverseid\': 533669}, {\'name\': \'Vista do Dossel\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {G} ou {W}.)\\nVista do Dossel entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Floresta Planície\', \'flavor\': \'O continente de Murasa fica sob um manto de densa vegetação, seus galhos enormes tão densamente emaranhados que alguns habitantes jamais veem o chão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6ee88cb-f105-436d-823e-2536aa9441dc\', \'multiverseId\': 533880}, \'multiverseid\': 533880}, {\'name\': \'Дорога Среди Крон\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {G} или {W}.)\\nДорога Среди Крон выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Лес Равнина\', \'flavor\': \'Весь континент Мураса покрывают дремучие леса. Огромные ветви деревьев переплетаются так плотно, что некоторые обитатели крон живут и умирают, ни разу не увидев земли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e9ac596-0cca-4206-bbbf-544c0ca0bb6d\', \'multiverseId\': 534091}, \'multiverseid\': 534091}, {\'name\': \'林冠远景\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}或{W}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则林冠远景须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地 ～树林／平原\', \'flavor\': \'姆拉撒大陆上覆厚密植被，庞巨盘枝交错横生，尚有居民从未见过其下大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73648b1e-74f0-48d3-a676-20d69e42fc83\', \'multiverseId\': 534302}, \'multiverseid\': 534302}, {\'name\': \'林冠遠景\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{G}或{W}。）\\n除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則林冠遠景須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'地 ～樹林／平原\', \'flavor\': \'姆拉撒大陸上覆厚密植被，龐巨盤枝交錯橫生，尚有居民從未見過其下大地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b1a3d9-7a18-4ec5-8d44-631f84b980c5\', \'multiverseId\': 534513}, \'multiverseid\': 534513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blühende Umarmung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3 und „Zu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments erzeugst du einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532771&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5922508-b54e-4fd8-8aba-5f6052dbf9c5\', \'multiverseId\': 532771}, \'multiverseid\': 532771}, {\'name\': \'Abrazo verde\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3 y tiene "Al comienzo de cada mantenimiento, crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c488023-7443-45a0-a612-dc6fe17c9c01\', \'multiverseId\': 532982}, \'multiverseid\': 532982}, {\'name\': \'Étreinte verdoyante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3 et a « Au début de chaque entretien, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f94adeb0-95f8-4dff-8613-10d2008ac305\', \'multiverseId\': 533193}, \'multiverseid\': 533193}, {\'name\': \'Abbraccio della Vegetazione\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3 e ha "All\\\'inizio di ogni mantenimento, crea una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'176cf32e-1930-47e4-9387-593aa29c093d\', \'multiverseId\': 533404}, \'multiverseid\': 533404}, {\'name\': \'新緑の抱擁\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受け「各アップキープの開始時に、緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df7e2e0-b142-43e5-a917-c6f0fc81d009\', \'multiverseId\': 533615}, \'multiverseid\': 533615}, {\'name\': \'Abraço Verdejante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3 e tem "No início de cada manutenção, crie uma ficha de criatura Saprófita verde 1/1."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3560ca3-af29-45ab-a94b-ca0348c10b00\', \'multiverseId\': 533826}, \'multiverseid\': 533826}, {\'name\': \'Зеленое Объятье\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3 и имеет способность «В начале каждого шага поддержки создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9342f7e-cab9-4dc9-96f0-e358a2037f66\', \'multiverseId\': 534037}, \'multiverseid\': 534037}, {\'name\': \'新绿之拥\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3且具有「在每个维持开始时，派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70f6533-dc91-467a-ab1f-7d94b0dc5ee9\', \'multiverseId\': 534248}, \'multiverseid\': 534248}, {\'name\': \'新綠之擁\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+3/+3且具有「在每個維持開始時，派出一個1/1綠色腐生物衍生生物。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99afcb25-26f9-48de-8006-c7a97afae451\', \'multiverseId\': 534459}, \'multiverseid\': 534459}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bogardanischer Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn der Bogardanische Höllendrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er 5 Schadenspunkte zu, deren Aufteilung auf eine beliebige Anzahl an Zielen deiner Wahl du bestimmst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532713&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0ae078-a0e7-4c2c-9276-f399477f1613\', \'multiverseId\': 532713}, \'multiverseid\': 532713}, {\'name\': \'Engendro de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando el Engendro de Bogardan entre al campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño divididos como elijas entre cualquier cantidad de objetivos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b1e190-1ef5-484d-bc92-72b82b405997\', \'multiverseId\': 532924}, \'multiverseid\': 532924}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer du Bogardân\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand l\'Escouflenfer du Bogardân arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures réparties comme vous le voulez entre n\'importe quel nombre de cibles.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533135&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e6d6b43-d928-49f6-869f-51c986cef2da\', \'multiverseId\': 533135}, \'multiverseid\': 533135}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nVolare\\nQuando il Nibbio Infernale di Bogardan entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni divisi a tua scelta tra un qualsiasi numero di bersagli.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1891760f-8aa7-4473-adb6-43ebb6200577\', \'multiverseId\': 533346}, \'multiverseid\': 533346}, {\'name\': \'ボガーダンのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\nボガーダンのヘルカイトが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち望む数を対象とし、あなたの望むように５点分を割り振る。これはそれらにその割り振った点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8a79fb5-e126-44c0-8eeb-aa6a2821734a\', \'multiverseId\': 533557}, \'multiverseid\': 533557}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nVoar\\nQuando Dragão Avérneo de Bogardan entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 5 pontos de dano distribuídos à sua escolha entre qualquer número de alvos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e3557b-efc1-4a15-82e3-d92115dfde03\', \'multiverseId\': 533768}, \'multiverseid\': 533768}, {\'name\': \'Богарданский Змей\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nПолет\\nКогда Богарданский Змей выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 5 повреждений, разделенных по вашему выбору между любым количеством целей.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78166b31-f038-400d-afc7-b5116a018393\', \'multiverseId\': 533979}, \'multiverseid\': 533979}, {\'name\': \'博卡登残虐者\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当博卡登残虐者进战场时，它对任意数量的目标造成共5点伤害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534190&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b95d6d-f27b-49e6-9749-55c08c05efbb\', \'multiverseId\': 534190}, \'multiverseid\': 534190}, {\'name\': \'博卡登殘虐者\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n飛行\\n當博卡登殘虐者進戰場時，它對任意數量的目標造成共5點傷害，你可以任意分配。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1238772b-a39f-4365-97eb-d6c0bba1f9e4\', \'multiverseId\': 534401}, \'multiverseid\': 534401}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532824&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53b6360-789f-4498-b5e7-f440f2221006\', \'multiverseId\': 532824}, \'multiverseid\': 532824}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d118205-430e-4120-84d9-4bc7c0e00cdc\', \'multiverseId\': 533035}, \'multiverseid\': 533035}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533246&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ed9474-5473-4955-af07-3085b67275bc\', \'multiverseId\': 533246}, \'multiverseid\': 533246}, {\'name\': \'Acquitrino di Bojuka\', \'text\': "L\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquitrino di Bojuka entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49d7acc9-2822-4e3e-8c23-4a74e81dce5c\', \'multiverseId\': 533457}, \'multiverseid\': 533457}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63d24f8b-e451-4aeb-a276-9572dda72ff9\', \'multiverseId\': 533668}, \'multiverseid\': 533668}, {\'name\': \'Pântano de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'Pântano de Bojuka entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Pântano de Bojuka entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ed7b17-aba8-4625-943b-2af1583fe586\', \'multiverseId\': 533879}, \'multiverseid\': 533879}, {\'name\': \'Боджукское Болото\', \'text\': \'Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Боджукское Болото выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'685fb5c3-5d9b-4ec2-8990-6f7d83451ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 534090}, \'multiverseid\': 534090}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼须横置进战场。\\n当泊卒卡腐沼进战场时，放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\\n{T}：加{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59d523cc-c2b0-409b-a4b4-46a053185cf3\', \'multiverseId\': 534301}, \'multiverseid\': 534301}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼須橫置進戰場。\\n當泊卒卡腐沼進戰場時，放逐目標玩家墳墓場中的所有牌。\\n{T}：加{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7fba3ee-beff-4f4d-8bc0-844a40a6f559\', \'multiverseId\': 534512}, \'multiverseid\': 534512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brosche des Wandersmanns\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, opfere die Brosche des Wandersmanns: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Druiden halten bestimmte Pflanzen für heilig und benutzen ihre Blätter und ihr Holz als Fokus für Zaubersprüche.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'225fab62-7f7f-4a81-b6d4-8758c3ea023f\', \'multiverseId\': 532820}, \'multiverseid\': 532820}, {\'name\': \'Baratija del caminante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrificar la Baratija del caminante: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los druidas creen que ciertos árboles son sagrados y emplean sus hojas y madera como canalizador mágico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb13cf3-1d07-455c-84be-4f1445b8fc66\', \'multiverseId\': 533031}, \'multiverseid\': 533031}, {\'name\': \'Babiole du voyageur\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifiez la Babiole du voyageur : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les druides considèrent certaines plantes comme sacrées et utilisent leurs feuilles et leur bois comme focus d\'incantation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533242&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64815e54-913d-43a2-8671-f0612e12c07b\', \'multiverseId\': 533242}, \'multiverseid\': 533242}, {\'name\': \'Ninnolo del Viaggiatore\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Ninnolo del Viaggiatore: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I druidi venerano certe piante e ne usano le foglie e il legno per incanalare i propri poteri magici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8340b7eb-dcbb-478b-ac87-09f01fb2a64b\', \'multiverseId\': 533453}, \'multiverseid\': 533453}, {\'name\': \'旅人のガラクタ\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, 旅人のガラクタを生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ドルイドは特定のいくつかの植物を聖別し、その葉や枝を呪文発動焦点具として用いる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8209eda7-2ced-43b1-bbe1-b0f66daf2462\', \'multiverseId\': 533664}, \'multiverseid\': 533664}, {\'name\': \'Bijuteria do Viajante\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, sacrifique Bijuteria do Viajante: Procure em seu grimório um card de terreno básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os druidas consideram certas plantas sagradas e usam as folhas e a madeira delas como foco conjuratório.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9502c7d6-08ac-47e7-a4d4-e97c56a6d1a8\', \'multiverseId\': 533875}, \'multiverseid\': 533875}, {\'name\': \'Безделушка Путника\', \'text\': \'{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Безделушку Путника: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Друиды считают некоторые растения священными и используют их листья и древесину в качестве фокусирующих предметов для заклинания.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938a1ab7-680c-4e39-b169-91e36736541c\', \'multiverseId\': 534086}, \'multiverseid\': 534086}, {\'name\': \'旅人饰品\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，牺牲旅人饰品：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'德鲁伊视特定种类的植物为圣物，会用其落叶与枝条当作法器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61f34839-0523-4d6f-80ac-3186a9b544a1\', \'multiverseId\': 534297}, \'multiverseid\': 534297}, {\'name\': \'旅人飾品\', \'text\': \'{2}，{T}，犧牲旅人飾品：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將該牌橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'德魯伊視特定種類的植物為聖物，會用其落葉與枝條當作法器。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f992194c-bccf-4db1-aad8-4f5c99f01ce5\', \'multiverseId\': 534508}, \'multiverseid\': 534508}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bucknards immervoller Geldbeutel\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Würfle einen W4 und erzeuge so viele Schatz-Spielsteine, wie dem Ergebnis entspricht. Der Spieler rechts von dir übernimmt die Kontrolle über Bucknards immervollen Geldbeutel.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Solange man ihn nicht komplett leert, produziert dieser magische Beutel jeden Morgen ein paar Münzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c3976a9-28a5-427f-879c-6ee629aec81b\', \'multiverseId\': 532012}, \'multiverseid\': 532012}, {\'name\': \'Monedero siemprelleno de Bucknard\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Tira 1d4 y crea una cantidad de fichas de Tesoro igual al resultado. El jugador de tu derecha gana el control del Monedero siemprelleno de Bucknard.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Este bolsito mágico creará monedas cada amanecer siempre y cuando no quede vacío.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625cfbff-5ee9-4b61-ab2f-ecb1b328e40d\', \'multiverseId\': 532066}, \'multiverseid\': 532066}, {\'name\': \'Bourse magique de Bucknard\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Lancez un d4 et créez un nombre de jetons Trésor égal au résultat. Le joueur à votre droite acquiert le contrôle de la Bourse magique de Bucknard.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Tant qu\'elle ne reste jamais vide, cette bourse magique produit des pièces chaque jour à l\'aube.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505d4925-adca-4fff-b08e-cb51c9d43186\', \'multiverseId\': 532120}, \'multiverseid\': 532120}, {\'name\': \'Borsa Sempre Piena di Bucknard\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Tira un d4 e crea un numero di pedine Tesoro pari al risultato. Il giocatore alla tua destra prende il controllo della Borsa Sempre Piena di Bucknard.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Fintanto che non viene svuotato del tutto, questo borsello magico produce monete a ogni alba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c300c38-e5d0-43f8-aa9a-c30b7572ff9a\', \'multiverseId\': 532174}, \'multiverseid\': 532174}, {\'name\': \'バックナードの裕福な財布\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：１個のd4を振り、その出目に等しい数の宝物・トークンを生成する。あなたの右側のプレイヤーはバックナードの裕福な財布のコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'空にしないかぎり、この魔法のポーチは夜明けごとにコインを生み出す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d2c184-5661-4229-bf6a-d0b081398958\', \'multiverseId\': 532228}, \'multiverseid\': 532228}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa Semprecheia de Bucknard\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Role um d4 e crie um número de fichas de Tesouro igual ao resultado. O jogador à sua direita ganha o controle de Bolsa Semprecheia de Bucknard.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Esta bolsa mágica produzirá moedas a cada amanhecer, desde que nunca fique vazia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4554d45-7af5-4d39-80fa-31bc1d790bee\', \'multiverseId\': 532282}, \'multiverseid\': 532282}, {\'name\': \'Вечнополный Кошель Бакнарда\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: бросьте d4 и создайте количество фишек Клада, равное результату броска. Игрок справа от вас получает контроль над Вечнополным Кошелем Бакнарда.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Если не оставлять его пустым, этот волшебный кошель творит монеты на каждой заре.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab46c620-b085-4045-8536-4fe5d8f33250\', \'multiverseId\': 532336}, \'multiverseid\': 532336}, {\'name\': \'巴克娜的满溢钱包\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：掷一颗d4并派出若干珍宝衍生物，其数量等同于掷骰结果。你右手边的牌手获得巴克娜的满溢钱包之操控权。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'只要不把这魔法钱包掏空，它每天清晨都会生出金币。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a65a69-d6cb-4e1e-825f-a81b4a09ef27\', \'multiverseId\': 532390}, \'multiverseid\': 532390}, {\'name\': \'巴克娜的滿溢錢包\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：擲一顆d4並派出若干珍寶衍生物，其數量等同於擲骰結果。你右手邊的玩家獲得巴克娜的滿溢錢包之操控權。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'只要不把這魔法錢包掏空，它每天清晨都會生出金幣。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f280a23-12c4-4235-b96d-90b529c17b03\', \'multiverseId\': 532444}, \'multiverseid\': 532444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Catti-brie von Mithralhalle\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag, Reichweite\\nImmer wenn Catti-brie von Mithralhalle angreift, lege für jede an sie angelegte Ausrüstung eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\n{1}, entferne alle +1/+1-Marken von Catti-Brie: Sie fügt einer angreifenden oder blockenden Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl der auf diese Weise entfernten Marken ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Bogenschütze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531589&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fefe87c-52b5-4261-a46e-1f4f56c84162\', \'multiverseId\': 531589}, \'multiverseid\': 531589}, {\'name\': \'Catti-brie del Salón de Mithral\', \'text\': \'Daña primero, alcance.\\nSiempre que Catti-brie del Salón de Mithral ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella por cada Equipo anexado a ella.\\n{1}, remover todos los contadores +1/+1 de Catti-brie: Hace X puntos de daño a la criatura atacante o bloqueadora objetivo que controla un oponente, donde X es la cantidad de contadores removidos de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Arquero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4d10385-bd20-413b-912f-86e3273b84c3\', \'multiverseId\': 531645}, \'multiverseid\': 531645}, {\'name\': \'Catti-Brie de Castelmithral\', \'text\': "Initiative, portée\\nÀ chaque fois que Catti-Brie de Castelmithral attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle pour chaque équipement qui lui est attaché.\\n{1}, retirez tous les marqueurs +1/+1 de Catti-Brie : Elle inflige X blessures à une créature attaquante ou bloqueuse ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle, X étant le nombre de marqueurs retirés de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et archer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531701&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901c0c22-b340-4d06-9de0-86c1e28f8ff6\', \'multiverseId\': 531701}, \'multiverseid\': 531701}, {\'name\': \'Catti-brie di Mithral Hall\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso, raggiungere\\nOgniqualvolta Catti-brie di Mithral Hall attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa per ogni Equipaggiamento assegnato ad essa.\\n{1}, Rimuovi tutti i segnalini +1/+1 da Catti-brie: Infligge X danni a una creatura attaccante o bloccante bersaglio controllata da un avversario, dove X è il numero di segnalini rimossi in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Arciere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff53a9e8-d004-4b4e-a53b-9200c24cebdd\', \'multiverseId\': 531757}, \'multiverseid\': 531757}, {\'name\': \'ミスラル・ホールのキャッティ・ブリー\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃、到達\\nミスラル・ホールのキャッティ・ブリーが攻撃するたび、これの上に、これについている装備品の数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。\\n{1}, ミスラル・ホールのキャッティ・ブリーの上からすべての＋１/＋１カウンターを取り除く：対戦相手がコントロールしている、攻撃クリーチャーやブロック・クリーチャーのうち１つを対象とする。これはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはこれにより取り除かれたカウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・射手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26140ee6-e648-4a7d-8cbb-a482b3a07a41\', \'multiverseId\': 531813}, \'multiverseid\': 531813}]', '[{\'name\': \'Champion des Scharfsinns\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Champion des Scharfsinns ins Spiel kommt, kannst du so viele Karten ziehen, wie seine Stärke beträgt. Falls du dies tust, wirf zwei Karten ab.\\nVerewigen {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie von ihr ist, außer dass er ein 4/4 schwarzer Zombie-Naga-Zauberer ohne Manakosten ist. Spiele Verewigen wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532678&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b448c1e7-a778-4c61-a799-1fc2ca4a0edd\', \'multiverseId\': 532678}, \'multiverseid\': 532678}, {\'name\': \'Campeona del ingenio\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Campeona del ingenio entre al campo de batalla, puedes robar una cantidad de cartas igual a su fuerza. Si lo haces, descarta dos cartas.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U}. ({5}{U}{U}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha que es una copia de esta carta, excepto que es un Hechicero Naga Zombie negro 4/4 sin coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de eternizar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b19cf0-29c4-4b6f-98cf-84920520a77b\', \'multiverseId\': 532889}, \'multiverseid\': 532889}, {\'name\': "Championne d\'esprits", \'text\': "Quand la Championne d\'esprits arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez piocher un nombre de cartes égal à sa force. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous de deux cartes.\\nÉternalisation {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Créez un jeton qui en est une copie, excepté que c\'est un zombie et naga et sorcier 4/4 noir sans coût de mana. N\'utilisez l\'éternalisation que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature : naga et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad949818-8c33-4631-ac1b-8cd188570584\', \'multiverseId\': 533100}, \'multiverseid\': 533100}, {\'name\': "Campionessa d\'Ingegno", \'text\': "Quando la Campionessa d\'Ingegno entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pescare carte pari alla sua forza. Se lo fai, scarta due carte.\\nEternare {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, Esilia questa carta dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina che è una copia della carta, tranne che è un Mago Naga Zombie 4/4 nero senza costo di mana. Eterna solo come una stregoneria.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Naga\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'589e4dff-f75d-48ab-b354-172f71e6e224\', \'multiverseId\': 533311}, \'multiverseid\': 533311}, {\'name\': \'機知の勇者\', \'text\': \'機知の勇者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは「これのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。その後、カード２枚を捨てる。」を選んでもよい。\\n永遠{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}, あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：マナ・コストを持たず黒で４/４でゾンビ・ナーガ・ウィザードであることを除きこれのコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。永遠はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7adcfc22-a976-4e92-a4a5-b77646b2e34d\', \'multiverseId\': 533522}, \'multiverseid\': 533522}, {\'name\': \'Campeã do Raciocínio\', \'text\': \'Quando Campeã do Raciocínio entra no campo de batalha, você pode comprar uma quantidade de cards igual ao seu poder. Se fizer isso, descarte dois cards.\\nEternizar {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, exile este card de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha que seja uma cópia dele, com a exceção de ser um Zumbi Naga Mago preto 4/4 sem custo de mana. Eternize somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Naga Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf47fff-1198-4acd-82b7-d7f58f0dc4fa\', \'multiverseId\': 533733}, \'multiverseid\': 533733}, {\'name\': \'Поборница Разума\', \'text\': \'Когда Поборница Разума выходит на поле битвы, вы можете взять количество карт, равное ее силе. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте две карты.\\nУвековечивание {5}{U}{U} ({5}{U}{U}, изгоните эту карту из вашего кладбища: создайте одну фишку, являющуюся ее копией, но при этом являющуюся черным Зомби Нагой Чародеем 4/4 без мана-стоимости. Увековечивайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Нага Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132d8397-fea9-4e08-b03f-b085f3a3365c\', \'multiverseId\': 533944}, \'multiverseid\': 533944}, {\'name\': \'聪智斗士\', \'text\': \'当聪智斗士进战场时，你可以抓等同于其力量的牌。若你如此作，则弃两张牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：派出一个衍生物，且为此牌的复制品，但它是4/4黑色灵俑／那伽／法术师，且没有法术力费用。只能于法术时机永生。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ba0cc0-3309-4e58-ab7f-b1ca5566ca9c\', \'multiverseId\': 534155}, \'multiverseid\': 534155}, {\'name\': \'聰智鬥士\', \'text\': \'當聰智鬥士進戰場時，你可以抽等同於其力量的牌。若你如此作，則棄兩張牌。\\n永生{5}{U}{U}（{5}{U}{U}，從你的墳墓場放逐此牌：派出一個衍生物，且為此牌的複製品，但它是4/4黑色殭屍／那伽／魔法師，且沒有魔法力費用。只能於巫術時機永生。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～那伽／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0ecb2f-d46b-4b9b-a397-c475d5157da2\', \'multiverseId\': 534366}, \'multiverseid\': 534366}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosdrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nDer Chaosdrache greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug würfelt jeder Spieler einen W20. Falls ein oder mehrere Gegner das höchste Ergebnis erzielt haben, kann der Chaosdrache in diesem Kampf keinen jener Spieler oder Planeswalker, die sie kontrollieren, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531575&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77d981b7-5415-4e3b-b1dc-46b7895448ae\', \'multiverseId\': 531575}, \'multiverseid\': 531575}, {\'name\': \'Dragón del caos\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nEl Dragón del caos ataca cada combate si puede.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, cada jugador tira 1d20. Si uno o más oponentes sacaron el resultado más alto, el Dragón del caos no puede atacar este combate a esos jugadores o a planeswalkers que controlan.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c089634-ff58-46b6-84cd-bdbc4b5a43bf\', \'multiverseId\': 531631}, \'multiverseid\': 531631}, {\'name\': \'Dragon du chaos\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nLe Dragon du chaos attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, chaque joueur lance un d20. Si au moins un adversaire a eu le résultat le plus élevé, le Dragon du chaos ne peut pas attaquer ce joueur ou les planeswalkers qu\'il contrôle pendant ce combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531687&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e9ece9-407c-43be-b126-113fc2ffde87\', \'multiverseId\': 531687}, \'multiverseid\': 531687}, {\'name\': \'Drago del Caos\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nIl Drago del Caos attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, ogni giocatore tira un d20. Se uno o più avversari hanno ottenuto il risultato più alto, il Drago del Caos non può attaccare quei giocatori o i planeswalker che controllano in questo combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12ddff1-1654-4fb2-8684-efd64a6b1563\', \'multiverseId\': 531743}, \'multiverseid\': 531743}, {\'name\': \'ケイオス・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n各戦闘で、ケイオス・ドラゴンは可能なら攻撃する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれd20を１回振る。１人以上の対戦相手が最大の出目を出したなら、この戦闘で、ケイオス・ドラゴンはそのプレイヤーやそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f837b28f-f9a6-42ab-a60c-3ffba5bbf633\', \'multiverseId\': 531799}, \'multiverseid\': 531799}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosdrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nDer Chaosdrache greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich.\\nZu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug würfelt jeder Spieler einen W20. Falls ein oder mehrere Gegner das höchste Ergebnis erzielt haben, kann der Chaosdrache in diesem Kampf keinen jener Spieler oder Planeswalker, die sie kontrollieren, angreifen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9665d06a-d182-4361-819b-f00b18afdcdc\', \'multiverseId\': 531989}, \'multiverseid\': 531989}, {\'name\': \'Dragón del caos\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nEl Dragón del caos ataca cada combate si puede.\\nAl comienzo del combate en tu turno, cada jugador tira 1d20. Si uno o más oponentes sacaron el resultado más alto, el Dragón del caos no puede atacar este combate a esos jugadores o a planeswalkers que controlan.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0778e7-0b1a-4e68-88ae-c635bcc6d776\', \'multiverseId\': 532043}, \'multiverseid\': 532043}, {\'name\': \'Dragon du chaos\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nLe Dragon du chaos attaque à chaque combat si possible.\\nAu début du combat pendant votre tour, chaque joueur lance un d20. Si au moins un adversaire a eu le résultat le plus élevé, le Dragon du chaos ne peut pas attaquer ce joueur ou les planeswalkers qu\'il contrôle pendant ce combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d8cba3-db4a-4ec7-950c-6365c9c00adf\', \'multiverseId\': 532097}, \'multiverseid\': 532097}, {\'name\': \'Drago del Caos\', \'text\': "Volare, rapidità\\nIl Drago del Caos attacca in ogni combattimento, se può farlo.\\nAll\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, ogni giocatore tira un d20. Se uno o più avversari hanno ottenuto il risultato più alto, il Drago del Caos non può attaccare quei giocatori o i planeswalker che controllano in questo combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d7e390-0c0f-4705-88ea-b88f7a901e89\', \'multiverseId\': 532151}, \'multiverseid\': 532151}, {\'name\': \'混沌のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n各戦闘で、混沌のドラゴンは可能なら攻撃する。\\nあなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、各プレイヤーはそれぞれd20を１回振る。１人以上の対戦相手が最大の出目を出したなら、この戦闘で、混沌のドラゴンはそのプレイヤーやそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカーを攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1874741e-18f5-4af0-bfc7-ff0d9402ebb6\', \'multiverseId\': 532205}, \'multiverseid\': 532205}, {\'name\': \'Dragão do Caos\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nDragão do Caos ataca a cada combate se estiver apto.\\nNo início do combate no seu turno, cada jogador rola um d20. Se um ou mais oponentes tirarem o maior resultado, Dragão do Caos não poderá atacar aqueles jogadores ou os planeswalkers que eles controlem neste combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aaff6f8-b58f-4593-bea3-4e6cc3228a23\', \'multiverseId\': 532259}, \'multiverseid\': 532259}, {\'name\': \'Дракон Хаоса\', \'text\': "Полет, Ускорение\\nДракон Хаоса атакует в каждом бою, если может.\\nВ начале боя во время вашего хода каждый игрок бросает d20. Если у одного или нескольких оппонентов наивысший результат, то Дракон Хаоса не может атаковать тех игроков или planeswalker\'ов под их контролем в этом бою.", \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e3f2c7f-1adc-4233-b97f-8799caab10be\', \'multiverseId\': 532313}, \'multiverseid\': 532313}, {\'name\': \'混乱巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n混乱巨龙每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击。\\n在你回合的战斗开始时，每位牌手各掷一颗d20。如果一位或数位对手的掷骰结果最大，则混乱巨龙本次战斗中不能攻击这些牌手或由其操控的鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'883171ed-4a23-4de8-a527-4b4114ab9c17\', \'multiverseId\': 532367}, \'multiverseid\': 532367}, {\'name\': \'混亂巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行，敏捷\\n混亂巨龍每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊。\\n在你回合的戰鬥開始時，每位玩家各擲一顆d20。如果一位或數位對手的擲骰結果最大，則混亂巨龍本次戰鬥中不能攻擊這些玩家或由其操控的鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1af51d4-879e-4f49-ad33-c78dcfc589a1\', \'multiverseId\': 532421}, \'multiverseid\': 532421}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer einer bleibenden Karte deiner Wahl mischt sie in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine bleibende Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532715&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'390998c2-6fee-457b-8ae7-edf5b702a284\', \'multiverseId\': 532715}, \'multiverseid\': 532715}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5aa8619-dc1f-4dea-a9f6-a8f0461bf140\', \'multiverseId\': 532926}, \'multiverseid\': 532926}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533137&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c72dcb5f-72a5-4d1f-be4f-5c68d6790f93\', \'multiverseId\': 533137}, \'multiverseid\': 533137}, {\'name\': \'Distorsione Caotica\', \'text\': \'Il proprietario di un permanente bersaglio lo rimescola nel suo grimorio, poi rivela la prima carta del suo grimorio. Se è una carta permanente, la mette sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7390006-72ec-4e12-a443-fce6c942275a\', \'multiverseId\': 533348}, \'multiverseid\': 533348}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それがパーマネント・カードであるなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae1dd3ea-ed30-4f35-8194-30401f03851e\', \'multiverseId\': 533559}, \'multiverseid\': 533559}, {\'name\': \'Distorção Caótica\', \'text\': \'O dono da permanente alvo a embaralha no próprio grimório e depois revela o card do topo do próprio grimório. Se for um card de permanente, ele o coloca no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cc772b-d8ee-4974-b32a-aab9687b92cb\', \'multiverseId\': 533770}, \'multiverseid\': 533770}, {\'name\': \'Искривление Хаоса\', \'text\': \'Владелец целевого перманента втасовывает его в свою библиотеку, затем показывает верхнюю карту своей библиотеки. Если это карта перманента, он кладет ее на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d4cf963-442c-439a-91ce-ee8690cdecab\', \'multiverseId\': 533981}, \'multiverseid\': 533981}, {\'name\': \'混沌歪曲\', \'text\': \'选择目标永久物。其拥有者将它洗入其牌库，然后展示其牌库顶牌。如果该牌是永久物牌，则该牌手将它放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5902c0-aa0f-4e79-a900-70adc18e9c13\', \'multiverseId\': 534192}, \'multiverseid\': 534192}, {\'name\': \'混沌歪曲\', \'text\': \'選擇目標永久物。其擁有者將它洗入其牌庫，然後展示其牌庫頂牌。如果該牌是永久物牌，則該玩家將它放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29b53932-4696-4016-9716-d2602cb1d30b\', \'multiverseId\': 534403}, \'multiverseid\': 534403}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosstab\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532799&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd214e1b-6be2-4bf7-bc1c-e12f65bd839d\', \'multiverseId\': 532799}, \'multiverseid\': 532799}, {\'name\': \'Varita del caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: El oponente objetivo exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, pon las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a7800c-230e-4198-be3d-363a62063768\', \'multiverseId\': 533010}, \'multiverseid\': 533010}, {\'name\': \'Baguette du chaos\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Un adversaire ciblé exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de cette bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d92090-553d-4518-83d6-239052597b3b\', \'multiverseId\': 533221}, \'multiverseid\': 533221}, {\'name\': \'Bacchetta del Caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Un avversario bersaglio esilia carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a che non esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi metti in fondo a quel grimorio in ordine casuale le carte esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd7466a3-ad00-4c2d-861a-e3e793ebb45d\', \'multiverseId\': 533432}, \'multiverseid\': 533432}, {\'name\': \'混沌のワンド\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後これにより追放して唱えなかったカードをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53254b0-6968-4b67-9844-91dd972d016b\', \'multiverseId\': 533643}, \'multiverseid\': 533643}, {\'name\': \'Varinha do Caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: O oponente alvo exila cards do topo do próprio grimório até exilar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Depois, coloque os cards exilados que não foram conjurados desta forma no fundo daquele grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13f5ddc8-6582-42c6-a038-0abb6d0e4858\', \'multiverseId\': 533854}, \'multiverseid\': 533854}, {\'name\': \'Магический Жезл Хаоса\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: целевой оппонент изгоняет карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгонит карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Затем положите изгнанные карты, не разыгранные таким образом, в низ той библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c929adf3-ae6a-4321-ad35-6b0dc79e63f7\', \'multiverseId\': 534065}, \'multiverseid\': 534065}, {\'name\': \'混沌法杖\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：目标对手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌依随机顺序置于该牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e912ec2-c125-41e6-9b96-90a93e091e76\', \'multiverseId\': 534276}, \'multiverseid\': 534276}, {\'name\': \'混沌法杖\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：目標對手從其牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。然後將所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌依隨機順序置於該牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c9f2b3c-2a4a-43e4-b643-ef82dde82664\', \'multiverseId\': 534487}, \'multiverseid\': 534487}]', "[{'name': 'Dekret der Wildheit', 'text': 'Lege vier +1/+1-Marken auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\\nUmwandlung {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du das Dekret der Wildheit umwandelst, kannst du vier +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl legen.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532754&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3138f69a-a632-45cd-9a4f-dc1518ebfcf2', 'multiverseId': 532754}, 'multiverseid': 532754}, {'name': 'Decreto de salvajismo', 'text': 'Pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas.\\nCiclo {4}{G}{G}. ({4}{G}{G}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Decreto de salvajismo, puedes poner cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532965&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '85129925-0285-4446-ac63-975b84284bf2', 'multiverseId': 532965}, 'multiverseid': 532965}, {'name': 'Décret de sauvagerie', 'text': 'Mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nRecyclage {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Décret de sauvagerie, vous pouvez mettre quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533176&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f86f6a3-0e42-4cdc-8409-c9bd8941de9f', 'multiverseId': 533176}, 'multiverseid': 533176}, {'name': 'Decreto della Ferocia', 'text': 'Metti quattro segnalini +1/+1 su ogni creatura che controlli.\\nCiclo {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)\\nQuando cicli il Decreto della Ferocia, puoi mettere quattro segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533387&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2f3f0247-58ea-4442-bc01-005f1d09225f', 'multiverseId': 533387}, 'multiverseid': 533387}, {'name': '凶暴の命令', 'text': 'あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター４個を置く。\\nサイクリング{4}{G}{G}（{4}{G}{G}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたが凶暴の命令をサイクリングしたとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたはそれの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個を置いてもよい。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533598&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48f0bcf9-d513-4bac-a19e-470b184f832c', 'multiverseId': 533598}, 'multiverseid': 533598}, {'name': 'Decreto de Selvageria', 'text': 'Coloque quatro marcadores +1/+1 em cada criatura que você controla.\\nReciclar {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\\nQuando você recicla Decreto de Selvageria, você pode colocar quatro marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533809&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94aca7fe-93ea-448c-9455-a754f7c70e69', 'multiverseId': 533809}, 'multiverseid': 533809}, {'name': 'Дикарский Указ', 'text': 'Положите четыре жетона +1/+1 на каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nЦикл {4}{G}{G} ({4}{G}{G}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\\nКогда вы совершаете Цикл Дикарского Указа, вы можете положить четыре жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534020&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78c37a92-ea31-4099-926c-e7d48dbf5b99', 'multiverseId': 534020}, 'multiverseid': 534020}, {'name': '蛮勇的宣判', 'text': '在每个由你操控的生物上各放置四个+1/+1指示物。\\n循环{4}{G}{G}（{4}{G}{G}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环蛮勇的宣判时，你可以在目标生物上放置四个+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534231&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4366334-8b34-4f40-9084-869593b4e7ba', 'multiverseId': 534231}, 'multiverseid': 534231}, {'name': '蠻勇的宣判', 'text': '在每個由你操控的生物上放置四個+1/+1指示物。\\n循環{4}{G}{G}（{4}{G}{G}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\\n當你循環蠻勇的宣判時，你可以在目標生物上放置四個+1/+1指示物。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534442&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '32d1b4fa-0803-462e-b5d7-3493d4901be6', 'multiverseId': 534442}, 'multiverseid': 534442}]", '[{\'name\': \'Der Ärger\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nSolange der Ärger in deinem Friedhof ist und du ein Gebirge kontrollierst, haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Eile.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Inkarnation\', \'flavor\': \'„Geschmolzene Erde alleine hat keine Wut. Erst wenn du sie mit deinem eigenem Zorn fütterst, kann das Magma brodeln und Gestalt annehmen."\\n—Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532711&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9c8925e-da70-4bbf-9436-7ebc5d97cffa\', \'multiverseId\': 532711}, \'multiverseid\': 532711}, {\'name\': \'Enojo\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nMientras el Enojo esté en tu cementerio y controles una Montaña, las criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de prisa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnación\', \'flavor\': \'"La tierra fundida no está enojada. Pero si le infundes tu ira, el magma es capaz de entrar en cólera y tomar una forma".\\n—Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc7afd29-26ce-4080-858b-3ece0d2e4aa7\', \'multiverseId\': 532922}, \'multiverseid\': 532922}, {\'name\': \'La Colère\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nTant que La Colère est dans votre cimetière et que vous contrôlez une montagne, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont la célérité.\', \'type\': \'Créature : incarnation\', \'flavor\': "« La roche en fusion n\'a aucune colère. Il n\'y a qu\'en lui insufflant votre propre rage que le magma peut bouillir et prendre forme. »\\n—Koth du Marteau", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533133&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addc8f22-2b96-47e1-8a21-e40c582b9f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 533133}, \'multiverseid\': 533133}, {\'name\': \'La Rabbia\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nFintanto che La Rabbia è nel tuo cimitero e controlli una Montagna, le creature che controlli hanno rapidità.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Incarnazione\', \'flavor\': \'"La terra fusa non ha una rabbia intrinseca. Solo infondendogli la tua rabbia il magma può ribollire e prendere forma."\\n—Koth del Martello\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d033df8a-9fc3-49b9-9e15-c662363cee8d\', \'multiverseId\': 533344}, \'multiverseid\': 533344}, {\'name\': \'憤怒\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n憤怒があなたの墓地にあり、あなたが山をコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — インカーネーション\', \'flavor\': \'「溶けた大地自体は怒っているわけではない。そこにおのれの激怒を吹き込むことで、マグマは沸き返り、形を成す。」\\n――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d11c882-06c3-4b88-9469-fc32806f6ae7\', \'multiverseId\': 533555}, \'multiverseid\': 533555}, {\'name\': \'Ira\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nEnquanto Ira estiver em seu cemitério e você controlar uma Montanha, as criaturas que você controla terão ímpeto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Encarnação\', \'flavor\': \'"A terra derretida não tem ira inata. Você precisa infundi-la com sua própria ira para que ela possa fervilhar e tomar forma."\\n— Koth do Martelo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ab1675-2711-4641-baef-c758f202f554\', \'multiverseId\': 533766}, \'multiverseid\': 533766}, {\'name\': \'Злость\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nПока Злость находится на вашем кладбище и вы контролируете Гору, существа под вашим контролем имеют Ускорение.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Инкарнация\', \'flavor\': \'«Расплавленная земля сама по себе не злая. Лишь когда ты напитаешь ее собственной яростью, кипящая магма может обрести форму».\\n— Кос из племени Молота\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc41225-1bca-403b-afec-c03845a6d544\', \'multiverseId\': 533977}, \'multiverseid\': 533977}, {\'name\': \'愤怒\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n只要愤怒在你的坟墓场，并且你操控山脉，由你操控的生物便具有敏捷异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～化身\', \'flavor\': \'「炽焰大地本身不会愤怒。yh 唯有你将自身怒气倾注当中后，其岩浆方能翻滚成形。」\\n～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48f1b6aa-0e3c-4acb-8181-faf286a86d64\', \'multiverseId\': 534188}, \'multiverseid\': 534188}, {\'name\': \'憤怒\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n只要憤怒在你的墳墓場，並且你操控山脈，由你操控的生物便具有敏捷異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～化身\', \'flavor\': \'「熾焰大地本身不會憤怒。唯有你將自身怒氣傾注當中後，其岩漿方能翻滾成形。」\\n～鎚族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0d3dc72-2874-45f4-ad7c-d50f57578694\', \'multiverseId\': 534399}, \'multiverseid\': 534399}]', '[{\'name\': \'Despot des Himmels\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Despot des Himmels ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du der Monarch bist, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532738&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f54967eb-b651-4061-931b-d0757ea2af7e\', \'multiverseId\': 532738}, \'multiverseid\': 532738}, {\'name\': \'Déspota del horizonte\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Déspota del horizonte entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si eres el monarca, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96c8799-9d65-4c47-8e2b-e7541b8cabd2\', \'multiverseId\': 532949}, \'multiverseid\': 532949}, {\'name\': \'Despote des tours\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Despote des tours arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si vous êtes le monarque, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533160&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f15aa8a-02e7-4d8b-81fe-d0fd646e4cd5\', \'multiverseId\': 533160}, \'multiverseid\': 533160}, {\'name\': "Despota dell\'Orizzonte", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando il Despota dell\'Orizzonte entra nel campo di battaglia, diventi il monarca.\\nAll\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se sei il monarca, crea una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3a7e52e-80f9-4d15-aee4-0dacec03edaf\', \'multiverseId\': 533371}, \'multiverseid\': 533371}, {\'name\': \'天空の独裁者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n天空の独裁者が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたが統治者である場合、飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533582&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd253f93-33b3-46e4-ba39-bbe59cdd1a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 533582}, \'multiverseid\': 533582}, {\'name\': \'Déspota do Horizonte\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Déspota do Horizonte entra no campo de batalha você se torna monarca.\\nNo início de sua manutenção, se você for monarca, crie uma ficha de criatura Dragão vermelha 5/5 com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee2755cf-257e-4867-bd94-323ffcf25a70\', \'multiverseId\': 533793}, \'multiverseid\': 533793}, {\'name\': \'Небесный Деспот\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Небесный Деспот выходит на поле битвы, вы становитесь монархом.\\nВ начале вашего шага поддержки, если вы являетесь монархом, создайте одну фишку существа 5/5 красный Дракон с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca0f179f-5251-47c7-b765-ad70ee9b6f64\', \'multiverseId\': 534004}, \'multiverseid\': 534004}, {\'name\': \'天际霸王\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当天际霸王进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的维持开始时，若你是君主，则派出一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8f776ba-ae47-4170-aa4e-43b53a5ccdc4\', \'multiverseId\': 534215}, \'multiverseid\': 534215}, {\'name\': \'天際霸王\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當天際霸王進戰場時，你成為君主。\\n在你的維持開始時，若你是君主，則派出一個5/5紅色，具飛行異能的龍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff926e4a-902e-4040-822a-647dece01a70\', \'multiverseId\': 534426}, \'multiverseid\': 534426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Zukunft entfachen\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, kannst du Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden, spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nRückblende {7}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532727&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d510579d-b974-4c78-b632-394b3c5611ef\', \'multiverseId\': 532727}, \'multiverseid\': 532727}, {\'name\': \'Avivar el futuro\', \'text\': \'Exilia las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas. Si este hechizo fue lanzado desde un cementerio, puedes jugar cartas de esta manera sin pagar sus costes de maná.\\nRetrospectiva {7}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5cae37e8-6244-4417-aa67-f6c3723b954c\', \'multiverseId\': 532938}, \'multiverseid\': 532938}, {\'name\': "Embraser l\'avenir", \'text\': "Exilez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, vous pouvez jouer des cartes de cette manière sans payer leur coût de mana.\\nFlashback {7}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185c433f-5a16-4c40-bdc6-d1c9675653ca\', \'multiverseId\': 533149}, \'multiverseid\': 533149}, {\'name\': \'Infiammare il Futuro\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte. Se questa magia è stata lanciata da un cimitero, puoi giocare carte in questo modo senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\\nFlashback {7}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d18356c-b908-4156-bf32-c6ed686cf0a3\', \'multiverseId\': 533360}, \'multiverseid\': 533360}, {\'name\': \'未来を点火\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。この呪文を墓地から唱えていたなら、次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{7}{R}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533571&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8dfe7db-80b0-440e-8b70-fe3ba1b9e102\', \'multiverseId\': 533571}, \'multiverseid\': 533571}, {\'name\': \'Inflamar o Futuro\', \'text\': \'Exile os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar esses cards. Se esta mágica foi conjurada de um cemitério, você pode jogar cards dessa forma sem pagar seus custos de mana.\\nRecapitular {7}{R} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a5d7880-9d27-4d95-bb00-cb543371e0c8\', \'multiverseId\': 533782}, \'multiverseid\': 533782}, {\'name\': \'Пожар Будущего\', \'text\': \'Изгоните три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть те карты до конца вашего следующего хода. Если это заклинание было разыграно из кладбища, то вы можете разыгрывать таким образом карты без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\\nВоспоминание {7}{R} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c80013-7acb-4424-84db-2690c28a2dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 533993}, \'multiverseid\': 533993}, {\'name\': \'燃亮未来\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的三张牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌。如果此咒语是从坟墓场施放，则你使用这些牌时，可以不支付其法术力费用。\\n返照{7}{R}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f767f7bc-4803-4e31-98bc-ec0cd3583cbe\', \'multiverseId\': 534204}, \'multiverseid\': 534204}, {\'name\': \'燃亮未來\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的三張牌。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以使用這些牌。如果此咒語是從墳墓場施放，則你使用這些牌時，可以不支付其魔法力費用。\\n返照{7}{R}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d76ab3-9755-4ef6-b663-dddc19b05a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 534415}, \'multiverseid\': 534415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die innere Bestie\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher erzeugt einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„In jedem Herzen lebt ein Monster. Wir bilden uns nur ein, dass die Zivilisation es zähmt."\\n―Euphemia, Beobachterin des Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532750&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888bdb70-a07d-4b72-976a-0020feae60cd\', \'multiverseId\': 532750}, \'multiverseid\': 532750}, {\'name\': \'La bestia interior\', \'text\': \'Destruye el permanente objetivo. Su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los monstruos habitan en todos los corazones. Solo creemos que la civilización los domestica".\\n—Eufemia, vigilante del nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3310b76-fe27-46ef-a57e-1dd004d47745\', \'multiverseId\': 532961}, \'multiverseid\': 532961}, {\'name\': \'Réveiller la bête\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un permanent ciblé. Son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Un monstre se cache dans chaque cœur. Nous croyons seulement qu\'il est dompté par la civilisation. »\\n―Euphemia, gardienne du Nexus", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723b8f76-631a-454e-81b0-e080a5eaca06\', \'multiverseId\': 533172}, \'multiverseid\': 533172}, {\'name\': \'Bestia Interiore\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un permanente bersaglio. Il suo controllore crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"In ogni cuore risiedono mostri. L\\\'idea che la civiltà li addomestichi è una mera illusione."\\n―Eufemia, guardiana del Nexus\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dd46f02-cdf6-4ff7-aebe-e2096e0e1cb5\', \'multiverseId\': 533383}, \'multiverseid\': 533383}, {\'name\': \'内にいる獣\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「怪物はあらゆる者の心の奥底に潜んでいる。それらを飼い慣らしているのが文明であると我々は考える。」\\n――生息地の見張り、ユーフェミア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533594&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a58bb855-b43a-4a7d-b06d-4164e889b7dc\', \'multiverseId\': 533594}, \'multiverseid\': 533594}, {\'name\': \'Fera Interior\', \'text\': \'Destrua a permanente alvo. Seu controlador cria uma ficha de criatura Besta verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os monstros habitam todos os corações. Nós só achamos que a civilização os doma."\\n― Euphemia, vigia do Nexo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397b10d2-9249-4d09-99e5-a377b60b2a5f\', \'multiverseId\': 533805}, \'multiverseid\': 533805}, {\'name\': \'Зверь Внутри\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой перманент. Контролирующий его игрок создает одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«В каждом из нас кроется чудовище. Мы ошибочно полагаем, что цивилизация сумела его укротить».\\n— Эвфемия, страж Ядра\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23281c96-06cf-4e12-8957-51eb2e5cb9c1\', \'multiverseId\': 534016}, \'multiverseid\': 534016}, {\'name\': \'体内野兽\', \'text\': \'消灭目标永久物。其操控者派出一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个人的心中都潜藏着怪物。我们只是认为文明已将之驯服。」\\n～连结点看守尤菲米娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ce7547-9d57-494a-aa72-a0a6cc1afac1\', \'multiverseId\': 534227}, \'multiverseid\': 534227}, {\'name\': \'體內野獸\', \'text\': \'消滅目標永久物。其操控者派出一個3/3綠色野獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每個人的心中都潛藏著怪物。我們只是認為文明已將之馴服。」\\n〜連結點看守尤菲米婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae8ca23-76c5-4bfa-ac72-d8872f381df2\', \'multiverseId\': 534438}, \'multiverseid\': 534438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Drachenfürstin\', \'text\': \'Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka-Goblins schmieren sich mit dem Öl giftiger Kräuter ein, in der Hoffnung, nicht als Dessert für ihre gefräßigen Meister zu enden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532721&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'441ba47b-ddf2-4b0b-b077-05e77f43060c\', \'multiverseId\': 532721}, \'multiverseid\': 532721}, {\'name\': \'Sirviente de la señora dragón\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de Dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los trasgos que sirven a Atarka se untan de grasa mezclada con hierbas venenosas con la esperanza de que sus voraces señores no los añadan al banquete.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2bd272-71bb-438d-9ee1-235c1faa6e99\', \'multiverseId\': 532932}, \'multiverseid\': 532932}, {\'name\': \'Servant du seigneur-dragon\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Les gobelins servant Atarka s\'enduisent de graisse imprégnée de plantes toxiques, espérant ainsi décourager leurs maîtres voraces de les ajouter au menu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533143&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'720fe896-28ed-4b3b-8b08-2ae6ecbc24cc\', \'multiverseId\': 533143}, \'multiverseid\': 533143}, {\'name\': \'Servitore del Signore dei Draghi\', \'text\': \'Le magie Drago che lanci costano {1} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': "I goblin servitori di Atarka si spalmano il corpo di grasso infuso con erbe velenose, sperando di scoraggiare i loro famelici padroni dall\'includerli nel loro pasto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e90e63-3930-4cc0-87ff-65b03d87f425\', \'multiverseId\': 533354}, \'multiverseid\': 533354}, {\'name\': \'龍王の召使い\', \'text\': \'あなたがドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'アタルカに仕えるゴブリンたちは、空腹なご主人様が彼らを食事のメニューに付け加えるのを思いとどまってくれることを期待して、自らの体に有害な薬草を練り込んだ油脂を塗りたくっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533565&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b1375a0-d5cc-44e3-abd0-77f0948458f2\', \'multiverseId\': 533565}, \'multiverseid\': 533565}, {\'name\': \'Servo do Soberano Dragão\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de Dragão que você conjura custam {1} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Os goblins a serviço de Atarka banham-se num óleo infundido em ervas nocivas, na esperança de desencorajar seus vorazes mestres de acrescentá-los ao cardápio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d709114-5be5-43ef-8eba-e9e8037c28be\', \'multiverseId\': 533776}, \'multiverseid\': 533776}, {\'name\': \'Слуга Владычицы Драконов\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами заклинания Драконов стоят на {1} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Гоблины на службе Атарки обмазываются жиром с добавкой ядовитых трав в надежде на то, что их прожорливые хозяева побрезгуют портить ими свои яства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533987&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b90124d-9e21-4a38-b55f-27067d954bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 533987}, \'multiverseid\': 533987}, {\'name\': \'龙王仆役\', \'text\': \'你施放的龙咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'服侍安塔卡的鬼怪在身上涂满加了毒草的油脂，希望他们永无餍足的主人不会拿他们加菜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e949624-16ad-42bc-8d40-b4b6bdee5d10\', \'multiverseId\': 534198}, \'multiverseid\': 534198}, {\'name\': \'龍王僕役\', \'text\': \'你施放的龍咒語減少{1}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'服侍安塔卡的鬼怪在身上塗滿加了毒草的油脂，希望他們永無饜足的主人不會拿他們加菜。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb451ef-0d3b-4192-bc6e-742a0f4312fe\', \'multiverseId\': 534409}, \'multiverseid\': 534409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532832&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f88d6ef3-3f1c-436f-9726-1abe1dd69ec5\', \'multiverseId\': 532832}, \'multiverseid\': 532832}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6b2375-faf2-4188-8d06-a51f65c35f75\', \'multiverseId\': 533043}, \'multiverseid\': 533043}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533254&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385bcfa4-ea05-468c-a631-17701995dc37\', \'multiverseId\': 533254}, \'multiverseid\': 533254}, {\'name\': \'Acquedotto Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando l\'Acquedotto Dimir entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'625e0e1d-f4ad-46a4-ac18-d50406cdfa07\', \'multiverseId\': 533465}, \'multiverseid\': 533465}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3abbd4d-c091-4815-b2ce-f0160b69ebfc\', \'multiverseId\': 533676}, \'multiverseid\': 533676}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduto Dimir\', \'text\': \'Aqueduto Dimir entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Aqueduto Dimir entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53470834-734c-4613-8578-1c3b7b589d6a\', \'multiverseId\': 533887}, \'multiverseid\': 533887}, {\'name\': \'Акведук Димиров\', \'text\': \'Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Акведук Димиров выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cdcabe8-4a13-4ae8-94ca-42c4bb365494\', \'multiverseId\': 534098}, \'multiverseid\': 534098}, {\'name\': \'底密尔下水道\', \'text\': \'底密尔下水道须横置进战场。\\n当底密尔下水道进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50d69eda-cf44-425f-86d6-127b1bb8792e\', \'multiverseId\': 534309}, \'multiverseid\': 534309}, {\'name\': \'底密爾下水道\', \'text\': \'底密爾下水道須橫置進戰場。\\n當底密爾下水道進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7d3191-2fcb-43b9-bfdf-df43731728f2\', \'multiverseId\': 534520}, \'multiverseid\': 534520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerbruch-Regentin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Drache, den du kontrollierst, das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, fügt die Donnerbruch-Regentin jenem Spieler 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Es kann ein fataler Fehler sein, die Aufmerksamkeit eines Drachen auf sich zu ziehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532745&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2125b489-ade5-4290-8c92-ba71c8472fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 532745}, \'multiverseid\': 532745}, {\'name\': \'Regente tempestad desatada\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un Dragón que controlas sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, la Regente tempestad desatada hace 3 puntos de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Atraer la atención de un dragón puede ser el último error que cometas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532956&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4904472f-af0e-49ae-bf06-fc1244d5af86\', \'multiverseId\': 532956}, \'multiverseid\': 532956}, {\'name\': \'Régente brisetonnerre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un dragon que vous contrôlez devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, la Régente brisetonnerre inflige 3 blessures à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Attirer l\'attention d\'un dragon sera probablement votre dernière erreur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533167&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b71661f5-a3e9-49da-9db3-729e38e8937f\', \'multiverseId\': 533167}, \'multiverseid\': 533167}, {\'name\': \'Reggente Squarciatuono\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un Drago che controlli diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, la Reggente Squarciatuono infligge 3 danni a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': "Attirare l\'attenzione di un drago potrebbe essere l\'ultimo errore che commetti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cace4de-636e-48df-b45e-0127633970fe\', \'multiverseId\': 533378}, \'multiverseid\': 533378}, {\'name\': \'雷破の執政\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがコントロールしているドラゴン１体が対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、雷破の執政はそのプレイヤーに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'龍の注意を引くことは、最期の過ちとなりかねない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7d10e29-340a-42c2-8905-80762c3a98b3\', \'multiverseId\': 533589}, \'multiverseid\': 533589}, {\'name\': \'Regente do Ataque Fulminante\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um Dragão que você controla se torna alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, Regente do Ataque Fulminante causa 3 pontos de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Atrair a atenção de um dragão pode ser seu último erro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f87a6959-7395-4110-89a2-a6c672d6bced\', \'multiverseId\': 533800}, \'multiverseid\': 533800}, {\'name\': \'Регент Грянувшего Грома\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Дракон под вашим контролем становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, Регент Грянувшего Грома наносит 3 повреждения тому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Если ты обратишь на себя внимание дракона, это может стать твоей последней ошибкой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdca1b1c-3161-475d-a2d8-d3b906af0302\', \'multiverseId\': 534011}, \'multiverseid\': 534011}, {\'name\': \'破霆龙侯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一个由你操控的龙成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，破霆龙侯对该牌手造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'引起巨龙的注意可能是你最不该犯的错误。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce4a2e5-b8a1-456c-8024-d51a857e1d20\', \'multiverseId\': 534222}, \'multiverseid\': 534222}, {\'name\': \'破霆龍侯\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一個由你操控的龍成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，破霆龍侯對該玩家造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'引起巨龍的注意可能是你最不該犯的錯誤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb0d9b2-02f7-4b46-a24b-744893b5895d\', \'multiverseId\': 534433}, \'multiverseid\': 534433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenblütige Heldin\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler 5 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bin mit den Geschichten meiner Vorfahren aufgewachsen, und ich möchte meine eigenen Seiten den Erzählungen hinzufügen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532004&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16ef1f9a-513d-4f83-91ae-edec0d58e90a\', \'multiverseId\': 532004}, \'multiverseid\': 532004}, {\'name\': \'Campeona dracónida\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que una fuente que controlas haga 5 o más puntos de daño a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero dragón\', \'flavor\': \'"Las historias de mis ancestros me acompañaron toda la vida y pienso formar parte de ellas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afea215b-030e-4df7-aadf-bbbfce04bb3a\', \'multiverseId\': 532058}, \'multiverseid\': 532058}, {\'name\': \'Championne drakéide\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige au moins 5 blessures à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai grandi avec les histoires de mes ancêtres, et je veux écrire mon propre chapitre. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fbe1313-3b7c-4041-b80a-ad0a7af250bd\', \'multiverseId\': 532112}, \'multiverseid\': 532112}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa Dragonide\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge 5 o più danni a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Drago\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono cresciuta con le storie dei miei antenati e voglio aggiungere le mie pagine ai loro racconti."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48edd1f4-5d14-46bc-b328-1f1808b20482\', \'multiverseId\': 532166}, \'multiverseid\': 532166}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンボーンの勇者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしている発生源１つがプレイヤー１人に５点以上のダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「ご先祖たちの話を聞かされて育ったの。その物語に自分のページを加えたいって思ってるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca70c19-8ce0-4bdd-9111-efc22eed7685\', \'multiverseId\': 532220}, \'multiverseid\': 532220}, {\'name\': \'Campeã Draconata\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que uma fonte que você controla causar 5 ou mais pontos de dano a um jogador, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cresci com as histórias dos meus ancestrais. Agora quero escrever minhas próprias páginas nessa saga."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf92d36-4d0f-467e-b89f-98cdaa7e6777\', \'multiverseId\': 532274}, \'multiverseid\': 532274}, {\'name\': \'Драконорожденная Воительница\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда источник под вашим контролем наносит 5 или больше повреждений игроку, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Я росла на историях о моих предках и хочу вписать собственные страницы в легенды».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325596d0-fe53-4b06-87dc-8e7a1ec06ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 532328}, \'multiverseid\': 532328}, {\'name\': \'龙裔斗士\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当一个由你操控的来源对任一牌手造成5点或更多伤害时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我听着先人的故事长大，现在要来书写属于自己的篇章。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'187c3405-371b-4db2-9d50-f09042b767fb\', \'multiverseId\': 532382}, \'multiverseid\': 532382}, {\'name\': \'龍裔鬥士\', \'text\': \'踐踏\\n每當一個由你操控的來源對任一玩家造成5點或更多傷害時，你抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「我聽著先人的故事長大，現在要來書寫屬於自己的篇章。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a6000d4-b2fc-45de-9eca-2e62db8d903a\', \'multiverseId\': 532436}, \'multiverseid\': 532436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenblütige Heldin\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn ein Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler 5 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531590&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7eb9e0f-9466-4eac-89b0-46d54ca25f35\', \'multiverseId\': 531590}, \'multiverseid\': 531590}, {\'name\': \'Campeona dracónida\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que una fuente que controlas haga 5 o más puntos de daño a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820d5a62-35ea-4129-b05f-96cf57fee286\', \'multiverseId\': 531646}, \'multiverseid\': 531646}, {\'name\': \'Championne drakéide\', \'text\': "Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une source que vous contrôlez inflige au moins 5 blessures à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531702&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4bc3050-ca35-4049-b66e-c68cea72e3d5\', \'multiverseId\': 531702}, \'multiverseid\': 531702}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa Dragonide\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta una fonte che controlli infligge 5 o più danni a un giocatore, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9cb193c-77a0-423a-866f-d23eee2d3c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 531758}, \'multiverseid\': 531758}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンボーンの勇者\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\nあなたがコントロールしている発生源がプレイヤー１人に５点以上のダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'076aeeeb-8a6f-4b58-8b45-62c369aca5df\', \'multiverseId\': 531814}, \'multiverseid\': 531814}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachensprecher-Schamane\', \'text\': \'Drache-Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir sprechen die Sprache der Drachen, von Flammen und Zorn. Sie sprechen unsere Sprache, von Wildheit und Ehre. Zusammen werden wir eine Geschichte der Zerstörung erzählen, wie es sie noch nie gegeben hat."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'024c3476-0ff1-47d9-ae0c-4f3a76e2ea97\', \'multiverseId\': 534562}, \'multiverseid\': 534562}, {\'name\': \'Chamán dragonhablante\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar los hechizos de Dragón.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bárbaro humano Chamán\', \'flavor\': \'"Hablamos el idioma de flama y de cólera de los dragones. Ellos hablan nuestro idioma de furia y de honor. Juntos tramaremos un relato de destrucción sin igual".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f03faefb-5578-4c4c-834d-01d3d831a26f\', \'multiverseId\': 534564}, \'multiverseid\': 534564}, {\'name\': \'Shamane languedragon\', \'text\': \'Les sorts de dragon que vous lancez coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et barbare et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Nous parlons le langage de flamme et de rage des dragons. Ils parlent notre langue de fureur et d\'honneur. Ensemble, nous écrirons un récit de destruction sans égal. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d24ef8-fbf0-42ef-88f9-20cbb92a94cb\', \'multiverseId\': 534566}, \'multiverseid\': 534566}, {\'name\': \'Sciamano Dracofono\', \'text\': \'Le magie Drago che lanci costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Barbaro Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Parliamo il linguaggio dei draghi, di fuoco e ira. Loro parlano il nostro, di furia e onore. Insieme porteremo un\\\'ondata di distruzione senza eguali."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e5eeb1-501d-44c5-9e2b-0c04dfdcb7ca\', \'multiverseId\': 534568}, \'multiverseid\': 534568}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴン語りのシャーマン\', \'text\': \'あなたがドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は炎と激怒からなるドラゴンの言葉を語る。ドラゴンは激情と栄誉からなる我々の言葉を語る。我らが共に紡ぎあげるは、類稀なる破壊の詩よ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d2e7361-51ad-4fcd-8d96-3c18b6a60cae\', \'multiverseId\': 534570}, \'multiverseid\': 534570}, {\'name\': \'Xamã Dracontófilo\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de Dragão que você conjura custam {2} a menos para serem conjuradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bárbaro Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós falamos a língua dos dragões, de chamas e ira. Eles falam a nossa língua, de fúria e honra. Juntos, criaremos uma onda de destruição inigualável."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0f2388b-8700-4a2c-baaa-1ad6a31f9d71\', \'multiverseId\': 534572}, \'multiverseid\': 534572}, {\'name\': \'Шаман, Говорящий с Драконами\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами заклинания Драконов стоят на {2} меньше.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Варвар Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы говорим на драконьем языке огня и ярости. Они говорят на нашем языке гнева и чести. Вместе мы напишем историю разрушения, которой не будет равных».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecba5928-041c-4354-a7b3-96e59ac07b59\', \'multiverseId\': 534574}, \'multiverseid\': 534574}, {\'name\': \'龙语祭师\', \'text\': \'你施放的龙咒语减少{2}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／野蛮人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我等了解龙族的炽焰与狂愤。他们了解我等的怒火与荣耀。我们将一同编织前所未见的毁灭篇章。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534576&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69520c9c-b88b-48c7-b3c4-64f6c2fda2c1\', \'multiverseId\': 534576}, \'multiverseid\': 534576}, {\'name\': \'龍語祭師\', \'text\': \'你施放的龍咒語減少{2}來施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／野蠻人／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「我等瞭解龍族的熾焰與狂憤。他們瞭解我等的怒火與榮耀。我們將一同編織前所未見的毀滅篇章。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0efddeaa-9ab1-4121-a611-b4b512e7dedb\', \'multiverseId\': 534578}, \'multiverseid\': 534578}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druide der Reinigung\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Druide der Reinigung ins Spiel kommt, kann jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung, das bzw. die du nicht kontrollierst, bestimmen. Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Kehre zurück zur Erde und zum Wind."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2523f830-374c-4958-9f13-7029b9d955b3\', \'multiverseId\': 531998}, \'multiverseid\': 531998}, {\'name\': \'Druida de la purificación\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Druida de la purificación entre al campo de batalla, comenzando contigo, cada jugador puede elegir un artefacto o encantamiento que no controlas. Destruye cada permanente elegido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Regresa a la tierra y al viento".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d071fb5-593b-4275-a4a7-7d0f7f0fee86\', \'multiverseId\': 532052}, \'multiverseid\': 532052}, {\'name\': \'Druide de purification\', \'text\': \'Quand le Druide de purification arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur peut choisir un artefact ou un enchantement que vous ne contrôlez pas. Détruisez chaque permanent choisi de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Retourne à la terre et aux vents. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb647b8-590c-4ba1-a492-7f8e3a32e1db\', \'multiverseId\': 532106}, \'multiverseid\': 532106}, {\'name\': \'Druido della Purificazione\', \'text\': \'Quando il Druido della Purificazione entra nel campo di battaglia, a partire da te, ogni giocatore può scegliere un artefatto o un incantesimo che non controlli. Distruggi ogni permanente scelto in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Torna alla terra e al vento."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'979548bc-6b67-41d5-8136-480733017750\', \'multiverseId\': 532160}, \'multiverseid\': 532160}, {\'name\': \'浄化のドルイド\', \'text\': \'浄化のドルイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしていない１つを選んでもよい。これにより選ばれたすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「大地と風の元へ還れ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92f58aca-662d-4262-ac6b-1314a6953d70\', \'multiverseId\': 532214}, \'multiverseid\': 532214}, {\'name\': \'Druida da Purificação\', \'text\': \'Quando Druida da Purificação entra no campo de batalha, a começar por você, cada jogador pode escolher um artefato ou encantamento que você não controla. Destrua cada permanente escolhida dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Volte à terra e ao vento."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9645e6d-7885-42e7-bb72-df804f6489c2\', \'multiverseId\': 532268}, \'multiverseid\': 532268}, {\'name\': \'Друид Очищения\', \'text\': \'Когда Друид Очищения выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок, начиная с вас, может выбрать артефакт или чары не под вашим контролем. Уничтожьте каждый выбранный таким образом перманент.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Возвращайся к земле и ветру».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6531ffda-73cd-436a-b6b5-ce0906b9481e\', \'multiverseId\': 532322}, \'multiverseid\': 532322}, {\'name\': \'净化之德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'当净化之德鲁伊进战场时，由你开始，每位牌手各可以选择一个不由你操控的神器或结界。消灭所有以此法选择的永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「回归大地，散入清风。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f82c4723-fc5a-4a23-a23b-6f69aa448884\', \'multiverseId\': 532376}, \'multiverseid\': 532376}, {\'name\': \'淨化之德魯伊\', \'text\': \'當淨化之德魯伊進戰場時，由你開始，每位玩家各可以選擇一個不由你操控的神器或結界。消滅所有以此法選擇的永久物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「回歸大地，散入清風。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c7c3ec-aa8b-47ac-b8f0-1d403060633d\', \'multiverseId\': 532430}, \'multiverseid\': 532430}]', "[{'name': 'Druide der Reinigung', 'text': 'Wenn der Druide der Reinigung ins Spiel kommt, kann jeder Spieler, beginnend mit dir, ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung, das bzw. die du nicht kontrollierst, bestimmen. Zerstöre jede bleibende Karte, die auf diese Weise bestimmt wurde.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531584&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '45693e60-031b-4048-8470-878eeba2d187', 'multiverseId': 531584}, 'multiverseid': 531584}, {'name': 'Druida de la purificación', 'text': 'Cuando el Druida de la purificación entre al campo de batalla, comenzando contigo, cada jugador puede elegir un artefacto o encantamiento que no controlas. Destruye cada permanente elegido de esta manera.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531640&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88f140ae-04c2-4bad-8243-ba48048728ed', 'multiverseId': 531640}, 'multiverseid': 531640}, {'name': 'Druide de purification', 'text': 'Quand le Druide de purification arrive sur le champ de bataille, en commençant par vous, chaque joueur peut choisir un artefact ou un enchantement que vous ne contrôlez pas. Détruisez chaque permanent choisi de cette manière.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531696&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '84c2bd77-1753-422e-b660-db5b80d51570', 'multiverseId': 531696}, 'multiverseid': 531696}, {'name': 'Druido della Purificazione', 'text': 'Quando il Druido della Purificazione entra nel campo di battaglia, a partire da te, ogni giocatore può scegliere un artefatto o un incantesimo che non controlli. Distruggi ogni permanente scelto in questo modo.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Umano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531752&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c3961f0f-7038-4f35-960c-0d0bca2bb6b7', 'multiverseId': 531752}, 'multiverseid': 531752}, {'name': '浄化のドルイド', 'text': '浄化のドルイドが戦場に出たとき、あなたから始めて各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、アーティファクトやエンチャントのうちあなたがコントロールしていない１つを選んでもよい。これにより選ばれたすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531808&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a401874-35b7-4624-b264-3c255c611c57', 'multiverseId': 531808}, 'multiverseid': 531808}]", '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unterirdische Überschwemmungen haben alte Grabkammern verschluckt, in denen es jetzt spukt … und in denen Schlammwesen hausen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c30e8c-8eec-441e-a929-bd4ab57571c7\', \'multiverseId\': 532830}, \'multiverseid\': 532830}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La inundación de la Infraoscuridad sumergió las cámaras funerarias antiguas de los drow. Ahora están embrujadas... y llenas de cienos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8581ca-bc03-48ae-820b-9d7c89a10424\', \'multiverseId\': 533041}, \'multiverseid\': 533041}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les inondations d\'Outreterre ont englouti de vieilles chambres funéraires drows, qui sont désormais hantées... et infestées de limons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533252&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4010ae-6554-4dba-8f27-ac7ad90dc985\', \'multiverseId\': 533252}, \'multiverseid\': 533252}, {\'name\': \'Catacombe di Acquascura\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'alluvione dell\'Underdark ha inghiottito le antiche camere sepolcrali dei drow, che sono ora infestate dai loro spiriti... e dalle melme.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73216bb9-997a-417a-b4cf-63141936fdab\', \'multiverseId\': 533463}, \'multiverseid\': 533463}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'アンダーダークへの浸水が古代のドラウの玄室を飲み込み、今ではウーズの巣になっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ae5d6a-4ea3-4a17-828c-b285f33d6e08\', \'multiverseId\': 533674}, \'multiverseid\': 533674}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas de Darkwater\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Uma inundação no Subterrâneo engoliu antigas câmaras mortuárias dos drows, que agora são assombradas... e infestadas de lodos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01bb08ef-5f2c-4519-940d-ba5dd3b81351\', \'multiverseId\': 533885}, \'multiverseid\': 533885}, {\'name\': \'Катакомбы Темноводья\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Потоп в Подземье поглотил древние погребальные мавзолеи дроу, и теперь они населены духами... и кишат слизнями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385daad7-88b1-4150-b34d-4de94d32f6e9\', \'multiverseId\': 534096}, \'multiverseid\': 534096}, {\'name\': \'黑水陵墓\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'幽暗地域的洪水早已将卓尔精灵的古墓尽数淹没，如今此处恶灵遍地…泥魔横行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22295824-d5ea-4ae9-9df3-50ba937603d0\', \'multiverseId\': 534307}, \'multiverseid\': 534307}, {\'name\': \'黑水陵墓\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'幽暗地域的洪水早已將卓爾精靈的古墓盡數淹沒，如今此處惡靈遍地…泥魔橫行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd11dbcb-f408-4b30-810b-cf177d33242f\', \'multiverseId\': 534518}, \'multiverseid\': 534518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsteres Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W10 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel zurück, wie dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis entspricht. Dann verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich dem anderen Ergebnis ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Nicht lebendig und nicht tot, aber definitiv wütend.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f7439b8-c7cd-4216-a156-9090777f7db0\', \'multiverseId\': 531983}, \'multiverseid\': 531983}, {\'name\': \'Reto peligroso\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d10 y elige un resultado. Regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual a ese resultado. Luego cada oponente pierde X vidas y tú ganas X vidas, donde X es el otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No está vivo ni muerto, pero sí está muy furioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5e3ef6-5f61-46f3-955e-cc81ca519373\', \'multiverseId\': 532037}, \'multiverseid\': 532037}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre sépulcrale\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d10 et choisissez un résultat. Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, avec un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à ce résultat sur elle, une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. Puis chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Ni vivant, ni mort, mais clairement furieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532091&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e6d2eb7-8104-4e89-9ec0-caae11499a27\', \'multiverseId\': 532091}, \'multiverseid\': 532091}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Sepolta\', \'text\': "Tira due d10 e scegli un risultato. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari a quel risultato. Poi ogni avversario perde X punti vita e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è l\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Non è vivo, non è morto, ma è decisamente infuriato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc9cf301-bf11-46a6-86e8-3fbd9396c318\', \'multiverseId\': 532145}, \'multiverseid\': 532145}, {\'name\': \'悲惨な挑戦\', \'text\': \'２個のd10を振り、出目１つを選ぶ。あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を、その出目に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。その後、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはもう１つの出目に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'生きているとも死んでいるとも言えないが、怒っているのは間違いない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67bf8b9a-82cf-42c8-b1dc-c071ff3d2472\', \'multiverseId\': 532199}, \'multiverseid\': 532199}, {\'name\': \'Empreitada Funesta\', \'text\': \'Role dois d10 e escolha um resultado. Devolva um card de criatura de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha com um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual àquele resultado. Em seguida, cada oponente perde X pontos de vida e você ganha X pontos de vida, sendo X o outro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Nem vivo, nem morto, mas definitivamente furioso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e59c733-e324-4092-9c5d-4ced76980215\', \'multiverseId\': 532253}, \'multiverseid\': 532253}, {\'name\': \'Могильное Предприятие\', \'text\': \'Бросьте два d10 и выберите один результат. Верните карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы с количеством жетонов +1/+1 на ней, равным тому результату. Затем каждый оппонент теряет X жизней, а вы получаете X жизней, где X — другой результат.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Не живой, не мертвый, но определенно в ярости.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765cf441-8493-477d-80b0-d932f1454419\', \'multiverseId\': 532307}, \'multiverseid\': 532307}, {\'name\': \'肃穆勇进\', \'text\': \'掷两颗d10并选择一个掷骰结果。将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，且上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于该掷骰结果。然后每位对手各失去X点生命，且你获得X点生命，X为另一个掷骰结果。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'不算活，没死透，但绝对怒气十足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3460e689-84a4-4725-b52c-408c612b21bf\', \'multiverseId\': 532361}, \'multiverseid\': 532361}, {\'name\': \'肅穆勇進\', \'text\': \'擲兩顆d10並選擇一個擲骰結果。將一張生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場，且上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於該擲骰結果。然後每位對手各失去X點生命，且你獲得X點生命，X為另一個擲骰結果。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'不算活，沒死透，但絕對怒氣十足。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930f4978-68f3-449a-b768-60a8bb158743\', \'multiverseId\': 532415}, \'multiverseid\': 532415}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsteres Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W10 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel zurück, wie dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis entspricht. Dann verliert jeder Gegner X Lebenspunkte und du erhältst X Lebenspunkte dazu, wobei X gleich dem anderen Ergebnis ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8b10b1a-15a6-4ce4-9419-f7d6b77f7775\', \'multiverseId\': 531569}, \'multiverseid\': 531569}, {\'name\': \'Reto peligroso\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d10 y elige un resultado. Regresa una carta de criatura de tu cementerio al campo de batalla con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual a ese resultado. Luego cada oponente pierde X vidas y tú ganas X vidas, donde X es el otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66d86898-8609-4dfe-9f5a-f526432207c2\', \'multiverseId\': 531625}, \'multiverseid\': 531625}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre sépulcrale\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d10 et choisissez un résultat. Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, avec un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal à ce résultat sur elle, une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière. Puis chaque adversaire perd X points de vie et vous gagnez X points de vie, X étant l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531681&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f56ea10e-aa57-49d9-93b0-b730a8d752d6\', \'multiverseId\': 531681}, \'multiverseid\': 531681}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Sepolta\', \'text\': "Tira due d10 e scegli un risultato. Rimetti sul campo di battaglia dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari a quel risultato. Poi ogni avversario perde X punti vita e tu guadagni X punti vita, dove X è l\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'930d6e92-6e9f-47c2-a43f-0ba80db3b9bd\', \'multiverseId\': 531737}, \'multiverseid\': 531737}, {\'name\': \'悲惨な挑戦\', \'text\': \'d10を２回振り、出目１つを選ぶ。あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を、その出目に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に戻す。その後、各対戦相手はそれぞれＸ点のライフを失い、あなたはＸ点のライフを得る。Ｘはもう１つの出目に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a92ad7-623d-472b-a1e6-1d396a9cbbcb\', \'multiverseId\': 531793}, \'multiverseid\': 531793}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ebenholzfliege\', \'text\': \'Die Ebenholzfliege kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}: Würfle einen W6. Du kannst die Ebenholzfliege bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer X/X Insekt-Artefaktkreatur mit Flugfähigkeit werden lassen, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist.\\nImmer wenn die Ebenholzfliege angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl Flugfähigkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76803a84-4ac3-46e3-af85-da7ba885779e\', \'multiverseId\': 532015}, \'multiverseid\': 532015}, {\'name\': \'Mosca de ébano\', \'text\': \'La Mosca de ébano entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}: Tira 1d6. Puedes hacer que la Mosca de ébano se convierta hasta el final del turno en una criatura artefacto Insecto X/X con la habilidad de volar, donde X es el resultado.\\nSiempre que la Mosca de ébano ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c9566f-e300-4221-9653-af56d81aac37\', \'multiverseId\': 532069}, \'multiverseid\': 532069}, {\'name\': "Mouche d\'ébène", \'text\': "La Mouche d\'ébène arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4} : Lancez un d6. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez faire que la Mouche d\'ébène devienne une créature-artefact X/X Insecte avec le vol, X étant le résultat.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Mouche d\'ébène attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9593671-d3a5-4411-a85d-214f7dadde0e\', \'multiverseId\': 532123}, \'multiverseid\': 532123}, {\'name\': "Mosca d\'Ebano", \'text\': "La Mosca d\'Ebano entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{4}: Tira un d6. Puoi far diventare la Mosca d\'Ebano una creatura artefatto Insetto X/X con volare fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il risultato.\\nOgniqualvolta la Mosca d\'Ebano attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio ha volare fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46816088-f097-410b-aadb-770bdca54d7f\', \'multiverseId\': 532177}, \'multiverseid\': 532177}, {\'name\': \'エボニー・フライ\', \'text\': \'エボニー・フライはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}：１個のd6を振る。あなたは「ターン終了時まで、エボニー・フライは飛行を持つＸ/Ｘの昆虫・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。」を選んでもよい。Ｘはその出目に等しい。\\nエボニー・フライが攻撃するたび、これ以外の攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2861f580-985b-4609-9e92-ee765fca36f6\', \'multiverseId\': 532231}, \'multiverseid\': 532231}, {\'name\': \'Mosca de Ébano\', \'text\': \'Mosca de Ébano entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{4}: Role um d6. Você pode fazer com que Mosca de Ébano se torne uma criatura artefato Inseto X/X com voar até o final do turno, sendo X o resultado.\\nToda vez que Mosca de Ébano ataca, outra criatura atacante alvo ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2965c8ef-7630-4c91-9875-04da73c762b0\', \'multiverseId\': 532285}, \'multiverseid\': 532285}, {\'name\': \'Эбеновая Муха\', \'text\': \'Эбеновая Муха выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{4}: бросьте d6. Вы можете заставить Эбеновую Муху до конца хода стать артефактом существом X/X Насекомое с Полетом, где X — результат броска.\\nКаждый раз, когда Эбеновая Муха атакует, другое целевое атакующее существо получает Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c56d540-a92b-4e9d-a023-e506936f5669\', \'multiverseId\': 532339}, \'multiverseid\': 532339}, {\'name\': \'黑檀苍蝇\', \'text\': \'黑檀苍蝇须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}：掷一颗d6。你可以使黑檀苍蝇成为X/X，具飞行异能的昆虫神器生物直到回合结束，X为掷骰结果。\\n每当黑檀苍蝇攻击时，另一个目标进行攻击的生物获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e384cb22-4c51-4654-9108-0ab26342bb78\', \'multiverseId\': 532393}, \'multiverseid\': 532393}, {\'name\': \'黑檀蒼蠅\', \'text\': \'黑檀蒼蠅須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}：擲一顆d6。你可以使黑檀蒼蠅成為X/X，具飛行異能的昆蟲神器生物直到回合結束，X為擲骰結果。\\n每當黑檀蒼蠅攻擊時，另一個目標進行攻擊的生物獲得飛行異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5281987-19d4-467b-a3f8-7748b51a4949\', \'multiverseId\': 532447}, \'multiverseid\': 532447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Endgültigkeit\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Endgültigkeit ins Spiel kommt, schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Toten sollten besser für immer Abschied nehmen, als versklavt zu werden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532661&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31ccc8c-cffe-40c0-9a78-60c66933cafc\', \'multiverseId\': 532661}, \'multiverseid\': 532661}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de irrevocabilidad\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de irrevocabilidad entre al campo de batalla, exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'"Mejor que los muertos se marchen del todo a que sean esclavizados".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67c9e2a-c1b0-4916-afa8-336e5907924d\', \'multiverseId\': 532872}, \'multiverseid\': 532872}, {\'name\': \'Ange de la fatalité\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de la fatalité arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "« Mieux vaut être mort définitivement qu\'asservi. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f08acf03-1744-47ba-a00f-d1211e6241be\', \'multiverseId\': 533083}, \'multiverseid\': 533083}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Ineluttabilità", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Ineluttabilità entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'"Per i morti, è meglio una dipartita completa che la schiavitù."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7874e232-71ad-47a9-aa65-56ba9ae02233\', \'multiverseId\': 533294}, \'multiverseid\': 533294}, {\'name\': \'決断の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n決断の天使が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'「死者にとっても隷属の身とされるより、完全に消し去られた方が本望であろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afa74cdc-0e1b-4dfb-b12a-0d225cd51ebc\', \'multiverseId\': 533505}, \'multiverseid\': 533505}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Finalidade\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Finalidade entrar no campo de batalha, exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'"Para os mortos, uma morte definitiva é sempre melhor que a escravidão."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd8c4169-ab25-4b32-b46a-477ffba0422f\', \'multiverseId\': 533716}, \'multiverseid\': 533716}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Окончательности\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Окончательности выходит на поле битвы, изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'«Мертвым лучше покинуть нас навсегда, чем быть порабощенными».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19932111-2b89-4153-b99a-0e534aa30429\', \'multiverseId\': 533927}, \'multiverseid\': 533927}, {\'name\': \'终绝天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当终绝天使进战场时，放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「逝者就该离苦得乐，免遭奴役。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'437344dc-8819-4c3f-8e49-23e1b7fadaa9\', \'multiverseId\': 534138}, \'multiverseid\': 534138}, {\'name\': \'終絕天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當終絕天使進戰場時，放逐目標玩家墳墓場中的所有牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'「逝者就該離苦得樂，免遭奴役。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b394d9f0-b658-4eb8-9515-5862a840010e\', \'multiverseId\': 534349}, \'multiverseid\': 534349}]', "[{'name': 'Erhabenes Scheinbild', 'text': 'Wenn das Erhabene Scheinbild ins Spiel kommt, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nWenn das Erhabene Scheinbild stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532814&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b805a4b9-4d38-4f6b-9d31-6770fd20e366', 'multiverseId': 532814}, 'multiverseid': 532814}, {'name': 'Simulacro solemne', 'text': 'Cuando el Simulacro solemne entre al campo de batalla, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, poner esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nCuando el Simulacro solemne muera, puedes robar una carta.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Gólem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533025&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fc3c901d-174c-49f9-9e56-f3007fe213b3', 'multiverseId': 533025}, 'multiverseid': 533025}, {'name': 'Simulacre solennel', 'text': 'Quand le Simulacre solennel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez chercher une carte de terrain de base dans votre bibliothèque, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nQuand le Simulacre solennel meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533236&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '839f6e54-1c4c-433c-921a-fcea043af3da', 'multiverseId': 533236}, 'multiverseid': 533236}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solenne', 'text': 'Quando il Simulacro Solenne entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nQuando il Simulacro Solenne muore, puoi pescare una carta.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533447&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aa6f55e-9ac5-4340-ac39-ff1f539a478f', 'multiverseId': 533447}, 'multiverseid': 533447}, {'name': '真面目な身代わり', 'text': '真面目な身代わりが戦場に出たとき、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n真面目な身代わりが死亡したとき、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533658&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a813b39c-c6e3-409c-966e-d0078b54f64a', 'multiverseId': 533658}, 'multiverseid': 533658}, {'name': 'Simulacro Solene', 'text': 'Quando Simulacro Solene entra no campo de batalha, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\\nQuando Simulacro Solene morre, você pode comprar um card.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Golem', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533869&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c330a930-3db3-4a2c-902f-e2227a711bf5', 'multiverseId': 533869}, 'multiverseid': 533869}, {'name': 'Величественный Симулякр', 'text': 'Когда Величественный Симулякр выходит на поле битвы, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\\nКогда Величественный Симулякр умирает, вы можете взять карту.', 'type': 'Артефакт Существо — Голем', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534080&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e9a6166-807e-47fc-b380-285befc9beb5', 'multiverseId': 534080}, 'multiverseid': 534080}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '当黯色幻影进战场时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n当黯色幻影死去时，你可以抓一张牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534291&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40614a39-05c9-4fd1-a95a-9ed6d022eae7', 'multiverseId': 534291}, 'multiverseid': 534291}, {'name': '黯色幻影', 'text': '當黯色幻影進戰場時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將該牌橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\\n當黯色幻影死去時，你可以抽一張牌。', 'type': '神器生物 ～魔像', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534502&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4d38596-03ad-489b-8258-1cf2d577aaa6', 'multiverseId': 534502}, 'multiverseid': 534502}]", '[{\'name\': \'Erkunden\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in diesem Zug ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Belohnung für einen Entdecker ist ein Blick auf die Möglichkeiten der Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532755&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a4429b-6706-41a7-ad3a-99745b790cea\', \'multiverseId\': 532755}, \'multiverseid\': 532755}, {\'name\': \'Explorar\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La recompensa de un explorador es una visión de las posibilidades del mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a899911c-ee92-4f7a-8a68-6fc515328438\', \'multiverseId\': 532966}, \'multiverseid\': 532966}, {\'name\': \'Explorer\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La récompense de l\'explorateur est la vision des possibilités du lendemain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533177&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ef3029-090c-450d-9796-f682e2610ed1\', \'multiverseId\': 533177}, \'multiverseid\': 533177}, {\'name\': \'Esplorare\', \'text\': \'Puoi giocare una terra addizionale in questo turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La ricompensa di un esploratore? La certezza delle possibilità di domani.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32fabf60-c1e7-4207-b2ae-49cff5d557b1\', \'multiverseId\': 533388}, \'multiverseid\': 533388}, {\'name\': \'探検\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたは追加で土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'探検家にとっての報奨とは、明日の可能性への見通しである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f459562-7397-4181-ace4-90736eac0aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 533599}, \'multiverseid\': 533599}, {\'name\': \'Explorar\', \'text\': \'Você pode jogar um terreno adicional neste turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A recompensa de um explorador é a visão das possibilidades de amanhã.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a3f2c3d-08b9-4031-bd13-034a5ede3df2\', \'multiverseId\': 533810}, \'multiverseid\': 533810}, {\'name\': \'На Поиски\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыграть одну дополнительную землю в этом ходу.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Наградой исследователю становятся завтрашние перспективы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f849024b-6659-4c39-82bd-69244a7a9263\', \'multiverseId\': 534021}, \'multiverseid\': 534021}, {\'name\': \'探索大地\', \'text\': \'本回合中，你可以额外使用一个地。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'探险家的报偿，就是目睹明天的可能性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98b1016-9ae1-4677-b1a0-277e47b736fa\', \'multiverseId\': 534232}, \'multiverseid\': 534232}, {\'name\': \'探索大地\', \'text\': \'本回合中，你可以額外使用一個地。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'探險家的報償，就是目睹明天的可能性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5720ebc5-7e06-4a44-bc39-3a98a126967e\', \'multiverseId\': 534443}, \'multiverseid\': 534443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Etali der Ursturm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn Etali der Ursturm angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Dann kannst du davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Dinosaurier\', \'flavor\': \'Der Sturm tobt und das Erdreich bricht auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532724&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1aedf4e8-77a1-43a6-a78e-86608bd0482b\', \'multiverseId\': 532724}, \'multiverseid\': 532724}, {\'name\': \'Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que Etali, la Tempestad Primigenia ataque, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador. Luego puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre esas cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dinosaurio anciano\', \'flavor\': \'La tormenta arrecia y la tierra se abre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b25ae26d-a070-4283-bb92-24239c388518\', \'multiverseId\': 532935}, \'multiverseid\': 532935}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempête primordiale\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'Etali, Tempête primordiale attaque, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur, puis vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dinosaure\', \'flavor\': \'La tempête fait rage et la terre se brise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533146&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae91f293-572c-4b80-b6f7-792cb42d1a67\', \'multiverseId\': 533146}, \'multiverseid\': 533146}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tempesta Primordiale\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta Etali, Tempesta Primordiale attacca, esilia la prima carta del grimorio di ogni giocatore, poi puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie scelte tra quelle carte senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Dinosauro\', \'flavor\': \'La tempesta infuria e la terra si sgretola.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'730158e3-3dd4-42d6-9684-7e105b68a3eb\', \'multiverseId\': 533357}, \'multiverseid\': 533357}, {\'name\': \'原初の嵐、エターリ\', \'text\': \'原初の嵐、エターリが攻撃するたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚をそれぞれ追放する。その後あなたは、それらのカードの中から望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・恐竜\', \'flavor\': \'嵐が怒り大地が裂ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32bd7502-aac4-4e90-9367-bde5f1b0b2d3\', \'multiverseId\': 533568}, \'multiverseid\': 533568}, {\'name\': \'Etali, Tormenta Primordial\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Etali, Tormenta Primordial, atacar, exile o card do topo do grimório de cada jogador. Em seguida, você pode conjurar qualquer número de mágicas dentre aqueles cards sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dinossauro Ancião\', \'flavor\': \'À fúria da tormenta, a terra fende-se.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d5a1202-ad72-4a73-a174-130e3dddc76c\', \'multiverseId\': 533779}, \'multiverseid\': 533779}, {\'name\': \'Этали, Первозданная Буря\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Этали, Первозданная Буря атакует, изгоните верхнюю карту библиотеки каждого игрока, затем вы можете разыграть любое количество находящихся среди тех карт заклинаний без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Динозавр\', \'flavor\': \'Бушует буря, и земля разверзается.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc3fa292-d542-40a3-90ec-7838b5f30e20\', \'multiverseId\': 533990}, \'multiverseid\': 533990}, {\'name\': \'始啸埃泰力\', \'text\': \'每当始啸埃泰力攻击时，放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌，然后你可以从这些牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／恐龙\', \'flavor\': \'风暴肆虐，大地开裂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45f38429-b7ab-4875-aac9-f2391819a6bf\', \'multiverseId\': 534201}, \'multiverseid\': 534201}, {\'name\': \'始嘯埃泰力\', \'text\': \'每當始嘯埃泰力攻擊時，放逐每位玩家的牌庫頂牌，然後你可以從這些牌之中施放任意數量的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／恐龍\', \'flavor\': \'風暴肆虐，大地開裂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'679ae1d9-3570-435a-a5b2-3f2bf13a1072\', \'multiverseId\': 534412}, \'multiverseid\': 534412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewiger Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{W}{W}: Bringe den Ewigen Drachen aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Versorgungssegments.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532664&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'128444d6-2e81-480f-a39e-f94e6992bacf\', \'multiverseId\': 532664}, \'multiverseid\': 532664}, {\'name\': \'Dragón eterno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{W}{W}: Regresa el Dragón eterno de tu cementerio a tu mano. Activa esto solo durante tu mantenimiento.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01c07548-e99b-4b38-a354-ec64275ed6b6\', \'multiverseId\': 532875}, \'multiverseid\': 532875}, {\'name\': \'Dragon éternel\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{W}{W} : Renvoyez le Dragon éternel depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. N\'activez que pendant votre entretien.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863e849d-804b-4f55-9e4a-a6ea5604e922\', \'multiverseId\': 533086}, \'multiverseid\': 533086}, {\'name\': \'Drago Eterno\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{3}{W}{W}: Riprendi in mano il Drago Eterno dal tuo cimitero. Attiva solo durante il tuo mantenimento.\\nCiclopianura {2} ({2}, Scarta questa carta: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano, poi rimescola.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6d9311-f9a3-4aa2-a2a0-4c407755658e\', \'multiverseId\': 533297}, \'multiverseid\': 533297}, {\'name\': \'永遠のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{W}{W}：あなたの墓地にある永遠のドラゴンをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたのアップキープにしか起動できない。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533508&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e2632c-72ab-40cb-bd2d-d79feb19abe4\', \'multiverseId\': 533508}, \'multiverseid\': 533508}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Perpétuo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{W}{W}: Devolva Dragão Perpétuo de seu cemitério para sua mão. Ative apenas durante sua manutenção.\\nReciclar planície {2} ({2}, descarte este card: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, revele-o, coloque-o em sua mão e depois embaralhe.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'717822e4-c111-40ee-bdd7-54d17973c263\', \'multiverseId\': 533719}, \'multiverseid\': 533719}, {\'name\': \'Вечный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{3}{W}{W}: верните Вечного Дракона из вашего кладбища в вашу руку. Активируйте только во время вашего шага поддержки.\\nЦикл Равнин {2} ({2}, сбросьте эту карту: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины, покажите ее, положите ее в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550eb257-27eb-4492-a5ae-57359fe8fe57\', \'multiverseId\': 533930}, \'multiverseid\': 533930}, {\'name\': \'不朽巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{3}{W}{W}：将不朽巨龙从你的坟墓场移回你手上。只能于你的维持中起动。\\n循环平原{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e64fb3b1-8dd8-4915-8715-de829d715fe5\', \'multiverseId\': 534141}, \'multiverseid\': 534141}, {\'name\': \'不朽巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{W}{W}：將不朽巨龍從你的墳墓場移回你手上。只能於你的維持中起動。\\n循環平原{2}（{2}，棄掉此牌：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張平原牌，展示該牌，將它置於你手上，然後洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／精靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b675527-95cc-44c0-a977-c82c75380bca\', \'multiverseId\': 534352}, \'multiverseid\': 534352}]', "[{'name': 'Exhumierungsrituale', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nRückblende {3}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Alle sehnen sich nach dem Heiligen Schlaf. Nur wenigen ist er vergönnt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532709&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91e63af6-aa94-443e-ae14-2c044af2eeda', 'multiverseId': 532709}, 'multiverseid': 532709}, {'name': 'Ritos de desentierro', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Todos desean el Sueño Bendito. Pocos lo reciben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532920&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3977d662-7866-42fb-8fbf-84b743fb48ca', 'multiverseId': 532920}, 'multiverseid': 532920}, {'name': 'Sacres de déterrement', 'text': 'Renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Tous désirent le Sommeil béni. Peu le reçoivent.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533131&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1b8a0e4-4492-41fd-90dd-2253c04ab691', 'multiverseId': 533131}, 'multiverseid': 533131}, {'name': 'Rituali di Esumazione', 'text': 'Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {3}{W} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Tutti bramano il Sonno Benedetto. Ben pochi lo ricevono.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533342&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd5f14d3b-c804-4b71-973a-16af5f2ab331', 'multiverseId': 533342}, 'multiverseid': 533342}, {'name': '掘葬の儀式', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{W}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '誰もが祝福された眠りを切望する。それを得られる者はほとんどいない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533553&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1f5cf00-0801-4f2d-9afa-dce9f6c5ad8f', 'multiverseId': 533553}, 'multiverseid': 533553}, {'name': 'Ritos de Desenterro', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\nRecapitular {3}{W} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Todos anseiam pelo Sono Abençoado. Mas poucos o recebem.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533764&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'da7692a1-5f77-4c57-9b48-da43ce527fcc', 'multiverseId': 533764}, 'multiverseid': 533764}, {'name': 'Обряд Раззахоронения', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\nВоспоминание {3}{W} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Все жаждут забыться Благословенным Сном, но лишь немногие получают такую роскошь.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533975&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '437e0d52-cd69-4732-85a1-8ff7466f7a6d', 'multiverseId': 533975}, 'multiverseid': 533975}, {'name': '掀坟仪式', 'text': '将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n返照{3}{W}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '大家都祈求着受福安眠。很少人能够蒙福。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534186&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2bbe154f-b8a6-4a9b-80c2-a0a682729d81', 'multiverseId': 534186}, 'multiverseid': 534186}, {'name': '掀墳儀式', 'text': '將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n返照{3}{W}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '大家都祈求著受福安眠。很少人能夠蒙福。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534397&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '159ca18e-72c9-46ca-a343-c54f14a3d5cf', 'multiverseId': 534397}, 'multiverseid': 534397}]", '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e067e91-3b82-4e80-87fd-acf76c86035d\', \'multiverseId\': 532834}, \'multiverseid\': 532834}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48118049-6d35-4998-9f0b-1903a1ca7212\', \'multiverseId\': 533045}, \'multiverseid\': 533045}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain que votre adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533256&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26859bd0-a457-4ccc-858c-c8d31241d85f\', \'multiverseId\': 533256}, \'multiverseid\': 533256}, {\'name\': \'Frutteto Esotico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Era una strana mattina. Quando ci siamo svegliati, abbiamo trovato i nostri alberi completamente trasformati. Non sapevamo più se innaffiarli o lucidarli."\\n—Pulan, agricoltore di Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6133b45a-2ba8-4890-87aa-e8b3dc7a665e\', \'multiverseId\': 533467}, \'multiverseid\': 533467}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84fc1877-9c5b-432e-aa0b-974bf68f28b8\', \'multiverseId\': 533678}, \'multiverseid\': 533678}, {\'name\': \'Pomar Exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi uma manhã estranha. Quando acordamos, encontramos nossas árvores transformadas. Não sabíamos se deveriam ser regadas ou polidas."\\n— Pulan, pomareiro de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2b3563-2fd8-4a8a-adf9-46a4aede6cae\', \'multiverseId\': 533889}, \'multiverseid\': 533889}, {\'name\': \'Экзотический Сад\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета, которую могла бы произвести земля под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Утро было странное. Когда мы проснулись, то обнаружили, что деревья вокруг полностью преобразились. Мы даже не знали, поливать их или полировать».\\n— Пулан, бэнтский садовник\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4528e881-3570-4c8c-bd8d-a21134357b12\', \'multiverseId\': 534100}, \'multiverseid\': 534100}, {\'name\': \'异国果园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是个奇怪的早晨。我们醒来时，就发现树变了样子。不晓得该要替它浇水还是把它擦亮。」\\n～班特栽果人普兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04091d61-c319-40ee-9878-ee7d3343ccc3\', \'multiverseId\': 534311}, \'multiverseid\': 534311}, {\'name\': \'異國果園\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為由對手操控的地能產生之任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是個奇怪的早晨。我們醒來時，就發現樹變了樣子。不曉得該要替它澆水還是把它擦亮。」\\n～班特栽果人普蘭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b367bdfc-3464-4835-bdf3-b88c29c0258d\', \'multiverseId\': 534522}, \'multiverseid\': 534522}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feenstute\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Feenstute angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur oder ein Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Ritt in die Legende.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'531755dd-7b04-4dce-a5ef-12feda222399\', \'multiverseId\': 531964}, \'multiverseid\': 531964}, {\'name\': \'Montura feérica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Montura feérica ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura o planeswalker que controlas sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Cabalga hacia la leyenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7984b334-257c-40cd-a70b-b15eec455e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 532018}, \'multiverseid\': 532018}, {\'name\': \'Destrier de la Féerie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Destrier de la Féerie attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature ou qu\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': \'Entrez dans la légende au galop.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532072&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b57ab4d5-e33b-48c5-a995-eb48e193b7eb\', \'multiverseId\': 532072}, \'multiverseid\': 532072}, {\'name\': \'Destriero Fatato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Destriero Fatato attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio che controlli ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura o un planeswalker che controlli diventano bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, puoi pescare una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Cavalca nella leggenda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00d6ab9d-15c6-48fa-b554-b9d098744529\', \'multiverseId\': 532126}, \'multiverseid\': 532126}, {\'name\': \'フェイの騎獣\', \'text\': \'フェイの騎獣が攻撃するたび、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでない攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つが、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'これに乗り伝説となれ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33260577-a990-45f0-a463-ee2eff5f9603\', \'multiverseId\': 532180}, \'multiverseid\': 532180}, {\'name\': \'Corcel Feérico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Corcel Feérico ataca, outra criatura alvo atacante que você controla ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que uma criatura ou um planeswalker que você controla se torna alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, você pode comprar um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Cavalgue rumo às lendas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eaa8095-1949-423f-9c4b-8da7655fac70\', \'multiverseId\': 532234}, \'multiverseid\': 532234}, {\'name\': \'Скакун из Страны Фей\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Скакун из Страны Фей атакует, другое целевое атакующее существо под вашим контролем получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо или planeswalker под вашим контролем становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, вы можете взять карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'Скачи в легенды.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dec2e6e7-5ad5-4027-9238-53c344da7d8e\', \'multiverseId\': 532288}, \'multiverseid\': 532288}, {\'name\': \'妖精荒野骏鹿\', \'text\': \'每当妖精荒野骏鹿攻击时，另一个目标由你操控且进行攻击的生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物或鹏洛客成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'奔向传奇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b16502d-f59b-4d7d-8ac7-9e953c245470\', \'multiverseId\': 532342}, \'multiverseid\': 532342}, {\'name\': \'妖精荒野駿鹿\', \'text\': \'每當妖精荒野駿鹿攻擊時，另一個目標由你操控且進行攻擊的生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n每當一個由你操控的生物或鵬洛客成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，你可以抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'奔向傳奇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0a0f617-a086-4484-a28f-454d7c20c955\', \'multiverseId\': 532396}, \'multiverseid\': 532396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feenstute\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Feenstute angreift, erhält eine andere angreifende Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur oder ein Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aa01983-b248-4312-b08c-0d2bddb25b76\', \'multiverseId\': 531550}, \'multiverseid\': 531550}, {\'name\': \'Montura feérica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Montura feérica ataque, otra criatura atacante objetivo que controlas gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que una criatura o planeswalker que controlas sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22c20b7e-a45a-4054-8e2c-ad06dd7cc29d\', \'multiverseId\': 531606}, \'multiverseid\': 531606}, {\'name\': \'Destrier de la Féerie\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Destrier de la Féerie attaque, une autre créature attaquante ciblée que vous contrôlez acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature ou qu\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élan\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531662&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4f81ed9-5a36-4818-8abf-dd95b1fc06bb\', \'multiverseId\': 531662}, \'multiverseid\': 531662}, {\'name\': \'Destriero Fatato\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta il Destriero Fatato attacca, un\'altra creatura attaccante bersaglio che controlli ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura o un planeswalker che controlli diventano bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, puoi pescare una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Alce\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7ffaab7-7d47-4685-a79e-7f8bec9dd668\', \'multiverseId\': 531718}, \'multiverseid\': 531718}, {\'name\': \'フェイの騎獣\', \'text\': \'フェイの騎獣が攻撃するたび、これ以外であなたがコントロールしている攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つが、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fba6538-25a7-4e4c-9992-65dae5fc04d1\', \'multiverseId\': 531774}, \'multiverseid\': 531774}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe2f5f5-72d2-4296-a032-7ecf650054e4\', \'multiverseId\': 532804}, \'multiverseid\': 532804}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?".\\n—Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d1dde9-a8b4-4716-85f4-007ac51f27e9\', \'multiverseId\': 533015}, \'multiverseid\': 533015}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain que votre adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? »\\n—Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533226&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c5e5610-40f5-4c23-be41-3aab49adeaa3\', \'multiverseId\': 533226}, \'multiverseid\': 533226}, {\'name\': \'Pietra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore che una terra controllata da un avversario potrebbe produrre.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'hai tu che io non posso ottenere?"\\n—Mairsil, il Pretendente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71571d1b-7c29-4247-81eb-1720e51d864d\', \'multiverseId\': 533437}, \'multiverseid\': 533437}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――詐欺師メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33951382-0ef3-4a74-a33c-f9d178f4750f\', \'multiverseId\': 533648}, \'multiverseid\': 533648}, {\'name\': \'A Pedra Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor que um terreno controlado por um oponente possa gerar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que você tem que eu não possa obter?"\\n— Mairsil, o Impostor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37cbbb8a-57b8-4dce-bcea-d32ece51962c\', \'multiverseId\': 533859}, \'multiverseid\': 533859}, {\'name\': \'Фелворский Камень\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета, которую могла бы произвести земля под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Что у тебя есть такого, что я не могу заполучить?»\\n— Майрсил Притворщик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7627d6-e0e5-4cad-b7fb-79ffb89515e5\', \'multiverseId\': 534070}, \'multiverseid\': 534070}, {\'name\': \'战野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有的东西，哪一样我得不到？」\\n～伪装者梅西尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e748ab96-7240-497c-af63-d4235200fd6d\', \'multiverseId\': 534281}, \'multiverseid\': 534281}, {\'name\': \'戰野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為由對手操控的地能產生之任一顏色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有的東西，哪一樣我得不到？」\\n～偽裝者梅西爾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60a260a3-5289-48ed-8c4b-83d237bca326\', \'multiverseId\': 534492}, \'multiverseid\': 534492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fernglas des Erforschers\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Falls es eine Länderkarte ist, kannst du sie getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\nAusrüsten {1} ({1}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b632cdb2-d64d-4c87-af7e-b9bf7a15f630\', \'multiverseId\': 532803}, \'multiverseid\': 532803}, {\'name\': \'Telescopio del explorador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Si es una carta de tierra, puedes ponerla en el campo de batalla girada.\\nEquipar {1}. ({1}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ede6c92d-949e-430f-a5fb-274f50d3c520\', \'multiverseId\': 533014}, \'multiverseid\': 533014}, {\'name\': "Longue-vue de l\'explorateur", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de terrain, vous pouvez la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nÉquipement {1} ({1} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfce3129-f56c-4614-b869-2f55abc0daf8\', \'multiverseId\': 533225}, \'multiverseid\': 533225}, {\'name\': "Cannocchiale dell\'Esploratore", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Se è una carta terra, puoi metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nEquipaggiare {1} ({1}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f3455b-c36b-4caf-8bf5-45fb29e6ca0e\', \'multiverseId\': 533436}, \'multiverseid\': 533436}, {\'name\': \'探検者の望遠鏡\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。それが土地・カードであるなら、あなたはそれをタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備{1}（{1}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c523e19a-ec2c-4638-b0b5-9d37e31fda1a\', \'multiverseId\': 533647}, \'multiverseid\': 533647}, {\'name\': \'Escopo do Explorador\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Se for um card de terreno, você poderá colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado.\\nEquipar {1} ({1}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da9ae97-8baf-4174-8700-60c9669b6b47\', \'multiverseId\': 533858}, \'multiverseid\': 533858}, {\'name\': \'Подзорная Труба Исследователя\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Если это карта земли, вы можете положить ее на поле битвы повернутой.\\nСнарядить {1} ({1}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb84ec87-f160-4902-a06f-1a1d3f70876b\', \'multiverseId\': 534069}, \'multiverseid\': 534069}, {\'name\': \'探险家望远镜\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，检视你的牌库顶牌。若它是地牌，则你可以将之横置放进战场。\\n佩带{1}（{1}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77b71cea-a0dc-4356-aea7-a6ca294ef686\', \'multiverseId\': 534280}, \'multiverseid\': 534280}, {\'name\': \'探險家望遠鏡\', \'text\': \'每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，檢視你的牌庫頂牌。若它是地牌，你可以將之橫置放進戰場。\\n佩帶{1}（{1}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7f8243-0d29-4483-93d7-e3a3bdacf3d8\', \'multiverseId\': 534491}, \'multiverseid\': 534491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feuerspucken\', \'text\': \'Feuerspucken fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn ein Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe Feuerspucken aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532740&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d3f9f99-ee98-45ee-9c32-3a61d32af6f0\', \'multiverseId\': 532740}, \'multiverseid\': 532740}, {\'name\': \'Escupir llamas\', \'text\': \'Escupir llamas hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que un Dragón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {R}. Si lo haces, regresa Escupir llamas de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ae4897f-a29b-4464-bf1f-f3759ea573ba\', \'multiverseId\': 532951}, \'multiverseid\': 532951}, {\'name\': \'Cracher des flammes\', \'text\': "Cracher des flammes inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {R}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez Cracher des flammes depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533162&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df6e3100-5eaa-470c-b7e5-9d80be84c74a\', \'multiverseId\': 533162}, \'multiverseid\': 533162}, {\'name\': \'Respiro Bruciante\', \'text\': \'Il Respiro Bruciante infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta un Drago entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {R}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano il Respiro Bruciante dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b589e2b-f3b4-40c1-ac28-3e76c8181a42\', \'multiverseId\': 533373}, \'multiverseid\': 533373}, {\'name\': \'吐炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。吐炎はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\nドラゴン１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは「{R}を支払い、あなたの墓地にある吐炎をあなたの手札に戻す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533584&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1331e3df-7943-482d-b805-caad3770e4cd\', \'multiverseId\': 533584}, \'multiverseid\': 533584}, {\'name\': \'Cuspir Chamas\', \'text\': \'Cuspir Chamas causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\nToda vez que um Dragão entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode pagar {R}. Se fizer isso, devolva Cuspir Chamas de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc0d8406-eb2d-4550-a393-6fad2a0db21b\', \'multiverseId\': 533795}, \'multiverseid\': 533795}, {\'name\': \'Изрыгание Пламени\', \'text\': \'Изрыгание Пламени наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\\nКаждый раз, когда Дракон выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {R}. Если вы это делаете, верните Изрыгание Пламени из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c44b10-9ffa-4008-8e03-0b075ab4ef89\', \'multiverseId\': 534006}, \'multiverseid\': 534006}, {\'name\': \'吐焰\', \'text\': \'吐焰对目标生物造成4点伤害。\\n每当一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，则将吐焰从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4e1d129-8b1e-4467-8316-0b3d72ca76ce\', \'multiverseId\': 534217}, \'multiverseid\': 534217}, {\'name\': \'吐焰\', \'text\': \'吐焰對目標生物造成4點傷害。\\n每當一個龍在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，則將吐焰從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d345f0-261e-4f2f-9c91-2484a19996dc\', \'multiverseId\': 534428}, \'multiverseid\': 534428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fieberhaftes Misstrauen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst von jenen Nichtland-Karten eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nAbprall (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand wirkst, schicke ihn ins Exil, sowie er verrechnet wird. Zu Beginn deines nächsten Versorgungssegments kannst du diese Karte aus dem Exil wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532006&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848f01c8-c50e-4438-b77d-cd6545a83674\', \'multiverseId\': 532006}, \'multiverseid\': 532006}, {\'name\': \'Sospecha vehemente\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta que no sea tierra. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre esas cartas que no sean tierra sin pagar sus costes de maná.\\nRebote. (Si lanzas este hechizo desde tu mano, exílialo en cuanto se resuelva. Al comienzo de tu próximo mantenimiento, puedes lanzar esta carta desde el exilio sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe0b6702-a981-4210-9c00-892d55f0a722\', \'multiverseId\': 532060}, \'multiverseid\': 532060}, {\'name\': \'Suspicion enfiévrée\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte non-terrain. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi ces cartes non-terrain sans payer leur coût de mana.\\nRebond (Si vous lancez ce sort depuis votre main, exilez-le au moment où il se résout. Au début de votre prochain entretien, vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis l\'exil sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532114&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc9ed43-3aab-4f1a-8fd8-79d5e5de916a\', \'multiverseId\': 532114}, \'multiverseid\': 532114}, {\'name\': \'Sospetto Febbrile\', \'text\': "Ogni avversario esilia carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio finché non esilia una carta non terra. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie scelte tra quelle carte non terra senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\\nRipresa (Se lanci questa magia dalla tua mano, esiliala mentre si risolve. All\'inizio del tuo prossimo mantenimento, puoi lanciare questa carta dall\'esilio senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b1ec58-a4e8-4f5a-a983-3b80edea9aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 532168}, \'multiverseid\': 532168}, {\'name\': \'熱病の疑惑\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ、土地でないカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたは、それらの土地でないカードのうち望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n反復（この呪文をあなたの手札から唱えていたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。次のあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域にあるこのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9236bac9-8c91-4665-8f7e-b7cee5b7afd5\', \'multiverseId\': 532222}, \'multiverseid\': 532222}, {\'name\': \'Suspeita Fervorosa\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente exila cards do topo do próprio grimório até exilar um card não de terreno. Você pode conjurar qualquer número de mágicas dentre aqueles cards não de terreno sem pagar seus custos de mana.\\nRebote (Se você conjurar esta mágica da sua mão, exile-a conforme ela for resolvida. No início de sua próxima manutenção, você poderá conjurar este card do exílio sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42190e4f-4009-4e4c-91f8-1a864f86fc83\', \'multiverseId\': 532276}, \'multiverseid\': 532276}, {\'name\': \'Лихорадочное Подозрение\', \'text\': \'Каждый оппонент изгоняет карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгонит не являющуюся землей карту. Вы можете разыграть любое количество заклинаний, находящихся среди тех не являющихся землями карт, без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\\nОтскок (Изгоните это заклинание в момент его разрешения, если вы разыгрываете его из вашей руки. В начале вашего следующего шага поддержки вы можете разыграть эту карту из изгнания без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fd72932-32aa-4a72-a54a-8934410fdbbb\', \'multiverseId\': 532330}, \'multiverseid\': 532330}, {\'name\': \'狂热怀疑\', \'text\': \'每位对手各从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止。你可以从这些非地牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29e8d6d6-0af6-49ab-8d7b-573c83022b25\', \'multiverseId\': 532384}, \'multiverseid\': 532384}, {\'name\': \'狂熱懷疑\', \'text\': \'每位對手各從其牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張非地牌為止。你可以從這些非地牌之中施放任意數量的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\\n彈回（如果你從你手上施放此咒語，於它結算時將之放逐。在你的下一個維持開始時，你可以從放逐區施放此牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509a3d26-7ab5-4f9f-a9ac-0ab32b306380\', \'multiverseId\': 532438}, \'multiverseid\': 532438}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fieberhaftes Misstrauen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst von jenen Nichtland-Karten eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\\nAbprall\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca71e387-704b-48e7-ab2f-4abcdeedd1c2\', \'multiverseId\': 531592}, \'multiverseid\': 531592}, {\'name\': \'Sospecha vehemente\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta que no sea tierra. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre esas cartas que no sean tierra sin pagar sus costes de maná.\\nRebote.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ab8b108-aa52-4422-bd05-bfb19d4ce087\', \'multiverseId\': 531648}, \'multiverseid\': 531648}, {\'name\': \'Suspicion enfiévrée\', \'text\': "Chaque adversaire exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte non-terrain. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi ces cartes non-terrain sans payer leur coût de mana.\\nRebond", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531704&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'130e5ebe-fb95-4e4f-b097-db34ff92222b\', \'multiverseId\': 531704}, \'multiverseid\': 531704}, {\'name\': \'Sospetto Febbrile\', \'text\': \'Ogni avversario esilia carte dalla cima del proprio grimorio finché non esilia una carta non terra. Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie scelte tra quelle carte non terra senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\\nRipresa\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9619b194-64f3-414e-ba8d-0049b217515b\', \'multiverseId\': 531760}, \'multiverseid\': 531760}, {\'name\': \'熱病の疑惑\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ、土地でないカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたは、それらの土地でないカードのうち望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\\n反復\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456a25cd-6463-4bb0-a02a-6bd05f7e4bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 531816}, \'multiverseid\': 531816}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fiepsende Hexe\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Fiepsende Hexe ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge so viele 1/1 schwarze Ratte-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie du Gegner hast.\\n{1}{B}, opfere eine Kreatur: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -2/-2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532693&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7487008b-b3c3-46ae-bd15-dc9c81e45a92\', \'multiverseId\': 532693}, \'multiverseid\': 532693}, {\'name\': \'Bruja chilladora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Bruja chilladora entre al campo de batalla, crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Rata negras 1/1 igual a la cantidad de oponentes que tienes.\\n{1}{B}, sacrificar una criatura: La criatura objetivo obtiene -2/-2 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2980883-07ff-4a14-9a9b-852f91c8c625\', \'multiverseId\': 532904}, \'multiverseid\': 532904}, {\'name\': \'Envoûteuse bruyante\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Envoûteuse bruyante arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez un nombre de jetons de créature 1/1 noire Rat égal au nombre d\'adversaires que vous avez.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifiez une créature : Une créature ciblée gagne -2/-2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'560b47c2-73e9-4e78-912a-e3dfae6aaad4\', \'multiverseId\': 533115}, \'multiverseid\': 533115}, {\'name\': \'Strega Squittente\', \'text\': \'Quando la Strega Squittente entra nel campo di battaglia, crea un numero di pedine creatura Ratto 1/1 nere pari al numero di avversari che hai.\\n{1}{B}, Sacrifica una creatura: Una creatura bersaglio prende -2/-2 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b9a08e3-dd69-4850-a17a-34ade3f538c2\', \'multiverseId\': 533326}, \'multiverseid\': 533326}, {\'name\': \'さえずる魔女\', \'text\': \'さえずる魔女が戦場に出たとき、あなたの対戦相手の人数に等しい数の、黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n{1}{B}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－２/－２の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533537&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7089074f-1ebf-4fb2-9968-1d61ce52359f\', \'multiverseId\': 533537}, \'multiverseid\': 533537}, {\'name\': \'Bruxa Chiadora\', \'text\': \'Quando Bruxa Chiadora entrar no campo de batalha, crie uma quantidade de fichas de criatura Rato preta 1/1 igual ao número de oponentes que você tem.\\n{1}{B}, sacrifique uma criatura: A criatura alvo recebe -2/-2 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4dc364e-5dd0-48a8-8810-f85803bea019\', \'multiverseId\': 533748}, \'multiverseid\': 533748}, {\'name\': \'Верещащая Ведьма\', \'text\': \'Когда Верещащая Ведьма выходит на поле битвы, создайте количество фишек существа 1/1 черная Крыса, равное числу имеющихся у вас оппонентов.\\n{1}{B}, пожертвуйте существо: целевое существо получает -2/-2 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5aa527-626e-4620-9e7b-36a46f08e239\', \'multiverseId\': 533959}, \'multiverseid\': 533959}, {\'name\': \'吱响巫婆\', \'text\': \'当吱响巫婆进战场时，派出若干1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，其数量等同于你的对手数量。\\n{1}{B}，牺牲一个生物：目标生物得-2/-2直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39bdb475-6880-4892-af09-69539cd44c73\', \'multiverseId\': 534170}, \'multiverseid\': 534170}, {\'name\': \'吱響巫婆\', \'text\': \'當吱響巫婆進戰場時，派出若干1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物，其數量等同於你的對手數量。\\n{1}{B}，犧牲一個生物：目標生物得-2/-2直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1554af-d054-4eec-a6a7-ae94a758db80\', \'multiverseId\': 534381}, \'multiverseid\': 534381}]', "[{'name': 'Flinkfuß-Stiefel', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': 'Wer magische *Stiefel des Schreitens und Springens* trägt, kann erstaunliche Strecken zurücklegen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532815&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a64433fa-f4e9-4e4d-8698-6c07de920f67', 'multiverseId': 532815}, 'multiverseid': 532815}, {'name': 'Botas de pies ligeros', 'text': 'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': 'Quien lleva *botas de zancadas y brincos* mágicas puede saltar unas distancias asombrosas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533026&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce0a801b-48e7-4bba-a35e-9376a39418c0', 'multiverseId': 533026}, 'multiverseid': 533026}, {'name': 'Bottes de piedagile', 'text': 'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': 'Qui porte des *bottes de sept lieues* magiques peut bondir sur des distances stupéfiantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533237&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b3491dc-dc4b-4cda-9f2d-e98f1d9f59cd', 'multiverseId': 533237}, 'multiverseid': 533237}, {'name': 'Stivali Piedelesto', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata ha anti-malocchio e rapidità.\\nEquipaggiare {1}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': 'Chi indossa i magici *stivali molleggiati* può saltare incredibili distanze.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533448&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '213e7c2d-4a14-473c-8cff-296b2e49662c', 'multiverseId': 533448}, 'multiverseid': 533448}, {'name': '速足のブーツ', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': '魔法のブーツ「*ブーツ・オヴ・ストライディング・アンド・スプリンギング*」を身につければ、驚くほどの距離を飛び越えられる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533659&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9ac1ec39-2bff-4637-8dcd-f4b8f90e1949', 'multiverseId': 533659}, 'multiverseid': 533659}, {'name': 'Botas Pé-ligeiro', 'text': 'A criatura equipada tem resistência a magia e ímpeto.\\nEquipar {1}', 'type': 'Artefato — Equipamento', 'flavor': 'Quem usa *botas de caminhar e saltar* mágicas pode saltar distâncias incríveis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533870&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '82a8f0ee-ee96-4eec-b225-07651cd236f3', 'multiverseId': 533870}, 'multiverseid': 533870}, {'name': 'Скороходные Сапоги', 'text': 'Снаряженное существо имеет Порчеустойчивость и Ускорение.\\nСнарядить {1}', 'type': 'Артефакт — Снаряжение', 'flavor': 'Тот, кто носит волшебные *скороходные сапоги,* может прыгать на поразительную длину.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534081&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbc36745-0e36-4e09-a7f7-6b17736c0901', 'multiverseId': 534081}, 'multiverseid': 534081}, {'name': '疾行靴', 'text': '佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。\\n佩带{1}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '奇物*跑跳靴*能让穿戴者跳得更高更远。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534292&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bda54330-f772-45bb-bcfe-33c11df31435', 'multiverseId': 534292}, 'multiverseid': 534292}, {'name': '疾行靴', 'text': '佩帶此武具的生物具有辟邪與敏捷異能。\\n佩帶{1}', 'type': '神器 ～武具', 'flavor': '奇物*跑跳靴*能讓穿戴者跳得更高更遠。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534503&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fbab178f-4ed0-4a95-8963-65f6740b79c0', 'multiverseId': 534503}, 'multiverseid': 534503}]", '[{\'name\': \'Fluch der Geschwätzigkeit\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler angegriffen wird, ziehst du eine Karte. Jeder Gegner, der den Spieler angreift, tut dasselbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch\', \'flavor\': \'Sorgloses Geplapper lockt so manch aufmerksame Zuhörer an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532680&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb6fe50-3730-4b27-8027-8cbfc1bd3a9b\', \'multiverseId\': 532680}, \'multiverseid\': 532680}, {\'name\': \'Maldición de verborrea\', \'text\': \'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado sea atacado, robas una carta. Cada oponente que ataque a ese jugador también roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura maldición\', \'flavor\': \'La charlatanería atrae a muchos oídos atentos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba10058-dd49-4683-8b4e-eba62c4d51cb\', \'multiverseId\': 532891}, \'multiverseid\': 532891}, {\'name\': \'Malédiction de loquacité\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté est attaqué, vous piochez une carte. Chaque adversaire attaquant ce joueur fait de même.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura et malédiction\', \'flavor\': "Les indiscrétions attirent bon nombre d\'oreilles attentives.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7d87100-25e7-47e3-a2d7-7ae0c91ec778\', \'multiverseId\': 533102}, \'multiverseid\': 533102}, {\'name\': \'Maledizione della Loquacità\', \'text\': \'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato viene attaccato, pesca una carta. Ogni avversario che attacca quel giocatore fa lo stesso.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema\', \'flavor\': \'Le chiacchiere vane attirano più di un orecchio attento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9e9fc68-213c-464b-8def-4ed2157bdbbc\', \'multiverseId\': 533313}, \'multiverseid\': 533313}, {\'name\': \'饒舌の呪い\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーが攻撃されるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。そのプレイヤーを攻撃している各対戦相手はそれぞれ同じことを行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い\', \'flavor\': \'無駄話は無数の聞き耳を引き寄せる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533524&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c95b144-a475-40ef-a2f8-272bdca0d7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 533524}, \'multiverseid\': 533524}, {\'name\': \'Maldição da Prolixidade\', \'text\': \'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado for atacado, você compra um card. Cada oponente que estiver atacando aquele jogador faz o mesmo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura Maldição\', \'flavor\': \'Conversa fiada atrai muitos ouvidos atentos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880ca210-61e5-46b4-b5e7-4bb1172414cc\', \'multiverseId\': 533735}, \'multiverseid\': 533735}, {\'name\': \'Проклятие Празднословия\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать игрока\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованный игрок атакован, вы берете карту. То же самое делает каждый оппонент, атакующий того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура Проклятие\', \'flavor\': \'Пустая болтовня привлекает многих внимательных слушателей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf7def32-98a1-440f-adc3-a1640cbac05d\', \'multiverseId\': 533946}, \'multiverseid\': 533946}, {\'name\': \'赘言诅咒\', \'text\': \'结附于牌手\\n每当所结附的牌手被攻击时，你抓一张牌。每位正向该牌手进行攻击的对手亦如此。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气／诅咒\', \'flavor\': \'闲言碎语招引各路好事之徒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8366575-64e9-4d6c-acee-af40a0eb603a\', \'multiverseId\': 534157}, \'multiverseid\': 534157}, {\'name\': \'贅言詛咒\', \'text\': \'結附於玩家\\n每當所結附的玩家被攻擊時，你抽一張牌。每位正向該玩家進行攻擊的對手亦如此。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣／詛咒\', \'flavor\': \'閒言碎語招引各路好事之徒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'706b5e09-38e7-4952-942c-57cfe175651d\', \'multiverseId\': 534368}, \'multiverseid\': 534368}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flusskundiger Augur\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Flusskundige Augur ins Spiel kommt, ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Zeit fließt dahin, wie die Flüsse zu unbekannten Meeren. Die Weisen richten ihren Blick stromabwärts."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532691&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02f43231-8e24-4be3-a7ab-45db0f891606\', \'multiverseId\': 532691}, \'multiverseid\': 532691}, {\'name\': \'Presagio de la sabiduría del río\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Presagio de la sabiduría del río entre al campo de batalla, roba tres cartas, luego pon dos cartas de tu mano en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"El tiempo fluye, como los ríos, hacia un mar desconocido. Los sabios otean en la dirección de la corriente".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3fd040-599c-4a4d-851c-aaa150f8588a\', \'multiverseId\': 532902}, \'multiverseid\': 532902}, {\'name\': \'Augure sophiopotame\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Augure sophiopotame arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez trois cartes et mettez ensuite deux cartes de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'« Le temps, tel un fleuve, avance vers une mer inconnue. Les sages savent regarder en aval. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533113&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0860ecdb-6d6e-482a-bc13-6e4dcb3ddc6d\', \'multiverseId\': 533113}, \'multiverseid\': 533113}, {\'name\': \'Augure della Saggezza Fluviale\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Augure della Saggezza Fluviale entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'"Come un fiume, il tempo scorre verso un mare ignoto. I saggi sanno guardare alla foce."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c182d211-17c8-4783-b79d-3aa8cbb66901\', \'multiverseId\': 533324}, \'multiverseid\': 533324}, {\'name\': \'川識の占い師\', \'text\': \'川識の占い師が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を引き、その後あなたの手札にあるカード２枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「時は知られざる大海に向かい川のように流れるもの。識者はその下流を見通すもの。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ae57496-a8aa-46bf-86dc-c71b801ad011\', \'multiverseId\': 533535}, \'multiverseid\': 533535}, {\'name\': \'Áugure Fluviossábio\', \'text\': \'Quando Áugure Fluviossábio entrar no campo de batalha, compre três cards e depois coloque dois cards de sua mão no topo de seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"O tempo corre como os rios, rumo a um mar desconhecido. Os sábios olham rio abaixo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3136581-48a9-4dc1-b4ac-d3649e4612a1\', \'multiverseId\': 533746}, \'multiverseid\': 533746}, {\'name\': \'Авгур-Рекознатец\', \'text\': \'Когда Авгур-Рекознатец выходит на поле битвы, возьмите три карты, затем положите две карты из вашей руки на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Время течет, словно река, навстречу неизвестному морю. Мудрый знает, что нужно направить взор вниз по течению».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47782972-4b58-4819-8d30-ac05bd4fd88a\', \'multiverseId\': 533957}, \'multiverseid\': 533957}, {\'name\': \'通流卜算师\', \'text\': \'当通流卜算师进战场时，抓三张牌，然后将两张牌从你手上以任意顺序置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「时间就如这滔滔江水，奔流向前汇聚入海。智者知晓该在下流探寻。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a946f199-4ff5-4d5b-bbcd-81a750c2e407\', \'multiverseId\': 534168}, \'multiverseid\': 534168}, {\'name\': \'通流卜算師\', \'text\': \'當通流卜算師進戰場時，抽三張牌，然後將兩張牌從你手上以任意順序置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「時間就如這滔滔江水，奔流向前匯聚入海。智者知曉該在下流探尋。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a0bd23-200f-41ff-a646-b6f9f42ded5c\', \'multiverseId\': 534379}, \'multiverseid\': 534379}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flötender Rattenfänger\', \'text\': \'Ratten, die du kontrollierst, haben Bedrohlichkeit.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, opfere drei Ratten: Übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn es Ohren hat, wird es nach meiner Pfeife tanzen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532704&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc307541-b7db-4b95-8773-dc86ed738474\', \'multiverseId\': 532704}, \'multiverseid\': 532704}, {\'name\': \'Flautista de las Ratas\', \'text\': \'Las Ratas que controlas tienen la habilidad de amenaza.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrificar tres Ratas: Gana el control de la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tiene oídos, bailará al son que toco".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532915&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f79e9abf-f737-4b9d-90cc-670a8cb45aea\', \'multiverseId\': 532915}, \'multiverseid\': 532915}, {\'name\': \'Flûteur de rats\', \'text\': "Les rats que vous contrôlez ont la menace.\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez trois rats : Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': \'« Ma mélodie fera danser tout ce qui a des oreilles. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd50effe-3b4c-409f-9ffd-be6830216f81\', \'multiverseId\': 533126}, \'multiverseid\': 533126}, {\'name\': \'Pifferaio della Colonia\', \'text\': \'I Ratti che controlli hanno minacciare.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica tre Ratti: Prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Warlock Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha orecchie, danzerà al ritmo della mia melodia."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e3d382d-e4a9-427e-8739-d16558277659\', \'multiverseId\': 533337}, \'multiverseid\': 533337}, {\'name\': \'群れの笛吹き男\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのネズミは威迫を持つ。\\n{1}{B}, {T}：黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, ネズミ３体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「耳があれば、私の曲で踊るでしょう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0224aba6-3ec2-43cc-8d4d-a8a83f8324b4\', \'multiverseId\': 533548}, \'multiverseid\': 533548}, {\'name\': \'Flautista da Rataria\', \'text\': \'Os Ratos que você controla têm ameaçar.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, sacrifique três Ratos: Ganhe o controle da criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Bruxo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se tem orelhas, vai dançar ao ritmo da minha música."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89eb22f6-18d4-452f-9051-fe431fe8fe35\', \'multiverseId\': 533759}, \'multiverseid\': 533759}, {\'name\': \'Дудочник Скопища\', \'text\': \'Крысы под вашим контролем имеют Угрозу.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черная Крыса.\\n{2}{B}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте три Крысы: получите контроль над целевым существом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Колдун\', \'flavor\': \'«Если у них есть уши, они станут плясать под мою дудку».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd8943b5-729e-4bc4-ac20-2f21d5197a7b\', \'multiverseId\': 533970}, \'multiverseid\': 533970}, {\'name\': \'鼠群魔笛手\', \'text\': \'由你操控的老鼠具有威慑异能。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n{2}{B}{B}，{T}，牺牲三个老鼠：获得目标生物的操控权。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'「只要它有耳朵，就会随着我的旋律起舞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b18826c-fa82-4d66-88c7-f38c6cee89ae\', \'multiverseId\': 534181}, \'multiverseid\': 534181}, {\'name\': \'鼠群魔笛手\', \'text\': \'由你操控的老鼠具有威懾異能。\\n{1}{B}，{T}：派出一個1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n{2}{B}{B}，{T}，犧牲三個老鼠：獲得目標生物的操控權。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'「只要牠有耳朵，就會隨著我的旋律起舞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe2d452-a790-42f0-bd5c-7d02cfe3ac96\', \'multiverseId\': 534392}, \'multiverseid\': 534392}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fraßbeutel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du ein anderes Nichtspielsteinartefakt oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur opferst, schicke es bzw. sie ins Exil.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere ein anderes Artefakt oder eine andere Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere den Fraßbeutel: Würfle einen W10. Bringe bis zu X Karten, die mit dem Fraßbeutel ins Exil geschickt wurden, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531566&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12fb00fd-9b1d-4448-8595-7684987096f3\', \'multiverseId\': 531566}, \'multiverseid\': 531566}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa devoradora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques otro artefacto o criatura que no sea ficha, exílialo.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar otro artefacto o criatura: Roba una carta.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar la Bolsa devoradora: Tira 1d10. Regresa hasta X cartas de entre las cartas exiliadas con la Bolsa devoradora a las manos de sus propietarios, donde X es el resultado.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fc7d7cc-15cc-4f5e-b8d0-da85a2eb7b72\', \'multiverseId\': 531622}, \'multiverseid\': 531622}, {\'name\': \'Sac dévoreur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un autre artefact non-jeton ou une autre créature non-jeton, exilez-la.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un autre artefact ou une autre créature : Piochez une carte.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez le Sac dévoreur : Lancez un d10. Renvoyez jusqu\'à X cartes parmi les cartes exilées par le Sac dévoreur dans les mains de leurs propriétaires, X étant le résultat.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531678&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d841db74-b0e4-4033-9f26-9cddefa67653\', \'multiverseId\': 531678}, \'multiverseid\': 531678}, {\'name\': \'Borsa Divorante\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un altro artefatto o creatura non pedina, esilia quell\'artefatto o quella creatura.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica un altro artefatto o creatura: Pesca una carta.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica la Borsa Divorante: Tira un d10. Fai tornare in mano ai rispettivi proprietari fino a X carte scelte tra le carte esiliate con la Borsa Divorante, dove X è il risultato.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9e373b-e27b-40f8-b72e-b12fc57c292e\', \'multiverseId\': 531734}, \'multiverseid\': 531734}, {\'name\': \'バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリング\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちトークンでもこれでもない１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、それを追放する。\\n{2}, {T}, アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちこれ以外の１つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}, {T}, バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリングを生け贄に捧げる：d10を１回振る。バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリングによって追放されているカードのうちＸ枚をオーナーの手札に戻す。Ｘはその出目に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6488c263-97e0-4b6b-b3d9-8f65a4f5d3f2\', \'multiverseId\': 531790}, \'multiverseid\': 531790}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fraßbeutel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du ein anderes Nichtspielsteinartefakt oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur opferst, schicke es bzw. sie ins Exil.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere ein anderes Artefakt oder eine andere Kreatur: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{3}, {T}, opfere den Fraßbeutel: Würfle einen W10. Bringe bis zu X Karten, die mit dem Fraßbeutel ins Exil geschickt wurden, auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531980&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d50a944-7b2c-4d4b-8d9c-e8de10614b76\', \'multiverseId\': 531980}, \'multiverseid\': 531980}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa devoradora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que sacrifiques otro artefacto o criatura que no sea ficha, exílialo.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar otro artefacto o criatura: Roba una carta.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrificar la Bolsa devoradora: Tira 1d10. Regresa hasta X cartas de entre las cartas exiliadas con la Bolsa devoradora a las manos de sus propietarios, donde X es el resultado.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a9052c-b0d6-4ca4-aae1-5f3f4ce86d17\', \'multiverseId\': 532034}, \'multiverseid\': 532034}, {\'name\': \'Sac dévoreur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un autre artefact non-jeton ou une autre créature non-jeton, exilez-la.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un autre artefact ou une autre créature : Piochez une carte.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifiez le Sac dévoreur : Lancez un d10. Renvoyez jusqu\'à X cartes parmi les cartes exilées par le Sac dévoreur dans les mains de leurs propriétaires, X étant le résultat.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f460d524-3e4c-4098-bbc7-76cb6ebada0c\', \'multiverseId\': 532088}, \'multiverseid\': 532088}, {\'name\': \'Borsa Divorante\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta sacrifichi un altro artefatto o creatura non pedina, esilia quell\'artefatto o quella creatura.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica un altro artefatto o creatura: Pesca una carta.\\n{3}, {T}, Sacrifica la Borsa Divorante: Tira un d10. Fai tornare in mano ai rispettivi proprietari fino a X carte scelte tra le carte esiliate con la Borsa Divorante, dove X è il risultato.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39646cf6-f0dd-4dac-b316-1728687a73db\', \'multiverseId\': 532142}, \'multiverseid\': 532142}, {\'name\': \'バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリング\', \'text\': \'あなたがアーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちトークンでもこれでもない１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、それを追放する。\\n{2}, {T}, アーティファクトやクリーチャーのうちこれ以外の１つを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\\n{3}, {T}, バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリングを生け贄に捧げる：１個のd10を振る。バッグ・オヴ・ディヴァウアリングによって追放されているカードのうちＸ枚をオーナーの手札に戻す。Ｘはその出目に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c53ceb80-4092-44d5-a808-35caba45d754\', \'multiverseId\': 532196}, \'multiverseid\': 532196}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa Devoradora\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você sacrificar outro artefato ou criatura não ficha, exile-o.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique outro artefato ou criatura: Compre um card.\\n{3}, {T}, sacrifique Bolsa Devoradora: Role um d10. Devolva para as mãos de seus donos até X cards dentre os cards exilados com Bolsa Devoradora, sendo X o resultado.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec54a3b4-6e8f-41b8-ba24-a315979f7e7f\', \'multiverseId\': 532250}, \'multiverseid\': 532250}, {\'name\': \'Сумка Пожирания\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы жертвуете другой не являющийся фишкой артефакт или существо, изгоните его.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте другой артефакт или существо: возьмите карту.\\n{3}, {T}, пожертвуйте Сумку Пожирания: бросьте d10. Верните не более Х карт среди изгнанных Сумкой Пожирания карт в руки их владельцев, где X — результат броска.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbebb2a5-4057-4955-adf4-41b8d5f13672\', \'multiverseId\': 532304}, \'multiverseid\': 532304}, {\'name\': \'吞噬袋\', \'text\': \'每当你牺牲另一个非衍生物的神器或生物时，将它放逐。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲另一个神器或生物：抓一张牌。\\n{3}，{T}，牺牲吞噬袋：掷一颗d10。将以吞噬袋放逐之牌中的至多X张移回其拥有者手上，X为掷骰结果。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5c47fbc-6bff-4e3a-af10-5cf041c312a6\', \'multiverseId\': 532358}, \'multiverseid\': 532358}, {\'name\': \'吞噬袋\', \'text\': \'每當你犧牲另一個非衍生物的神器或生物時，將它放逐。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲另一個神器或生物：抽一張牌。\\n{3}，{T}，犧牲吞噬袋：擲一顆d10。將以吞噬袋放逐之牌中的至多X張移回其擁有者手上，X為擲骰結果。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a331e6a2-de40-410c-8013-a5ae6f1474ac\', \'multiverseId\': 532412}, \'multiverseid\': 532412}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fruchtbarer Boden\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein zusätzliches Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Die wahre Macht der Natur ist kein tosender Sturm und kein anstürmendes Nashorn, sondern die unaufhaltsame Vitalität des Lebens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532756&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0050be31-83f0-45df-bbfa-9eca862f33c1\', \'multiverseId\': 532756}, \'multiverseid\': 532756}, {\'name\': \'Tierra fértil\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná adicional de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'La verdadera fuerza de la naturaleza no es una tormenta furiosa ni un rinoceronte en carga, sino el inexorable ímpetu de la vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa5d5b5b-34c7-4c69-b547-c7850a407130\', \'multiverseId\': 532967}, \'multiverseid\': 532967}, {\'name\': \'Terrain fertile\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un mana supplémentaire de la couleur de son choix.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "La véritable force de la nature ne réside pas dans la violence de l\'orage ou la fougue du rhinocéros, mais dans la vitalité inexorable de la vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533178&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a364fb43-d010-484f-a380-37ffc88f1e23\', \'multiverseId\': 533178}, \'multiverseid\': 533178}, {\'name\': \'Terreno Fertile\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge un mana addizionale di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La vera forza della natura non risiede nella furia della tempesta né nel rinoceronte alla carica, bensì nell\'inesorabile prosperità della vita.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'743fa718-2ec6-4576-8ec7-c7020e652ea8\', \'multiverseId\': 533389}, \'multiverseid\': 533389}, {\'name\': \'肥沃な大地\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントされている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'自然の真の強さというのは、荒れ狂う嵐でもなく、突進するサイでもなく、容赦無い生命力だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533600&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'840642e2-fdb8-4909-802e-a93f0e72c48f\', \'multiverseId\': 533600}, \'multiverseid\': 533600}, {\'name\': \'Solo Fértil\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona um mana extra de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'A verdadeira força da natureza não está na fúria da tormenta, nem na carga do rinoceronte, mas no vigor inexorável da vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff07b2e0-973d-4638-91a6-05762e1bf81b\', \'multiverseId\': 533811}, \'multiverseid\': 533811}, {\'name\': \'Плодородная Почва\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованная земля поворачивается для получения маны, контролирующий ее игрок добавляет одну дополнительную ману любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Истинная сила природы — это не бушующая буря или несущийся носорог. Это непреклонная воля к жизни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'619522c8-4782-4116-85b0-2e6c81cf00f5\', \'multiverseId\': 534022}, \'multiverseid\': 534022}, {\'name\': \'肥沃大地\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n每当横置所结附的地以产生法术力时，其操控者额外加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'自然最真实的力量并不在于猛袭风暴或狂躁犀牛，而在于生命的无尽活力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b21b9d-cec6-4f04-9de8-39b243d592be\', \'multiverseId\': 534233}, \'multiverseid\': 534233}, {\'name\': \'肥沃大地\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n每當橫置所結附的地以產生魔法力時，其操控者額外加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'自然最真實的力量並不在於猛襲風暴或狂躁犀牛，而在於生命的無盡活力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'137b7364-3b94-4822-b3c7-a5c371a27efd\', \'multiverseId\': 534444}, \'multiverseid\': 534444}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelnder Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532736&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ca4ac6-abc4-499b-9ae5-7c3d54b984e7\', \'multiverseId\': 532736}, \'multiverseid\': 532736}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu brillante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, creas una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23941ab1-ac5e-4530-bd65-12415519d906\', \'multiverseId\': 532947}, \'multiverseid\': 532947}, {\'name\': \'Impetus brillant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44551744-c83a-4762-a5f9-8d4d910a8c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 533158}, \'multiverseid\': 533158}, {\'name\': \'Impeto Lucente\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, crei una pedina Tesoro. (È un artefatto con "{T}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75bd0e7-8f6c-43c1-8ca4-02ea48e660c3\', \'multiverseId\': 533369}, \'multiverseid\': 533369}, {\'name\': \'輝光の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533580&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'175da8c1-acf8-41bc-a8da-842776c32eec\', \'multiverseId\': 533580}, \'multiverseid\': 533580}, {\'name\': \'Ímpeto Brilhante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, você cria uma ficha de Tesouro. (Ela é um artefato com "{T}, sacrifique este artefato: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'198330de-baf2-4768-984a-a6112a76f413\', \'multiverseId\': 533791}, \'multiverseid\': 533791}, {\'name\': \'Сверкающее Побуждение\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, вы создаете одну фишку Клада. (Это артефакт со способностью «{T}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0606e8e3-44d8-41fd-a17d-01892bac8788\', \'multiverseId\': 534002}, \'multiverseid\': 534002}, {\'name\': \'闪耀促动\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，你派出一个珍宝衍生物。（珍宝衍生物是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924e0923-c91c-4793-8694-b7262b2abd31\', \'multiverseId\': 534213}, \'multiverseid\': 534213}, {\'name\': \'閃耀促動\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當所結附的生物攻擊時，你派出一個珍寶衍生物。（珍寶衍生物是具有「{T}，犧牲此神器：加一點任意顏色的魔法力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2c5530a-01db-4f0b-8472-45e892546f92\', \'multiverseId\': 534424}, \'multiverseid\': 534424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkenraub\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder mehr ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana wandte sich flüsternd an die Reste von Oketras und Bontus Bewusstsein: „Ihr seid die Götter. Er ist ein Eindringling. Ihr wisst, was zu tun ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532782&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13c27d9e-f20c-4a51-ad2e-1b75d26f65c9\', \'multiverseId\': 532782}, \'multiverseid\': 532782}, {\'name\': \'Extraer la chispa\', \'text\': \'Exilia el permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana susurró a la poca conciencia de sí mismas que quedaba en Oketra y Bontu:\\n—Ustedes son las diosas. Él es el usurpador. Ya saben qué hacer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ea79df-7648-425f-b886-9f03ea3d29c9\', \'multiverseId\': 532993}, \'multiverseid\': 532993}, {\'name\': "Suppression d\'étincelle", \'text\': \'Exilez un permanent ciblé avec une valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 4.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Liliana murmura au peu de conscience qu\'il restait à Oketra et Bontu. « Vous êtes les dieux. C\'est lui l\'imposteur. Vous savez ce que vous avez à faire. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f354db1f-8e23-45e2-b8bd-6d114334eb16\', \'multiverseId\': 533204}, \'multiverseid\': 533204}, {\'name\': \'Descintillazione\', \'text\': \'Esilia un permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sussurrò al barlume di coscienza che rimaneva in Oketra e Bontu. "Voi siete le dee. Lui è l\\\'usurpatore. Sapete cosa fare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4fbf77-91dd-48bd-979a-5b2e10c297b4\', \'multiverseId\': 533415}, \'multiverseid\': 533415}, {\'name\': \'灯の燼滅\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が４以上のパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'オケチラとバントゥにどれほど自意識が残っているか分からないまま、リリアナはこう囁いた。「あなたたちは本当の神でしょ。あれは簒奪者よ。どうするべきか分かるわね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa27ca5-5eac-48dc-adaa-04c16f489841\', \'multiverseId\': 533626}, \'multiverseid\': 533626}, {\'name\': \'Descentelhar\', \'text\': \'Exile a permanente alvo com valor de mana igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Liliana sussurrou ao restante de consciência em Bontu e Oketra. "Vocês são as deusas. Ele é o usurpador. Vocês sabem o que fazer."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'218cc6bb-3093-4a3b-8824-2e76b9119dc2\', \'multiverseId\': 533837}, \'multiverseid\': 533837}, {\'name\': \'Лишение Искры\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевой перманент с мановой ценностью 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Вы — боги, — шептала Лилиана тем неясным остаткам сознания, что сохранили Бонту и Окетра. — Он — узурпатор. Вы знаете, что делать».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541977dd-ecbd-4df9-9118-0288ec3bdc46\', \'multiverseId\': 534048}, \'multiverseid\': 534048}, {\'name\': \'灭除火花\', \'text\': \'放逐目标法术力值等于或大于4的永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'莉莲娜向欧柯塔和芭图尚存的意识低语道：「你们才是神明。他不过是篡位者。你们清楚该怎么办。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd174a71-913a-4094-abf6-7df98aab954d\', \'multiverseId\': 534259}, \'multiverseid\': 534259}, {\'name\': \'滅除火花\', \'text\': \'放逐目標魔法力值等於或大於4的永久物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'莉蓮娜向歐柯塔和芭圖尚存的意識低語道：「你們才是神明。他不過是篡位者。你們清楚該怎麼辦。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'282b22e0-2f18-4668-b65d-d445ea1c8dec\', \'multiverseId\': 534470}, \'multiverseid\': 534470}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galea, Entzünderin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nDu kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Aura- und Ausrüstung-Zaubersprüche oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken. Wenn du auf diese Weise einen Ausrüstung-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält er „Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, lege sie an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af196042-0a14-480d-bf01-afae02c33cfb\', \'multiverseId\': 531593}, \'multiverseid\': 531593}, {\'name\': \'Galea, Colmaesperanzas\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nPuedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos de Aura y de Equipo desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Cuando lances un hechizo de Equipo de esta manera, gana "Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, anéxalo a la criatura objetivo que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'302bbc19-674e-4572-bf67-375721fbe65f\', \'multiverseId\': 531649}, \'multiverseid\': 531649}, {\'name\': "Galea, embraseuse d\'espoir", \'text\': "Vigilance\\nVous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts d\'aura et d\'équipement depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque. Quand vous lancez un sort d\'équipement de cette manière, il acquiert « Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-le à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531705&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd44e4dc-12d8-4692-9b73-d686fb9ebb44\', \'multiverseId\': 531705}, \'multiverseid\': 531705}, {\'name\': \'Galea, Scintilla di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nPuoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi lanciare magie Aura ed Equipaggiamento dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Quando lanci una magia Equipaggiamento in questo modo, ha "Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c3f88ef-821e-4f11-ac53-e040945b28f9\', \'multiverseId\': 531761}, \'multiverseid\': 531761}, {\'name\': \'希望の焚きつけ屋、ゲイリア\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にありオーラや装備品である呪文を唱えてもよい。あなたがこれにより装備品・呪文を唱えたとき、それは「この装備品が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d293957c-0ec1-4801-8bc0-6815ae75db15\', \'multiverseId\': 531817}, \'multiverseid\': 531817}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galea, Entzünderin der Hoffnung\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nDu kannst dir zu jedem Zeitpunkt die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek anschauen.\\nDu kannst Aura- und Ausrüstung-Zaubersprüche oben von deiner Bibliothek wirken. Wenn du auf diese Weise einen Ausrüstung-Zauberspruch wirkst, erhält er „Wenn diese Ausrüstung ins Spiel kommt, lege sie an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e436d770-93d1-412a-a739-630fb5a56a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 531834}, \'multiverseid\': 531834}, {\'name\': \'Galea, Colmaesperanzas\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nPuedes mirar la primera carta de tu biblioteca en cualquier momento.\\nPuedes lanzar hechizos de Aura y de Equipo desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Cuando lances un hechizo de Equipo de esta manera, gana "Cuando este Equipo entre al campo de batalla, anéxalo a la criatura objetivo que controlas".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Caballero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b461d0d-6c13-401d-ae39-3bb1d2b63786\', \'multiverseId\': 531838}, \'multiverseid\': 531838}, {\'name\': "Galea, embraseuse d\'espoir", \'text\': "Vigilance\\nVous pouvez regarder la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque à tout moment.\\nVous pouvez lancer les sorts d\'aura et d\'équipement depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque. Quand vous lancez un sort d\'équipement de cette manière, il acquiert « Quand cet équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille, attachez-le à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : elfe et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531842&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0db98dff-f9d7-4954-8c96-5c9adcb0c820\', \'multiverseId\': 531842}, \'multiverseid\': 531842}, {\'name\': \'Galea, Scintilla di Speranza\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nPuoi guardare la prima carta del tuo grimorio in qualsiasi momento.\\nPuoi lanciare magie Aura ed Equipaggiamento dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Quando lanci una magia Equipaggiamento in questo modo, ha "Quando questo Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia, assegnalo a una creatura bersaglio che controlli".\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Cavaliere Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b57438-ae87-4be5-b1b5-7211bcd17bad\', \'multiverseId\': 531846}, \'multiverseid\': 531846}, {\'name\': \'希望の焚きつけ屋、ゲイリア\', \'text\': \'警戒\\nあなたはいつでもあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見てよい。\\nあなたはあなたのライブラリーの一番上にありオーラや装備品である呪文を唱えてもよい。あなたがこれにより装備品・呪文を唱えたとき、それは「この装備品が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4de4a2-5804-4acb-9ca2-3db45c2db6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 531850}, \'multiverseid\': 531850}, {\'name\': \'Galea, Avivadora da Esperança\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nVocê pode olhar o card do topo de seu grimório a qualquer momento.\\nVocê pode conjurar mágicas de Aura e Equipamento do topo de seu grimório. Quando você conjura uma mágica de Equipamento dessa forma, ela ganha "Quando este Equipamento entrar no campo de batalha, anexe-o à criatura alvo que você controla".\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Elfo Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dba3eb83-c8a5-4c96-a4f8-a07c99885255\', \'multiverseId\': 531854}, \'multiverseid\': 531854}, {\'name\': \'Галея, Дарующая Надежду\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nВы в любой момент можете посмотреть верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\\nВы можете разыгрывать заклинания Аур и Снаряжения с верха вашей библиотеки. Когда вы таким образом разыгрываете заклинание Снаряжения, оно получает способность «Когда это Снаряжение выходит на поле битвы, прикрепите его к целевому существу под вашим контролем».\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эльф Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66761d2e-d0dc-4205-9cb0-bd48e51e4eca\', \'multiverseId\': 531858}, \'multiverseid\': 531858}, {\'name\': \'燃望者盖莉娅\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n你可以随时检视你的牌库顶牌。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶施放灵气和武具咒语。当你以此法施放武具咒语时，它获得「当此武具进战场时，将它贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～妖精／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a5399b-6716-48c4-8570-afe85da5e3e2\', \'multiverseId\': 531862}, \'multiverseid\': 531862}, {\'name\': \'燃望者蓋莉婭\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n你可以隨時檢視你的牌庫頂牌。\\n你可以從你的牌庫頂施放靈氣和武具咒語。當你以此法施放武具咒語時，它獲得「當此武具進戰場時，將它貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。」\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～妖精／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54b698d5-955a-4f08-9184-a2f733d0f562\', \'multiverseId\': 531866}, \'multiverseid\': 531866}]', '[{\'name\': \'Garruks Aufstand\', \'text\': \'Wenn Garruks Aufstand ins Spiel kommt und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532757&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1bba32-51b8-47a5-89dd-951873b46e15\', \'multiverseId\': 532757}, \'multiverseid\': 532757}, {\'name\': \'Alzamiento de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Alzamiento de Garruk entre al campo de batalla, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, roba una carta.\\nLas criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\\nSiempre que una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76195726-b1f8-468b-b23f-556cf11dfb02\', \'multiverseId\': 532968}, \'multiverseid\': 532968}, {\'name\': \'Soulèvement de Garruk\', \'text\': "Quand le Soulèvement de Garruk arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, piochez une carte.\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec une force supérieure ou égale à 4 arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533179&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2c21ed-b190-4465-9362-5e54f6039037\', \'multiverseId\': 533179}, \'multiverseid\': 533179}, {\'name\': \'Insurrezione di Garruk\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Insurrezione di Garruk entra nel campo di battaglia, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, pesca una carta.\\nLe creature che controlli hanno travolgere.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4 entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a6ca0ce-0225-4b29-8018-73b621eb5846\', \'multiverseId\': 533390}, \'multiverseid\': 533390}, {\'name\': \'ガラクの蜂起\', \'text\': \'ガラクの蜂起が戦場に出たとき、あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\\nパワーが４以上のクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff65950c-4ab4-4316-8d8e-6d151f55b922\', \'multiverseId\': 533601}, \'multiverseid\': 533601}, {\'name\': \'Levante de Garruk\', \'text\': \'Quando Levante de Garruk entrar no campo de batalha, se você controlar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, compre um card.\\nAs criaturas que você controla têm atropelar.\\nToda vez que uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4 entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5f41f57-8454-476d-902b-b95e5c45c6b8\', \'multiverseId\': 533812}, \'multiverseid\': 533812}, {\'name\': \'Бунт Гаррука\', \'text\': \'Когда Бунт Гаррука выходит на поле битвы, если вы контролируете существо с силой не менее 4, возьмите карту.\\nСущества под вашим контролем имеют Пробивной удар.\\nКаждый раз, когда существо с силой 4 или больше выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2615a48-7e6c-43e7-9d25-2977eb1f1674\', \'multiverseId\': 534023}, \'multiverseid\': 534023}, {\'name\': \'贾路的反抗\', \'text\': \'当贾路的反抗进战场时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则抓一张牌。\\n由你操控的生物具有践踏异能。\\n每当一个力量等于或大于4的生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'224dd6e5-9548-482c-aeef-b816644cb481\', \'multiverseId\': 534234}, \'multiverseid\': 534234}, {\'name\': \'賈路的反抗\', \'text\': \'當賈路的反抗進戰場時，若你操控力量等於或大於4的生物，則抽一張牌。\\n由你操控的生物具有踐踏異能。\\n每當一個力量等於或大於4的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62fb9709-3845-4d09-a678-3fe55fb43fb8\', \'multiverseId\': 534445}, \'multiverseid\': 534445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere den Gedankenstein: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist Mana anderes als Möglichkeit, eine Idee, der noch nicht Gestalt gegeben wurde?"\\n—Jhoira, Meisterbastlerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e38e65b8-980f-4fae-a245-83328ef9591f\', \'multiverseId\': 532809}, \'multiverseid\': 532809}, {\'name\': \'Piedra mental\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar la Piedra mental: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué es el maná sino una posibilidad, una idea a la que todavía no se ha dado forma?".\\n—Jhoira, maestra artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9249399-d53e-4d4a-8bdf-33ea187c7fda\', \'multiverseId\': 533020}, \'multiverseid\': 533020}, {\'name\': "Pierre de l\'esprit", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez la Pierre de l\'esprit : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'est-ce que le mana sinon une possibilité, une idée qui n\'a pas encore pris forme ? »\\n—Djoïra, maîtresse artificière", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58a49cc5-1034-4c8d-9cba-14d8635c4a26\', \'multiverseId\': 533231}, \'multiverseid\': 533231}, {\'name\': \'Pietra della Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica la Pietra della Mente: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Cos\\\'è il mana se non una possibilità, un\\\'idea che ancora non ha preso forma?"\\n—Jhoira, maestra artefice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ded81d4-7253-4b9d-9675-afb09fda6304\', \'multiverseId\': 533442}, \'multiverseid\': 533442}, {\'name\': \'精神石\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, 精神石を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはまだ形を成していない発想よ。それが可能性でなければ何だというの？」\\n――練達の工匠、ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39ea6360-016f-41ff-ba7f-686c93b1b7b6\', \'multiverseId\': 533653}, \'multiverseid\': 533653}, {\'name\': \'Pedra da Mente\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Pedra da Mente: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"O que é o mana senão o possível, uma ideia à qual ainda não se deu forma?"\\n— Jhoira, mestre artífice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c635af4-a8b6-4c59-812b-5fe37bad99ef\', \'multiverseId\': 533864}, \'multiverseid\': 533864}, {\'name\': \'Камень Разума\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Камень Разума: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Что есть мана, как не возможность, не идея, еще не обретшая форму?»\\n— Джойра, мастер-механик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06c50cd4-6fef-406c-bd09-6643137cdf00\', \'multiverseId\': 534075}, \'multiverseid\': 534075}, {\'name\': \'心灵石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲心灵石：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「法术力是尚无定形的理念，那这无穷的可能性又是什么？」\\n～神器大师尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f05622-a15a-4aad-ad59-bd7367c77a42\', \'multiverseId\': 534286}, \'multiverseid\': 534286}, {\'name\': \'心靈石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲心靈石：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「魔法力是尚無定形的理念，那這無窮的可能性又是什麼？」\\n～神器大師尤依菈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3aaf398-a52f-4cc4-918a-76dc340af4ae\', \'multiverseId\': 534497}, \'multiverseid\': 534497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedankenwirbel\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und lege dann zwei Karten aus deiner Hand in beliebiger Reihenfolge oben auf deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Das Mizzium-Sphärenfeld trug ihren Geist tief in das Gedankenfeld, in dem man nur die seltensten Genius-Partikel — reifen Früchten gleich — pflücken konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532677&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1c84714-61ed-4b30-8a45-b8e8b8b9f5ff\', \'multiverseId\': 532677}, \'multiverseid\': 532677}, {\'name\': \'Inspiración súbita\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas y luego pon dos cartas de tu mano en la parte superior de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El conjunto de esferas de mízzium hundió su mente en las profundidades del campo del pensamiento, donde solo se pueden encontrar las más raras motas de ingenio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2b4ce1-e05b-4b7d-9975-3ce51506bac0\', \'multiverseId\': 532888}, \'multiverseid\': 532888}, {\'name\': \'Remue-méninges\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes et mettez ensuite deux cartes de votre main au-dessus de votre bibliothèque dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La batterie de sphères de mizzium conduisit son esprit dans les profondeurs du champ mental, où attendent d\'être cueillis les rarissimes éclairs de génie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'639b7d9f-85f4-44a8-b5f4-d1df5ec394d0\', \'multiverseId\': 533099}, \'multiverseid\': 533099}, {\'name\': \'Tempesta Cerebrale\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi metti due carte dalla tua mano in cima al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "L\'arsenale delle sfere di Mizzium fece volare i suoi pensieri lontano, in un luogo dove solo i granelli più rari della ricchezza d\'ingegno possono essere estirpati.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a518cb2-22fd-46ae-860c-f05404114f3c\', \'multiverseId\': 533310}, \'multiverseid\': 533310}, {\'name\': \'渦まく知識\', \'text\': \'カード３枚を引く。その後、あなたの手札にあるカード２枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番上に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'あるかないかの光明を求め、彼女の精神はミジウム球配列によって思考場の深みへと誘われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da8dafdd-b696-43e2-91b9-62cf40b6d9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 533521}, \'multiverseid\': 533521}, {\'name\': \'Tempestade Cerebral\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards. Depois, coloque dois cards de sua mão no topo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A matriz de mizzium-esfera levou sua mente às profundezas do campo das ideias, de onde somente as partículas mais raras de genialidade podem ser colhidas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b10f440-b2c1-4d3e-a61d-f22a963c30e7\', \'multiverseId\': 533732}, \'multiverseid\': 533732}, {\'name\': \'Мозговой Штурм\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты, затем положите две карты из вашей руки на верх вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Кольцо из миззиевых сфер заставило ее разум погрузиться в бездны поля мыслей, где можно было выловить редчайшие частицы гениальности.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ae2975-7d55-4c35-927e-dab8d0c0761d\', \'multiverseId\': 533943}, \'multiverseid\': 533943}, {\'name\': \'脑力激荡\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后将两张牌从你手上以任意顺序置于你的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'整排的米捷球助她的心灵深探思想领域，寻访其间智慧灵光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487a1679-4314-4aea-90a0-47918afdee9b\', \'multiverseId\': 534154}, \'multiverseid\': 534154}, {\'name\': \'腦力激盪\', \'text\': \'抽三張牌，然後將兩張牌從你手上以任意順序置於你的牌庫頂。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'整排的米捷球助她的心靈深探思想領域，尋訪其間智慧靈光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ae04a0-2402-4f48-bcb5-3cd89faab07a\', \'multiverseId\': 534365}, \'multiverseid\': 534365}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihende Heide\', \'text\': \'Die Gedeihende Heide kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Heide ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Weiß.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Blüte der Wildblumen richtet sich hier nicht nach den Jahreszeiten, sondern nach den Gezeiten der Magie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ab95e1d-32a9-42fe-96fc-73c5746789da\', \'multiverseId\': 532867}, \'multiverseid\': 532867}, {\'name\': \'Brezal floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Brezal floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Brezal floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea blanco.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las flores salvajes de aquí no florecen según las estaciones, sino según los altibajos y el flujo de la magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d3739c-0063-4337-b5c0-726f40859023\', \'multiverseId\': 533078}, \'multiverseid\': 533078}, {\'name\': \'Prairie prospère\', \'text\': \'La Prairie prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où la Prairie prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le blanc.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Ici, les fleurs sauvages s\'épanouissent non pas au gré des saisons mais au gré des flux de magie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533289&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2728b609-925c-420a-aee1-48941ffaa16b\', \'multiverseId\': 533289}, \'multiverseid\': 533289}, {\'name\': \'Brughiera Florida\', \'text\': \'La Brughiera Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Brughiera Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal bianco.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I fiori selvatici qui non sbocciano in base alle stagioni, ma seguendo il fluire della magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'125623c2-37b1-414a-a1d8-6a389e579e08\', \'multiverseId\': 533500}, \'multiverseid\': 533500}, {\'name\': \'興隆する荒野\', \'text\': \'興隆する荒野はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する荒野が戦場に出るに際し、白でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{W}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'季節ではなく魔法の干満に従って野生の花が咲く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dc1d653-c7d9-4bc7-8c3d-d2b3fab968c9\', \'multiverseId\': 533711}, \'multiverseid\': 533711}, {\'name\': \'Charneca Vicejante\', \'text\': \'Charneca Vicejante entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nConforme Charneca Vicejante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor, exceto branco.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou um mana da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As flores silvestres aqui desabrocham não com a estação, mas com os fluxos de magia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3024ffa6-9592-45ea-8a66-784d19b98503\', \'multiverseId\': 533922}, \'multiverseid\': 533922}, {\'name\': \'Цветущая Пустошь\', \'text\': \'Цветущая Пустошь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nПри выходе Цветущей Пустоши на поле битвы выберите любой цвет, кроме белого.\\n{T}: добавьте {W} или одну ману выбранного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Дикие цветы здесь расцветают не по сезонам, а с приливами и отливами магии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c889ea4-4737-4ab5-b8a2-de35b04d94be\', \'multiverseId\': 534133}, \'multiverseid\': 534133}, {\'name\': \'兴旺荒地\', \'text\': \'兴旺荒地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺荒地进战场时，选择一种白色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{W}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'驱使这片野花绽放的，并非季节更替，而是魔力起伏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8084d56f-7de3-4944-bcce-2eec0e375a59\', \'multiverseId\': 534344}, \'multiverseid\': 534344}, {\'name\': \'興旺荒地\', \'text\': \'興旺荒地須橫置進戰場。\\n於興旺荒地進戰場時，選擇一種白色以外的顏色。\\n{T}：加{W}或一點所選顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'驅使這片野花綻放的，並非季節更替，而是魔力起伏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de03e9cf-ff05-4706-9fc6-faeef4250c48\', \'multiverseId\': 534555}, \'multiverseid\': 534555}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihende Insel\', \'text\': \'Die Gedeihende Insel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie die Gedeihende Insel ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Blau.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Wunder der natürlichen Welt in einem einzigen atemberaubenden Mikrokosmos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4848f2-0a73-47cb-ba38-8c112043437f\', \'multiverseId\': 532868}, \'multiverseid\': 532868}, {\'name\': \'Islote floreciente\', \'text\': \'El Islote floreciente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nEn cuanto el Islote floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea azul.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las maravillas del mundo natural en un microcosmos asombroso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96e322cc-4e86-40e7-8470-3988a2a6f411\', \'multiverseId\': 533079}, \'multiverseid\': 533079}, {\'name\': \'Île prospère\', \'text\': "L\'Île prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où l\'Île prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le bleu.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Toutes les merveilles de la nature dans un microcosme à couper le souffle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1564082-aae0-4f4e-82e7-e568c471f689\', \'multiverseId\': 533290}, \'multiverseid\': 533290}, {\'name\': \'Isola Florida\', \'text\': "L\'Isola Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre l\'Isola Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal blu.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o un mana del colore scelto.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Tutte le meraviglie della natura in un microcosmo mozzafiato.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10cf9396-1e4b-4561-83d5-086fd93af17c\', \'multiverseId\': 533501}, \'multiverseid\': 533501}, {\'name\': \'興隆する島嶼\', \'text\': \'興隆する島嶼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する島嶼が戦場に出るに際し、青でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{U}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'自然界のあらゆる驚異がこの美しく小さな世界に詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62061bf9-d089-4ea2-960e-ac5e56bdda67\', \'multiverseId\': 533712}, \'multiverseid\': 533712}, {\'name\': \'Ilha Vicejante\', \'text\': \'Ilha Vicejante entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nConforme Ilha Vicejante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor, exceto azul.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou um mana da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as maravilhas do mundo natural num único microcosmo de tirar o fôlego.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1013773d-9c62-4dc5-9502-b5de4eb6f544\', \'multiverseId\': 533923}, \'multiverseid\': 533923}, {\'name\': \'Цветущий Островок\', \'text\': \'Цветущий Островок выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nПри выходе Цветущего Островка на поле битвы выберите любой цвет, кроме синего.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или одну ману выбранного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Все чудеса мира природы в одном захватывающем дух микрокосмосе.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9256f28-1ccd-4058-87a5-4930934d1fef\', \'multiverseId\': 534134}, \'multiverseid\': 534134}, {\'name\': \'兴旺岛屿\', \'text\': \'兴旺岛屿须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺岛屿进战场时，选择一种蓝色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{U}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'于精妙微观世界中，尽览自然伟大奇迹。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44cfe7b5-8e50-4c65-8d2c-a9bf22a43328\', \'multiverseId\': 534345}, \'multiverseid\': 534345}, {\'name\': \'興旺島嶼\', \'text\': \'興旺島嶼須橫置進戰場。\\n於興旺島嶼進戰場時，選擇一種藍色以外的顏色。\\n{T}：加{U}或一點所選顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'於精妙微觀世界中，盡覽自然偉大奇跡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d95e888-0aa0-4ebb-bbd0-f17d9cd96099\', \'multiverseId\': 534556}, \'multiverseid\': 534556}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gedeihender Hain\', \'text\': \'Der Gedeihende Hain kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie der Gedeihende Hain ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Grün.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Menschlichen Blicken entzogen, schwirren Vögel in einem verborgenen Paradies zwischen farbenfrohen Blüten umher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99494cea-0c71-4baf-9324-717a3a69c5d1\', \'multiverseId\': 532866}, \'multiverseid\': 532866}, {\'name\': \'Arboleda floreciente\', \'text\': \'La Arboleda floreciente entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nEn cuanto la Arboleda floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea verde.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o un maná del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Lejos de la mirada de los humanos, los pájaros revolotean entre flores en un paraíso oculto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf061d6-28d2-4d9f-966b-4352073e8709\', \'multiverseId\': 533077}, \'multiverseid\': 533077}, {\'name\': \'Bosquet prospère\', \'text\': \'Le Bosquet prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nAu moment où le Bosquet prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le vert.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "À l\'abri des regards humains, les oiseaux papillonnent entre les fleurs luxuriantes d\'un paradis caché.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533288&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9968d66a-7c90-4830-8cf4-1289ad460c85\', \'multiverseId\': 533288}, \'multiverseid\': 533288}, {\'name\': \'Boschetto Florido\', \'text\': \'Il Boschetto Florido entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nMentre il Boschetto Florido entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal verde.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o un mana del colore scelto.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Al riparo da occhi umani, gli uccellini guizzano tra boccioli dai colori vivaci in un paradiso nascosto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02562170-d506-4448-86d1-92e0d93ed93c\', \'multiverseId\': 533499}, \'multiverseid\': 533499}, {\'name\': \'興隆する木立\', \'text\': \'興隆する木立はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する木立が戦場に出るに際し、緑でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{G}か、その選ばれた色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'人の目に触れないこの知られざる楽園で、鳥たちは鮮やかな花々の間を飛び交っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221ae389-b11a-4fb8-87dd-1acecf53582b\', \'multiverseId\': 533710}, \'multiverseid\': 533710}, {\'name\': \'Bosque Vicejante\', \'text\': \'Bosque Vicejante entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nConforme Bosque Vicejante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor, exceto verde.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou um mana da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Longe de olhos humanos, os pássaros esvoaçam em meio a flores exuberantes num paraíso oculto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ac2a127-06be-466e-abbe-8152af229861\', \'multiverseId\': 533921}, \'multiverseid\': 533921}, {\'name\': \'Цветущая Роща\', \'text\': \'Цветущая Роща выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nПри выходе Цветущей Рощи на поле битвы выберите любой цвет, кроме зеленого.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или одну ману выбранного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Вдали от людских глаз птицы порхают между яркими цветами в укрытом от всех раю.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a028db96-e2d8-4540-9098-3dd2cc98aaab\', \'multiverseId\': 534132}, \'multiverseid\': 534132}, {\'name\': \'兴旺树丛\', \'text\': \'兴旺树丛须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺树丛进战场时，选择一种绿色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{G}或一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人类视界之外还有一片隐蔽乐土，此处鸟语花香，绿意盎然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f134cd-94a8-453f-8e96-61c01a71b334\', \'multiverseId\': 534343}, \'multiverseid\': 534343}, {\'name\': \'興旺樹叢\', \'text\': \'興旺樹叢須橫置進戰場。\\n於興旺樹叢進戰場時，選擇一種綠色以外的顏色。\\n{T}：加{G}或一點所選顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'人類視界之外還有一片隱蔽樂土，此處鳥語花香，綠意盎然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3371bde-bb89-471e-8d7b-82ce84bb6aa7\', \'multiverseId\': 534554}, \'multiverseid\': 534554}]', "[{'name': 'Gedeihendes Moor', 'text': 'Das Gedeihende Moor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nSowie das Gedeihende Moor ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe außer Schwarz.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder ein Mana der bestimmten Farbe.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Schönheit zeigt sich denen, die sie erkennen können, an merkwürdigen Orten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532869&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec732a22-5845-4654-9196-8d385d42c26f', 'multiverseId': 532869}, 'multiverseid': 532869}, {'name': 'Páramo floreciente', 'text': 'El Páramo floreciente entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nEn cuanto el Páramo floreciente entre al campo de batalla, elige un color que no sea negro.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o un maná del color elegido.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los que ven la belleza son capaces de vislumbrarla en lugares extraños.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533080&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'adeadeab-a143-4b25-979a-44fe34fd721e', 'multiverseId': 533080}, 'multiverseid': 533080}, {'name': 'Lande prospère', 'text': 'La Lande prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nAu moment où la Lande prospère arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur autre que le noir.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou un mana de la couleur choisie.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La beauté perle dans des endroits étranges pour ceux qui peuvent la voir.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533291&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cdfff38-7131-42eb-8dd1-d943eead2d0f', 'multiverseId': 533291}, 'multiverseid': 533291}, {'name': 'Landa Florida', 'text': 'La Landa Florida entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nMentre la Landa Florida entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore diverso dal nero.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o un mana del colore scelto.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'La bellezza si manifesta in luoghi insoliti per chi ha occhi per vederla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533502&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7ee7a93-2460-4de0-bc01-3adb449e9e09', 'multiverseId': 533502}, 'multiverseid': 533502}, {'name': '興隆する湿地帯', 'text': '興隆する湿地帯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n興隆する湿地帯が戦場に出るに際し、黒でない色１色を選ぶ。\\n{T}：{B}か、その選ばれた色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '奇妙な場所にも美は存在し、見る目を持つものを楽しませる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533713&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '686da6a5-d0b6-4887-8424-47582e56e4a4', 'multiverseId': 533713}, 'multiverseid': 533713}, {'name': 'Charco Vicejante', 'text': 'Charco Vicejante entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nConforme Charco Vicejante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor, exceto preto.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou um mana da cor escolhida.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Para quem tem olhos para vê-la, a beleza se mostra em lugares estranhos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533924&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c94ea93-608e-453e-9e27-68ef6da9faf1', 'multiverseId': 533924}, 'multiverseid': 533924}, {'name': 'Цветущая Топь', 'text': 'Цветущая Топь выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nПри выходе Цветущей Топи на поле битвы выберите любой цвет, кроме черного.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или одну ману выбранного цвета.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Для тех, кто способен видеть, красота проявляется в самых странных местах.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534135&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d910f73-ac52-4dfd-b942-e41a61838636', 'multiverseId': 534135}, 'multiverseid': 534135}, {'name': '兴旺湿地', 'text': '兴旺湿地须横置进战场。\\n于兴旺湿地进战场时，选择一种黑色以外的颜色。\\n{T}：加{B}或一点所选颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '此地美景尽藏奇异之处，唯眼光独到者方能得见。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534346&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94dea9fd-34ba-4795-85fa-32b25866205d', 'multiverseId': 534346}, 'multiverseid': 534346}, {'name': '興旺濕地', 'text': '興旺濕地須橫置進戰場。\\n於興旺濕地進戰場時，選擇一種黑色以外的顏色。\\n{T}：加{B}或一點所選顏色的魔法力。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '此地美景盡藏奇異之處，唯眼光獨到者方能得見。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534557&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e535c8eb-7df1-4bac-aa61-456c7da4e8cb', 'multiverseId': 534557}, 'multiverseid': 534557}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gefangen im Mond\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, ein Land oder einen Planeswalker\\nDie verzauberte bleibende Karte ist ein farbloses Land mit „{T}: Erzeuge {C}" und verliert alle anderen Kartentypen und Fähigkeiten.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Nur ein Ort war groß genug, um als Gefängnis für Emrakul zu dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532683&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8db313ed-1fd1-4048-8d49-198d82741e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 532683}, \'multiverseid\': 532683}, {\'name\': \'Prisión lunar\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura, tierra o planeswalker.\\nEl permanente encantado es una tierra incolora con "{T}: Agrega {C}" y pierde todos sus otros tipos de carta y habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Solo una prisión era lo suficientemente grande para Emrakul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0aa29e-3692-4589-9c36-38dbe292c0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 532894}, \'multiverseid\': 532894}, {\'name\': \'Prisonnier de la lune\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature, terrain ou planeswalker\\nLe permanent enchanté est un terrain incolore avec « {T} : Ajoutez {C} » et perd tous ses autres types de carte et capacités.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'y avait qu\'un seul endroit assez grand pour contenir Emrakul.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c4cedc-0449-4f61-a39b-5849dd994abf\', \'multiverseId\': 533105}, \'multiverseid\': 533105}, {\'name\': \'Imprigionare nella Luna\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura, terra o planeswalker\\nIl permanente incantato è una terra incolore con "{T}: Aggiungi {C}" e perde tutti gli altri tipi di carta e le altre abilità.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "C\'era solo un posto abbastanza grande da contenere Emrakul.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ea3b38-2c21-4660-8d88-47083d08c25a\', \'multiverseId\': 533316}, \'multiverseid\': 533316}, {\'name\': \'月への封印\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャーか土地かプレインズウォーカー）\\nエンチャントしているパーマネントは「{T}：{C}を加える。」を持つ無色の土地であり、それ以外のすべてのカード・タイプとすべての能力を失う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'エムラクールを閉じ込められるほど大きなものは一つしかなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80a9b53b-9e6e-4bb7-97b7-a1774a84ea37\', \'multiverseId\': 533527}, \'multiverseid\': 533527}, {\'name\': \'Aprisionados na Lua\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura, terreno ou planeswalker\\nA permanente encantada é um terreno incolor com "{T}: Adicione {C}" e perde todos os outros tipos de card e habilidades.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Somente uma câmara era grande o suficiente para conter Emrakul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef90db3e-005a-489a-ad72-cecd4f455f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 533738}, \'multiverseid\': 533738}, {\'name\': \'Лунная Темница\', \'text\': "Зачаровать существо, землю или planeswalker\'а\\nЗачарованный перманент является бесцветной землей со способностью «{T}: добавьте {C}» и теряет все другие типы карты и способности.", \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Лишь одна темница способна вместить Эмракул.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ca32487-e91a-41e1-a018-1700f6b4b243\', \'multiverseId\': 533949}, \'multiverseid\': 533949}, {\'name\': \'禁锢于月\', \'text\': \'结附于生物，地或鹏洛客\\n所结附的永久物是无色地，且具有「{T}：加{C}」，并失去所有其他牌张类别和异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'只有一个天牢大到足以囚困伊莫库。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f62a6bd-d010-4508-9f5b-0155c4c285e0\', \'multiverseId\': 534160}, \'multiverseid\': 534160}, {\'name\': \'禁錮於月\', \'text\': \'結附於生物，地或鵬洛客\\n所結附的永久物是無色地，且具有「{T}：加{C}」，並失去所有其他牌張類別和異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'只有一個天牢大到足以囚困伊莫庫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51b25abc-2666-4c06-b79f-5876f63ce8f8\', \'multiverseId\': 534371}, \'multiverseid\': 534371}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geflutete Ebene\', \'text\': \'Die Geflutete Ebene kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere die Geflutete Ebene: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene- oder Insel-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'588b07ed-8eef-4f88-bff4-047b4fbac0c1\', \'multiverseId\': 532835}, \'multiverseid\': 532835}, {\'name\': \'Llanura anegada\', \'text\': \'La Llanura anegada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}, sacrificar la Llanura anegada: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura o Isla, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ffea58-933a-4166-99fd-4a154f6f373d\', \'multiverseId\': 533046}, \'multiverseid\': 533046}, {\'name\': \'Plaine inondée\', \'text\': "La Plaine inondée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Plaine inondée : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine ou d\'île, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533257&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd24d26-9fee-4916-8bf9-bed6a19e5915\', \'multiverseId\': 533257}, \'multiverseid\': 533257}, {\'name\': \'Pianura Alluvionale\', \'text\': \'La Pianura Alluvionale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Pianura Alluvionale: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura o Isola, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4570fe8-9d92-4bb8-9c0c-e697126445e7\', \'multiverseId\': 533468}, \'multiverseid\': 533468}, {\'name\': \'氾濫原\', \'text\': \'氾濫原はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 氾濫原を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから平地か島であるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addef7a0-d5c1-436e-b272-ecfe88739838\', \'multiverseId\': 533679}, \'multiverseid\': 533679}, {\'name\': \'Planície Alagadiça\', \'text\': \'Planície Alagadiça entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}, sacrifique Planície Alagadiça: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície ou Ilha, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27e475d2-d222-4d0c-9b30-00fa4579a3a7\', \'multiverseId\': 533890}, \'multiverseid\': 533890}, {\'name\': \'Речная Пойма\', \'text\': \'Речная Пойма выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Речную Пойму: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Равнины или Острова, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d689d437-e8c5-4040-b58b-76028f169b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 534101}, \'multiverseid\': 534101}, {\'name\': \'洪泛平原\', \'text\': \'洪泛平原须横置进战场。\\n{T}，牺牲洪泛平原：从你的牌库中搜寻一张平原或海岛牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85134cd9-e7a6-4296-921e-7b60b870a9df\', \'multiverseId\': 534312}, \'multiverseid\': 534312}, {\'name\': \'洪泛平原\', \'text\': \'洪泛平原須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}，犧牲洪泛平原：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張平原或海島牌，將之放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbc2bdee-af4d-4d58-9b49-f0f32663c4db\', \'multiverseId\': 534523}, \'multiverseid\': 534523}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geflügelte Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit und Abwehr {4}. (Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {4}.)\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Lass dich davontragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fd42bdd-631b-4cbb-a39f-d2f245b74cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 531979}, \'multiverseid\': 531979}, {\'name\': \'Botas aladas\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de volar y rebatir {4}. (Siempre que la criatura equipada sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {4}.)\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Déjate llevar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dad77976-2932-4a40-88b0-68221607036e\', \'multiverseId\': 532033}, \'multiverseid\': 532033}, {\'name\': \'Bottes ailées\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a le vol et parade {4}. (À chaque fois que la créature équipée devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {4}.)\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Laissez-vous emporter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83268972-9b9e-4c9e-884a-ceb38d383292\', \'multiverseId\': 532087}, \'multiverseid\': 532087}, {\'name\': \'Stivali Alati\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha volare ed egida {4}. (Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {4}.)\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Lasciati trasportare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532141&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e2f142-9e7a-4968-a61f-ac836dc50f84\', \'multiverseId\': 532141}, \'multiverseid\': 532141}, {\'name\': \'ウィングド・ブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは飛行と護法{4}を持つ。（装備しているクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{4}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'地に足がつかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26bcd38f-d91b-4e59-ab75-ae07c746beb7\', \'multiverseId\': 532195}, \'multiverseid\': 532195}, {\'name\': \'Botas Aladas\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem voar e salvaguarda {4}. (Toda vez que a criatura equipada se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {4}.)\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Deixe-se levar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec723742-8d89-49c4-bd70-22a546011e13\', \'multiverseId\': 532249}, \'multiverseid\': 532249}, {\'name\': \'Крылатые Сапоги\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Полет и Оберег {4}. (Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, отмените то заклинание или способность, если тот игрок не заплатит {4}.)\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Пусть тебя унесет...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0568ea1-2e97-4146-8bb2-39f3e8360731\', \'multiverseId\': 532303}, \'multiverseid\': 532303}, {\'name\': \'飞翼靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有飞行与守护{4}。（每当佩带此武具的生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{4}，否则反击之。）\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'随风飞舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d771a9-22d8-45a4-9fc8-5553bfb4e355\', \'multiverseId\': 532357}, \'multiverseid\': 532357}, {\'name\': \'飛翼靴\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有飛行與守護{4}。（每當佩帶此武具的生物成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，除非該玩家支付{4}，否則反擊之。）\\n佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'隨風飛舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9298e942-07e2-46a1-bae8-88b67eab3a98\', \'multiverseId\': 532411}, \'multiverseid\': 532411}]', "[{'name': 'Geflügelte Stiefel', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit und Abwehr {4}.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531565&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b8e7a30-70bc-4ea0-b513-c8f7ab0ccf14', 'multiverseId': 531565}, 'multiverseid': 531565}, {'name': 'Botas aladas', 'text': 'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de volar y rebatir {4}.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531621&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07f07556-3d40-4d28-b75b-d3ed00d120ae', 'multiverseId': 531621}, 'multiverseid': 531621}, {'name': 'Bottes ailées', 'text': 'La créature équipée a le vol et parade {4}.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531677&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a871d381-1554-4ab4-b234-98930991ef55', 'multiverseId': 531677}, 'multiverseid': 531677}, {'name': 'Stivali Alati', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata ha volare ed egida {4}.\\nEquipaggiare {1}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531733&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c43c53d3-014a-4f80-9b82-13bd1e1c221f', 'multiverseId': 531733}, 'multiverseid': 531733}, {'name': 'ウィングド・ブーツ', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは飛行と護法{4}を持つ。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531789&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a1607986-460f-4d23-92af-b7d77dac6d57', 'multiverseId': 531789}, 'multiverseid': 531789}]", "[{'name': 'Gehirn extrahieren', 'text': 'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl bestimmt X Karten auf seiner Hand. Schaue dir die Karten an. Du kannst davon einen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Kein Gedanke ist so saftig wie ein Geheimnis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532005&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e808e35-8583-49f7-80c5-04b04aa3fbed', 'multiverseId': 532005}, 'multiverseid': 532005}, {'name': 'Extraer cerebro', 'text': 'El oponente objetivo elige X cartas de su mano. Mira esas cartas. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'No hay pensamiento más suculento que un secreto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532059&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56c2c120-babb-4abe-846c-9347a362f353', 'multiverseId': 532059}, 'multiverseid': 532059}, {'name': 'Extraction de cerveau', 'text': 'Un adversaire ciblé choisit X cartes de sa main. Regardez ces cartes. Vous pouvez lancer un sort parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les secrets sont les plus délicieuses des pensées.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532113&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fe1ed73d-fb77-4286-928c-77fd34594898', 'multiverseId': 532113}, 'multiverseid': 532113}, {'name': 'Estrarre Cervello', 'text': 'Un avversario bersaglio sceglie X carte dalla sua mano. Guarda quelle carte. Puoi lanciare una magia scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Nessun pensiero è succulento quanto un segreto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532167&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15209a80-1612-4161-8dc2-bf566d0c620f', 'multiverseId': 532167}, 'multiverseid': 532167}, {'name': '脳髄引き抜き', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にあるカードＸ枚を選ぶ。あなたはそれらのカードを見る。あなたはその中から呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '秘密ほどそそる思考はない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532221&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c925c2be-20d1-4f8a-a6dd-9265d6be6f55', 'multiverseId': 532221}, 'multiverseid': 532221}, {'name': 'Extrair Cérebro', 'text': 'O oponente alvo escolhe X cards da própria mão. Olhe aqueles cards. Você pode conjurar uma mágica dentre eles sem pagar seu custo de mana.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Nenhum pensamento é tão suculento quanto um segredo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532275&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a394cb81-1a29-4405-8812-842c394fdaf9', 'multiverseId': 532275}, 'multiverseid': 532275}, {'name': 'Извлечение Мозга', 'text': 'Целевой оппонент выбирает X карт из своей руки. Посмотрите те карты. Вы можете разыграть находящееся среди них заклинание без уплаты его мана-стоимости.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Ни одна мысль не бывает такой сочной, как секреты.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532329&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '622c26e4-9dfe-449c-9f4c-7578ed321f57', 'multiverseId': 532329}, 'multiverseid': 532329}, {'name': '夺脑', 'text': '目标对手从其手上选择X张牌。你检视这些牌。你可以从其中施放一个咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '没有什么思想能比秘密更鲜美。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532383&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c7520da-721f-4385-a9bd-0d37cd09c0cf', 'multiverseId': 532383}, 'multiverseid': 532383}, {'name': '奪腦', 'text': '目標對手從其手上選擇X張牌。你檢視這些牌。你可以從其中施放一個咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '沒有什麼思想能比秘密更鮮美。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532437&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a01712f3-fe25-4437-9c32-450af860aaca', 'multiverseId': 532437}, 'multiverseid': 532437}]", "[{'name': 'Gehirn extrahieren', 'text': 'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl bestimmt X Karten auf seiner Hand. Schaue dir die Karten an. Du kannst davon einen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531591&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd738da47-105b-422f-9402-afd155dfc6a3', 'multiverseId': 531591}, 'multiverseid': 531591}, {'name': 'Extraer cerebro', 'text': 'El oponente objetivo elige X cartas de su mano. Mira esas cartas. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531647&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a56b9142-f3bd-44c6-8d12-210af39f193e', 'multiverseId': 531647}, 'multiverseid': 531647}, {'name': 'Extraction de cerveau', 'text': 'Un adversaire ciblé choisit X cartes de sa main. Regardez ces cartes. Vous pouvez lancer un sort parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531703&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8304ce22-e369-45da-8987-ab0fc32dc49a', 'multiverseId': 531703}, 'multiverseid': 531703}, {'name': 'Estrarre Cervello', 'text': 'Un avversario bersaglio sceglie X carte dalla sua mano. Guarda quelle carte. Puoi lanciare una magia scelta tra esse senza pagare il suo costo di mana.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531759&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdf67bfb-061a-4e60-8ab9-f74040f5acb5', 'multiverseId': 531759}, 'multiverseid': 531759}, {'name': '脳髄引き抜き', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にあるカードＸ枚を選ぶ。それらのカードを見る。あなたはそれらのうち呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531815&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ec1c3c1-c6a0-4b7a-bd8d-a0fe7313f0f1', 'multiverseId': 531815}, 'multiverseid': 531815}]", '[{\'name\': \'Geierberg-Sanatorium\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Jeder Spieler zieht eine Karte und wirft dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Land\', \'flavor\': \'Jeder ist willkommen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ed898c2-7b9a-4a71-9b26-57ef50bd890a\', \'multiverseId\': 532839}, \'multiverseid\': 532839}, {\'name\': \'Manicomio de la Cima Geier\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Cada jugador roba una carta y luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Tierra legendaria\', \'flavor\': \'Todos son bienvenidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'358cf2b6-5681-4adb-81b1-d784abbaf725\', \'multiverseId\': 533050}, \'multiverseid\': 533050}, {\'name\': \'Asile de la Chaîne de Geier\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T} : Chaque joueur pioche une carte et se défausse ensuite d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Terrain légendaire\', \'flavor\': \'Tout le monde y est le bienvenu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533261&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1be02f01-944d-4025-b9b6-da451d48954b\', \'multiverseId\': 533261}, \'multiverseid\': 533261}, {\'name\': \'Manicomio delle Alture Geier\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Ogni giocatore pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Terra Leggendaria\', \'flavor\': \'Tutti sono i benvenuti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5e4b83-1225-4127-8eca-e1955281d102\', \'multiverseId\': 533472}, \'multiverseid\': 533472}, {\'name\': \'ガイアー岬の療養所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}：各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'伝説の土地\', \'flavor\': \'どなたでも大歓迎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'390eb4ea-f3d5-4d96-86f8-0c1e1cb776e0\', \'multiverseId\': 533683}, \'multiverseid\': 533683}, {\'name\': \'Sanatório da Cordilheira de Geier\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: Cada jogador compra um card e depois descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Terreno Lendário\', \'flavor\': \'Todos são bem-vindos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9075fe4-2155-41cc-a683-3b45109a5fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 533894}, \'multiverseid\': 533894}, {\'name\': \'Лечебница Гайерской Полосы\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}, {T}: каждый игрок берет карту, затем сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарная Земля\', \'flavor\': \'И тебя вылечат.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c913782-fbd7-4d8d-b2d5-8191e5cdfe74\', \'multiverseId\': 534105}, \'multiverseid\': 534105}, {\'name\': \'基尔山脉疯人院\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：每位牌手抓一张牌，然后各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇地\', \'flavor\': \'来者不拒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27f84d1-cb31-4e56-be55-75ccc30f79f0\', \'multiverseId\': 534316}, \'multiverseid\': 534316}, {\'name\': \'基爾山脈瘋人院\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}：每位玩家抽一張牌，然後各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇地\', \'flavor\': \'來者不拒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534527&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8bf9402-b452-4736-b585-2438bb3611ce\', \'multiverseId\': 534527}, \'multiverseid\': 534527}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geiselnehmerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geiselnehmerin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis die Geiselnehmerin das Spiel verlässt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana eines beliebigen Typs.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532784&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa131701-906b-4f85-8c4f-97fce1747be1\', \'multiverseId\': 532784}, \'multiverseid\': 532784}, {\'name\': \'Secuestradora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Secuestradora entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura o artefacto objetivo hasta que la Secuestradora deje el campo de batalla. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae95da1-0f36-46ba-917d-fcd599c2e185\', \'multiverseId\': 532995}, \'multiverseid\': 532995}, {\'name\': "Preneuse d\'otage", \'text\': "Quand la Preneuse d\'otage arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre cible, créature ou artefact, jusqu\'à ce que la Preneuse d\'otage quitte le champ de bataille. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quel type pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85585797-2753-4044-a3f3-5e66dca547ed\', \'multiverseId\': 533206}, \'multiverseid\': 533206}, {\'name\': \'Sequestratrice di Ostaggi\', \'text\': "Quando la Sequestratrice di Ostaggi entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un altro artefatto o un\'altra creatura bersaglio finché la Sequestratrice di Ostaggi non lascia il campo di battaglia. Puoi lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarla.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82f44d03-98ae-4515-8b24-23ac7e2803c9\', \'multiverseId\': 533417}, \'multiverseid\': 533417}, {\'name\': \'人質取り\', \'text\': \'人質取りが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやアーティファクトのうちこれでない１つを対象とする。人質取りが戦場を離れるまでそれを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a6de74-7bea-4b67-aee0-d419ad462fed\', \'multiverseId\': 533628}, \'multiverseid\': 533628}, {\'name\': \'Tomadora de Reféns\', \'text\': \'Quando Tomadora de Reféns entrar no campo de batalha, exile outra criatura ou artefato alvo até que Tomadora de Reféns deixe o campo de batalha. Você pode conjurar aquele card enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer tipo para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49ecb95d-7fa5-4b91-b8e7-577fba9e1104\', \'multiverseId\': 533839}, \'multiverseid\': 533839}, {\'name\': \'Захватчица Заложников\', \'text\': \'Когда Захватчица Заложников выходит на поле битвы, изгоните другое целевое существо или артефакт до тех пор, пока Захватчица Заложников не покинет поле битвы. Вы можете разыграть ту карту, пока она остается в изгнании, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого типа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'598b5496-c107-4c8e-88b8-4dd8dc46a2de\', \'multiverseId\': 534050}, \'multiverseid\': 534050}, {\'name\': \'人质挟匪\', \'text\': \'当人质挟匪进战场时，放逐另一个目标生物或神器，直到人质挟匪离开战场为止。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放之，且你可以将法术力视同任意种类的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d36d08-578a-4dc3-a5f2-6da43b1d4aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 534261}, \'multiverseid\': 534261}, {\'name\': \'人質挾匪\', \'text\': \'當人質挾匪進戰場時，放逐另一個目標生物或神器，直到人質挾匪離開戰場為止。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以施放之，且你可以將魔法力視同任意種類的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／海盜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3e8bc30-d8db-49e9-b076-83ca73ee2488\', \'multiverseId\': 534472}, \'multiverseid\': 534472}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterross\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn das Geisterross ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis das Geisterross das Spiel verlässt.\\nImmer wenn das Geisterross angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ins Exil geschickten Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Illusion ist. Opfere den Spielstein am Ende des Kampfes.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pferd, Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531563&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bbb0fe-d732-4ae3-afb5-fdc54d222776\', \'multiverseId\': 531563}, \'multiverseid\': 531563}, {\'name\': \'Corcel fantasma\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Corcel fantasma entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura objetivo que controlas hasta que el Corcel fantasma deje el campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que el Corcel fantasma ataque, crea una ficha girada y atacando que es una copia de la criatura exiliada, excepto que es una Ilusión además de sus otros tipos. Sacrifica esa ficha al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión caballo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdc77246-ca7d-4417-a3c3-38cae9b91ad2\', \'multiverseId\': 531619}, \'multiverseid\': 531619}, {\'name\': \'Monture fantôme\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Monture fantôme arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à ce que la Monture fantôme quitte le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Monture fantôme attaque, créez un jeton engagé et attaquant qui est une copie de la créature exilée, excepté que c\'est une illusion en plus de ses autres types. Sacrifiez ce jeton à la fin du combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : cheval et illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531675&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf4b091-b74d-4f28-8d8b-023bf821e657\', \'multiverseId\': 531675}, \'multiverseid\': 531675}, {\'name\': \'Destriero Fantomatico\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando il Destriero Fantomatico entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli finché il Destriero Fantomatico non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il Destriero Fantomatico attacca, crea una pedina TAPpata e attaccante che è una copia della creatura esiliata, tranne che è un\'Illusione in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Sacrifica quella pedina alla fine del combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Cavallo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9748d87e-d41c-44b8-9c6b-370195a42be5\', \'multiverseId\': 531731}, \'multiverseid\': 531731}, {\'name\': \'ファントム・スティード\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nファントム・スティードが戦場に出たとき、これ以外であなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ファントム・スティードが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\\nファントム・スティードが攻撃するたび、それの他のタイプに加えてイリュージョンであることを除きその追放されているクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体を、タップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 馬・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67dbe592-8c62-436a-95d0-7f74feeb93db\', \'multiverseId\': 531787}, \'multiverseid\': 531787}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterross\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn das Geisterross ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil, bis das Geisterross das Spiel verlässt.\\nImmer wenn das Geisterross angreift, erzeuge einen getappten und angreifenden Spielstein, der eine Kopie der ins Exil geschickten Kreatur ist, außer dass er zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Illusion ist. Opfere den Spielstein am Ende des Kampfes.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pferd, Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531977&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65818d01-27f4-4161-9459-2fd5366f114a\', \'multiverseId\': 531977}, \'multiverseid\': 531977}, {\'name\': \'Corcel fantasma\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando el Corcel fantasma entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura objetivo que controlas hasta que el Corcel fantasma deje el campo de batalla.\\nSiempre que el Corcel fantasma ataque, crea una ficha girada y atacando que es una copia de la criatura exiliada, excepto que es una Ilusión además de sus otros tipos. Sacrifica esa ficha al final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión caballo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69101652-1411-401e-bb99-cbdd8ef46411\', \'multiverseId\': 532031}, \'multiverseid\': 532031}, {\'name\': \'Monture fantôme\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Monture fantôme arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre créature ciblée que vous contrôlez jusqu\'à ce que la Monture fantôme quitte le champ de bataille.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Monture fantôme attaque, créez un jeton engagé et attaquant qui est une copie de la créature exilée, excepté que c\'est une illusion en plus de ses autres types. Sacrifiez ce jeton à la fin du combat.", \'type\': \'Créature : cheval et illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6c6976b-8bf5-4638-83d7-301e43d21862\', \'multiverseId\': 532085}, \'multiverseid\': 532085}, {\'name\': \'Destriero Fantomatico\', \'text\': "Lampo\\nQuando il Destriero Fantomatico entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia un\'altra creatura bersaglio che controlli finché il Destriero Fantomatico non lascia il campo di battaglia.\\nOgniqualvolta il Destriero Fantomatico attacca, crea una pedina TAPpata e attaccante che è una copia della creatura esiliata, tranne che è un\'Illusione in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi. Sacrifica quella pedina alla fine del combattimento.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione Cavallo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c39ccec7-15d8-4763-b9e0-8381e3b7644d\', \'multiverseId\': 532139}, \'multiverseid\': 532139}, {\'name\': \'ファントム・スティード\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nファントム・スティードが戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ファントム・スティードが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。\\nファントム・スティードが攻撃するたび、それの他のタイプに加えてイリュージョンであることを除きその追放されているクリーチャーのコピーであるトークン１体を、タップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で生成する。戦闘終了時に、そのトークンを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 馬・イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5583baaa-d94f-4ff2-9b15-47b7e95d0f8f\', \'multiverseId\': 532193}, \'multiverseid\': 532193}, {\'name\': \'Montaria Fantasmagórica\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nQuando Montaria Fantasmagórica entrar no campo de batalha, exile outra criatura alvo que você controla até que Montaria Fantasmagórica deixe o campo de batalha.\\nToda vez que Montaria Fantasmagórica atacar, crie uma ficha virada e atacando que seja uma cópia da criatura exilada, com a exceção de ser uma Ilusão além de seus outros tipos. Sacrifique aquela ficha no final do combate.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Cavalo Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'213d051d-7d6e-4ba6-9537-782f91757f23\', \'multiverseId\': 532247}, \'multiverseid\': 532247}, {\'name\': \'Призрачный Скакун\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nКогда Призрачный Скакун выходит на поле битвы, изгоните другое целевое существо под вашим контролем до тех пор, пока Призрачный Скакун не покинет поле битвы.\\nКаждый раз, когда Призрачный Скакун атакует, создайте одну повернутую и атакующую фишку, являющуюся копией того изгнанного существа, но при этом являющуюся Иллюзией в дополнение к своим другим типам. Пожертвуйте ту фишку в конце боя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лошадь Иллюзия\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca9fb124-64a7-4baa-9dd7-439037ded682\', \'multiverseId\': 532301}, \'multiverseid\': 532301}, {\'name\': \'魅影驹\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当魅影驹进战场时，放逐另一个目标由你操控的生物，直到魅影驹离开战场为止。\\n每当魅影驹攻击时，派出一个已横置且正进行攻击的衍生物，该衍生物为所放逐之生物的复制品，但它额外具有虚影此类别。在战斗结束时，牺牲该衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～马／虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327a9b4b-ff19-4faf-80fd-0ca6643e80db\', \'multiverseId\': 532355}, \'multiverseid\': 532355}, {\'name\': \'魅影駒\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n當魅影駒進戰場時，放逐另一個目標由你操控的生物，直到魅影駒離開戰場為止。\\n每當魅影駒攻擊時，派出一個已橫置且正進行攻擊的衍生物，該衍生物為所放逐之生物的複製品，但它額外具有虛影此類別。在戰鬥結束時，犧牲該衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～馬／虛影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3bf3786-94ac-436f-b6c5-046fa5c0f78c\', \'multiverseId\': 532409}, \'multiverseid\': 532409}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geißel von Valkas\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Geißel von Valkas oder ein anderer Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, fügt sie bzw. er einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Drachen ist, die du kontrollierst.\\n{R}: Die Geißel von Valkas erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532735&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7de80eb-285a-4e8f-b13a-345b32df2494\', \'multiverseId\': 532735}, \'multiverseid\': 532735}, {\'name\': \'Azote de Valkas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Azote de Valkas u otro Dragón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo, donde X es la cantidad de Dragones que controlas.\\n{R}: El Azote de Valkas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffdfc794-123d-44e5-bf2d-b733a52584c8\', \'multiverseId\': 532946}, \'multiverseid\': 532946}, {\'name\': \'Fléau de Valkas\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fléau de Valkas ou qu\'un autre dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, il inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible, X étant le nombre de dragons que vous contrôlez.\\n{R} : Le Fléau de Valkas gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533157&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae5d743f-ca3a-4b6c-9dd6-d775efe9f8c5\', \'multiverseId\': 533157}, \'multiverseid\': 533157}, {\'name\': \'Flagello di Valkas\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Flagello di Valkas o un altro Drago entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio, dove X è il numero di Draghi che controlli.\\n{R}: Il Flagello di Valkas prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adfbfc10-2f9d-4243-9b46-b3fcdba55e87\', \'multiverseId\': 533368}, \'multiverseid\': 533368}, {\'name\': \'ヴァルカスの災い魔\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nヴァルカスの災い魔かこれ以外のドラゴン１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。その戦場に出たクリーチャーはそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているドラゴンの数に等しい。\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、ヴァルカスの災い魔は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06cfa112-a8eb-4000-97e6-399504e5d0ca\', \'multiverseId\': 533579}, \'multiverseid\': 533579}, {\'name\': \'Flagelo de Valkas\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Flagelo de Valkas ou outro Dragão entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, ele causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo, sendo X o número de Dragões que você controla.\\n{R}: Flagelo de Valkas recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7709dd-b26f-4ead-850e-8232b01d73dd\', \'multiverseId\': 533790}, \'multiverseid\': 533790}, {\'name\': \'Бич Валкаса\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Бич Валкаса или другой Дракон выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, он наносит Х повреждений любой цели, где Х — количество Драконов под вашим контролем.\\n{R}: Бич Валкаса получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92196c0a-0e93-4882-a396-a5ebcd48caf0\', \'multiverseId\': 534001}, \'multiverseid\': 534001}, {\'name\': \'伐卡兹祸害\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当伐卡兹祸害或另一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，它对任意一个目标造成X点伤害，X为由你操控的龙数量。\\n{R}：伐卡兹祸害得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'160b1740-43cc-430a-9664-71fd37b930e9\', \'multiverseId\': 534212}, \'multiverseid\': 534212}, {\'name\': \'伐卡兹禍害\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當伐卡茲禍害或另一個龍在你的操控下進戰場時，它對任意一個目標造成X點傷害，X為由你操控的龍數量。\\n{R}：伐卡茲禍害得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'269b0a3a-b4e8-42ef-8861-9299401a3a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 534423}, \'multiverseid\': 534423}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gipfel der Macht\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du davon Zaubersprüche wirken.\\nFalls dieser Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand gewirkt wurde, erzeuge zehn Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ich verlange, soll geschehen."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd490162-ed06-49a0-80d7-cbb99e6faf30\', \'multiverseId\': 532712}, \'multiverseid\': 532712}, {\'name\': \'Cúspide del poder\', \'text\': \'Exilia las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar hechizos de entre ellas.\\nSi este hechizo fue lanzado desde tu mano, agrega diez manás de un color cualquiera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo será como yo lo desee".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532923&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4d1e6d-7ad8-4ac7-a0ba-8b1e7205565c\', \'multiverseId\': 532923}, \'multiverseid\': 532923}, {\'name\': \'Zénith du pouvoir\', \'text\': "Exilez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer des sorts parmi elles.\\nSi ce sort a été lancé depuis votre main, ajoutez dix manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est ma volonté, donc ce sera une réalité. »\\n—Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533134&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'709f6cf6-56fc-45ac-ad00-348275a78447\', \'multiverseId\': 533134}, \'multiverseid\': 533134}, {\'name\': \'Apice del Potere\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime sette carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare magie scelte tra esse.\\nSe questa magia è stata lanciata dalla tua mano, aggiungi dieci mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni mio desiderio si compie."\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a2146d7-a306-486c-ad32-255b493a3c3c\', \'multiverseId\': 533345}, \'multiverseid\': 533345}, {\'name\': \'力の頂点\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはその中から呪文を唱えてもよい。\\nこの呪文があなたの手札から唱えられたなら、好きな色１色のマナ10点を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我が望めば、その通りになる。」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533556&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d391364-6209-4eab-9d4f-8016cd681f31\', \'multiverseId\': 533556}, \'multiverseid\': 533556}, {\'name\': \'Ápice do Poder\', \'text\': \'Exile os sete cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar mágicas dentre eles.\\nSe esta mágica foi conjurada de sua mão, adicione dez manas de uma cor à sua escolha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Como eu desejar, assim será."\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9edc7ef-5905-4eed-b5ed-065c32789313\', \'multiverseId\': 533767}, \'multiverseid\': 533767}, {\'name\': \'Вершина Могущества\', \'text\': \'Изгоните семь верхних карт вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыгрывать находящиеся среди них заклинания.\\nЕсли это заклинание было разыграно из вашей руки, добавьте десять ман любого одного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Как я пожелаю, так и будет».\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3bbebf-dfd6-4ece-b5da-650f5794f324\', \'multiverseId\': 533978}, \'multiverseid\': 533978}, {\'name\': \'无上力量\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的七张牌。直到回合结束，你可以从其中施放咒语。\\n如果此咒语是从你手上施放，则加十点任意颜色的单色法术力。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「吾之所欲，必能成型。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20cbb553-0264-41e3-9bb3-804a37fa685a\', \'multiverseId\': 534189}, \'multiverseid\': 534189}, {\'name\': \'無上力量\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的七張牌。直到回合結束，你可以從其中施放咒語。\\n如果此咒語是從你手上施放，則加十點任意顏色的單色魔法力。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「吾之所欲，必能成型。」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14180c4e-f954-4001-b77c-9ddafecf0951\', \'multiverseId\': 534400}, \'multiverseid\': 534400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glanzgeschliffener Hirsch\', \'text\': \'{3}, opfere den Glanzgeschliffenen Hirsch: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Hirsch\', \'flavor\': \'Von Göttern geschmiedet, um unter Sterblichen zu wandeln.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c34ddd0-c727-49a4-b724-c259b4a0c1a6\', \'multiverseId\': 532798}, \'multiverseid\': 532798}, {\'name\': \'Venado bruñido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrificar el Venado bruñido: Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por manos divinas para deambular por los reinos mortales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08c7c939-53e1-4685-9cbf-2081c0fb41f3\', \'multiverseId\': 533009}, \'multiverseid\': 533009}, {\'name\': \'Cerf bruni\', \'text\': "{3}, sacrifiez le Cerf bruni : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : élan\', \'flavor\': \'Forgé par des mains divines pour sillonner les royaumes des mortels.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca9e557-24c3-4694-ab25-aa6b19c4922a\', \'multiverseId\': 533220}, \'multiverseid\': 533220}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunito\', \'text\': \'{3}, Sacrifica il Cervo Brunito: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forgiato da mani divine per vagare tra i reami mortali.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd92e163-7d68-4789-9769-14057e774df8\', \'multiverseId\': 533431}, \'multiverseid\': 533431}, {\'name\': \'つややかな雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}, つややかな雄鹿を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 大鹿\', \'flavor\': \'定命の者の世界をさまようため、天界の者の手により創られた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b99206-531b-4276-bd7a-07a2ad004550\', \'multiverseId\': 533642}, \'multiverseid\': 533642}, {\'name\': \'Cervo Brunido\', \'text\': \'{3}, sacrifique Cervo Brunido: Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Alce\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado por mãos divinas para vagar pelos reinos mortais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0744f9a3-94ee-4126-a174-96ae50d4abea\', \'multiverseId\': 533853}, \'multiverseid\': 533853}, {\'name\': \'Сверкающий Олень\', \'text\': \'{3}, пожертвуйте Сверкающего Оленя: найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Вапити\', \'flavor\': \'Выкован божественными руками, чтобы ходить по землям смертных.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9e0363-b882-4395-a069-104fabe6b2c0\', \'multiverseId\': 534064}, \'multiverseid\': 534064}, {\'name\': \'光洁雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，牺牲光洁雄鹿：从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'由神明之手铸造，在凡人领域游荡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9a64ac3-adcc-4458-ac35-2e2f7c8d911b\', \'multiverseId\': 534275}, \'multiverseid\': 534275}, {\'name\': \'光潔雄鹿\', \'text\': \'{3}，犧牲光潔雄鹿：從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～麋鹿\', \'flavor\': \'由神明之手鑄造，在凡人領域遊蕩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2dd18f-1c05-4e01-8d89-5606a46b9c73\', \'multiverseId\': 534486}, \'multiverseid\': 534486}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz, ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Solange die Karte im Exil bleibt, kannst du sie anschauen und sie wirken, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana eines beliebigen Typs.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532698&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da95c1c1-3762-4a31-a675-7571fcc0d12a\', \'multiverseId\': 532698}, \'multiverseid\': 532698}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, señor de la opulencia\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando Gonti, señor de la opulencia entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de la biblioteca del oponente objetivo y exilia una de ellas boca abajo. Luego, pon el resto en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Mientras esa carta permanezca exiliada, puedes mirarla, lanzarla y usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67fba833-748d-4ef9-8c4f-b10453a65984\', \'multiverseId\': 532909}, \'multiverseid\': 532909}, {\'name\': "Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé, exilez l\'une d\'elles face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de cette bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez regarder cette carte et la lancer tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quel type pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533120&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15118c74-9af6-495c-a564-c8f3bdab1ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 533120}, \'multiverseid\': 533120}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, Signore del Lusso\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale\\nQuando Gonti, Signore del Lusso entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime quattro carte del grimorio di un avversario bersaglio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo a quel grimorio in ordine casuale. Puoi guardare e lanciare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarla.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Farabutto Eteride\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9350d8e-ff99-4798-be11-ba245ece2e0b\', \'multiverseId\': 533331}, \'multiverseid\': 533331}, {\'name\': \'豪華の王、ゴンティ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n豪華の王、ゴンティが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放する。その後、残りをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれを見てもよく、あなたはその呪文を唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払って唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533542&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6840983-20b5-438e-b9df-4597f25aa18d\', \'multiverseId\': 533542}, \'multiverseid\': 533542}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, Senhor da Opulência\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Gonti, Senhor da Opulência, entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os quatro cards do topo do grimório do oponente alvo, exile um deles com a face voltada para baixo e, em seguida, coloque o restante no fundo daquele grimório em ordem aleatória. Você poderá olhá-lo e conjurá-lo enquanto ele permanecer exilado, e poderá gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer tipo para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Etergênito Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e94457-57ff-4ae6-8fab-ed45493ac97e\', \'multiverseId\': 533753}, \'multiverseid\': 533753}, {\'name\': \'Гонти, Владыка Роскоши\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Гонти, Владыка Роскоши выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите четыре верхние карты библиотеки целевого оппонента, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные карты в низ той библиотеки в случайном порядке. Пока та карта остается в изгнании, вы можете смотреть ее, можете разыграть ее, если это карта заклинания, и можете тратить на разыгрывание того заклинания ману, как если бы это была мана любого типа.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Эфирид Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2e6ca4-2db2-47b9-a67f-651102942fc1\', \'multiverseId\': 533964}, \'multiverseid\': 533964}, {\'name\': \'奢华领主贡提\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当奢华领主贡提进战场时，检视目标对手牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于该牌库底。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以检视并施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意种类的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee19e0f4-6294-45ec-9388-b05dfa8ca1cb\', \'multiverseId\': 534175}, \'multiverseid\': 534175}, {\'name\': \'奢華領主貢提\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n當奢華領主貢提進戰場時，檢視目標對手牌庫頂的四張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於該牌庫底。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以檢視並施放該牌，且你可以將魔法力視同任意種類的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～乙太種／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a08d36c-f0e7-4f76-92ee-bc56ff47ea43\', \'multiverseId\': 534386}, \'multiverseid\': 534386}]', "[{'name': 'Grasland', 'text': 'Das Grasland kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}, opfere das Grasland: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- oder Ebene-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532840&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '62bd47e4-6fdf-41a8-99e6-b55a5904afb3', 'multiverseId': 532840}, 'multiverseid': 532840}, {'name': 'Pradera', 'text': 'La Pradera entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}, sacrificar la Pradera: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque o Llanura, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533051&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52d857e1-ab09-435b-aa2d-ea3bf4f7b8a7', 'multiverseId': 533051}, 'multiverseid': 533051}, {'name': 'Herbages', 'text': 'Les Herbages arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\n{T}, sacrifiez les Herbages : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt ou de plaine, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533262&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8389d3b7-7e49-4cc6-bba1-ca967ab24454', 'multiverseId': 533262}, 'multiverseid': 533262}, {'name': 'Prateria Equatoriale', 'text': 'La Prateria Equatoriale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Prateria Equatoriale: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta o Pianura, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533473&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73bd29d4-aa1a-436d-8b5c-4a29cfbdefa5', 'multiverseId': 533473}, 'multiverseid': 533473}, {'name': '草原', 'text': '草原はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}, 草原を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森か平地であるカード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533684&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fafb0961-3c4a-4bad-8cdd-b900569fdc7d', 'multiverseId': 533684}, 'multiverseid': 533684}, {'name': 'Pastagem', 'text': 'Pastagem entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}, sacrifique Pastagem: Procure um card de Floresta ou Planície em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533895&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c7884e02-f4fc-4d7f-a611-e0ac10f57d92', 'multiverseId': 533895}, 'multiverseid': 533895}, {'name': 'Пастбища', 'text': 'Пастбища выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Пастбища: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Леса или Равнины, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534106&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa44332b-828d-4c9d-9e7f-2981753c6045', 'multiverseId': 534106}, 'multiverseid': 534106}, {'name': '牧草原野', 'text': '牧草原野须横置进战场。\\n{T}，牺牲牧草原野：从你的牌库中搜寻一张树林或平原牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534317&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '97fb2cf4-0fa3-48e0-b115-429f238e010e', 'multiverseId': 534317}, 'multiverseid': 534317}, {'name': '牧草原野', 'text': '牧草原野須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}，犧牲牧草原野：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張樹林或平原牌，將之放進戰場，然後洗牌。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534528&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '67af23f7-dda5-43e4-8af8-0330252e100f', 'multiverseId': 534528}, 'multiverseid': 534528}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Söldling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\\n{B}, opfere X Schätze: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tiefling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531570&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdb309f6-6451-442f-be92-f3e125453172\', \'multiverseId\': 531570}, \'multiverseid\': 531570}, {\'name\': \'Asalariada siniestra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\\n{B}, sacrificar X Tesoros: La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff66ee7-21c8-4421-999c-a89fbbf5fd1f\', \'multiverseId\': 531626}, \'multiverseid\': 531626}, {\'name\': \'Employée sinistre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez deux jetons Trésor.\\n{B}, sacrifiez X trésors : Une créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : tieffelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531682&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19e164ad-a287-4f92-bb97-bc3163f610e9\', \'multiverseId\': 531682}, \'multiverseid\': 531682}, {\'name\': \'Gregaria Cupa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea due pedine Tesoro.\\n{B}, Sacrifica X Tesori: Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7a0397-02e2-4e4e-b917-280d9c09aa5f\', \'multiverseId\': 531738}, \'multiverseid\': 531738}, {\'name\': \'不気味な雇われ人\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\\n{B}, 宝物X個を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3035492-5a2d-41fc-97ad-857033b04ca5\', \'multiverseId\': 531794}, \'multiverseid\': 531794}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grimmiger Söldling\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\\n{B}, opfere X Schätze: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Tiefling, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d5c5cd2-d5d6-4dce-bdfe-ee7cd985bcc3\', \'multiverseId\': 531984}, \'multiverseid\': 531984}, {\'name\': \'Asalariada siniestra\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\\n{B}, sacrificar X Tesoros: La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67aec47f-db30-441c-9731-1658fba301dc\', \'multiverseId\': 532038}, \'multiverseid\': 532038}, {\'name\': \'Employée sinistre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez deux jetons Trésor.\\n{B}, sacrifiez X trésors : Une créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature : tieffelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2db422a8-e3d6-4083-8e4d-be612656ae62\', \'multiverseId\': 532092}, \'multiverseid\': 532092}, {\'name\': \'Gregaria Cupa\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea due pedine Tesoro.\\n{B}, Sacrifica X Tesori: Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a8b8760-a552-4b6c-b227-a9cd88fe0b96\', \'multiverseId\': 532146}, \'multiverseid\': 532146}, {\'name\': \'不気味な雇われ人\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\\n{B}, 宝物X個を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ティーフリング・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af1c930-c2bf-41fd-8875-173792967da7\', \'multiverseId\': 532200}, \'multiverseid\': 532200}, {\'name\': \'Capanga Sinistra\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causarem dano de combate a um jogador, crie duas fichas de Tesouro.\\n{B}, sacrifique X Tesouros: A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tiferino Ladino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f21bb0d3-db09-421e-8406-758013f0db3a\', \'multiverseId\': 532254}, \'multiverseid\': 532254}, {\'name\': \'Мрачная Наемница\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда одно или несколько существ под вашим контролем наносят боевые повреждения игроку, создайте две фишки Клада.\\n{B}, пожертвуйте X Кладов: целевое существо получает -Х/-Х до конца хода. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Тифлинг Бродяга\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffa1c3d1-cfa5-445a-9166-1fd937a94767\', \'multiverseId\': 532308}, \'multiverseid\': 532308}, {\'name\': \'残酷雇工\', \'text\': \'每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出两个珍宝衍生物。\\n{B}，牺牲X个珍宝：目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df2a932a-c62b-4767-b931-eb3e9e37897b\', \'multiverseId\': 532362}, \'multiverseid\': 532362}, {\'name\': \'殘酷雇工\', \'text\': \'每當由你操控的一個或數個生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出兩個珍寶衍生物。\\n{B}，犧牲X個珍寶：目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～魔人／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01bbfcc5-cf28-4760-a3ca-544f135810eb\', \'multiverseId\': 532416}, \'multiverseid\': 532416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grundlose Gewalt\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einer bleibenden Karte oder einem Spieler Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie der bleibenden Karte oder dem Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Ein harmloser Ausflug in die Stadt wurde zu einem eigenen Abenteuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532725&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f1f1c2-29a6-4bc3-a140-c5fde08ee95e\', \'multiverseId\': 532725}, \'multiverseid\': 532725}, {\'name\': \'Violencia innecesaria\', \'text\': \'Si una criatura que controlas fuera a hacer daño a un permanente o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el doble de ese daño a ese permanente o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Lo que supuestamente iba a ser un descanso tranquilo en la ciudad acabó siendo toda una aventura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41dc73f6-f45d-48a6-9888-5bf8843ad208\', \'multiverseId\': 532936}, \'multiverseid\': 532936}, {\'name\': \'Violence gratuite\', \'text\': \'Si une créature que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un permanent ou à un joueur, elle inflige à la place le double de ces blessures à ce permanent ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Ce qui devait être une promenade tranquille en ville s\'est transformé en aventure à part entière.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533147&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb736299-441f-43fb-868d-1d68f99716ee\', \'multiverseId\': 533147}, \'multiverseid\': 533147}, {\'name\': \'Violenza Gratuita\', \'text\': \'Se una creatura che controlli sta per infliggere danno a un permanente o a un giocatore, infligge invece il doppio di quel danno a quel permanente o a quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "Quella che doveva essere una tranquilla tappa in città si rivelò invece essere un\'altra avventura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d58284-98b0-4a8b-bb2e-1729ec5d78ec\', \'multiverseId\': 533358}, \'multiverseid\': 533358}, {\'name\': \'理由なき暴力\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーがパーマネントやプレイヤーにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーにその２倍の点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'町で静かに過ごすはずが、大変な冒険になってしまった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a78f4c-8091-4ce8-9a5e-ff127ff61c97\', \'multiverseId\': 533569}, \'multiverseid\': 533569}, {\'name\': \'Violência Gratuita\', \'text\': \'Se uma criatura que você controla for causar dano a uma permanente ou a um jogador, em vez disso, ela causará o dobro daquele dano àquela permanente ou àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O que deveria ter sido um dia tranquilo na cidade se tornou uma aventura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73aa7247-42f0-4f6e-8160-43ac5765f4f8\', \'multiverseId\': 533780}, \'multiverseid\': 533780}, {\'name\': \'Беспричинное Насилие\', \'text\': \'Если существо под вашим контролем должно нанести повреждения перманенту или игроку, вместо этого оно наносит те повреждения тому перманенту или игроку в двойном размере.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'То, что должно было стать спокойной передышкой в городе, превратилось в самостоятельное приключение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'330ea193-1d4d-4f0d-b8e2-9b28432cb7cb\', \'multiverseId\': 533991}, \'multiverseid\': 533991}, {\'name\': \'无端暴力\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控的生物将对任一永久物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该永久物或牌手造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'小镇原本的恬静时光平添几道浓墨重彩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe37a24-99b2-4915-ae3e-ae7cc5fd7124\', \'multiverseId\': 534202}, \'multiverseid\': 534202}, {\'name\': \'無端暴力\', \'text\': \'如果某個由你操控的生物將對任一永久物或玩家造成傷害，則改為它對該永久物或玩家造成兩倍的傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'小鎮原本的恬靜時光平添幾道濃墨重彩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b374c3ce-3507-4db6-8c2f-de6cc6f80ffb\', \'multiverseId\': 534413}, \'multiverseid\': 534413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruul-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zeichen, mit denen die Gruul ihren Einflussbereich kennzeichnen, sind oft nicht lesbar. Das Blut, der Rotz und der Schlamm, mit denen sie gezeichnet wurden, reichen jedoch meist zur Identifikation.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efe662f8-0313-41a1-8304-7c6b3754fcf6\', \'multiverseId\': 532805}, \'multiverseid\': 532805}, {\'name\': \'Sello gruul\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Las marcas territoriales de los gruul no necesitan ser legibles. La sangre, el moco y el barro usados para impregnarlas son indudablemente gruul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfba6591-2af4-4f8a-960c-a40d9316f197\', \'multiverseId\': 533016}, \'multiverseid\': 533016}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Gruul\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les marques territoriales des Gruul n\'ont pas besoin d\'être officielles. Le sang, la morve et la crasse utilisés pour les dessiner sont tout de suite identifiables.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77fc6dc-08d1-42fa-bee6-bd0bd041893a\', \'multiverseId\': 533227}, \'multiverseid\': 533227}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Gruul\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Le indicazioni territoriali dei Gruul non devono essere leggibili. Il fatto che siano tracciate con sangue, muco e sporcizia le identifica chiaramente come Gruul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1234f5f8-e59c-4f47-b9ab-04333134f04b\', \'multiverseId\': 533438}, \'multiverseid\': 533438}, {\'name\': \'グルールの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'グルール領の境界線は明瞭である必要は無い。グルールの塗りたくられた血や鼻糞や泥は見間違いようがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533649&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e2bc035-9907-4e74-8bc0-8008fe1b0bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 533649}, \'multiverseid\': 533649}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Gruul\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'As marcas territoriais dos Gruul não precisam ser legíveis. O sangue, a meleca e a podridão usadas para demarcá-las são inconfundivelmente Gruul.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b48bcba8-530f-440f-825c-670f6fd8e36c\', \'multiverseId\': 533860}, \'multiverseid\': 533860}, {\'name\': \'Печать Груулов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Груулам ни к чему отчетливые метки вокруг своей территории. Кровь, сопли и навоз, которыми заляпаны эти знаки, безошибочно выдают Груулов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d612077b-8e11-4aa9-899f-22510e1b25d1\', \'multiverseId\': 534071}, \'multiverseid\': 534071}, {\'name\': \'古鲁印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{G}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'古鲁的地界标志不需要刻意清楚标示。看到用鲜血，鼻涕，或粪便涂抹的痕迹，就晓得这边属于古鲁。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e76b65e4-f295-443f-aaec-093df3b3f523\', \'multiverseId\': 534282}, \'multiverseid\': 534282}, {\'name\': \'古魯印記\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{G}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'古魯的地界標誌不需要刻意清楚標示。看到用鮮血，鼻涕，或糞便塗抹的痕跡，就曉得這邊屬於古魯。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72d576cc-99bb-4880-90e0-6b23c52aece2\', \'multiverseId\': 534493}, \'multiverseid\': 534493}]', "[{'name': 'Gruulgrund', 'text': 'Der Gruulgrund kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Gruulgrund ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532841&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eca166a4-1179-4595-ba86-27bd3bccc6d1', 'multiverseId': 532841}, 'multiverseid': 532841}, {'name': 'Territorio gruul', 'text': 'El Territorio gruul entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Territorio gruul entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533052&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '650b5c4a-c727-47d9-a10e-a32ed769658a', 'multiverseId': 533052}, 'multiverseid': 533052}, {'name': 'Territoire des Gruul', 'text': 'Le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Territoire des Gruul arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533263&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ebb2393-9a7f-4eb0-ba89-b2a43b39d31b', 'multiverseId': 533263}, 'multiverseid': 533263}, {'name': 'Torba Gruul', 'text': 'La Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Torba Gruul entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533474&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9798a22b-aa50-4b7d-ae5d-c6e17047d690', 'multiverseId': 533474}, 'multiverseid': 533474}, {'name': 'グルールの芝地', 'text': 'グルールの芝地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nグルールの芝地が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{R}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533685&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '748731aa-1dec-4970-b093-30a60eed6f33', 'multiverseId': 533685}, 'multiverseid': 533685}, {'name': 'Gleba Gruul', 'text': 'Gleba Gruul entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Gleba Gruul entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533896&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d056782-f459-416d-b44a-b404a5835cda', 'multiverseId': 533896}, 'multiverseid': 533896}, {'name': 'Территория Груулов', 'text': 'Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Территория Груулов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {R}{G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534107&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'efe28251-0018-4641-957e-9d4ca88a9995', 'multiverseId': 534107}, 'multiverseid': 534107}, {'name': '古鲁地盘', 'text': '古鲁地盘须横置进战场。\\n当古鲁地盘进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534318&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e4efb55-eb49-4b13-8ff5-aa8210ce270e', 'multiverseId': 534318}, 'multiverseid': 534318}, {'name': '古魯地盤', 'text': '古魯地盤須橫置進戰場。\\n當古魯地盤進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{R}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534529&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd86a2ecd-a150-4b8e-bb49-b594c207bf18', 'multiverseId': 534529}, 'multiverseid': 534529}]", '[{\'name\': \'Größeres Wohl\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur: Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die Stärke der geopferten Kreatur beträgt, und wirf dann drei Karten ab.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Im Tod kann man Weisheit erlangen — sei es die eigene oder die eines anderen."\\n—Jarad, Lichfürst der Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532758&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266cafbd-1414-42ac-b6b4-9d61203a7c25\', \'multiverseId\': 532758}, \'multiverseid\': 532758}, {\'name\': \'Beneficio superior\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar una criatura: Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada, luego descarta tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"La muerte, tanto si es la tuya como la de otra persona, encierra sabiduría".\\n—Jarad, señor liche golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d62a7391-b9da-402c-a757-faf103e90805\', \'multiverseId\': 532969}, \'multiverseid\': 532969}, {\'name\': \'Pour le plus grand bien\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez une créature : Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée, puis défaussez-vous de trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La mort apporte de la sagesse, peu importe qu\'il s\'agisse de la sienne ou de celle d\'autrui. »\\n—Jarad, seigneur liche des Golgari", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533180&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f961df4-2a5b-419e-9837-8c28de8651e3\', \'multiverseId\': 533180}, \'multiverseid\': 533180}, {\'name\': \'Bene Supremo\', \'text\': \'Sacrifica una creatura: Pesca carte pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata, poi scarta tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Si può imparare molto dalla morte, che sia la propria o quella di altri."\\n—Jarad, Signore dei Lich Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8d9edc-9f9d-4ae7-8851-dbf53bfeceec\', \'multiverseId\': 533391}, \'multiverseid\': 533391}, {\'name\': \'よりよい品物\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたはその生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引き、その後カード３枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「死から得られる知恵がある。自分自身であれ、別の誰かであれ。」\\n――ゴルガリの死者の王、ジャラド\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed0fe4d8-257d-4a09-bc6f-7957084b5daa\', \'multiverseId\': 533602}, \'multiverseid\': 533602}, {\'name\': \'Bem Maior\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique uma criatura: Compre uma quantidade de cards igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada, depois descarte três cards.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A morte traz sabedoria, pouco importa se é a própria ou a de outra pessoa."\\n— Jarad, senhor lich Golgari\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01db6aca-ec0a-4949-b063-203a3c5ce7e7\', \'multiverseId\': 533813}, \'multiverseid\': 533813}, {\'name\': \'Великое Благо\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте существо: возьмите количество карт, равное силе пожертвованного существа, затем сбросьте три карты.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«В смерти можно обрести мудрость — и в своей смерти, и в чужой».\\n— Джарад, лорд-лич Голгари\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8138a748-684f-4d70-b49c-8a5111408686\', \'multiverseId\': 534024}, \'multiverseid\': 534024}, {\'name\': \'牺牲小我\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物：抓等同于所牺牲生物之力量的牌，然后弃三张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡之中可以获得知识～无论是自己的还是别人的。」\\n～葛加理巫妖领主贾雷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53300331-c950-4e10-b134-81213e6847ca\', \'multiverseId\': 534235}, \'multiverseid\': 534235}, {\'name\': \'犧牲小我\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物：抽等同於所犧牲生物之力量的牌，然後棄三張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「死亡之中可以獲得知識～無論是自己的還是別人的。\\n～葛加理巫妖領主賈雷\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fabff10-e716-4f3e-a60b-a270596a797d\', \'multiverseId\': 534446}, \'multiverseid\': 534446}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grübelschlängler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Grübelschlängler ins Spiel kommt, ziehe zwei Karten.\\nHerbeirufen {2}{U} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532685&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'befa5eb8-de71-4b64-a195-0276dc9282c2\', \'multiverseId\': 532685}, \'multiverseid\': 532685}, {\'name\': \'Errante meditabundo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Errante meditabundo entre al campo de batalla, roba dos cartas.\\nEvocar {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a194cfd-6d0a-4343-9b56-3714d7386287\', \'multiverseId\': 532896}, \'multiverseid\': 532896}, {\'name\': \'Vagabond des pensées\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Vagabond des pensées arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez deux cartes.\\nÉvocation {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35a40b40-2081-4c6b-83b5-058f076dc1fa\', \'multiverseId\': 533107}, \'multiverseid\': 533107}, {\'name\': \'Vagabondo Pensoso\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Vagabondo Pensoso entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca due carte.\\nApparire {2}{U} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7858b15a-1c29-4493-859e-888d1301f7c8\', \'multiverseId\': 533318}, \'multiverseid\': 533318}, {\'name\': \'熟考漂い\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n熟考漂いが戦場に出たとき、カード２枚を引く。\\n想起{2}{U}（あなたはこの呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127803a2-501e-475e-b461-fb21791abf30\', \'multiverseId\': 533529}, \'multiverseid\': 533529}, {\'name\': \'Vaga-pensador\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Vaga-pensador entrar no campo de batalha, compre dois cards.\\nEvocar {2}{U} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68c16bd-1acb-4b38-9d55-3c67f3af335e\', \'multiverseId\': 533740}, \'multiverseid\': 533740}, {\'name\': \'Плыводум\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Плыводум выходит на поле битвы, возьмите две карты.\\nВызывание {2}{U} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Вызывания. Если вы это делаете, оно приносится в жертву, когда выходит на поле битвы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63462390-3f5c-4639-89b0-4c79e00143e5\', \'multiverseId\': 533951}, \'multiverseid\': 533951}, {\'name\': \'漂念精\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当漂念精进战场时，抓两张牌。\\n呼魂{2}{U}（你可以支付此咒语的呼魂费用来施放它。若你如此作，当它进战场时便牺牲之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc07e602-4cb7-4168-a525-321bb49c23b2\', \'multiverseId\': 534162}, \'multiverseid\': 534162}, {\'name\': \'漂念精\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當漂念精進戰場時，抽兩張牌。\\n呼魂{2}{U}（你可以支付此咒語的呼魂費用來施放它。若你如此作，當它進戰場時便犧牲之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'181a0a71-39f7-40a7-b061-967d59039e69\', \'multiverseId\': 534373}, \'multiverseid\': 534373}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gründliche Untersuchung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du angreifst, stelle Nachforschungen an. (Erzeuge einen farblosen Hinweis-Artefaktspielstein mit „{2}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\\nImmer wenn du einen Hinweis opferst, wage dich ins Gewölbe. (Betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'491a5a2c-ce04-4c28-9c04-3eba2bd9c739\', \'multiverseId\': 531971}, \'multiverseid\': 531971}, {\'name\': \'Investigación minuciosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques, investiga. (Crea una ficha de artefacto Pista incolora con "{2}, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\\nSiempre que sacrifiques una Pista, adéntrate en la mazmorra. (Entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f35d87b2-3fe0-45d8-8697-90e648c8df64\', \'multiverseId\': 532025}, \'multiverseid\': 532025}, {\'name\': \'Examen approfondi\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez, enquêtez. (Créez un jeton d\'artefact incolore Indice avec « {2}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un indice, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. (Entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'146b584e-2b51-46ec-8a5f-1ab3bd18074f\', \'multiverseId\': 532079}, \'multiverseid\': 532079}, {\'name\': \'Indagine Approfondita\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi, indaga. (Crea una pedina artefatto Indizio incolore con "{2}, Sacrifica questo artefatto: Pesca una carta".)\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Indizio, esplora il dungeon. (Entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva.)\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4838ffc1-e0de-4c51-9682-fb3214f070d5\', \'multiverseId\': 532133}, \'multiverseid\': 532133}, {\'name\': \'入念な調査\', \'text\': \'あなたが攻撃するたび、調査を行う。（「{2}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つ無色の手掛かり・アーティファクト・トークン１つを生成する。）\\nあなたが手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eea18c95-4084-4dbf-b640-98eab140aa88\', \'multiverseId\': 532187}, \'multiverseid\': 532187}, {\'name\': \'Investigação Minuciosa\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar, investigue. (Crie uma ficha de artefato Pista incolor com "{2}, sacrifique este artefato: Compre um card".)\\nToda vez que você sacrificar uma Pista, aventure-se na masmorra. (Entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688fdbac-4b97-42f3-8292-8f07b15db5fc\', \'multiverseId\': 532241}, \'multiverseid\': 532241}, {\'name\': \'Дотошное Расследование\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы атакуете, используйте Дознание. (Создайте одну фишку бесцветного артефакта Улика со способностью «{2}, пожертвуйте этот артефакт: возьмите карту».)\\nКаждый раз, когда вы жертвуете Улику, углубитесь в подземелье. (Войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5b6a54-ac56-47a8-8be9-fdddfcdf5356\', \'multiverseId\': 532295}, \'multiverseid\': 532295}, {\'name\': \'详细调查\', \'text\': \'每当你攻击时，探查。（派出一个无色线索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌。」）\\n每当你牺牲一个线索时，深入地城。（进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38309a39-edc9-4ff8-a5a3-263115180306\', \'multiverseId\': 532349}, \'multiverseid\': 532349}, {\'name\': \'詳細調查\', \'text\': \'每當你攻擊時，探查。（派出一個無色線索衍生神器，且具有「{2}，犧牲此神器：抽一張牌。」）\\n每當你犧牲一個線索時，深入地城。（進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'096a818c-a6a9-4ea8-b3b6-3bb5a9e650b0\', \'multiverseId\': 532403}, \'multiverseid\': 532403}]', "[{'name': 'Gründliche Untersuchung', 'text': 'Immer wenn du angreifst, stelle Nachforschungen an.\\nImmer wenn du einen Hinweis opferst, wage dich ins Gewölbe.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531557&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90909379-275e-4ae6-ae51-05754f77be37', 'multiverseId': 531557}, 'multiverseid': 531557}, {'name': 'Investigación minuciosa', 'text': 'Siempre que ataques, investiga.\\nSiempre que sacrifiques una Pista, adéntrate en la mazmorra.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531613&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b4903fa-9b54-4d6c-b26d-09aaa4c7bc69', 'multiverseId': 531613}, 'multiverseid': 531613}, {'name': 'Examen approfondi', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous attaquez, enquêtez.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un indice, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531669&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbef47cd-a02f-45df-88c7-fa03c773cf00', 'multiverseId': 531669}, 'multiverseid': 531669}, {'name': 'Indagine Approfondita', 'text': 'Ogniqualvolta attacchi, indaga.\\nOgniqualvolta sacrifichi un Indizio, esplora il dungeon.', 'type': 'Incantesimo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531725&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9081c9a5-af2a-46f4-b687-80f00d888d79', 'multiverseId': 531725}, 'multiverseid': 531725}, {'name': '入念な調査', 'text': 'あなたが攻撃するたび、調査を行う。\\nあなたが手掛かり１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531781&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0cb499a0-ef66-4ff1-b6d9-70fad7163c98', 'multiverseId': 531781}, 'multiverseid': 531781}]", '[{\'name\': \'Grüner Zorn\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\\nWenn der Grüne Zorn aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, bringe den Grünen Zorn auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Hass überlebt die Hassenden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532765&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b384e9e8-88a5-41e1-99e1-b0c25f3ff561\', \'multiverseId\': 532765}, \'multiverseid\': 532765}, {\'name\': \'Rencor\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\\nCuando el Rencor vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, regresa el Rencor a la mano de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'El odio vive más que los que odian.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d366900-5346-460e-adbd-31de6897e257\', \'multiverseId\': 532976}, \'multiverseid\': 532976}, {\'name\': \'Rancœur\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+0 et a le piétinement.\\nQuand la Rancœur est mise dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, renvoyez la Rancœur dans la main de son propriétaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Moi, je l\'aurai simplement par la haine. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533187&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0139bb92-9479-42ab-9187-fda23c9af429\', \'multiverseId\': 533187}, \'multiverseid\': 533187}, {\'name\': \'Rancore\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+0 e ha travolgere.\\nQuando il Rancore viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, fai tornare il Rancore in mano al suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "L\'odio sopravvive a colui che odia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75eaf7c8-36b2-48b0-a0ce-4feca6eb39a6\', \'multiverseId\': 533398}, \'multiverseid\': 533398}, {\'name\': \'怨恨\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受けトランプルを持つ。\\n怨恨が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、怨恨をオーナーの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'憎しみは、憎むべき者が死んだ後まで残る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0dfac908-d20f-4a15-bbfc-f46f26d70bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 533609}, \'multiverseid\': 533609}, {\'name\': \'Rancor\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+0 e tem atropelar.\\nQuando Rancor for colocado num cemitério vindo do campo de batalha, devolva Rancor para a mão de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'O rancoroso morre, mas seu rancor sobrevive.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e74c78e4-36bb-4a8d-a0d0-6459b1662206\', \'multiverseId\': 533820}, \'multiverseid\': 533820}, {\'name\': \'Злоба\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+0 и имеет Пробивной удар.\\nКогда Злоба попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, верните Злобу в руку ее владельца.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Ненависть переживает ненавидящего.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2293dd7f-ae1b-4cb8-9d01-b7cf8bc55d87\', \'multiverseId\': 534031}, \'multiverseid\': 534031}, {\'name\': \'仇视\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+0且具有践踏异能。\\n当仇视从战场进入坟墓场时，将仇视移回其拥有者手上。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'恨意会比其目标存留得更久。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72492750-170b-4f5a-ad20-c5c382bf6bf7\', \'multiverseId\': 534242}, \'multiverseid\': 534242}, {\'name\': \'仇視\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+0且具有踐踏異能。\\n當仇視從戰場進入墳墓場時，將仇視移回其擁有者手上。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'恨意會比其目標存留得更久。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c34cd2b5-3992-40f5-8983-2e0516ec6481\', \'multiverseId\': 534453}, \'multiverseid\': 534453}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gürtel der Riesenstärke\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 10/10.\\nAusrüsten {10}. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Stärke der Kreatur ist, die sie als Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531583&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f31728-b54e-4f63-9530-e1042a037207\', \'multiverseId\': 531583}, \'multiverseid\': 531583}, {\'name\': \'Cinturón de fuerza de gigante\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 10/10.\\nEquipar {10}. Te cuesta {X} menos activar esta habilidad, donde X es la fuerza de la criatura a la que hace objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9960c990-afba-4b3e-8b3b-0ce92f3181d3\', \'multiverseId\': 531639}, \'multiverseid\': 531639}, {\'name\': \'Ceinturon de force de géant\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a une force et une endurance de base de 10/10.\\nÉquipement {10}. Cette capacité coûte {X} de moins à activer, X étant la force de la créature qu\'elle cible.", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531695&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b633908-66ec-4921-b381-0bd53ef345b9\', \'multiverseId\': 531695}, \'multiverseid\': 531695}, {\'name\': \'Cintura della Forza dei Giganti\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha forza e costituzione base 10/10.\\nEquipaggiare {10}. Questa abilità costa {X} in meno per essere attivata, dove X è la forza della creatura che bersaglia.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8988d754-42ea-478b-b2db-9b90a52f3201\', \'multiverseId\': 531751}, \'multiverseid\': 531751}, {\'name\': \'ベルト・オヴ・ジャイアント・ストレングス\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーの基本のパワーとタフネスは10/10になる。\\n装備{10}。この能力を起動するためのコストは、{X}少なくなる。Ｘはこの能力が対象としているクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77894a17-cbcc-4f4f-bc48-a128044abf49\', \'multiverseId\': 531807}, \'multiverseid\': 531807}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gürtel der Riesenstärke\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 10/10.\\nAusrüsten {10}. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Stärke der Kreatur ist, die sie als Ziel hat.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531997&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d4a8931-8b78-4fb0-8c85-8f0078809183\', \'multiverseId\': 531997}, \'multiverseid\': 531997}, {\'name\': \'Cinturón de fuerza de gigante\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 10/10.\\nEquipar {10}. Te cuesta {X} menos activar esta habilidad, donde X es la fuerza de la criatura a la que hace objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4157778c-5699-4e33-ae47-30c5bdd0b658\', \'multiverseId\': 532051}, \'multiverseid\': 532051}, {\'name\': \'Ceinturon de force de géant\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a une force et une endurance de base de 10/10.\\nÉquipement {10}. Cette capacité coûte {X} de moins à activer, X étant la force de la créature qu\'elle cible.", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532105&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ded667-0006-4d33-b0be-e38e80feee10\', \'multiverseId\': 532105}, \'multiverseid\': 532105}, {\'name\': \'Cintura della Forza dei Giganti\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha forza e costituzione base 10/10.\\nEquipaggiare {10}. Questa abilità costa {X} in meno per essere attivata, dove X è la forza della creatura che bersaglia.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0177d5a-d850-475a-bc07-d2daccc287d5\', \'multiverseId\': 532159}, \'multiverseid\': 532159}, {\'name\': \'ベルト・オヴ・ジャイアント・ストレングス\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーの基本のパワーとタフネスは10/10になる。\\n装備{10}。この能力を起動するためのコストは、{X}少なくなる。Ｘはこの能力が対象としているクリーチャーのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd545df9-72ef-4b59-bc82-06b8d6f7c440\', \'multiverseId\': 532213}, \'multiverseid\': 532213}, {\'name\': \'Cinto da Força de Gigante\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem poder e resistência básicos 10/10.\\nEquipar {10}. Esta habilidade custa {X} a menos para ser ativada, sendo X o poder da criatura que é alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11522aa3-7a44-4b06-b740-b13a4f16c987\', \'multiverseId\': 532267}, \'multiverseid\': 532267}, {\'name\': \'Пояс Силы Великана\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет базовую силу и выносливость 10/10.\\nСнарядить {10}. Активация этой способности стоит на {X} меньше, где Х — сила существа, являющегося ее целью.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d7eb490-c9d0-4a75-8e94-498450e293d5\', \'multiverseId\': 532321}, \'multiverseid\': 532321}, {\'name\': \'巨力腰带\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物之基础力量和防御力为10/10。\\n佩带{10}。此异能减少{X}来起动，X是为此异能目标之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10336173-f036-4701-9053-3275b23610b0\', \'multiverseId\': 532375}, \'multiverseid\': 532375}, {\'name\': \'巨力腰帶\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物之基礎力量和防禦力為10/10。\\n佩帶{10}。此異能減少{X}來起動，X是為此異能目標之生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ce8c58b-fe65-4c9a-a91b-275c35a19b8b\', \'multiverseId\': 532429}, \'multiverseid\': 532429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hafenstadt\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Hafenstadt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Ebene- oder Insel-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Hafenstadt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6903c82b-2e12-4fbb-8d00-3565678cdd26\', \'multiverseId\': 532853}, \'multiverseid\': 532853}, {\'name\': \'Pueblo portuario\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Pueblo portuario entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Llanura o Isla de tu mano. Si no lo haces, el Pueblo portuario entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8f5103e-9236-4d98-b22e-fbecebe8ec9f\', \'multiverseId\': 533064}, \'multiverseid\': 533064}, {\'name\': \'Ville portuaire\', \'text\': "Au moment où la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de plaine ou d\'île de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Ville portuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533275&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc979652-a3f1-441e-8c4f-c39e317905ab\', \'multiverseId\': 533275}, \'multiverseid\': 533275}, {\'name\': \'Città Portuale\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Città Portuale entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Pianura o Isola dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, la Città Portuale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a0a22f4-a90f-49b3-8351-6a1536a1cc6f\', \'multiverseId\': 533486}, \'multiverseid\': 533486}, {\'name\': \'港町\', \'text\': \'港町が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり平地か島であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、港町はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f9175c-3d7e-4e6a-82f8-6ee77bf57fbd\', \'multiverseId\': 533697}, \'multiverseid\': 533697}, {\'name\': \'Cidade Portuária\', \'text\': \'Conforme Cidade Portuária entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Planície ou Ilha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Cidade Portuária entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad7ff8b-d2de-49bd-9747-b833de2c241a\', \'multiverseId\': 533908}, \'multiverseid\': 533908}, {\'name\': \'Портовый Город\', \'text\': \'При выходе Портового Города на поле битвы вы можете показать карту Равнины или Острова из вашей руки. Если вы этого не делаете, Портовый Город выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {W} или {U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8efa5cd6-183b-4edc-9ab4-6479618db756\', \'multiverseId\': 534119}, \'multiverseid\': 534119}, {\'name\': \'港镇\', \'text\': \'于港镇进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张平原或海岛牌。如果你未如此作，则港镇须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f32ee34c-a841-40ec-bb44-141eda4b12ee\', \'multiverseId\': 534330}, \'multiverseid\': 534330}, {\'name\': \'港鎮\', \'text\': \'於港鎮進戰場時，你可以從你手上展示一張平原或海島牌。如果你未如此作，則港鎮須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{W}或{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e05b7c0f-22da-4df3-953e-e8d06f0da4ac\', \'multiverseId\': 534541}, \'multiverseid\': 534541}]', '[{\'name\': \'Halimar-Untiefe\', \'text\': \'Die Halimar-Untiefe kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Halimar-Untiefe ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88d5b75a-33fe-4463-a508-681ca5911d21\', \'multiverseId\': 532842}, \'multiverseid\': 532842}, {\'name\': \'Abismos de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Los Abismos de Halimar entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCuando los Abismos de Halimar entren al campo de batalla, mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y regrésalas en cualquier orden.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d5ed16-ea31-44f5-83d3-f36564bc08b6\', \'multiverseId\': 533053}, \'multiverseid\': 533053}, {\'name\': \'Profondeurs de Halimar\', \'text\': "Les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\nQuand les Profondeurs de Halimar arrivent sur le champ de bataille, regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533264&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8c56b43-f9dc-4876-a3f1-41c319bfa60f\', \'multiverseId\': 533264}, \'multiverseid\': 533264}, {\'name\': \'Abissi di Halimar\', \'text\': \'Gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpati.\\nQuando gli Abissi di Halimar entrano nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio, poi rimettile a posto in qualsiasi ordine.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4e9f915-044b-4ade-ada9-b811c1c56f1b\', \'multiverseId\': 533475}, \'multiverseid\': 533475}, {\'name\': \'ハリマーの深み\', \'text\': \'ハリマーの深みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nハリマーの深みが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見て、その後それらを望む順番で戻す。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7aae06-b03f-4d1d-a850-6acb762c45eb\', \'multiverseId\': 533686}, \'multiverseid\': 533686}, {\'name\': \'Profundezas de Halimar\', \'text\': \'Profundezas de Halimar entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Profundezas de Halimar entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório e depois coloque-os de volta em qualquer ordem.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06aa383-9c86-44d3-a126-e338674020cf\', \'multiverseId\': 533897}, \'multiverseid\': 533897}, {\'name\': \'Халимарские Глубины\', \'text\': \'Халимарские Глубины выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\nКогда Халимарские Глубины выходят на поле битвы, посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки, затем положите их обратно в любом порядке.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d666949-8b5c-487b-98d2-cee26bee792a\', \'multiverseId\': 534108}, \'multiverseid\': 534108}, {\'name\': \'哈利玛奥流\', \'text\': \'哈利玛奥流须横置进战场。\\n当哈利玛奥流进战场时，检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将它们以任意顺序放回。\\n{T}：加{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbc84e93-7956-4d07-b4c6-2437b44957b8\', \'multiverseId\': 534319}, \'multiverseid\': 534319}, {\'name\': \'哈利瑪奧流\', \'text\': \'哈利瑪奧流須橫置進戰場。\\n當哈利瑪奧流進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌，然後將它們以任意順序放回。\\n{T}：加{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55fc6a24-6238-472f-aec0-4abec1602310\', \'multiverseId\': 534530}, \'multiverseid\': 534530}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hammer des Kolossus\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +10/+10 und verliert Flugfähigkeit.\\nAusrüsten {8} ({8}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt nur einen Weg, um sicherzustellen, dass es wirklich tot ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d672006-b96b-42fc-bc94-4e94a89c0c68\', \'multiverseId\': 532800}, \'multiverseid\': 532800}, {\'name\': \'Martillo colosal\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +10/+10 y pierde la habilidad de volar.\\nEquipar {8}. ({8}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo hay una forma de asegurarnos de que está muerto del todo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a93e3da-b4fd-4744-a1f0-b227cef36690\', \'multiverseId\': 533011}, \'multiverseid\': 533011}, {\'name\': \'Marteau colossal\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +10/+10 et perd le vol.\\nÉquipement {8} ({8} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Il n\'y a qu\'une façon de s\'assurer qu\'il est vraiment mort. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3691a3e9-1750-4300-a9b0-413819c3aaf1\', \'multiverseId\': 533222}, \'multiverseid\': 533222}, {\'name\': \'Martello del Colosso\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +10/+10 e perde volare.\\nEquipaggiare {8} ({8}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"C\\\'è solo un modo per assicurarsi che sia davvero morto."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84249a48-9dac-4068-8383-94a45a1eb583\', \'multiverseId\': 533433}, \'multiverseid\': 533433}, {\'name\': \'巨像の鎚\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋10/＋10の修整を受け飛行を失う。\\n装備{8}（{8}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「本当に死んでいるかどうか確かめる方法が一つある。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b0a362-03d3-4881-8a7a-9d90715b2bde\', \'multiverseId\': 533644}, \'multiverseid\': 533644}, {\'name\': \'Martelo do Colosso\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +10/+10 e perde voar.\\nEquipar {8} ({8}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Só há um jeito de ter certeza de que ele está morto mesmo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9ac462d-83c4-4b7d-ab03-94e862625153\', \'multiverseId\': 533855}, \'multiverseid\': 533855}, {\'name\': \'Молот Исполина\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +10/+10 и теряет Полет.\\nСнарядить {8} ({8}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть лишь один способ убедиться, что он на самом деле мертв».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39cbb9c0-7b2a-43b1-9a5b-6f9296bb7663\', \'multiverseId\': 534066}, \'multiverseid\': 534066}, {\'name\': \'巨锤\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+10/+10且失去飞行异能。\\n佩带{8}（{8}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「要保证对方死透，只有一种办法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a583699-b668-4c7a-9ad8-c35382d426f8\', \'multiverseId\': 534277}, \'multiverseid\': 534277}, {\'name\': \'巨鎚\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+10/+10且失去飛行異能。\\n佩帶{8}（{8}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「要保證對方死透，只有一種辦法。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9362a144-d6ac-4dc6-8aca-63a9b54f203e\', \'multiverseId\': 534488}, \'multiverseid\': 534488}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heiliger Rächer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Doppelschlag.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Aura-Karte aus deiner Hand an sie angelegt ins Spiel bringen.\\nAusrüsten {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Göttliches Licht in Stahl geschmiedet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f44fcddd-504a-40f4-9d98-3bae889ee4e2\', \'multiverseId\': 531965}, \'multiverseid\': 531965}, {\'name\': \'Vengadora sagrada\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de Aura de tu mano anexada a ella.\\nEquipar {2}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Luz divina forjada con acero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b63830-1774-41dd-a48e-ccf61589ec4a\', \'multiverseId\': 532019}, \'multiverseid\': 532019}, {\'name\': \'Vengeresse sacrée\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a la double initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, attachée à elle, une carte d\'aura de votre main.\\nÉquipement {2}{W}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "La lumière divine forgée dans l\'acier.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532073&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52eceb8e-cbba-4d56-9ad3-912768817d86\', \'multiverseId\': 532073}, \'multiverseid\': 532073}, {\'name\': \'Sacro Vendicatore\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha doppio attacco.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta Aura assegnata ad essa.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Luce divina forgiata nell\'acciaio.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532127&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6672f6ce-be41-409a-bad0-ac4f2bfb5c97\', \'multiverseId\': 532127}, \'multiverseid\': 532127}, {\'name\': \'ホーリィ・アヴェンジャー\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはあなたの手札にあるオーラ・カード１枚を、それについている状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備{2}{W}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'鋼に鍛造された聖なる光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3739db24-681f-4558-b85f-0f6a35ccec16\', \'multiverseId\': 532181}, \'multiverseid\': 532181}, {\'name\': \'Vingadora Sagrada\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem golpe duplo.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causa dano de combate, você pode colocar um card de Aura de sua mão no campo de batalha anexado a ela.\\nEquipar {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'A luz divina forjada em aço.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05cf4e84-8d62-4f8f-b228-4516771757dc\', \'multiverseId\': 532235}, \'multiverseid\': 532235}, {\'name\': \'Священный Мститель\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Двойной удар.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения, вы можете положить карту Ауры из вашей руки на поле битвы прикрепленной к нему.\\nСнарядить {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Божественный свет, выкованный из стали.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abda3c36-ec1a-49fb-8d16-9b2f70d5b754\', \'multiverseId\': 532289}, \'multiverseid\': 532289}, {\'name\': \'神圣复仇者\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有连击异能。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物造成战斗伤害时，你可以将一张灵气牌从你手上放进战场并贴附于其上。\\n佩带{2}{W}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'钢铁铸成的神圣辉光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532343&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3627805-07bd-48fb-85e5-11560d81a888\', \'multiverseId\': 532343}, \'multiverseid\': 532343}, {\'name\': \'神聖復仇者\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有連擊異能。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以將一張靈氣牌從你手上放進戰場並貼附於其上。\\n佩帶{2}{W}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'鋼鐵鑄成的神聖輝光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fb4a3f3-f83b-4aeb-9c50-f4f4c2d60c45\', \'multiverseId\': 532397}, \'multiverseid\': 532397}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heiliger Rächer\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Doppelschlag.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Aura-Karte aus deiner Hand an sie angelegt ins Spiel bringen.\\nAusrüsten {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531551&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b12e5c93-9bc5-4fc9-9294-6b12344b1229\', \'multiverseId\': 531551}, \'multiverseid\': 531551}, {\'name\': \'Vengadora sagrada\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de dañar dos veces.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de Aura de tu mano anexada a ella.\\nEquipar {2}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a2fd03-3670-4a50-bce0-8dbba4a54b27\', \'multiverseId\': 531607}, \'multiverseid\': 531607}, {\'name\': \'Vengeresse sacrée\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a la double initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, attachée à elle, une carte d\'aura de votre main.\\nÉquipement {2}{W}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531663&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4461ee79-ca11-40b6-877c-5a660e087393\', \'multiverseId\': 531663}, \'multiverseid\': 531663}, {\'name\': \'Sacro Vendicatore\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha doppio attacco.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta Aura assegnata ad essa.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{W}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc9698f1-b5fa-482b-988d-7fc79999d9e6\', \'multiverseId\': 531719}, \'multiverseid\': 531719}, {\'name\': \'ホーリィ・アヴェンジャー\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは二段攻撃を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはあなたの手札にあるオーラ・カード１枚を、それについている状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n装備{2}{W}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fdd27b7-3e66-4974-a892-65836839ac7b\', \'multiverseId\': 531775}, \'multiverseid\': 531775}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herbeirufung der Sippe\', \'text\': \'Bestimme einen Kreaturentyp. Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du X Kreaturenkarten des bestimmten Typs aufgedeckt hast, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen ist, die du von diesem Typ kontrollierst. Bringe jene Karten ins Spiel, dann mische den Rest der aufgedeckten Karten in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532761&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d41073f9-6a03-4946-84f8-37c5f321fe2b\', \'multiverseId\': 532761}, \'multiverseid\': 532761}, {\'name\': \'Invocaciones de la estirpe\', \'text\': \'Elige un tipo de criatura. Muestra las cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres X cartas de criatura del tipo elegido, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas que controlas de ese tipo. Pon esas cartas en el campo de batalla, luego baraja el resto de las cartas mostradas en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4d54d1-fb48-4f07-b653-6266b986fcaf\', \'multiverseId\': 532972}, \'multiverseid\': 532972}, {\'name\': \'Recrutement de congénères\', \'text\': "Choisissez un type de créature. Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez X cartes de créature du type choisi, X étant le nombre de créatures de ce type que vous contrôlez. Mettez ces cartes sur le champ de bataille et mélangez ensuite le reste des cartes révélées dans votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3670ecc4-5c7c-434a-826d-0c88e7c9aea8\', \'multiverseId\': 533183}, \'multiverseid\': 533183}, {\'name\': \'Evocazioni della Stirpe\', \'text\': \'Scegli un tipo di creatura. Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli X carte creatura del tipo scelto, dove X è il numero di creature che controlli di quel tipo. Metti sul campo di battaglia quelle carte, poi rimescola le altre carte rivelate nel tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffb741a0-fbbb-4bdd-b885-ed69c41d1813\', \'multiverseId\': 533394}, \'multiverseid\': 533394}, {\'name\': \'同族の召喚\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・タイプ１つを選ぶ。その選ばれたタイプのクリーチャー・カードＸ枚が公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。Ｘはあなたがコントロールしているそのタイプのクリーチャーの数に等しい。それらのカードを戦場に出し、その後残りの公開されたカードをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab89da0-5ed4-4218-b506-629be2b7b5af\', \'multiverseId\': 533605}, \'multiverseid\': 533605}, {\'name\': \'Invocações da Estirpe\', \'text\': \'Escolha um tipo de criatura. Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar X cards de criatura do tipo escolhido, sendo X o número de criaturas que você controla daquele tipo. Coloque aqueles cards no campo de batalha, depois embaralhe o restante dos cards revelados em seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba87c54b-e4a5-49ed-bec2-6cdb6f2428a6\', \'multiverseId\': 533816}, \'multiverseid\': 533816}, {\'name\': \'Призыв Рода\', \'text\': \'Выберите тип существа. Показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете X карт существ выбранного типа, где X — количество существ того типа под вашим контролем. Положите те карты на поле битвы, затем втасуйте остальные показанные карты в вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15e8125-d333-455f-a296-db8e054444a5\', \'multiverseId\': 534027}, \'multiverseid\': 534027}, {\'name\': \'同族召唤\', \'text\': \'选择一种生物类别。从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出X张该类别的生物牌为止，X为由你操控的该类别生物数量。将这些牌放进战场，然后将其余展示的牌洗入你的牌库。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6ca43c-3d58-4c38-9030-729bf4b95127\', \'multiverseId\': 534238}, \'multiverseid\': 534238}, {\'name\': \'同族召喚\', \'text\': \'選擇一種生物類別。從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出X張該類別的生物牌為止，X為由你操控的該類別生物數量。將這些牌放進戰場，然後將其餘展示的牌洗入你的牌庫。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d151f1f-c7f9-4b82-9802-592cc35ca497\', \'multiverseId\': 534449}, \'multiverseid\': 534449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herbstritterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Herbstritterin ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eines —\\n• Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf die Herbstritterin.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Du erhältst 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dryade, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532785&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f96caac2-1fce-4269-853e-f7ecaa74e843\', \'multiverseId\': 532785}, \'multiverseid\': 532785}, {\'name\': \'Caballero del otoño\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Caballero del otoño entre al campo de batalla, elige uno:\\n• Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la Caballero del otoño.\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Ganas 4 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero dríada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f56f43b-bc46-4b13-8961-301ae23e4965\', \'multiverseId\': 532996}, \'multiverseid\': 532996}, {\'name\': "Chevalière de l\'automne", \'text\': "Quand la Chevalière de l\'automne arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la Chevalière de l\'automne.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé ou un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Vous gagnez 4 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : dryade et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76717b75-45e2-4e91-a4e1-9c5e5f3ba940\', \'multiverseId\': 533207}, \'multiverseid\': 533207}, {\'name\': "Cavaliera dell\'Autunno", \'text\': "Quando la Cavaliera dell\'Autunno entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli uno —\\n• Metti due segnalini +1/+1 sulla Cavaliera dell\'Autunno.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto o un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Guadagni 4 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Driade\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8cac597-c3b6-4cbb-98d0-b714aeabe304\', \'multiverseId\': 533418}, \'multiverseid\': 533418}, {\'name\': \'秋の騎士\', \'text\': \'秋の騎士が戦場に出たとき、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 秋の騎士の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n• アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• あなたは４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドライアド・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0073636b-bcd7-4667-b9ec-31f77ffe8b09\', \'multiverseId\': 533629}, \'multiverseid\': 533629}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleira do Outono\', \'text\': \'Quando Cavaleira do Outono entrar no campo de batalha, escolha um —\\n• Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 em Cavaleira do Outono.\\n• Destrua o artefato ou o encantamento alvo.\\n• Você ganha 4 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dríade Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'337fce5e-caae-4cb1-ae5c-047fcc52d9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 533840}, \'multiverseid\': 533840}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Осени\', \'text\': \'Когда Рыцарь Осени выходит на поле битвы, выберите одно —\\n• Положите два жетона +1/+1 на Рыцаря Осени.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт или чары.\\n• Вы получаете 4 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дриада Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206c36cd-27bf-4c49-84af-e1a038c9b84f\', \'multiverseId\': 534051}, \'multiverseid\': 534051}, {\'name\': \'暮秋骑士\', \'text\': \'当暮秋骑士进战场时，选择一项～\\n•在暮秋骑士上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n•消灭目标神器或结界。\\n•你获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～树灵／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f35ace48-da3a-4ffa-9982-eebd809626b8\', \'multiverseId\': 534262}, \'multiverseid\': 534262}, {\'name\': \'暮秋騎士\', \'text\': \'當暮秋騎士進戰場時，選擇一項～\\n•在暮秋騎士上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n•消滅目標神器或結界。\\n•你獲得4點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～樹靈／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94afb329-b648-4687-bd3b-b73c0c171956\', \'multiverseId\': 534473}, \'multiverseid\': 534473}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heroische Intervention\', \'text\': \'Bleibende Karten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Bleib in der Nähe, dann werden ihre zornigen Flammen dir nichts anhaben können."\\n—Galea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532759&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9364c74b-f1cc-4e0a-b1a8-c4ca031898b3\', \'multiverseId\': 532759}, \'multiverseid\': 532759}, {\'name\': \'Intervención heroica\', \'text\': \'Los permanentes que controlas ganan las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"No te separes y sus llamas iracundas no te harán daño".\\n—Galea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532970&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bcd39b6-b6cd-43d6-b1dd-01eed21ec2cc\', \'multiverseId\': 532970}, \'multiverseid\': 532970}, {\'name\': \'Intervention héroïque\', \'text\': "Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Restez près de moi et leurs flammes furieuses ne pourront rien contre vous. »\\n—Galea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533181&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46205da5-18c9-46d1-8198-90e27f573f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 533181}, \'multiverseid\': 533181}, {\'name\': \'Intervento Eroico\', \'text\': \'I permanenti che controlli hanno anti-malocchio e indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Statemi vicini e la furia delle loro fiamme non potrà ferirvi."\\n—Galea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7032fe-ed23-4852-84c1-c9e20bca3e27\', \'multiverseId\': 533392}, \'multiverseid\': 533392}, {\'name\': \'英雄的介入\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは呪禁と破壊不能を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「近くにいて。あいつらの炎は防いでみせるから。」\\n――ゲイリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0b626de-0f5b-4d0f-b1c0-905b5cf3ed09\', \'multiverseId\': 533603}, \'multiverseid\': 533603}, {\'name\': \'Intervenção Heroica\', \'text\': \'As permanentes que você controla ganham resistência a magia e indestrutível até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Não se afaste e suas chamas iradas não ferirão você."\\n— Galea\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cea7139-51ee-4f48-ae6e-1137941c216b\', \'multiverseId\': 533814}, \'multiverseid\': 533814}, {\'name\': \'Героическое Вмешательство\', \'text\': \'Перманенты под вашим контролем получают Порчеустойчивость и Неразрушимость до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Держись поближе, и их гневное пламя не причинит тебе вреда».\\n— Галея\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e7162f-d9af-402d-8f75-ba9a0dc50653\', \'multiverseId\': 534025}, \'multiverseid\': 534025}, {\'name\': \'英勇干预\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物获得辟邪与不灭异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「靠近我，这样他们的激愤烈焰便伤不到你。」\\n～盖莉娅\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caae245b-0fc0-435c-9e29-efa829fb2cfe\', \'multiverseId\': 534236}, \'multiverseid\': 534236}, {\'name\': \'英勇干預\', \'text\': \'由你操控的永久物獲得辟邪與不滅異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「靠近我，這樣他們的激憤烈焰便傷不到你。」\\n～蓋莉婭\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534447&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3ff672e-4e3e-49a9-b1c8-1ac4385d89e6\', \'multiverseId\': 534447}, \'multiverseid\': 534447}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmelswolken-Weite\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Legende besagt, dass ein mächtiger Engel den bedürftigen Pilgern erscheint, die diese luftige Höhe erreichen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532859&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'defc2cc2-ece3-413e-a47a-75b4d9ea9a98\', \'multiverseId\': 532859}, \'multiverseid\': 532859}, {\'name\': \'Expansión Nubeceleste\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuenta la leyenda que un ángel extraordinario se les aparece a los peregrinos en apuros que llegan a estas elevadas alturas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb591e44-d8bd-4798-8bed-724a0ed18d68\', \'multiverseId\': 533070}, \'multiverseid\': 533070}, {\'name\': \'Immensité de Cielcouvert\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "D\'après la légende, un ange puissant apparaît aux pèlerins dans le besoin qui parviennent sur ces nobles hauteurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533281&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a131c093-bbeb-4473-b26e-e7f8d185f737\', \'multiverseId\': 533281}, \'multiverseid\': 533281}, {\'name\': \'Distesa di Cielonube\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'La leggenda narra che un potente angelo attende i pellegrini bisognosi che raggiungono queste altezze vertiginose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d5e5727-d901-4a26-95ad-d78eba633bd0\', \'multiverseId\': 533492}, \'multiverseid\': 533492}, {\'name\': \'広漠なるスカイクラウド\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'伝説によれば、これほどの高所までたどりついた困窮する巡礼者の前には比類なき天使が姿を見せるという。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e649533a-a5fc-4456-8b85-149f8bdd2cbc\', \'multiverseId\': 533703}, \'multiverseid\': 533703}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão de Skycloud\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Diz a lenda que um poderoso anjo aparece aos peregrinos necessitados que alcançam tamanha altura.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97e981e-2e6e-48e8-a822-e3bf8fa4d1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 533914}, \'multiverseid\': 533914}, {\'name\': \'Гладь Небесного Облака\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {W}{U}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Легенда гласит, что могучий ангел является тем паломникам, которые достигают этой головокружительной высоты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3a6a7ce-cf80-441b-b77b-0e5682624ada\', \'multiverseId\': 534125}, \'multiverseid\': 534125}, {\'name\': \'天云旷野\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'有传闻说，只要朝圣客能到达此云巅高地，便会有强大天使应求现身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'257122fe-4106-4ded-b56e-e27b1e4c4259\', \'multiverseId\': 534336}, \'multiverseid\': 534336}, {\'name\': \'天雲曠野\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'有傳聞說，只要朝聖客能到達此雲巔高地，便會有強大天使應求現身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a336c9ab-2abc-4531-9322-1cd8708d8d37\', \'multiverseId\': 534547}, \'multiverseid\': 534547}]', '[{\'name\': \'Himmlisches Geschenk\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn das Himmlische Geschenk ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Heute wird Zendikar triumphieren und unsere Armeen werden mit Engeln fliegen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532662&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b56ae4b7-24d0-456d-82d1-32018da472a2\', \'multiverseId\': 532662}, \'multiverseid\': 532662}, {\'name\': \'Don angelical\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando el Don angelical entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada tiene la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Hoy Zendikar triunfará, y nuestros ejércitos volarán junto a los ángeles".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16363527-e435-4fcd-b8c8-90e0000dbfe9\', \'multiverseId\': 532873}, \'multiverseid\': 532873}, {\'name\': \'Don angélique\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand le Don angélique arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée a le vol.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce jour verra la victoire de Zendikar, et nos armées voleront avec les anges. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfb7a42d-2991-4b0a-b4fc-517158a5a4ae\', \'multiverseId\': 533084}, \'multiverseid\': 533084}, {\'name\': \'Dono Angelico\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nQuando il Dono Angelico entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata ha volare.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar oggi trionferà e i nostri eserciti voleranno con gli angeli."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bad3c7a-4759-4d86-bc60-04d52a6aef32\', \'multiverseId\': 533295}, \'multiverseid\': 533295}, {\'name\': \'天使の贈り物\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\n天使の贈り物が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは飛行を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「ついにゼンディカーに勝利が訪れ、我が軍は天使と共に空を舞うであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19c2e0de-9500-41ae-9c3f-058f74868629\', \'multiverseId\': 533506}, \'multiverseid\': 533506}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva Angelical\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Dádiva Angelical entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nA criatura encantada tem voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Zendikar triunfará hoje e nossos exércitos voarão com os anjos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28e936cf-06f4-4bdd-900e-602a678a0453\', \'multiverseId\': 533717}, \'multiverseid\': 533717}, {\'name\': \'Ангельский Дар\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Ангельский Дар выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nЗачарованное существо имеет Полет.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Сегодня Зендикар одержит победу, и наши армии воспарят вместе с ангелами».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7850c2d9-e4b9-4dd7-9f5d-74aee537d6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 533928}, \'multiverseid\': 533928}, {\'name\': \'天使赋礼\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n当天使赋礼进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物具有飞行异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「赞迪卡今日必得胜，全军与天使共翱翔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9285a5f-6ba5-4136-8fb4-0c8f18e755b5\', \'multiverseId\': 534139}, \'multiverseid\': 534139}, {\'name\': \'天使賦禮\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n當天使賦禮進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n所結附的生物具有飛行異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「贊迪卡今日必得勝，全軍與天使共翱翔。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30324fda-7d1b-40dd-8538-3fc28d846bb8\', \'multiverseId\': 534350}, \'multiverseid\': 534350}]', "[{'name': 'Hoher Markt', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Wenn man es hier nicht kriegen kann, dann nirgendwo auf keiner Welt.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532844&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6a2186b2-02d5-4c09-87a6-fe2af40cc5c7', 'multiverseId': 532844}, 'multiverseid': 532844}, {'name': 'Mercado alto', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Ganas 1 vida.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Si no lo tienen aquí, no lo tienen en ningún mundo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533055&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '10556df2-d5fe-4310-a35e-6138ffdcb59f', 'multiverseId': 533055}, 'multiverseid': 533055}, {'name': 'Haut marché', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Si vous ne le trouvez pas là, vous ne le trouverez nulle part.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533266&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '505a50f5-6f22-4d16-b117-2851de98e8ba', 'multiverseId': 533266}, 'multiverseid': 533266}, {'name': 'Mercato Principale', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifica una creatura: Guadagni 1 punto vita.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Se non lo trovi qui, non lo troverai in nessun altro mondo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533477&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b674674-dea0-4206-8669-b147f09ae754', 'multiverseId': 533477}, 'multiverseid': 533477}, {'name': '高級市場', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは１点のライフを得る。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'ここで手に入らないなら、どの世界へ行っても手に入らないよ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533688&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e154c2de-d13b-4431-87c9-1c7652030879', 'multiverseId': 533688}, 'multiverseid': 533688}, {'name': 'Mercado Alto', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifique uma criatura: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Se não encontrares aqui, não encontras em mundo nenhum.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533899&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27dda4cd-7744-4f8f-9a36-1c2c5de2c4c8', 'multiverseId': 533899}, 'multiverseid': 533899}, {'name': 'Верхний Рынок', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте существо: вы получаете 1 жизнь.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Если этого не найти здесь, то не найти ни в одном из миров.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534110&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abb6437d-a1d9-4be1-b153-801bdc6ab01b', 'multiverseId': 534110}, 'multiverseid': 534110}, {'name': '最高市场', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，牺牲一个生物：你获得1点生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '若是还有这里弄不到的东西，那么恐怕走遍天下也弄不着了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534321&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d4d7df2-cc8e-479e-9d3b-52e759b4b610', 'multiverseId': 534321}, 'multiverseid': 534321}, {'name': '最高市場', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，犧牲一個生物：你獲得1點生命。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '若是還有這裡弄不到的東西，那麼恐怕走遍天下也弄不著了。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534532&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '129c8e0b-ee10-49fc-bcd0-045ccdf88be3', 'multiverseId': 534532}, 'multiverseid': 534532}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hort des Drachen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, lege eine Goldmarke auf den Hort des Drachen.\\n{T}, entferne eine Goldmarke vom Hort des Drachen: Ziehe eine Karte.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532802&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e3ac7e-0629-43a0-9ff5-24d3fc5c0acf\', \'multiverseId\': 532802}, \'multiverseid\': 532802}, {\'name\': \'Botín del dragón\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Dragón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, pon un contador de oro sobre el Botín del dragón.\\n{T}, remover un contador de oro del Botín del dragón: Roba una carta.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c88e9c7-d289-4c7c-9e11-27e9844cf10c\', \'multiverseId\': 533013}, \'multiverseid\': 533013}, {\'name\': \'Butin du dragon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, mettez un marqueur « or » sur le Butin du dragon.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur « or » du Butin du dragon : Piochez une carte.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8287f61c-b9bb-4c58-b002-8d282148611e\', \'multiverseId\': 533224}, \'multiverseid\': 533224}, {\'name\': \'Bottino del Drago\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Drago entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, metti un segnalino oro sul Bottino del Drago.\\n{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino oro dal Bottino del Drago: Pesca una carta.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d29a1338-93f9-4f94-8f3b-8a4fc53733df\', \'multiverseId\': 533435}, \'multiverseid\': 533435}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの財宝\', \'text\': \'ドラゴン１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ドラゴンの財宝の上に黄金カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T}, ドラゴンの財宝の上から黄金カウンター１個を取り除く：カード１枚を引く。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fcf9792-2170-403c-a2dc-fe7e7cd4fcc0\', \'multiverseId\': 533646}, \'multiverseid\': 533646}, {\'name\': \'Tesouro do Dragão\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Dragão entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, coloque um marcador de ouro em Tesouro do Dragão.\\n{T}, remova um marcador de ouro de Tesouro do Dragão: Compre um card.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'705d342f-7b50-45c5-aa20-de78d4d604f9\', \'multiverseId\': 533857}, \'multiverseid\': 533857}, {\'name\': \'Сокровища Дракона\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Дракон выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, положите один жетон золота на Сокровища Дракона.\\n{T}, удалите один жетон золота с Сокровищ Дракона: возьмите карту.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fbcaa61-25e4-4535-a393-8e0dab4bf4aa\', \'multiverseId\': 534068}, \'multiverseid\': 534068}, {\'name\': \'巨龙宝库\', \'text\': \'每当一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，在巨龙宝库上放置一个黄金指示物。\\n{T}，从巨龙宝库上移去一个黄金指示物：抓一张牌。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2d10cdc-b6f2-46ad-ac74-82bfc775c93c\', \'multiverseId\': 534279}, \'multiverseid\': 534279}, {\'name\': \'巨龍寶庫\', \'text\': \'每當一個龍在你的操控下進戰場時，在巨龍寶庫上放置一個黃金指示物。\\n{T}，從巨龍寶庫上移去一個黃金指示物：抽一張牌。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ca0e2f-2af8-4e33-92b3-6dd67f7869d8\', \'multiverseId\': 534490}, \'multiverseid\': 534490}]', "[{'name': 'Hort des Geisterdrachen', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine Speichermarke auf den Hort des Geisterdrachen.\\n{T}, entferne X Speichermarken vom Hort des Geisterdrachen: Erzeuge X Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Drache-Zaubersprüche zu wirken oder Fähigkeiten von Drachen zu aktivieren.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532829&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bfa13ba4-c1b2-4078-959c-749b89de48ef', 'multiverseId': 532829}, 'multiverseid': 532829}, {'name': 'Crisol del dragón espíritu', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador de almacenaje sobre el Crisol del dragón espíritu.\\n{T}, remover X contadores de almacenaje del Crisol del dragón espíritu: Agrega X manás de cualquier combinación de colores. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de Dragón o activar habilidades de Dragones.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533040&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '13944bda-4cca-4f09-9315-bfd398a42af0', 'multiverseId': 533040}, 'multiverseid': 533040}, {'name': 'Creuset du dragon-esprit', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « stock » sur le Creuset du dragon-esprit.\\n{T}, retirez X marqueurs « stock » du Creuset du dragon-esprit : Ajoutez X manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts de dragon ou activer des capacités de dragon.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533251&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '209527bb-18df-4471-8b16-bfede5fffc20', 'multiverseId': 533251}, 'multiverseid': 533251}, {'name': 'Crogiolo dello Spirito Drago', 'text': '{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Metti un segnalino magazzino sul Crogiolo dello Spirito Drago.\\n{T}, Rimuovi X segnalini magazzino dal Crogiolo dello Spirito Drago: Aggiungi X mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie Drago o attivare abilità di Draghi.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533462&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1839710f-1259-4a29-86e6-77a2edc991de', 'multiverseId': 533462}, 'multiverseid': 533462}, {'name': '精霊龍のるつぼ', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：精霊龍のるつぼの上に貯蔵カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T}, 精霊龍のるつぼの上から貯蔵カウンターＸ個を取り除く：望む色の組み合わせのマナＸ点を加える。このマナは、ドラゴン・呪文を唱えるためか、ドラゴンの能力を起動するためにのみ使用できる。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533673&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9da4a649-838b-4066-8aea-65db7da1e1ef', 'multiverseId': 533673}, 'multiverseid': 533673}, {'name': 'Crisol do Dragão Espírito', 'text': '{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Coloque um marcador de estocagem em Crisol do Dragão Espírito.\\n{T}, remova X marcadores de estocagem de Crisol do Dragão Espírito: Adicione X manas em qualquer combinação de cores. Gaste este mana somente para conjurar mágicas de Dragão ou ativar habilidades de Dragões.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533884&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30b6256e-1c50-49af-9249-8f092c4f6a7c', 'multiverseId': 533884}, 'multiverseid': 533884}, {'name': 'Горнило Духа Дракона', 'text': '{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: положите один накопительный жетон на Горнило Духа Дракона.\\n{T}, удалите X накопительных жетонов с Горнила Духа Дракона: добавьте X маны в любой комбинации цветов. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинаний Драконов или на активацию способностей Драконов.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534095&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1f5e198-fc14-4b68-96ca-b6a490441384', 'multiverseId': 534095}, 'multiverseid': 534095}, {'name': '灵龙蛰居', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：在灵龙蛰居上放置一个储藏指示物。\\n{T}，从灵龙蛰居上移去X个储藏指示物：加X点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择。此法术力只能用来施放龙咒语，或是起动龙的异能。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534306&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e2d27d0-1fea-41b4-9294-7060057436ad', 'multiverseId': 534306}, 'multiverseid': 534306}, {'name': '靈龍蟄居', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：在靈龍蟄居上放置一個儲藏指示物。\\n{T}，從靈龍蟄居上移去X個儲藏指示物：加X點魔法力，其顏色組合由你選擇。此魔法力只能用來施放龍咒語，或是起動龍的異能。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534517&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '851ac0f5-27a8-48e7-831b-d6e050859830', 'multiverseId': 534517}, 'multiverseid': 534517}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hortschmelzender Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{3}{R}: Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl. Der Hortschmelzende Drache erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+0, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Artefakts ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Er sammelt die wertvollen Metalle und wandelt dann den Rest in Treibgas um.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532726&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30707d92-8efb-4a13-9f26-dac1c110c12c\', \'multiverseId\': 532726}, \'multiverseid\': 532726}, {\'name\': \'Dragón fundetesoros\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{3}{R}: Destruye el artefacto objetivo. El Dragón fundetesoros obtiene +X/+0 hasta el final del turno, donde X es el valor de maná de ese artefacto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Colecciona los metales preciosos, y luego convierte el resto en propulsor.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9399e59b-d6a2-4f70-8806-db4bc6cae728\', \'multiverseId\': 532937}, \'multiverseid\': 532937}, {\'name\': \'Dragon fondeur de butin\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{3}{R} : Détruisez un artefact ciblé. Le Dragon fondeur de butin gagne +X/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant la valeur de mana de cet artefact.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Il récupère les métaux précieux et transforme ensuite le reste en carburant.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bc06798-7e74-4e84-afd6-201d66a66848\', \'multiverseId\': 533148}, \'multiverseid\': 533148}, {\'name\': \'Drago Fonditesori\', \'text\': "Volare\\n{3}{R}: Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio. Il Drago Fonditesori prende +X/+0 fino alla fine del turno, dove X è il valore di mana di quell\'artefatto.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Accumula metalli preziosi e poi converte il resto in propellente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'723ee94f-0c17-4831-99fd-568c5fa6088f\', \'multiverseId\': 533359}, \'multiverseid\': 533359}, {\'name\': \'蔵製錬のドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{R}：アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。ターン終了時まで、蔵製錬のドラゴンは＋Ｘ/＋０の修整を受ける。Ｘはそのアーティファクトのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'彼は貴重な金属を集め、残りを噴気へと変える。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee05e67a-9e4b-42ec-ad47-cf22b9cc816c\', \'multiverseId\': 533570}, \'multiverseid\': 533570}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Fundidor de Tesouro\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{3}{R}: Destrua o artefato alvo. Dragão Fundidor de Tesouro recebe +X/+0 até o final do turno, sendo X o valor de mana daquele artefato.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Ele recolhe os metais preciosos e depois converte o restante em combustível.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f28dc5b2-376d-4dc5-9ec8-6d038b995b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 533781}, \'multiverseid\': 533781}, {\'name\': \'Дракон, Плавильщик Кладов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{3}{R}: уничтожьте целевой артефакт. Дракон, Плавильщик Кладов получает +X/+0 до конца хода, где Х — мановая ценность того артефакта.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Он собирает драгоценные металлы, а затем преобразует все остальное в топливо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4257535f-b30c-444f-be77-8eac1674aba4\', \'multiverseId\': 533992}, \'multiverseid\': 533992}, {\'name\': \'炼储巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{3}{R}：消灭目标神器。炼储巨龙得+X/+0直到回合结束，X为该神器的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'他收集贵金属，然后将其他的转化为推进燃料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ee965c1-6da4-4643-a928-ed3d7299e5a1\', \'multiverseId\': 534203}, \'multiverseid\': 534203}, {\'name\': \'鍊儲巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{3}{R}：消滅目標神器。鍊儲巨龍得+X/+0直到回合結束，X為該神器的魔法力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'他收集貴金屬，然後將其他的轉化為推進燃料。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4b86f8-d030-4a63-bc57-9a5feb809025\', \'multiverseId\': 534414}, \'multiverseid\': 534414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllischer Tadel\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten bleibende Karten, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, „Wenn diese bleibende Karte dem Spieler, der den Höllischen Tadel gewirkt hat, Schaden zufügt, opfere sie. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Dann brennen wir gemeinsam!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531985&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f2e6109-083c-4eb3-832d-56653e3a50e1\', \'multiverseId\': 531985}, \'multiverseid\': 531985}, {\'name\': \'Reprensión infernal\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, los permanentes que controlan tus oponentes ganan "Cuando este permanente haga daño al jugador que lanzó la Reprensión infernal, sacrifica este permanente. Pierdes 2 vidas".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Arderemos juntos, pues!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b017ea74-1743-4007-886f-709f14b6bc1b\', \'multiverseId\': 532039}, \'multiverseid\': 532039}, {\'name\': \'Blâme infernal\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les permanents que vos adversaires contrôlent acquièrent « Quand ce permanent inflige des blessures au joueur qui a lancé le Blâme infernal, sacrifiez ce permanent. Vous perdez 2 points de vie. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Alors, nous brûlerons ensemble ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ce394a-1808-44c6-ad94-920267fc594c\', \'multiverseId\': 532093}, \'multiverseid\': 532093}, {\'name\': \'Intimorire Infernale\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, i permanenti controllati dai tuoi avversari hanno "Quando questo permanente infligge danno al giocatore che ha lanciato Intimorire Infernale, sacrifica questo permanente. Perdi 2 punti vita".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Allora bruceremo insieme!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479f5186-a7f9-405a-b72f-299e0a505ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 532147}, \'multiverseid\': 532147}, {\'name\': \'ヘリッシュ・リビューク\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、各対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは「このパーマネントがヘリッシュ・リビュークを唱えたプレイヤーにダメージを与えたとき、このパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。あなたは２点のライフを失う。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「ならば諸共に燃えるまで！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532201&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c1ed0d-2ad8-42cc-beb4-6046dfefdfbb\', \'multiverseId\': 532201}, \'multiverseid\': 532201}, {\'name\': \'Repreensão Infernal\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, as permanentes que seus oponentes controlam ganham "Quando esta permanente causar dano ao jogador que conjurou Repreensão Infernal, sacrifique esta permanente. Você perde 2 pontos de vida".\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Então queimaremos juntos!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4cfac2-fc03-4523-b134-a0ca12a0f429\', \'multiverseId\': 532255}, \'multiverseid\': 532255}, {\'name\': \'Адское Возмездие\', \'text\': \'До конца хода перманенты под контролем ваших оппонентов получают способность «Когда этот перманент наносит повреждения игроку, разыгравшему Адское Возмездие, пожертвуйте этот перманент. Вы теряете 2 жизни».\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Тогда мы сгорим вместе!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8696376-6fb0-4ea9-9831-3f289d9187b3\', \'multiverseId\': 532309}, \'multiverseid\': 532309}, {\'name\': \'炼狱叱喝\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由对手操控的永久物获得「当此永久物对施放炼狱叱喝的牌手造成伤害时，牺牲此永久物。你失去2点生命。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「让我们一起受此煎熬！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2a4724-550e-4585-9f18-6285a20cd95e\', \'multiverseId\': 532363}, \'multiverseid\': 532363}, {\'name\': \'煉獄叱喝\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，由對手操控的永久物獲得「當此永久物對施放煉獄叱喝的玩家造成傷害時，犧牲此永久物。你失去2點生命。」\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「讓我們一起受此煎熬！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6eabd848-0395-4078-9310-85837b4740ec\', \'multiverseId\': 532417}, \'multiverseid\': 532417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höllischer Tadel\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten bleibende Karten, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, „Wenn diese bleibende Karte dem Spieler, der den Höllischen Tadel gewirkt hat, Schaden zufügt, opfere sie. Du verlierst 2 Lebenspunkte."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a0df62d-4910-43d9-b830-6a6d88902444\', \'multiverseId\': 531571}, \'multiverseid\': 531571}, {\'name\': \'Reprensión infernal\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, los permanentes que controlan tus oponentes ganan "Cuando este permanente haga daño al jugador que lanzó la Reprensión infernal, sacrifica este permanente. Pierdes 2 vidas".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03c67e4f-41c8-4b69-b42b-c609d4b2021e\', \'multiverseId\': 531627}, \'multiverseid\': 531627}, {\'name\': \'Blâme infernal\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les permanents que vos adversaires contrôlent acquièrent « Quand ce permanent inflige des blessures au joueur qui a lancé le Blâme infernal, sacrifiez ce permanent. Vous perdez 2 points de vie. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531683&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d345c71d-78ae-4c6b-bdaa-24c0c76a86c6\', \'multiverseId\': 531683}, \'multiverseid\': 531683}, {\'name\': \'Intimorire Infernale\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, i permanenti controllati dai tuoi avversari hanno "Quando questo permanente infligge danno al giocatore che ha lanciato Intimorire Infernale, sacrifica questo permanente. Perdi 2 punti vita".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6acbd465-0c45-4a20-a005-844c59d86ee1\', \'multiverseId\': 531739}, \'multiverseid\': 531739}, {\'name\': \'ヘリッシュ・リビューク\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは「このパーマネントがヘリッシュ・リビュークを唱えたプレイヤーにダメージを与えたとき、このパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる。あなたは２点のライフを失う。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bedfd89c-debb-4cde-bc0e-506d972805ac\', \'multiverseId\': 531795}, \'multiverseid\': 531795}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei Schritte nach Norden führen dich in die ungewisse Zukunft, nach Süden in die unruhige Vergangenheit, nach Osten in den heutigen Tag und nach Westen in das große Durcheinander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff042d9a-e933-42bd-990e-3f41e5569eb7\', \'multiverseId\': 532865}, \'multiverseid\': 532865}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Haz dos pasos al norte hacia el futuro inestable, al sur hacia el pasado inquieto, al este hacia el presente o al oeste hacia lo desconocido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c67c59-d94e-4534-83ad-f2d20f8368a4\', \'multiverseId\': 533076}, \'multiverseid\': 533076}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Faites deux pas au nord dans l\'avenir instable, au sud dans le passé agité, à l\'est dans le présent ou à l\'ouest dans le vaste inconnu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533287&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd25018-e35f-484f-bf4a-8225efaa7b67\', \'multiverseId\': 533287}, \'multiverseid\': 533287}, {\'name\': \'Distesa Terramorfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, Sacrifica la Distesa Terramorfica: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Fai due passi a nord nel futuro incerto, a sud nel passato inquieto, a est nel giorno attuale o a ovest nel grande ignoto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2134eb26-7301-4857-bef1-ae793bb67d90\', \'multiverseId\': 533498}, \'multiverseid\': 533498}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'二歩北へ進めば不安定な未来、南へ進めば不穏な過去、東に進めば今日この日、西へ進めば偉大なる未知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5ac756c-e56d-403d-b5bd-d3d584b7f80d\', \'multiverseId\': 533709}, \'multiverseid\': 533709}, {\'name\': \'Vastidão Morfoterrena\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifique Vastidão Morfoterrena: Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Dê dois passos ao norte para o futuro incerto, ao sul para o passado inquieto, ao leste para o presente, ou ao oeste para o grande desconhecido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fe3d49a-32ce-461a-a772-b8daeb64480b\', \'multiverseId\': 533920}, \'multiverseid\': 533920}, {\'name\': \'Просторы Преображенных Земель\', \'text\': \'{T}, пожертвуйте Просторы Преображенных Земель: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Сделай два шага на север — в необитаемое будущее, на юг — в неупокоенное прошлое, на восток — в настоящее или на запад — в великое неизвестное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6c8a0c2-c610-46a1-9b9d-923886c3a830\', \'multiverseId\': 534131}, \'multiverseid\': 534131}, {\'name\': \'地塑旷野\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲地塑旷野：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'迈开两步，向北迈进动荡将来，向南则为无宁过往，向东步回眼下此刻，或向西踏入未知境地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11580b13-24f5-40e4-a544-8ea7f0b2a92a\', \'multiverseId\': 534342}, \'multiverseid\': 534342}, {\'name\': \'地塑曠野\', \'text\': \'{T}，犧牲地塑曠野：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'邁開兩步，向北邁進動盪將來，向南則為無寧過往，向東步回眼下此刻，或向西踏入未知境地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a823f63-b7ef-4ce9-bf0f-83c097410dc4\', \'multiverseId\': 534553}, \'multiverseid\': 534553}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Szene setzen\', \'text\': \'Spektakel {R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Spektakel-Kosten anstatt seiner Manakosten wirken, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat.)\\nSchicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Alle auf ihre Plätze!"\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532729&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a00aa10-1dae-4c6e-9ed0-ad9e7fdd0a6b\', \'multiverseId\': 532729}, \'multiverseid\': 532729}, {\'name\': \'Iluminar el escenario\', \'text\': \'Espectáculo {R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de espectáculo en vez de por su coste de maná si un oponente perdió vidas este turno.)\\nExilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Todo el mundo a sus puestos!".\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fbccb45-2bfc-4d6f-932f-b9d59e9dfcf3\', \'multiverseId\': 532940}, \'multiverseid\': 532940}, {\'name\': \'Éclairer la piste\', \'text\': "Spectacle {R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de spectacle à la place de son coût de mana si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci.)\\nExilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« En place tout le monde ! »\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533151&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'497eddf6-704a-4d77-95da-40c490749897\', \'multiverseId\': 533151}, \'multiverseid\': 533151}, {\'name\': \'Illuminare la Scena\', \'text\': \'Spettacolo {R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di spettacolo invece del suo costo di mana se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno.)\\nEsilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Tutti in posizione!"\\n—Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62d5160e-b795-444a-8853-2edb9036e805\', \'multiverseId\': 533362}, \'multiverseid\': 533362}, {\'name\': \'舞台照らし\', \'text\': \'絢爛{R}（このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていたなら、あなたはこの呪文を、マナ・コストではなく絢爛コストで唱えてもよい。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「皆、持ち場について！」\\n――ジュディス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982021d8-4d2b-4c13-b4ef-ad045b7a3048\', \'multiverseId\': 533573}, \'multiverseid\': 533573}, {\'name\': \'Iluminar o Palco\', \'text\': \'Espetáculo {R} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica por seu custo de espetáculo, em vez de seu custo de mana, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno.)\\nExile os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar esses cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Todos aos seus lugares!"\\n— Judith\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7889eddc-292d-4967-aafa-e6d89c39ff2f\', \'multiverseId\': 533784}, \'multiverseid\': 533784}, {\'name\': \'Зажечь Сцену\', \'text\': \'Зрелище {R} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Зрелища вместо его мана-стоимости, если оппонент терял жизнь(-и) в этом ходу.)\\nИзгоните две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть те карты до конца вашего следующего хода.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Внимание, все по местам!»\\n— Джудит\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'664b1c51-e025-467c-b4e4-346b1b33424f\', \'multiverseId\': 533995}, \'multiverseid\': 533995}, {\'name\': \'照亮舞台\', \'text\': \'揭幕{R}（如果本回合有对手曾失去生命，则你可以支付此咒语的揭幕费用而非法术力费用来施放它。）\\n放逐你牌库顶的两张牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「登台就位！」\\n～裘蒂丝\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7ef9197-616b-4149-8969-b1ba8b40b85c\', \'multiverseId\': 534206}, \'multiverseid\': 534206}, {\'name\': \'照亮舞台\', \'text\': \'揭幕{R}（如果本回合有對手曾失去生命，則你可以支付此咒語的揭幕費用而非魔法力費用來施放它。）\\n放逐你牌庫頂的兩張牌。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以使用這些牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「登台就位！」\\n～裘蒂絲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4701f90-5fe0-4696-81ca-b80f4c575e64\', \'multiverseId\': 534417}, \'multiverseid\': 534417}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ins Gedächtnis verschwinden\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Du ziehst so viele Karten, wie die Stärke der Kreatur beträgt. Bringe sie zu Beginn deines nächsten Versorgungssegments unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers ins Spiel zurück. Falls du dies tust, wirf so viele Karten ab, wie ihre Widerstandskraft beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Aus den Augen, nicht aus dem Sinn.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532794&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d58d025-b52b-4b20-8278-0c31d0aa14f1\', \'multiverseId\': 532794}, \'multiverseid\': 532794}, {\'name\': \'Desvanecerse en la memoria\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Tú robas una cantidad de cartas igual a la fuerza de esa criatura. Al comienzo de tu próximo mantenimiento, regresa esa carta al campo de batalla bajo el control de su propietario. Si lo haces, descarta una cantidad de cartas igual a la resistencia de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'No lo veo, ahora lo creo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d8c6097-35f7-4bb9-92eb-a7d2cb1adf4d\', \'multiverseId\': 533005}, \'multiverseid\': 533005}, {\'name\': \'Disparition dans la mémoire\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée. Vous piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force de cette créature. Au début de votre prochain entretien, renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'un nombre de cartes égal à l\'endurance de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Loin des yeux, proche de l\'esprit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533216&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c680a9-733f-46b4-a6ab-53d48bbc8dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 533216}, \'multiverseid\': 533216}, {\'name\': \'Svanire nella Memoria\', \'text\': "Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Peschi carte pari alla forza di quella creatura. All\'inizio del tuo prossimo mantenimento, rimetti quella carta sul campo di battaglia sotto il controllo del suo proprietario. Se lo fai, scarta carte pari alla costituzione di quella creatura.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Lontano dagli occhi, vicino al cuore.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a5c1b06-6365-46e2-b1de-e5687ef118e8\', \'multiverseId\': 533427}, \'multiverseid\': 533427}, {\'name\': \'記憶への消失\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。あなたはそのクリーチャーのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを引く。次のあなたのアップキープの開始時に、そのカードをオーナーのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。そうしたなら、そのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい枚数のカードを捨てる。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'遠く離れて心の内に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85681a0a-d600-4b43-894c-90928f470fd4\', \'multiverseId\': 533638}, \'multiverseid\': 533638}, {\'name\': \'Desaparecer na Memória\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Você compra uma quantidade de cards igual ao poder daquela criatura. No início de sua próxima manutenção, devolva aquele card ao campo de batalha sob o controle de seu dono. Se fizer isso, descarte uma quantidade de cards igual à resistência daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O que os olhos não veem, a mente apreende.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d8f4a5e-264d-41cf-90f5-79174173a6f8\', \'multiverseId\': 533849}, \'multiverseid\': 533849}, {\'name\': \'Исчезновение в Памяти\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. Вы берете количество карт, равное силе того существа. В начале вашего следующего шага поддержки верните ту карту на поле битвы под контролем ее владельца. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте количество карт, равное выносливости того существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'С глаз долой, в разум вон.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534060&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359fb62c-b1d0-40ba-9619-e7473814ac02\', \'multiverseId\': 534060}, \'multiverseid\': 534060}, {\'name\': \'褪入记忆\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。你抓若干牌，其数量等同于该生物的力量。在你的下一个维持开始时，将该牌在其拥有者的操控下移回战场。若你如此作，则弃若干牌，其数量等同于该生物的防御力。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'眼不见，心挂念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec08680a-6623-4a2b-9193-903ac46862a6\', \'multiverseId\': 534271}, \'multiverseid\': 534271}, {\'name\': \'褪入記憶\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。你抽若干牌，其數量等同於該生物的力量。\\n在你的下一個維持開始時，將該牌在其擁有者的操控下移回戰場。若你如此作，則棄若干牌，其數量等同於該生物的防禦力。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'眼不見，心掛念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534482&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c94f8e-2f96-446b-b1c1-39a1d5400148\', \'multiverseId\': 534482}, \'multiverseid\': 534482}]', '[{\'name\': \'Instabiler Obelisk\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, opfere den Instabilen Obelisken: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Zerfall ist wie das letzte Aufbäumen einer längst vergangenen Zivilisation, die es nicht ertragen kann, in Vergessenheit zu geraten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4415002-30aa-4db6-b43a-bf87bba3b5cb\', \'multiverseId\': 532818}, \'multiverseid\': 532818}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco inestable\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar el Obelisco inestable: Destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Su derrumbamiento es como la insolencia de una civilización largo tiempo extinta y ofendida por haber sido olvidada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2aad561-ad95-4691-ae06-c148acf2e567\', \'multiverseId\': 533029}, \'multiverseid\': 533029}, {\'name\': \'Obélisque instable\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Obélisque instable : Détruisez un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Son effondrement est l\'ultime attaque d\'une civilisation disparue qui refuse de sombrer dans l\'oubli.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533240&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c13248b8-170d-46c3-bf25-ce5b5f79a04c\', \'multiverseId\': 533240}, \'multiverseid\': 533240}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instabile\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Obelisco Instabile: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo crollo è il monito stizzito di una civiltà scomparsa da tempo che non sopporta di essere dimenticata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73271f64-bd02-4851-9cb3-5ec3cc42f75c\', \'multiverseId\': 533451}, \'multiverseid\': 533451}, {\'name\': \'不安定なオベリスク\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{7}, {T}, 不安定なオベリスクを生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'その崩壊は、遠い昔に死に絶えた文明が忘れ去られることへの不満を表す足掻きのようであった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9354b17-649c-4fbc-b908-4e597dc8eb9b\', \'multiverseId\': 533662}, \'multiverseid\': 533662}, {\'name\': \'Obelisco Instável\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifique Obelisco Instável: Destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seu colapso é como a revolta de uma civilização extinta há muito tempo ofendida por ter sido esquecida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a3e584-cce3-431c-9937-eddd5227d40d\', \'multiverseId\': 533873}, \'multiverseid\': 533873}, {\'name\': \'Нестабильный Обелиск\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{7}, {T}, пожертвуйте Нестабильный Обелиск: уничтожьте целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Его падение — как последний удар давно погибшей цивилизации, которая отказывается быть забытой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f456f15c-c4a8-4524-926c-8ff1190e59c8\', \'multiverseId\': 534084}, \'multiverseid\': 534084}, {\'name\': \'不稳定石碑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{7}，{T}，牺牲不稳定石碑：消灭目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'远古文明若遭后人遗忘，定会带来惨烈后果以警醒世人。此座石碑之坍塌亦然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed3d3e08-912c-404d-9437-176068653448\', \'multiverseId\': 534295}, \'multiverseid\': 534295}, {\'name\': \'不穩定石碑\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{7}，{T}，犧牲不穩定石碑：消滅目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'遠古文明若遭後人遺忘，定會帶來慘烈後果以警醒世人。此座石碑之坍塌亦然。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfa2fd35-2a59-4355-b564-6d6b6596579c\', \'multiverseId\': 534506}, \'multiverseid\': 534506}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Chemister\', \'text\': \'Eile\\n{R}, {T}: Schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, opfere den Izzet-Chemister: Wirke eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten, die vom Izzet-Chemister ins Exil geschickt wurden, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532728&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727333b5-889c-4e0e-b62b-48d3c0b9000c\', \'multiverseId\': 532728}, \'multiverseid\': 532728}, {\'name\': \'Quimista ízzet\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\n{R}, {T}: Exilia la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo de tu cementerio.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrificar el Quimista ízzet: Lanza cualquier cantidad de cartas exiliadas con el Quimista ízzet sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40aaf510-d3db-41b1-af48-3b2127c9ff52\', \'multiverseId\': 532939}, \'multiverseid\': 532939}, {\'name\': "Chimiste d\'Izzet", \'text\': "Célérité\\n{R}, {T} : Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée de votre cimetière.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez le Chimiste d\'Izzet : Lancez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes exilées par le Chimiste d\'Izzet sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533150&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80fef07-18d6-44b4-89f5-d8fb3256e53a\', \'multiverseId\': 533150}, \'multiverseid\': 533150}, {\'name\': \'Chimimago Izzet\', \'text\': \'Rapidità\\n{R}, {T}: Esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, Sacrifica il Chimimago Izzet: Lancia un qualsiasi numero di carte esiliate con il Chimimago Izzet senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Goblin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14dffe46-2c49-4af9-a287-c4e3d56b9f31\', \'multiverseId\': 533361}, \'multiverseid\': 533361}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの薬術師\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n{R}, {T}：あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\\n{1}{R}, {T}, イゼットの薬術師を生け贄に捧げる：イゼットの薬術師によって追放されている望む枚数のカードを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533572&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98764663-9b38-4fe2-a162-57c2fed0a177\', \'multiverseId\': 533572}, \'multiverseid\': 533572}, {\'name\': \'Quimiomante Izzet\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\n{R}, {T}: Exile o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo de seu cemitério.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, sacrifique Quimiomante Izzet: Conjure qualquer número de cards exilados com Quimiomante Izzet sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6d711f1-28d6-4d5d-8539-85d8bc2e2be0\', \'multiverseId\': 533783}, \'multiverseid\': 533783}, {\'name\': \'Химик Иззетов\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\n{R}, {T}: изгоните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из вашего кладбища.\\n{1}{R}, {T}, пожертвуйте Химика Иззетов: разыграйте любое количество изгнанных Химиком Иззетов карт заклинаний без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc57771-0052-427e-80d1-5ec097dc6181\', \'multiverseId\': 533994}, \'multiverseid\': 533994}, {\'name\': \'伊捷化学师\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{R}，{T}：将目标瞬间或法术牌从你的坟墓场放逐。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，牺牲伊捷化学师：施放任意数量以伊捷化学师放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21a16067-ecbb-4e4b-b7b5-e17cccaea350\', \'multiverseId\': 534205}, \'multiverseid\': 534205}, {\'name\': \'伊捷化學師\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n{R}，{T}：將目標瞬間或巫術牌從你的墳墓場放逐。\\n{1}{R}，{T}，犧牲伊捷化學師：施放任意數量以伊捷化學師放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07534e95-ac19-42fe-aa3e-776d449b5e69\', \'multiverseId\': 534416}, \'multiverseid\': 534416}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaltäugiger Selkie\', \'text\': \'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nImmer wenn der Kaltäugige Selkie einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Er wandert die alten Nebenflüsse hinauf, die angelegt worden waren, als sich die Merrow noch um die Gezeiten kümmerten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532781&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d56f1fc-6948-40a1-8fa9-b711cfd30dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 532781}, \'multiverseid\': 532781}, {\'name\': \'Selkie de ojos fríos\', \'text\': \'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nSiempre que la Selkie de ojos fríos haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Ella sigue las viejas tradiciones de cuando los merrow todavía daban forma a las mareas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8b848f-6080-455f-a91e-91b41d350734\', \'multiverseId\': 532992}, \'multiverseid\': 532992}, {\'name\': \'Selkie aux yeux glacés\', \'text\': \'Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Selkie aux yeux glacés inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher autant de cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Elle utilise les anciens chenaux construits quand les suires façonnaient encore les marées.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'933f0471-332f-4643-a360-d348892921c6\', \'multiverseId\': 533203}, \'multiverseid\': 533203}, {\'name\': \'Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio\', \'text\': "Passa-Isole (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata fintanto che il giocatore in difesa controlla un\'Isola.)\\nOgniqualvolta la Selkie dagli Occhi di Ghiaccio infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, puoi pescare altrettante carte.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'Segue i vecchi affluenti creati quando i merrow ancora modellavano le maree.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c296d5c2-ec16-430f-b48f-eb4db819cf24\', \'multiverseId\': 533414}, \'multiverseid\': 533414}, {\'name\': \'冷淡なセルキー\', \'text\': \'島渡り（防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\n冷淡なセルキーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'メロウがまだ潮汐を形作っていた頃、彼女は古き支流に従っていた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c01adfb-61bb-4f78-a51f-94c06c79768d\', \'multiverseId\': 533625}, \'multiverseid\': 533625}, {\'name\': \'Selkie Olhos-frios\', \'text\': \'Travessia de ilha (Esta criatura não poderá ser bloqueada enquanto o jogador defensor controlar uma Ilha.)\\nToda vez que Selkie Olhos-frios causa dano de combate a um jogador, você pode comprar aquela quantidade de cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Ela segue os antigos afluentes construídos quando os sirenídeos ainda moldavam as marés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8a06203-3c52-4606-a744-9ae54256fea0\', \'multiverseId\': 533836}, \'multiverseid\': 533836}, {\'name\': \'Хладноокая Селки\', \'text\': \'Знание Островов (Это существо не может быть заблокировано, пока защищающийся игрок контролирует Остров.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Хладноокая Селки наносит боевые повреждения игроку, вы можете взять такое же количество карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Она путешествует по старым притокам, проложенным, когда мерроу еще управляли приливами.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27041789-d21e-4567-83d5-eed9fafa901d\', \'multiverseId\': 534047}, \'multiverseid\': 534047}, {\'name\': \'冷眼海豹妖\', \'text\': \'海岛行者（只要防御牌手操控海岛，此生物便不能被阻挡。）\\n每当冷眼海豹妖对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'当美洛仍能塑潮时，她只待在古老的支流里。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb3d7d18-8405-4ce5-a773-17f7a2ece83f\', \'multiverseId\': 534258}, \'multiverseid\': 534258}, {\'name\': \'冷眼海豹妖\', \'text\': \'海島行者（只要防禦玩家操控海島，此生物便不能被阻擋。）\\n每當冷眼海豹妖對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，你可以抽等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'當美洛仍能塑潮時，她只待在古老的支流裡。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6335903-7055-4fbc-aea6-a123111a6aaa\', \'multiverseId\': 534469}, \'multiverseid\': 534469}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karazikar der Augentyrann\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spieler angreifst, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der Spieler kontrolliert, und stachle sie an. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen anderen deiner Gegner angreift, zieht du und der angreifende Spieler jeweils eine Karte und verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Betrachter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d388ddb-ad28-4eac-91fc-18a24e818ae4\', \'multiverseId\': 531874}, \'multiverseid\': 531874}, {\'name\': \'Karázikar, el ojo tirano\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques a un jugador, gira la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador e incítala. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que un oponente ataque a otro de tus oponentes, el jugador atacante y tú roban cada uno una carta y pierden 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Contemplador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b046aca-94b0-4331-a2f3-ca9132999214\', \'multiverseId\': 531878}, \'multiverseid\': 531878}, {\'name\': \'Karazikar, le despote tyrannœil\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez un joueur, engagez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle et incitez-la. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire attaque un autre de vos adversaires, le joueur attaquant et vous piochez chacun une carte et perdez chacun 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tyrannœil\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531882&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d362243-8b1c-475c-b96c-89f55fd79a83\', \'multiverseId\': 531882}, \'multiverseid\': 531882}, {\'name\': "Karazikar, l\'Occhio Tiranno", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi una giocatore, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore e spronala. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario attacca un altro dei tuoi avversari, tu e il giocatore attaccante pescate una carta e perdete 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Beholder\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10859fcb-5f82-4dc8-bc2a-4e0729657f0d\', \'multiverseId\': 531886}, \'multiverseid\': 531886}, {\'name\': \'ひとつ目の暴君、カラジカール\', \'text\': \'あなたがプレイヤー１人を攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップし、使嗾する。（あなたの次のターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n対戦相手１人が他のあなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、あなたとその攻撃プレイヤーはそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ビホルダー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac8303a1-371d-4217-b51d-080c0fbba47e\', \'multiverseId\': 531890}, \'multiverseid\': 531890}, {\'name\': \'Karazikar, o Olho Tirano\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você atacar um jogador, vire a criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla e atice-a. (Até seu próximo turno, aquela criatura ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que um oponente ataca outro de seus oponentes, você e o jogador atacante compram um card e perdem um ponto de vida cada um.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Observador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1665f421-3117-44ef-be22-2b4795f336fd\', \'multiverseId\': 531894}, \'multiverseid\': 531894}, {\'name\': \'Каразикар, Око-Тиран\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы атакуете игрока, поверните целевое существо под контролем того игрока и разъярите его. (До вашего следующего хода то существо атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент атакует другого вашего оппонента, вы и атакующий игрок берете по одной карте и теряете по 1 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Злобоглаз\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e44ec94a-b5a1-4b89-9955-fd56a83aa215\', \'multiverseId\': 531898}, \'multiverseid\': 531898}, {\'name\': \'巨眼暴君卡拉兹卡\', \'text\': \'每当你攻击任一牌手时，横置目标由该牌手操控的生物并煽惑它。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当任一对手攻击你的另一位对手时，你和该攻击牌手各抓一张牌并失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～眼魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f71ec7ed-2272-451b-bdfe-31ac9ce84e07\', \'multiverseId\': 531902}, \'multiverseid\': 531902}, {\'name\': \'巨眼暴君卡拉茲卡\', \'text\': \'每當你攻擊任一玩家時，橫置目標由該玩家操控的生物並煽惑它。（直到你的下一個回合，該生物每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當任一對手攻擊你的另一位對手時，你和該攻擊玩家各抽一張牌並失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～眼魔\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638834c0-b8a5-497c-ad12-7fa42047d3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 531906}, \'multiverseid\': 531906}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karazikar der Augentyrann\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spieler angreifst, tappe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die der Spieler kontrolliert, und stachle sie an.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen anderen deiner Gegner angreift, zieht du und der angreifende Spieler jeweils eine Karte und verliert 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Betrachter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531595&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1112a30a-b6b3-43c3-977a-e42d13a99238\', \'multiverseId\': 531595}, \'multiverseid\': 531595}, {\'name\': \'Karázikar, el ojo tirano\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ataques a un jugador, gira la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador e incítala.\\nSiempre que un oponente ataque a otro de tus oponentes, el jugador atacante y tú roban cada uno una carta y pierden 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Contemplador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a56a7f1-6fa8-42e9-ba19-ed6577fad0a8\', \'multiverseId\': 531651}, \'multiverseid\': 531651}, {\'name\': \'Karazikar, le despote tyrannœil\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous attaquez un joueur, engagez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle et incitez-la.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire attaque un autre de vos adversaires, le joueur attaquant et vous piochez chacun une carte et perdez chacun 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tyrannœil\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531707&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71322063-86f4-4d02-898f-259fe7b71603\', \'multiverseId\': 531707}, \'multiverseid\': 531707}, {\'name\': "Karazikar, l\'Occhio Tiranno", \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta attacchi un giocatore, TAPpa una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore e spronala.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario attacca un altro dei tuoi avversari, tu e il giocatore attaccante pescate una carta e perdete 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Beholder\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5695dc56-fc72-45db-9217-53abe860a1ed\', \'multiverseId\': 531763}, \'multiverseid\': 531763}, {\'name\': \'ひとつ目の暴君、カラジカール\', \'text\': \'あなたがプレイヤー１人を攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それをタップし、使嗾する。\\n対戦相手１人が他のあなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、あなたとその攻撃プレイヤーはそれぞれ、カード１枚を引き１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ビホルダー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531819&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e25ea1d-a672-4ec9-aeef-d49cc237ff49\', \'multiverseId\': 531819}, \'multiverseid\': 531819}]', '[{\'name\': \'Karmischer Begleiter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Schutz vor Schwarz\\nEcho {3}{W}{W} (Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls diese bleibende Karte seit Beginn deines letzten Versorgungssegments unter deine Kontrolle gekommen ist, opfere sie, es sei denn, du bezahlst ihre Echokosten.)\\nWenn der Karmische Begleiter ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Geist\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532666&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83a711f-9f23-4b48-88c0-c072379ad608\', \'multiverseId\': 532666}, \'multiverseid\': 532666}, {\'name\': \'Guía kármica\', \'text\': \'Vuela, protección contra negro.\\nEco {3}{W}{W}. (Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si esto entró bajo tu control desde el comienzo de tu último mantenimiento, sacrifícalo a menos que pagues su coste de eco.)\\nCuando la Guía kármica entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b3b0d7f-9251-4078-bf90-80e4e82f20f6\', \'multiverseId\': 532877}, \'multiverseid\': 532877}, {\'name\': \'Guide karmique\', \'text\': "Vol, protection contre le noir\\nÉcho {3}{W}{W} (Au début de votre entretien, si ce permanent est passé sous votre contrôle depuis le début de votre dernier entretien, sacrifiez-le à moins que vous ne payiez son coût d\'écho.)\\nQuand le Guide karmique arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange et esprit\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533088&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a933e2b-0a2e-4175-9aa1-919925237d84\', \'multiverseId\': 533088}, \'multiverseid\': 533088}, {\'name\': \'Guida del Karma\', \'text\': "Volare, protezione dal nero\\nEco {3}{W}{W} (All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se questo permanente è entrato sotto il tuo controllo dall\'inizio del tuo ultimo mantenimento, sacrificalo a meno che non paghi il suo costo di eco.)\\nQuando la Guida del Karma entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a9310de-5723-49b2-bfdc-cea941c0508f\', \'multiverseId\': 533299}, \'multiverseid\': 533299}, {\'name\': \'霊体の先達\', \'text\': \'飛行、プロテクション（黒）\\nエコー{3}{W}{W}（あなたのアップキープの開始時に、これが直前のあなたのアップキープの開始時よりも後にあなたのコントロール下になっていた場合、これのエコー・コストを支払わないかぎりこれを生け贄に捧げる。）\\n霊体の先達が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・スピリット\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'765f9ab4-e26d-4487-8ee0-87f928988e95\', \'multiverseId\': 533510}, \'multiverseid\': 533510}, {\'name\': \'Guia Cármico\', \'text\': \'Voar, proteção contra o preto\\nEco {3}{W}{W} (No início de sua manutenção, se este card passou ao seu controle desde o início de sua última manutenção, sacrifique-o, a menos que você pague seu custo de eco.)\\nQuando Guia Cármico entrar no campo de batalha, devolva ao campo de batalha o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo Espírito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a1ac2b6-1c68-4f68-a855-aa231091f261\', \'multiverseId\': 533721}, \'multiverseid\': 533721}, {\'name\': \'Кармическая Проводница\', \'text\': \'Полет, Защита от черного\\nЭхо {3}{W}{W} (В начале вашего шага поддержки, если этот объект попал под ваш контроль с момента начала вашего предыдущего шага поддержки, пожертвуйте его, если вы не заплатите его стоимость Эха.)\\nКогда Кармическая Проводница выходит на поле битвы, верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел Дух\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c0532a-722f-4382-868a-6043c68ac1db\', \'multiverseId\': 533932}, \'multiverseid\': 533932}, {\'name\': \'宿命导士\', \'text\': \'飞行，反黑保护\\n返响{3}{W}{W}（在你的维持开始时，若你在你前一个维持开始后才操控它，则除非你支付其返响费用，否则牺牲之。）\\n当宿命导士进战场时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／精怪\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd25a298-f8cb-4e70-8315-58915b15e7e3\', \'multiverseId\': 534143}, \'multiverseid\': 534143}, {\'name\': \'宿命導士\', \'text\': \'飛行，反黑保護\\n返響{3}{W}{W}（在你的維持開始時，若你在你前一個維持開始後才操控它，則除非你支付其返響費用，否則犧牲之。）\\n當宿命導士進戰場時，將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使／精靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89174ce0-bf1b-45a3-97d3-0c58e4b48510\', \'multiverseId\': 534354}, \'multiverseid\': 534354}]', "[{'name': 'Kenriths Verwandlung', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nWenn Kenriths Verwandlung ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur verliert alle Fähigkeiten und ist eine grüne Hirsch-Kreatur mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 3/3. (Sie verliert alle anderen Karten- und Kreaturentypen.)', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532760&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff679cdb-f821-4346-b4e2-a39a432fedfb', 'multiverseId': 532760}, 'multiverseid': 532760}, {'name': 'La transformación de Kenrith', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nCuando La transformación de Kenrith entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa criatura encantada pierde todas las habilidades y es una criatura Alce verde con fuerza y resistencia base de 3/3. (Pierde todos los otros tipos de carta y de criatura.)', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532971&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cb014b4-2eec-4eb0-8bc0-38aa3b3830ae', 'multiverseId': 532971}, 'multiverseid': 532971}, {'name': 'Transformation de Kenrith', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nQuand la Transformation de Kenrith arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLa créature enchantée perd toutes ses capacités et est une créature verte Élan avec une force et une endurance de base de 3/3. (Elle perd tous ses autres types de carte et types de créature.)', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533182&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f3eec05a-0869-4259-960c-4d659b0b714b', 'multiverseId': 533182}, 'multiverseid': 533182}, {'name': 'Trasformazione di Kenrith', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nQuando la Trasformazione di Kenrith entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa creatura incantata perde tutte le abilità ed è una creatura Alce verde con forza e costituzione base 3/3. (Perde tutti gli altri tipi di carta e di creatura.)', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533393&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88900832-a333-42b4-8023-ceb1d5c7abeb', 'multiverseId': 533393}, 'multiverseid': 533393}, {'name': 'ケンリスの変身', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nケンリスの変身が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは能力をすべて失い、基本のパワーとタフネスが３/３の緑の大鹿・クリーチャーである。（それは他のすべてのカード・タイプとクリーチャー・タイプを失う。）', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533604&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '919e4007-1f7e-456b-b4b2-6cb1068203e9', 'multiverseId': 533604}, 'multiverseid': 533604}, {'name': 'Transformação de Kenrith', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nQuando Transformação de Kenrith entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nA criatura encantada perde todas as habilidades e é uma criatura Alce verde com poder e resistência básicos 3/3. (Ela perde todos os outros tipos de card e criatura.)', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533815&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ec7217eb-3c45-415c-9ce1-9e61807c2cc5', 'multiverseId': 533815}, 'multiverseid': 533815}, {'name': 'Преображение Кенрита', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nКогда Преображение Кенрита выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nЗачарованное существо теряет все способности и является существом зеленый Вапити с базовыми силой и выносливостью 3/3. (Оно теряет все другие типы карт и типы существ.)', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534026&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '334ca003-a075-4c29-8143-e671a2fa0421', 'multiverseId': 534026}, 'multiverseid': 534026}, {'name': '肯理斯化身', 'text': '结附于生物\\n当肯理斯化身进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的生物失去所有异能，且是基础力量与防御力为3/3的绿色麋鹿生物。（它会失去其他牌张类别和生物类别。）', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534237&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6d79a0a5-d145-49c0-880c-52d535ccf57a', 'multiverseId': 534237}, 'multiverseid': 534237}, {'name': '肯理斯化身', 'text': '結附於生物\\n當肯理斯化身進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n所結附的生物失去所有異能，且是基礎力量與防禦力為3/3的綠色麋鹿生物。（它會失去其他牌張類別和生物類別。）', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534448&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '606acb39-1afe-4c1e-ade5-5cb2fda31a96', 'multiverseId': 534448}, 'multiverseid': 534448}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kettenreaktion\', \'text\': \'Die Kettenreaktion fügt jeder Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Kreaturen im Spiel ist.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir bereiten uns auch auf das Unwahrscheinliche vor, falls mal der Blitz an einem Ort doppelt oder überall gleichzeitig einschlägt."\\n—Nundari, Hauptmann der Miliz von Seetor\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532714&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33c6f543-f681-42d9-890c-d6695f6a93e3\', \'multiverseId\': 532714}, \'multiverseid\': 532714}, {\'name\': \'Reacción en cadena\', \'text\': \'La Reacción en cadena hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura, donde X es la cantidad de criaturas en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Entrenamos para lo improbable, como un relámpago cayendo dos veces en el mismo lugar, o cayendo en todos lados al mismo tiempo".\\n—Nundari, capitán de la milicia de Portal Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfa52bf7-3890-4a47-83e8-e1d2e95f7466\', \'multiverseId\': 532925}, \'multiverseid\': 532925}, {\'name\': \'Réaction en chaîne\', \'text\': \'La Réaction en chaîne inflige X blessures à chaque créature, X étant le nombre de créatures sur le champ de bataille.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Nous nous entraînons à confronter l\'improbable, comme la foudre frappant deux fois au même endroit, ou partout à la fois. »\\n—Nundari, capitaine de la milice de Porte des Mers", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7bd9af4-c408-4913-81d8-9124c0639420\', \'multiverseId\': 533136}, \'multiverseid\': 533136}, {\'name\': \'Reazione a Catena\', \'text\': \'La Reazione a Catena infligge X danni a ogni creatura, dove X è il numero di creature sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci addestriamo per affrontare l\\\'improbabile, come un fulmine che colpisca lo stesso luogo due volte od ogni luogo contemporaneamente."\\n—Nundari, capitano di milizia di Portale Marino\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87ebaae6-7d4f-45ac-b060-1b4fa18a69bc\', \'multiverseId\': 533347}, \'multiverseid\': 533347}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反応\', \'text\': \'連鎖反応は各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。Ｘは戦場にあるクリーチャーの数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我々はありえなさそうなことに対して訓練をしています。雷が同じ場所に二度落ちるとか、そこらじゅうに同時に落ちるとか。」\\n――海門の民兵隊長、ナンダーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1b83113-461f-4b3d-8a9d-747d85ba15d8\', \'multiverseId\': 533558}, \'multiverseid\': 533558}, {\'name\': \'Reação em Cadeia\', \'text\': \'Reação em Cadeia causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura, sendo X o número de criaturas no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nós treinamos para o improvável, como um raio atingir o mesmo lugar duas vezes ou atingir todos os lugares de uma vez só."\\n— Nundari, capitão da milícia de Portão Marinho\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73260003-2a3a-4021-a52a-7ef69349da39\', \'multiverseId\': 533769}, \'multiverseid\': 533769}, {\'name\': \'Цепная Реакция\', \'text\': \'Цепная Реакция наносит X повреждений каждому существу, где X — количество существ на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы готовимся к маловероятному: например, если молния вдруг ударит дважды в одно и то же место, или же, наоборот, сразу везде».\\n— Нундари, капитан мореградского ополчения\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c067493-1453-42cc-8549-34afe8ca2498\', \'multiverseId\': 533980}, \'multiverseid\': 533980}, {\'name\': \'连锁反应\', \'text\': \'连锁反应对每个生物各造成X点伤害，X为战场上的生物数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「我们的训练是要应付不可能的事，例如闪电两次都落在同一个地方，或是一次落在所有地方。」\\n～海户义勇军队长努达力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573a7fd6-fe71-4bfc-b20f-6927b3682862\', \'multiverseId\': 534191}, \'multiverseid\': 534191}, {\'name\': \'連鎖反應\', \'text\': \'連鎖反應對每個生物各造成X點傷害，X為戰場上的生物數量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「我們的訓練是要應付不可能的事，例如閃電兩次都落在同一個地方，或是一次落在所有地方。」\\n～海戶義勇軍隊長努達力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d84d7aee-c361-4ecd-ada6-33f74268297b\', \'multiverseId\': 534402}, \'multiverseid\': 534402}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klauth, unangefochtenes Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Klauth, unangefochtenes Urwesen, angreift, erzeuge X Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der angreifenden Kreaturen ist. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd26889d-e70f-430e-af8e-c07bb7acd291\', \'multiverseId\': 531596}, \'multiverseid\': 531596}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, anciano sin igual\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que Klauth, anciano sin igual ataque, agrega X manás de cualquier combinación de colores, donde X es la fuerza total de las criaturas atacantes. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe7d3c6-3d7b-4409-bec5-5961bbd64fb3\', \'multiverseId\': 531652}, \'multiverseid\': 531652}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, ancêtre sans égal\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Klauth, ancêtre sans égal attaque, ajoutez X manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix, X étant la force totale des créatures attaquantes. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531708&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac3fb971-1a18-4557-a094-43a84f69912e\', \'multiverseId\': 531708}, \'multiverseid\': 531708}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, Antico Senza Rivali\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Klauth, Antico Senza Rivali attacca, aggiungi X mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori, dove X è la forza totale delle creature attaccanti. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie. Fino alla fine del turno, non perdi questo mana al termine di ogni fase o sottofase.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c452e5f0-250a-4195-9fe8-a6c02a857173\', \'multiverseId\': 531764}, \'multiverseid\': 531764}, {\'name\': \'無双の古きもの、クラウス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n無双の古きもの、クラウスが攻撃するたび、望む色の組み合わせのマナＸ点を加える。Ｘは、すべての攻撃クリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。このマナは呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2151484-2153-447a-939a-d064a3ad3341\', \'multiverseId\': 531820}, \'multiverseid\': 531820}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klauth, unangefochtenes Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Klauth, unangefochtenes Urwesen, angreift, erzeuge X Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben, wobei X gleich der Gesamtstärke der angreifenden Kreaturen ist. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531875&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'047bd560-d555-4ca6-8358-9be96931a6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 531875}, \'multiverseid\': 531875}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, anciano sin igual\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que Klauth, anciano sin igual ataque, agrega X manás de cualquier combinación de colores, donde X es la fuerza total de las criaturas atacantes. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dc7d222-4f0e-4d13-880c-0c03b6c0ef5c\', \'multiverseId\': 531879}, \'multiverseid\': 531879}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, ancêtre sans égal\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Klauth, ancêtre sans égal attaque, ajoutez X manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix, X étant la force totale des créatures attaquantes. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531883&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34741ca0-b65a-4d57-8454-bf74b7196ae0\', \'multiverseId\': 531883}, \'multiverseid\': 531883}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, Antico Senza Rivali\', \'text\': \'Volare, rapidità\\nOgniqualvolta Klauth, Antico Senza Rivali attacca, aggiungi X mana in qualsiasi combinazione di colori, dove X è la forza totale delle creature attaccanti. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare magie. Fino alla fine del turno, non perdi questo mana al termine di ogni fase o sottofase.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45b73502-3d75-4ea5-a9f1-bdb6692dc7d8\', \'multiverseId\': 531887}, \'multiverseid\': 531887}, {\'name\': \'無双の古きもの、クラウス\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n無双の古きもの、クラウスが攻撃するたび、望む色の組み合わせのマナＸ点を加える。Ｘは、すべての攻撃クリーチャーのパワーの合計に等しい。このマナは呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f6799b7-20e2-44e8-aacc-dc392d37651b\', \'multiverseId\': 531891}, \'multiverseid\': 531891}, {\'name\': \'Klauth, Ancião Inigualável\', \'text\': \'Voar, ímpeto\\nToda vez que Klauth, Ancião Inigualável, atacar, adicione X manas em qualquer combinação de cores, sendo X o poder total das criaturas atacantes. Gaste esse mana somente para conjurar mágicas. Até o final do turno, você não perde esse mana conforme as etapas e fases terminam.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d99ee87-f467-4eea-b506-905e2a655876\', \'multiverseId\': 531895}, \'multiverseid\': 531895}, {\'name\': \'Клаут, Непобедимый Древний\', \'text\': \'Полет, Ускорение\\nКаждый раз, когда Клаут, Непобедимый Древний атакует, добавьте Х маны в любой комбинации цветов, где Х — суммарная сила атакующих существ. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинаний. До конца хода вы не теряете эту ману по окончании шагов и фаз.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aba15b2-d56c-424e-82fe-c34d4c2f9889\', \'multiverseId\': 531899}, \'multiverseid\': 531899}, {\'name\': \'旷代古龙克劳斯\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当旷代古龙克劳斯攻击时，加X点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择，X为所有进行攻击之生物的力量总和。此法术力只能用来施放咒语。直到回合结束，你不会因步骤与阶段结束失去这份法术力。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056fc3c7-b9ba-4780-9766-1cb70e079792\', \'multiverseId\': 531903}, \'multiverseid\': 531903}, {\'name\': \'曠代古龍克勞斯\', \'text\': \'飛行，敏捷\\n每當曠代古龍克勞斯攻擊時，加X點魔法力，其顏色組合由你選擇，X為所有進行攻擊之生物的力量總和。此魔法力只能用來施放咒語。直到回合結束，你不會因步驟與階段結束失去這份魔法力。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726bdcd4-1f1c-49ef-b9cf-29309c88dea8\', \'multiverseId\': 531907}, \'multiverseid\': 531907}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klauths Wille\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines. Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du beides bestimmen.\\n• Feueratem — Klauths Wille fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Relikte zerschmettern — Zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531597&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28d61cae-17f8-47ee-b62b-92aedfe9c47e\', \'multiverseId\': 531597}, \'multiverseid\': 531597}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad de Klauth\', \'text\': \'Elige uno. Si controlas un comandante al lanzar este hechizo, puedes elegir los dos.\\n• Escupir llamas — La Voluntad de Klauth hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar.\\n• Destruir reliquias — Destruye hasta X artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a834df-ff54-4a41-8836-bb0c7e63a6de\', \'multiverseId\': 531653}, \'multiverseid\': 531653}, {\'name\': \'Volonté de Klauth\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un. Si vous contrôlez un commandant au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez choisir les deux.\\n• Souffle de flammes — La Volonté de Klauth inflige X blessures à chaque créature sans le vol.\\n• Fracas de reliques — Détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531709&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea77a480-ee55-42b7-bc7f-5c388026604f\', \'multiverseId\': 531709}, \'multiverseid\': 531709}, {\'name\': \'Volontà di Klauth\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno. Se controlli un comandante mentre lanci questa magia, puoi scegliere entrambi.\\n• Soffio di Fuoco — La Volontà di Klauth infligge X danni a ogni creatura senza volare.\\n• Distruggere le Reliquie — Distruggi fino a X artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67b6b52-1b49-49a0-8b9d-4a1f5dbb17a5\', \'multiverseId\': 531765}, \'multiverseid\': 531765}, {\'name\': \'クラウスの意志\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。この呪文を唱える際にあなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたは両方を選んでもよい。\\n• ブリーズ・フレイム ― クラウスの意志は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n• スマッシュ・レリクス ― アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3d23b19-f21d-4b18-baae-25293bc2e622\', \'multiverseId\': 531821}, \'multiverseid\': 531821}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klauths Wille\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines. Falls du einen Kommandeur kontrollierst, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du beides bestimmen.\\n• Feueratem — Klauths Wille fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Relikte zerschmettern — Zerstöre bis zu X Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83af930a-c05f-44e6-bb87-ecbea828eea7\', \'multiverseId\': 532008}, \'multiverseid\': 532008}, {\'name\': \'Voluntad de Klauth\', \'text\': \'Elige uno. Si controlas un comandante al lanzar este hechizo, puedes elegir los dos.\\n• Escupir llamas — La Voluntad de Klauth hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar.\\n• Destruir reliquias — Destruye hasta X artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6bbd416-ce62-4c74-9d5d-d6eeefab7222\', \'multiverseId\': 532062}, \'multiverseid\': 532062}, {\'name\': \'Volonté de Klauth\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un. Si vous contrôlez un commandant au moment où vous lancez ce sort, vous pouvez choisir les deux.\\n• Souffle de flammes — La Volonté de Klauth inflige X blessures à chaque créature sans le vol.\\n• Fracas de reliques — Détruisez jusqu\'à X artefacts et/ou enchantements ciblés.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc8eb10e-e2e0-45f9-bd71-4f02bf765baa\', \'multiverseId\': 532116}, \'multiverseid\': 532116}, {\'name\': \'Volontà di Klauth\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno. Se controlli un comandante mentre lanci questa magia, puoi scegliere entrambi.\\n• Soffio di Fuoco — La Volontà di Klauth infligge X danni a ogni creatura senza volare.\\n• Distruggere le Reliquie — Distruggi fino a X artefatti e/o incantesimi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a4f0acd-885f-4427-b036-2f47aba1188d\', \'multiverseId\': 532170}, \'multiverseid\': 532170}, {\'name\': \'クラウスの意志\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。この呪文を唱える際にあなたが統率者をコントロールしているなら、あなたは両方を選んでもよい。\\n• ブリーズ・フレイム ― クラウスの意志は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\\n• スマッシュ・レリクス ― アーティファクトやエンチャントのうち最大Ｘ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532224&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fe7664c-e6d7-4b2b-add0-aed561cd7c3f\', \'multiverseId\': 532224}, \'multiverseid\': 532224}, {\'name\': \'Vontade de Klauth\', \'text\': \'Escolha um. Se você controla um comandante conforme conjura esta mágica, você pode escolher ambos.\\n• Soprar chamas — Vontade de Klauth causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar.\\n• Quebrar relíquias — Destrua até X artefatos e/ou encantamentos alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2f43dde-28f4-4b5e-9a8f-bcf6e4bc5550\', \'multiverseId\': 532278}, \'multiverseid\': 532278}, {\'name\': \'Воля Клаута\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно. Если при разыгрывании этого заклинания у вас под контролем есть командир, вы можете выбрать оба.\\n• Дыхание огнем — Воля Клаута наносит X повреждений каждому существу без Полета.\\n• Сокрушение реликвий — Уничтожьте не более X целевых артефактов и/или чар.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81c3bddb-5e69-4530-816e-a93ccb363128\', \'multiverseId\': 532332}, \'multiverseid\': 532332}, {\'name\': \'克劳斯的意志\', \'text\': \'选择一项。如果你于施放此咒语时操控指挥官，则你可以两项都选。\\n•喷吐烈焰～克劳斯的意志对每个不具飞行异能的生物各造成X点伤害。\\n•粉碎遗宝～消灭至多X个目标神器和／或结界。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a5efad4-da1c-4e7c-8009-4aee4916977f\', \'multiverseId\': 532386}, \'multiverseid\': 532386}, {\'name\': \'克勞斯的意志\', \'text\': \'選擇一項。如果你於施放此咒語時操控指揮官，則你可以兩項都選。\\n‧噴吐烈焰～克勞斯的意志對每個不具飛行異能的生物各造成X點傷害。\\n‧粉碎遺寶～消滅至多X個目標神器和／或結界。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca82ba5-2774-4f54-a21f-3a9f66cd6ceb\', \'multiverseId\': 532440}, \'multiverseid\': 532440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolossale Erhabenheit\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Macht errichtet nicht nur Imperien. Sie beschützt sie auch."\\n—Inti, Ritter des Imperiums der Sonne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532752&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c185ad18-db96-4518-9176-f7119aa597fe\', \'multiverseId\': 532752}, \'multiverseid\': 532752}, {\'name\': \'Majestad colosal\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El poder no solo erige imperios, también los protege".\\n—Inti, caballero del Imperio del Sol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1bb4d13-1d57-42e8-a9a0-b433b92d9551\', \'multiverseId\': 532963}, \'multiverseid\': 532963}, {\'name\': \'Majesté colossale\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La puissance ne construit pas simplement des empires. Elle les protège. »\\n—Inti, chevalier de l\'Empire du Soleil", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533174&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01dd0b8e-6b91-4ccf-8a66-7249e01ddd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 533174}, \'multiverseid\': 533174}, {\'name\': \'Maestà Colossale\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, se controlli una creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"La potenza non si limita a costruire imperi. Deve anche proteggerli."\\n—Inti, cavaliere dell\\\'Impero del Sole\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25d61417-814e-48f2-b6d1-8fb671eaa0ee\', \'multiverseId\': 533385}, \'multiverseid\': 533385}, {\'name\': \'巨大な威厳\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャーをコントロールしている場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「覇権は帝国を作り上げるだけではない。帝国を守っているのだ。」\\n――太陽帝国の騎士、インティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7d59a0c-1bfd-439f-82ed-3931eea2e1f2\', \'multiverseId\': 533596}, \'multiverseid\': 533596}, {\'name\': \'Majestade Colossal\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, se você controlar uma criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A força não apenas constrói impérios. Ela os protege."\\n— Inti, cavaleira do Império do Sol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ebaa93-6f7c-410e-ac03-64001f5de45a\', \'multiverseId\': 533807}, \'multiverseid\': 533807}, {\'name\': \'Колоссальное Величие\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки, если вы контролируете существо с силой не менее 4, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Могущество не только строит империи. Оно защищает их».\\n— Инти, рыцарь Империи Солнца\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b55c87-b9bd-42df-8dad-7a44c9133791\', \'multiverseId\': 534018}, \'multiverseid\': 534018}, {\'name\': \'巨兽扬威\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，若你操控力量等于或大于4的生物，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「强威不仅能建立帝国；它还能守护帝国。」\\n～烈阳帝国骑士因缇\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'696c5a52-9937-4a6a-bb4f-7563ac6b50b4\', \'multiverseId\': 534229}, \'multiverseid\': 534229}, {\'name\': \'巨獸揚威\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，若你操控力量等於或大於4的生物，則抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「強威不僅能建立帝國；它還能守護帝國。」\\n～烈陽帝國騎士因緹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97497086-925d-4a9e-a1f2-1f099f95c988\', \'multiverseId\': 534440}, \'multiverseid\': 534440}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kolossales Chamäleon\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nSchutz vor Schwarz\\n{2}{G}{G}: Das Kolossale Chamäleon erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges +X/+X, wobei X gleich seiner Stärke ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532751&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31b6407f-2cf2-4d17-bdfa-3cb4b97dc5ae\', \'multiverseId\': 532751}, \'multiverseid\': 532751}, {\'name\': \'Coloso camaleónico\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nProtección contra negro.\\n{2}{G}{G}: El Coloso camaleónico obtiene +X/+X hasta el final del turno, donde X es su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532962&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d1bd619-1e36-43cd-acb4-5c221192cdd8\', \'multiverseId\': 532962}, \'multiverseid\': 532962}, {\'name\': \'Colosse caméléon\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nProtection contre le noir\\n{2}{G}{G} : Le Colosse caméléon gagne +X/+X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant sa force.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'416e7e1a-d24c-443b-a42a-e0587b8149b4\', \'multiverseId\': 533173}, \'multiverseid\': 533173}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Camaleontico\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nProtezione dal nero\\n{2}{G}{G}: Il Colosso Camaleontico prende +X/+X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è la sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533384&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5adc49a4-fdd2-4dd4-94fb-d0c784291380\', \'multiverseId\': 533384}, \'multiverseid\': 533384}, {\'name\': \'カメレオンの巨像\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\nプロテクション（黒）\\n{2}{G}{G}：ターン終了時まで、カメレオンの巨像は＋Ｘ/＋Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはこれのパワーに等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83a7b63-5a9c-4184-8a98-bb3b166b14b1\', \'multiverseId\': 533595}, \'multiverseid\': 533595}, {\'name\': \'Colosso Camaleão\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nProteção contra o preto\\n{2}{G}{G}: Colosso Camaleão recebe +X/+X até o final do turno, sendo X seu poder.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82564990-6ba1-4b50-be27-dbc4977f1209\', \'multiverseId\': 533806}, \'multiverseid\': 533806}, {\'name\': \'Колосс-Хамелеон\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nЗащита от черного\\n{2}{G}{G}: Колосс-Хамелеон получает +X/+X до конца хода, где X — значение его силы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c00281-ca3a-48f4-a722-52a5add1ab8b\', \'multiverseId\': 534017}, \'multiverseid\': 534017}, {\'name\': \'善变巨像\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n反黑保护\\n{2}{G}{G}：善变巨像得+X/+X直到回合结束，X为其力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44880ad-5eeb-41b9-9a33-dd910ae9752f\', \'multiverseId\': 534228}, \'multiverseid\': 534228}, {\'name\': \'善變巨像\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n反黑保護\\n{2}{G}{G}：善變巨像得+X/+X直到回合結束，X為其力量。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9478900c-7950-41cf-83ed-e41ab86ddd18\', \'multiverseId\': 534439}, \'multiverseid\': 534439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kreischmaul\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\\nWenn das Kreischmaul ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine nichtschwarze Nichtartefaktkreatur deiner Wahl.\\nHerbeirufen {1}{B} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Herbeirufungskosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, wird die Kreatur geopfert, wenn sie ins Spiel kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532708&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96750929-a2e1-4c14-b2e6-ba94ae8812ba\', \'multiverseId\': 532708}, \'multiverseid\': 532708}, {\'name\': \'Garganta chillona\', \'text\': \'Inspirar temor. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\\nCuando el Garganta chillona entre al campo de batalla, destruye la criatura objetivo que no sea negra o artefacto.\\nEvocar {1}{B}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de evocar. Si lo haces, sacrifícalo cuando entre al campo de batalla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dc9025b-d0e6-40ba-a1a9-7545e377aad0\', \'multiverseId\': 532919}, \'multiverseid\': 532919}, {\'name\': \'Hurlegueule\', \'text\': "Peur (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nQuand le Hurlegueule arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez une créature non-artefact, non-noire ciblée.\\nÉvocation {1}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût d\'évocation. Si vous faites ainsi, il est sacrifié quand il arrive sur le champ de bataille.)", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a7bdbd-660c-46e9-91c5-c8b7ed53af8a\', \'multiverseId\': 533130}, \'multiverseid\': 533130}, {\'name\': \'Fauce Urlante\', \'text\': \'Paura (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da creature artefatto e/o creature nere.)\\nQuando la Fauce Urlante entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi una creatura non artefatto, non nera bersaglio.\\nApparire {1}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa magia pagando il suo costo di apparire. Se lo fai, viene sacrificata quando entra nel campo di battaglia.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'541e310c-b000-4b35-9701-35254f063fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 533341}, \'multiverseid\': 533341}, {\'name\': \'叫び大口\', \'text\': \'畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。）\\n叫び大口が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n想起{1}{B}（あなたはこの呪文を想起コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、これが戦場に出たとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52c8679a-02e9-4330-8cd0-36a1f850937d\', \'multiverseId\': 533552}, \'multiverseid\': 533552}, {\'name\': \'Bocarra Ululante\', \'text\': \'Amedrontar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por criaturas pretas e/ou criaturas artefato.)\\nQuando Bocarra Ululante entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a criatura alvo não preta e não artefato.\\nEvocar {1}{B} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de evocar. Se fizer isso, ela será sacrificada quando entrar no campo de batalha.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88561123-5f98-44a1-bdb9-4c74e54347d6\', \'multiverseId\': 533763}, \'multiverseid\': 533763}, {\'name\': \'Визгобрюх\', \'text\': \'Страх (Это существо может быть заблокировано только артефактом существом и/или черным существом.)\\nКогда Визгобрюх выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевое не являющееся артефактом нечерное существо.\\nВызывание {1}{B} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Вызывания. Если вы это делаете, оно приносится в жертву, когда выходит на поле битвы.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1739096b-83ec-46b4-98a7-e602f01d9cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 533974}, \'multiverseid\': 533974}, {\'name\': \'尖吼怪\', \'text\': \'恐惧（此生物只能被神器生物和／或黑色生物阻挡。）\\n当尖吼怪进战场时，消灭目标非神器且非黑色的生物。\\n呼魂{1}{B}（你可以支付此咒语的呼魂费用来施放它。若你如此作，当它进战场时便牺牲之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28717e2c-226c-4726-9ec4-20d3cd6064a4\', \'multiverseId\': 534185}, \'multiverseid\': 534185}, {\'name\': \'尖吼怪\', \'text\': \'恐懼（此生物只能被神器生物和／或黑色生物阻擋。）\\n當尖吼怪進戰場時，消滅目標非神器且非黑色的生物。\\n呼魂{1}{B}（你可以支付此咒語的呼魂費用來施放它。若你如此作，當它進戰場時便犧牲之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deb12b85-b3ba-4a79-8bce-32c71bf99357\', \'multiverseId\': 534396}, \'multiverseid\': 534396}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krähenschwarm\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine andere Kreatur stirbt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen. Falls du dies tust, wirf eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sie sehnen sich nach den letzten Worten der Sterbenden noch mehr als nach Aas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532686&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223db03d-1078-48b7-ab41-4bd4a0abf912\', \'multiverseId\': 532686}, \'multiverseid\': 532686}, {\'name\': \'Bandada de cuervos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que otra criatura muera, puedes robar una carta. Si lo haces, descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Más que carroña, desean las últimas palabras del moribundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'411a12f8-b776-4167-9645-5599dcf46685\', \'multiverseId\': 532897}, \'multiverseid\': 532897}, {\'name\': \'Volée de corneilles\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une autre créature meurt, vous pouvez piocher une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau\', \'flavor\': \'Plus que la charogne, ils se repaissent des dernières paroles des mourants.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f531d325-57ec-4180-82b9-c8f9c450c213\', \'multiverseId\': 533108}, \'multiverseid\': 533108}, {\'name\': \'Stormo di Corvi\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta un\'altra creatura muore, puoi pescare una carta. Se lo fai, scarta una carta.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Ancora più delle carogne, bramano le ultime parole dei morenti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aca463a8-9dc1-4f30-bbe8-ba823c446c2c\', \'multiverseId\': 533319}, \'multiverseid\': 533319}, {\'name\': \'カラスの群れ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nこれ以外のクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'彼らが求めるのは、死肉よりも瀬戸際にいる者の最期の言葉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533530&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'978adb65-cc2b-4343-8a3f-44d1c1079418\', \'multiverseId\': 533530}, \'multiverseid\': 533530}, {\'name\': \'Revoada de Corvos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que outra criatura morre, você pode comprar um card. Se fizer isso, descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Há apenas uma coisa que eles desejam mais do que a carniça: as últimas palavras do moribundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09934526-1721-4be6-b2ec-1d2c7b376823\', \'multiverseId\': 533741}, \'multiverseid\': 533741}, {\'name\': \'Стая Ворон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда другое существо умирает, вы можете взять карту. Если вы это делаете, сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Последние слова умирающих им даже больше по вкусу, чем падаль.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'189bc7ce-cb22-4293-b996-304b35e623b2\', \'multiverseId\': 533952}, \'multiverseid\': 533952}, {\'name\': \'乌鸦群\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当另一个生物死去时，你可以抓一张牌。若你如此作，则弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'比起腐肉，它们更渴求死者的临终话语。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'724f2d9c-5774-4d2a-8022-0118abd8b0e5\', \'multiverseId\': 534163}, \'multiverseid\': 534163}, {\'name\': \'烏鴉群\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當另一個生物死去時，你可以抽一張牌。若你如此作，則棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'比起腐肉，牠們更渴求死者的臨終話語。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3670f57d-6264-44f8-b5c8-4a46d2a4ee48\', \'multiverseId\': 534374}, \'multiverseid\': 534374}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kultivieren\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, zeige sie offen vor, bringe eine davon getappt ins Spiel, nimm die andere auf deine Hand und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Samen haben eine Verbindung zueinander, die durch die Unendlichkeit hindurch reicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532753&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc9ec05-ca7a-4193-835f-ff14f0afed30\', \'multiverseId\': 532753}, \'multiverseid\': 532753}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, muéstralas, pon una de ellas en el campo de batalla girada y la otra en tu mano. Luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las semillas comparten un lazo, llamándose entre ellas a través del infinito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee0928d-3624-458e-93f8-b300f2d6546a\', \'multiverseId\': 532964}, \'multiverseid\': 532964}, {\'name\': \'Culture\', \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, révélez ces cartes, mettez-en une sur le champ de bataille engagée et l\'autre dans votre main, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les graines partagent un lien les reliant à travers l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533175&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fd338fd-2056-4cf6-b137-832b069fe8d0\', \'multiverseId\': 533175}, \'multiverseid\': 533175}, {\'name\': \'Coltivare\', \'text\': "Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per trovare fino a due carte terra base, rivelale, mettine una sul campo di battaglia TAPpata e aggiungi l\'altra alla tua mano, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Tutti i semi condividono un legame comune, chiamandosi l\'un l\'altro nello spazio infinito.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533386&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69eb8781-a217-4d99-81db-44b881ddd148\', \'multiverseId\': 533386}, \'multiverseid\': 533386}, {\'name\': \'耕作\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、公開し、その１枚をタップ状態で戦場に、もう１枚をあなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'全ての種には繋がりがあり、互いを無限の彼方から呼び合う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b09b14d0-aec4-4d7e-8a17-5060644d9656\', \'multiverseId\': 533597}, \'multiverseid\': 533597}, {\'name\': \'Cultivar\', \'text\': \'Procure até dois cards de terreno básico em seu grimório, revele-os e coloque um deles no campo de batalha virado e o outro na sua mão. Depois, embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Todas as sementes possuem um elo em comum que as une através da eternidade.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa55b857-4019-4fde-a2fb-4f65ce1482fa\', \'multiverseId\': 533808}, \'multiverseid\': 533808}, {\'name\': \'Культивировать\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке не более двух карт базовых земель, покажите те карты, положите одну из них на поле битвы повернутой, а другую — в вашу руку, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Все семена связаны прочными узами, взывая друг к другу через бесконечность.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b4e0fcf-94f4-4726-9dcc-9a26ae759e63\', \'multiverseId\': 534019}, \'multiverseid\': 534019}, {\'name\': \'栽培\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，展示这些牌，将一张横置放进战场，另一张则置于你手上，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'所有种子都互相连结成一体，永远地彼此呼唤着。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'647db00a-38d7-437e-8cce-a6895f72beef\', \'multiverseId\': 534230}, \'multiverseid\': 534230}, {\'name\': \'栽培\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋至多兩張基本地牌，展示這些牌，將一張橫置放進戰場，另一張則置於你手上，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'所有種子都互相連結成一體，永遠地彼此呼喚著。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c7e1b0-24f4-4d40-b087-06f5692f014c\', \'multiverseId\': 534441}, \'multiverseid\': 534441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kurator der Mysterien\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine andere Karte umwandelst oder abwirfst, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\nUmwandlung {U} ({U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Sphinx um Rat zu bitten, ist eine Frage der Geduld. Vielleicht ist das auch die einzige Frage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532679&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f9e2bd7-cc4f-47ce-af73-2e0fc4dc3134\', \'multiverseId\': 532679}, \'multiverseid\': 532679}, {\'name\': \'Custodio de misterios\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que actives una habilidad de ciclo o descartes otra carta, adivina 1.\\nCiclo {U}. ({U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Consultar a una esfinge es una prueba de paciencia. Quizás de eso se trata.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487f1feb-ea73-43ed-82f3-8bcdc4030145\', \'multiverseId\': 532890}, \'multiverseid\': 532890}, {\'name\': \'Conservateur de mystères\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous recyclez ou vous défaussez d\'une autre carte, regard 1.\\nRecyclage {U} ({U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': "Consulter un sphinx met la patience à l\'épreuve. C\'est peut-être là l\'intérêt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9cb31db-aa0a-4b1c-8662-1b77aa3c1603\', \'multiverseId\': 533101}, \'multiverseid\': 533101}, {\'name\': \'Sovrintendente dei Misteri\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta cicli o scarti un\'altra carta, profetizza 1.\\nCiclo {U} ({U}, Scarta questa carta: Pesca una carta.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Chiedere consiglio a una sfinge significa mettere alla prova la propria pazienza. Forse è proprio questo il punto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e89523c-4d91-4c9d-bc07-7e904a4556b4\', \'multiverseId\': 533312}, \'multiverseid\': 533312}, {\'name\': \'秘法の管理者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがこれ以外のカード１枚をサイクリングするか捨てるたび、占術１を行う。\\nサイクリング{U}（{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': \'スフィンクスに物事を尋ねるには忍耐がいる。恐らくそれが重要なのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'851af23c-7b52-4143-9657-346e36e190ab\', \'multiverseId\': 533523}, \'multiverseid\': 533523}, {\'name\': \'Curador de Mistérios\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você reciclar ou descartar outro card, use vidência 1.\\nReciclar {U} ({U}, descarte este card: Compre um card.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': \'Consultar uma esfinge é um teste de paciência. Talvez seja essa a ideia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0ba342-8d74-4e86-840d-944610411156\', \'multiverseId\': 533734}, \'multiverseid\': 533734}, {\'name\': \'Хранитель Загадок\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы совершаете Цикл другой карты или сбрасываете другую карту, предскажите 1.\\nЦикл {U} ({U}, сбросьте эту карту: возьмите карту.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': \'Обратиться за советом к сфинксу — настоящее испытание терпения. Может быть, в этом и есть суть.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'981121e8-1cd2-4118-80ec-0c070fdc63f5\', \'multiverseId\': 533945}, \'multiverseid\': 533945}, {\'name\': \'护谜史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你循环或弃另一张牌时，占卜1。\\n循环{U}（{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': \'咨询史芬斯要考验耐心。或许这便是其意义所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f6e5878-6d23-4bd2-9ff7-a410cb0792f5\', \'multiverseId\': 534156}, \'multiverseid\': 534156}, {\'name\': \'護謎史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你循環或棄另一張牌時，占卜1。\\n循環{U}（{U}，棄掉此牌：抽一張牌。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': \'諮詢史芬斯要考驗耐心。或許這便是其意義所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42710e03-0ae6-4c2c-8851-b412c3e68d96\', \'multiverseId\': 534367}, \'multiverseid\': 534367}]', '[{\'name\': \'Labyrinth des Heiligenscheins\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine Insel kontrollierst.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine Ebene kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn man seine Mitte findet, hat man auch die eigene gefunden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532850&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ec9d42e-a365-4dc4-9e95-b6358313e4e4\', \'multiverseId\': 532850}, \'multiverseid\': 532850}, {\'name\': \'Laberinto de nimbos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}. Activa esto solo si controlas una Isla.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}. Activa esto solo si controlas una Llanura.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Encontrar su centro es encontrar el propio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccf94976-4a0b-4422-889f-02d084940575\', \'multiverseId\': 533061}, \'multiverseid\': 533061}, {\'name\': \'Labyrinthe du halo\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une île.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une plaine.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Trouver son centre, c\'est se trouver soi-même.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533272&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900de7f6-2b42-4106-bc7b-c0243ce2faf9\', \'multiverseId\': 533272}, \'multiverseid\': 533272}, {\'name\': \'Labirinto di Nembi\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}. Attiva solo se controlli un\'Isola.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U}. Attiva solo se controlli una Pianura.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Trovarne il centro significa trovare il proprio centro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5f6199e-3060-4f20-bf03-581e234391fa\', \'multiverseId\': 533483}, \'multiverseid\': 533483}, {\'name\': \'雨雲の迷路\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}を加える。あなたが島をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\\n{T}：{U}を加える。あなたが平地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'その中心を探すことは、それ自身を探すこと。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533694&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f5b532-1ba0-4714-bea8-9ea635e888f4\', \'multiverseId\': 533694}, \'multiverseid\': 533694}, {\'name\': \'Labirinto Nimboso\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}. Ative somente se você controlar uma Ilha.\\n{T}: Adicione {U}. Ative somente se você controlar uma Planície.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Quem encontra o centro do labirinto, encontra seu próprio centro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cf5c80c-11d2-460f-8642-310e43b66fb0\', \'multiverseId\': 533905}, \'multiverseid\': 533905}, {\'name\': \'Небесный Лабиринт\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете Остров.\\n{T}: добавьте {U}. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете Равнину.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы отыскать его центр, нужно найти свой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1ad92a7-e9bb-4ad0-80b8-7d9b26cb7a90\', \'multiverseId\': 534116}, \'multiverseid\': 534116}, {\'name\': \'玄云迷宫\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{W}。只能于你操控海岛时起动。\\n{T}：加{U}。只能于你操控平原时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'若想找到中心，你得先搞清身在何处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4d06dc-746e-4b4e-b3ec-db9d93684d2f\', \'multiverseId\': 534327}, \'multiverseid\': 534327}, {\'name\': \'玄雲迷宮\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{W}。只能於你操控海島時起動。\\n{T}：加{U}。只能於你操控平原時起動。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'若想找到中心，你得先搞清身在何處。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa9858be-5cf7-4930-b66a-cba1d75568c4\', \'multiverseId\': 534538}, \'multiverseid\': 534538}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lawinenritt\', \'text\': \'Der nächste Zauberspruch, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kann gewirkt werden, als ob er Aufblitzen hätte. Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Zauberspruch wirkst, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Der Berg wird dir einen Steinhaufen aus Schnee und Eis und Stein errichten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2aad63a3-bf69-4ff9-ab64-aea25271fc88\', \'multiverseId\': 532010}, \'multiverseid\': 532010}, {\'name\': \'Desatar la avalancha\', \'text\': \'El próximo hechizo que lances este turno puede ser lanzado como si tuviera la habilidad de destello. Cuando lances tu siguiente hechizo este turno, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La montaña construirá tu túmulo de nieve, hielo y piedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ad3a63-0013-49a5-830c-77a07b575e27\', \'multiverseId\': 532064}, \'multiverseid\': 532064}, {\'name\': "Chevaucher l\'avalanche", \'text\': "Le prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci peut être lancé comme s\'il avait le flash. Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort ce tour-ci, ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'La montagne construira pour vous un cairn de neige, de glace et de pierre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532118&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc671621-5a0f-4ee6-ace0-02dcd146895f\', \'multiverseId\': 532118}, \'multiverseid\': 532118}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcare la Valanga\', \'text\': \'La prossima magia che lanci in questo turno può essere lanciata come se avesse lampo. Quando lanci la tua prossima magia in questo turno, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Sarà la montagna stessa a costruire il tuo tumulo di neve, ghiaccio e roccia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd066e46-a40d-48a4-8cae-7b0675232948\', \'multiverseId\': 532172}, \'multiverseid\': 532172}, {\'name\': \'雪崩を乗りこなせ\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたは次に唱える呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。このターン、あなたが次に呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'その山は遭難した者に雪と氷と石のケルンを作る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3889eca8-147f-4cd8-9e20-f60833d89eb4\', \'multiverseId\': 532226}, \'multiverseid\': 532226}, {\'name\': \'Cavalgar a Avalanche\', \'text\': \'A próxima mágica que você conjurar neste turno pode ser conjurada como se tivesse lampejo. Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica neste turno, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 em até uma criatura alvo, sendo X o valor de mana daquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A montanha construirá seu túmulo de neve, gelo e pedra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69f29e0b-fa04-4c6b-a8af-7da52c90118f\', \'multiverseId\': 532280}, \'multiverseid\': 532280}, {\'name\': \'Оседлать Лавину\', \'text\': \'Следующее заклинание, которое вы разыграете в этом ходу, может быть разыграно, как будто у него есть Миг. Когда вы разыграете ваше следующее заклинание в этом ходу, положите X жетонов +1/+1 на не более чем одно целевое существо, где X — мановая ценность того заклинания.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Гора воздвигнет твой курган из снега, льда и камня.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2faaa81f-ae99-4274-aa9c-2c602f9c2966\', \'multiverseId\': 532334}, \'multiverseid\': 532334}, {\'name\': \'山崩之威\', \'text\': \'你本回合中施放的下一个咒语能视同具有闪现异能地来施放。本回合中，当你施放你的下一个咒语时，在至多一个目标生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'高山会用霜雪、寒冰与石块来为你筑好坟冢。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a36c8956-a819-4db8-b01e-0b041b56ac03\', \'multiverseId\': 532388}, \'multiverseid\': 532388}, {\'name\': \'山崩之威\', \'text\': \'你本回合中施放的下一個咒語能視同具有閃現異能地來施放。本回合中，當你施放你的下一個咒語時，在至多一個目標生物上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為該咒語的魔法力值。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'高山會用霜雪、寒冰與石塊來為你築好墳塚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532442&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc944131-7a04-4b73-8cc8-7af37e09f679\', \'multiverseId\': 532442}, \'multiverseid\': 532442}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lawinenritt\', \'text\': \'Der nächste Zauberspruch, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kann gewirkt werden, als ob er Aufblitzen hätte. Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Zauberspruch wirkst, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag des Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531601&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ec9e6a-fe87-4e5c-870e-39070bf15691\', \'multiverseId\': 531601}, \'multiverseid\': 531601}, {\'name\': \'Desatar la avalancha\', \'text\': \'El próximo hechizo que lances este turno puede ser lanzado como si tuviera la habilidad de destello. Cuando lances tu siguiente hechizo este turno, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre hasta una criatura objetivo, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af75175-d934-4d0d-afeb-0e5bb30f47a5\', \'multiverseId\': 531657}, \'multiverseid\': 531657}, {\'name\': "Chevaucher l\'avalanche", \'text\': "Le prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci peut être lancé comme s\'il avait le flash. Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort ce tour-ci, ciblez jusqu\'à une créature. Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531713&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a6ee8e6-fde5-4407-a638-2989b5ff1e41\', \'multiverseId\': 531713}, \'multiverseid\': 531713}, {\'name\': \'Cavalcare la Valanga\', \'text\': \'La prossima magia che lanci in questo turno può essere lanciata come se avesse lampo. Quando lanci la tua prossima magia in questo turno, scegli fino a una creatura bersaglio. Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa, dove X è il valore di mana di quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f0b337-f22e-4038-836e-bc901e189572\', \'multiverseId\': 531769}, \'multiverseid\': 531769}, {\'name\': \'雪崩を乗りこなせ\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたは次に唱える呪文を、それが瞬速を持っているかのように唱えてもよい。このターン、あなたが次に呪文を唱えたとき、クリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2897db-a873-4c73-a176-c9435d7a3f73\', \'multiverseId\': 531825}, \'multiverseid\': 531825}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lehmgolem\', \'text\': \'{6}, würfle einen W8: Monstrum X, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege X +1/+1-Marken auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nBerserker — Wenn der Lehmgolem monströs wird, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d618566-5e14-4a15-b9bc-8b1b66630c4f\', \'multiverseId\': 532013}, \'multiverseid\': 532013}, {\'name\': \'Gólem de arcilla\', \'text\': \'{6}, tirar 1d8: Monstruosidad X, donde X es el resultado. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nBerserk — Cuando el Gólem de arcilla se convierta en monstruoso, destruye el permanente objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b8f570-16bb-49af-ad89-c45a1a1035a5\', \'multiverseId\': 532067}, \'multiverseid\': 532067}, {\'name\': "Golem d\'argile", \'text\': "{6}, lancez un d8 : Monstruosité X, X étant le résultat. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nBerserk — Quand le Golem d\'argile devient monstrueux, détruisez un permanent ciblé.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532121&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6854915d-f65f-42c5-8f3a-819f9f4cdf9f\', \'multiverseId\': 532121}, \'multiverseid\': 532121}, {\'name\': \'Golem di Argilla\', \'text\': \'{6}, Tira un d8: Mostruosità X, dove X è il risultato. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti X segnalini +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nBerserk — Quando il Golem di Argilla diventa mostruoso, distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e71aee6c-7f5c-4cf1-a81a-e058a017e0af\', \'multiverseId\': 532175}, \'multiverseid\': 532175}, {\'name\': \'クレイ・ゴーレム\', \'text\': \'{6}, １個のd8を振る：怪物化Ｘを行う。Ｘはその出目に等しい。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個を置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\nバーサーク ― クレイ・ゴーレムが怪物的になったとき、パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff732ef0-09b6-4d94-bb8e-591b755d73d6\', \'multiverseId\': 532229}, \'multiverseid\': 532229}, {\'name\': \'Golem de Argila\', \'text\': \'{6}, role um d8: Monstruosidade X, sendo X o resultado. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque X marcadores +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nBerserk — Quando Golem de Argila se tornar monstruoso, destrua a permanente alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a770f88-33b3-489d-a1bf-8e70541156f2\', \'multiverseId\': 532283}, \'multiverseid\': 532283}, {\'name\': \'Глиняный Голем\', \'text\': \'{6}, бросьте d8: Чудовищность X, где X — результат броска. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него X жетонов +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nИсступление — Когда Глиняный Голем становится чудовищным, уничтожьте целевой перманент.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c6b56e3-cd2a-44a2-bf67-739a21fd2ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 532337}, \'multiverseid\': 532337}, {\'name\': \'黏土魔像\', \'text\': \'{6}，掷一颗d8：蛮化X，X为掷骰结果。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置X个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。）\\n狂暴态～当黏土魔像蛮化时，消灭目标永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2faf53ae-a0d5-4477-a1b3-d883b3c815e0\', \'multiverseId\': 532391}, \'multiverseid\': 532391}, {\'name\': \'黏土魔像\', \'text\': \'{6}，擲一顆d8：蠻化X，X為擲骰結果。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置X個+1/+1指示物且它已蠻化。）\\n狂暴態～當黏土魔像蠻化時，消滅目標永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d57f566-665f-465d-aa1b-a263faae7643\', \'multiverseId\': 532445}, \'multiverseid\': 532445}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lied der Inspiration\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu zwei bleibende Karten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu den Gesamt-Manabetrag der Karten.\\n1—14 | Bringe die bestimmten Karten auf deine Hand zurück.\\n15+ | Bringe die bestimmten Karten auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Gesamt-Manabetrags dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cf867ab-b133-4088-8491-26131f8bd2e3\', \'multiverseId\': 531587}, \'multiverseid\': 531587}, {\'name\': \'Canción de la inspiración\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos cartas de permanente objetivo en tu cementerio. Tira 1d20 y suma el valor de maná total de esas cartas.\\n1—14 | Regresa esas cartas a tu mano.\\n15+ | Regresa esas cartas a tu mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná total de esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b63d889c-287f-49b9-a131-c0be8710084a\', \'multiverseId\': 531643}, \'multiverseid\': 531643}, {\'name\': "Chant d\'inspiration", \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à deux cartes de permanent ciblées de votre cimetière. Lancez un d20 et ajoutez la valeur de mana totale de ces cartes au résultat.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez ces cartes dans votre main.\\n15+ | Renvoyez ces cartes dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à leur valeur de mana totale.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531699&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f3a5e78-c848-4d32-9a5a-1f5c2ed346a2\', \'multiverseId\': 531699}, \'multiverseid\': 531699}, {\'name\': \'Canto di Ispirazione\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a due carte permanente bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Tira un d20 e aggiungi il valore di mana totale di quelle carte.\\n1—14 | Riprendi in mano quelle carte.\\n15+ | Riprendi in mano quelle carte. Guadagni punti vita pari al loro valore di mana totale.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c3f9bf6-a586-463c-b118-26abded4377f\', \'multiverseId\': 531755}, \'multiverseid\': 531755}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞の歌\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード最大２枚を対象とする。d20を１回振り、それらのカードのマナ総量の合計を加える。\\n1—14 | それらのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n15+ | それらのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそれらのマナ総量の合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad3d7a1-5bb0-4e86-b714-1ae4802b0da8\', \'multiverseId\': 531811}, \'multiverseid\': 531811}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lied der Inspiration\', \'text\': \'Bestimme bis zu zwei bleibende Karten deiner Wahl in deinem Friedhof. Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu den Gesamt-Manabetrag der Karten.\\n1—14 | Bringe die bestimmten Karten auf deine Hand zurück.\\n15+ | Bringe die bestimmten Karten auf deine Hand zurück. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Gesamt-Manabetrags dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51c8f825-7428-4997-93b3-2b414bf59c41\', \'multiverseId\': 532001}, \'multiverseid\': 532001}, {\'name\': \'Canción de la inspiración\', \'text\': \'Elige hasta dos cartas de permanente objetivo en tu cementerio. Tira 1d20 y suma el valor de maná total de esas cartas.\\n1—14 | Regresa esas cartas a tu mano.\\n15+ | Regresa esas cartas a tu mano. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná total de esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94b34c43-26e5-48b8-a762-0480a43b59f4\', \'multiverseId\': 532055}, \'multiverseid\': 532055}, {\'name\': "Chant d\'inspiration", \'text\': "Choisissez jusqu\'à deux cartes de permanent ciblées de votre cimetière. Lancez un d20 et ajoutez la valeur de mana totale de ces cartes au résultat.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez ces cartes dans votre main.\\n15+ | Renvoyez ces cartes dans votre main. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à leur valeur de mana totale.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f40754b-0912-4919-89bd-871cea287a39\', \'multiverseId\': 532109}, \'multiverseid\': 532109}, {\'name\': \'Canto di Ispirazione\', \'text\': \'Scegli fino a due carte permanente bersaglio nel tuo cimitero. Tira un d20 e aggiungi il valore di mana totale di quelle carte.\\n1—14 | Riprendi in mano quelle carte.\\n15+ | Riprendi in mano quelle carte. Guadagni punti vita pari al loro valore di mana totale.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'127f1e28-1ec6-473e-bd45-f463308cdbd3\', \'multiverseId\': 532163}, \'multiverseid\': 532163}, {\'name\': \'鼓舞の歌\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード最大２枚を対象とする。１個のd20を振り、その出目とそれらのカードのマナ総量の合計を足す。\\n1—14 | それらのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n15+ | それらのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。あなたはそれらのマナ総量の合計に等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d771cfb-fa51-4f37-9828-8f5fa3d631e4\', \'multiverseId\': 532217}, \'multiverseid\': 532217}, {\'name\': \'Canção da Inspiração\', \'text\': \'Escolha até dois cards de permanente alvo em seu cemitério. Role um d20 e some ao resultado o valor de mana total daqueles cards.\\n1—14 | Devolva aqueles cards para sua mão.\\n15+ | Devolva aqueles cards para sua mão. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao valor de mana total deles.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'103de393-95e5-47d0-a409-6f95619fbe63\', \'multiverseId\': 532271}, \'multiverseid\': 532271}, {\'name\': \'Песнь Вдохновения\', \'text\': \'Выберите не более двух целевых карт перманентов на вашем кладбище. Бросьте d20 и прибавьте суммарную мановую ценность тех карт.\\n1—14 | Верните те карты в вашу руку.\\n15+ | Верните те карты в вашу руку. Вы получаете количество жизней, равное их суммарной мановой ценности.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'406273f0-8c62-40c4-9b1b-06e0ee3e962c\', \'multiverseId\': 532325}, \'multiverseid\': 532325}, {\'name\': \'激灵曲\', \'text\': \'选择至多两张目标在你坟墓场中的永久物牌。掷一颗d20，然后将点数加上这些牌的法术力值总和。\\n1～14 | 将这些牌移回你手上。\\n15+ | 将这些牌移回你手上。你获得等同于其法术力值加总的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22cf3fcc-026f-4ca2-8949-e1fffaa69fcf\', \'multiverseId\': 532379}, \'multiverseid\': 532379}, {\'name\': \'激靈曲\', \'text\': \'選擇至多兩張目標在你墳墓場中的永久物牌。擲一顆d20，然後將點數加上這些牌的魔法力值總和。\\n1～14 | 將這些牌移回你手上。\\n15+ | 將這些牌移回你手上。你獲得等同於其魔法力值加總的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fba10c8-992e-4f36-85f9-9864c71dd9ae\', \'multiverseId\': 532433}, \'multiverseid\': 532433}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lorcan, Hexenmeister-Sammler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Hexenmeister.\\nFalls ein Hexenmeister, den du kontrollierst, sterben würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531572&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34fa5b5a-adc6-4851-9522-3a50278df159\', \'multiverseId\': 531572}, \'multiverseid\': 531572}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, coleccionista de brujos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una carta de criatura vaya a un cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, puedes pagar una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná. Si lo haces, ponla en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Es un Brujo además de sus otros tipos.\\nSi un Brujo que controlas fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'533006cd-7113-44d6-89e7-b9ed2c95df0c\', \'multiverseId\': 531628}, \'multiverseid\': 531628}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, collectionneur de sorciers\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, vous pouvez payer un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. C\'est un psychagogue en plus de ses autres types.\\nSi un psychagogue que vous contrôlez devait mourir, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : diable\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531684&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41abc4a-d6be-4a6f-8e24-f7b4f5fc1f25\', \'multiverseId\': 531684}, \'multiverseid\': 531684}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, Collezionista di Warlock\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una carta creatura viene messa nel cimitero di un avversario da qualsiasi zona, puoi pagare punti vita pari al suo valore di mana. Se lo fai, mettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. È un Warlock in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nSe un Warlock che controlli sta per morire, invece esilialo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02c62587-c24c-4b89-be17-18c75fec1bef\', \'multiverseId\': 531740}, \'multiverseid\': 531740}, {\'name\': \'ウォーロックの収集家、ローカン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャー・カード１枚がいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、あなたはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それはそれの他のタイプに加えて邪術師である。\\nあなたがコントロールしている邪術師が死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3fc5e4-9ae2-4144-9a87-db20824e41cb\', \'multiverseId\': 531796}, \'multiverseid\': 531796}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lorcan, Hexenmeister-Sammler\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn eine Kreaturenkarte von irgendwoher auf den Friedhof eines Gegners gelegt wird, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihres Manabetrags bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe sie unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen ein Hexenmeister.\\nFalls ein Hexenmeister, den du kontrollierst, sterben würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Teufel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531986&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64dd078e-87e0-488d-82ad-6bd781121032\', \'multiverseId\': 531986}, \'multiverseid\': 531986}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, coleccionista de brujos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que una carta de criatura vaya a un cementerio de un oponente desde cualquier parte, puedes pagar una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná. Si lo haces, ponla en el campo de batalla bajo tu control. Es un Brujo además de sus otros tipos.\\nSi un Brujo que controlas fuera a morir, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Diablo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f1dc8b4-38d1-4b8d-adf7-f173d5eb5d30\', \'multiverseId\': 532040}, \'multiverseid\': 532040}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, collectionneur de sorciers\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une carte de créature est mise dans le cimetière d\'un adversaire d\'où qu\'elle vienne, vous pouvez payer un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana. Si vous faites ainsi, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle. C\'est un psychagogue en plus de ses autres types.\\nSi un psychagogue que vous contrôlez devait mourir, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : diable\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23fe6078-dc18-48d7-b983-a238320b8adb\', \'multiverseId\': 532094}, \'multiverseid\': 532094}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, Collezionista di Warlock\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta una carta creatura viene messa nel cimitero di un avversario da qualsiasi zona, puoi pagare punti vita pari al suo valore di mana. Se lo fai, mettila sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo. È un Warlock in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi.\\nSe un Warlock che controlli sta per morire, invece esilialo.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Diavolo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd473a5-8532-4e63-b76c-a8b5326e3985\', \'multiverseId\': 532148}, \'multiverseid\': 532148}, {\'name\': \'ウォーロックの収集家、ローカン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nクリーチャー・カード１枚がいずこかから対戦相手の墓地に置かれるたび、あなたは「それのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払い、それをあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出す。それはそれの他のタイプに加えて邪術師である。」を選んでもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしている邪術師が死亡するなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — デビル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c96c38c2-41bd-4370-81ee-cd22a1fab655\', \'multiverseId\': 532202}, \'multiverseid\': 532202}, {\'name\': \'Lorcan, Colecionador de Bruxos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que um card de criatura é colocado no cemitério de um oponente vindo de qualquer lugar, você pode pagar uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual a seu valor de mana. Se fizer isso, coloque-o no campo de batalha sob seu controle. Ele é um Bruxo além de seus outros tipos.\\nSe um Bruxo que você controla morreria, em vez disso, exile-o.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Diabo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd94d76-d1fd-4298-b21f-5cce4e7d82c6\', \'multiverseId\': 532256}, \'multiverseid\': 532256}, {\'name\': \'Лоркан, Коллекционер Колдунов\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда карта существа попадает откуда-либо на кладбище оппонента, вы можете заплатить количество жизней, равное ее мановой ценности. Если вы это делаете, положите ее на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Она является Колдуном в дополнение к своим другим типам.\\nЕсли Колдун под вашим контролем должен умереть, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дьявол\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ec16f42-a43d-43e0-946d-06a4094d41d3\', \'multiverseId\': 532310}, \'multiverseid\': 532310}, {\'name\': \'邪术师收集魔洛坎\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一张生物牌从任何区域进入对手的坟墓场时，你可以支付等同于其法术力值的生命。若你如此作，则将它在你的操控下放进战场。它额外具有邪术师此类别。\\n如果某个由你操控的邪术师将死去，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92159b70-fe9b-4f79-abbe-fea8c8fa836a\', \'multiverseId\': 532364}, \'multiverseid\': 532364}, {\'name\': \'邪術師收集魔洛坎\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當一張生物牌從任何區域進入對手的墳墓場時，你可以支付等同於其魔法力值的生命。若你如此作，則將它在你的操控下放進戰場。它額外具有邪術師此類別。\\n如果某個由你操控的邪術師將死去，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～魔鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'887debb4-9cc9-4a08-873f-544f43d9173c\', \'multiverseId\': 532418}, \'multiverseid\': 532418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Loyaler Lehrling\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nLeutnant — Zu Beginn des Kampfes in deinem Zug und falls du deinen Kommandeur kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Thopter-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit. Der Spielstein erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': \'Weise Gelehrte hören auf diejenigen, die über Vorstellungskraft verfügen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532730&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b2b7920-797f-41f6-8dd0-2722145b2d04\', \'multiverseId\': 532730}, \'multiverseid\': 532730}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz leal\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nTeniente — Al comienzo del combate en tu turno, si controlas a tu comandante, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Tóptero incolora 1/1 con la habilidad de volar. Esa ficha gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los que poseen el conocimiento harían bien en escuchar a quienes tienen el don de la imaginación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cc5469b-a3a3-408a-b889-8d263f7d0899\', \'multiverseId\': 532941}, \'multiverseid\': 532941}, {\'name\': \'Apprentie loyale\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nLieutenant — Au début du combat pendant votre tour, si vous contrôlez votre commandant, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Mécanoptère avec le vol. Ce jeton acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui ont des connaissances ont tout intérêt à écouter ceux qui ont de l\'imagination.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533152&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e899aa49-0d91-48bf-8884-e1150e19e618\', \'multiverseId\': 533152}, \'multiverseid\': 533152}, {\'name\': \'Apprendista Fedele\', \'text\': "Rapidità\\nTenente — All\'inizio del combattimento nel tuo turno, se controlli il tuo comandante, crea una pedina creatura artefatto Tottero 1/1 incolore con volare. Quella pedina ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': "Chi ha il dono della sapienza è abbastanza saggio da ascoltare chi ha il dono dell\'immaginazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402e9927-d1f6-4f1a-9dd4-3eb395a20fee\', \'multiverseId\': 533363}, \'multiverseid\': 533363}, {\'name\': \'忠実な弟子\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n副官 ― あなたのターンの戦闘の開始時に、あなたがあなたの統率者をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ無色の１/１の飛行機械・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。ターン終了時まで、そのトークンは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': \'知識ある者は賢明にして、創意ある者に耳を傾ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93829428-0565-460d-954f-33072b7fee49\', \'multiverseId\': 533574}, \'multiverseid\': 533574}, {\'name\': \'Aprendiz Leal\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nTenente — No início do combate no seu turno, se você controlar seu comandante, crie uma ficha de criatura artefato Tóptero incolor 1/1 com voar. Aquela ficha ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': \'Os dotados de inteligência são sábios o bastante para ouvir os dotados de imaginação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d23e3d-e2e4-4efe-8327-213671fb7aa8\', \'multiverseId\': 533785}, \'multiverseid\': 533785}, {\'name\': \'Верная Ученица\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nЛейтенант — В начале боя во время вашего хода, если вы контролируете вашего командира, создайте одну фишку артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Топтер с Полетом. Та фишка получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': \'Те, у кого есть знания, достаточно мудры, чтобы прислушиваться к тем, у кого есть воображение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca0bb58-c187-45b0-8976-9e5b036c40d3\', \'multiverseId\': 533996}, \'multiverseid\': 533996}, {\'name\': \'忠实学徒\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n副官～在你回合的战斗开始时，若你操控你的指挥官，则派出一个1/1无色，具飞行异能的振翼机衍生神器生物。该衍生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': \'知识渊博者都晓得想象丰富者的言论值得一听。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25e8ff6-ca15-4b13-9cc9-3bfebc238837\', \'multiverseId\': 534207}, \'multiverseid\': 534207}, {\'name\': \'忠實學徒\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n副官～在你回合的戰鬥開始時，若你操控你的指揮官，則派出一個1/1無色，具飛行異能的振翼機衍生神器生物。該衍生物獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': \'知識淵博者都曉得想像豐富者的言論值得一聽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534418&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36ab5ee2-d1c1-4a7d-a57d-c220115a1a31\', \'multiverseId\': 534418}, \'multiverseid\': 534418}]', '[{\'name\': \'Luftschiff-Jäger\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{R}: Der Luftschiff-Jäger erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{R}: Der Luftschiff-Jäger erhält Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n{R}: Der Luftschiff-Jäger erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532739&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc00ba35-c61a-44f9-970f-d8294b71aa51\', \'multiverseId\': 532739}, \'multiverseid\': 532739}, {\'name\': \'Acechador de aeronaves\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{R}: El Acechador de aeronaves obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\n{R}: El Acechador de aeronaves gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno.\\n{R}: El Acechador de aeronaves gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc249bdf-1828-4687-b6d5-4c3f5ebc7420\', \'multiverseId\': 532950}, \'multiverseid\': 532950}, {\'name\': \'Pisteur de vaisseaux volants\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{R} : Le Pisteur de vaisseaux volants gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{R} : Le Pisteur de vaisseaux volants acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n{R} : Le Pisteur de vaisseaux volants acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533161&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c056a5a-5b04-469a-ba01-a45da6204e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 533161}, \'multiverseid\': 533161}, {\'name\': \'Cacciatore di Avionavi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{R}: Il Cacciatore di Avionavi prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\\n{R}: Il Cacciatore di Avionavi ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno.\\n{R}: Il Cacciatore di Avionavi ha rapidità fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1ac59ed-421c-4708-bc9d-00133fa5e067\', \'multiverseId\': 533372}, \'multiverseid\': 533372}, {\'name\': \'航空船に忍び寄るもの\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、航空船に忍び寄るものは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、航空船に忍び寄るものは先制攻撃を得る。\\n{R}：ターン終了時まで、航空船に忍び寄るものは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533583&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'400e454b-8094-4a5f-9339-b15a1f5b4c12\', \'multiverseId\': 533583}, \'multiverseid\': 533583}, {\'name\': \'Espreitador de Aeronau\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{R}: Espreitador de Aeronau recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\\n{R}: Espreitador de Aeronau ganha iniciativa até o final do turno.\\n{R}: Espreitador de Aeronau ganha ímpeto até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d359be0-213d-4ec1-8da2-eeb17cd1d8be\', \'multiverseId\': 533794}, \'multiverseid\': 533794}, {\'name\': \'Охотник на Небесные Корабли\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{R}: Охотник на Небесные Корабли получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\\n{R}: Охотник на Небесные Корабли получает Первый удар до конца хода.\\n{R}: Охотник на Небесные Корабли получает Ускорение до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'369e5eb6-6112-444c-bcd5-3087b4a62490\', \'multiverseId\': 534005}, \'multiverseid\': 534005}, {\'name\': \'飞船伏龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{R}：飞船伏龙得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n{R}：飞船伏龙获得先攻异能直到回合结束。\\n{R}：飞船伏龙获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0168afa-f075-4c14-8bd0-1b6218a0a8bd\', \'multiverseId\': 534216}, \'multiverseid\': 534216}, {\'name\': \'飛船伏龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{R}：飛船伏龍得+1/+0直到回合結束。\\n{R}：飛船伏龍獲得先攻異能直到回合結束。\\n{R}：飛船伏龍獲得敏捷異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a8212d-17ea-48a5-b1b5-ae81bc9abfc2\', \'multiverseId\': 534427}, \'multiverseid\': 534427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmabeben\', \'text\': \'Das Magmabeben fügt jeder nichtfliegenden Kreatur und jedem Planeswalker X Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Wohin willst du fliehen, wenn ich dich mit eben dem Boden bestrafe, auf dem du fliehst?"\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532731&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1959e5fe-a987-42eb-97df-3e386123bd5e\', \'multiverseId\': 532731}, \'multiverseid\': 532731}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'El Magmamoto hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura sin la habilidad de volar y a cada planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Adónde huirás cuando te castigue con el mismo suelo sobre el que corres?".\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c4f538a-312f-44c9-8943-c327e04a9dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 532942}, \'multiverseid\': 532942}, {\'name\': \'Tremblement de lave\', \'text\': \'Le Tremblement de lave inflige X blessures à chaque créature sans le vol et à chaque planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Où fuir, quand je te châtie à l\'aide du sol sur lequel tu prends appui pour courir ? »\\n—Nicol Bolas", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a66dd8-f328-452f-bc17-ca32ee4d6126\', \'multiverseId\': 533153}, \'multiverseid\': 533153}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'Il Magmamoto infligge X danni a ogni creatura senza volare e a ogni planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Dove potrai mai fuggire quando ti punisco con lo stesso terreno su cui stai correndo?"\\n—Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21693add-0d64-474b-af08-5b7e68e01549\', \'multiverseId\': 533364}, \'multiverseid\': 533364}, {\'name\': \'溶岩震\', \'text\': \'溶岩震は飛行を持たない各クリーチャーと各プレインズウォーカーにそれぞれＸ点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「貴様が落ち延びた先の大地そのもので罰してやるというのに、どこへ逃げるつもりだ？」\\n――ニコル・ボーラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb22c60-e2ff-4dfb-aa0d-8957b69836ac\', \'multiverseId\': 533575}, \'multiverseid\': 533575}, {\'name\': \'Magmamoto\', \'text\': \'Magmamoto causa X pontos de dano a cada criatura sem voar e a cada planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Vai correr para onde quando eu o punir com o mesmo solo que usa para fugir?"\\n— Nicol Bolas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f032eef9-425a-46f9-91ef-cb22dc37edc7\', \'multiverseId\': 533786}, \'multiverseid\': 533786}, {\'name\': \'Магматрясение\', \'text\': "Магматрясение наносит X повреждений каждому существу без Полета и каждому planeswalker\'у.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Куда ты скроешься, когда я покараю тебя той самой землей, по которой ты бежишь?»\\n— Никол Болас\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cf12e84-d83a-475a-bcc1-6740f81b1357\', \'multiverseId\': 533997}, \'multiverseid\': 533997}, {\'name\': \'岩浆暴震\', \'text\': \'岩浆暴震对每个鹏洛客和每个不具飞行异能的生物各造成X点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「你脚踩的大地就是我要拿来对付你的东西，还想往哪逃？」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f5b6c9a-4f9e-42f7-bcd6-35acac24ba52\', \'multiverseId\': 534208}, \'multiverseid\': 534208}, {\'name\': \'岩漿暴震\', \'text\': \'岩漿暴震對每個鵬洛客與每個不具飛行異能的生物各造成X點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「你腳踩的大地就是我要拿來對付你的東西，還想往哪逃？」\\n～尼可波拉斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e64dd57-5be9-424e-9c6c-a2d4900a04d4\', \'multiverseId\': 534419}, \'multiverseid\': 534419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mantel der Alten\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nWenn der Mantel der Alten ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Aura- und/oder Ausrüstung-Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof an die verzauberte Kreatur angelegt ins Spiel zurück.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede an sie angelegte Aura und Ausrüstung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531553&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ed3fdf5-2a94-4801-94cf-dabfb8da2c4e\', \'multiverseId\': 531553}, \'multiverseid\': 531553}, {\'name\': \'Manto de los Antiguos\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nCuando el Manto de los Antiguos entre al campo de batalla, regresa cualquier cantidad de cartas objetivo de Aura y/o Equipo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla anexadas a la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb2ee760-511f-482e-a47f-68c5a550091f\', \'multiverseId\': 531609}, \'multiverseid\': 531609}, {\'name\': \'Manteau des Anciens\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nQuand le Manteau des Anciens arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, attachées à la créature enchantée, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'aura et/ou d\'équipement ciblées de votre cimetière.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura et chaque équipement qui lui sont attachés.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531665&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'790ecee0-3cc1-4fa8-81c0-e92c0e56a43b\', \'multiverseId\': 531665}, \'multiverseid\': 531665}, {\'name\': \'Manto degli Antichi\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura che controlli\\nQuando il Manto degli Antichi entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte Aura e/o Equipaggiamento bersaglio dal tuo cimitero assegnate alla creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura ed Equipaggiamento ad essa assegnati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'429ab336-ac52-4294-b283-f790fd1ed656\', \'multiverseId\': 531721}, \'multiverseid\': 531721}, {\'name\': \'古き者のまとい身\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\n古き者のまとい身が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありオーラや装備品である望む数のカードを対象とする。それらを、エンチャントしているクリーチャーについている状態で戦場に戻す。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それについているオーラや装備品１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'848c8226-df06-42fe-bc0c-e55807cc50bf\', \'multiverseId\': 531777}, \'multiverseid\': 531777}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mantel der Alten\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst\\nWenn der Mantel der Alten ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine beliebige Anzahl an Aura- und/oder Ausrüstung-Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof an die verzauberte Kreatur angelegt ins Spiel zurück.\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jede an sie angelegte Aura und Ausrüstung.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d0fa12-e40c-4095-b853-018e55c81d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 531967}, \'multiverseid\': 531967}, {\'name\': \'Manto de los Antiguos\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controlas.\\nCuando el Manto de los Antiguos entre al campo de batalla, regresa cualquier cantidad de cartas objetivo de Aura y/o Equipo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla anexadas a la criatura encantada.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Aura y Equipo anexados a ella.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a2f12a4-698c-4aa8-9f4b-c446a6b58e01\', \'multiverseId\': 532021}, \'multiverseid\': 532021}, {\'name\': \'Manteau des Anciens\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature que vous contrôlez\\nQuand le Manteau des Anciens arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, attachées à la créature enchantée, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes d\'aura et/ou d\'équipement ciblées de votre cimetière.\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque aura et chaque équipement qui lui sont attachés.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6293de2e-37d6-4ca3-9c69-0316ba1648c4\', \'multiverseId\': 532075}, \'multiverseid\': 532075}, {\'name\': \'Manto degli Antichi\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura che controlli\\nQuando il Manto degli Antichi entra nel campo di battaglia, rimetti sul campo di battaglia un qualsiasi numero di carte Aura e/o Equipaggiamento bersaglio dal tuo cimitero assegnate alla creatura incantata.\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Aura ed Equipaggiamento ad essa assegnati.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394aacfd-26fa-4a48-8cc7-79ec690d6975\', \'multiverseId\': 532129}, \'multiverseid\': 532129}, {\'name\': \'古き者のまとい身\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\n古き者のまとい身が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありオーラや装備品である望む数のカードを対象とする。それらを、エンチャントしているクリーチャーについている状態で戦場に戻す。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、それについているオーラや装備品１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ab86be-9e8b-4970-959b-777d1c871762\', \'multiverseId\': 532183}, \'multiverseid\': 532183}, {\'name\': \'Manto dos Antigos\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que você controla\\nQuando Manto dos Antigos entrar no campo de batalha, devolva qualquer número de cards de Aura e/ou Equipamento alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha anexados à criatura encantada.\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Aura e Equipamento anexado a ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'217b1320-4589-47ba-87b3-80c4a48f3030\', \'multiverseId\': 532237}, \'multiverseid\': 532237}, {\'name\': \'Мантия Древних\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо под вашим контролем\\nКогда Мантия Древних выходит на поле битвы, верните любое количество целевых карт Аур и/или Снаряжения из вашего кладбища на поле битвы прикрепленными к зачарованному существу.\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 за каждую прикрепленную к нему Ауру и Снаряжение.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddb8a0a-79c6-43f6-b73b-14acf546fa4c\', \'multiverseId\': 532291}, \'multiverseid\': 532291}, {\'name\': \'先贤披风\', \'text\': \'结附于由你操控的生物\\n当先贤披风进战场时，将任意数量目标灵气和／或武具牌从你的坟墓场移回战场并贴附在所结附的生物上。\\n所结附的生物上每贴附一个灵气或武具，便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17c38141-4e94-4ec1-b0d1-98dc002c2b08\', \'multiverseId\': 532345}, \'multiverseid\': 532345}, {\'name\': \'先賢披風\', \'text\': \'結附於由你操控的生物\\n當先賢披風進戰場時，將任意數量目標靈氣和／或武具牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場並貼附在所結附的生物上。\\n所結附的生物上每貼附一個靈氣或武具，便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa6bc773-719e-4f72-81e1-e4c0e75c47d0\', \'multiverseId\': 532399}, \'multiverseid\': 532399}]', '[{\'name\': \'Martern\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist leicht, sich im Spektakel zu verlieren und ein paar dreiste Scherze zu genießen. Aber vergiss nie, dass der Rakdos-Kult gefährlich ist."\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532777&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a771ad69-23d4-4fb1-b83a-7c7a52fedb0c\', \'multiverseId\': 532777}, \'multiverseid\': 532777}, {\'name\': \'Atormentar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto, criatura o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Es fácil dejarse llevar por el espectáculo y disfrutar de un poco de diversión culpable. Pero no te confundas: el Culto a Rakdos es un peligro".\\n—Tájic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532988&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e6ab42f-a34c-47c8-b3d0-ca8a472a40f3\', \'multiverseId\': 532988}, \'multiverseid\': 532988}, {\'name\': \'Affres\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une cible, artefact, créature ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« On se laisse facilement emporter par le spectacle, profitant de quelques plaisirs coupables. Mais ne vous y trompez pas : le Culte de Rakdos est dangereux. »\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533199&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b9ade39-344b-4fbc-85ba-7423affb919e\', \'multiverseId\': 533199}, \'multiverseid\': 533199}, {\'name\': \'Tormento Diabolico\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto, una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"È facile lasciarsi affascinare dallo spettacolo e gustarsi un po\\\' di crudele divertimento. Non fatevi ingannare, però: il Culto di Rakdos è una minaccia."\\n—Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5386d7da-56d6-40a8-a575-5a55c589a9fd\', \'multiverseId\': 533410}, \'multiverseid\': 533410}, {\'name\': \'魔性\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「絢爛に惑わされて、多少の汚らわしい娯楽を楽しむのは簡単だ。しかし間違いない、ラクドス教団は危険だ。」\\n――タージク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533621&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a116953-f338-4f07-bdbc-6f9214e14e94\', \'multiverseId\': 533621}, \'multiverseid\': 533621}, {\'name\': \'Atormentar\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato, a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"É fácil deixar-se levar pelo espetáculo, divertir-se com a perversidade. Mas não se engane: o Culto de Rakdos é um perigo."\\n— Tajic\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99652119-affb-4a2f-9b27-eecf416765df\', \'multiverseId\': 533832}, \'multiverseid\': 533832}, {\'name\': \'Терзания\', \'text\': "Уничтожьте целевой артефакт, существо или planeswalker\'а.", \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Так легко увлечься спектаклем, почувствовать вкус запретных наслаждений. Но не ошибись! Культ Ракдоса несет в себе опасность».\\n— Тажик\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb49880-bcde-475e-a929-b2200d39c5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 534043}, \'multiverseid\': 534043}, {\'name\': \'糟蹋\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器，生物或鹏洛客。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「人们很容易就会被演出所吸引，享受点不太正经的娱乐。不过切记：拉铎司宗派是威胁。」\\n～塔疾克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5b837b-32c6-4879-8340-fd1a4d54dcb4\', \'multiverseId\': 534254}, \'multiverseid\': 534254}, {\'name\': \'糟蹋\', \'text\': \'消滅目標神器，生物或鵬洛客。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「人們很容易就會被演出所吸引，享受點不太正經的娛樂。不過切記：拉鐸司宗派是威脅。」\\n～塔疾克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b7518a-abcd-4fa7-8109-87ae6294455e\', \'multiverseId\': 534465}, \'multiverseid\': 534465}]', "[{'name': 'Materialkomponentenbeutel', 'text': '{T}, entferne eine Materialmarke vom Materialkomponentenbeutel: Erzeuge zwei Mana in unterschiedlichen Farben.\\n{T}: Würfle einen W20.\\n1—9 | Lege eine Materialmarke auf den Materialkomponentenbeutel.\\n10—20 | Lege zwei Materialmarken auf den Materialkomponentenbeutel.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532014&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '438c374c-2340-4d31-b8a4-f082ef881e98', 'multiverseId': 532014}, 'multiverseid': 532014}, {'name': 'Saquito de componentes', 'text': '{T}, remover un contador de componente del Saquito de componentes: Agrega dos manás de colores distintos.\\n{T}: Tira 1d20.\\n1—9 | Pon un contador de componente sobre el Saquito de componentes.\\n10—20 | Pon dos contadores de componente sobre el Saquito de componentes.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532068&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a150ff81-f8b0-463d-a40b-edd52c1c1e9d', 'multiverseId': 532068}, 'multiverseid': 532068}, {'name': 'Sacoche à composantes', 'text': '{T}, retirez un marqueur « composante » de la Sacoche à composantes : Ajoutez deux manas de couleurs différentes.\\n{T} : Lancez un d20.\\n1-9 | Mettez un marqueur « composante » sur la Sacoche à composantes.\\n10-20 | Mettez deux marqueurs « composante » sur la Sacoche à composantes.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532122&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '59db33c1-c75d-4536-8afc-1905b4bad01d', 'multiverseId': 532122}, 'multiverseid': 532122}, {'name': 'Borsa per Componenti', 'text': '{T}, Rimuovi un segnalino componente dalla Borsa per Componenti: Aggiungi due mana di colori diversi.\\n{T}: Tira un d20.\\n1—9 | Metti un segnalino componente sulla Borsa per Componenti.\\n10—20 | Metti due segnalini componente sulla Borsa per Componenti.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532176&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1effcd92-7a6e-497b-a59b-6656eb0c9995', 'multiverseId': 532176}, 'multiverseid': 532176}, {'name': '呪文構成要素ポーチ', 'text': '{T}, 呪文構成要素ポーチの上から構成要素カウンター１個を取り除く：異なる色のマナ２点を加える。\\n{T}：１個のd20を振る。\\n1—9 | 呪文構成要素ポーチの上に構成要素カウンター１個を置く。\\n10—20 | 呪文構成要素ポーチの上に構成要素カウンター２個を置く。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532230&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f94e8ad-aa1d-4b40-b209-5221695abc41', 'multiverseId': 532230}, 'multiverseid': 532230}, {'name': 'Bolsa de Componentes', 'text': '{T}, remova um marcador de componente de Bolsa de Componentes: Adicione dois manas de cores diferentes.\\n{T}: Role um d20.\\n1—9 | Coloque um marcador de componente em Bolsa de Componentes.\\n10—20 | Coloque dois marcadores de componente em Bolsa de Componentes.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532284&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a82c9ce-840c-4002-bf29-fe4823fb11f3', 'multiverseId': 532284}, 'multiverseid': 532284}, {'name': 'Сумка с Компонентами', 'text': '{T}, удалите один жетон компонента с Сумки с Компонентами: добавьте две маны различных цветов.\\n{T}: бросьте d20.\\n1—9 | Положите один жетон компонента на Сумку с Компонентами.\\n10—20 | Положите два жетона компонента на Сумку с Компонентами.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532338&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a24f0c0-7eb6-4cbb-9539-268364102f5e', 'multiverseId': 532338}, 'multiverseid': 532338}, {'name': '材料包', 'text': '{T}，从材料包上移去一个材料指示物：加两点不同颜色的法术力。\\n{T}：掷一颗d20。\\n1～9 | 在材料包上放置一个材料指示物。\\n10～20 | 在材料包上放置两个材料指示物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532392&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ab14aef3-472e-4d27-adfe-89bb1445bacb', 'multiverseId': 532392}, 'multiverseid': 532392}, {'name': '材料包', 'text': '{T}，從材料包上移去一個材料指示物：加兩點不同顏色的魔法力。\\n{T}：擲一顆d20。\\n1～9 | 在材料包上放置一個材料指示物。\\n10～20 | 在材料包上放置兩個材料指示物。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532446&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5076d746-4903-4c62-9600-6bbafba96a7b', 'multiverseId': 532446}, 'multiverseid': 532446}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mauer der Omen\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nWenn die Mauer der Omen ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich suche nach einer Vision für Zendikar, in der keine Eldrazi vorkommen."\\n—Aus einem Expeditionstagebuch\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532675&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59dc01d5-58fd-450e-8d0b-2cf69d8ba244\', \'multiverseId\': 532675}, \'multiverseid\': 532675}, {\'name\': \'Muro de profecías\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nCuando el Muro de profecías entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Busco una visión de Zendikar que no incluya a los Eldrazi".\\n—Fragmento de un diario de expedición\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253ee575-817c-422e-9ae1-6e6ff8de79db\', \'multiverseId\': 532886}, \'multiverseid\': 532886}, {\'name\': "Mur d\'augures", \'text\': "Défenseur\\nQuand le Mur d\'augures arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : mur\', \'flavor\': "« Je recherche une vision de Zendikar qui n\'inclut pas les Eldrazi. »\\n—Extrait de journal d\'expédition", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533097&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0fcf945-552d-4a8b-b25b-838e26d22188\', \'multiverseId\': 533097}, \'multiverseid\': 533097}, {\'name\': \'Muro dei Presagi\', \'text\': \'Difensore\\nQuando il Muro dei Presagi entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cerco una visione di Zendikar che non comprenda gli Eldrazi."\\n—Annotazione del diario di spedizione\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a4b40c8-a08a-4004-b6a3-3b1220701857\', \'multiverseId\': 533308}, \'multiverseid\': 533308}, {\'name\': \'前兆の壁\', \'text\': \'防衛\\n前兆の壁が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「私が求めるのは、エルドラージのいないゼンディカーの風景だ。」\\n――探検日誌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff9f009-02cf-4ff2-a25d-fa393407f02f\', \'multiverseId\': 533519}, \'multiverseid\': 533519}, {\'name\': \'Barreira de Agouros\', \'text\': \'Defensor\\nQuando Barreira de Agouros entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Barreira\', \'flavor\': \'"Procuro uma visão de Zendikar que não inclua os Eldrazi."\\n— Trecho do diário da expedição\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c2d8dad-e57a-4119-ab23-9e31948c9354\', \'multiverseId\': 533730}, \'multiverseid\': 533730}, {\'name\': \'Стена Предзнаменований\', \'text\': \'Защитник\\nКогда Стена Предзнаменований выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Стена\', \'flavor\': \'«Я стремлюсь увидеть Зендикар, свободный от Эльдрази».\\n— запись в походном дневнике\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c525d245-17c4-4868-b857-05d1b2641004\', \'multiverseId\': 533941}, \'multiverseid\': 533941}, {\'name\': \'预兆墙\', \'text\': \'守军\\n当预兆墙进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～墙\', \'flavor\': \'「我寻求着没有奥札奇的赞迪卡愿景。」\\n～探险队日志一笔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ae1e81-c4f1-45a0-9211-e3392995c5b8\', \'multiverseId\': 534152}, \'multiverseid\': 534152}, {\'name\': \'預兆牆\', \'text\': \'守軍\\n當預兆牆進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牆\', \'flavor\': \'「我尋求著沒有奧札奇的贊迪卡願景。」\\n～探險隊日誌一筆\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534363&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f10f4a32-6045-420a-838a-866da3e45ca6\', \'multiverseId\': 534363}, \'multiverseid\': 534363}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meisterin der Marionetten\', \'text\': \'Fabrizieren 3 (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, lege drei +1/+1-Marken auf sie oder erzeuge drei 1/1 farblose Servo-Artefaktkreaturenspielsteine.)\\nImmer wenn ein Artefakt, das du kontrollierst, aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt wird, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der Meisterin der Marionetten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Handwerker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532700&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'253b27df-77ec-4828-b18b-1c48bdeb8a49\', \'multiverseId\': 532700}, \'multiverseid\': 532700}, {\'name\': \'Maestra titiritera\', \'text\': \'Fabricar 3. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, pon tres contadores +1/+1 sobre ella o crea tres fichas de criatura artefacto Servo incoloras 1/1.)\\nSiempre que un artefacto que controlas vaya a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a la fuerza de la Maestra titiritera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Artífice humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1782493d-7794-4a36-9848-fffbe8c76b29\', \'multiverseId\': 532911}, \'multiverseid\': 532911}, {\'name\': \'Maîtresse des marionnettes\', \'text\': "Fabrication 3 (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, mettez trois marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle ou créez trois jetons de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Servo.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un artefact que vous contrôlez est mis dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, un adversaire ciblé perd un nombre de points de vie égal à la force de la Maîtresse des marionnettes.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et artificier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533122&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889cefa4-49c4-4a64-a778-9b138c148aea\', \'multiverseId\': 533122}, \'multiverseid\': 533122}, {\'name\': \'Maestra Burattinaia\', \'text\': \'Fabbrica 3 (Quando questa creatura entra nel campo di battaglia, metti tre segnalini +1/+1 su di essa o crea tre pedine creatura artefatto Servomeccanismo 1/1 incolori.)\\nOgniqualvolta un artefatto che controlli viene messo in un cimitero dal campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde punti vita pari alla forza della Maestra Burattinaia.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Artefice Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09140846-f87c-4f89-90d0-12095fa8e2f3\', \'multiverseId\': 533333}, \'multiverseid\': 533333}, {\'name\': \'マリオネットの達人\', \'text\': \'製造３（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター３個を置くか、無色の１/１の霊気装置・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン３体を生成する。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つが戦場から墓地に置かれるたび、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはマリオネットの達人のパワーに等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・工匠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cf79126-3c66-4202-83ad-b3d5621a64e2\', \'multiverseId\': 533544}, \'multiverseid\': 533544}, {\'name\': \'Mestra das Marionetes\', \'text\': \'Fabricar 3 (Quando esta criatura entrar no campo de batalha, coloque três marcadores +1/+1 nela ou crie três fichas de criatura artefato Servus incolor 1/1.)\\nToda vez que um artefato que você controla é colocado num cemitério do campo de batalha, o oponente alvo perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao poder de Mestra das Marionetes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Artesão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a2796c6-e4d9-4b55-9c1c-29365aa3fdc1\', \'multiverseId\': 533755}, \'multiverseid\': 533755}, {\'name\': \'Хозяйка Марионеток\', \'text\': \'Производство 3 (Когда это существо выходит на поле битвы, положите на него три жетона +1/+1 или создайте три фишки артефакта существа 1/1 бесцветный Сервотрон.)\\nКаждый раз, когда артефакт под вашим контролем попадает с поля битвы на кладбище, целевой оппонент теряет количество жизней, равное силе Хозяйки Марионеток.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Механик\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c8906c-de42-460a-b47c-48a7ae011977\', \'multiverseId\': 533966}, \'multiverseid\': 533966}, {\'name\': \'弄偶大师\', \'text\': \'装配3（当此生物进战场时，在其上放置三个+1/+1指示物或派出三个1/1无色自动机衍生神器生物。）\\n每当一个由你操控的神器从战场进入坟墓场时，目标对手失去等同于弄偶大师力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／神器师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ae9071a-3da6-4c78-8d72-7f9ff7137c02\', \'multiverseId\': 534177}, \'multiverseid\': 534177}, {\'name\': \'弄偶大師\', \'text\': \'裝配3（當此生物進戰場時，在其上放置三個+1/+1指示物或派出三個1/1無色自動機衍生神器生物。）\\n每當一個由你操控的神器從戰場置入墳墓場時，目標對手失去等同於弄偶大師力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／神器師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bad709ff-254a-4430-95a7-faf70c928ad1\', \'multiverseId\': 534388}, \'multiverseid\': 534388}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meisterwerk der Erfindungsgabe\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Meisterwerk der Erfindungsgabe als Kopie einer beliebigen Ausrüstung im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Schmelztiegel bringt hervor, was deine Gedanken geschmiedet haben. Du musst nur danach greifen und das Meisterwerk herausziehen."\\n—Wahara, Hüterin des Schmelztiegels\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532807&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1905a76e-94b4-45bb-a54b-4b9879ccbc89\', \'multiverseId\': 532807}, \'multiverseid\': 532807}, {\'name\': \'Obra maestra del ingenio\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que la Obra maestra del ingenio entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier Equipo en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"El crisol produce lo que has forjado en tu mente. Solo tienes que extender la mano y extraer la obra maestra".\\n—Wahara, guardiana del crisol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f2a0f3e-6f1c-4ade-80a8-146e45cfe60a\', \'multiverseId\': 533018}, \'multiverseid\': 533018}, {\'name\': "Chef-d\'œuvre d\'ingéniosité", \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que le Chef-d\'œuvre d\'ingéniosité arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quel équipement sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Le creuset produit ce que vous avez forgé dans votre esprit. Vous n\'avez plus qu\'à tendre la main pour récupérer votre chef-d\'œuvre. »\\n—Wahara, gardienne du creuset", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6ab5173-2dcb-4f4a-9b07-cd9f48ff3841\', \'multiverseId\': 533229}, \'multiverseid\': 533229}, {\'name\': \'Capolavoro di Ingegno\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare il Capolavoro di Ingegno nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi Equipaggiamento sul campo di battaglia.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Il crogiolo produce ciò che la tua mente ha forgiato. Devi solo tendere la mano per estrarne un capolavoro."\\n—Wahara, Custode del Crogiolo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533440&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148d784f-eff7-4d04-9d54-a6d97988b962\', \'multiverseId\': 533440}, \'multiverseid\': 533440}, {\'name\': \'創意工夫の傑作\', \'text\': \'あなたは創意工夫の傑作を、戦場にある装備品１つのコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「るつぼはあなたが思い描いたものを生み出します。あとは、あなたがこの中に手を伸ばして、傑作を引き出してあげるだけ。」\\n――るつぼの守り手、ワハラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02566991-b419-481f-a06d-8e5e6610ff7c\', \'multiverseId\': 533651}, \'multiverseid\': 533651}, {\'name\': \'Obra-prima da Engenhosidade\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Obra-prima da Engenhosidade entre no campo de batalha como cópia de qualquer Equipamento no campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O crisol produz o que você forjou em sua mente. Você só precisa enfiar a mão e extrair a obra-prima."\\n— Wahara, Guarda do Crisol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4abfc34a-862b-490d-8b5d-f8e5c7a2493c\', \'multiverseId\': 533862}, \'multiverseid\': 533862}, {\'name\': \'Шедевр Изобретательности\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заставить Шедевр Изобретательности выйти на поле битвы в качестве копии любого Снаряжения на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'«Горнило дает тебе то, что ты выковал в своем разуме. Нужно только протянуть руку и получить свой шедевр».\\n— Вахара, хранительница Горнила\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce9207bc-0906-4401-b40c-af7de0debb5e\', \'multiverseId\': 534073}, \'multiverseid\': 534073}, {\'name\': \'巧手神兵\', \'text\': \'你可以使巧手神兵当成战场上任一武具的复制品来进入战场。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「心中神兵锤炼，都在熔炉之中。只需伸手入内，就能将之取出。」\\n～熔炉看守瓦哈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534284&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59307bb1-c7a8-4bdb-a921-0768b463c113\', \'multiverseId\': 534284}, \'multiverseid\': 534284}, {\'name\': \'巧手神兵\', \'text\': \'你可以使巧手神兵當成戰場上任一武具的複製品來進入戰場。\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'「心中神兵錘鍊，都在熔爐之中。只需伸手入內，就能將之取出。」\\n～熔爐看守瓦哈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fb43cb6-8bc3-4f4e-adff-1ff5ceb5aacd\', \'multiverseId\': 534495}, \'multiverseid\': 534495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Meteorgolem\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Meteorgolem ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl, die kein Land ist und die ein Gegner kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'Der Einschlag ließ die Soldaten erzittern — dann erhob sich etwas aus dem Krater.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aca5061-0c35-4306-854a-f58379fb4f67\', \'multiverseId\': 532808}, \'multiverseid\': 532808}, {\'name\': \'Gólem meteoro\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Gólem meteoro entre al campo de batalla, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Gólem\', \'flavor\': \'El impacto dispersó a los soldados y, después, algo emergió del cráter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3668c6fd-09ae-4525-bd40-117d67ba03d7\', \'multiverseId\': 533019}, \'multiverseid\': 533019}, {\'name\': \'Golem météoritique\', \'text\': "Quand le Golem météoritique arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impact dispersa les soldats, puis quelque chose émergea du cratère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adea77c9-321a-4710-ae66-322a8ec460ea\', \'multiverseId\': 533230}, \'multiverseid\': 533230}, {\'name\': \'Golem Meteora\', \'text\': \'Quando il Golem Meteora entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un permanente non terra bersaglio controllato da un avversario.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Golem\', \'flavor\': "L\'impatto disperse i soldati, poi dal cratere emerse qualcosa.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9a9dcf3-2d77-4975-9ce6-abded42f9ff7\', \'multiverseId\': 533441}, \'multiverseid\': 533441}, {\'name\': \'隕石ゴーレム\', \'text\': \'隕石ゴーレムが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ゴーレム\', \'flavor\': \'その衝撃で兵士たちは散り散りになった。すると、その穴から何かが現れた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ac5d2a8-bdfe-4320-9bf1-839961228ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 533652}, \'multiverseid\': 533652}, {\'name\': \'Golem Meteórico\', \'text\': \'Quando Golem Meteórico entrar no campo de batalha, destrua a permanente alvo não de terreno que um oponente controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Golem\', \'flavor\': \'O impacto dispersou os soldados. Então, algo surgiu da cratera.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c45f5d35-bd2e-4b76-81ad-d2456d95c6a9\', \'multiverseId\': 533863}, \'multiverseid\': 533863}, {\'name\': \'Метеоритный Голем\', \'text\': \'Когда Метеоритный Голем выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой не являющийся землей перманент под контролем оппонента.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Голем\', \'flavor\': \'От удара солдаты разлетелись в стороны, а потом что-то поднялось из кратера.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9677e335-228e-49e6-8de3-21349a352aab\', \'multiverseId\': 534074}, \'multiverseid\': 534074}, {\'name\': \'陨石魔像\', \'text\': \'当陨石魔像进战场时，消灭目标由对手操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'冲击将士兵四散震飞～随后坑中有人影起身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1245a9-3e7f-4e0f-92e9-4988752b85ce\', \'multiverseId\': 534285}, \'multiverseid\': 534285}, {\'name\': \'隕石魔像\', \'text\': \'當隕石魔像進戰場時，消滅目標由對手操控的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～魔像\', \'flavor\': \'衝擊將士兵四散震飛～隨後坑中有人影起身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e866b4-4286-47f2-8030-3a43422929fc\', \'multiverseId\': 534496}, \'multiverseid\': 534496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Minn, hinterlistige Illusionistin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Illusion-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 für jede andere Illusion, die du kontrollierst."\\nImmer wenn eine Illusion, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich der Stärke jener Kreatur aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gnom, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531561&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1559d8e7-a662-421f-b371-8c87b314d791\', \'multiverseId\': 531561}, \'multiverseid\': 531561}, {\'name\': \'Minn, ilusionista astuta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ilusión azul 1/1 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 por cada otra Ilusión que controlas".\\nSiempre que una Ilusión que controlas muera, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de permanente de tu mano con valor de maná menor o igual que la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero gnomo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec685d1a-5436-4ed9-a0a5-86310755e8a7\', \'multiverseId\': 531617}, \'multiverseid\': 531617}, {\'name\': \'Minn, illusionniste rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Illusion avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+0 pour chaque autre illusion que vous contrôlez. »\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une illusion que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre main, une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la force de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gnome et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531673&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f213401-e641-45ed-ac4b-ef473e3520c7\', \'multiverseId\': 531673}, \'multiverseid\': 531673}, {\'name\': \'Minn, Illusionista Astuta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Illusione 1/1 blu con "Questa creatura prende +1/+0 per ogni altra Illusione che controlli".\\nOgniqualvolta un\\\'Illusione che controlli muore, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta permanente con valore di mana pari o inferiore alla forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Gnomo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c91e0a35-0d28-4624-9a29-d61b35315244\', \'multiverseId\': 531729}, \'multiverseid\': 531729}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な幻術師、ミーン\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターンのあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、「このクリーチャーは、これ以外であなたがコントロールしているイリュージョン１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ青の１/１のイリュージョン・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているイリュージョン１体が死亡するたび、あなたはあなたの手札にありマナ総量がそのクリーチャーのパワー以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ノーム・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'432c6b23-5081-4483-8b3c-4ac3f4f7499f\', \'multiverseId\': 531785}, \'multiverseid\': 531785}]', '[{\'name\': \'Minn, hinterlistige Illusionistin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deine zweite Karte innerhalb desselben Zuges ziehst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Illusion-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 für jede andere Illusion, die du kontrollierst."\\nImmer wenn eine Illusion, die du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du eine bleibende Karte mit Manabetrag kleiner oder gleich der Stärke jener Kreatur aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Gnom, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf98bb70-f463-4015-a79c-9e3985105bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 531975}, \'multiverseid\': 531975}, {\'name\': \'Minn, ilusionista astuta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que robes tu segunda carta cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Ilusión azul 1/1 con "Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 por cada otra Ilusión que controlas".\\nSiempre que una Ilusión que controlas muera, puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de permanente de tu mano con valor de maná menor o igual que la fuerza de esa criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero gnomo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce3abddb-e34f-48bc-8ff4-d0fabadd2d0d\', \'multiverseId\': 532029}, \'multiverseid\': 532029}, {\'name\': \'Minn, illusionniste rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous piochez votre deuxième carte à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Illusion avec « Cette créature gagne +1/+0 pour chaque autre illusion que vous contrôlez. »\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une illusion que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre main, une carte de permanent avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à la force de cette créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : gnome et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532083&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dad187a-0e09-4f2b-a514-ab99f5cdf265\', \'multiverseId\': 532083}, \'multiverseid\': 532083}, {\'name\': \'Minn, Illusionista Astuta\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta peschi la tua seconda carta in ogni turno, crea una pedina creatura Illusione 1/1 blu con "Questa creatura prende +1/+0 per ogni altra Illusione che controlli".\\nOgniqualvolta un\\\'Illusione che controlli muore, puoi mettere sul campo di battaglia dalla tua mano una carta permanente con valore di mana pari o inferiore alla forza di quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Gnomo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f86f3b5-83fe-4ab6-ad11-ec2e1ff3aa8a\', \'multiverseId\': 532137}, \'multiverseid\': 532137}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な幻術師、ミーン\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターンのあなたの２枚目のカードを引くたび、「このクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないイリュージョン１体につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ青の１/１のイリュージョン・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nあなたがコントロールしているイリュージョン１体が死亡するたび、あなたはあなたの手札にありマナ総量がそのクリーチャーのパワー以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ノーム・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532191&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21de8cb-5495-4b47-98af-735af7254b10\', \'multiverseId\': 532191}, \'multiverseid\': 532191}, {\'name\': \'Minn, Ilusionista Astuta\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você comprar seu segundo card a cada turno, crie uma ficha de criatura Ilusão azul 1/1 com "Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 para cada outra Ilusão que você controla".\\nToda vez que uma Ilusão que você controla morre, você pode colocar no campo de batalha um card de permanente da sua mão com valor de mana igual ou inferior ao poder daquela criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Gnomo Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb878e9-1210-4a83-8182-bb834517bf2c\', \'multiverseId\': 532245}, \'multiverseid\': 532245}, {\'name\': \'Минн, Коварная Иллюзионистка\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы берете вашу вторую карту в каждом ходу, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 синяя Иллюзия со способностью «Это существо получает +1/+0 за каждую другую Иллюзию под вашим контролем».\\nКаждый раз, когда Иллюзия под вашим контролем умирает, вы можете положить карту перманента с мановой ценностью, не превышающей силу того существа, из вашей руки на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Карлик Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad5e9e6-2628-4c83-9ad6-0b8abcaa0193\', \'multiverseId\': 532299}, \'multiverseid\': 532299}, {\'name\': \'老成幻术师珉恩\', \'text\': \'每当你抓每回合中你的第二张牌时，派出一个1/1蓝色虚影衍生生物，且具有「你每操控一个其他虚影，此生物便得+1/+0。」\\n每当一个由你操控的虚影死去时，你可以将一张法术力值等于或小于该生物力量的永久物牌从你手上放进战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～地侏／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687c424a-f92a-48e8-a453-c61d9876fc1f\', \'multiverseId\': 532353}, \'multiverseid\': 532353}, {\'name\': \'老成幻術師珉恩\', \'text\': \'每當你抽每回合中你的第二張牌時，派出一個1/1藍色虛影衍生生物，且具有「你每操控一個其他虛影，此生物便得+1/+0。」\\n每當一個由你操控的虛影死去時，你可以將一張魔法力值等於或小於該生物力量的永久物牌從你手上放進戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～地侏／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aaeacc79-6923-43b3-a6ca-98e215799024\', \'multiverseId\': 532407}, \'multiverseid\': 532407}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mishras Fabrik\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}: Mishras Fabrik wird bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 2/2 Montagearbeiter-Artefaktkreatur. Sie ist immer noch ein Land.\\n{T}: Eine Montagearbeiter-Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532846&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a84f700-f0c1-4942-954d-b0006023ce86\', \'multiverseId\': 532846}, \'multiverseid\': 532846}, {\'name\': \'Factoría de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}: La Factoría de Mishra se convierte en una criatura artefacto Operario 2/2 hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\\n{T}: La criatura Operario objetivo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0eae63b-ba43-4b1c-87f8-9428cc38c9d2\', \'multiverseId\': 533057}, \'multiverseid\': 533057}, {\'name\': \'Usine de Mishra\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1} : L\'Usine de Mishra devient une créature-artefact 2/2 Ouvrier spécialisé jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.\\n{T} : Une créature Ouvrier spécialisé ciblée gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533268&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65c3e7ef-71a2-499e-bddf-5f6c286d02d0\', \'multiverseId\': 533268}, \'multiverseid\': 533268}, {\'name\': \'Fabbrica di Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}: La Fabbrica di Mishra diventa una creatura artefatto Addetto-al-Montaggio 2/2 fino alla fine del turno. È ancora una terra.\\n{T}: Una creatura Addetto-al-Montaggio bersaglio prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c9f3bef-64c9-4087-91e6-3a6e54f91b81\', \'multiverseId\': 533479}, \'multiverseid\': 533479}, {\'name\': \'ミシュラの工廠\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}：ターン終了時まで、ミシュラの工廠は２/２の組立作業員・アーティファクト・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\\n{T}：組立作業員・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533690&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c1f39ad-27e6-4429-92eb-82e588787c8c\', \'multiverseId\': 533690}, \'multiverseid\': 533690}, {\'name\': \'Fábrica de Mishra\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}: Fábrica de Mishra torna-se uma criatura artefato Operário de Linha de Montagem 2/2 até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\\n{T}: A criatura Operário de Linha de Montagem alvo recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c43144-ada9-4642-9c2d-61f02e9c7590\', \'multiverseId\': 533901}, \'multiverseid\': 533901}, {\'name\': \'Фабрика Мишры\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}: Фабрика Мишры становится артефактом существом 2/2 Рабочий-Сборщик до конца хода. При этом она остается землей.\\n{T}: целевое существо Рабочий-Сборщик получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534112&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c56625-bd01-410b-890a-1581df2b02b7\', \'multiverseId\': 534112}, \'multiverseid\': 534112}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的工厂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}：米斯拉的工厂成为2/2组装工人神器生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\\n{T}：目标组装工人生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5669c655-88aa-4a91-a86b-eaa8f6523036\', \'multiverseId\': 534323}, \'multiverseid\': 534323}, {\'name\': \'米斯拉的工廠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}：米斯拉的工廠成為2/2組裝工人神器生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\\n{T}：目標組裝工人生物得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae1387c-d9d2-47ab-a725-7902f9cbcf45\', \'multiverseId\': 534534}, \'multiverseid\': 534534}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitternacht-Pfadleuchter\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, können nicht geblockt werden, außer von legendären Kreaturen.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, wage dich ins Gewölbe. (Betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceb6eeab-b408-4d3f-9026-f993c14f69d3\', \'multiverseId\': 532009}, \'multiverseid\': 532009}, {\'name\': \'Alumbrasendas de medianoche\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas no pueden ser bloqueadas excepto por criaturas legendarias.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, adéntrate en la mazmorra. (Entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'938be182-a34d-49c9-958a-3dc9c9f9fa13\', \'multiverseId\': 532063}, \'multiverseid\': 532063}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireur de chemin de minuit\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloquées excepté par des créatures légendaires.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. (Entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3f99e90-28a5-4702-a8c5-d61faa392b31\', \'multiverseId\': 532117}, \'multiverseid\': 532117}, {\'name\': \'Rischiarasentieri di Mezzanotte\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli non possono essere bloccate tranne che da creature leggendarie.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esplora il dungeon. (Entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2d86d5a-6222-497b-8afd-19cbb335335f\', \'multiverseId\': 532171}, \'multiverseid\': 532171}, {\'name\': \'真夜中の道照らし\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは伝説のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'717e973e-33d9-4e74-8a17-de909b1d86fb\', \'multiverseId\': 532225}, \'multiverseid\': 532225}, {\'name\': \'Alumiador de Trilhas da Meia-noite\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla só podem ser bloqueadas por criaturas lendárias.\\nToda vez que uma ou mais criaturas que você controla causarem dano de combate a um jogador, aventure-se na masmorra. (Entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b69cf8-84fd-46c3-a1be-b5391df6280a\', \'multiverseId\': 532279}, \'multiverseid\': 532279}, {\'name\': \'Полуночный Фонарщик\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем могут быть заблокированы только легендарными существами.\\nКаждый раз, когда одно или несколько существ под вашим контролем наносят боевые повреждения игроку, углубитесь в подземелье. (Войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532333&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'575e70a8-5b7b-41f5-a304-92ea1798c6e1\', \'multiverseId\': 532333}, \'multiverseid\': 532333}, {\'name\': \'午夜引路人\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物只能被传奇生物阻挡。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，深入地城。（进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2659c034-8a56-4724-8c65-94296d35b608\', \'multiverseId\': 532387}, \'multiverseid\': 532387}, {\'name\': \'午夜引路人\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物只能被傳奇生物阻擋。\\n每當由你操控的一個或數個生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，深入地城。（進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532441&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90bbbc9b-d899-4ba7-90f9-8c692a2196de\', \'multiverseId\': 532441}, \'multiverseid\': 532441}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitternacht-Pfadleuchter\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, können nicht geblockt werden, außer von legendären Kreaturen.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, wage dich ins Gewölbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531598&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa2eade-9ab2-4914-b781-be3e667af500\', \'multiverseId\': 531598}, \'multiverseid\': 531598}, {\'name\': \'Alumbrasendas de medianoche\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas no pueden ser bloqueadas excepto por criaturas legendarias.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, adéntrate en la mazmorra.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5384a024-b8c1-41d9-ac56-15345021be2d\', \'multiverseId\': 531654}, \'multiverseid\': 531654}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireur de chemin de minuit\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez ne peuvent pas être bloquées excepté par des créatures légendaires.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531710&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28fef711-5e47-484a-a827-e064a60db6a5\', \'multiverseId\': 531710}, \'multiverseid\': 531710}, {\'name\': \'Rischiarasentieri di Mezzanotte\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli non possono essere bloccate tranne che da creature leggendarie.\\nOgniqualvolta una o più creature che controlli infliggono danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esplora il dungeon.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'603662ca-4e46-4f80-aff8-a46df965ec1f\', \'multiverseId\': 531766}, \'multiverseid\': 531766}, {\'name\': \'真夜中の道照らし\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは伝説のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cbec07-1965-4142-a6c1-5e4c9fcd91bf\', \'multiverseId\': 531822}, \'multiverseid\': 531822}]', '[{\'name\': \'Moosfeuer-Tal\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Pflanzenwelt im Tal verändert sich zum Schlechteren, da der Abfluss von Zwergenschmieden das Wasser verunreinigt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f164b938-b6dc-4da8-8d23-10898f940910\', \'multiverseId\': 532848}, \'multiverseid\': 532848}, {\'name\': \'Valle Fuegomusgo\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La vegetación del valle cambia a peor cuando los vertidos de las forjas de los enanos contaminan el agua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a78ed0b-44de-4e14-af3c-a3992c065bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 533059}, \'multiverseid\': 533059}, {\'name\': \'Vallée de Moussefeu\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La contamination de l\'eau par l\'écoulement des forges naines détruit peu à peu la flore de la vallée.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533270&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a171c3e5-6ece-4065-b7f6-9148506a0cdf\', \'multiverseId\': 533270}, \'multiverseid\': 533270}, {\'name\': \'Valle di Piromuschio\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Le scorie delle forge naniche inquinano le acque della valle, a discapito della flora che vi risiede.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'581d2316-e21b-47f4-93ce-3e0b4bfd5a15\', \'multiverseId\': 533481}, \'multiverseid\': 533481}, {\'name\': \'モスファイアの谷\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ドワーフの鍛冶場から出る排水が水を汚染し、この谷の植物生態は悪化している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85388ba5-4673-4ee6-900f-4f65575d134e\', \'multiverseId\': 533692}, \'multiverseid\': 533692}, {\'name\': \'Vale de Piromusgo\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'As plantas do vale mudam para pior conforme o refugo das forjas dos anões contamina a água.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fbe66b3-ae26-452a-964b-f28b12a18c29\', \'multiverseId\': 533903}, \'multiverseid\': 533903}, {\'name\': \'Долина Огненных Мхов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Жизнь растений в долине стала куда хуже, когда стоки из дварфских кузниц отравили воду.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b67ef2c8-b090-4069-baf4-3d04d62a1959\', \'multiverseId\': 534114}, \'multiverseid\': 534114}, {\'name\': \'苔炎山谷\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{G}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'矮人锻炉的残渣污染水源后，山谷中的植被生态进一步恶化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de2bc266-3049-40bc-8fe4-81d42f128330\', \'multiverseId\': 534325}, \'multiverseid\': 534325}, {\'name\': \'苔炎山谷\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{G}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'矮人鍛爐的殘渣污染水源後，山谷中的植被生態進一步惡化。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20cdbd1e-3b6a-4893-8ba5-ca9e58e763a9\', \'multiverseId\': 534536}, \'multiverseid\': 534536}]', "[{'name': 'Mooswurz-Brücke', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Falls die Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, eine Gesamtstärke von 10 oder mehr haben, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532849&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '118704a3-a790-4b95-9e5c-80b96f92c927', 'multiverseId': 532849}, 'multiverseid': 532849}, {'name': 'Puente de hierba musgo', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza total de 10 o más.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533060&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eca0b5b2-04aa-4dc7-8ef0-eecee54735b1', 'multiverseId': 533060}, 'multiverseid': 533060}, {'name': 'Pont de fangemousse', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{G}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force totale supérieure ou égale à 10.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533271&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e53cb3a8-e6bd-4e2e-9b75-d841999bf66b', 'multiverseId': 533271}, 'multiverseid': 533271}, {'name': 'Ponte Muscoso', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se le creature che controlli hanno una forza totale pari o superiore a 10.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533482&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00ead497-98af-45a1-bca0-a354240e0b8e', 'multiverseId': 533482}, 'multiverseid': 533482}, {'name': '苔汁の橋', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{G}を加える。\\n{G}, {T}：あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーのパワーの合計が10以上であるなら、あなたはその追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533693&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e049b29b-e5d4-40e0-b696-7545110cfc7f', 'multiverseId': 533693}, 'multiverseid': 533693}, {'name': 'Ponte Musgomosto', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se as criaturas que você controla tiverem poder total igual ou superior a 10.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533904&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '675377c7-ff3d-49e9-a9ac-dac2d45ed53d', 'multiverseId': 533904}, 'multiverseid': 533904}, {'name': 'Мост Ползучего Мха', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {G}.\\n{G}, {T}: вы можете разыграть ту изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если суммарная сила существ под вашим контролем равна 10 или более.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534115&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86ecba8e-e0d1-4cf1-9fa2-543a45f92360', 'multiverseId': 534115}, 'multiverseid': 534115}, {'name': '苔草桥', 'text': '掩蔽（此地须横置进战场。当它进战场时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌置于你牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{G}，{T}：如果由你操控之生物的力量总和等于或大于10，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534326&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f90696f-8aae-4f2f-8a77-786bd3998136', 'multiverseId': 534326}, 'multiverseid': 534326}, {'name': '苔草橋', 'text': '掩蔽（此地須橫置進戰場。當它進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌置於你牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{G}。\\n{G}，{T}：如果由你操控之生物的力量總和等於或大於10，則你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534537&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '83a4ac39-4fb9-446c-a8ff-b94931c79957', 'multiverseId': 534537}, 'multiverseid': 534537}]", '[{\'name\': \'Mysteriöses Sanktum\', \'text\': \'Das Mysteriöse Sanktum kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}, {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir müssen uns auf unser eigenes Wissen verlassen, nicht auf das Dogma der Suchenden oder das Gemurmel der Sphingen."\\n—Tullus von Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532821&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c7548f0-f5ce-457f-9b66-6a7926af34ab\', \'multiverseId\': 532821}, \'multiverseid\': 532821}, {\'name\': \'Santuario arcano\', \'text\': \'El Santuario arcano entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Debemos confiar en nuestro conocimiento, no en el dogma de los buscadores o los balbuceos de las esfinges".\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'946501c3-2ed2-4df6-a349-21fbf8352fbc\', \'multiverseId\': 533032}, \'multiverseid\': 533032}, {\'name\': \'Sanctuaire ésotérique\', \'text\': \'Le Sanctuaire ésotérique arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}, {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous devons nous fier à notre connaissance, pas au dogme des chercheurs ou aux murmures des sphinx. »\\n—Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533243&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d69609d-0b83-4db7-b343-990533f6fd9b\', \'multiverseId\': 533243}, \'multiverseid\': 533243}, {\'name\': \'Santuario Arcano\', \'text\': \'Il Santuario Arcano entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}, {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Dobbiamo confidare nelle nostre conoscenze, non nel dogma dei cercatori o nei mormorii delle sfingi."\\n—Tullus di Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38d1ffe9-1077-4fdc-a8f7-0ee64ad3261a\', \'multiverseId\': 533454}, \'multiverseid\': 533454}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の聖域\', \'text\': \'秘儀の聖域はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「我々は求道者の教義やスフィンクスのぼやきなどではなく、自らの知識を礎としなければならない。」\\n――パランディウスのタラス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54fcab16-91bd-446f-98ef-e2324be8e50e\', \'multiverseId\': 533665}, \'multiverseid\': 533665}, {\'name\': \'Santuário Arcano\', \'text\': \'Santuário Arcano entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}, {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Precisamos contar com nosso próprio conhecimento, não com o dogma dos buscadores nem com a ladainha das esfinges."\\n— Tullus de Palandius\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66b3916f-6455-48f9-80db-36903f88341e\', \'multiverseId\': 533876}, \'multiverseid\': 533876}, {\'name\': \'Загадочное Святилище\', \'text\': \'Загадочное Святилище выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}, {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«Мы должны полагаться на собственные знания, а не на догмы искателей и бормотания сфинксов».\\n— Туллус, правитель Паландиуса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6490d1-d408-4a15-81d6-be5e11d92b0d\', \'multiverseId\': 534087}, \'multiverseid\': 534087}, {\'name\': \'玄秘圣所\', \'text\': \'玄秘圣所须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我们得依赖自己的知识，而不是致知者的文件、史芬斯的呢喃。」\\n～帕连迪的突卢兹\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e832c9e-99d0-423f-9455-e6a1a4f417cd\', \'multiverseId\': 534298}, \'multiverseid\': 534298}, {\'name\': \'玄秘聖所\', \'text\': \'玄秘聖所須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{W}，{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我們得依賴自己的知識，而不是致知者的文件、史芬斯的呢喃。」\\n～帕連迪的突盧茲\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12522ac9-8d18-4cf9-aeea-80a35dbc55f5\', \'multiverseId\': 534509}, \'multiverseid\': 534509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Naturgeheimnisse\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Druidentum ist eine einfache Anrufung der Naturgeister, die einen Einblick in die Geheimnisse der Natur verspricht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532762&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d76cfd-cf53-48e3-9cc6-d239b67d9bf5\', \'multiverseId\': 532762}, \'multiverseid\': 532762}, {\'name\': \'Sabiduría de la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El saber druídico no es más que una invocación de espíritus de la naturaleza que dejan columbrar los secretos de esta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23abd5d-c292-41f8-9948-5025674f6510\', \'multiverseId\': 532973}, \'multiverseid\': 532973}, {\'name\': \'Sapience naturaliste\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'art druidique est une simple invocation des esprits de la nature, promettant d\'entrapercevoir les secrets du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533184&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca4e66d2-a41b-44ba-b4d5-a2c44d7b8fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 533184}, \'multiverseid\': 533184}, {\'name\': \'Sapere della Natura\', \'text\': \'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "L\'artificio druidico è una semplice invocazione agli spiriti della natura, che promettono un assaggio dei loro segreti.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6361163-e3be-45c0-bed4-fa1905f6efba\', \'multiverseId\': 533395}, \'multiverseid\': 533395}, {\'name\': \'自然の知識\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ドルイドクラフトは、自然のスピリットを呼び出して自然の秘密を垣間見せてくれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d1fa62-ca7d-4a9a-b5fc-9a29977e4915\', \'multiverseId\': 533606}, \'multiverseid\': 533606}, {\'name\': \'Sabedoria da Natureza\', \'text\': \'Procure em seu grimório um card de Floresta, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O druidismo é uma invocação simples dos espíritos da natureza, com a promessa de um vislumbre de seus segredos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16205a89-c8c6-490d-9f5a-062722583097\', \'multiverseId\': 533817}, \'multiverseid\': 533817}, {\'name\': \'Мудрость Природы\', \'text\': \'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту Леса, положите ту карту на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Друидизм — это простое взывание к природным духам в надежде хоть немного приоткрыть тайны природы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6010798-1a26-4f3c-8c64-7adca24ea13e\', \'multiverseId\': 534028}, \'multiverseid\': 534028}, {\'name\': \'大自然的知识\', \'text\': \'从你的牌库中搜寻一张树林牌，将该牌放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'德鲁伊伎俩正是对自然之魂的虔诚祈愿，换取对方许你窥见自然的秘密真相。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfad40a3-9cd0-4a09-b282-cb6a07d36e6d\', \'multiverseId\': 534239}, \'multiverseid\': 534239}, {\'name\': \'大自然的知識\', \'text\': \'從你的牌庫中搜尋一張樹林牌，將該牌放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'德魯伊伎倆正是對自然之魂的虔誠祈願，換取對方許你窺見自然的秘密真相。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b202ae-17cb-48e2-9a43-88ac14227784\', \'multiverseId\': 534450}, \'multiverseid\': 534450}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekromagische Auslese\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen und bringe dann eine Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurde, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück. Sie ist zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben und Typen ein schwarzer Zombie. Schicke die Nekromagische Auslese ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Er schlurfte aus der Aschewolke und ließ den Knochenhaufen hinter sich, völlig unbeirrt von seinem eigenen Tod.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532701&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ec2cd96-344b-469a-9ef9-f5cc1cff9861\', \'multiverseId\': 532701}, \'multiverseid\': 532701}, {\'name\': \'Selección nigromántica\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas. Luego, regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura puesta en un cementerio de esta manera. Es un Zombie negro además de sus otros colores y tipos. Exilia la Selección nigromántica.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Se arrastró entre la nube de cenizas y polvo de hueso, sin ceder al desaliento de su propia extinción.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c5029cb-17ba-4d2b-b50e-e247141fc602\', \'multiverseId\': 532912}, \'multiverseid\': 532912}, {\'name\': \'Sélection nécromantique\', \'text\': "Détruisez toutes les créatures, puis renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature mise dans un cimetière de cette manière. C\'est un zombie noir en plus de ses autres couleurs et de ses autres types. Exilez la Sélection nécromantique.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Peu découragé par sa propre extinction, il jaillit en titubant du nuage de cendres et de poussières d\'os.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533123&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7fda1c-e7f7-41d5-a81a-bcdd8f06660c\', \'multiverseId\': 533123}, \'multiverseid\': 533123}, {\'name\': \'Selezione Necromantica\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature, poi rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura messa in un cimitero in questo modo. È uno Zombie nero in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e colori. Esilia la Selezione Necromantica.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Uscì arrancando dalla nuvola di cenere e polvere d\'osso, incurante della propria morte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2938f6ad-1bb7-42a0-a0d4-65c4cec58d62\', \'multiverseId\': 533334}, \'multiverseid\': 533334}, {\'name\': \'屍術淘汰\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。その後、これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。それは、他の色やタイプに加えて黒のゾンビでもある。屍術淘汰を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'それは自らの死滅など意に介さぬがごとく、灰と骨粉の煙の中からよろめき出た。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e1f8ad9-3d14-4f76-9d1d-f15244664415\', \'multiverseId\': 533545}, \'multiverseid\': 533545}, {\'name\': \'Seleção Necromântica\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas. Em seguida, devolva um card de criatura colocado em um cemitério desta forma ao campo de batalha sob seu controle. Ele é um Zumbi preto além de suas outras cores e tipos. Exile Seleção Necromântica.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Ele saiu cambaleante da nuvem de cinzas e poeira de ossos, sem se abalar com a própria morte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57846ab5-3f6c-4f58-aec0-eb5a206fbd01\', \'multiverseId\': 533756}, \'multiverseid\': 533756}, {\'name\': \'Некромантический Отбор\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все существа, затем верните карту существа, положенную на кладбище таким образом, на поле битвы под вашим контролем. Она является черным Зомби в дополнение к своим другим цветам и типам. Изгоните Некромантический Отбор.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Он вышел из облака праха и костяной пыли, и собственная смерть не могла остановить его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13ecd88b-abb3-4c59-b260-09c106c91315\', \'multiverseId\': 533967}, \'multiverseid\': 533967}, {\'name\': \'物尽天择\', \'text\': \'消灭所有生物，然后将一张以此法进入坟墓场的生物牌在你的操控下移回战场。它额外具有黑色此颜色与灵俑此类别。放逐物尽天择。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'残灰散尽，骨骸落定，它自混沌中蹒跚而出，饶是自身灭绝也未能惊动分毫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1646164-9f92-49e0-9eaf-efbb9a14d6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 534178}, \'multiverseid\': 534178}, {\'name\': \'物盡天擇\', \'text\': \'消滅所有生物，然後將一張以此法進入墳墓場的生物牌在你的操控下移回戰場。它額外具有黑色此顏色與殭屍此類別。放逐物盡天擇。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'殘灰散盡，骨骸落定，它自混沌中蹣跚而出，饒是自身滅絕也未能驚動分毫。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bae8f1e5-3ffd-441b-8592-63654c792433\', \'multiverseId\': 534389}, \'multiverseid\': 534389}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nekrotischer Remasuri\', \'text\': \'Alle Remasuris haben „{3}, opfere diese bleibende Karte: Zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Remasuri\', \'flavor\': \'Obwohl Volrath schon lange tot ist, haben sich die Remasuris genau so entwickelt, wie er es wollte: zu hirnlosen Verbreitern von Zerstörung und Verzweiflung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532786&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e068d68-966d-4783-95d9-49764d980111\', \'multiverseId\': 532786}, \'multiverseid\': 532786}, {\'name\': \'Fragmentado necrótico\', \'text\': \'Todos los Fragmentados tienen "{3}, sacrificar este permanente: Destruye el permanente objetivo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fragmentado\', \'flavor\': \'Aunque Volrath está muerto hace tiempo, los fragmentados se convirtieron en todo lo que él quería: instrumentos de destrucción y desesperación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd7e904-91b9-486b-a680-ce44c155e049\', \'multiverseId\': 532997}, \'multiverseid\': 532997}, {\'name\': \'Slivoïde nécrotique\', \'text\': \'Tous les slivoïdes ont « {3}, sacrifiez ce permanent : Détruisez un permanent ciblé. »\', \'type\': \'Créature : slivoïde\', \'flavor\': "Wöhlrajh a beau avoir péri depuis longtemps, les slivoïdes sont devenus tout ce qu\'il espérait : des instruments de destruction et de désespoir dénués d\'intelligence.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52410907-0c34-458e-98d0-15ac3dc60ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 533208}, \'multiverseid\': 533208}, {\'name\': \'Tramutante Necrotico\', \'text\': \'Tutti i Tramutanti hanno "{3}, Sacrifica questo permanente: Distruggi un permanente bersaglio".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Tramutante\', \'flavor\': \'Sebbene Volrath sia morto da tempo, i tramutanti sono diventati tutto ciò che lui voleva diventassero: strumenti di distruzione e disperazione, privi di alcun senno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce122169-9dbc-4b82-a975-9eda81510966\', \'multiverseId\': 533419}, \'multiverseid\': 533419}, {\'name\': \'壊死スリヴァー\', \'text\': \'すべてのスリヴァーは「{3}, このパーマネントを生け贄に捧げる：パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スリヴァー\', \'flavor\': \'ヴォルラスははるか昔に死んだが、スリヴァーは彼が望んでいたその通りになった。破壊と絶望をもたらす意志なき道具だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90320e95-8979-4a48-b16c-db1bceb8a09e\', \'multiverseId\': 533630}, \'multiverseid\': 533630}, {\'name\': \'Fractius Necrótico\', \'text\': \'Todos os Fractius têm "{3}, sacrifique esta permanente: Destrua a permanente alvo".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Fractius\', \'flavor\': \'Embora Volrath esteja morto há muito tempo, os fractius se tornaram tudo que ele queria: instrumentos irracionais de destruição e desespero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4a2711c-86f6-4aae-ba6e-1db341edd02d\', \'multiverseId\': 533841}, \'multiverseid\': 533841}, {\'name\': \'Омертвелая Щепка\', \'text\': \'Все Щепки имеют способность «{3}, пожертвуйте этот перманент: уничтожьте целевой перманент».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Щепка\', \'flavor\': \'Хотя Волрат давно мертв, щепки стали воплощением всего, к чему он стремился, — безмозглыми инструментами ужаса и разрушения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ba3cc47-3287-4513-a237-7ffdac0fcfe1\', \'multiverseId\': 534052}, \'multiverseid\': 534052}, {\'name\': \'溃疽裂片妖\', \'text\': \'所有裂片妖具有「{3}，牺牲此永久物：消灭目标永久物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'瓦拉司虽早已败亡，他对裂片妖的期待却已实现：它们已是制造毁灭与绝望的无情工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64546a57-c81d-41f5-9e0c-da3116f9e5fb\', \'multiverseId\': 534263}, \'multiverseid\': 534263}, {\'name\': \'潰疽裂片妖\', \'text\': \'所有裂片妖具有「{3}，犧牲此永久物：消滅目標永久物。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～裂片妖\', \'flavor\': \'瓦拉司雖早已敗亡，他對裂片妖的期待卻已實現：牠們已是製造毀滅與絕望的無情工具。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a70b7c2f-d8ab-42f6-9b6a-515b4b1bcd55\', \'multiverseId\': 534474}, \'multiverseid\': 534474}]', '[{\'name\': \'Niewinter-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Niewinter-Hydra ins Spiel kommt, würfle X W6. Sie kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie dem Gesamtergebnis entspricht.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nAbwehr {4} (Immer wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {4}.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532000&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'060eae9c-55f3-4fc1-b1de-8fa9eb6ded74\', \'multiverseId\': 532000}, \'multiverseid\': 532000}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Nuncainvierno\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Hidra de Nuncainvierno entre al campo de batalla, tira Xd6. Entra con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual al total de esos resultados.\\nArrolla.\\nRebatir {4}. (Siempre que esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {4}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14e28636-bfa3-4695-a135-50f2c3ca317d\', \'multiverseId\': 532054}, \'multiverseid\': 532054}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de Padhiver\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Hydre de Padhiver arrive sur le champ de bataille, lancez X d6. Elle arrive avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au total de ces résultats.\\nPiétinement\\nParade {4} (À chaque fois que cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {4}.)", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532108&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32fc9ffe-ad05-4f2a-afee-a7ec5b983328\', \'multiverseId\': 532108}, \'multiverseid\': 532108}, {\'name\': \'Idra di Neverwinter\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Idra di Neverwinter entra nel campo di battaglia, tira X d6. Entra con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al totale di quei risultati.\\nTravolgere\\nEgida {4} (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che quel giocatore non paghi {4}.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532162&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4182e2-ec31-4927-8451-9d94d1d8df84\', \'multiverseId\': 532162}, \'multiverseid\': 532162}, {\'name\': \'ネヴァーウィンターのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'ネヴァーウィンターのハイドラが戦場に出るに際し、X個のd6を振る。これはそれらの出目の合計に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nトランプル\\n護法{4}（このクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{4}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef61003-659b-4717-8970-9e4eda0ca8fa\', \'multiverseId\': 532216}, \'multiverseid\': 532216}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Nevenunca\', \'text\': \'Conforme Hidra de Nevenunca entrar no campo de batalha, role X d6. Ela entra com um número de marcadores +1/+1 igual ao total desses resultados.\\nAtropelar\\nSalvaguarda {4} (Toda vez que esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule-a, a menos que aquele jogador pague {4}.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72e67327-faaa-4d3a-a9a1-818b8107aba4\', \'multiverseId\': 532270}, \'multiverseid\': 532270}, {\'name\': \'Гидра Невервинтера\', \'text\': \'При выходе Гидры Невервинтера на поле битвы бросьте X d6. Она выходит с количеством жетонов +1/+1 на ней, равным сумме результатов тех бросков.\\nПробивной удар\\nОберег {4} (Каждый раз, когда это существо становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, отмените то заклинание или способность, если тот игрок не заплатит {4}.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6777e61f-3b09-4239-b36b-f9875308f31f\', \'multiverseId\': 532324}, \'multiverseid\': 532324}, {\'name\': \'绝冬之森多头蛇蜥\', \'text\': \'于绝冬之森多头蛇蜥进战场时，掷X颗d6。它进战场时上面有数个+1/+1指示物，其数量等同于所有掷骰结果的总和。\\n践踏\\n守护{4}（每当此生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{4}，否则反击之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532378&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ca961f3-ced2-4bbe-aadb-c314d73a744a\', \'multiverseId\': 532378}, \'multiverseid\': 532378}, {\'name\': \'絕冬之森多頭蛇蜥\', \'text\': \'於絕冬之森多頭蛇蜥進戰場時，擲X顆d6。它進戰場時上面有數個+1/+1指示物，其數量等同於所有擲骰結果的總和。\\n踐踏\\n守護{4}（每當此生物成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，除非該玩家支付{4}，否則反擊之。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09672e55-2fa4-4b02-bd18-32ebe1cb9cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 532432}, \'multiverseid\': 532432}]', '[{\'name\': \'Niewinter-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Niewinter-Hydra ins Spiel kommt, würfle X W6. Sie kommt mit so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie dem Gesamtergebnis entspricht.\\nVerursacht Trampelschaden\\nAbwehr {4}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ea3c0c-a007-498b-b969-0e611f4f40c8\', \'multiverseId\': 531586}, \'multiverseid\': 531586}, {\'name\': \'Hidra de Nuncainvierno\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Hidra de Nuncainvierno entre al campo de batalla, tira Xd6. Entra con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella igual al total de esos resultados.\\nArrolla.\\nRebatir {4}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'577035ef-f4e8-47d1-96c4-55e726baa3e3\', \'multiverseId\': 531642}, \'multiverseid\': 531642}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de Padhiver\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Hydre de Padhiver arrive sur le champ de bataille, lancez X d6. Elle arrive avec, sur elle, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 égal au total de ces résultats.\\nPiétinement\\nParade {4}", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531698&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f8d8249-2e35-4e18-a90f-62a9073fe8f8\', \'multiverseId\': 531698}, \'multiverseid\': 531698}, {\'name\': \'Idra di Neverwinter\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Idra di Neverwinter entra nel campo di battaglia, tira X d6. Entra con un numero di segnalini +1/+1 pari al totale di quei risultati.\\nTravolgere\\nEgida {4}", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa4180f7-df0e-4ca7-9936-3f987ef26e10\', \'multiverseId\': 531754}, \'multiverseid\': 531754}, {\'name\': \'ネヴァーウィンターのハイドラ\', \'text\': \'ネヴァーウィンターのハイドラが戦場に出るに際し、d6をX回振る。これはそれらの出目の合計に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターが置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\nトランプル\\n護法{4}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63c3f1d-ece4-4ec4-b7a9-cb468b1226ec\', \'multiverseId\': 531810}, \'multiverseid\': 531810}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Wenn Nihiloor ins Spiel kommt, tappe für jeden Gegner bis zu eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Wenn du dies tust, übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert und deren Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Stärke der getappten Kreatur ist, solange du Nihiloor kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn du mit einer Kreatur angreifst, die ein Gegner besitzt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und jener Spieler verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531599&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab40f611-a752-4385-8f28-fcaeeb9dc8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 531599}, \'multiverseid\': 531599}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Cuando Nihiloor entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, gira hasta una criatura enderezada que controlas. Cuando lo hagas, ganas el control de la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador con fuerza menor o igual que la fuerza de la criatura girada mientras controles a Nihiloor.\\nSiempre que ataques con una criatura que sea propiedad de un oponente, ganas 2 vidas y ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffd2948-6c13-4e52-b917-8ca225f2c960\', \'multiverseId\': 531655}, \'multiverseid\': 531655}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': "Quand Nihiloor arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, engagez jusqu\'à une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez. Quand vous faites ainsi, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle ayant une force inférieure ou égale à la force de la créature engagée tant que vous contrôlez Nihiloor.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec une créature qu\'un adversaire possède, vous gagnez 2 points de vie et ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531711&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde9b681-4e97-4787-a40e-7a16f7899423\', \'multiverseId\': 531711}, \'multiverseid\': 531711}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Quando Nihiloor entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, TAPpa fino a una creatura STAPpata che controlli. Quando lo fai, prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore con forza pari o inferiore a quella della creatura TAPpata fintanto che controlli Nihiloor.\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con una creatura posseduta da un avversario, guadagni 2 punti vita e quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2553b838-443c-4e6a-90df-b2fc0af9f32a\', \'multiverseId\': 531767}, \'multiverseid\': 531767}, {\'name\': \'ナイヘルア\', \'text\': \'ナイヘルアが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のクリーチャー最大１体をタップする。そうしたとき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてパワーがそのタップされたクリーチャーのパワー以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたがナイヘルアをコントロールし続けているかぎり、それのコントロールを得る。\\nあなたが、対戦相手がオーナーであるクリーチャー１体で攻撃するたび、あなたは２点のライフを得て、そのクリーチャーのオーナーであるプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3bc1bd4-8989-4d84-b574-9239d241ff60\', \'multiverseId\': 531823}, \'multiverseid\': 531823}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Wenn Nihiloor ins Spiel kommt, tappe für jeden Gegner bis zu eine ungetappte Kreatur, die du kontrollierst. Wenn du dies tust, übernimm die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert und deren Stärke kleiner oder gleich der Stärke der getappten Kreatur ist, solange du Nihiloor kontrollierst.\\nImmer wenn du mit einer Kreatur angreifst, die ein Gegner besitzt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und jener Spieler verliert 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acef9937-0c08-41a7-a1c2-c7c114bd5d54\', \'multiverseId\': 531876}, \'multiverseid\': 531876}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Cuando Nihiloor entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, gira hasta una criatura enderezada que controlas. Cuando lo hagas, ganas el control de la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador con fuerza menor o igual que la fuerza de la criatura girada mientras controles a Nihiloor.\\nSiempre que ataques con una criatura que sea propiedad de un oponente, ganas 2 vidas y ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e41fef85-8809-41c9-a735-10f06ee79450\', \'multiverseId\': 531880}, \'multiverseid\': 531880}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': "Quand Nihiloor arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, engagez jusqu\'à une créature dégagée que vous contrôlez. Quand vous faites ainsi, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle ayant une force inférieure ou égale à la force de la créature engagée tant que vous contrôlez Nihiloor.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous attaquez avec une créature qu\'un adversaire possède, vous gagnez 2 points de vie et ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531884&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c107bd6-7812-47d0-a7bb-7a24d37092a6\', \'multiverseId\': 531884}, \'multiverseid\': 531884}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Quando Nihiloor entra nel campo di battaglia, per ogni avversario, TAPpa fino a una creatura STAPpata che controlli. Quando lo fai, prendi il controllo di una creatura bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore con forza pari o inferiore a quella della creatura TAPpata fintanto che controlli Nihiloor.\\nOgniqualvolta attacchi con una creatura posseduta da un avversario, guadagni 2 punti vita e quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orrore\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a47031c-d4e0-4210-a03c-63893ca30c9f\', \'multiverseId\': 531888}, \'multiverseid\': 531888}, {\'name\': \'ナイヘルア\', \'text\': \'ナイヘルアが戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態のクリーチャー最大１体をタップする。そうしたとき、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてパワーがそのタップされたクリーチャーのパワー以下のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたがナイヘルアをコントロールし続けているかぎり、それのコントロールを得る。\\nあなたが、対戦相手がオーナーであるクリーチャー１体で攻撃するたび、あなたは２点のライフを得て、そのクリーチャーのオーナーであるプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ee3b9fb-edda-4764-aebd-e8db5caebf84\', \'multiverseId\': 531892}, \'multiverseid\': 531892}, {\'name\': \'Nihiloor\', \'text\': \'Quando Nihiloor entrar no campo de batalha, para cada oponente, vire até uma criatura desvirada que você controla. Quando fizer isso, enquanto você controlar Nihiloor, ganhe o controle da criatura alvo que aquele jogador controla com poder igual ou inferior ao poder da criatura virada.\\nToda vez que você ataca com uma criatura que pertence a um oponente, você ganha 2 pontos de vida e aquele jogador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Horror\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c42ae1ee-9d5a-4c8f-8e2b-6cdef3f348c3\', \'multiverseId\': 531896}, \'multiverseid\': 531896}, {\'name\': \'Нигилур\', \'text\': \'Когда Нигилур выходит на поле битвы, за каждого оппонента поверните не более одного неповернутого существа под вашим контролем. Когда вы это делаете, получите контроль над целевым существом под контролем того игрока, значение силы которого не превышает значение силы повернутого существа, на все время, пока вы контролируете Нигилура.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы атакуете существом, принадлежащим оппоненту, вы получаете 2 жизни, а тот игрок теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Ужас\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'029cefbb-36e1-4ef6-9892-5bf37edd1eb8\', \'multiverseId\': 531900}, \'multiverseid\': 531900}, {\'name\': \'奈席洛\', \'text\': \'当奈席洛进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～横置至多一个由你操控且未横置的生物。当你如此作时，选择目标由该牌手操控的生物，且其力量须等于或小于所横置者。于你操控奈席洛的时段内，获得所选生物之操控权。\\n每当你以一个由对手拥有的生物攻击时，你获得2点生命，且该牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe63acc2-1497-455d-985e-bcd26d38f522\', \'multiverseId\': 531904}, \'multiverseid\': 531904}, {\'name\': \'奈席洛\', \'text\': \'當奈席洛進戰場時，為每位對手各進行以下流程～橫置至多一個由你操控且未橫置的生物。當你如此作時，選擇目標由該玩家操控的生物，且其力量須等於或小於所橫置者。於你操控奈席洛的時段內，獲得所選生物之操控權。\\n每當你以一個由對手擁有的生物攻擊時，你獲得2點生命，且該玩家失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～驚懼獸\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a90412f8-a094-4a5a-877f-1d20ad36645e\', \'multiverseId\': 531908}, \'multiverseid\': 531908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ogerfürst der Slums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\\nRatten, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„In seiner Mietskaserne wimmelt es von dem widerwärtigsten, abscheulichsten Ungeziefer. Und rattenverseucht ist sie auch."\\n—Branko Einohr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532702&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58b5cac3-e64e-471b-a46e-fd75a5b5bc19\', \'multiverseId\': 532702}, \'multiverseid\': 532702}, {\'name\': \'Ogro amo del distrito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1.\\nLas Ratas que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Su propiedad está llena de las alimañas más viles y asquerosas. Y además está infestada de ratas".\\n—Branko Una Oreja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e4f77ed-9d1e-4c8b-b9e7-e792781d2ebf\', \'multiverseId\': 532913}, \'multiverseid\': 532913}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur ogre de quartier insalubre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat.\\nLes rats que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature : ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Son logis est rempli de la vermine la plus dégoûtante, la plus vile qui soit. Et en plus, il est infesté de rats. »\\n—Branko Une-Oreille\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9c2fed7-7d9e-452c-b906-68d65ffac137\', \'multiverseId\': 533124}, \'multiverseid\': 533124}, {\'name\': \'Ogre Padrone dei Tuguri\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un\'altra creatura non pedina muore, puoi creare una pedina creatura Ratto 1/1 nera.\\nI Ratti che controlli hanno tocco letale.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Ogre\', \'flavor\': \'"Il suo caseggiato è infestato dai parassiti più disgustosi. E anche dai ratti."\\n—Branko Senz\\\'Orecchio\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83256bff-0eaf-4fae-9270-1d0af380ded4\', \'multiverseId\': 533335}, \'multiverseid\': 533335}, {\'name\': \'オーガの貧王\', \'text\': \'これでもトークンでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのネズミは接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつのボロ部屋ときたら、気色悪い最低の害虫がうようよしてやがる。しかもネズミまで住み着いてるんだぜ。」\\n――隻耳のブランコ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'982682e2-a80d-4187-9dc1-dac231f57f30\', \'multiverseId\': 533546}, \'multiverseid\': 533546}, {\'name\': \'Senhorio Ogro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma outra criatura não ficha morre, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura Rato preta 1/1.\\nOs Ratos que você controla têm toque mortífero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ogro Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'"O cortiço dele está cheio das pragas mais vis e nojentas. E está infestado de ratos também."\\n— Branko Uma Orelha\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ace8c2d3-d09a-4e3f-b194-6afed9672d32\', \'multiverseId\': 533757}, \'multiverseid\': 533757}, {\'name\': \'Огр, Хозяин Трущоб\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда другое не являющееся фишкой существо умирает, вы можете создать одну фишку существа 1/1 черная Крыса.\\nКрысы под вашим контролем имеют Смертельное касание.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Огр Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'«Его жилище буквально кишит самыми омерзительными и гнусными паразитами. Не говоря уже о крысах».\\n— Одноухий Бранко\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15fc7e3c-341c-4dd4-9bee-968c873a9053\', \'multiverseId\': 533968}, \'multiverseid\': 533968}, {\'name\': \'贫窟霸食人魔\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物死去时，你可以派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的老鼠具有死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「他的居所充满最邪恶恶心的病媒，还有鼠辈横行。」\\n～单耳布兰可\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a2e7b01-fafe-4b51-a988-94e752d96b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 534179}, \'multiverseid\': 534179}, {\'name\': \'貧窟霸食人魔\', \'text\': \'每當另一個非衍生物的生物死去時，你可以派出一個1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的老鼠具有死觸異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「他的居所充滿最邪惡噁心的病媒，還有鼠輩橫行。」\\n～單耳布蘭可\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb21428c-6207-4717-bc49-c5b958367817\', \'multiverseId\': 534390}, \'multiverseid\': 534390}]', "[{'name': 'Omen des Sehers', 'text': 'Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Anzahl der Karten auf deiner Hand.\\n1—14 | Ziehe X Karten.\\n15+ | Hellsicht X, ziehe dann X Karten.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531560&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7811572c-f45c-43a5-9630-f21a10d24166', 'multiverseId': 531560}, 'multiverseid': 531560}, {'name': 'Presagio del adivino', 'text': 'Tira 1d20 y suma la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\\n1—14 | Roba X cartas.\\n15+ | Adivina X y luego roba X cartas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531616&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb9ee782-39a4-4fdb-9237-b84241d9e741', 'multiverseId': 531616}, 'multiverseid': 531616}, {'name': 'Présage du devin', 'text': 'Lancez un d20 et ajoutez le nombre de cartes dans votre main au résultat.\\n1-14 | Piochez X cartes.\\n15+ | Regard X, puis piochez X cartes.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531672&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d2dcd16-0305-43fa-97fe-5ec21dca0040', 'multiverseId': 531672}, 'multiverseid': 531672}, {'name': 'Portento del Divinatore', 'text': 'Tira un d20 e aggiungi il numero di carte nella tua mano.\\n1—14 | Pesca X carte.\\n15+ | Profetizza X, poi pesca X carte.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531728&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98c4fb45-24bc-4b31-b85d-21f68cfaf2a1', 'multiverseId': 531728}, 'multiverseid': 531728}, {'name': '預言者の先触れ', 'text': 'd20を１回振り、あなたの手札にあるカードの枚数を加える。\\n1—14 | カードＸ枚を引く。\\n15+ | 占術Ｘを行い、その後カードＸ枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531784&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1940e4e-7896-4ca3-a44e-a01a20e18209', 'multiverseId': 531784}, 'multiverseid': 531784}]", "[{'name': 'Omen des Sehers', 'text': 'Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Anzahl der Karten auf deiner Hand.\\n1—14 | Ziehe X Karten.\\n15+ | Hellsicht X, ziehe dann X Karten.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531974&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d314f17-b264-40f3-86ea-ec0ea5613c8d', 'multiverseId': 531974}, 'multiverseid': 531974}, {'name': 'Presagio del adivino', 'text': 'Tira 1d20 y suma la cantidad de cartas en tu mano.\\n1—14 | Roba X cartas.\\n15+ | Adivina X y luego roba X cartas.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532028&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9d593cc-ab93-46c2-bd5f-bc712951b87a', 'multiverseId': 532028}, 'multiverseid': 532028}, {'name': 'Présage du devin', 'text': 'Lancez un d20 et ajoutez le nombre de cartes dans votre main au résultat.\\n1-14 | Piochez X cartes.\\n15+ | Regard X, puis piochez X cartes.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532082&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4857716f-9264-40e3-952b-eaec01de6160', 'multiverseId': 532082}, 'multiverseid': 532082}, {'name': 'Portento del Divinatore', 'text': 'Tira un d20 e aggiungi il numero di carte nella tua mano.\\n1—14 | Pesca X carte.\\n15+ | Profetizza X, poi pesca X carte.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532136&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f828ffd-ae4a-44d2-8c4a-49bfc9560752', 'multiverseId': 532136}, 'multiverseid': 532136}, {'name': '預言者の先触れ', 'text': '１個のd20を振り、その出目にあなたの手札にあるカードの枚数を足す。\\n1—14 | カードＸ枚を引く。\\n15+ | 占術Ｘを行い、その後カードＸ枚を引く。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532190&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2a01e49f-ed6e-4d56-b051-39ef9fa947ac', 'multiverseId': 532190}, 'multiverseid': 532190}, {'name': 'Augúrio do Adivinho', 'text': 'Role um d20 e some ao resultado o número de cards em sua mão.\\n1—14 | Compre X cards.\\n15+ | Use vidência X e depois compre X cards.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532244&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '53aa7ea9-0a2c-4cc7-9753-1f4b63f16784', 'multiverseId': 532244}, 'multiverseid': 532244}, {'name': 'Знамение Предсказателя', 'text': 'Бросьте d20 и прибавьте число карт в вашей руке.\\n1—14 | Возьмите Х карт.\\n15+ | Предскажите X, затем возьмите Х карт.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532298&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51134168-dc61-4ea2-b98c-bedca47be079', 'multiverseId': 532298}, 'multiverseid': 532298}, {'name': '预言师示兆', 'text': '掷一颗d20，然后将点数加上你的手牌数量。\\n1～14 | 抓X张牌。\\n15+ | 占卜X，然后抓X张牌。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532352&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '64e7d45a-f4b2-4d64-8bc5-19b45430d3cc', 'multiverseId': 532352}, 'multiverseid': 532352}, {'name': '預言師示兆', 'text': '擲一顆d20，然後將點數加上你的手牌數量。\\n1～14 | 抽X張牌。\\n15+ | 占卜X，然後抽X張牌。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532406&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ad33293-b9b0-4abb-8c5d-045406533e55', 'multiverseId': 532406}, 'multiverseid': 532406}]", '[{\'name\': \'Opulentes Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nWenn das Opulente Wachstum ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nDas verzauberte Land hat „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532748&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17f2eb5a-71a8-4fd2-bddb-dfa31d246d2a\', \'multiverseId\': 532748}, \'multiverseid\': 532748}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento abundante\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nCuando Crecimiento abundante entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\\nLa tierra encantada tiene "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0fd02b3-98a6-4b29-8174-98ee6f3fc3aa\', \'multiverseId\': 532959}, \'multiverseid\': 532959}, {\'name\': \'Croissance abondante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nQuand la Croissance abondante arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\\nLe terrain enchanté a « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02b5b251-e79a-4474-a311-df0a240cae73\', \'multiverseId\': 533170}, \'multiverseid\': 533170}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Abbondante\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nQuando la Crescita Abbondante entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\\nLa terra incantata ha "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533381&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'596dc4d4-9596-4520-a21f-71614a56d266\', \'multiverseId\': 533381}, \'multiverseid\': 533381}, {\'name\': \'豊かな成長\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\n豊かな成長が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\\nエンチャントしている土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533592&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75b95090-37c5-4e57-84bc-306088eb2bc8\', \'multiverseId\': 533592}, \'multiverseid\': 533592}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Abundante\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nQuando Crescimento Abundante entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\\nO terreno encantado tem "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor".\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b695d3f9-5141-4761-83f7-d73953a19ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 533803}, \'multiverseid\': 533803}, {\'name\': \'Обильный Рост\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nКогда Обильный Рост выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\\nЗачарованная земля имеет способность «{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43fb90b5-232e-4441-b7d1-0e6a8cac43f7\', \'multiverseId\': 534014}, \'multiverseid\': 534014}, {\'name\': \'丰足成长\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n当丰足成长进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n所结附的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25aa3fa-ecd3-4a04-8c0a-65c45d73e2ea\', \'multiverseId\': 534225}, \'multiverseid\': 534225}, {\'name\': \'豐足成長\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n當豐足成長進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n所結附的地具有「{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。」\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b208b7cb-7b2f-4351-be8f-65a4595ea170\', \'multiverseId\': 534436}, \'multiverseid\': 534436}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orakel der Dunkelheit\', \'text\': \'{1}, opfere eine Kreatur: Schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Man braucht keine Augen, um die Zukunft zu sehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532717&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5184154-2ea8-410b-94ad-b1e69d273177\', \'multiverseId\': 532717}, \'multiverseid\': 532717}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo de habitasombras\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrificar una criatura: Exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los ojos no son necesarios para ver el futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7461d8cd-64d7-454b-8ef3-6fb351fb9e42\', \'multiverseId\': 532928}, \'multiverseid\': 532928}, {\'name\': \'Oracle sciaphile\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifiez une créature : Exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Inutile d\'avoir des yeux pour voir l\'avenir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3cc775f3-4518-4a39-8ff1-47b4809540a8\', \'multiverseId\': 533139}, \'multiverseid\': 533139}, {\'name\': "Oracolo Abitante dell\'Oscurità", \'text\': \'{1}, Sacrifica una creatura: Esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Non servono gli occhi per vedere il futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4766dca-f6ab-4a14-a571-ade8a48e157d\', \'multiverseId\': 533350}, \'multiverseid\': 533350}, {\'name\': \'闇住まいの神託者\', \'text\': \'{1}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。このターン、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'未来を見るのに目は必要ない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10629118-b444-4b42-9b6e-24f55efc64c3\', \'multiverseId\': 533561}, \'multiverseid\': 533561}, {\'name\': \'Oráculo Habitante do Escuro\', \'text\': \'{1}, sacrifique uma criatura: Exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'Não é preciso olhos para ver o futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6679a6cd-2d6b-4572-b3bc-1f099bb47239\', \'multiverseId\': 533772}, \'multiverseid\': 533772}, {\'name\': \'Оракул, Обитатель Тьмы\', \'text\': \'{1}, пожертвуйте существо: изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы заглянуть в будущее, не обязательно иметь глаза.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5511d2ed-f274-4c23-8838-0b8a908bc924\', \'multiverseId\': 533983}, \'multiverseid\': 533983}, {\'name\': \'暗栖先知\', \'text\': \'{1}，牺牲一个生物：放逐你的牌库顶牌。本回合中，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'预见未来不需用眼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28efc404-0219-41f8-8ce8-92a71f2a0fab\', \'multiverseId\': 534194}, \'multiverseid\': 534194}, {\'name\': \'暗棲先知\', \'text\': \'{1}，犧牲一個生物：放逐你的牌庫頂牌。本回合中，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'預見未來不需用眼。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077c8baf-935f-4929-b207-a97ff8271ba1\', \'multiverseId\': 534405}, \'multiverseid\': 534405}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orazca-Relikt\', \'text\': \'Aufstieg (Falls du zehn oder mehr bleibende Karten kontrollierst, erhältst du für den Rest der Partie den Segen der Stadt.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, opfere das Orazca-Relikt: Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du den Segen der Stadt hast.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf5cc1e-414f-4466-8603-37a95f98a75e\', \'multiverseId\': 532811}, \'multiverseid\': 532811}, {\'name\': \'Reliquia de Orazca\', \'text\': \'Ascender. (Si controlas diez o más permanentes, obtienes la bendición de la ciudad durante el resto del juego.)\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, sacrificar la Reliquia de Orazca: Ganas 3 vidas y robas una carta. Activa esto solo si tienes la bendición de la ciudad.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c60aa649-a485-4404-8c62-a958b1addaa3\', \'multiverseId\': 533022}, \'multiverseid\': 533022}, {\'name\': "Relique d\'Orazca", \'text\': "Ascension (Si vous contrôlez au moins dix permanents, vous gagnez l\'agrément de la cité pour le reste de la partie.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Relique d\'Orazca : Vous gagnez 3 points de vie et vous piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous avez l\'agrément de la cité.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533233&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cb1e640-2c60-45d5-b199-a0b31563a31a\', \'multiverseId\': 533233}, \'multiverseid\': 533233}, {\'name\': \'Reliquia di Orazca\', \'text\': \'Ascesa (Se controlli dieci o più permanenti, ottieni la benedizione della città per il resto della partita.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}, Sacrifica la Reliquia di Orazca: Guadagni 3 punti vita e peschi una carta. Attiva solo se hai la benedizione della città.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533444&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fc3e4e5-e6d7-461f-8c47-a28b6ff4d23d\', \'multiverseId\': 533444}, \'multiverseid\': 533444}, {\'name\': \'オラーズカの秘宝\', \'text\': \'昇殿（あなたが10個以上のパーマネントをコントロールしているなら、このゲームの間、あなたは都市の承認を得る。）\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, オラーズカの秘宝を生け贄に捧げる：あなたは３点のライフを得てカード１枚を引く。あなたが都市の承認を持っていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da851aa2-22f0-491a-b816-7a787cf9a06d\', \'multiverseId\': 533655}, \'multiverseid\': 533655}, {\'name\': \'Relíquia de Orazca\', \'text\': \'Ascender (Se você controla dez ou mais permanentes, você recebe a bênção da cidade pelo restante do jogo.)\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifique Relíquia de Orazca: Você ganha 3 pontos de vida e compra um card. Ative apenas se você tiver a bênção da cidade.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ca4b06-498a-49f8-81bb-045a508fc3c4\', \'multiverseId\': 533866}, \'multiverseid\': 533866}, {\'name\': \'Реликвия Ораски\', \'text\': \'Возвышение (Если под вашим контролем есть десять или больше перманентов, вы получаете благословение города до конца партии.)\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}, пожертвуйте Реликвию Ораски: вы получаете 3 жизни и берете карту. Активируйте, только если у вас есть благословение города.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8ffb4b6-9995-4e49-a70c-170f1db5f435\', \'multiverseId\': 534077}, \'multiverseid\': 534077}, {\'name\': \'欧拉兹卡遗宝\', \'text\': \'登殿（如果你操控十个或更多永久物，则于这盘游戏接下来的时段中，你得到黄金城祝福。）\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，牺牲欧拉兹卡遗宝：你获得3点生命且抓一张牌。只能于你有黄金城祝福时起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bed0ae7b-8595-4769-bb1d-f79aff7e49aa\', \'multiverseId\': 534288}, \'multiverseid\': 534288}, {\'name\': \'歐拉茲卡遺寶\', \'text\': \'登殿（如果你操控十個或更多永久物，則於這盤遊戲接下來的時段中，你得到黃金城祝福。）\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，犧牲歐拉茲卡遺寶：你獲得3點生命且抽一張牌。只能於你有黃金城祝福時起動。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534499&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad388535-116b-4534-bfcc-9d35e63ec933\', \'multiverseId\': 534499}, \'multiverseid\': 534499}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Basilika\', \'text\': \'Die Orzhov-Basilika kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Orzhov-Basilika ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532851&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'619432b8-e47c-4ed8-a995-0497547e4080\', \'multiverseId\': 532851}, \'multiverseid\': 532851}, {\'name\': \'Basílica orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basílica orzhov entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Basílica orzhov entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1daf36fa-9836-4722-b07f-97d175671fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 533062}, \'multiverseid\': 533062}, {\'name\': "Basilique d\'Orzhov", \'text\': "La Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Basilique d\'Orzhov arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533273&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50873ecb-4175-49e6-877f-7c23d0400faf\', \'multiverseId\': 533273}, \'multiverseid\': 533273}, {\'name\': \'Basilica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'La Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Basilica Orzhov entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbfe278-af3f-49ba-b61a-00fbaddbb1f9\', \'multiverseId\': 533484}, \'multiverseid\': 533484}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの聖堂\', \'text\': \'オルゾフの聖堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nオルゾフの聖堂が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533695&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cdd297e-e117-48c9-9e43-efa1438491e8\', \'multiverseId\': 533695}, \'multiverseid\': 533695}, {\'name\': \'Basílica Orzhov\', \'text\': \'Basílica Orzhov entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Basílica Orzhov entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56c63ada-827e-4cbb-82fb-e751d5ec8507\', \'multiverseId\': 533906}, \'multiverseid\': 533906}, {\'name\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов\', \'text\': \'Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Базилика Дома Орзов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534117&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7560663-fe79-4292-a22a-b16450474250\', \'multiverseId\': 534117}, \'multiverseid\': 534117}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫大殿\', \'text\': \'欧佐夫大殿须横置进战场。\\n当欧佐夫大殿进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e98d998-0dbe-47d6-acfc-280b3924a19a\', \'multiverseId\': 534328}, \'multiverseid\': 534328}, {\'name\': \'歐佐夫大殿\', \'text\': \'歐佐夫大殿須橫置進戰場。\\n當歐佐夫大殿進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'153420e3-e2f9-4759-9ad3-b0c5d03039c5\', \'multiverseId\': 534539}, \'multiverseid\': 534539}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panorama von Bant\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Panorama von Bant: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-, Ebene- oder Insel-Standardlandkarte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Herzen in Bant sind so rein wie die Luft und so hell wie der Himmel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532823&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b134771-5916-4d74-a44a-a379f617f5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 532823}, \'multiverseid\': 532823}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Bant\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Panorama de Bant: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque, Llanura o Isla básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los corazones de Bant son puros como su aire y brillantes como sus cielos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98986e3-a01f-4dea-97e1-327ec677aa8f\', \'multiverseId\': 533034}, \'multiverseid\': 533034}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Bant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Panorama de Bant : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, de plaine ou d\'île de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les cœurs de Bant sont aussi purs que son air et aussi limpides que ses cieux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533245&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adbe9aa3-ecbd-4979-8ee3-74cae4d0f473\', \'multiverseId\': 533245}, \'multiverseid\': 533245}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Bant\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Panorama di Bant: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Foresta, Pianura o Isola base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'I cuori di Bant sono puri come la sua aria e luminosi come i suoi cieli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29df9d1b-550d-4228-9bcb-2513c39fd111\', \'multiverseId\': 533456}, \'multiverseid\': 533456}, {\'name\': \'バントの全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, バントの全景を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本であり森か平地か島であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'バントの中心は、その空気と同じぐらい清らかで、その空と同じぐらい明るい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68265f48-7b90-4e9f-a4af-2cee3f873727\', \'multiverseId\': 533667}, \'multiverseid\': 533667}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Bant\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Panorama de Bant: Procure em seu grimório um card de Floresta, Planície ou Ilha básico e coloque-o no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os corações de Bant são tão puros quanto seu ar, tão límpidos quanto seus céus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ce8bec-e26c-44b0-af95-b13323507494\', \'multiverseId\': 533878}, \'multiverseid\': 533878}, {\'name\': \'Панорама Бэнта\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Панораму Бэнта: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базового Леса, Равнины или Острова, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Сердца Бэнта чисты, как воздух, и светлы, как небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbeb923e-493f-4aa7-a8ca-05f1e978f6c0\', \'multiverseId\': 534089}, \'multiverseid\': 534089}, {\'name\': \'班特全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲班特全景：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本的树林，平原或海岛牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'班特的心思如空气纯净，似天空明亮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93e89433-7cdf-415b-9750-259a6615baad\', \'multiverseId\': 534300}, \'multiverseid\': 534300}, {\'name\': \'班特全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲班特全景：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本的樹林，平原或海島牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'班特的心思如空氣純淨，似天空明亮。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45852b33-8069-4ecc-8507-588002022e13\', \'multiverseId\': 534511}, \'multiverseid\': 534511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Panorama von Esper\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, opfere das Panorama von Esper: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-, Insel- oder Sumpf-Standardlandkarte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Esper ist wie eine riesige Leinwand, die von genauen, kontrollierenden Händen bemalt wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2deabb24-4433-46ef-bd6a-103aa2905302\', \'multiverseId\': 532833}, \'multiverseid\': 532833}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Esper\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrificar el Panorama de Esper: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, Isla o Pantano básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Esper es una tela pintada por manos controladoras y precisas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78a70f16-eead-4921-8ad9-f1428b6a6a54\', \'multiverseId\': 533044}, \'multiverseid\': 533044}, {\'name\': "Panorama d\'Esper", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifiez le Panorama d\'Esper : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, d\'île ou de marais de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Esper est une toile immense peinte par des mains précises et expertes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533255&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2a3993-2614-402b-b723-b6af64f324a1\', \'multiverseId\': 533255}, \'multiverseid\': 533255}, {\'name\': \'Panorama di Esper\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, Sacrifica il Panorama di Esper: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta Pianura, Isola o Palude base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'Esper è una vasta tela dipinta da mani precise e dominanti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb845a27-b8d7-4b76-8363-a73055ffcabb\', \'multiverseId\': 533466}, \'multiverseid\': 533466}, {\'name\': \'エスパーの全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}, エスパーの全景を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本であり平地か島か沼であるカード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'エスパーは緻密に統制された手で塗られている、広がりゆくキャンバスだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64a6a30f-ac73-4dab-a366-edde01c82059\', \'multiverseId\': 533677}, \'multiverseid\': 533677}, {\'name\': \'Panorama de Esper\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, sacrifique Panorama de Esper: Procure em seu grimório um card de Planície, Ilha ou Pântano básico, coloque-o no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Esper é uma ampla tela pintada por mãos meticulosas e controladoras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49bc3547-d1c9-4f52-82a2-3ea85a004278\', \'multiverseId\': 533888}, \'multiverseid\': 533888}, {\'name\': \'Панорама Эспера\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{1}, {T}, пожертвуйте Панораму Эспера: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой Равнины, Острова или Болота, положите ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Эспер — это масштабное полотно, нарисованное точными, умелыми руками.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53717624-5d66-459c-a947-ec7a3bb40725\', \'multiverseId\': 534099}, \'multiverseid\': 534099}, {\'name\': \'艾斯波全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，牺牲艾斯波全景：从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本的平原，海岛或沼泽牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'艾斯波有如一块广大帆布，由精细而全面控制的手上色。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c293fcc-a2aa-4510-b1a8-34eb0cd77863\', \'multiverseId\': 534310}, \'multiverseid\': 534310}, {\'name\': \'艾斯波全景\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}，犧牲艾斯波全景：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本的平原，海島或沼澤牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'艾斯波有如一塊廣大帆布，由精細而全面控制的手上色。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9fa2de2-28a0-43ec-bfef-690162ebc084\', \'multiverseId\': 534521}, \'multiverseid\': 534521}]', '[{\'name\': \'Paradiesdruidin\', \'text\': \'Die Paradiesdruidin hat Fluchsicherheit, solange sie ungetappt ist.(Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Es gibt viele Arten von Pflichten. Meine Pflicht besteht darin, unsere Welt wachsen zu sehen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532763&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5020bea7-8c09-43a2-ad54-e290404ee1f6\', \'multiverseId\': 532763}, \'multiverseid\': 532763}, {\'name\': \'Druida del paraíso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del paraíso tiene la habilidad de antimaleficio mientras esté enderezada.(No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Hay muchos tipos de deber, y el mío es ver que nuestro mundo crezca y resista".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'856caf8a-d1ee-42b6-9867-9bc376316e63\', \'multiverseId\': 532974}, \'multiverseid\': 532974}, {\'name\': \'Druidesse de paradis\', \'text\': "La Druidesse de paradis a la défense talismanique tant qu\'elle est dégagée.(Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Il existe une multitude de rôles différents, et le mien consiste à voir notre monde survivre et s\'épanouir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533185&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bf331ff-b5d9-483f-90b5-4f048b127be5\', \'multiverseId\': 533185}, \'multiverseid\': 533185}, {\'name\': \'Druida del Paradiso\', \'text\': \'La Druida del Paradiso ha anti-malocchio fintanto che è STAPpata.(Non può essere bersaglio di magie o abilità controllate dai tuoi avversari.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Esistono molti tipi di dovere e il mio è osservare il nostro mondo crescere e perdurare."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b2e4c9-7acc-4d7d-8be9-13ad164eaeb0\', \'multiverseId\': 533396}, \'multiverseid\': 533396}, {\'name\': \'楽園のドルイド\', \'text\': \'楽園のドルイドがアンタップ状態であるかぎり、これは呪禁を持つ。（これは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「責務には様々な形があります。私の場合はこの世界が育ち耐える様子を見守ること。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59be6a91-be84-4fa4-a1aa-c8489dc1bb8f\', \'multiverseId\': 533607}, \'multiverseid\': 533607}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Paraíso\', \'text\': \'Druida do Paraíso terá resistência a magia enquanto estiver desvirado.(Ela não pode ser alvo de mágicas nem de habilidades que seus oponentes controlam.)\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"Há muitos tipos de dever, e o meu é ver nosso mundo crescer e perdurar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'070d9daa-0245-4daa-8d9c-406c87dc17be\', \'multiverseId\': 533818}, \'multiverseid\': 533818}, {\'name\': \'Друидка Райских Кущ\', \'text\': \'Друидка Райских Кущ имеет Порчеустойчивость, пока она развернута.(Она не может быть целью заклинаний или способностей под контролем ваших оппонентов.)\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Есть много работ, и моя — следить за тем, чтобы наш мир рос и справлялся с трудностями».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'550d3761-9475-470b-9ed4-184fc37a9195\', \'multiverseId\': 534029}, \'multiverseid\': 534029}, {\'name\': \'天堂德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'只要天堂德鲁伊未横置，它便具有辟邪异能。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「世上有许多使命，我的使命就是照管世界，令其茁壮长存。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc32e96a-e3df-4d70-8700-bd30d9fe2c6d\', \'multiverseId\': 534240}, \'multiverseid\': 534240}, {\'name\': \'天堂德魯伊\', \'text\': \'只要天堂德魯伊未橫置，它便具有辟邪異能。（它不能成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標。）\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「世上有許多使命，我的使命就是照管世界，令其茁壯長存。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cb23897-8a1f-4887-a505-573077161bea\', \'multiverseId\': 534451}, \'multiverseid\': 534451}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pechhaltiger Strahl\', \'text\': \'Kaskade (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet als dieser Zauberspruch. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\\nDer Pechhaltige Strahl fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532779&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e94a1a4-45ec-4d90-8887-83599c181b02\', \'multiverseId\': 532779}, \'multiverseid\': 532779}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga bituminosa\', \'text\': \'Cascada. (Cuando lances este hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\\nLa Ráfaga bituminosa hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'990ef467-9e87-4985-afca-771aa1e0ffa6\', \'multiverseId\': 532990}, \'multiverseid\': 532990}, {\'name\': \'Salve bitumeuse\', \'text\': "Cascade (Quand vous lancez ce sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)\\nLa Salve bitumeuse inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54def94-3eed-4b2f-9c7a-3fd56e3fca86\', \'multiverseId\': 533201}, \'multiverseid\': 533201}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione di Bitume\', \'text\': "Cascata (Quando lanci questa magia, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)\\nL\'Esplosione di Bitume infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'067e139e-9063-45d2-a1b3-cca6ef0e853a\', \'multiverseId\': 533412}, \'multiverseid\': 533412}, {\'name\': \'瀝青破\', \'text\': \'続唱（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、コストがこれより低く土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\\nクリーチャー１体を対象とする。瀝青破はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb825241-d9c6-47db-85ce-53ef87c6e46a\', \'multiverseId\': 533623}, \'multiverseid\': 533623}, {\'name\': \'Explosão Betuminosa\', \'text\': \'Cascata (Quando conjurar esta mágica, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\\nExplosão Betuminosa causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe6a33e-df0b-439e-b339-a696693fd85b\', \'multiverseId\': 533834}, \'multiverseid\': 533834}, {\'name\': \'Битуминозная Волна\', \'text\': \'Каскад (Когда вы разыгрываете это заклинание, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгоните не являющуюся землей и стоящую меньше карту. Вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите изгнанные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\\nБитуминозная Волна наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6edd5c2d-0827-4f9e-aa1f-2c49ba23a32f\', \'multiverseId\': 534045}, \'multiverseid\': 534045}, {\'name\': \'沥青冲击\', \'text\': \'倾曳（当你施放此咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比此咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\\n沥青冲击对目标生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0a0524-2392-402a-b4f0-c7f64a233376\', \'multiverseId\': 534256}, \'multiverseid\': 534256}, {\'name\': \'瀝青衝擊\', \'text\': \'傾曳（當你施放此咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張費用比此咒語低的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所放逐的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。）\\n瀝青衝擊對目標生物造成4點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'729cd8f5-845a-472b-adf9-ddf84ffd9297\', \'multiverseId\': 534467}, \'multiverseid\': 534467}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs. Wenn dieses Mana verwendet wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Kommandeur gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c382c9c-9f92-4ad1-b8c2-ed73bc9e56fc\', \'multiverseId\': 532852}, \'multiverseid\': 532852}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11cbd644-0750-4214-aa9f-9e004c9acfce\', \'multiverseId\': 533063}, \'multiverseid\': 533063}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quelle couleur de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd4f229-b894-4949-a0b7-16b9aefb1ac5\', \'multiverseId\': 533274}, \'multiverseid\': 533274}, {\'name\': \'Sentiero Ancestrale\', \'text\': "Il Sentiero Ancestrale entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante. Quando quel mana viene speso per lanciare una magia creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con il tuo comandante, profetizza 1.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7630399f-3741-444c-9e7c-302a5f50032f\', \'multiverseId\': 533485}, \'multiverseid\': 533485}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。そのマナが、あなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533696&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'330bd8a9-d5e7-4ce1-b97d-c7002e580878\', \'multiverseId\': 533696}, \'multiverseid\': 533696}, {\'name\': \'Caminho da Ascendência\', \'text\': \'Caminho da Ascendência entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante. Quando aquele mana for gasto para conjurar uma mágica que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com seu comandante, use vidência 1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1718522-d7e9-47ab-a8bc-d6e1507df671\', \'multiverseId\': 533907}, \'multiverseid\': 533907}, {\'name\': \'Путь Предков\', \'text\': \'Путь Предков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира. Когда та мана тратится на разыгрывание заклинания существа, у которого есть такой же тип существа, как у вашего командира, предскажите 1.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfba7d3a-77ab-4acc-878f-8151dc41befd\', \'multiverseId\': 534118}, \'multiverseid\': 534118}, {\'name\': \'祖灵径道\', \'text\': \'祖灵径道须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。当该法术力用来施放与你指挥官具共通生物类别的生物咒语时，占卜1。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534329&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6970401a-93fc-4e6d-a370-2e6b2d41f5ff\', \'multiverseId\': 534329}, \'multiverseid\': 534329}, {\'name\': \'祖靈徑道\', \'text\': \'祖靈徑道須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。當該魔法力用來施放與你指揮官具共通生物類別的生物咒語時，占卜1。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534540&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bffe372b-9d2c-4f86-8e74-dc4b76023395\', \'multiverseId\': 534540}, \'multiverseid\': 534540}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plündernde Meermänner\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Meermänner wissen nicht immer, nach was sie suchen — bis sie es gefunden haben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532684&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c080586c-09e6-40e5-86f4-69a28efd1675\', \'multiverseId\': 532684}, \'multiverseid\': 532684}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador tritón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': \'Los tritones no siempre saben qué están buscando, pero están seguros una vez que lo encuentran.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532895&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9eb3705-c9b0-4d6e-9776-633daf575599\', \'multiverseId\': 532895}, \'multiverseid\': 532895}, {\'name\': \'Détrousseur ondin\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les ondins ne savent pas toujours ce qu\'ils cherchent, mais une fois trouvé, ils en sont certains.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533106&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c514bb7e-09a8-4c33-bc0a-6fbb86aec9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 533106}, \'multiverseid\': 533106}, {\'name\': \'Tritone Saccheggiatore\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Tritone\', \'flavor\': \'I tritoni non sempre sanno cosa cercano, ma sono sicuri quando lo trovano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6c9a22c-beb2-4f9a-a0e7-1eb9df198c08\', \'multiverseId\': 533317}, \'multiverseid\': 533317}, {\'name\': \'マーフォークの物あさり\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'マーフォークが何を求めているのかは自分でもわかっていないが、見つけたものには間違いは無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd6b9291-b27b-4cc9-a1e6-5e88445430eb\', \'multiverseId\': 533528}, \'multiverseid\': 533528}, {\'name\': \'Tritão Saqueador\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Tritão Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'Os tritões nem sempre sabem o que procuram, mas têm certeza ao encontrá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12875860-989d-42ec-91c3-7aa3b8e3f237\', \'multiverseId\': 533739}, \'multiverseid\': 533739}, {\'name\': \'Мерфолк-Грабитель\', \'text\': \'{T}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Мерфолк Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Мерфолки не всегда знают, что ищут, но когда находят, то не сомневаются.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac21f482-1677-4f78-9301-e7c0c9828c77\', \'multiverseId\': 533950}, \'multiverseid\': 533950}, {\'name\': \'掠夺人鱼\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'人鱼并不总知道自己要些什么，但他们相信找到时就会知道了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'171fdd3b-81cf-48cb-b39c-33cd51a529bf\', \'multiverseId\': 534161}, \'multiverseid\': 534161}, {\'name\': \'掠奪人魚\', \'text\': \'{T}：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人魚／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'人魚並不總知道自己要些什麼，但他們相信找到時就會知道了。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7fb525-33c2-42ea-a121-604d1456a061\', \'multiverseId\': 534372}, \'multiverseid\': 534372}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pontifex der Fäulnis\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Abnötigen. (Hat eine Kreatur mehrfach Abnötigen, wird jedes Vorkommen einzeln ausgelöst.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532706&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb712a42-72aa-446e-89e9-6dc6e959b83b\', \'multiverseId\': 532706}, \'multiverseid\': 532706}, {\'name\': \'Pontífice de desolación\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de extorsionar. (Si una criatura tiene varias copias de extorsionar, cada una se dispara por separado.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eeae619e-45d5-49eb-b9e5-eef46aeb9055\', \'multiverseId\': 532917}, \'multiverseid\': 532917}, {\'name\': \'Pontife du fléau\', \'text\': "Extorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont l\'extorsion. (Si une créature a plusieurs occurrences d\'extorsion, chacune d\'elles se déclenche séparément.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et clerc\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533128&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba0e98bd-e48f-400e-b878-48bf633e4566\', \'multiverseId\': 533128}, \'multiverseid\': 533128}, {\'name\': \'Pontefice della Rovina\', \'text\': \'Estorsione (Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia, puoi pagare {W/B}. Se lo fai, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni altrettanti punti vita.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno estorsione. (Se una creatura ha più istanze di estorsione, ognuna si innesca separatamente.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8efeb6eb-0ca3-451e-b479-d0d66165ed5a\', \'multiverseId\': 533339}, \'multiverseid\': 533339}, {\'name\': \'荒廃の司教\', \'text\': \'強請（あなたが呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは強請を持つ。（クリーチャー１体に強請が複数あるなら、それぞれ誘発する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43c90102-1ca4-4278-9af8-118cd3d1c745\', \'multiverseId\': 533550}, \'multiverseid\': 533550}, {\'name\': \'Pontífice do Flagelo\', \'text\': \'Extorquir (Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica, poderá pagar {W/B}. Se fizer isso, cada oponente perderá 1 ponto de vida e você ganhará uma quantidade equivalente de pontos de vida.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm extorquir. (Se uma criatura tem ocorrências múltiplas de extorquir, cada uma é desencadeada separadamente.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Clérigo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b53bf0d0-688d-496c-bf55-5fc41d19ac7f\', \'multiverseId\': 533761}, \'multiverseid\': 533761}, {\'name\': \'Понтифик Упадка\', \'text\': \'Вымогательство (Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание, вы можете заплатить {W/B}. Если вы это делаете, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете столько же жизней.)\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем имеют Вымогательство. (Если у существа есть несколько способностей Вымогательства, каждая из них срабатывает отдельно.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Священник\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4cc320-2dec-4eb0-b8c0-be8d23bee31f\', \'multiverseId\': 533972}, \'multiverseid\': 533972}, {\'name\': \'枯萎主教\', \'text\': \'敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\\n由你操控的其他生物具有敲诈异能。（若某生物具有数个敲诈异能，则每一个都会分别触发。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／僧侣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534183&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a0d5ab-5528-4efb-be96-d72729b3b5bb\', \'multiverseId\': 534183}, \'multiverseid\': 534183}, {\'name\': \'枯萎主教\', \'text\': \'敲詐（每當你施放咒語時，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，則每位對手各失去1點生命，且你獲得等量的生命。）\\n由你操控的其他生物具有敲詐異能。（若某生物具有數個敲詐異能，則每一個都會分別觸發。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／僧侶\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc28d62c-343f-4cad-af78-baedab75744c\', \'multiverseId\': 534394}, \'multiverseid\': 534394}]', '[{\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die er kontrolliert und die dich angreift.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Kosten deines Widerstands werden aus deinem Verstand extrahiert."\\n—Nekusar der Gedankenreißer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532689&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26663817-1840-462c-8554-6df12a1bdbe9\', \'multiverseId\': 532689}, \'multiverseid\': 532689}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El coste de tu oposición se extraerá de tu cordura".\\n—Nekusar, el arrasamentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'058a73a3-fb60-41ea-acb3-d9b447cff5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 532900}, \'multiverseid\': 532900}, {\'name\': \'Propagande\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le prix de votre opposition sera prélevé sur votre esprit. »\\n—Nekusar, le terrasseur d\'esprit", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533111&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eedd7d13-1f1f-46b9-b870-573470429bee\', \'multiverseId\': 533111}, \'multiverseid\': 533111}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Le creature non possono attaccarti a meno che il loro controllore non paghi {2} per ogni creatura che controlla che ti sta attaccando.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il costo della vostra opposizione verrà estratto dalle vostre menti."\\n—Nekusar, il Distruttore di Menti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c79ceae-fbb2-476e-b325-213c9d216427\', \'multiverseId\': 533322}, \'multiverseid\': 533322}, {\'name\': \'プロパガンダ\', \'text\': \'あなたを攻撃するクリーチャー１体につきそのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、クリーチャーは攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「敵対したことの対価は、お前の機知から頂くとしよう。」\\n――精神破壊者、ネクサル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'099ef95c-0f80-4fc2-b474-ac6afd1418a1\', \'multiverseId\': 533533}, \'multiverseid\': 533533}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'As criaturas não podem atacá-lo, a menos que seu controlador pague {2} para cada criatura que controla que está atacando você.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"O custo de sua oposição será extraído de seus pensamentos."\\n— Nekusar, o Arrasador de Mentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21849305-2d24-4609-b182-f096f7f0dba5\', \'multiverseId\': 533744}, \'multiverseid\': 533744}, {\'name\': \'Пропаганда\', \'text\': \'Существа не могут атаковать вас, если только контролирующий их игрок не заплатит {2} за каждое из атакующих вас существ под его контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Цена твоего сопротивления будет взята из твоего разума».\\n— Некузар, Грабитель Мыслей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4045ff54-f224-4b20-93ff-a087635b1c2f\', \'multiverseId\': 533955}, \'multiverseid\': 533955}, {\'name\': \'宣导\', \'text\': \'对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{2}，否则它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「你反抗的代价将从你的智慧中萃取。」\\n～毁灵师奈库萨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5223405-79af-4985-b696-e1a88f46493b\', \'multiverseId\': 534166}, \'multiverseid\': 534166}, {\'name\': \'宣導\', \'text\': \'對每個生物而言，除非其操控者為其支付{2}，否則它不能攻擊你。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「你反抗的代價將從你的智慧中萃取。」\\n～毀靈師奈庫薩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76e99b64-30d8-4180-8df7-73a48dfd6120\', \'multiverseId\': 534377}, \'multiverseid\': 534377}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prophezeiende Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWirf eine Karte ab: Die Prophezeiende Sphinx erhält Fluchsicherheit bis zum Ende des Zuges. Tappe sie.\\nImmer wenn die Prophezeiende Sphinx angreift, wende Hellsicht 3 an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532688&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef2ca854-5cdf-4326-8962-3314bbbed6e2\', \'multiverseId\': 532688}, \'multiverseid\': 532688}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge adivina\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nDescartar una carta: La Esfinge adivina gana la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. Gírala.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge adivina ataque, adivina 3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcad11df-4a57-433d-949f-982a4efb3ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 532899}, \'multiverseid\': 532899}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx des auspices\', \'text\': "Vol\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : Le Sphinx des auspices acquiert la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Engagez-le.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sphinx des auspices attaque, regard 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fab4dcbe-60dc-4ff0-b2cd-94f3c3f0241e\', \'multiverseId\': 533110}, \'multiverseid\': 533110}, {\'name\': \'Sfinge Profetica\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nScarta una carta: La Sfinge Profetica ha anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. TAPpala.\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfinge Profetica attacca, profetizza 3.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'428cfaa7-d1f1-4631-a67c-f3d5d5bf6950\', \'multiverseId\': 533321}, \'multiverseid\': 533321}, {\'name\': \'予知するスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nカード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、予知するスフィンクスは呪禁を得る。これをタップする。\\n予知するスフィンクスが攻撃するたび、占術３を行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533532&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86368c45-e7f0-4dc1-bdbe-6fe97dc4d960\', \'multiverseId\': 533532}, \'multiverseid\': 533532}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge Prognóstica\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nDescarte um card: Esfinge Prognóstica ganha resistência a magia até o final do turno. Vire-a.\\nToda vez que Esfinge Prognóstica atacar, use vidência 3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3c3075-68ab-46a9-9bd7-41a1b7b78ede\', \'multiverseId\': 533743}, \'multiverseid\': 533743}, {\'name\': \'Сфинкс-Провидец\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nСбросьте карту: Сфинкс-Провидец получает Порчеустойчивость до конца хода. Поверните его.\\nКаждый раз, когда Сфинкс-Провидец атакует, предскажите 3.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Сфинкс\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58f0195d-bd14-4f03-a865-f3194180855d\', \'multiverseId\': 533954}, \'multiverseid\': 533954}, {\'name\': \'先知史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n弃一张牌：先知史芬斯获得辟邪异能直到回合结束。将之横置。\\n每当先知史芬斯攻击时，占卜3。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a911dd2-7246-4ce6-9194-4c30d4dbaba6\', \'multiverseId\': 534165}, \'multiverseid\': 534165}, {\'name\': \'先知史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n棄一張牌：先知史芬斯獲得辟邪異能直到回合結束。將之橫置。\\n每當先知史芬斯攻擊時，占卜3。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e067f3c4-e7b4-4bbb-9c09-d28b1d11f6bd\', \'multiverseId\': 534376}, \'multiverseid\': 534376}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prosper der Buchgebundene\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nMystisches Arkanum — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments schickst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\\nSegen des Pakts — Immer wenn du eine Karte aus dem Exil spielst, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Tiefling, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531600&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef0619b7-64c3-40fe-be53-988b59fa8e7a\', \'multiverseId\': 531600}, \'multiverseid\': 531600}, {\'name\': \'Próspero, unido al grimorio\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nArcanum místico — Al comienzo de tu paso final, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\nBeneficio del pacto — Siempre que juegues una carta desde el exilio, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74bf9ac9-da65-4297-b38d-193e1c1e0401\', \'multiverseId\': 531656}, \'multiverseid\': 531656}, {\'name\': \'Prosper, lié au grimoire\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nArcanum mystique — Au début de votre étape de fin, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\nFaveur de pacte — À chaque fois que vous jouez une carte depuis l\'exil, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tieffelin et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531712&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c5e102a-2c6e-48a0-be68-b873a83e01ec\', \'multiverseId\': 531712}, \'multiverseid\': 531712}, {\'name\': \'Prosper, Vincolato al Tomo\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nArcanum Mistico — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\\nDono del Patto — Ogniqualvolta giochi una carta dall\'esilio, crea una pedina Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fe0052c-c6cd-4ba7-a01f-a4cf26d7089d\', \'multiverseId\': 531768}, \'multiverseid\': 531768}, {\'name\': \'秘本に縛られし者、プロスパー\', \'text\': \'接死\\n秘奥義 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n契約の恩恵 ― あなたが追放領域にあるカードをプレイするたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ティーフリング・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7e5500e-ce60-4ce6-a5dd-94017ef0d70e\', \'multiverseId\': 531824}, \'multiverseid\': 531824}]', '[{\'name\': \'Prosper der Buchgebundene\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nMystisches Arkanum — Zu Beginn deines Endsegments schickst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\\nSegen des Pakts — Immer wenn du eine Karte aus dem Exil spielst, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Tiefling, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531835&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f070a67-55db-49b6-aa24-ca57a2870374\', \'multiverseId\': 531835}, \'multiverseid\': 531835}, {\'name\': \'Próspero, unido al grimorio\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nArcanum místico — Al comienzo de tu paso final, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\nBeneficio del pacto — Siempre que juegues una carta desde el exilio, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dfb39fe-2840-40ee-b50c-6be9bbfe11c1\', \'multiverseId\': 531839}, \'multiverseid\': 531839}, {\'name\': \'Prosper, lié au grimoire\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nArcanum mystique — Au début de votre étape de fin, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\nFaveur de pacte — À chaque fois que vous jouez une carte depuis l\'exil, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : tieffelin et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531843&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ed8d1a6-ff74-4722-8d6f-57d7110101c2\', \'multiverseId\': 531843}, \'multiverseid\': 531843}, {\'name\': \'Prosper, Vincolato al Tomo\', \'text\': "Tocco letale\\nArcanum Mistico — All\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\\nDono del Patto — Ogniqualvolta giochi una carta dall\'esilio, crea una pedina Tesoro.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Warlock Tiefling\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a396046-d0dc-4a75-8d93-dfbfd373ea96\', \'multiverseId\': 531847}, \'multiverseid\': 531847}, {\'name\': \'秘本に縛られし者、プロスパー\', \'text\': \'接死\\n秘奥義 ― あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n契約の恩恵 ― あなたが追放領域にあるカードをプレイするたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ティーフリング・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83a1f1a4-4952-4f2e-9c4b-ff9675af7af6\', \'multiverseId\': 531851}, \'multiverseid\': 531851}, {\'name\': \'Prosper, Vinculado ao Tomo\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero\\nArcana Mística — No início de sua etapa final, exile o card do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar aquele card.\\nDádiva do Pacto — Toda vez que jogar um card do exílio, crie uma ficha de Tesouro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Tiferino Bruxo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6023185-74cd-47ce-970b-1acad6d81fad\', \'multiverseId\': 531855}, \'multiverseid\': 531855}, {\'name\': \'Проспер, Связанный с Гримуаром\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание\\nМистический арканум — В начале вашего заключительного шага изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту до конца вашего следующего хода.\\nДар договора — Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете карту из изгнания, создайте одну фишку Клада.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Тифлинг Колдун\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f8337d9-3f4c-481a-880e-14c3a3266cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 531859}, \'multiverseid\': 531859}, {\'name\': \'书契坡斯博\', \'text\': \'死触\\n玄奥秘法～在你的结束步骤开始时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\\n魔契之赐～每当你从放逐区使用牌时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～魔人／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae3d1de4-957f-45c5-bb4d-8a99e8c16364\', \'multiverseId\': 531863}, \'multiverseid\': 531863}, {\'name\': \'書契坡斯博\', \'text\': \'死觸\\n玄奧祕法～在你的結束步驟開始時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以使用該牌。\\n魔契之賜～每當你從放逐區使用牌時，派出一個珍寶衍生物。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～魔人／邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7546ab95-2a0a-4151-9ceb-c9e23fbb0378\', \'multiverseId\': 531867}, \'multiverseid\': 531867}]', "[{'name': 'Präriefluss', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {U}.)\\nDer Präriefluss kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Ebene, Insel', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Ondu ist ein ausgedehntes Plateau, durchzogen von tiefen Furchen und Mäanderströmen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532854&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bec8ec4-d1d4-43e3-a268-83fd99d100a1', 'multiverseId': 532854}, 'multiverseid': 532854}, {'name': 'Manantial de la pradera', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {W} o {U}.)\\nEl Manantial de la pradera entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Llanura isla', 'flavor': 'El continente de Ondu es una gran meseta atravesada por profundas zanjas y ríos serpenteantes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533065&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74934bad-0181-4eb4-ae2d-0183f18ec4a1', 'multiverseId': 533065}, 'multiverseid': 533065}, {'name': 'Prairie ruisselante', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {U}.)\\nLa Prairie ruisselante arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : plaine et île', 'flavor': 'Le continent du Ondou est un vaste plateau traversé de fossés profonds et de rivières sinueuses.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533276&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0b507f5-a5c7-4338-a16a-286b8a6bd925', 'multiverseId': 533276}, 'multiverseid': 533276}, {'name': 'Ruscello nella Prateria', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {W} o {U}.)\\nIl Ruscello nella Prateria entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Pianura Isola', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Ondu è un vasto altopiano segnato da profondi fossati e fiumi sinuosi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533487&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fccad7c0-9947-4639-896d-e78b9731945d', 'multiverseId': 533487}, 'multiverseid': 533487}, {'name': '大草原の川', 'text': '（{T}：{W}か{U}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、大草原の川はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 平地・島', 'flavor': 'オンドゥ大陸は広大な平地である。そこを深い溝が縦横に走り、曲がりくねった川が流れている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533698&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed7310bc-7fe6-42c9-9086-00ac97014e7a', 'multiverseId': 533698}, 'multiverseid': 533698}, {'name': 'Riacho da Pradaria', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {W} ou {U}.)\\nRiacho da Pradaria entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Planície Ilha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Ondu é um vasto platô atravessado por desfiladeiros profundos e rios sinuosos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533909&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc0506c4-f890-4015-b08a-0ded25eb1c8b', 'multiverseId': 533909}, 'multiverseid': 533909}, {'name': 'Ручей в Прерии', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {W} или {U}.)\\nРучей в Прерии выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Равнина Остров', 'flavor': 'Континент Онду — бескрайнее плато, изрезанное глубокими оврагами и извилистыми реками.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534120&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c1bb2e52-8aea-4759-a345-6f5ed5a216ab', 'multiverseId': 534120}, 'multiverseid': 534120}, {'name': '沃原溪流', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则沃原溪流须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 ～平原／海岛', 'flavor': '昂度大陆这片广袤高原沟壑纵横，蜿流交错。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534331&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bf30ea98-d170-4826-97d2-fbfdb0bf9693', 'multiverseId': 534331}, 'multiverseid': 534331}, {'name': '沃原溪流', 'text': '（{T}：加{W}或{U}。）\\n除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則沃原溪流須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地 ～平原／海島', 'flavor': '昂度大陸這片廣袤高原溝壑縱橫，蜿流交錯。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534542&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '838a16c6-1e14-4065-975c-55916acfa658', 'multiverseId': 534542}, 'multiverseid': 534542}]", "[{'name': 'Psychischer Impuls', 'text': 'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, wendest du Hellsicht 2 an.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532690&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6760c44-c670-4640-9f19-a3a3edd545ff', 'multiverseId': 532690}, 'multiverseid': 532690}, {'name': 'Ímpetu psíquico', 'text': 'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, adivinas 2.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532901&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96f095b3-40c0-4e8b-b06f-baf6901fa6f9', 'multiverseId': 532901}, 'multiverseid': 532901}, {'name': 'Impetus psychique', 'text': 'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous appliquez regard 2.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533112&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b68767db-07db-4e78-84f5-ac04773a1a4f', 'multiverseId': 533112}, 'multiverseid': 533112}, {'name': 'Impeto Psichico', 'text': 'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +2/+2 ed è spronata. (Attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura incantata attacca, profetizzi 2.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533323&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '896c44cd-0e76-4fcb-b8b2-37bbc2f92ac4', 'multiverseId': 533323}, 'multiverseid': 533323}, {'name': '心理の推進力', 'text': 'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、常に使嗾される。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは占術２を行う。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533534&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4557c987-85e0-41b3-8ca4-daef67c05e08', 'multiverseId': 533534}, 'multiverseid': 533534}, {'name': 'Ímpeto Psíquico', 'text': 'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +2/+2 e é atiçada. (Ela ataca a cada combate se estiver apta e ataca um jogador que não seja você se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que a criatura encantada ataca, você usa vidência 2.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533745&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'db344e72-b798-4730-9a9f-8551bf2c6c03', 'multiverseId': 533745}, 'multiverseid': 533745}, {'name': 'Психическое Побуждение', 'text': 'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +2/+2 и разъярено. (Оно атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованное существо атакует, вы предсказываете 2.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533956&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7728ebea-b1e7-4a8d-b29b-5e2cf2dbfb55', 'multiverseId': 533956}, 'multiverseid': 533956}, {'name': '心灵促动', 'text': '结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，你占卜2。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534167&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b03bb3bf-1d36-4606-84bc-c3028ec60916', 'multiverseId': 534167}, 'multiverseid': 534167}, {'name': '心靈促動', 'text': '結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當所結附的生物攻擊時，你占卜2。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534378&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78b9e894-462a-46b8-9b9a-e4ff77130c8e', 'multiverseId': 534378}, 'multiverseid': 534378}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Vorfahr\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Rachsüchtige Vorfahr ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn eine angestachelte Kreatur angreift, fügt sie ihrem Beherrscher 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531994&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f9053aa-b9e2-4d1d-b404-c77e0e713b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 531994}, \'multiverseid\': 531994}, {\'name\': \'Ancestro vengativo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Ancestro vengativo entre al campo de batalla o ataque, incita a la criatura objetivo. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que una criatura incitada ataque, hace 1 punto de daño a su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456b491f-acec-4463-b806-94de596a7c6b\', \'multiverseId\': 532048}, \'multiverseid\': 532048}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre vengeur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ancêtre vengeur arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, incitez une créature ciblée. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature incitée attaque, elle inflige 1 blessure à son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532102&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2252a40-902a-47f5-b123-9f3a8aa6b608\', \'multiverseId\': 532102}, \'multiverseid\': 532102}, {\'name\': \'Antenato Vendicativo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Antenato Vendicativo entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, sprona una creatura bersaglio. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quella creatura attacca in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se può farlo.)\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura spronata attacca, infligge 1 danno al suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fea23475-ef72-49c9-bb52-d2cf4880704a\', \'multiverseId\': 532156}, \'multiverseid\': 532156}, {\'name\': \'復讐の祖霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n復讐の祖霊が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。（あなたの次のターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\n使嗾されているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、それはそれのコントローラーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ca1886-0dfc-4bdd-b7e6-7dd68da30975\', \'multiverseId\': 532210}, \'multiverseid\': 532210}, {\'name\': \'Ancestral Vingativo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Ancestral Vingativo entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, atice a criatura alvo. (Até seu próximo turno, aquela criatura ataca a cada combate, se estiver apta, e ataca um jogador que não seja você, se estiver apta.)\\nToda vez que uma criatura atiçada ataca, ela causa 1 ponto de dano ao próprio controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'936c4924-9913-4350-9ea7-c12951ea9615\', \'multiverseId\': 532264}, \'multiverseid\': 532264}, {\'name\': \'Мстительный Предок\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Мстительный Предок выходит на поле битвы или атакует, разъярите целевое существо. (До вашего следующего хода то существо атакует в каждом бою, если может, и атакует не вас, а другого игрока, если может.)\\nКаждый раз, когда разъяренное существо атакует, оно наносит 1 повреждение контролирующему его игроку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9312292-d9cc-4147-9796-1ce7b631c971\', \'multiverseId\': 532318}, \'multiverseid\': 532318}, {\'name\': \'复仇先祖\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当复仇先祖进战场或攻击时，煽惑目标生物。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当一个已煽惑的生物攻击时，它对其操控者造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精怪／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532372&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7fc971-463d-4010-a4e1-c88f2a590234\', \'multiverseId\': 532372}, \'multiverseid\': 532372}, {\'name\': \'復仇先祖\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當復仇先祖進戰場或攻擊時，煽惑目標生物。（直到你的下一個回合，該生物每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\\n每當一個已煽惑的生物攻擊時，它對其操控者造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～精靈／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f644b8b-8a72-4be8-814d-4e6c807e341d\', \'multiverseId\': 532426}, \'multiverseid\': 532426}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Vorfahr\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Rachsüchtige Vorfahr ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an.\\nImmer wenn eine angestachelte Kreatur angreift, fügt sie ihrem Beherrscher 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ef342f6-e01c-4428-b7a3-18cb11cdf4a4\', \'multiverseId\': 531580}, \'multiverseid\': 531580}, {\'name\': \'Ancestro vengativo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Ancestro vengativo entre al campo de batalla o ataque, incita a la criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que una criatura incitada ataque, hace 1 punto de daño a su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b49c22e7-4ce2-45b1-992e-3133378075ac\', \'multiverseId\': 531636}, \'multiverseid\': 531636}, {\'name\': \'Ancêtre vengeur\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Ancêtre vengeur arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, incitez une créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature incitée attaque, elle inflige 1 blessure à son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531692&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f4f54ee-8c2e-4afd-b03e-992518a9a1fc\', \'multiverseId\': 531692}, \'multiverseid\': 531692}, {\'name\': \'Antenato Vendicativo\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Antenato Vendicativo entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, sprona una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura spronata attacca, infligge 1 danno al suo controllore.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago Spirito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e05d222a-318c-479e-814a-dfd47a147339\', \'multiverseId\': 531748}, \'multiverseid\': 531748}, {\'name\': \'復讐の祖霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n復讐の祖霊が戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n使嗾されているクリーチャー１体が攻撃するたび、それはそれのコントローラーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b748fc6-3540-4044-bfa4-f2d7bef79857\', \'multiverseId\': 531804}, \'multiverseid\': 531804}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rakdos-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Schicke alle Karten aus dem Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Jede Kreatur fügt ihrem Beherrscher 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f583e8b-2928-464c-9d76-8fbb782778ef\', \'multiverseId\': 532788}, \'multiverseid\': 532788}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto rakdos\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Exilia todas las cartas del cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Cada criatura hace 1 punto de daño a su controlador.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a45bfd0-2255-4ee5-b16c-586918e12dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 532999}, \'multiverseid\': 532999}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Rakdos\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Exilez toutes les cartes du cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Chaque créature inflige 1 blessure à son contrôleur.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c5b05b0-1833-40a0-ab1f-01898dd37660\', \'multiverseId\': 533210}, \'multiverseid\': 533210}, {\'name\': \'Talismano Rakdos\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Esilia tutte le carte dal cimitero di un giocatore bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Ogni creatura infligge 1 danno al suo controllore.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d182d4-1904-45bc-86a0-7c090745722d\', \'multiverseId\': 533421}, \'multiverseid\': 533421}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地にあるすべてのカードを追放する。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• 各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、それのコントローラーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c957d97-57a4-4790-a121-575a902f1d76\', \'multiverseId\': 533632}, \'multiverseid\': 533632}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto Rakdos\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Exile todos os cards do cemitério do jogador alvo.\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Cada criatura causa 1 ponto de dano a seu controlador.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533843&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9977591-852b-482c-80cf-e43e6e0cb8f5\', \'multiverseId\': 533843}, \'multiverseid\': 533843}, {\'name\': \'Талисман Ракдосов\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Изгоните все карты из кладбища целевого игрока.\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Каждое существо наносит 1 повреждение контролирующему его игроку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88021ec7-003f-41fa-921a-16cb702135c1\', \'multiverseId\': 534054}, \'multiverseid\': 534054}, {\'name\': \'拉铎司护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•放逐目标牌手坟墓场中的所有牌。\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•每个生物各对其操控者造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d70fb90-74de-4d22-97fa-17728c2e35fa\', \'multiverseId\': 534265}, \'multiverseid\': 534265}, {\'name\': \'拉鐸司護符\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•放逐目標玩家墳墓場中的所有牌。\\n‧消滅目標神器。\\n•每個生物各對其操控者造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'603838e5-a688-4c8b-8121-a5d8973a7eee\', \'multiverseId\': 534476}, \'multiverseid\': 534476}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rakdos-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es wird aus Knochen gefertigt und in Blut gesiedet, aber ein Rakdos-Petschaft gilt erst dann als vollkommen, wenn es als Mordwaffe verwendet wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fd87147-05f8-47b7-998a-187bbe4e5979\', \'multiverseId\': 532812}, \'multiverseid\': 532812}, {\'name\': \'Sello rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Hecho de hueso y hervido en sangre, el sello rakdos no está terminado hasta que no se usa como un arma homicida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8581ea00-c18d-48e9-8069-f10ab7aecbf5\', \'multiverseId\': 533023}, \'multiverseid\': 533023}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Fait d\'os bouilli dans le sang, un cachet de Rakdos est considéré comme terminé lorsqu\'il a été utilisé comme arme pour un meurtre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533234&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'969a9e8e-5149-4d6c-84fb-89e564614142\', \'multiverseId\': 533234}, \'multiverseid\': 533234}, {\'name\': \'Sigillo Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Costruito con ossa e bollito nel sangue, un sigillo Rakdos non è considerato finito finché non viene usato come arma per un omicidio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533445&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c1443e4-1b4a-4830-b123-6a73800239c7\', \'multiverseId\': 533445}, \'multiverseid\': 533445}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ラクドスの印鑑は骨から作られ血で煮られ、さらに殺しの武器として用いられるまでは完成したとみなされない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7a03f8f-b70d-433b-9e9e-c77780a1b537\', \'multiverseId\': 533656}, \'multiverseid\': 533656}, {\'name\': \'Sinete Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Forjado com ossos e fervido em sangue, um Sinete Rakdos não é considerado finalizado até que tenha sido usado como arma assassina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a0215f-238f-4933-bc52-5ed00c833e94\', \'multiverseId\': 533867}, \'multiverseid\': 533867}, {\'name\': \'Печать Дома Ракдосов\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Сделанная из костей, вываренная в крови, печать Ракдосов все еще не считается законченной, пока она не послужит орудием убийства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12af5599-fddb-4c9a-bff9-ba45cb430ec3\', \'multiverseId\': 534078}, \'multiverseid\': 534078}, {\'name\': \'拉铎司印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'拉铎司印记以白骨制成，要拿鲜血煮过，并且用来杀生之后才能算是大功告成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fccde89-4bf5-46ec-9e99-436cac1f89ad\', \'multiverseId\': 534289}, \'multiverseid\': 534289}, {\'name\': \'拉鐸司印記\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'拉鐸司印記以白骨製成，要拿鮮血煮過，並且用來殺生之後才能算是大功告成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c549c4-ca0b-463a-a1b8-a3bcf028e71b\', \'multiverseId\': 534500}, \'multiverseid\': 534500}]', "[{'name': 'Rakdos-Schlachtstätte', 'text': 'Die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Rakdos-Schlachtstätte ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532855&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c9e6b74a-7528-4e7b-88a2-38ce9438ff02', 'multiverseId': 532855}, 'multiverseid': 532855}, {'name': 'Carnarium rakdos', 'text': 'El Carnarium rakdos entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Carnarium rakdos entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533066&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c11b85d-50f9-4dce-9fb8-7be668bc8c59', 'multiverseId': 533066}, 'multiverseid': 533066}, {'name': 'Carnarium de Rakdos', 'text': 'Le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Carnarium de Rakdos arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533277&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f76f0398-d1a1-451e-a8d8-7841ddcf2152', 'multiverseId': 533277}, 'multiverseid': 533277}, {'name': 'Carnario Rakdos', 'text': 'Il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Carnario Rakdos entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533488&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a7a0fde7-8d3d-4fc1-adf1-ca15edfca625', 'multiverseId': 533488}, 'multiverseid': 533488}, {'name': 'ラクドスの肉儀場', 'text': 'ラクドスの肉儀場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nラクドスの肉儀場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{B}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533699&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20fd6ff9-0dfd-469b-b60a-31a35e4cf488', 'multiverseId': 533699}, 'multiverseid': 533699}, {'name': 'Carnarium Rakdos', 'text': 'Carnarium Rakdos entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Carnarium Rakdos entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533910&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b1911dc-2400-496a-8574-b2dc9450a5ca', 'multiverseId': 533910}, 'multiverseid': 533910}, {'name': 'Карнариум Ракдосов', 'text': 'Карнариум Ракдосов выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Карнариум Ракдосов выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}{R}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534121&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca9f2ee1-5f56-4e58-9e04-fb3c7769f8c9', 'multiverseId': 534121}, 'multiverseid': 534121}, {'name': '拉铎司剜祭场', 'text': '拉铎司剜祭场须横置进战场。\\n当拉铎司剜祭场进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534332&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cff67fe4-1800-460c-b2ac-26705f862f56', 'multiverseId': 534332}, 'multiverseid': 534332}, {'name': '拉鐸司剜祭場', 'text': '拉鐸司剜祭場須橫置進戰場。\\n當拉鐸司剜祭場進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{B}{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534543&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee44978b-568e-40b7-9424-be0b0ecb85af', 'multiverseId': 534543}, 'multiverseid': 534543}]", '[{\'name\': \'Raserei des Berserkers\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur vor dem Kampf oder während des Kampfes, bevor Blocker deklariert werden.\\nWürfle zwei W20 und ignoriere das niedrigere Ergebnis.\\n1—14 | Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen. Sie blocken in diesem Zug, falls möglich.\\n15—20 | Du bestimmst, welche Kreaturen in diesem Zug blocken und wie sie blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dcabca3d-ed6f-46b5-97de-9e039be2ca2e\', \'multiverseId\': 531574}, \'multiverseid\': 531574}, {\'name\': \'Frenesí de berserker\', \'text\': \'Lanza este hechizo solo antes del combate o durante el combate antes de que se declaren bloqueadoras.\\nTira 2d20 e ignora la tirada más baja.\\n1—14 | Elige cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Bloquean este turno si pueden.\\n15—20 | Tú eliges qué criaturas bloquean este turno y cómo bloquean esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531630&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3656aeff-0feb-47b1-a9dd-0b3701f5f363\', \'multiverseId\': 531630}, \'multiverseid\': 531630}, {\'name\': \'Frénésie du berserker\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort qu\'avant le combat ou pendant le combat avant la déclaration des bloqueurs.\\nLancez deux d20 et ignorez le résultat le plus bas.\\n1-14 | Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures. Elles bloquent ce tour-ci si possible.\\n15-20 | Vous choisissez quelles créatures bloquent ce tour-ci et comment ces créatures bloquent.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531686&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82e66931-3844-41d7-9872-cccf2c6adee7\', \'multiverseId\': 531686}, \'multiverseid\': 531686}, {\'name\': \'Frenesia del Berserker\', \'text\': \'Lancia questa magia solo prima del combattimento o durante il combattimento prima della dichiarazione delle creature bloccanti.\\nTira due d20 e ignora il risultato più basso.\\n1—14 | Scegli un qualsiasi numero di creature. Bloccano in questo turno, se possono farlo.\\n15—20 | Scegli quali creature bloccano in questo turno e come bloccano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a54f4d3e-615d-4ff3-aa2a-2e0611050b98\', \'multiverseId\': 531742}, \'multiverseid\': 531742}, {\'name\': \'狂戦士の激情\', \'text\': \'この呪文は戦闘の前か戦闘中にブロック・クリーチャーが指定される前にしか唱えられない。\\nd20を２回振り、値の小さい方の出目を無視する。\\n1—14 | 望む数のクリーチャーを選ぶ。このターン、それらは可能ならブロックする。\\n15—20 | このターン、どのクリーチャーがブロックするか、どうブロックするかはあなたが選ぶ。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a349a7db-4015-417d-a200-ef1070207a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 531798}, \'multiverseid\': 531798}]', '[{\'name\': \'Raserei des Berserkers\', \'text\': \'Wirke diesen Zauberspruch nur vor dem Kampf oder während des Kampfes, bevor Blocker deklariert werden.\\nWürfle zwei W20 und ignoriere das niedrigere Ergebnis.\\n1—14 | Bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl an Kreaturen. Sie blocken in diesem Zug, falls möglich.\\n15—20 | Du bestimmst, welche Kreaturen in diesem Zug blocken und wie sie blocken.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d53917-54d9-43ba-9433-f0beb306f21d\', \'multiverseId\': 531988}, \'multiverseid\': 531988}, {\'name\': \'Frenesí de berserker\', \'text\': \'Lanza este hechizo solo antes del combate o durante el combate antes de que se declaren bloqueadoras.\\nTira 2d20 e ignora la tirada más baja.\\n1—14 | Elige cualquier cantidad de criaturas. Bloquean este turno si pueden.\\n15—20 | Tú eliges qué criaturas bloquean este turno y cómo bloquean esas criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b8fd1f-977e-482c-aa88-9e9167ad5040\', \'multiverseId\': 532042}, \'multiverseid\': 532042}, {\'name\': \'Frénésie du berserker\', \'text\': "Ne lancez ce sort qu\'avant le combat ou pendant le combat avant la déclaration des bloqueurs.\\nLancez deux d20 et ignorez le résultat le plus bas.\\n1-14 | Choisissez n\'importe quel nombre de créatures. Elles bloquent ce tour-ci si possible.\\n15-20 | Vous choisissez quelles créatures bloquent ce tour-ci et comment ces créatures bloquent.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532096&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6385fa1-ccde-4c41-8225-68f9f9b9080c\', \'multiverseId\': 532096}, \'multiverseid\': 532096}, {\'name\': \'Frenesia del Berserker\', \'text\': \'Lancia questa magia solo prima del combattimento o durante il combattimento prima della dichiarazione delle creature bloccanti.\\nTira due d20 e ignora il risultato più basso.\\n1—14 | Scegli un qualsiasi numero di creature. Bloccano in questo turno, se possono farlo.\\n15—20 | Scegli quali creature bloccano in questo turno e come bloccano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14c3fbe3-44a0-41d5-9701-e34f03c6a73b\', \'multiverseId\': 532150}, \'multiverseid\': 532150}, {\'name\': \'狂戦士の激情\', \'text\': \'この呪文は戦闘の前か戦闘中にブロック・クリーチャーが指定される前にしか唱えられない。\\n２個のd20を振り、値の小さい方の出目を無視する。\\n1—14 | 望む数のクリーチャーを選ぶ。このターン、それらは可能ならブロックする。\\n15—20 | このターン、どのクリーチャーがブロックするか、どうブロックするかはあなたが選ぶ。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d80f61e6-15cf-43ae-80b3-a37812e72637\', \'multiverseId\': 532204}, \'multiverseid\': 532204}, {\'name\': \'Frenesi do Berserker\', \'text\': \'Conjure esta mágica somente antes do combate ou durante o combate antes da declaração de bloqueadores.\\nRole dois d20 e ignore o resultado mais baixo.\\n1—14 | Escolha qualquer número de criaturas. Elas bloqueiam neste turno se estiverem aptas.\\n15—20 | Você escolhe quais criaturas bloqueiam neste turno e como elas bloqueiam.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7aa5967f-f4f4-493f-abb0-9cefe0e77b46\', \'multiverseId\': 532258}, \'multiverseid\': 532258}, {\'name\': \'Бешенство Берсерка\', \'text\': \'Разыгрывайте это заклинание только до боя или во время боя до объявления блокирующих.\\nБросьте два d20 и игнорируйте меньший результат броска.\\n1—14 | Выберите любое количество существ. Они блокируют в этом ходу, если могут.\\n15—20 | Вы выбираете, какие существа блокируют в этом ходу и как они блокируют.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06c27da-31c4-4ce0-b4fb-4f64e1d8ac9c\', \'multiverseId\': 532312}, \'multiverseid\': 532312}, {\'name\': \'狂战士狂热\', \'text\': \'只能于战斗前或战斗中宣告阻挡者前施放此咒语。\\n掷两颗d20并忽略较小点数。\\n1～14 | 选择任意数量的生物。它们本回合若能进行阻挡，则须如此作。\\n15～20 | 本回合中，由你选择哪些生物进行阻挡，以及这些生物将如何阻挡。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532366&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21fb826-7f6f-4a11-94eb-1888bf587b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 532366}, \'multiverseid\': 532366}, {\'name\': \'狂戰士狂熱\', \'text\': \'只能於戰鬥前或戰鬥中宣告阻擋者前施放此咒語。\\n擲兩顆d20並忽略較小點數。\\n1～14 | 選擇任意數量的生物。它們本回合若能進行阻擋，則須如此作。\\n15～20 | 本回合中，由你選擇哪些生物進行阻擋，以及這些生物將如何阻擋。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5c7eba5-e5d4-4a5f-97d1-7da233757969\', \'multiverseId\': 532420}, \'multiverseid\': 532420}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rathische Stürme\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre alle Kreaturen, die nicht verzaubert sind. Sie können nicht regeneriert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Es wird einen enormen Schrei geben, und danach eine noch enormere Stille."\\n—Das Orakel *en-*Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92a2747d-c274-418c-bf2b-b0c59f875015\', \'multiverseId\': 532676}, \'multiverseid\': 532676}, {\'name\': \'Vientos de Rath\', \'text\': \'Destruye todas las criaturas que no estén encantadas. No pueden ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Se oirá un enorme grito, seguido de un silencio aún más enorme".\\n—Oráculo *en-*Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60e5d6be-a5b4-4b34-9f2d-d70fa9cb2c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 532887}, \'multiverseid\': 532887}, {\'name\': \'Vents de Rajh\', \'text\': \'Détruisez toutes les créatures qui ne sont pas enchantées. Elles ne peuvent pas être régénérées.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Il y aura un grand cri, et puis un silence plus grand encore. »\\n—Oracle *en-*Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d060194d-12a1-425a-a217-3104eedf3c50\', \'multiverseId\': 533098}, \'multiverseid\': 533098}, {\'name\': \'Venti di Rath\', \'text\': \'Distruggi tutte le creature che non sono incantate. Non possono essere rigenerate.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Ci sarà un urlo lacerante e poi un silenzio ancor più grande."\\n—Oracolo *en-*Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533309&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98683eb6-5a0b-43a4-aa49-178d0ef74c69\', \'multiverseId\': 533309}, \'multiverseid\': 533309}, {\'name\': \'ラースの風\', \'text\': \'エンチャントされていないすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。それらは再生できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大きな叫び声が上がり、その後もっと大きな静寂が訪れるだろう。」\\n――ヴェクの巫女**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9483431e-ea2c-4aa5-adcc-80ac2bf5861d\', \'multiverseId\': 533520}, \'multiverseid\': 533520}, {\'name\': \'Ventos de Rath\', \'text\': \'Destrua todas as criaturas que não estiverem encantadas. Elas não podem ser regeneradas.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Haverá um imenso clamor, seguido de um silêncio ainda maior."\\n— Oráculo *en-*Vec\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32e20e2e-fb19-4ba2-8e6d-60282bceaa27\', \'multiverseId\': 533731}, \'multiverseid\': 533731}, {\'name\': \'Ветры Рата\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте все незачарованные существа. Они не могут быть регенерированы.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«За страшным криком придет страшное безмолвие».\\n— Оракул *эн-*Век\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bd03e17-2a19-4397-acb9-93023d11e664\', \'multiverseId\': 533942}, \'multiverseid\': 533942}, {\'name\': \'瑞斯之风\', \'text\': \'消灭所有未被结附的生物。它们不能重生。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「在巨量喧哗后，将有更慑人的死寂。」\\n～维克族神谕使**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e5fcad6-21be-45ab-bbcd-bc595070a06a\', \'multiverseId\': 534153}, \'multiverseid\': 534153}, {\'name\': \'瑞斯之風\', \'text\': \'消滅所有未被結附的生物。它們不能重生。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「在巨量喧嘩後，將有更懾人的死寂。」\\n～維克族神諭使**\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b2fd18c-a426-40f1-b210-a2201411f48a\', \'multiverseId\': 534364}, \'multiverseid\': 534364}]', "[{'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // Abstreifen', 'text': 'Wachsamkeit', 'type': 'Kreatur — Riese', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532668&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbe356de-b8bd-4eb3-b584-2da093b80179', 'multiverseId': 532668}, 'multiverseid': 532668}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // Quitar los hilos', 'text': 'Vigilancia.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532879&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31de309f-b805-4383-b7cb-f0fa1eaac043', 'multiverseId': 532879}, 'multiverseid': 532879}, {'name': 'Géant drapé de royaume // Dévêtir', 'text': 'Vigilance', 'type': 'Créature : géant', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Géant drapé de royaume', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533090&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9d3d6828-35c7-4d32-b565-455d24e43e91', 'multiverseId': 533090}, 'multiverseid': 533090}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // Gettare Via', 'text': 'Cautela', 'type': 'Creatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533301&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e805c88b-834e-45d3-99fc-93d380ca73b0', 'multiverseId': 533301}, 'multiverseid': 533301}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // 脱ぎ捨て', 'text': '警戒', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 巨人', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533512&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b2ac6cb-5a04-486b-9173-8fcfc7b22010', 'multiverseId': 533512}, 'multiverseid': 533512}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // Despojar-se', 'text': 'Vigilância', 'type': 'Criatura — Gigante', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533723&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7d805c1e-201d-432f-880f-7254e7382db4', 'multiverseId': 533723}, 'multiverseid': 533723}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // Отбросить', 'text': 'Бдительность', 'type': 'Существо — Гигант', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533934&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '192ecb97-f49d-4c67-bb46-849a2812b464', 'multiverseId': 533934}, 'multiverseid': 533934}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // 褪下披风', 'text': '警戒', 'type': '生物 ～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534145&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd538efed-c16b-4626-9a19-9e679e40410d', 'multiverseId': 534145}, 'multiverseid': 534145}, {'name': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant // 褪下披風', 'text': '警戒', 'type': '生物 ～巨人', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Realm-Cloaked Giant', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534356&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '52fa953c-8d64-4f90-b6ce-12e3ef8624c8', 'multiverseId': 534356}, 'multiverseid': 534356}]", '[{\'name\': \'Reinstahl-Paladin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Ausrüstung unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\\nMetallkunst — Ausrüstungen, die du kontrollierst, haben Ausrüsten {0}, solange du drei oder mehr Artefakte kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532667&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4249e0d-b671-4fa1-aafb-ea7b990f8007\', \'multiverseId\': 532667}, \'multiverseid\': 532667}, {\'name\': \'Paladín de acero puro\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un Equipo entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes robar una carta.\\nMetalurgia — Los Equipos que controlas tienen la habilidad de equipar {0} mientras controles tres o más artefactos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe667ee7-2bd9-44fc-a946-80b943846ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 532878}, \'multiverseid\': 532878}, {\'name\': \'Paladin de puracier\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un équipement arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez piocher une carte.\\nArt des métaux — Les équipements que vous contrôlez ont équipement {0} tant que vous contrôlez au moins trois artefacts.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f189ed67-537c-43bd-b8fb-791e01d5e06f\', \'multiverseId\': 533089}, \'multiverseid\': 533089}, {\'name\': \'Paladino di Acciaio Puro\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un Equipaggiamento entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pescare una carta.\\nMetallurgia — Gli Equipaggiamenti che controlli hanno equipaggiare {0} fintanto che controlli tre o più artefatti.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3393701a-04f1-43a6-b48d-aced5c35eb59\', \'multiverseId\': 533300}, \'multiverseid\': 533300}, {\'name\': \'純鋼の聖騎士\', \'text\': \'装備品１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\\n金属術 ― あなたが３つ以上のアーティファクトをコントロールしているかぎり、あなたがコントロールしているすべての装備品は装備{0}を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59cd736d-c8c7-4867-b03f-0eddc763c5e5\', \'multiverseId\': 533511}, \'multiverseid\': 533511}, {\'name\': \'Paladino de Aço Puro\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um Equipamento entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você pode comprar um card.\\nMaestria com metais — Os Equipamentos que você controla terão equipar {0} enquanto você controlar três ou mais artefatos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5604c22-208e-44f7-bbbf-7407eb2d09ee\', \'multiverseId\': 533722}, \'multiverseid\': 533722}, {\'name\': \'Паладин Чистой Стали\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Снаряжение выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете взять карту.\\nРабота по металлу — Снаряжение под вашим контролем имеет «Снарядить {0}», пока вы контролируете не менее трех артефактов.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3ab8a5d-5d20-4a4b-bb51-5222391c6ecb\', \'multiverseId\': 533933}, \'multiverseid\': 533933}, {\'name\': \'净钢神圣武士\', \'text\': \'每当一个武具在你的操控下进战场时，你可以抓一张牌。\\n金技～只要你操控三个或更多神器，由你操控的武具便具有佩带{0}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6801e7e-162f-4edb-96f5-0cfb909789e8\', \'multiverseId\': 534144}, \'multiverseid\': 534144}, {\'name\': \'淨鋼神聖武士\', \'text\': \'每當一個武具在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以抽一張牌。\\n金技～只要你操控三個或更多神器，由你操控的武具便具有佩帶{0}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79878a8e-7d8f-46d8-b397-20b762c07f26\', \'multiverseId\': 534355}, \'multiverseid\': 534355}]', '[{\'name\': \'Reizen\', \'text\': \'Reizen fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Die Kreatur verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Manchmal sind die Größten den Kleinsten ausgeliefert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532734&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0563305e-205f-4120-82dd-12518d3b9948\', \'multiverseId\': 532734}, \'multiverseid\': 532734}, {\'name\': \'Irritar\', \'text\': \'Irritar hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Esa criatura gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Lo enorme puede estar a merced de lo pequeño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ebb8eff-e76d-4cba-ad77-75f1bc586526\', \'multiverseId\': 532945}, \'multiverseid\': 532945}, {\'name\': \'Énervement\', \'text\': "L\'Énervement inflige 1 blessure à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. Cette créature acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Le géant se trouve parfois à la merci du petit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51012e83-2b53-476a-88ec-de376ae4339f\', \'multiverseId\': 533156}, \'multiverseid\': 533156}, {\'name\': \'Infastidire\', \'text\': \'Infastidire infligge 1 danno a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Quella creatura ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Gli enormi possono talvolta trovarsi alla mercé dei minuscoli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533367&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'687c0609-e0a2-4d46-a625-1e3884718569\', \'multiverseId\': 533367}, \'multiverseid\': 533367}, {\'name\': \'苛立ち\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。苛立ちはそれに１点のダメージを与える。ターン終了時まで、そのクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大も小に翻弄される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'475bd9b8-6d4d-4203-b8ab-96ec2814981b\', \'multiverseId\': 533578}, \'multiverseid\': 533578}, {\'name\': \'Exasperar\', \'text\': \'Exasperar causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo que você controla. Aquela criatura ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O enorme ainda pode ficar à mercê do pequeno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f83f256-f42e-4113-851b-9275cc9590b0\', \'multiverseId\': 533789}, \'multiverseid\': 533789}, {\'name\': \'Донимание\', \'text\': \'Донимание наносит 1 повреждение целевому существу под вашим контролем. То существо получает Пробивной удар до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Даже гиганты иногда остаются на милости карликов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29a13d32-b8dd-4761-acbe-f92118098a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 534000}, \'multiverseid\': 534000}, {\'name\': \'惹怒\', \'text\': \'惹怒对目标由你操控的生物造成1点伤害。该生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'大家伙也可能受到小不点的摆布。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b986d81-2101-4443-ac92-cb817a2c06bf\', \'multiverseId\': 534211}, \'multiverseid\': 534211}, {\'name\': \'惹怒\', \'text\': \'惹怒對目標由你操控的生物造成1點傷害。該生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'大傢伙也可能受到小不點的擺佈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'778fef3d-afed-45e9-b54c-c54c46ee2d82\', \'multiverseId\': 534422}, \'multiverseid\': 534422}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rishkars Expertise\', \'text\': \'Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\nDu kannst einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 5 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Große Verbindung kontrollieren? Du kannst auch versuchen, einen Fluss mit deinen Händen zu teilen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532768&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cda11a4-ec15-4855-a897-a30966088426\', \'multiverseId\': 532768}, \'multiverseid\': 532768}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que controlas.\\nPuedes lanzar un hechizo desde tu mano con valor de maná de 5 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Controlar la Panconexión? Sería como alterar el curso de un río con las manos desnudas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73de36c5-6f89-4dc2-9654-414b82390719\', \'multiverseId\': 532979}, \'multiverseid\': 532979}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures que vous contrôlez.\\nVous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 5 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Contrôler le Grand conduit ? Vous auriez tôt fait de détourner une rivière avec les mains. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533190&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3ce1566-a7c1-4dd1-be33-297b1614a64f\', \'multiverseId\': 533190}, \'multiverseid\': 533190}, {\'name\': \'Competenza di Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature che controlli.\\nPuoi lanciare una magia con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 5 dalla tua mano senza pagare il suo costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Controllare il Grande Flusso? Tanto vale cercare di deviare un fiume a mani nude."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0454fc0e-ad2c-4934-86c3-09a528600de7\', \'multiverseId\': 533401}, \'multiverseid\': 533401}, {\'name\': \'リシュカーの巧技\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\nあなたは、あなたの手札にありマナ総量が５以下である呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「大導路を制御する？君なら川の流れを逆向きにもできるのだろうね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d39c21-6cc6-4977-833d-8ed6da84a198\', \'multiverseId\': 533612}, \'multiverseid\': 533612}, {\'name\': \'Especialidade de Rishkar\', \'text\': \'Compre uma quantidade de cards equivalente ao maior poder entre as criaturas que você controla.\\nVocê pode conjurar uma mágica com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 5 de sua mão sem pagar seu custo de mana.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Controlar o Grande Conduíte? Mais vale tentar desviar um rio com as mãos."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f94d9e52-f2a2-4cc6-aea6-5ec6dcaf141e\', \'multiverseId\': 533823}, \'multiverseid\': 533823}, {\'name\': \'Мастерство Ришкара\', \'text\': \'Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди существ под вашим контролем.\\nВы можете разыграть заклинание с мановой ценностью не более 5 из вашей руки без уплаты его мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Управлять Великим Каналом? С тем же успехом можно попытаться остановить реку голыми руками».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e96082ac-0d1a-4dd2-942f-1619c765c934\', \'multiverseId\': 534034}, \'multiverseid\': 534034}, {\'name\': \'李什克的专才\', \'text\': \'抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值等于或小于5的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「控制大通联？你还不如试试徒手使河水改道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e57ba38-faa7-4944-8385-782ebc53e48c\', \'multiverseId\': 534245}, \'multiverseid\': 534245}, {\'name\': \'李什克的專才\', \'text\': \'抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n你可以從你手上施放一個魔法力值等於或小於5的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「控制大通聯？你還不如試試徒手使河水改道。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc8d24a1-5419-4a62-b945-6469d402f136\', \'multiverseId\': 534456}, \'multiverseid\': 534456}]', '[{\'name\': \'Robe der Sterne\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +0/+3.\\nAstrale Projektion — {1}{W}: Die ausgerüstete Kreatur destabilisiert sich. (Behandle sie und alles, was an sie angelegt ist, bis zum Beginn des nächsten Zuges ihres Beherrschers, als würde es nicht existieren.)\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'adcb93be-0a8c-4bb5-99b6-1f592060ff2b\', \'multiverseId\': 531970}, \'multiverseid\': 531970}, {\'name\': \'Túnica de las estrellas\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +0/+3.\\nProyección astral — {1}{W}: La criatura equipada sale de fase. (Trátala a ella y a cualquier permanente anexado a ella como si no existiese hasta el próximo turno de su controlador.)\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c674386-f0c5-4133-b29c-7a7d0f3ad8a9\', \'multiverseId\': 532024}, \'multiverseid\': 532024}, {\'name\': \'Robe aux étoiles\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +0/+3.\\nProjection astrale — {1}{W} : La créature équipée passe hors phase. (Traitez-la et tout ce qui lui est attaché comme s\'ils n\'existaient pas jusqu\'au prochain tour de son contrôleur.)\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab294b3e-b017-45eb-92b6-44a450c28387\', \'multiverseId\': 532078}, \'multiverseid\': 532078}, {\'name\': \'Tunica delle Stelle\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +0/+3.\\nProiezione Astrale — {1}{W}: La creatura equipaggiata scompare. (Tratta quella creatura e qualsiasi permanente ad essa assegnato come se non esistessero fino al prossimo turno del controllore della creatura.)\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59be2262-9109-4497-8917-8a3cee557b99\', \'multiverseId\': 532132}, \'multiverseid\': 532132}, {\'name\': \'ローブ・オヴ・スターズ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋０/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nアストラル・プロジェクション ― {1}{W}：装備しているクリーチャーはフェイズ・アウトする。（それのコントローラーの次のターンまで、それやそれについているものはすべて存在しないかのように扱う。）\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09d5a02f-15a7-4af5-ac0c-f3cf71355125\', \'multiverseId\': 532186}, \'multiverseid\': 532186}, {\'name\': \'Robe das Estrelas\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +0/+3.\\nProjeção Astral — {1}{W}: A criatura equipada sai de fase. (Trate-a, assim como qualquer coisa anexada a ela, como se não existisse até o próximo turno de seu controlador.)\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f93e748-d128-4d17-ad93-cb6c4cc47407\', \'multiverseId\': 532240}, \'multiverseid\': 532240}, {\'name\': \'Мантия Звезд\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +0/+3.\\nАстральная проекция — {1}{W}: снаряженное существо уходит в противофазу. (До следующего хода контролирующего его игрока обращайтесь с ним и всеми прикрепленными к нему объектами, как будто они не существуют.)\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4d1b70-08b2-41b8-b756-699fea979f77\', \'multiverseId\': 532294}, \'multiverseid\': 532294}, {\'name\': \'星光法袍\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+0/+3。\\n星界投射～{1}{W}：佩带此武具的生物跃离。（直到其操控者的下一个回合，该生物及贴附于其上的所有东西都视作不存在。）\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65362e40-0c93-45b0-8b7d-6966417e6f6d\', \'multiverseId\': 532348}, \'multiverseid\': 532348}, {\'name\': \'星光法袍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+0/+3。\\n星界投射～{1}{W}：佩帶此武具的生物躍離。（直到其操控者的下一個回合，該生物及貼附於其上的所有東西都視作不存在。）\\n佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec67b46-b839-48a2-9625-8c25f7a9bd61\', \'multiverseId\': 532402}, \'multiverseid\': 532402}]', "[{'name': 'Robe der Sterne', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +0/+3.\\nAstrale Projektion — {1}{W}: Die ausgerüstete Kreatur destabilisiert sich.\\nAusrüsten {1}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531556&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34a0d3ff-c268-4e35-ad13-7f247a8383f3', 'multiverseId': 531556}, 'multiverseid': 531556}, {'name': 'Túnica de las estrellas', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +0/+3.\\nProyección astral — {1}{W}: La criatura equipada sale de fase.\\nEquipar {1}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531612&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1523de65-4aa9-4641-afae-f56968424452', 'multiverseId': 531612}, 'multiverseid': 531612}, {'name': 'Robe aux étoiles', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +0/+3.\\nProjection astrale — {1}{W} : La créature équipée passe hors phase.\\nÉquipement {1}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531668&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b7e58ce-e69a-4eac-aacf-6b120656bb0d', 'multiverseId': 531668}, 'multiverseid': 531668}, {'name': 'Tunica delle Stelle', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata prende +0/+3.\\nProiezione Astrale — {1}{W}: La creatura equipaggiata scompare.\\nEquipaggiare {1}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531724&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f7228c71-723d-4b30-9d24-e3de5b6946b6', 'multiverseId': 531724}, 'multiverseid': 531724}, {'name': 'ローブ・オヴ・スターズ', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋０/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nアストラル・プロジェクション ― {1}{W}：装備しているクリーチャーはフェイズ・アウトする。\\n装備{1}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531780&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c44f270b-322f-432a-8a1c-d9cb566c28f7', 'multiverseId': 531780}, 'multiverseid': 531780}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ronom-Einhorn\', \'text\': \'Opfere das Ronom-Einhorn: Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Einhorn\', \'flavor\': \'Die anomale Magie der Raureif-Magier sorgte dafür, dass sich die Einhörner aus den Ödländern des Nordens noch einmal auf den Kriegspfad begaben.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532669&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a09ab53-1cc4-4c30-8cb6-133abe5b1e99\', \'multiverseId\': 532669}, \'multiverseid\': 532669}, {\'name\': \'Unicornio de Rónom\', \'text\': \'Sacrificar el Unicornio de Rónom: Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicornio\', \'flavor\': \'La magia aberrante de Brisa Escarchada hizo volver a los unicornios desde los yermos del norte para luchar una vez más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58896de0-fcdc-4e85-b515-615800e6f28e\', \'multiverseId\': 532880}, \'multiverseid\': 532880}, {\'name\': \'Licorne de Ronom\', \'text\': \'Sacrifiez la Licorne de Ronom : Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Créature : licorne\', \'flavor\': \'Les aberrations magiques de Soufflegivre firent revenir les licornes des steppes du nord pour combattre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533091&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0257aacd-b6d4-4738-a177-061b9869c068\', \'multiverseId\': 533091}, \'multiverseid\': 533091}, {\'name\': \'Unicorno di Ronom\', \'text\': "Sacrifica l\'Unicorno di Ronom: Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Unicorno\', \'flavor\': \'La magia aberrante di Ventogelo richiamò gli unicorni dalle distese del nord per combattere ancora una volta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a20f77-4408-4ebb-8415-d594433e32d1\', \'multiverseId\': 533302}, \'multiverseid\': 533302}, {\'name\': \'ロノムの一角獣\', \'text\': \'ロノムの一角獣を生け贄に捧げる：エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ユニコーン\', \'flavor\': \'常軌を逸した霧氷風の魔術を感じ取った一角獣たちは、北方の荒原から再び戦場へ帰ってきた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d7e195c-3a1e-46b8-9ff7-93d2992f7412\', \'multiverseId\': 533513}, \'multiverseid\': 533513}, {\'name\': \'Unicórnio de Ronom\', \'text\': \'Sacrifique Unicórnio de Ronom: Destrua o encantamento alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Unicórnio\', \'flavor\': \'A mágica aberrante dos Vento-gélido reuniu os unicórnios dispersos nos agrestes ao norte para combater mais uma vez.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3df97d0-6843-47cf-bee8-28a37c4aa1ce\', \'multiverseId\': 533724}, \'multiverseid\': 533724}, {\'name\': \'Рономский Единорог\', \'text\': \'Пожертвуйте Рономского Единорога: уничтожьте целевые чары.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Единорог\', \'flavor\': \'Странная Ледоветренная магия вновь созвала единорогов с северных пустошей на битву.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533935&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9225a87f-83f0-4d7c-bd7b-4db03ed379f1\', \'multiverseId\': 533935}, \'multiverseid\': 533935}, {\'name\': \'若纳独角兽\', \'text\': \'牺牲若纳独角兽：消灭目标结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～独角兽\', \'flavor\': \'霜风会的法术不循正道而行，使得独角兽自北方荒野回返，准备再赴战场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'595affd2-30fe-4285-b322-e6788d9097cf\', \'multiverseId\': 534146}, \'multiverseid\': 534146}, {\'name\': \'若納獨角獸\', \'text\': \'犧牲若納獨角獸：消滅目標結界。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～獨角獸\', \'flavor\': \'霜風會的魔法不循正道而行，使得獨角獸自北方荒野回返，準備再赴戰場。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534357&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'119dc7f7-6409-4450-bd37-ef640711477d\', \'multiverseId\': 534357}, \'multiverseid\': 534357}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Die Rumpelholz-Wasserfälle werden bis zum Ende des Zuges zu einer 3/3 grünen und blauen Elementarwesen-Kreatur mit Fluchsicherheit. Sie sind immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2908cbc1-5815-441c-8565-835f8f1ccc7a\', \'multiverseId\': 532845}, \'multiverseid\': 532845}, {\'name\': \'Cascada estruendosa\', \'text\': \'La Cascada estruendosa entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: La Cascada estruendosa se convierte en una criatura Elemental verde y azul 3/3 con la habilidad de antimaleficio hasta el final del turno. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ecd75c-16a7-4f19-b7b5-d33f7e9ebf18\', \'multiverseId\': 533056}, \'multiverseid\': 533056}, {\'name\': \'Chutes mugissantes\', \'text\': "Les Chutes mugissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U} : Les Chutes mugissantes deviennent une créature 3/3 verte et bleue Élémental avec la défense talismanique jusqu\'à la fin du tour. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533267&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5305c7bf-27b0-4fa5-811e-a9ce0da477d2\', \'multiverseId\': 533267}, \'multiverseid\': 533267}, {\'name\': \'Cascate Roboanti\', \'text\': \'Le Cascate Roboanti entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G} o {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Le Cascate Roboanti diventano una creatura Elementale 3/3 verde e blu con anti-malocchio fino alla fine del turno. Sono ancora una terra.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa944dc1-10c2-44ff-b72f-0708f8d4e78c\', \'multiverseId\': 533478}, \'multiverseid\': 533478}, {\'name\': \'伐採地の滝\', \'text\': \'伐採地の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{U}：ターン終了時まで、伐採地の滝は呪禁を持つ緑青の３/３のエレメンタル・クリーチャーになる。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f79d590-5e50-473f-8a91-eae8d8671e24\', \'multiverseId\': 533689}, \'multiverseid\': 533689}, {\'name\': \'Quedas Estrondosas\', \'text\': \'Quedas Estrondosas entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G} ou {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Quedas Estrondosas torna-se uma criatura Elemental verde e azul 3/3 com resistência a magia até o final do turno. Ela ainda é um terreno.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e008ffd-606c-4bc5-8eea-ebf6c5a25eca\', \'multiverseId\': 533900}, \'multiverseid\': 533900}, {\'name\': \'Рокочущие Водопады\', \'text\': \'Рокочущие Водопады выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {G} или {U}.\\n{2}{G}{U}: Рокочущие Водопады становятся существом 3/3 зеленый и синий Элементаль с Порчеустойчивостью до конца хода. При этом они остаются землей.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4007f619-0f84-41d7-b7eb-45c0f7f65a9e\', \'multiverseId\': 534111}, \'multiverseid\': 534111}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。\\n{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成为3/3，绿蓝双色，具辟邪异能的元素生物直到回合结束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb23d8aa-a7e3-45da-882f-be907cfca304\', \'multiverseId\': 534322}, \'multiverseid\': 534322}, {\'name\': \'林木瀑布\', \'text\': \'林木瀑布須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。\\n{2}{G}{U}：林木瀑布成為3/3，綠藍雙色，具辟邪異能的元素生物直到回合結束。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534533&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9d6167-f6b0-49eb-8314-61c6b7184be7\', \'multiverseId\': 534533}, \'multiverseid\': 534533}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rätselwehr von Nesseril\', \'text\': \'Fokussierter Strahl — Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments würfelst du einen W4. Wende Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist.\\nPerfekte Illumination — Immer wenn du die höchstmögliche natürliche Augenzahl eines Würfels würfelst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Jede Konfiguration enthüllt eine mögliche Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0901f9a6-4ad3-46de-b7f3-7542c767efc4\', \'multiverseId\': 531976}, \'multiverseid\': 531976}, {\'name\': \'Puzle defensor netherés\', \'text\': \'Rayo concentrado — Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, tira 1d4. Adivina X, donde X es el resultado.\\nIluminación perfecta — Siempre que saques el resultado natural más alto de un dado, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Cada configuración muestra un posible futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cbdf41d-e11d-44d7-96fc-684aada0cda4\', \'multiverseId\': 532030}, \'multiverseid\': 532030}, {\'name\': \'Casse-tête de protection néthérisse\', \'text\': "Focalisation de rayon — Au début de votre entretien, lancez un d4. Regard X, X étant le résultat.\\nIllumination parfaite — À chaque fois que vous obtenez le résultat naturel le plus élevé d\'un dé, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Chaque configuration révèle un avenir potentiel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532084&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b4ddc44-7653-4c70-aae2-a5aa52703565\', \'multiverseId\': 532084}, \'multiverseid\': 532084}, {\'name\': \'Enigma-Interdizione di Netheril\', \'text\': "Direziona il Raggio — All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, tira un d4. Profetizza X, dove X è il risultato.\\nIlluminazione Perfetta — Ogniqualvolta tiri un dado e ottieni il risultato naturale più alto, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni configurazione rivela un potenziale futuro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac83b70-a268-4bbe-9c48-10ce50cf5263\', \'multiverseId\': 532138}, \'multiverseid\': 532138}, {\'name\': \'ネズリルのパズル房\', \'text\': \'フォーカス・ビーム ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、１個のd4を振る。占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはその出目に等しい。\\nパーフェクト・イルミネーション ― あなたが振ったサイコロがそのサイコロの最大の目を出すたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'一つの光路が一つの可能な未来を明かす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fa39a7-3a44-4881-9235-0d9da8914db6\', \'multiverseId\': 532192}, \'multiverseid\': 532192}, {\'name\': \'Proteção Enigmática Netherêsa\', \'text\': \'Feixe de foco — No início de sua manutenção, role um d4. Use vidência X, sendo X o resultado.\\nIluminação perfeita — Toda vez que você obtiver o maior resultado natural de um dado, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'Cada configuração revela um futuro em potencial.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3061b56b-08a0-4af6-9ee4-4e8394cdf943\', \'multiverseId\': 532246}, \'multiverseid\': 532246}, {\'name\': \'Нетерильский Оберег\', \'text\': \'Луч концентрации — В начале вашего шага поддержки бросьте d4. Предскажите X, где X — результат броска.\\nИдеальное освещение — Каждый раз, когда вы выбрасываете максимальное натуральное значение для кубика, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Каждая конфигурация раскрывает потенциальное будущее.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1504b145-e890-4069-a8db-aa5be3b3eff5\', \'multiverseId\': 532300}, \'multiverseid\': 532300}, {\'name\': \'耐瑟瑞尔谜团结界\', \'text\': \'汇聚光线～在你的维持开始时，掷一颗d4。占卜X，X为掷骰结果。\\n完美亮度～每当你掷出某骰子的最大原值结果时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'每种配置均揭示未来的一种可能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532354&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3094f95-d793-465e-aac6-8076dac72806\', \'multiverseId\': 532354}, \'multiverseid\': 532354}, {\'name\': \'耐瑟瑞爾謎團結界\', \'text\': \'匯聚光線～在你的維持開始時，擲一顆d4。占卜X，X為擲骰結果。\\n完美亮度～每當你擲出某骰子的最大原值結果時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'每種配置均揭示未來的一種可能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23eeb023-c132-488f-a30b-9da86d474f94\', \'multiverseId\': 532408}, \'multiverseid\': 532408}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rätselwehr von Nesseril\', \'text\': \'Fokussierter Strahl — Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments würfelst du einen W4. Wende Hellsicht X an, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist.\\nPerfekte Illumination — Immer wenn du die höchstmögliche natürliche Augenzahl eines Würfels würfelst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f85015-e2e7-444f-85e4-d956dac79365\', \'multiverseId\': 531562}, \'multiverseid\': 531562}, {\'name\': \'Puzle defensor netherés\', \'text\': \'Rayo concentrado — Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, tira 1d4. Adivina X, donde X es el resultado.\\nIluminación perfecta — Siempre que saques el resultado natural más alto de un dado, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e151697e-860c-4146-b11d-1a915db3df13\', \'multiverseId\': 531618}, \'multiverseid\': 531618}, {\'name\': \'Casse-tête de protection néthérisse\', \'text\': "Focalisation de rayon — Au début de votre entretien, lancez un d4. Regard X, X étant le résultat.\\nIllumination parfaite — À chaque fois que vous obtenez le résultat naturel le plus élevé d\'un dé, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531674&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'333f193b-77a5-49f2-a98b-cfb0d5b1f25c\', \'multiverseId\': 531674}, \'multiverseid\': 531674}, {\'name\': \'Enigma-Interdizione di Netheril\', \'text\': "Direziona il Raggio — All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, tira un d4. Profetizza X, dove X è il risultato.\\nIlluminazione Perfetta — Ogniqualvolta tiri un dado e ottieni il risultato naturale più alto, pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'190ce133-9a0a-4cc6-a795-aa762d38d9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 531730}, \'multiverseid\': 531730}, {\'name\': \'ネズリルのパズル錠\', \'text\': \'フォーカス・ビーム ― あなたのアップキープの開始時に、d4を１回振る。占術Ｘを行う。Ｘはその出目に等しい。\\nパーフェクト・イルミネーション ― あなたが振ったサイコロがそのサイコロの最大の目を出すたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'118d7a42-3843-4469-9613-5354bd90746e\', \'multiverseId\': 531786}, \'multiverseid\': 531786}]', "[{'name': 'Rückenfels-Hügelchen', 'text': 'Refugium (Dieses Land kommt getappt ins Spiel. Wenn dies geschieht, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege den Rest unter deine Bibliothek.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Falls einem Gegner in diesem Zug 7 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zugefügt wurden, kannst du die ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532861&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4c917e7-1c74-4c28-8c62-e77d9299c693', 'multiverseId': 532861}, 'multiverseid': 532861}, {'name': 'Loma espina rocosa', 'text': 'Esconder. (Esta tierra entra al campo de batalla girada. Cuando lo haga, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca, exilia una boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Puedes jugar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná si un oponente recibió 7 o más puntos de daño este turno.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533072&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de81ecd4-b034-40bd-bcaf-e0d228e9faae', 'multiverseId': 533072}, 'multiverseid': 533072}, {'name': 'Tertre de Rochépine', 'text': 'Cachette (Ce terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé. Quand il le fait, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, exilez-en une face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{R}, {T} : Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana si un adversaire a subi au moins 7 blessures ce tour-ci.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533283&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8548677-4523-4666-887e-a303c0659c1d', 'multiverseId': 533283}, 'multiverseid': 533283}, {'name': 'Poggio Spina Rocciosa', 'text': 'Nascondiglio (Questa terra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata. Quando lo fa, guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio, esiliane una a faccia in giù, poi metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Puoi giocare la carta esiliata senza pagare il suo costo di mana se a un avversario sono stati inflitti 7 o più danni in questo turno.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533494&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '63cfaa4a-664b-4c69-9d78-d393105012e7', 'multiverseId': 533494}, 'multiverseid': 533494}, {'name': '背骨岩の小山', 'text': '秘匿（この土地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。そうしたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見て、そのうち１枚を裏向きに追放し、その後残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置く。）\\n{T}：{R}を加える。\\n{R}, {T}：このターンに対戦相手１人が７点以上のダメージを受けていたなら、あなたはその追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533705&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '38a84cea-a770-4163-9e83-a28cce8d161a', 'multiverseId': 533705}, 'multiverseid': 533705}, {'name': 'Colina da Rocha Espinhosa', 'text': 'Refúgio (Este terreno entra no campo de batalha virado. Quando entrar, olhe os quatro cards do topo de seu grimório, exile um com a face voltada para baixo e depois coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: Você pode jogar o card exilado sem pagar seu custo de mana se um oponente sofreu 7 pontos de dano ou mais neste turno.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533916&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8fdb2da-2154-4581-be5d-9dea5b57b7a8', 'multiverseId': 533916}, 'multiverseid': 533916}, {'name': 'Хребтокаменный Холм', 'text': 'Укрытие (Эта земля выходит на поле битвы повернутой. Когда она это делает, посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки, изгоните одну из них рубашкой вверх, затем положите остальные в низ вашей библиотеки).\\n{T}: добавьте {R}.\\n{R}, {T}: вы можете разыграть изгнанную карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости, если в этом ходу оппоненту было нанесено не менее 7 повреждений.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534127&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e452895-0471-485e-875f-4a0133f94907', 'multiverseId': 534127}, 'multiverseid': 534127}, {'name': '脊石圆丘', 'text': '掩蔽（此地须横置进战场。当它进战场时，检视你牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌置于你牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{R}，{T}：如果某对手本回合中受过7点或更多伤害，则你可以使用所放逐的牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534338&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '30d16603-0655-4b61-b153-0f90f95fb070', 'multiverseId': 534338}, 'multiverseid': 534338}, {'name': '脊石圓丘', 'text': '掩蔽（此地須橫置進戰場。當它進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌，將其中一張牌面朝下地放逐，然後將其餘的牌置於你牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{R}。\\n{R}，{T}：如果某對手本回合中受過7點或更多傷害，則你可以使用被放逐的牌，且不須支付其魔法力費用。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534549&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e16e0358-87e5-44d2-b896-694726f9ed39', 'multiverseId': 534549}, 'multiverseid': 534549}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr des Wildsprechers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n• Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Fluch ist gebrochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532766&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ece5afe2-261f-44d0-9283-3140ed1006c8\', \'multiverseId\': 532766}, \'multiverseid\': 532766}, {\'name\': \'Regreso del Portavoz Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas.\\n• Las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha roto la maldición".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f90aba50-7342-4c81-9b50-b31a438b505d\', \'multiverseId\': 532977}, \'multiverseid\': 532977}, {\'name\': \'Retour du Languebestion\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez.\\n• Les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La malédiction est brisée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533188&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76bde6d4-d1d8-487b-b4a4-de545c65ea20\', \'multiverseId\': 533188}, \'multiverseid\': 533188}, {\'name\': \'Ritorno di Lingua Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Pesca carte pari alla forza maggiore tra le creature non Umano che controlli.\\n• Le creature non Umano che controlli prendono +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"La maledizione è stata spezzata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda2c8f8-ea5e-4ca8-a0c1-7ef0a78b0cb0\', \'multiverseId\': 533399}, \'multiverseid\': 533399}, {\'name\': \'野生語りの帰還\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないすべてのクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n• ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「呪いは解けた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc1f7fa-bfa9-45a2-9c07-185a3ab6f62a\', \'multiverseId\': 533610}, \'multiverseid\': 533610}, {\'name\': \'Retorno do Falabravo\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Compre uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior poder entre as criaturas não Humano que você controla.\\n• As criaturas não Humano que você controla recebem +3/+3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"A maldição foi quebrada."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9435c5c-a220-4a41-ae2b-07bfccf16a6e\', \'multiverseId\': 533821}, \'multiverseid\': 533821}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение Дикоречивого\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению силы среди не являющихся Человеком существ под вашим контролем.\\n• Не являющиеся Человеком существа под вашим контролем получают +3/+3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Проклятье снято».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b35daca-1ed7-4258-aa48-5fba0dc3536b\', \'multiverseId\': 534032}, \'multiverseid\': 534032}, {\'name\': \'召兽使复归\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的非人类生物中力量最大者的数值。\\n•由你操控的非人类生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「诅咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534243&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aaf2f3f-e597-458c-8b51-d3e043164d10\', \'multiverseId\': 534243}, \'multiverseid\': 534243}, {\'name\': \'召獸使復歸\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n‧抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的非人類生物中力量最大者的數值。\\n•由你操控的非人類生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「詛咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a257da7-1b6b-46e1-8c35-966b72adcd3d\', \'multiverseId\': 534454}, \'multiverseid\': 534454}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr zur Natur\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl.\\n• Zerstöre eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich ist die Natur stärker als alles andere. Du siehst ja auch keine kleinen Häuschen auf Bäumen sprießen."\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532767&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ab49ab-fdee-4595-842e-e679e1b898eb\', \'multiverseId\': 532767}, \'multiverseid\': 532767}, {\'name\': \'Regreso a la naturaleza\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto objetivo.\\n• Destruye el encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Exilia la carta objetivo de un cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sí, la naturaleza es más fuerte. De los árboles no brotan pequeños edificios".\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86f5cae2-8870-4282-8a9b-7e2c749506c8\', \'multiverseId\': 532978}, \'multiverseid\': 532978}, {\'name\': \'Regain de la nature\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez un artefact ciblé.\\n• Détruisez un enchantement ciblé.\\n• Exilez une carte ciblée depuis un cimetière.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Oui, la nature est la plus forte. On ne voit jamais de petits édifices pousser sur des arbres. »\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533189&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b07c21a3-7b32-4de3-89c5-ffaa1b99d33e\', \'multiverseId\': 533189}, \'multiverseid\': 533189}, {\'name\': \'Restituire alla Natura\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio.\\n• Distruggi un incantesimo bersaglio.\\n• Esilia una carta bersaglio da un cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sì, la natura è più forte. Hai mai visto piccoli edifici germogliare sugli alberi?"\\n—Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'185cf3aa-7e4c-4110-827a-c5dcb20fa3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 533400}, \'multiverseid\': 533400}, {\'name\': \'自然への回帰\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• アーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• エンチャント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n• 墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「そう、自然は強い。木から建物が生えるのは見たことがないでしょう。」\\n――イマーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508ffae5-c1da-4434-9ae4-8654c1ca72ce\', \'multiverseId\': 533611}, \'multiverseid\': 533611}, {\'name\': \'Retorno à Natureza\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• Destrua o artefato alvo.\\n• Destrua o encantamento alvo.\\n• Exile o card alvo de um cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Sim, a natureza é mais forte. Você não vê prediozinhos brotando em árvores."\\n— Emmara\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9151a769-f968-480c-9ea7-76788f322d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 533822}, \'multiverseid\': 533822}, {\'name\': \'Возвращение к Природе\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Уничтожьте целевой артефакт.\\n• Уничтожьте целевые чары.\\n• Изгоните целевую карту из кладбища.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Да, природа сильнее. Ты не найдешь дерева, поросшего маленькими домиками».\\n— Эммара\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b65f06-23f8-4c1e-badc-232380b7a746\', \'multiverseId\': 534033}, \'multiverseid\': 534033}, {\'name\': \'回返自然\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器。\\n•消灭目标结界。\\n•将目标牌从坟墓场放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「没错，自然更强大。你可看不到树上探出建物。」\\n～艾玛拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397c434d-c629-41ba-b48a-53aa5da5a653\', \'multiverseId\': 534244}, \'multiverseid\': 534244}, {\'name\': \'回返自然\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n•消滅目標神器。\\n•消滅目標結界。\\n•將目標牌從墳墓場放逐。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「沒錯，自然更強大。你可看不到樹上探出建物。」\\n～艾瑪拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd1af1df-5046-4159-b95b-6ca4daf7aa57\', \'multiverseId\': 534455}, \'multiverseid\': 534455}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schamanische Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine Karte.\\nWildheit — Du erhältst für jede Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du kontrollierst, 4 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Erst das Geflüster längst vergangener Tage. Dann Visionen von zukünftigen Ereignissen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532769&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4ba69a3-5a23-4d86-981a-78df6673d730\', \'multiverseId\': 532769}, \'multiverseid\': 532769}, {\'name\': \'Revelación chamánica\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta por cada criatura que controlas.\\nFerocidad — Ganas 4 vidas por cada criatura que controlas con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Primero llegaron los susurros de los días pasados. Después, las visiones de lo que aún no había ocurrido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bf0d03a-02dc-46a1-909d-d2a4b7ee7e03\', \'multiverseId\': 532980}, \'multiverseid\': 532980}, {\'name\': \'Révélation shamanique\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\nFérocité — Vous gagnez 4 points de vie pour chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "D\'abord des murmures des jours passés. Puis des visions des événements à venir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de947e44-4ac4-4e01-b113-59718974645d\', \'multiverseId\': 533191}, \'multiverseid\': 533191}, {\'name\': \'Rivelazione Sciamanica\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta per ogni creatura che controlli.\\nFerocia — Guadagni 4 punti vita per ogni creatura con forza pari o superiore a 4 che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Prima, sussurri di tempi antichi. Poi, visioni di cose a venire.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b22f63c0-8749-497b-afcc-001a3cb1e051\', \'multiverseId\': 533402}, \'multiverseid\': 533402}, {\'name\': \'巫師の天啓\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの数に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n獰猛 ― あなたはあなたがコントロールしていてパワーが４以上であるクリーチャー１体につき４点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'最初に古き時代からの囁きあり。そして、これより起こることの幻視が続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d5bd9b-4f7c-4062-ac80-26e44434650e\', \'multiverseId\': 533613}, \'multiverseid\': 533613}, {\'name\': \'Revelação Xamânica\', \'text\': \'Compre um card para cada criatura que você controla.\\nFeroz — Você ganha 4 pontos de vida para cada criatura que você controla com poder igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro, sussurros dos tempos antigos. Depois, visões do porvir.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60feab38-a689-44b6-8d37-e2ac29b7ab40\', \'multiverseId\': 533824}, \'multiverseid\': 533824}, {\'name\': \'Откровение Шамана\', \'text\': \'Возьмите одну карту за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\nСвирепость — Вы получаете 4 жизни за каждое существо с силой не менее 4 под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Сперва шепот о древних временах. Затем видения о грядущем.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e20e533c-d7d3-44bd-92db-5dde377b6351\', \'multiverseId\': 534035}, \'multiverseid\': 534035}, {\'name\': \'祭师启示\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个生物，便抓一张牌。\\n威猛～你每操控一个力量等于或大于4的生物，便获得4点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'先是呢喃细语述说远古过往。后有万千景象展现动荡未来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'047541d6-c8c9-49ea-8702-2e5204a4aea4\', \'multiverseId\': 534246}, \'multiverseid\': 534246}, {\'name\': \'祭師啟示\', \'text\': \'你每操控一個生物，便抽一張牌。\\n威猛～你每操控一個力量等於或大於4的生物，便獲得4點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'先是呢喃細語述說遠古過往。後有萬千景象展現動盪未來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'452918f3-9ebb-410d-8323-00734d2d3e4d\', \'multiverseId\': 534457}, \'multiverseid\': 534457}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenblut-Grat\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In den schattendurchfluteten Abgründen bringen Gnolle finsteren Mächten Opfergaben dar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532857&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89d0c75-65d1-418d-bc00-533fcffebfcd\', \'multiverseId\': 532857}, \'multiverseid\': 532857}, {\'name\': \'Cordillera Sangresombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los gnolls realizan ofrendas a fuerzas siniestras en los abismos ensombrecidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cae7fdf8-3a3c-4515-a00f-8c52c62e945d\', \'multiverseId\': 533068}, \'multiverseid\': 533068}, {\'name\': "Contreforts d\'Ombresang", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les gnolls font des offrandes aux forces sinistres des abysses plongés dans les ténèbres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533279&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70e79f01-42bc-4b8e-9bcc-e13b0cadd3d7\', \'multiverseId\': 533279}, \'multiverseid\': 533279}, {\'name\': \'Costa di Sangueombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Gli gnoll offrono sacrifici a forze sinistre nei baratri permeati dall\'oscurità.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'121cd6ce-69ef-409a-b9e0-9a60b5291956\', \'multiverseId\': 533490}, \'multiverseid\': 533490}, {\'name\': \'シャドーブラッドの尾根\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ノールたちは影の満ちた亀裂で悪意の軍団に捧げものをする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e650b558-82e4-4210-837d-ca2a01ebd5f6\', \'multiverseId\': 533701}, \'multiverseid\': 533701}, {\'name\': \'Serra de Sanguesombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os gnolls fazem oferendas a forças sinistras nas grotas tomadas pela sombra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8c69d0-d09c-4f71-90cf-e4e0a2a65925\', \'multiverseId\': 533912}, \'multiverseid\': 533912}, {\'name\': \'Хребет Тенекровья\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Гноллы делают подношения зловещим силам в безднах, пропитанных тьмой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6907da5c-3f2b-4732-8bdc-ca0d8c9f5bc5\', \'multiverseId\': 534123}, \'multiverseid\': 534123}, {\'name\': \'暗血山脊\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'豺狼人供奉邪恶力量的祭祀仪式，通常都在黯影重重的峡谷中进行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ca3bc85-03b5-4f00-9cea-d242ba17fcfe\', \'multiverseId\': 534334}, \'multiverseid\': 534334}, {\'name\': \'暗血山脊\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'豺狼人供奉邪惡力量的祭祀儀式，通常都在黯影重重的峽谷中進行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fc74afa-1350-4f3f-9129-7ab3e395855c\', \'multiverseId\': 534545}, \'multiverseid\': 534545}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenhafter Aal\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nTotembeistand (Falls die verzauberte Kreatur zerstört würde, entferne stattdessen allen Schaden von ihr und zerstöre diese Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76894bda-8c45-42f2-b193-406cad99a303\', \'multiverseId\': 532681}, \'multiverseid\': 532681}, {\'name\': \'Umbra de anguila\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1.\\nArmadura tótem. (Si la criatura encantada fuera a ser destruida, en vez de eso, remueve todo el daño de ella y destruye esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4878c113-d332-476f-806f-eb3443adb0ee\', \'multiverseId\': 532892}, \'multiverseid\': 532892}, {\'name\': "Ombre d\'anguille", \'text\': \'Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1.\\nArmure totémique (Si la créature enchantée devait être détruite, à la place, retirez-lui toutes ses blessures et détruisez cette aura.)\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d9f32e5-9d86-4dc0-94a2-09cb764ad0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 533103}, \'multiverseid\': 533103}, {\'name\': "Essenza dell\'Anguilla", \'text\': "Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1.\\nArmatura totem (Se la creatura incantata sta per essere distrutta, rimuovi invece tutto il danno da essa e distruggi quest\'Aura.)", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1918789-a9f9-4e39-b72e-79933f27bf77\', \'multiverseId\': 533314}, \'multiverseid\': 533314}, {\'name\': \'長魚の陰影\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n族霊鎧（エンチャントしているクリーチャーが破壊されるなら、代わりにそれが負っているすべてのダメージを取り除いてこのオーラを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533525&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b35c1cd-7a8d-4fce-a54c-855febcb1365\', \'multiverseId\': 533525}, \'multiverseid\': 533525}, {\'name\': \'Sombra de Enguia\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1.\\nArmadura de totem (Se a criatura encantada seria destruída, em vez disso, remova todo o dano dela e destrua esta Aura.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff74617b-51b3-49e9-a597-bc8bb8af794b\', \'multiverseId\': 533736}, \'multiverseid\': 533736}, {\'name\': \'Дух Угря\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЗачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1.\\nТотемная броня (Если зачарованное существо должно быть уничтожено, вместо этого снимите с него все повреждения и уничтожьте эту Ауру.)\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'469bf97a-e04d-4d13-9a3b-302737116491\', \'multiverseId\': 533947}, \'multiverseid\': 533947}, {\'name\': \'鳗本影\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+1。\\n替身甲（如果所结附的生物将被消灭，则改为移除它受到的所有伤害，并消灭此灵气。）\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e527e05d-86a8-467c-b01c-20d04d34c4d9\', \'multiverseId\': 534158}, \'multiverseid\': 534158}, {\'name\': \'鰻本影\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+1。\\n替身甲（如果所結附的生物將被消滅，則改為移除它受到的所有傷害，並消滅此靈氣。）\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534369&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53ec946d-112f-4bff-86aa-5f0eb4f588c9\', \'multiverseId\': 534369}, \'multiverseid\': 534369}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlund des Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Niemand kehrt unverändert zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532007&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b183b124-fbed-400a-beca-324aff8797f5\', \'multiverseId\': 532007}, \'multiverseid\': 532007}, {\'name\': \'Arrastrar por el infierno\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Nadie regresa igual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532061&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30da882c-a65f-4ca9-860f-cf61d25a3783\', \'multiverseId\': 532061}, \'multiverseid\': 532061}, {\'name\': \'Traversée des Enfers\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Personne n\'en revient inchangé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532115&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d6e354-5467-452d-84e1-ffee7b97628f\', \'multiverseId\': 532115}, \'multiverseid\': 532115}, {\'name\': "Scagliare all\'Inferno", \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi lanciare quella carta e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Chi fa ritorno non è più lo stesso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c22b1dd-636f-472e-99db-020819f270d6\', \'multiverseId\': 532169}, \'multiverseid\': 532169}, {\'name\': \'地獄送り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。あなたはその呪文を唱えるためにマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'変わらずに戻ってくる者はいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e005d63-764e-4e24-ab2e-f1c70124148b\', \'multiverseId\': 532223}, \'multiverseid\': 532223}, {\'name\': \'Lançar no Inferno\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. Até o final de seu próximo turno, você pode conjurar aquele card e pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer cor para conjurar aquela mágica.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Ninguém volta igual.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ebda2d8-fefc-483f-ac8e-640f335825af\', \'multiverseId\': 532277}, \'multiverseid\': 532277}, {\'name\': \'Бросок Сквозь Ад\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. До конца вашего следующего хода вы можете разыграть ту карту, если она является картой заклинания, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого цвета.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Никто не возвращается неизменным.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88295646-4bad-445f-ba01-67ab7f7dd012\', \'multiverseId\': 532331}, \'multiverseid\': 532331}, {\'name\': \'直坠噩梦\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'回来的人都从此大不相同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86ba2409-ab4e-4ef2-9772-2a11e3e1d958\', \'multiverseId\': 532385}, \'multiverseid\': 532385}, {\'name\': \'直墜噩夢\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以施放該牌，且你可以將魔法力視同任意顏色的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'回來的人都從此大不相同。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49318576-d70e-4fb9-b6ac-d433423df6be\', \'multiverseId\': 532439}, \'multiverseid\': 532439}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlund des Wahnsinns\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f30aeb-10c9-4927-b6a2-3ed157d7b84a\', \'multiverseId\': 531594}, \'multiverseid\': 531594}, {\'name\': \'Arrastrar por el infierno\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17cdb769-0f4f-4686-b77d-ca1f95b50a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 531650}, \'multiverseid\': 531650}, {\'name\': \'Traversée des Enfers\', \'text\': "Exilez une créature ciblée. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531706&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18047598-20c6-4e43-b909-21130805c768\', \'multiverseId\': 531706}, \'multiverseid\': 531706}, {\'name\': "Scagliare all\'Inferno", \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi lanciare quella carta e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi colore per lanciare quella magia.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f0ee904-6e5e-4b09-a9a4-6e59777135b6\', \'multiverseId\': 531762}, \'multiverseid\': 531762}, {\'name\': \'地獄送り\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよい。あなたはその呪文を唱えるために任意のマナを望む色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acc5f028-271f-48f2-983c-547adbb1774a\', \'multiverseId\': 531818}, \'multiverseid\': 531818}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schrecken vom Velusberg\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Doppelschlag\\nWenn der Schrecken vom Velusberg ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schmiede von Purphoros brennt im Herzen des Velusberges und lockt mit ihrer glühenden Hitze Drachen an.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532743&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b4ab2f-6038-41ff-b0b2-001f522a9a8e\', \'multiverseId\': 532743}, \'multiverseid\': 532743}, {\'name\': \'Terror del Monte Velus\', \'text\': \'Vuela, daña dos veces.\\nCuando el Terror del Monte Velus entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'La forja de Purforos arde en el corazón del Monte Velus, y atrae a los dragones con su calor abrasador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'485dba6a-3b85-4984-9cbd-a8ec4fef4f19\', \'multiverseId\': 532954}, \'multiverseid\': 532954}, {\'name\': \'Terreur du mont Vélius\', \'text\': "Vol, double initiative\\nQuand la Terreur du mont Vélius arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Les forges de Purphoros brûlent au cœur du mont Vélius, leur chaleur torride attirant les dragons.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae20dc7-4744-48ba-b5e4-132fd8eb058b\', \'multiverseId\': 533165}, \'multiverseid\': 533165}, {\'name\': \'Terrore del Monte Velus\', \'text\': \'Volare, doppio attacco\\nQuando il Terrore del Monte Velus entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli hanno doppio attacco fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'La fucina di Purforos brucia nel cuore del Monte Velus, attirando i draghi con il suo calore rovente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533376&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69a61d71-0db1-4c9a-a358-3046ec66c5d7\', \'multiverseId\': 533376}, \'multiverseid\': 533376}, {\'name\': \'ヴェリュス山の恐怖\', \'text\': \'飛行、二段攻撃\\nヴェリュス山の恐怖が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'パーフォロスの聖炉はヴェリュス山の中心にあり、焼けつく熱でドラゴンを呼び集めている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a9dffc-94d1-407b-bd74-7b0ef8d83a60\', \'multiverseId\': 533587}, \'multiverseid\': 533587}, {\'name\': \'Terror do Monte Velo\', \'text\': \'Voar, golpe duplo\\nQuando Terror do Monte Velo entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla ganham golpe duplo até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'A forja de Púrforo arde no coração do Monte Velo, atraindo os dragões com seu calor calcinante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9b280b-f934-4143-bcc8-4ebc52c22091\', \'multiverseId\': 533798}, \'multiverseid\': 533798}, {\'name\': \'Ужас Горы Велус\', \'text\': \'Полет, Двойной удар\\nКогда Ужас Горы Велус выходит на поле битвы, существа под вашим контролем получают Двойной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'В сердце горы Велус пылает кузница Пирфора, привлекая драконов своим нестерпимым жаром.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8532090-e218-40a2-b861-29b38cdcdef7\', \'multiverseId\': 534009}, \'multiverseid\': 534009}, {\'name\': \'维鲁斯山骇龙\', \'text\': \'飞行，连击\\n当维鲁斯山骇龙进战场时，由你操控的生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'普罗烽斯的锻炉座落在维鲁斯山脉核心之中，其熊熊烈焰吸引四方巨龙探访。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e1ff01f-4eb6-4e55-a420-be286e275b3f\', \'multiverseId\': 534220}, \'multiverseid\': 534220}, {\'name\': \'維魯斯山駭龍\', \'text\': \'飛行，連擊\\n當維魯斯山駭龍進戰場時，由你操控的生物獲得連擊異能直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'普羅烽斯的鍛爐座落在維魯斯山脈核心之中，其熊熊烈焰吸引四方巨龍探訪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bcd78d5-013e-4ab2-b165-f3a417abb2ef\', \'multiverseId\': 534431}, \'multiverseid\': 534431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schreckensflotten-Draufgängerin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn die Schreckensflotten-Draufgängerin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte in diesem Zug wirken, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana eines beliebigen Typs. Falls der Zauberspruch in diesem Zug auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532719&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ce71fa2-05d5-4b2b-9c8b-dde806b3dfef\', \'multiverseId\': 532719}, \'multiverseid\': 532719}, {\'name\': \'Temeraria de la Flota Arrasadora\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando la Temeraria de la Flota Arrasadora entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo del cementerio de un oponente. Puedes lanzarla este turno, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a un cementerio este turno, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3cea996-8790-454d-9b0e-056c3fa56da1\', \'multiverseId\': 532930}, \'multiverseid\': 532930}, {\'name\': \'Casse-cou de la Flotte implacable\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand la Casse-cou de la Flotte implacable arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire. Vous pouvez la lancer ce tour-ci, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quel type pour lancer ce sort. Si ce sort devait être mis dans un cimetière ce tour-ci, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533141&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dcba8e0-970e-46d1-9e94-9359f8720007\', \'multiverseId\': 533141}, \'multiverseid\': 533141}, {\'name\': \'Spericolata della Flotta Funesta\', \'text\': \'Attacco improvviso\\nQuando la Spericolata della Flotta Funesta entra nel campo di battaglia, esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria bersaglio dal cimitero di un avversario. Puoi lanciarla in questo turno e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciarla. Se quella magia sta per essere messa in un cimitero in questo turno, invece esiliala.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Pirata Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d69998-962d-4c45-926d-c2558b28461a\', \'multiverseId\': 533352}, \'multiverseid\': 533352}, {\'name\': \'凶兆艦隊の向こう見ず\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n凶兆艦隊の向こう見ずが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の墓地にありインスタントかソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。このターン、あなたはそれを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。このターン、その呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75691b52-5b4d-4829-87a8-e6de3dc1e674\', \'multiverseId\': 533563}, \'multiverseid\': 533563}, {\'name\': \'Destemida da Frota Macabra\', \'text\': \'Iniciativa\\nQuando Destemida da Frota Macabra entrar no campo de batalha, exile o card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço alvo do cemitério de um oponente. Você pode conjurar aquele card neste turno e gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer tipo para conjurar aquela mágica. Se aquela mágica seria colocada no seu cemitério neste turno, em vez disso, exile-a.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Pirata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b01f3fba-fe62-4745-ba8e-e5af65948457\', \'multiverseId\': 533774}, \'multiverseid\': 533774}, {\'name\': \'Сорвиголова Лютой Флотилии\', \'text\': \'Первый удар\\nКогда Сорвиголова Лютой Флотилии выходит на поле битвы, изгоните целевую карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства из кладбища оппонента. Вы можете разыграть ее в этом ходу, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание того заклинания, как если бы это была мана любого типа. Если то заклинание должно быть положено на кладбище в этом ходу, изгоните его вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Пират\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2e3173-e96c-4d02-bba3-3f10265c90ec\', \'multiverseId\': 533985}, \'multiverseid\': 533985}, {\'name\': \'焦炬舰队冒险客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n当焦炬舰队冒险客进战场时，将目标瞬间或法术牌从对手的坟墓场放逐。本回合中，你可以施放之，且你可以将法术力视同任意种类的法术力来支付施放该咒语的费用。如果该咒语本回合中将进入坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fc233f9-948e-408e-b4eb-7f1ded18b6e5\', \'multiverseId\': 534196}, \'multiverseid\': 534196}, {\'name\': \'焦炬艦隊冒險客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n當焦炬艦隊冒險客進戰場時，將目標瞬間或巫術牌從對手的墳墓場放逐。本回合中，你可以施放之，且你可以將魔法力視同任意種類的魔法力來支付施放該咒語的費用。如果該咒語本回合中將進入墳墓場，則改為將它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／海盜\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c4ef713-cdbf-4776-948c-c35634b9696b\', \'multiverseId\': 534407}, \'multiverseid\': 534407}]', "[{'name': 'Schwelendes Marschland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDas Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Guul Draz ist ein geothermisches Sumpfland, in dem die Luft vor Hitze und fauligem Gestank flimmert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532860&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f304b094-cc54-4cf2-a65c-bee22ba4c643', 'multiverseId': 532860}, 'multiverseid': 532860}, {'name': 'Cenagal ardiente', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'El continente de Guul Draz es una ciénaga geotérmica que respira calor y putrefacción.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533071&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8001ff71-8585-4123-b83a-e28d6cd8d6a0', 'multiverseId': 533071}, 'multiverseid': 533071}, {'name': 'Marécage fumant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Le continent de Guul Draz est un marais géothermique, puant de chaleur et de décomposition.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533282&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d3dce10-2a9c-4e8a-9aa2-22a270cfc2ae', 'multiverseId': 533282}, 'multiverseid': 533282}, {'name': 'Palude Rovente', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.)\\nLa Palude Rovente entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Palude Montagna', 'flavor': 'Il continente di Guul Draz è un terreno geotermico paludoso che puzza di afa e putrefazione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533493&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aac267b1-fb1e-43e8-a57c-a5aa18eb0adf', 'multiverseId': 533493}, 'multiverseid': 533493}, {'name': '燻る湿地', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': 'グール・ドラズ大陸は温沼地である。地熱による高温と腐敗で燻っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533704&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e7c46cb-1f1b-4f6d-9758-4e00a23aed65', 'multiverseId': 533704}, 'multiverseid': 533704}, {'name': 'Pântano Ardente', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.)\\nPântano Ardente entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Pântano Montanha', 'flavor': 'O continente de Guul Draz é um pântano geotérmico que fede a mofo e podridão.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533915&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'aa019e2f-3e1d-4f1c-8c10-92494f348bc3', 'multiverseId': 533915}, 'multiverseid': 533915}, {'name': 'Тлеющее Болото', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {B} или {R}.)\\nТлеющее Болото выходит на поле битвы повернутым, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Болото Гора', 'flavor': 'Континент Гуул-Драз — разогретое подземным теплом болото, от которого исходят душные гнилостные пары.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534126&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b1663cf-d83b-4b28-8628-54a059deb4b2', 'multiverseId': 534126}, 'multiverseid': 534126}, {'name': '闷燃沼地', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则闷燃沼地须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 ～沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': '古坠兹大陆这片地热沼泽热气蒸腾，腐臭弥漫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534337&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a539244-6933-41f8-99eb-f661238c854f', 'multiverseId': 534337}, 'multiverseid': 534337}, {'name': '悶燃沼地', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}。）\\n除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則悶燃沼地須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地 ～沼澤／山脈', 'flavor': '古墜茲大陸這片地熱沼澤熱氣蒸騰，腐臭瀰漫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534548&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a4cdf1c6-bfc6-4341-a6b7-2299360f61f3', 'multiverseId': 534548}, 'multiverseid': 534548}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schwert der Animistin\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +1/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, kannst du deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie getappt ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Die Klinge erstrahlt nur für Zendikars Auserwählte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532816&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29725110-2bcb-43c7-8b25-65def2a7c260\', \'multiverseId\': 532816}, \'multiverseid\': 532816}, {\'name\': \'Espada de la animista\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +1/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla girada y luego barajar.\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'La hoja solo resplandece en manos de la elegida de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03fb051c-eaf9-4c97-9250-ccc5877f079c\', \'multiverseId\': 533027}, \'multiverseid\': 533027}, {\'name\': "Épée de l\'animiste", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +1/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélanger.\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Sa lame ne brille que pour les élus de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658c2189-67e7-43e2-a086-564d0b1eb9b0\', \'multiverseId\': 533238}, \'multiverseid\': 533238}, {\'name\': "Spada dell\'Animista", \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +1/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, puoi passare in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, metterla sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescolare.\\nEquipaggiare {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'La lama si illumina solo per la prescelta da Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e93bb7-c21d-4900-ab69-2fbb870da19d\', \'multiverseId\': 533449}, \'multiverseid\': 533449}, {\'name\': \'精霊信者の剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'この刃は、ゼンディカーが選んだ者のためにのみ輝く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a92651-0d9f-41b6-9926-39106f7d19a7\', \'multiverseId\': 533660}, \'multiverseid\': 533660}, {\'name\': \'Espada da Animista\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +1/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada ataca, você pode procurar um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, colocá-lo no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhar.\\nEquipar {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'A lâmina brilha apenas para a escolhida de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d12eb60-3541-45c8-8f4a-98dbc88d921a\', \'multiverseId\': 533871}, \'multiverseid\': 533871}, {\'name\': \'Меч Анимиста\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, вы можете найти в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положить ее на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасовать библиотеку.\\nСнарядить {2}\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Клинок сияет только в руке, избранной Зендикаром.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff7e1538-2907-42cf-bb2d-818d77fd2545\', \'multiverseId\': 534082}, \'multiverseid\': 534082}, {\'name\': \'物灵师之剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，你可以从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'此剑只为赞迪卡的爱民发光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ace09b-c227-42be-89ae-3645c33eef01\', \'multiverseId\': 534293}, \'multiverseid\': 534293}, {\'name\': \'物靈師之劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+1/+1。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，你可以從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將之橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\\n佩帶{2}\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'此劍只為贊迪卡的愛民發光。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcd3e577-22af-4c1a-a32c-602295704ebe\', \'multiverseId\': 534504}, \'multiverseid\': 534504}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwert der Stunden\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur Kampfschaden zufügt, würfle einen W12. Falls das Ergebnis größer als der zugefügte Schaden oder gleich 12 ist, verdopple die Anzahl der +1/+1-Marken auf der Kreatur.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe4a832-6f9a-4aff-9442-d57827fa8396\', \'multiverseId\': 532016}, \'multiverseid\': 532016}, {\'name\': \'Espada de las horas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate, tira 1d12. Si el resultado es mayor al daño hecho o el resultado es 12, duplica la cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre esa criatura.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'385cccf0-262e-4a9f-832f-f997c241af36\', \'multiverseId\': 532070}, \'multiverseid\': 532070}, {\'name\': \'Épée des heures\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat, lancez un d12. Si le résultat est supérieur au nombre de blessures infligées ou que le résultat est 12, doublez le nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 sur cette créature.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532124&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4205866a-3b54-4af1-8d66-28d9206a1c35\', \'multiverseId\': 532124}, \'multiverseid\': 532124}, {\'name\': \'Spada delle Ore\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento, tira un d12. Se il risultato è superiore al danno inflitto o il risultato è 12, raddoppia il numero di segnalini +1/+1 su quella creatura.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'829f071e-ae5b-42cc-ba81-a81cdebc7ba2\', \'multiverseId\': 532178}, \'multiverseid\': 532178}, {\'name\': \'時の剣\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置く。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、１個のd12を振る。その出目がその与えたダメージより大きいかその出目が12であるなら、そのクリーチャーの上に置かれている＋１/＋１カウンターの個数を２倍にする。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a478a4f9-702f-4552-8f27-7385ff7bda38\', \'multiverseId\': 532232}, \'multiverseid\': 532232}, {\'name\': \'Espada das Horas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causar dano de combate, role um d12. Se o resultado for maior que o dano causado ou for 12, dobre o número de marcadores +1/+1 naquela criatura.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4824f43-4c10-4dde-9d35-17c009b977c0\', \'multiverseId\': 532286}, \'multiverseid\': 532286}, {\'name\': \'Меч Часов\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, положите на него один жетон +1/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения, бросьте d12. Если результат больше, чем нанесенные повреждения, или результат равен 12, то удвойте количество жетонов +1/+1 на том существе.\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a32f43e6-6b6b-46dd-95c2-419a1947c629\', \'multiverseId\': 532340}, \'multiverseid\': 532340}, {\'name\': \'日晷魔剑\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物造成战斗伤害时，掷一颗d12。如果掷骰结果大于所造成的伤害或掷骰结果为12，则将该生物上的+1/+1指示物数量加倍。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ef1a017-1cd6-4290-bbe6-429515f79257\', \'multiverseId\': 532394}, \'multiverseid\': 532394}, {\'name\': \'日晷魔劍\', \'text\': \'每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物造成戰鬥傷害時，擲一顆d12。如果擲骰結果大於所造成的傷害或擲骰結果為12，則將該生物上的+1/+1指示物數量加倍。\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532448&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8fd2c83-3f9e-4c38-a024-444b377482d4\', \'multiverseId\': 532448}, \'multiverseid\': 532448}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwerter zu Pflugscharen\', \'text\': \'Schicke eine Kreatur deiner Wahl ins Exil. Ihr Beherrscher erhält Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Schon ein kleiner Tropfen Bedauern kann zu einem Meer der Wiedergutmachung führen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532673&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea3ad56-f631-4725-b034-cf772b4a281a\', \'multiverseId\': 532673}, \'multiverseid\': 532673}, {\'name\': \'Espadas en guadañas\', \'text\': \'Exilia la criatura objetivo. Su controlador gana una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La más diminuta semilla de arrepentimiento puede germinar en redención.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5140fb00-cbe0-4129-a3eb-90391ad67f32\', \'multiverseId\': 532884}, \'multiverseid\': 532884}, {\'name\': \'Retour au pays\', \'text\': \'Exilez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur gagne un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "L\'embryon de regret le plus infime peut s\'épanouir dans la rédemption.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58007830-a7e3-49a7-98de-251f61d62e52\', \'multiverseId\': 533095}, \'multiverseid\': 533095}, {\'name\': \'Da Spade a Spighe!\', \'text\': \'Esilia una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore guadagna punti vita pari alla sua forza.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'La più piccola traccia di rimpianto può diventare voglia di riscatto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a7acae6-7a8c-4073-a6bc-4afe3a3444b3\', \'multiverseId\': 533306}, \'multiverseid\': 533306}, {\'name\': \'剣を鍬に\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを追放する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーに等しい点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ごく小さい後悔の種が救済の花を咲かせる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c321ddfd-fa47-4793-9f3f-97e46a796dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 533517}, \'multiverseid\': 533517}, {\'name\': \'Espadas em Arados\', \'text\': \'Exile a criatura alvo. O controlador da criatura ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao poder dela.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Da menor semente de arrependimento pode florescer a redenção.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d90e964-708f-4dfe-bd1b-674cf97aea1c\', \'multiverseId\': 533728}, \'multiverseid\': 533728}, {\'name\': \'Мечи на Орала\', \'text\': \'Изгоните целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок получает количество жизней, равное его силе.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Малейшее зернышко раскаяния может взойти ростком искупления.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42c70623-3cae-4324-b2ea-cbacd710dd28\', \'multiverseId\': 533939}, \'multiverseid\': 533939}, {\'name\': \'化剑为犁\', \'text\': \'放逐目标生物。其操控者获得等同于其力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'再小的悔恨种子也能开出救赎之花。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f431331-5325-49eb-a3eb-ff3e8fec301f\', \'multiverseId\': 534150}, \'multiverseid\': 534150}, {\'name\': \'化劍為犁\', \'text\': \'放逐目標生物。其操控者獲得等同於其力量的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'再小的悔恨種子也能開出救贖之花。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534361&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4afe8979-38ee-4a6e-b2ef-2f1bb05c1285\', \'multiverseId\': 534361}, \'multiverseid\': 534361}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwindsucht\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Ihr Beherrscher verliert Lebenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke plus ihrer Widerstandskraft.\\nAussetzen 5 — {1}{B} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {1}{B} bezahlen und sie mit fünf Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, wirke sie, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532703&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13fdbc9a-ef7a-422f-8205-da7854430d8f\', \'multiverseId\': 532703}, \'multiverseid\': 532703}, {\'name\': \'Tisis\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Su controlador pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a su fuerza más su resistencia.\\nSuspender 5—{1}{B}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta desde tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{B} y exiliarla con cinco contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d81b721-a2b3-4dd9-9ae9-1b418087ae1f\', \'multiverseId\': 532914}, \'multiverseid\': 532914}, {\'name\': \'Phtisie\', \'text\': "Détruisez une créature ciblée. Son contrôleur perd un nombre de points de vie égal à sa force plus son endurance.\\nSuspension 5 — {1}{B} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{B} et l\'exiler avec cinq marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, lancez cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c5495c9-0e94-425b-9013-978e783b3927\', \'multiverseId\': 533125}, \'multiverseid\': 533125}, {\'name\': \'Tisi\', \'text\': "Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Il suo controllore perde punti vita pari alla sua forza più la sua costituzione.\\nSospendere 5—{1}{B} (Invece di lanciare questa carta dalla tua mano, puoi pagare {1}{B} ed esiliarla con cinque segnalini tempo su di essa. All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, rimuovi un segnalino tempo. Quando l\'ultimo viene rimosso, lancia la carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533336&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f514d347-6a9f-4e75-bd03-73c2a069fe97\', \'multiverseId\': 533336}, \'multiverseid\': 533336}, {\'name\': \'結核\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それのコントローラーは、それのパワーにそれのタフネスを足した値に等しい点数のライフを失う。\\n待機５―{1}{B}（あなたはこのカードをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{B}を支払って時間カウンター５個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱える。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e13d169-d071-46e7-bffa-34703d520e35\', \'multiverseId\': 533547}, \'multiverseid\': 533547}, {\'name\': \'Tísica\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Seu controlador perde uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual ao seu poder mais sua resistência.\\nSuspender 5 — {1}{B} (Em vez de conjurar este card da sua mão, você pode pagar {1}{B} e exilá-lo com cinco marcadores temporais. No início de sua manutenção, remova um marcador temporal. Quando o último for removido, conjure-o sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e731032d-700e-4cfd-9746-36d7fdecb73a\', \'multiverseId\': 533758}, \'multiverseid\': 533758}, {\'name\': \'Чахотка\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Контролирующий его игрок теряет количество жизней, равное сумме его силы и выносливости.\\nОтсрочка 5 — {1}{B} (Вместо того, чтобы разыграть эту карту из вашей руки, вы можете заплатить {1}{B} и изгнать ее с пятью временными жетонами на ней. В начале вашего шага поддержки удалите один временной жетон. Когда удален последний временной жетон, разыграйте эту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6463c727-d425-4f5b-8831-29551f286f07\', \'multiverseId\': 533969}, \'multiverseid\': 533969}, {\'name\': \'痨病\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。其操控者失去等同于其力量与防御力加总的生命。\\n延缓5～{1}{B}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{B}并将它放逐，且上面有五个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5f27f8c-f2cd-4112-8348-a430f997b311\', \'multiverseId\': 534180}, \'multiverseid\': 534180}, {\'name\': \'癆病\', \'text\': \'消滅目標生物。其操控者失去等同於其力量與防禦力加總的生命。\\n延緩5～{1}{B}（除了從你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{B}並將它放逐，且上面有五個計時指示物。在你的維持開始時，從其上移去一個計時指示物。當移去最後一個時，施放它且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb8f1f72-09a0-4b56-a5e0-90af41b7ec53\', \'multiverseId\': 534391}, \'multiverseid\': 534391}]', "[{'name': 'Seeküstenzitadelle', 'text': 'Die Seeküstenzitadelle kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}, {W} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Um der Weisheit willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alles von oben sehen zu können. Um des Ruhmes willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um als Dokument der Macht zu dienen. Um der Stärke willen wurde sie hoch gebaut, um alle Angriffe abzuwehren.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532856&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8b7f013-bc84-4072-86f2-fa3b23c1a229', 'multiverseId': 532856}, 'multiverseid': 532856}, {'name': 'Ciudadela costera', 'text': 'La Ciudadela costera entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}, {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Para la sabiduría, fue construida bien alta para observarlo todo. Para la gloria, fue construida bien alta para ser un testimonio del poder. Para la fortaleza, fue construida bien alta para repeler todos los ataques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533067&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'af7a13dd-5bf9-46f8-b5f2-d96306812d73', 'multiverseId': 533067}, 'multiverseid': 533067}, {'name': 'Citadelle maritime', 'text': 'La Citadelle maritime arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}, {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Pour la sagesse, elle fut construite haute pour tout voir. Pour la gloire, elle fut construite haute en testament de la puissance. Pour la force, elle fut construite haute pour repousser toutes les attaques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533278&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1654b751-a400-4971-a594-444e0bff76bf', 'multiverseId': 533278}, 'multiverseid': 533278}, {'name': 'Cittadella sul Mare', 'text': 'La Cittadella sul Mare entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}, {W} o {U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Per la saggezza, è stata costruita in alto per contemplare ogni cosa. Per la gloria, è stata costruita in alto come testimonianza di potere. Per la potenza, è stata costruita in alto per respingere tutti gli attacchi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533489&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cdc8351b-bc70-48d2-abdb-4909861b4e28', 'multiverseId': 533489}, 'multiverseid': 533489}, {'name': '海辺の城塞', 'text': '海辺の城塞はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{W}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '智のために、それはあらゆる物を見下ろす高さとなった。名誉のために、それは力を示す高さとなった。力のために、それはすべての攻撃を跳ね返す高さとなった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533700&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27eff686-bdcd-4e17-b68a-1cd64620c0d5', 'multiverseId': 533700}, 'multiverseid': 533700}, {'name': 'Cidadela à Beira-mar', 'text': 'Cidadela à Beira-mar entra no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}, {W} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'Pela sabedoria, ela foi construída no alto para ver todas as coisas. Pela glória, ela foi construída no alto como um testemunho de poder. Pela força, ela foi construída no alto para repelir todos os ataques.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533911&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba3595b7-179d-4a40-afd6-c27fc7b0110e', 'multiverseId': 533911}, 'multiverseid': 533911}, {'name': 'Морская Цитадель', 'text': 'Морская Цитадель выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}, {W} или {U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Ее построили высокой ради мудрости, чтобы созерцать все вокруг. Ее построили высокой ради славы, чтобы доказать могущество. Ее построили высокой ради неприступности, чтобы отражать любые атаки.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534122&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c79c398a-4983-42c3-b885-9ea4e0fa3e9a', 'multiverseId': 534122}, 'multiverseid': 534122}, {'name': '海滨殿堂', 'text': '海滨殿堂须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}，{W}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '为了智慧，它建在高地来监看万物。为了荣誉，它建在高地以验证勇武。为了力量，它建在高地好斥退攻势。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534333&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '940dc87e-08dc-481e-83be-b16ef0aade0b', 'multiverseId': 534333}, 'multiverseid': 534333}, {'name': '海濱殿堂', 'text': '海濱殿堂須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{G}，{W}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '為了智慧，它建在高地來監看萬物。為了榮譽，它建在高地以驗證勇武。為了力量，它建在高地好斥退攻勢。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534544&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dd73a30-c9df-4f5b-8d3b-9f58a6dba210', 'multiverseId': 534544}, 'multiverseid': 534544}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sefris von den Verborgenen Wegen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, wage dich ins Gewölbe. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst. (Um dich ins Gewölbe zu wagen, betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\\nUntote erschaffen — Immer wenn du ein Gewölbe absolvierst, bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531836&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f056203-4dc6-4cce-85ab-6e54995cf908\', \'multiverseId\': 531836}, \'multiverseid\': 531836}, {\'name\': \'Sefris de la sabiduría oculta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más cartas de criatura vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte, adéntrate en la mazmorra. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno. (Para adentrarse en la mazmorra, entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\\nCrear muerto viviente — Siempre que completes una mazmorra, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ebf0a87-6d21-44ce-a124-465d8fd623d4\', \'multiverseId\': 531840}, \'multiverseid\': 531840}, {\'name\': \'Sefris des Voies Secrètes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour. (Pour vous aventurer dans le donjon, entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)\\nCréation de mort-vivant — À chaque fois que vous terminez un donjon, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531844&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84816910-d84e-4148-8ed3-d4028f567007\', \'multiverseId\': 531844}, \'multiverseid\': 531844}, {\'name\': \'Sefris delle Vie Nascoste\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più carte creatura vengono messe nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona, esplora il dungeon. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno. (Per esplorare il dungeon, entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva).\\nCreare Non Morti — Ogniqualvolta completi un dungeon, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531848&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2006fb71-25f0-4efb-a54f-17bac8ac71de\', \'multiverseId\': 531848}, \'multiverseid\': 531848}, {\'name\': \'隠道のセフリス\', \'text\': \'１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\\nクリエイト・アンデッド ― あなたがダンジョンを踏破するたび、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee90f4d3-3f86-4894-ae06-3706533c67a3\', \'multiverseId\': 531852}, \'multiverseid\': 531852}, {\'name\': \'Sefris dos Métodos Ocultos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais cards de criatura forem colocados em seu cemitério vindos de qualquer lugar, aventure-se na masmorra. Esta habilidade é desencadeada apenas uma vez a cada turno. (Para aventurar-se na masmorra, entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\\nCriar Morto-vivo — Toda vez que completar uma masmorra, devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e44bf570-a7d2-4523-8bea-a6cbd35d0efb\', \'multiverseId\': 531856}, \'multiverseid\': 531856}, {\'name\': \'Сефрис Тайного Пути\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда одна или несколько карт существ попадают откуда угодно на ваше кладбище, углубитесь в подземелье. Эта способность срабатывает только один раз в каждом ходу. (Чтобы углубиться в подземелье, войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\\nСоздание нежити — Каждый раз, когда вы проходите подземелье, верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531860&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec46af3e-9d3e-4735-8d94-54d2073e49d5\', \'multiverseId\': 531860}, \'multiverseid\': 531860}, {\'name\': \'密宗法师塞弗莉丝\', \'text\': \'每当一张或数张生物牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场时，深入地城。此异能每回合只会触发一次。（深入地城的流程是进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\\n唤起死灵～每当你完成地城时，将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ed9b77d-c45c-4e3c-8c49-6ea8e26613c1\', \'multiverseId\': 531864}, \'multiverseid\': 531864}, {\'name\': \'密宗法師塞弗莉絲\', \'text\': \'每當一張或數張生物牌從任何區域進入你的墳墓場時，深入地城。此異能每回合只會觸發一次。（深入地城的流程是進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\\n喚起死靈～每當你完成地城時，將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30ab241e-c03e-4fd9-b69c-0fbdfcda6b95\', \'multiverseId\': 531868}, \'multiverseid\': 531868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sefris von den Verborgenen Wegen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, wage dich ins Gewölbe. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\\nUntote erschaffen — Immer wenn du ein Gewölbe absolvierst, bringe eine Kreatur deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531602&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f74ee41-0eef-4b5c-90e1-3152f4576486\', \'multiverseId\': 531602}, \'multiverseid\': 531602}, {\'name\': \'Sefris de la sabiduría oculta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más cartas de criatura vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte, adéntrate en la mazmorra. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez cada turno.\\nCrear muerto viviente — Siempre que completes una mazmorra, regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f81eb292-e2ac-4f12-981f-25fa4fc52837\', \'multiverseId\': 531658}, \'multiverseid\': 531658}, {\'name\': \'Sefris des Voies Secrètes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.\\nCréation de mort-vivant — À chaque fois que vous terminez un donjon, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531714&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc26f632-89f9-4eed-9403-306b696d5da1\', \'multiverseId\': 531714}, \'multiverseid\': 531714}, {\'name\': \'Sefris delle Vie Nascoste\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più carte creatura vengono messe nel tuo cimitero da qualsiasi zona, esplora il dungeon. Questa abilità si innesca solo una volta per turno.\\nCreare Non Morti — Ogniqualvolta completi un dungeon, rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f86b8d94-6002-4f08-ab62-167ee53dc0f8\', \'multiverseId\': 531770}, \'multiverseid\': 531770}, {\'name\': \'隠道のセフリス\', \'text\': \'１枚以上のクリーチャー・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\\nクリエイト・アンデッド ― あなたがダンジョンを踏破するたび、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26f7f48e-6b4d-463e-9c72-ce3fbb65ed77\', \'multiverseId\': 531826}, \'multiverseid\': 531826}]', '[{\'name\': \'Segnung des Dommelgreifs\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+0 und hat Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{W}: Bringe die Segnung des Dommelgreifs aus deinem Friedhof an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl angelegt ins Spiel zurück. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532665&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef97ae9d-6307-413d-8205-cdc17ab9e2cd\', \'multiverseId\': 532665}, \'multiverseid\': 532665}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva de gryff\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+0 y tiene la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{W}: Regresa la Dádiva de gryff de tu cementerio al campo de batalla anexada a la criatura objetivo. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f35c0767-c863-4451-af52-9c71d3f10832\', \'multiverseId\': 532876}, \'multiverseid\': 532876}, {\'name\': \'Faveur du gryff\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+0 et a le vol.\\n{3}{W} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille la Faveur du gryff depuis votre cimetière, attachée à une créature ciblée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533087&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9997bdd2-7ad3-4685-9500-c9562d712b44\', \'multiverseId\': 533087}, \'multiverseid\': 533087}, {\'name\': \'Dono del Gryff\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+0 e ha volare.\\n{3}{W}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia il Dono del Gryff dal tuo cimitero assegnato a una creatura bersaglio. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c48e69f-8e3c-4e2f-a1ed-d916aa2403bf\', \'multiverseId\': 533298}, \'multiverseid\': 533298}, {\'name\': \'グリフの加護\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは、＋１/＋０の修整を受け飛行を持つ。\\n{3}{W}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたの墓地にあるグリフの加護をそのクリーチャーについた状態で戦場に戻す。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0e1981-aa07-466d-a1ed-64a7aac5d445\', \'multiverseId\': 533509}, \'multiverseid\': 533509}, {\'name\': \'Dádiva do Grifino\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+0 e tem voar.\\n{3}{W}: Devolva Dádiva do Grifino de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha anexado à criatura alvo. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e062ad7b-53e6-4d15-9089-2f70beee4699\', \'multiverseId\': 533720}, \'multiverseid\': 533720}, {\'name\': \'Дар Грифа\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+0 и имеет Полет.\\n{3}{W}: верните Дар Грифа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы прикрепленным к целевому существу. Активируйте только как волшебство.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08de5fe5-66d3-4dcb-94aa-42ead4bc6444\', \'multiverseId\': 533931}, \'multiverseid\': 533931}, {\'name\': \'骏鹭恩泽\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+1/+0且具有飞行异能。\\n{3}{W}：将骏鹭恩泽从你的坟墓场移回战场并贴附在目标生物上。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b010f237-a816-49f6-8d84-1a461855790f\', \'multiverseId\': 534142}, \'multiverseid\': 534142}, {\'name\': \'駿鷺恩澤\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+1/+0且具有飛行異能。\\n{3}{W}：將駿鷺恩澤從你的墳墓場移回戰場並貼附在目標生物上。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4abb754-bf7f-4a68-82ba-58dfbc62627e\', \'multiverseId\': 534353}, \'multiverseid\': 534353}]', '[{\'name\': \'Seuchensäer\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Seuchensäer ins Spiel kommt, opfert jeder Spieler eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker. Jeder Spieler, der dies nicht kann, wirft eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Gabe nimmt nicht nur, sie schenkt auch den Verbliebenen neue Wertschätzung für ihr Überleben."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532705&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f251e6e-6254-4f14-b419-b8382d7da467\', \'multiverseId\': 532705}, \'multiverseid\': 532705}, {\'name\': \'Difundeplagas\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Difundeplagas entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador sacrifica una criatura o planeswalker. Cada jugador que no pueda hacerlo descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi poder es generosidad, en cierto modo. Después de mí, mis supervivientes valoran más sus vidas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdef863d-d41d-419d-a1f6-442039b78ee4\', \'multiverseId\': 532916}, \'multiverseid\': 532916}, {\'name\': \'Façonneur de peste\', \'text\': "Quand le Façonneur de peste arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur sacrifie une créature ou un planeswalker. Chaque joueur qui ne peut pas se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Mon pouvoir est généreux, d\'une certaine manière. Je donne à ceux qui me survivent un aperçu de leur vie. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737be6b5-5efa-4259-824a-f9dd6b636823\', \'multiverseId\': 533127}, \'multiverseid\': 533127}, {\'name\': \'Plasmacontagio\', \'text\': \'Quando il Plasmacontagio entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura o un planeswalker. Ogni giocatore che non può farlo scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"In un certo senso, il mio potere è generoso. Regalo a chi mi sopravvive un maggior senso di gratitudine per la propria vita."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2a082e4-fab9-4746-8436-3d4369791ccf\', \'multiverseId\': 533338}, \'multiverseid\': 533338}, {\'name\': \'疫病造り師\', \'text\': \'疫病造り師が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１体を生け贄に捧げる。それができない各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「我が力はある意味寛大なのだ。生き延びた者たちに、生命への感謝を与えている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4aac2c2b-4617-4ac4-bccb-b78423f493be\', \'multiverseId\': 533549}, \'multiverseid\': 533549}, {\'name\': \'Empesteiro\', \'text\': \'Quando Empesteiro entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador sacrifica uma criatura ou um planeswalker. Cada jogador que não estiver apto descarta um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"De certa forma, meu poder é um ato de generosidade. Eu dou aos meus sobreviventes uma apreciação pela vida."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d28f63-9b4e-4867-8772-6c61ed31d7b2\', \'multiverseId\': 533760}, \'multiverseid\': 533760}, {\'name\': \'Мастер Чумы\', \'text\': "Когда Мастер Чумы выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок жертвует существо или planeswalker\'а. Каждый игрок, который не может это сделать, сбрасывает карту.", \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Мое могущество — это своего рода щедрость. Тем, кто не скончался, я дарю осознание ценности жизни».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533971&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28771c62-6f58-45f4-9a14-6fd5ee106535\', \'multiverseId\': 533971}, \'multiverseid\': 533971}, {\'name\': \'播疫师\', \'text\': \'当播疫师进战场时，每位牌手各牺牲一个生物或鹏洛客。每位无法如此作的牌手各弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「我的能力可谓慷慨。我让从我手下幸存的人对生命心怀感恩。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f7d97ae-1485-4e19-8093-8e0c04317dba\', \'multiverseId\': 534182}, \'multiverseid\': 534182}, {\'name\': \'播疫師\', \'text\': \'當播疫師進戰場時，每位玩家各犧牲一個生物或鵬洛客。每位無法如此作的玩家各棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「我的能力可謂慷慨。我讓從我手下倖存的人對生命心懷感恩。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf3b3dc3-784a-4d30-b971-39df472bc4c5\', \'multiverseId\': 534393}, \'multiverseid\': 534393}]', '[{\'name\': \'Shivan-Höllendrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{R}: Der Shivan-Höllendrache fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Schuppen eines Drachen geben hervorragende Schilde ab, vorausgesetzt du hast einen Drachenzahn, um sie zurechtzuschneiden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532737&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd4d8777-01a7-44a3-9160-ec3f63431457\', \'multiverseId\': 532737}, \'multiverseid\': 532737}, {\'name\': \'Engendro shivano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{R}: El Engendro shivano hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Una escama de dragón puede ser tallada hasta crear un escudo extraordinario, siempre que se consiga un diente de dragón para cortarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d61b692-8626-45a4-8eb8-b54482fdc255\', \'multiverseId\': 532948}, \'multiverseid\': 532948}, {\'name\': \'Escouflenfer shivân\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{1}{R} : L\'Escouflenfer shivân inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "D\'une écaille de dragon on peut faire un formidable bouclier... pour peu que l\'on ait aussi une dent de dragon pour la découper.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533159&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eeab2e3-d969-42ab-a13c-a59a7ea9dd99\', \'multiverseId\': 533159}, \'multiverseid\': 533159}, {\'name\': \'Nibbio Infernale di Shiv\', \'text\': \'Volare\\n{1}{R}: Il Nibbio Infernale di Shiv infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'La scaglia di un drago può diventare un potente scudo, a patto che ti possa procurare un dente di drago per lavorarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6211a0-77ed-46cf-bec7-669d19f4cbda\', \'multiverseId\': 533370}, \'multiverseid\': 533370}, {\'name\': \'シヴのヘルカイト\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{R}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。シヴのヘルカイトはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンのウロコを削って巨大な盾を作ることができる。ただし、削るための道具であるドラゴンの歯が手に入ればの話だが。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533581&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57d2147e-fefe-4da3-af59-9a4b6f732654\', \'multiverseId\': 533581}, \'multiverseid\': 533581}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Avérneo de Shiv\', \'text\': \'Voar\\n{1}{R}: Dragão Avérneo de Shiv causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'A escama de dragão dá um ótimo escudo, desde que você tenha um dente de dragão para cortá-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0ae1e5-2dbe-4330-9fd3-bb2402c72b32\', \'multiverseId\': 533792}, \'multiverseid\': 533792}, {\'name\': \'Шиванский Змей\', \'text\': \'Полет\\n{1}{R}: Шиванский Змей наносит 1 повреждение любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Из чешуи дракона можно смастерить прочный щит, если, конечно, ты сможешь достать зуб дракона, чтобы ее разрезать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3670a608-f8f2-4045-83b9-5dcb8e7ba3a2\', \'multiverseId\': 534003}, \'multiverseid\': 534003}, {\'name\': \'西瓦残虐者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{1}{R}：西瓦残虐者对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'龙鳞可制成强力的盾牌，但你要先取得龙牙来切割它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c949b5a-a4fe-455e-baa2-d36f2d7264df\', \'multiverseId\': 534214}, \'multiverseid\': 534214}, {\'name\': \'西瓦殘虐者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{R}：西瓦殘虐者對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'龍鱗可製成強力的盾牌，但你要先取得龍牙來切割它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ab9f1c2-247e-4e1a-8b86-975e91e41190\', \'multiverseId\': 534425}, \'multiverseid\': 534425}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silberrüstung\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +6/+6.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, zerstöre eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl.\\nAusrüsten {6}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Erfinder von Mirrodin lebt immer noch, formt immer noch Metall und gebietet immer noch über die Welt erschütternde Kräfte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532796&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc111a2-4eab-4745-ab14-9a98ba52b9e7\', \'multiverseId\': 532796}, \'multiverseid\': 532796}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de argentum\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +6/+6.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, destruye el permanente objetivo.\\nEquipar {6}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'El creador de Mirrodin todavía vive, todavía da forma al metal, y todavía tiene un poder que puede sacudir el mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b547253-46f7-4b61-8b70-b4646b017d4b\', \'multiverseId\': 533007}, \'multiverseid\': 533007}, {\'name\': "Armure d\'Argentum", \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +6/+6.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, détruisez un permanent ciblé.\\nÉquipement {6}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Le créateur de Mirrodin vit encore. Il continue de forger le métal et de contrôler une puissance à l\'échelle du monde.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533218&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ab052c7-cfca-4a54-8a3b-14d323385f9c\', \'multiverseId\': 533218}, \'multiverseid\': 533218}, {\'name\': \'Armatura di Argentum\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +6/+6.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, distruggi un permanente bersaglio.\\nEquipaggiare {6}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': \'Il creatore di Mirrodin è ancora vivo, forgia ancora metalli e domina ancora un potere in grado di scuotere il mondo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4e84969-38ea-4d81-9c03-53f7c985ba9e\', \'multiverseId\': 533429}, \'multiverseid\': 533429}, {\'name\': \'アージェンタムの鎧\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋６/＋６の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、パーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n装備{6}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'ミラディンの造物主はまだ生きていて、金属を形作り続け、世界を揺るがす力を手にしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4eda4d3e-fc60-48d1-b742-3f4f3a299dd6\', \'multiverseId\': 533640}, \'multiverseid\': 533640}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Argento\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +6/+6.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, destrua a permanente alvo.\\nEquipar {6}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'O criador de Mirrodin ainda vive, ainda modela metal e ainda comanda um poder arrebatador.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255cdfb3-52a4-4f78-acb4-6320de67457c\', \'multiverseId\': 533851}, \'multiverseid\': 533851}, {\'name\': \'Доспехи Аргентума\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +6/+6.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, уничтожьте целевой перманент.\\nСнарядить {6}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Создатель Мирродина все еще жив, все еще кует металл и все еще обладает силой, заставляющей мир содрогаться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3097ed07-48bb-4a62-b42d-86ffbf761aec\', \'multiverseId\': 534062}, \'multiverseid\': 534062}, {\'name\': \'古银铠甲\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+6/+6。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，消灭目标永久物。\\n佩带{6}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'秘罗地的创造者依旧活着，依旧塑造金属，也依旧持有惊天动地的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee545795-46cb-47de-8596-95ace409a96d\', \'multiverseId\': 534273}, \'multiverseid\': 534273}, {\'name\': \'古銀鎧甲\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+6/+6。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，消滅目標永久物。\\n佩帶{6}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'秘羅地的創造者依舊活著，依舊塑造金屬，也依舊持有驚天動地的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e6b8ab-7eb9-43a1-82ac-27191b057b49\', \'multiverseId\': 534484}, \'multiverseid\': 534484}]', "[{'name': 'Simic-Wachstumskammer', 'text': 'Die Simic-Wachstumskammer kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn die Simic-Wachstumskammer ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532858&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e514fcd6-55f8-4bdc-b863-90351b656ce3', 'multiverseId': 532858}, 'multiverseid': 532858}, {'name': 'Cámara de crecimiento simic', 'text': 'La Cámara de crecimiento simic entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Cámara de crecimiento simic entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533069&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e05b4078-9348-4325-a2cf-640c6d07b750', 'multiverseId': 533069}, 'multiverseid': 533069}, {'name': 'Chambre de croissance des Simic', 'text': 'La Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chambre de croissance des Simic arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533280&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '19d15e20-af08-4936-b751-a0d7d51ce1bc', 'multiverseId': 533280}, 'multiverseid': 533280}, {'name': 'Camera di Coltura Simic', 'text': 'La Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\nQuando la Camera di Coltura Simic entra nel campo di battaglia, fai tornare una terra che controlli in mano al suo proprietario.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533491&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b7431fa0-73b2-4031-a2b4-a3e54379129d', 'multiverseId': 533491}, 'multiverseid': 533491}, {'name': 'シミックの成長室', 'text': 'シミックの成長室はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nシミックの成長室が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{G}{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533702&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9df92f3d-15d8-4206-8aa8-251ef6f2eaf9', 'multiverseId': 533702}, 'multiverseid': 533702}, {'name': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic', 'text': 'Câmara de Crescimento Simic entra no campo de batalha virada.\\nQuando Câmara de Crescimento Simic entrar no campo de batalha, devolva um terreno que você controla para a mão de seu dono.\\n{T}: Adicione {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533913&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01ba1205-9ed4-44c3-b87b-e5bc487cf67d', 'multiverseId': 533913}, 'multiverseid': 533913}, {'name': 'Инкубатор Симиков', 'text': 'Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\nКогда Инкубатор Симиков выходит на поле битвы, верните землю под вашим контролем в руку ее владельца.\\n{T}: добавьте {G}{U}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534124&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '399680ab-3b62-4032-863c-852f6bce5fa8', 'multiverseId': 534124}, 'multiverseid': 534124}, {'name': '析米克生长室', 'text': '析米克生长室须横置进战场。\\n当析米克生长室进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534335&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '25d729f6-3624-4ff5-b82f-b8555c863916', 'multiverseId': 534335}, 'multiverseid': 534335}, {'name': '析米克生長室', 'text': '析米克生長室須橫置進戰場。\\n當析米克生長室進戰場時，將一個由你操控的地移回其擁有者手上。\\n{T}：加{G}{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534546&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0084349d-4080-4548-8101-1c5f6bec43a9', 'multiverseId': 534546}, 'multiverseid': 534546}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532671&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1955cf9-8b3b-4556-9932-e767129b5228\', \'multiverseId\': 532671}, \'multiverseid\': 532671}, {\'name\': \'Titán solar\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Titán solar entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes regresar la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sol ardiente que nunca se pone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'199a3556-4322-49d3-aade-6f0b37fa8d7a\', \'multiverseId\': 532882}, \'multiverseid\': 532882}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533093&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b413eca-4e10-4310-829f-1293fe30587d\', \'multiverseId\': 533093}, \'multiverseid\': 533093}, {\'name\': \'Titano Solare\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nOgniqualvolta il Titano Solare entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, puoi rimettere sul campo di battaglia una carta permanente bersaglio con valore di mana pari o inferiore a 3 dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sole cocente che non tramonta mai.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c257e8c9-a0f2-4c24-9718-7f87a7ceddab\', \'multiverseId\': 533304}, \'multiverseid\': 533304}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdbfc4b4-a17c-4af2-8eea-eef0c411638f\', \'multiverseId\': 533515}, \'multiverseid\': 533515}, {\'name\': \'Titã de Sol\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nToda vez que Titã de Sol entra no campo de batalha ou ataca, você pode devolver ao campo de batalha o card de permanente alvo com valor de mana igual ou inferior a 3 de seu cemitério.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Um sol flamejante que nunca se põe.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12c25ae5-98ab-433b-92dd-2b996e4aa52d\', \'multiverseId\': 533726}, \'multiverseid\': 533726}, {\'name\': \'Титан Солнца\', \'text\': \'Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда Титан Солнца выходит на поле битвы или атакует, вы можете вернуть целевую карту перманента с мановой ценностью 3 или меньше из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Ослепительное солнце, которое никогда не заходит.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f782a3-93d5-4f6b-a431-12aec015f1c4\', \'multiverseId\': 533937}, \'multiverseid\': 533937}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当旭日泰坦进战场或攻击时，你可以将目标法术力值等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec4ab12-e1cc-4298-b15a-bffe82cdbb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 534148}, \'multiverseid\': 534148}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每當旭日泰坦進戰場或攻擊時，你可以將目標魔法力值等於或小於3的永久物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b909ae9-83ce-42fb-820e-917f93a8de1d\', \'multiverseId\': 534359}, \'multiverseid\': 534359}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenexplosions-Engel\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Sonnenexplosions-Engel ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre alle getappten Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Es könnten Mächte existieren, die noch mächtiger als Phyrexia sind.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532672&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cce31f7-d1fb-4574-b55a-77025abd59c8\', \'multiverseId\': 532672}, \'multiverseid\': 532672}, {\'name\': \'Ángel ráfaga solar\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel ráfaga solar entre al campo de batalla, destruye todas las criaturas giradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Puede que existan poderes aún más grandes que Pirexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f1f3774-7686-4006-bca4-22801c4d67f0\', \'multiverseId\': 532883}, \'multiverseid\': 532883}, {\'name\': \'Ange solaire\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez toutes les créatures engagées.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': "Il se pourrait qu\'il existe des puissances encore plus redoutables que Phyrexia.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533094&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f0a47fe-39cd-436c-9178-04b104643af0\', \'multiverseId\': 533094}, \'multiverseid\': 533094}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Esplosione Solare", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Esplosione Solare entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi tutte le creature TAPpate.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Potrebbero esistere poteri ancora più immensi di Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'917261e1-2985-41aa-be96-0df1ac0862e0\', \'multiverseId\': 533305}, \'multiverseid\': 533305}, {\'name\': \'太陽破の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n太陽破の天使が戦場に出たとき、タップ状態のすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'ファイレクシアより大きな力も存在できる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58ca014e-9f3c-418f-9598-3fdca5efdf41\', \'multiverseId\': 533516}, \'multiverseid\': 533516}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Explosão Solar\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Explosão Solar entrar no campo de batalha, destrua todas as criaturas viradas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Podem existir poderes ainda maiores que Phyrexia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e86f3594-b65c-44cd-aa33-dedc25783a9a\', \'multiverseId\': 533727}, \'multiverseid\': 533727}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Солнечного Взрыва\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Солнечного Взрыва выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте все повернутые существа.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Возможно, существует сила помощнее Фирексии.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43501f8b-0d8c-4077-9854-010fa51cb9dd\', \'multiverseId\': 533938}, \'multiverseid\': 533938}, {\'name\': \'旭击天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当旭击天使进战场时，消灭所有已横置的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'可能存在着比非瑞克西亚更强大的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2415b390-faec-4db0-9a08-b059694cc715\', \'multiverseId\': 534149}, \'multiverseid\': 534149}, {\'name\': \'旭擊天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當旭擊天使進戰場時，消滅所有已橫置的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'可能存在著比非瑞克西亞更強大的力量。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66d0aef-66ae-42fe-b30e-187de6dcd56f\', \'multiverseId\': 534360}, \'multiverseid\': 534360}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnengras-Prärie\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die uralte Magie der Sonnenelfen sorgt in diesen Ländern für einen ewigen Sommer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'849045ba-1d38-465d-b378-2b60f28805b9\', \'multiverseId\': 532862}, \'multiverseid\': 532862}, {\'name\': \'Pradera Hierbasol\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La magia antigua de los elfos solares provoca que en estas tierras perdure un verano eterno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'895ade94-bf5b-4274-9851-f591ae691c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 533073}, \'multiverseid\': 533073}, {\'name\': \'Prairie de Solherbe\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'La magie ancestrale des elfes du soleil maintient ces terres dans un été permanent.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533284&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3b7caa8-6f65-4941-abab-caae442f4866\', \'multiverseId\': 533284}, \'multiverseid\': 533284}, {\'name\': \'Prateria di Solerba\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'antica magia degli elfi del sole fa sì che queste terre vivano un\'estate perenne.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f0a134-918b-4ee6-9e20-1f461d6efcf9\', \'multiverseId\': 533495}, \'multiverseid\': 533495}, {\'name\': \'サングラスの大草原\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{G}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'古代のサン・エルフの魔法がこの土地に永遠の夏をもたらしている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a41e62c-7dad-49ce-9dbd-78b3c1338cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 533706}, \'multiverseid\': 533706}, {\'name\': \'Pradaria de Capim Solar\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Adicione {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'A magia ancestral dos elfos solares mantém essas terras num eterno verão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6c48064-404a-4bf0-9e50-130539452640\', \'multiverseId\': 533917}, \'multiverseid\': 533917}, {\'name\': \'Прерия Солнечной Травы\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: добавьте {G}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Древняя магия солнечных эльфов сохраняет вечное лето в этих землях.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fde36ae5-3031-4733-af23-f99ac1cf04c5\', \'multiverseId\': 534128}, \'multiverseid\': 534128}, {\'name\': \'曦草沃原\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{G}{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'日精灵的远古魔法庇佑此地永享盛夏蓬勃生机。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'924e3520-74f0-48cc-a061-bbe88ea54d06\', \'multiverseId\': 534339}, \'multiverseid\': 534339}, {\'name\': \'曦草沃原\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{G}{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'日精靈的遠古魔法庇佑此地永享盛夏蓬勃生機。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34d13b98-5f7f-4f9f-bd4a-125f0a11b9ce\', \'multiverseId\': 534550}, \'multiverseid\': 534550}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenring\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kunst, das Licht eines fernen Sterns in einem Ring aus reinem Gold einzufangen, ist mit der Zeit verlorengegangen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9bfaaf7-34d6-4414-9eb2-bbd2409d5ee4\', \'multiverseId\': 532813}, \'multiverseid\': 532813}, {\'name\': \'Anillo solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Se ha perdido en el tiempo el arte del artífice de atrapar la luz de una estrella distante en un anillo del oro más puro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d30c9507-71dd-402a-b8c3-da532d180591\', \'multiverseId\': 533024}, \'multiverseid\': 533024}, {\'name\': \'Anneau solaire\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "L\'art de l\'artificier de piéger la lumière d\'un astre lointain dans un anneau d\'or le plus pur est désormais perdu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533235&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824aed15-e9b7-4faf-ab9e-243339eb04f8\', \'multiverseId\': 533235}, \'multiverseid\': 533235}, {\'name\': \'Anello Solare\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "Persa col tempo è l\'arte dell\'artefice di intrappolare la luce di una stella lontana in un anello di oro purissimo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d0fdb7c-7609-46c5-9581-358e117b92ba\', \'multiverseId\': 533446}, \'multiverseid\': 533446}, {\'name\': \'太陽の指輪\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'遥かな星の光を最も純なる黄金の指輪に捕らえる工匠の技は、時の中で失われた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0f0312c-fa31-4afe-850d-e5c4474f4b39\', \'multiverseId\': 533657}, \'multiverseid\': 533657}, {\'name\': \'Anel Solar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Perdeu-se no tempo a antiga arte dos artífices de capturar a luz de uma estrela distante em um anel do mais puro ouro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'587c64c5-26f4-4893-a79c-8edb850a52df\', \'multiverseId\': 533868}, \'multiverseid\': 533868}, {\'name\': \'Солнечное Кольцо\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}{C}.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Давно забытое искусство механиков позволяло заключить свет далекой звезды в кольцо из чистейшего золота.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24e2f0cb-d15c-4831-bc43-b6abafafd765\', \'multiverseId\': 534079}, \'multiverseid\': 534079}, {\'name\': \'阳光戒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'神器师曾能利用至纯黄金打造的戒指捕获来自遥远星辰的光芒，这门技艺如今早已亡佚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c66793f-9665-4dbd-8e76-7ee027c6784a\', \'multiverseId\': 534290}, \'multiverseid\': 534290}, {\'name\': \'陽光戒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'神器師曾能利用至純黃金打造的戒指捕獲來自遙遠星辰的光芒，這門技藝如今早已亡佚。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d168ad-35b8-465c-8ff8-e9db2a563bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 534501}, \'multiverseid\': 534501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Speer aus Mondsilber\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Erstschlag.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift, erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nAusrüsten {4}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7d759c2-ad2d-406c-9ca1-fbd70d8d7304\', \'multiverseId\': 532810}, \'multiverseid\': 532810}, {\'name\': \'Lanza de platalunar\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de dañar primero.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada ataque, crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nEquipar {4}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533021&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8f67dd2-6962-460e-8948-25b45bead9be\', \'multiverseId\': 533021}, \'multiverseid\': 533021}, {\'name\': "Lance d\'argent de lune", \'text\': "La créature équipée a l\'initiative.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol.\\nÉquipement {4}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfe5b5b-29f4-44f1-9145-97451be22b2e\', \'multiverseId\': 533232}, \'multiverseid\': 533232}, {\'name\': \'Lancia di Selenargento\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha attacco improvviso.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca, crea una pedina creatura Angelo 4/4 bianca con volare.\\nEquipaggiare {4}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6875ca0-b6c1-4cae-82b2-9511f30eb1aa\', \'multiverseId\': 533443}, \'multiverseid\': 533443}, {\'name\': \'月銀の槍\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n装備{4}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0adeee76-6ca2-42fb-9598-716c0fbfd95e\', \'multiverseId\': 533654}, \'multiverseid\': 533654}, {\'name\': \'Lança de Prata Lunar\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem iniciativa.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada atacar, crie uma ficha de criatura Anjo branca 4/4 com voar.\\nEquipar {4}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3afea44-383c-4d5d-b6cf-b296425a20db\', \'multiverseId\': 533865}, \'multiverseid\': 533865}, {\'name\': \'Копье Лунного Серебра\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет Первый удар.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует, создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белый Ангел с Полетом.\\nСнарядить {4}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'890270c4-83e5-4149-b90d-f85e17664cb5\', \'multiverseId\': 534076}, \'multiverseid\': 534076}, {\'name\': \'月银长矛\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有先攻异能。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物攻击时，派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。\\n佩带{4}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6f58a0e-51ca-4a52-b345-19fdda86fc87\', \'multiverseId\': 534287}, \'multiverseid\': 534287}, {\'name\': \'月銀長矛\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有先攻異能。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊時，派出一個4/4白色，具飛行異能的天使衍生生物。\\n佩帶{4}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534498&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c879a6d-58b5-40ef-8bba-58153cefc67d\', \'multiverseId\': 534498}, \'multiverseid\': 534498}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sphäre des Kommandeurs\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Kommandeurs.\\nOpfere die Sphäre des Kommandeurs: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Himmel verheißt Wohl … für mich. Und Wehe für dich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'356f452f-7549-4d79-ac5a-95e02399244c\', \'multiverseId\': 532801}, \'multiverseid\': 532801}, {\'name\': \'Esfera del comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\\nSacrificar la Esfera del comandante: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Los cielos me auguran prosperidad. A ti... miseria".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38c84563-64a1-400c-b6d8-811d5fa51bae\', \'multiverseId\': 533012}, \'multiverseid\': 533012}, {\'name\': \'Sphère du commandant\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.\\nSacrifiez la Sphère du commandant : Piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les cieux augurent prospérité... pour moi. Malheur pour toi. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ef7257-50ea-4ba3-b7ac-ae0657c654c9\', \'multiverseId\': 533223}, \'multiverseid\': 533223}, {\'name\': \'Sfera del Comandante\', \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore nell\'identità di colore del tuo comandante.\\nSacrifica la Sfera del Comandante: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"I cieli prevedono prosperità... per me. Per te, invece, dolore."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21c8ca58-ebb6-4294-97e2-1fc80dffae37\', \'multiverseId\': 533434}, \'multiverseid\': 533434}, {\'name\': \'統率者の宝球\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色のうち好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n統率者の宝球を生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「天が吉兆を示しておる……わしの上にじゃ。お前さんには凶兆じゃな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'defd3c4c-e637-46a3-91da-bb80ea6c69f4\', \'multiverseId\': 533645}, \'multiverseid\': 533645}, {\'name\': \'Esfera do Comandante\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor da identidade de cor de seu comandante.\\nSacrifique Esfera do Comandante: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"Os augúrios dos céus anunciam prosperidade... para mim. E infortúnio para você."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82df7ebd-45ab-47f9-8bc1-683294a0215c\', \'multiverseId\': 533856}, \'multiverseid\': 533856}, {\'name\': \'Сфера Командира\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета из цветовой принадлежности вашего командира.\\nПожертвуйте Сферу Командира: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Небеса, что сулят авгуры... они для меня. Для тебя — лишь горе».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eaf5c51-a795-4449-8086-08bca6967d1f\', \'multiverseId\': 534067}, \'multiverseid\': 534067}, {\'name\': \'指挥官法球\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\\n牺牲指挥官法球：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「卜筮结果是吉…不过是对我而言。于你则是凶。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d1891fc-3cd1-4d15-ab75-5caa9c7b083f\', \'multiverseId\': 534278}, \'multiverseid\': 534278}, {\'name\': \'指揮官法球\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點魔法力，其顏色為你指揮官標識色中的任一顏色。\\n犧牲指揮官法球：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「卜筮結果是吉…不過是對我而言。於你則是凶。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb8e080c-67f5-4dba-bee3-561ade40c411\', \'multiverseId\': 534489}, \'multiverseid\': 534489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sram, leitender Konstrukteur\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Aura-, Ausrüstung- oder Fahrzeug-Zauberspruch wirkst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Zwerg, Berater\', \'flavor\': \'„Je mehr dieser Konflikt eskaliert, desto schwieriger wird es, die Stadt vor dem Zusammenbruch zu bewahren. Wie lange können wir diese Maschinerie wohl noch in der Balance halten?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'107a3cc7-d60b-43f2-b764-dfa60497890a\', \'multiverseId\': 532670}, \'multiverseid\': 532670}, {\'name\': \'Sram, edificador experto\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de Aura, Equipo o Vehículo, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Enano consejero\', \'flavor\': \'"A medida que el conflicto se recrudece, cuesta más impedir que la ciudad entera se desmorone. ¿Cuánto tiempo podremos mantener la maquinaria en funcionamiento?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d692f46d-c8ac-4bf1-94d7-1c567ca3477e\', \'multiverseId\': 532881}, \'multiverseid\': 532881}, {\'name\': \'Sram, chef édificateur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'aura, d\'équipement ou de véhicule, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : nain et conseiller\', \'flavor\': "« Le conflit prend de l\'ampleur et il devient de plus en plus difficile d\'empêcher la ville de se diviser. Combien de temps encore pourrons-nous préserver l\'équilibre de ce mécanisme ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533092&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfaa5c26-356d-4e59-b053-ba1276771979\', \'multiverseId\': 533092}, \'multiverseid\': 533092}, {\'name\': \'Sram, Edificatore Capo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia Aura, Equipaggiamento o Veicolo, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Consigliere Nano\', \'flavor\': \'"Con il crescere del conflitto, è sempre più difficile impedire che la città cada in pezzi. Per quanto ancora riusciremo a mantenere in equilibrio questo meccanismo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13e01800-c45f-43e3-98bb-17ec0bfcfa8f\', \'multiverseId\': 533303}, \'multiverseid\': 533303}, {\'name\': \'上級建設官、スラム\', \'text\': \'あなたがオーラや装備品や機体である呪文を唱えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドワーフ・アドバイザー\', \'flavor\': \'「対立が深まり市の崩壊を防ぐのは難しくなるばかりだ。機構のバランスを、あとどれほど維持できるだろうか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f8e81f6-b60b-40ef-9be9-d8470c3e8160\', \'multiverseId\': 533514}, \'multiverseid\': 533514}, {\'name\': \'Sram, Edificador Sênior\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de Aura, Equipamento ou Veículo, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Anão Conselheiro\', \'flavor\': \'"À medida que este conflito cresce, fica mais difícil evitar que a cidade entre em colapso. Por quanto tempo mais conseguiremos manter este mecanismo em equilíbrio?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3017fe8d-2707-4fe0-a1b9-66bda4de583a\', \'multiverseId\': 533725}, \'multiverseid\': 533725}, {\'name\': \'Эсрам, Старший Градостроитель\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание Ауры, Снаряжения или Машины, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гном Советник\', \'flavor\': \'«Конфликт разрастается, и поддерживать город в рабочем состоянии становится все сложнее и сложнее. Сколько мы еще продержимся, прежде чем машины выйдут из строя?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9040320d-1928-4b79-afd1-83b479abe7c6\', \'multiverseId\': 533936}, \'multiverseid\': 533936}, {\'name\': \'资深建筑师斯勒姆\', \'text\': \'每当你施放灵气，武具或载具咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～矮人／参谋\', \'flavor\': \'「随着冲突愈演愈烈，眼下越来越难维持城市完整不至毁坏。这样的机械平衡还能维持多久？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05307ab7-c59d-4002-902f-fe7c82fbaeb4\', \'multiverseId\': 534147}, \'multiverseid\': 534147}, {\'name\': \'資深建築師斯勒姆\', \'text\': \'每當你施放靈氣，武具或載具咒語時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～矮人／參謀\', \'flavor\': \'「隨著衝突愈演愈烈，眼下越來越難維持城市完整不至毀壞。這樣的機械平衡還能維持多久？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534358&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f5133e-951d-40c9-8ea0-c7d6afde6657\', \'multiverseId\': 534358}, \'multiverseid\': 534358}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stierköpfiger Malmer\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch wirkt, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf den Stierköpfigen Malmer legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kraft eines Wasserfalls. Der Zorn einer Lawine. Der Verstand einer steifen Brise.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532741&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'855ace51-0d1c-4c48-80fb-8ed7607bdd21\', \'multiverseId\': 532741}, \'multiverseid\': 532741}, {\'name\': \'Lacerador taurino\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Lacerador taurino.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'El poder de una cascada. La furia de una avalancha. El intelecto de un vendaval.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da4972ee-8f8b-41c9-b493-4e662acfc7e0\', \'multiverseId\': 532952}, \'multiverseid\': 532952}, {\'name\': \'Meurtrisseur du taureau\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Meurtrisseur du taureau.", \'type\': \'Créature : changeforme\', \'flavor\': "La puissance d\'une cascade. La fureur d\'une avalanche. L\'intelligence d\'un vent de tempête.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533163&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88819dbc-dd9f-4fc9-9831-2d5eac3cc417\', \'multiverseId\': 533163}, \'multiverseid\': 533163}, {\'name\': \'Mazzuolatore Taurino\', \'text\': \'Cangiante (Questa carta ha tutti i tipi di creatura.)\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario lancia una magia, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Mazzuolatore Taurino.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Polimorfo\', \'flavor\': "La potenza di una cascata. La furia di una valanga. L\'astuzia di un uragano.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb232353-b296-4bb6-b82e-687b4c0207f4\', \'multiverseId\': 533374}, \'multiverseid\': 533374}, {\'name\': \'雄牛のやっかいもの\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n対戦相手が呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは雄牛のやっかいものの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'滝の力強さ。雪崩の怒り。強風の知性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'837dae15-f4b2-4010-bca1-cfca9e9097c0\', \'multiverseId\': 533585}, \'multiverseid\': 533585}, {\'name\': \'Esmagador Taurino\', \'text\': \'Morfoloide (Este card é de todos os tipos de criatura.)\\nToda vez que um oponente conjura uma mágica, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Esmagador Taurino.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'A força de uma cachoeira. A fúria de uma avalanche. O intelecto de uma borrasca.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1165727-b732-4655-b349-df0f832c1759\', \'multiverseId\': 533796}, \'multiverseid\': 533796}, {\'name\': \'Бык-Мучитель\', \'text\': \'Перевертыш (Эта карта обладает всеми типами существа.)\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент разыгрывает заклинание, вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Быка-Мучителя.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Имитатор\', \'flavor\': \'Мощь водопада. Ярость лавины. Интеллект урагана.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbe0787a-b592-4183-9965-7d3c577493dd\', \'multiverseId\': 534007}, \'multiverseid\': 534007}, {\'name\': \'牛身虐杀兽\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n每当任一对手施放咒语时，你可以在牛身虐杀兽上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'强如瀑布，怒如山崩，慧如狂风。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fca4746a-037a-415a-beb4-a057a5a6dadc\', \'multiverseId\': 534218}, \'multiverseid\': 534218}, {\'name\': \'牛身虐殺獸\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物類別。）\\n每當任一對手施放咒語時，你可以在牛身虐殺獸上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～變形獸\', \'flavor\': \'強如瀑布，怒如山崩，慧如狂風。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d251ba41-9893-40cb-9d3f-62ebfca3f98d\', \'multiverseId\': 534429}, \'multiverseid\': 534429}]', '[{\'name\': \'Storvald, Frostriesen-Jarl\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {3}\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {3}.\\nImmer wenn Storvald ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 7/7 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc5dd731-f3bd-457e-8cc3-3314e65a20e3\', \'multiverseId\': 531603}, \'multiverseid\': 531603}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, jarl gigante de escarcha\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {3}.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {3}.\\nSiempre que Storvald entre al campo de batalla o ataque, elige uno o ambos:\\n• La criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 7/7 hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1db165d-1d57-413a-841f-5a134d3cbe81\', \'multiverseId\': 531659}, \'multiverseid\': 531659}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, jarl géant du givre\', \'text\': "Parade {3}\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont parade {3}.\\nÀ chaque fois que Storvald arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 7/7 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 1/1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531715&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c14b44d5-fb25-44d2-8f09-c762d94886d2\', \'multiverseId\': 531715}, \'multiverseid\': 531715}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, Jarl dei Giganti del Gelo\', \'text\': \'Egida {3}\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno egida {3}.\\nOgniqualvolta Storvald entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 7/7 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 1/1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'551d7fbe-b6dd-4787-933f-4471697cc973\', \'multiverseId\': 531771}, \'multiverseid\': 531771}, {\'name\': \'フロスト・ジャイアントの伯爵、ストルヴァルド\', \'text\': \'護法{3}\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは護法{3}を持つ。\\nフロスト・ジャイアントの伯爵、ストルヴァルドが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは７/７になる。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは１/１になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38bc0352-65bd-492b-999f-50a92371139e\', \'multiverseId\': 531827}, \'multiverseid\': 531827}]', '[{\'name\': \'Storvald, Frostriesen-Jarl\', \'text\': \'Abwehr {3}\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Abwehr {3}.\\nImmer wenn Storvald ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, bestimme eines oder beides —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 7/7 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl hat Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cefee90e-4c69-42b8-9a1f-e1fc6d9801d7\', \'multiverseId\': 531877}, \'multiverseid\': 531877}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, jarl gigante de escarcha\', \'text\': \'Rebatir {3}.\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de rebatir {3}.\\nSiempre que Storvald entre al campo de batalla o ataque, elige uno o ambos:\\n• La criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 7/7 hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbdc8e74-3e4e-4c0c-b59b-b9c2b0dfd2f6\', \'multiverseId\': 531881}, \'multiverseid\': 531881}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, jarl géant du givre\', \'text\': "Parade {3}\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont parade {3}.\\nÀ chaque fois que Storvald arrive sur le champ de bataille ou attaque, choisissez l\'un ou les deux —\\n• Une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 7/7 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 1/1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531885&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba7178f-6f73-48ec-af26-13142374de49\', \'multiverseId\': 531885}, \'multiverseid\': 531885}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, Jarl dei Giganti del Gelo\', \'text\': \'Egida {3}\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno egida {3}.\\nOgniqualvolta Storvald entra nel campo di battaglia o attacca, scegli uno o entrambi —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 7/7 fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha forza e costituzione base 1/1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22f97fa7-0107-4bd3-a7cc-b7ed3bf4c43c\', \'multiverseId\': 531889}, \'multiverseid\': 531889}, {\'name\': \'フロスト・ジャイアントの伯爵、ストルヴァルド\', \'text\': \'護法{3}\\nあなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは護法{3}を持つ。\\nフロスト・ジャイアントの伯爵、ストルヴァルドが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、以下から１つまたは両方を選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは７/７になる。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは１/１になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4f2f006-d666-40ad-9047-157a8a7e058a\', \'multiverseId\': 531893}, \'multiverseid\': 531893}, {\'name\': \'Storvald, Jarl dos Gigantes do Gelo\', \'text\': \'Salvaguarda {3}\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm salvaguarda {3}.\\nToda vez que Storvald entrar no campo de batalha ou atacar, escolha um ou ambos —\\n• A criatura alvo tem poder e resistência básicos 7/7 até o final do turno.\\n• A criatura alvo tem poder e resistência básicos 1/1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95e39b82-456d-41e2-8e21-7702091ae4db\', \'multiverseId\': 531897}, \'multiverseid\': 531897}, {\'name\': \'Сторвальд, Ярл Ледяных Великанов\', \'text\': \'Оберег {3}\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем имеют Оберег {3}.\\nКаждый раз, когда Сторвальд выходит на поле битвы или атакует, выберите одно или оба —\\n• Целевое существо имеет базовую силу и выносливость 7/7 до конца хода.\\n• Целевое существо имеет базовую силу и выносливость 1/1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Гигант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d53052d8-2f52-4bf8-a9d1-1615e4654538\', \'multiverseId\': 531901}, \'multiverseid\': 531901}, {\'name\': \'霜巨人头目斯托瓦\', \'text\': \'守护{3}\\n由你操控的其他生物具有守护{3}。\\n每当斯托瓦进战场或攻击时，选择一项或都选～\\n•目标生物的基础力量与防御力为7/7直到回合结束。\\n•目标生物的基础力量与防御力为1/1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcb121d3-73ac-49b8-9d64-4e3f2e04daab\', \'multiverseId\': 531905}, \'multiverseid\': 531905}, {\'name\': \'霜巨人頭目斯托瓦\', \'text\': \'守護{3}\\n由你操控的其他生物具有守護{3}。\\n每當斯托瓦進戰場或攻擊時，選擇一項或都選～\\n•目標生物的基礎力量與防禦力為7/7直到回合結束。\\n•目標生物的基礎力量與防禦力為1/1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3f1f83f-f8d8-4427-9e72-25611c851be6\', \'multiverseId\': 531909}, \'multiverseid\': 531909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Strahlender Solar\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn der Strahlende Solar oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wage dich ins Gewölbe. (Betritt den ersten Raum oder rücke in den nächsten Raum vor.)\\n{W}, wirf den Strahlenden Solar ab: Wage dich ins Gewölbe. Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b2c98a2-bec9-49f5-970d-39f6004ef876\', \'multiverseId\': 531968}, \'multiverseid\': 531968}, {\'name\': \'Solar radiante\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que el Solar radiante u otra criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, adéntrate en la mazmorra. (Entra en la primera sala o avanza a la siguiente.)\\n{W}, descartar el Solar radiante: Adéntrate en la mazmorra y ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd3042a-e9ef-483b-baf6-73d65dcd855b\', \'multiverseId\': 532022}, \'multiverseid\': 532022}, {\'name\': \'Solar radieux\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que le Solar radieux ou une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, aventurez-vous dans le donjon. (Entrez dans la première pièce ou avancez jusqu\'à la pièce suivante.)\\n{W}, défaussez-vous du Solar radieux : Aventurez-vous dans le donjon et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532076&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e4aa26a-3a05-4127-85b3-a3560170a055\', \'multiverseId\': 532076}, \'multiverseid\': 532076}, {\'name\': \'Solar Radioso\', \'text\': "Volare, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta il Solar Radioso o un\'altra creatura non pedina entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esplora il dungeon. (Entra nella prima stanza o avanza a quella successiva.)\\n{W}, Scarta il Solar Radioso: Esplora il dungeon e guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83398fe3-edb7-49ef-8cbc-b7b1c66bfca6\', \'multiverseId\': 532130}, \'multiverseid\': 532130}, {\'name\': \'光輝のソーラー\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n光輝のソーラーか、トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ダンジョン探索をする。（ダンジョン探索をするとは、最初の部屋へ入るか、次の部屋へ進むことである。）\\n{W}, 光輝のソーラーを捨てる：ダンジョン探索をして、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea15dcf4-9f33-4e91-a97f-7af2950950a0\', \'multiverseId\': 532184}, \'multiverseid\': 532184}, {\'name\': \'Solar Radiante\', \'text\': \'Voar, vínculo com a vida\\nToda vez que Solar Radiante ou outra criatura não ficha entrar no campo de batalha sob seu controle, aventure-se na masmorra. (Entre na primeira sala ou prossiga para a próxima.)\\n{W}, descarte Solar Radiante: Aventure-se na masmorra. Você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9da15df-d2e6-423b-9dc3-d79a7e2e55d6\', \'multiverseId\': 532238}, \'multiverseid\': 532238}, {\'name\': \'Лучистый Солар\', \'text\': \'Полет, Цепь жизни\\nКаждый раз, когда Лучистый Солар или другое не являющееся фишкой существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, углубитесь в подземелье. (Войдите в первую комнату или перейдите в следующую комнату.)\\n{W}, сбросьте Лучистого Солара: углубитесь в подземелье, и вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8af2458-ce9c-44e2-8e13-1396a3c91531\', \'multiverseId\': 532292}, \'multiverseid\': 532292}, {\'name\': \'辉光炽天神侍\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n每当辉光炽天神侍或另一个非衍生物的生物在你的操控下进战场时，深入地城。（进入第一个房间，或前进至下一个房间。）\\n{W}，弃掉辉光炽天神侍：深入地城，且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d6adc49-87d4-46a3-b366-cca32965418f\', \'multiverseId\': 532346}, \'multiverseid\': 532346}, {\'name\': \'輝光熾天神侍\', \'text\': \'飛行，繫命\\n每當輝光熾天神侍或另一個非衍生物的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，深入地城。（進入第一個房間，或前進至下一個房間。）\\n{W}，棄掉輝光熾天神侍：深入地城，且你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c84caa0d-3d7e-4e8a-8003-37081ce8a646\', \'multiverseId\': 532400}, \'multiverseid\': 532400}]', '[{\'name\': \'Strahlender Solar\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn der Strahlende Solar oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\n{W}, wirf den Strahlenden Solar ab: Wage dich ins Gewölbe. Du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323eb088-30cc-411f-aefa-479a0b8cabf9\', \'multiverseId\': 531554}, \'multiverseid\': 531554}, {\'name\': \'Solar radiante\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que el Solar radiante u otra criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\n{W}, descartar el Solar radiante: Adéntrate en la mazmorra y ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'689c7936-7b82-44c4-9e12-146dc2e95095\', \'multiverseId\': 531610}, \'multiverseid\': 531610}, {\'name\': \'Solar radieux\', \'text\': \'Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois que le Solar radieux ou une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\n{W}, défaussez-vous du Solar radieux : Aventurez-vous dans le donjon et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531666&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e3de745-f51c-45ea-ac4c-30191770b265\', \'multiverseId\': 531666}, \'multiverseid\': 531666}, {\'name\': \'Solar Radioso\', \'text\': "Volare, legame vitale\\nOgniqualvolta il Solar Radioso o un\'altra creatura non pedina entrano nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, esplora il dungeon.\\n{W}, Scarta il Solar Radioso: Esplora il dungeon e guadagni 3 punti vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531722&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eecea734-bc0b-4101-bd0e-65177ece60f5\', \'multiverseId\': 531722}, \'multiverseid\': 531722}, {\'name\': \'光輝のソーラー\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n光輝のソーラーか、トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、ダンジョン探索をする。\\n{W}, 光輝のソーラーを捨てる：ダンジョン探索をして、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f859bb8-b34b-4343-bfed-00979be0e8e8\', \'multiverseId\': 531778}, \'multiverseid\': 531778}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talisman der Genusssucht\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}. Der Talisman der Genusssucht fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532817&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'407a2b94-71fa-4746-9353-08f2201cc2da\', \'multiverseId\': 532817}, \'multiverseid\': 532817}, {\'name\': \'Talismán de la indulgencia\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}. El Talismán de la indulgencia te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'907f364a-6d8f-458a-9bf1-dc7d197120ae\', \'multiverseId\': 533028}, \'multiverseid\': 533028}, {\'name\': "Talisman d\'indulgence", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}. Le Talisman d\'indulgence vous inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533239&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38148ee-a814-407d-9c74-418b0f2b34ed\', \'multiverseId\': 533239}, \'multiverseid\': 533239}, {\'name\': "Talismano dell\'Indulgenza", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}. Il Talismano dell\'Indulgenza ti infligge 1 danno.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3e79753-c93a-4913-a83a-af9756d0e7f9\', \'multiverseId\': 533450}, \'multiverseid\': 533450}, {\'name\': \'耽溺のタリスマン\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。耽溺のタリスマンはあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdfbed51-df5e-49f0-9875-a28cd5fd7ead\', \'multiverseId\': 533661}, \'multiverseid\': 533661}, {\'name\': \'Talismã da Indulgência\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}. Talismã da Indulgência causa 1 ponto de dano a você.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee2fbdc8-029d-4ae6-b985-853c3d09e143\', \'multiverseId\': 533872}, \'multiverseid\': 533872}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Потворства\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R}. Амулет Потворства наносит вам 1 повреждение.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4666b204-8353-46f8-9dc9-2b06920be1a5\', \'multiverseId\': 534083}, \'multiverseid\': 534083}, {\'name\': \'不羁饰符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。不羁饰符对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3390b937-9e32-42fc-a85f-c878f855a576\', \'multiverseId\': 534294}, \'multiverseid\': 534294}, {\'name\': \'不羈飾符\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。\\n不羈飾符對你造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd78238d-9b0f-4fb4-b984-d1e83105984e\', \'multiverseId\': 534505}, \'multiverseid\': 534505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tanz der Toten\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler opfert eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur. Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Widerstandskraft der Kreatur, die du auf diese Weise geopfert hast.\\n1—14 | Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurde, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\\n15+ | Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurden, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531567&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebfe1baa-e90d-43e6-8561-ff087865b252\', \'multiverseId\': 531567}, \'multiverseid\': 531567}, {\'name\': \'Danza macabra\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador sacrifica una criatura que no sea ficha. Tira 1d20 y suma la resistencia de la criatura que sacrificaste de esta manera.\\n1—14 | Regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura puesta en un cementerio de esta manera.\\n15+ | Regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control hasta dos cartas de criatura puestas en cementerios de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1337872b-78b6-499b-8730-16b6b4279dec\', \'multiverseId\': 531623}, \'multiverseid\': 531623}, {\'name\': \'Sort de danse macabre\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur sacrifie une créature non-jeton. Lancez un d20 et ajoutez au résultat l\'endurance de la créature que vous avez sacrifiée de cette manière.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature mise dans un cimetière de cette manière.\\n15+ | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature mises dans des cimetières de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531679&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'752f7d6a-6542-461a-bbb3-765c8e597782\', \'multiverseId\': 531679}, \'multiverseid\': 531679}, {\'name\': \'Danza Macabra\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura non pedina. Tira un d20 e aggiungi la costituzione della creatura che hai sacrificato in questo modo.\\n1—14 | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura messa in un cimitero in questo modo.\\n15+ | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo fino a due carte creatura messe nei cimiteri in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26370834-2aed-4b33-abcf-4eaa35fcdb65\', \'multiverseId\': 531735}, \'multiverseid\': 531735}, {\'name\': \'ダンス・マカブル\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれトークンでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。d20を１回振り、これによりあなたが生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのタフネスを加える。\\n1—14 | これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n15+ | これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード最大２枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1eb84e2-1d2f-4af5-a84c-0d7cc111480e\', \'multiverseId\': 531791}, \'multiverseid\': 531791}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tanz der Toten\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler opfert eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur. Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Widerstandskraft der Kreatur, die du auf diese Weise geopfert hast.\\n1—14 | Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurde, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\\n15+ | Bringe bis zu zwei Kreaturenkarten, die auf diese Weise auf einen Friedhof gelegt wurden, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4714567-7409-47c5-aae7-20b81407c64d\', \'multiverseId\': 531981}, \'multiverseid\': 531981}, {\'name\': \'Danza macabra\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador sacrifica una criatura que no sea ficha. Tira 1d20 y suma la resistencia de la criatura que sacrificaste de esta manera.\\n1—14 | Regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control una carta de criatura puesta en un cementerio de esta manera.\\n15+ | Regresa al campo de batalla bajo tu control hasta dos cartas de criatura puestas en cementerios de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da693cb-2cda-4ead-aea7-336b88722743\', \'multiverseId\': 532035}, \'multiverseid\': 532035}, {\'name\': \'Sort de danse macabre\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur sacrifie une créature non-jeton. Lancez un d20 et ajoutez au résultat l\'endurance de la créature que vous avez sacrifiée de cette manière.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, une carte de créature mise dans un cimetière de cette manière.\\n15+ | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, sous votre contrôle, jusqu\'à deux cartes de créature mises dans des cimetières de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532089&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47e3f21-f914-40a9-86a9-419c17fb0a16\', \'multiverseId\': 532089}, \'multiverseid\': 532089}, {\'name\': \'Danza Macabra\', \'text\': \'Ogni giocatore sacrifica una creatura non pedina. Tira un d20 e aggiungi la costituzione della creatura che hai sacrificato in questo modo.\\n1—14 | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo una carta creatura messa in un cimitero in questo modo.\\n15+ | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo fino a due carte creatura messe nei cimiteri in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a97d435-75cf-4161-8711-77ab9a65faf5\', \'multiverseId\': 532143}, \'multiverseid\': 532143}, {\'name\': \'ダンス・マカブル\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれトークンでないクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。１個のd20を振り、その出目とこれによりあなたが生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのタフネスを足す。\\n1—14 | これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\\n15+ | これにより墓地に置かれたクリーチャー・カード最大２枚をあなたのコントロール下で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8674c5d4-090b-4043-b357-fd240bcd3289\', \'multiverseId\': 532197}, \'multiverseid\': 532197}, {\'name\': \'Dança Macabra\', \'text\': \'Cada jogador sacrifica uma criatura não ficha. Role um d20 e some ao resultado a resistência da criatura que você sacrificou dessa forma.\\n1—14 | Devolva um card de criatura colocado em um cemitério desta forma ao campo de batalha sob seu controle.\\n15+ | Devolva ao campo de batalha sob seu controle até dois cards de criatura colocados em cemitérios dessa forma.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f70c4d21-2d56-4ac6-b1a4-9b96022ec1a2\', \'multiverseId\': 532251}, \'multiverseid\': 532251}, {\'name\': \'Пляска Смерти\', \'text\': \'Каждый игрок жертвует не являющееся фишкой существо. Бросьте d20 и прибавьте выносливость существа, которое вы пожертвовали таким образом.\\n1—14 | Верните карту существа, положенную на кладбище таким образом, на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\\n15+ | Верните не более двух карт существ, положенных на кладбища таким образом, на поле битвы под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f22516aa-f555-4894-9c7d-a2adca1335aa\', \'multiverseId\': 532305}, \'multiverseid\': 532305}, {\'name\': \'骷髅之舞\', \'text\': \'每位牌手各牺牲一个非衍生物的生物。掷一颗d20，然后将点数加上你以此法牺牲之生物的防御力。\\n1～14 | 将一张以此法进入坟墓场的生物牌在你的操控下移回战场。\\n15+ | 将至多两张以此法进入坟墓场的生物牌在你的操控下移回战场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04d1bf9c-ab8d-4624-8f59-32a4b0fa467f\', \'multiverseId\': 532359}, \'multiverseid\': 532359}, {\'name\': \'骷髏之舞\', \'text\': \'每位玩家各犧牲一個非衍生物的生物。擲一顆d20，然後將點數加上你以此法犧牲之生物的防禦力。\\n1～14 | 將一張以此法進入墳墓場的生物牌在你的操控下移回戰場。\\n15+ | 將至多兩張以此法進入墳墓場的生物牌在你的操控下移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'831a20ed-15d1-44fc-89d7-953c7b093515\', \'multiverseId\': 532413}, \'multiverseid\': 532413}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tapfere Haltung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Widerstandskraft 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jede Entscheidung beeinflusst den Pfad des Schicksals."\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532674&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37d24f47-c540-495e-b910-5b1b846ed9c0\', \'multiverseId\': 532674}, \'multiverseid\': 532674}, {\'name\': \'Postura valerosa\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo con resistencia de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada elección altera la senda del destino".\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532885&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ead2fe6-4c7d-406c-80e6-f338b519ba9f\', \'multiverseId\': 532885}, \'multiverseid\': 532885}, {\'name\': \'Posture valeureuse\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Détruisez une créature ciblée d\'endurance supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque décision modifie le cours du destin. »\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533096&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f851c716-cf80-4a16-a66b-460eff26a09f\', \'multiverseId\': 533096}, \'multiverseid\': 533096}, {\'name\': \'Posizione Valorosa\', \'text\': \'Scegli uno —\\n• Una creatura bersaglio ha indistruttibile fino alla fine del turno.\\n• Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con costituzione pari o superiore a 4.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ogni scelta modifica il corso del fato."\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8855d0e-c8a3-4d20-86e3-4d698474f0f7\', \'multiverseId\': 533307}, \'multiverseid\': 533307}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な姿勢\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。\\n• タフネスが４以上のクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての選択は、運命の道筋を変える。」\\n――サルカン・ヴォル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06730a1b-a140-4be3-b686-d9ab5eb7ab4b\', \'multiverseId\': 533518}, \'multiverseid\': 533518}, {\'name\': \'Postura Valente\', \'text\': \'Escolha um —\\n• A criatura alvo ganha indestrutível até o final do turno.\\n• Destrua a criatura alvo com resistência igual ou superior a 4.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Toda escolha altera o caminho do destino."\\n— Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'056d969a-190b-4917-b8e4-389638952e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 533729}, \'multiverseid\': 533729}, {\'name\': \'Доблестная Стойка\', \'text\': \'Выберите одно —\\n• Целевое существо получает Неразрушимость до конца хода.\\n• Уничтожьте целевое существо с выносливостью 4 или больше.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Каждый сделанный выбор меняет путь судьбы».\\n— Сархан Воль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'84a465ac-9086-400c-93a1-863965995f85\', \'multiverseId\': 533940}, \'multiverseid\': 533940}, {\'name\': \'英勇以对\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n•消灭目标防御力等于或大于4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个选择都会影响命途走向。」\\n～萨坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18cc399c-626e-40f4-8bcc-3b4b975614a2\', \'multiverseId\': 534151}, \'multiverseid\': 534151}, {\'name\': \'英勇以對\', \'text\': \'選擇一項～\\n• 目標生物獲得不滅異能直到回合結束。\\n• 消滅目標防禦力等於或大於4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「每個選擇都會影響命途走向。」\\n～薩坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3550c20-92be-43a5-af24-cc346243bbcf\', \'multiverseId\': 534362}, \'multiverseid\': 534362}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tapferes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W6 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer oder gleich dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis ist. Erzeuge dann so viele 2/2 weiße Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Sieg wird unseren Ansturm stoppen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f331315-27a5-4a0c-884f-564261418b91\', \'multiverseId\': 531972}, \'multiverseid\': 531972}, {\'name\': \'Reto heroico\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d6 y elige un resultado. Destruye cada criatura con una fuerza mayor o igual que ese resultado. Luego crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Caballero blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia igual al otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Solo la victoria detendrá nuestra ofensiva!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'837e19fb-55f9-4b9c-ac03-5850b4c5b82b\', \'multiverseId\': 532026}, \'multiverseid\': 532026}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre vaillante\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d6 et choisissez un résultat. Détruisez chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à ce résultat. Puis créez un nombre de jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance égal à l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Seule la victoire mettra fin à notre assaut ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532080&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d960df5a-e1db-4d56-81a7-2b7f34e08745\', \'multiverseId\': 532080}, \'multiverseid\': 532080}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Valorosa\', \'text\': "Tira due d6 e scegli un risultato. Distruggi ogni creatura con forza pari o superiore a quel risultato. Poi crea un numero di pedine creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianche con cautela pari all\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"La nostra carica si fermerà solo davanti alla vittoria!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49458ce3-c1a7-4693-8b2a-bf607f68baa0\', \'multiverseId\': 532134}, \'multiverseid\': 532134}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な挑戦\', \'text\': \'２個のd6を振り、出目１つを選ぶ。パワーがその出目以上であるすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。その後、もう１つの出目に等しい数の、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我らの猛攻は勝利まで止まない！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16212c6b-4059-48f2-95c8-21f622ee5b14\', \'multiverseId\': 532188}, \'multiverseid\': 532188}, {\'name\': \'Empreitada Valente\', \'text\': \'Role dois d6 e escolha um resultado. Destrua cada criatura com poder igual ou superior àquele resultado. Em seguida, crie um número de fichas de criatura Cavaleiro branca 2/2 com vigilância igual ao outro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Nossa carga só terminará com a vitória!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd19675c-9c25-4f08-af7c-86e07821e0fa\', \'multiverseId\': 532242}, \'multiverseid\': 532242}, {\'name\': \'Доблестное Предприятие\', \'text\': \'Бросьте два d6 и выберите один результат. Уничтожьте каждое существо, сила которого больше или равна тому результату. Затем создайте количество фишек существа 2/2 белый Рыцарь с Бдительностью, равное другому результату.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Лишь победа остановит наш натиск!»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42406788-6984-4453-a525-4895ccd1fbd8\', \'multiverseId\': 532296}, \'multiverseid\': 532296}, {\'name\': \'顽强勇进\', \'text\': \'掷两颗d6并选择一个掷骰结果。消灭所有力量等于或大于该掷骰结果的生物。然后派出若干2/2白色，具警戒异能的骑士衍生生物，其数量等同于另一个掷骰结果。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「只有胜利才是停止冲锋的讯号！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eff7fea-93a4-4084-88e4-ec42a562884b\', \'multiverseId\': 532350}, \'multiverseid\': 532350}, {\'name\': \'頑強勇進\', \'text\': \'擲兩個d6並選擇一個擲骰結果。消滅所有力量等於或大於該擲骰結果的生物。然後派出若干2/2白色，具警戒異能的騎士衍生生物，其數量等同於另一個擲骰結果。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「只有勝利才是停止衝鋒的訊號！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fbbc4ca-1917-447c-9b70-f92789b96c29\', \'multiverseId\': 532404}, \'multiverseid\': 532404}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tapferes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W6 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Zerstöre jede Kreatur, deren Stärke größer oder gleich dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis ist. Erzeuge dann so viele 2/2 weiße Ritter-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Wachsamkeit, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531558&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5e99e9c-ad4c-4b8b-95d8-f55f9b66ce2d\', \'multiverseId\': 531558}, \'multiverseid\': 531558}, {\'name\': \'Reto heroico\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d6 y elige un resultado. Destruye cada criatura con una fuerza mayor o igual que ese resultado. Luego crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Caballero blancas 2/2 con la habilidad de vigilancia igual al otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ca80896-03b6-4d4c-ae14-67fa789920ff\', \'multiverseId\': 531614}, \'multiverseid\': 531614}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre vaillante\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d6 et choisissez un résultat. Détruisez chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à ce résultat. Puis créez un nombre de jetons de créature 2/2 blanche Chevalier avec la vigilance égal à l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531670&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1860949b-e182-44cf-98cd-04dec289116c\', \'multiverseId\': 531670}, \'multiverseid\': 531670}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Valorosa\', \'text\': "Tira due d6 e scegli un risultato. Distruggi ogni creatura con forza pari o superiore a quel risultato. Poi crea un numero di pedine creatura Cavaliere 2/2 bianche con cautela pari all\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b19804be-1672-4ef4-9de1-2eaea0c9a736\', \'multiverseId\': 531726}, \'multiverseid\': 531726}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な挑戦\', \'text\': \'d6を２回振り、出目１つを選ぶ。パワーがその出目以上のすべてのクリーチャーを破壊する。その後、もう１つの出目に等しい数の、警戒を持つ白の２/２の騎士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116a4831-a6ce-4553-a3e0-d6f5a20eba5d\', \'multiverseId\': 531782}, \'multiverseid\': 531782}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tektonischer Riese\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Tektonische Riese angreift oder das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs wird, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, bestimme eines —\\n• Der Tektonische Riese fügt jedem Gegner 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Schicke die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bestimme eine davon. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Riese\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3e3414f-b529-4454-9e71-8df1d70563dd\', \'multiverseId\': 532742}, \'multiverseid\': 532742}, {\'name\': \'Gigante tectónico\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Gigante tectónico ataque o sea objetivo de un hechizo que controla un oponente, elige uno:\\n• El Gigante tectónico hace 3 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\\n• Exilia las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Elige una de ellas. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1390b41-1ab1-4cb7-9466-5004be2babcc\', \'multiverseId\': 532953}, \'multiverseid\': 532953}, {\'name\': \'Géant tectonique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Géant tectonique attaque ou devient la cible d\'un sort qu\'un adversaire contrôle, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Géant tectonique inflige 3 blessures à chaque adversaire.\\n• Exilez les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Choisissez l\'une d\'elles. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et géant\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533164&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47983175-d690-435e-b2ed-60ee0797e6b3\', \'multiverseId\': 533164}, \'multiverseid\': 533164}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Tettonico\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Gigante Tettonico attacca o diventa bersaglio di una magia controllata da un avversario, scegli uno —\\n• Il Gigante Tettonico infligge 3 danni a ogni avversario.\\n• Esilia le prime due carte del tuo grimorio. Scegli una di quelle carte. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quella carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gigante Elementale\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4123be03-faf8-4a20-94ec-2a362ee57d17\', \'multiverseId\': 533375}, \'multiverseid\': 533375}, {\'name\': \'地盤の巨人\', \'text\': \'地盤の巨人が攻撃するか、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文の対象になるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n• 地盤の巨人は各対戦相手にそれぞれ３点のダメージを与える。\\n• あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。そのうち１枚を選ぶ。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e0aac0e-5d70-42ba-b329-cc8b1f36c9b5\', \'multiverseId\': 533586}, \'multiverseid\': 533586}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Tectônico\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Gigante Tectônico atacar ou se tornar alvo de uma mágica que um oponente controla, escolha um —\\n• Gigante Tectônico causa 3 pontos de dano a cada oponente.\\n• Exile os dois cards do topo de seu grimório. Escolha um deles. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar aquele card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Gigante\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01404e56-2065-4642-9778-3e2f147d56b9\', \'multiverseId\': 533797}, \'multiverseid\': 533797}, {\'name\': \'Тектонический Гигант\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Тектонический Гигант атакует или становится целью заклинания под контролем оппонента, выберите одно —\\n• Тектонический Гигант наносит 3 повреждения каждому оппоненту.\\n• Изгоните две верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Выберите одну из них. Вы можете разыграть ту карту до конца вашего следующего хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Гигант\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa632017-d8a8-4598-838e-8864240ab2a6\', \'multiverseId\': 534008}, \'multiverseid\': 534008}, {\'name\': \'地壳巨人\', \'text\': \'每当地壳巨人攻击或成为由对手操控之咒语的目标时，选择一项～\\n•地壳巨人向每位对手各造成3点伤害。\\n•放逐你牌库顶的两张牌。从中选择一张。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534219&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9e1682d-81a8-4b50-843a-9ff637dc1b05\', \'multiverseId\': 534219}, \'multiverseid\': 534219}, {\'name\': \'地殼巨人\', \'text\': \'每當地殼巨人攻擊或成為由對手操控之咒語的目標時，選擇一項～\\n•地殼巨人向每位對手各造成3點傷害。\\n•放逐你牌庫頂的兩張牌。從中選擇一張。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以使用該牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／巨人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18dc59ce-d037-4f6c-af69-f873c0280ef3\', \'multiverseId\': 534430}, \'multiverseid\': 534430}]', "[{'name': 'Terminieren', 'text': 'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie kann nicht regeneriert werden.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': 'Jede Sonne geht irgendwann unter.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532791&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f769663c-3af1-4d19-b4da-eb43e5224b8a', 'multiverseId': 532791}, 'multiverseid': 532791}, {'name': 'Terminar', 'text': 'Destruye la criatura objetivo. No puede ser regenerada.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': 'Todos los soles tienen su ocaso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533002&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '292b5924-eeb4-4f8b-8fd7-950c9646ff3b', 'multiverseId': 533002}, 'multiverseid': 533002}, {'name': 'Terminaison', 'text': 'Détruisez une créature ciblée. Elle ne peut pas être régénérée.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': 'Tous les soleils doivent se coucher.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533213&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '17cba900-030b-4669-9758-c0bd98d380c8', 'multiverseId': 533213}, 'multiverseid': 533213}, {'name': 'Terminare', 'text': 'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Non può essere rigenerata.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': 'Tutti i soli devono tramontare.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533424&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8c1fd3d-be27-474e-9ccd-05db1f444c13', 'multiverseId': 533424}, 'multiverseid': 533424}, {'name': '終止', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。それは再生できない。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': '沈まない太陽などない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533635&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd02b7aea-3cba-4db8-8281-ce74f68a52fb', 'multiverseId': 533635}, 'multiverseid': 533635}, {'name': 'Findar', 'text': 'Destrua a criatura alvo. Ela não pode ser regenerada.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': 'Todos os sóis precisam se pôr.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533846&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a48fa096-3547-494b-89b7-5d98a45f6bbd', 'multiverseId': 533846}, 'multiverseid': 533846}, {'name': 'Истребить', 'text': 'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Оно не может быть регенерировано.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': 'Всякое солнце должно закатиться.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534057&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c8ee469-1fd1-444d-8769-02511efd5ecc', 'multiverseId': 534057}, 'multiverseid': 534057}, {'name': '终结', 'text': '消灭目标生物。它不能重生。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': '烈日终有落下时。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534268&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '553febce-c815-461f-9d99-6164fa6f9e60', 'multiverseId': 534268}, 'multiverseid': 534268}, {'name': '終結', 'text': '消滅目標生物。它不能重生。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': '烈日終有落下時。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534479&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b8ae67c3-2456-4a48-a8de-abd5405a8ace', 'multiverseId': 534479}, 'multiverseid': 534479}]", '[{\'name\': \'Theater des Schreckens\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments schickst du die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil.\\nWährend deines Zuges, falls ein Gegner in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte verloren hat, kannst du von den vom Theater des Schreckens ins Exil geschickten Karten Länder spielen und Zaubersprüche wirken.\\n{3}{R}: Das Theater des Schreckens fügt einem Gegner oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90cb967e-e3a8-4337-aa4e-c5057fdaa88c\', \'multiverseId\': 532792}, \'multiverseid\': 532792}, {\'name\': \'Teatro de los horrores\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nDurante tu turno, si un oponente perdió vidas este turno, puedes jugar tierras y lanzar hechizos de entre las cartas exiliadas con el Teatro de los horrores.\\n{3}{R}: El Teatro de los horrores hace 1 punto de daño al oponente o planeswalker objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d97904f7-5b8f-4672-8282-d207aa4383ee\', \'multiverseId\': 533003}, \'multiverseid\': 533003}, {\'name\': \'Théâtre des horreurs\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\nPendant votre tour, si un adversaire a perdu des points de vie ce tour-ci, vous pouvez jouer des terrains et lancer des sorts parmi les cartes exilées par le Théâtre des horreurs.\\n{3}{R} : Le Théâtre des horreurs inflige 1 blessure à une cible, adversaire ou planeswalker.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68a95ff5-c80d-4598-a303-46a0ee729d2c\', \'multiverseId\': 533214}, \'multiverseid\': 533214}, {\'name\': \'Teatro degli Orrori\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, esilia la prima carta del tuo grimorio.\\nDurante il tuo turno, se un avversario ha perso punti vita in questo turno, puoi giocare terre e lanciare magie scelte tra le carte esiliate con il Teatro degli Orrori.\\n{3}{R}: Il Teatro degli Orrori infligge 1 danno a un avversario o a un planeswalker bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccd05fef-4579-4d84-af87-ad5fed7cdf62\', \'multiverseId\': 533425}, \'multiverseid\': 533425}, {\'name\': \'恐怖の劇場\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。\\nあなたのターンの間、このターンに対戦相手がライフを失っていたなら、あなたは恐怖の劇場によって追放されているカードの中から、望む数の、土地をプレイしたり呪文を唱えたりしてもよい。\\n{3}{R}：対戦相手やプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。恐怖の劇場はそれに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30fe8e19-5f5e-4944-83e5-32e232a723ca\', \'multiverseId\': 533636}, \'multiverseid\': 533636}, {\'name\': \'Teatro de Horrores\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, exile o card do topo de seu grimório.\\nDurante o seu turno, se um oponente perdeu pontos de vida neste turno, você pode jogar terrenos e conjurar mágicas dentre os cards exilados com Teatro de Horrores.\\n{3}{R}: Teatro de Horrores causa 1 ponto de dano ao oponente ou planeswalker alvo.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e9d1b98-0835-4190-9d6a-19842a3d2408\', \'multiverseId\': 533847}, \'multiverseid\': 533847}, {\'name\': \'Театр Ужасов\', \'text\': "В начале вашего шага поддержки изгоните верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки.\\nВо время вашего хода, если оппонент терял жизнь(-и) в этом ходу, вы можете разыгрывать земли и заклинания, находящиеся среди карт, изгнанных Театром Ужасов.\\n{3}{R}: Театр Ужасов наносит 1 повреждение целевому оппоненту или planeswalker\'у.", \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1997801d-9dee-4a92-8367-cd7a83b3f25d\', \'multiverseId\': 534058}, \'multiverseid\': 534058}, {\'name\': \'恐怖剧场\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。\\n于你的回合中，如果有对手本回合中失去过生命，则你可以从以恐怖剧场放逐的牌之中使用地和施放咒语。\\n{3}{R}：恐怖剧场向目标对手或鹏洛客造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'505a607e-0a5b-4eb1-8507-d5fb252f9174\', \'multiverseId\': 534269}, \'multiverseid\': 534269}, {\'name\': \'恐怖劇場\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，放逐你的牌庫頂牌。\\n於你的回合中，如果有對手本回合中失去過生命，則你可以從以恐怖劇場放逐的牌之中使用地和施放咒語。\\n{3}{R}：恐怖劇場向目標對手或鵬洛客造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'779d03dc-d39f-4708-97ee-149165bbd131\', \'multiverseId\': 534480}, \'multiverseid\': 534480}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todestyrann\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nAntimagie-Kegel — Immer wenn eine angreifende Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, oder eine blockende Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{5}{B}: Bringe den Todestyrannen aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Betrachter, Skelett\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb0b1ec0-d657-4099-83ed-3b1760a79bf1\', \'multiverseId\': 531568}, \'multiverseid\': 531568}, {\'name\': \'Tirano sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCono de energía negativa — Siempre que una criatura atacante que controlas o una criatura bloqueadora que controla un oponente muera, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\n{5}{B}: Regresa el Tirano sepulcral de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto contemplador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8593e1-5e36-4ff7-b652-942d25f60ab3\', \'multiverseId\': 531624}, \'multiverseid\': 531624}, {\'name\': \'Tyramort\', \'text\': "Menace\\nCône d\'énergie négative — À chaque fois qu\'une créature attaquante que vous contrôlez ou qu\'une créature bloqueuse qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\n{5}{B} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, le Tyramort depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyrannœil et squelette\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531680&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1001e34b-f67d-429e-832e-05413654b137\', \'multiverseId\': 531680}, \'multiverseid\': 531680}, {\'name\': \'Tiranno della Morte\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nCono di Energia Negativa — Ogniqualvolta una creatura attaccante che controlli o una creatura bloccante controllata da un avversario muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\n{5}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpato il Tiranno della Morte dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scheletro Beholder\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d74aa6-f84f-4bc7-b171-2e540f62cc57\', \'multiverseId\': 531736}, \'multiverseid\': 531736}, {\'name\': \'デス・タイラント\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nネガティヴ・エナジー・コーン ― あなたがコントロールしている攻撃クリーチャーや対戦相手がコントロールしているブロック・クリーチャーのうち１つが死亡するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{5}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるデス・タイラントをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビホルダー・スケルトン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531792&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d05382a-e816-40f8-81f2-cc963d7b0f2f\', \'multiverseId\': 531792}, \'multiverseid\': 531792}]', '[{\'name\': \'Todestyrann\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nAntimagie-Kegel — Immer wenn eine angreifende Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, oder eine blockende Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{5}{B}: Bringe den Todestyrannen aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Betrachter, Skelett\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'009494e4-cc8d-4c60-8996-5c858a92cf86\', \'multiverseId\': 531982}, \'multiverseid\': 531982}, {\'name\': \'Tirano sepulcral\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCono de energía negativa — Siempre que una criatura atacante que controlas o una criatura bloqueadora que controla un oponente muera, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\\n{5}{B}: Regresa el Tirano sepulcral de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto contemplador\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f372442-b639-4589-ad8e-3e0582690bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 532036}, \'multiverseid\': 532036}, {\'name\': \'Tyramort\', \'text\': "Menace\\nCône d\'énergie négative — À chaque fois qu\'une créature attaquante que vous contrôlez ou qu\'une créature bloqueuse qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\n{5}{B} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, le Tyramort depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : tyrannœil et squelette\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7633f62-be2b-413c-a432-dc9d4adcbecb\', \'multiverseId\': 532090}, \'multiverseid\': 532090}, {\'name\': \'Tiranno della Morte\', \'text\': \'Minacciare\\nCono di Energia Negativa — Ogniqualvolta una creatura attaccante che controlli o una creatura bloccante controllata da un avversario muoiono, crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera.\\n{5}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia TAPpato il Tiranno della Morte dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Scheletro Beholder\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a30f791-5934-4875-b528-f97d21db1d12\', \'multiverseId\': 532144}, \'multiverseid\': 532144}, {\'name\': \'デス・タイラント\', \'text\': \'威迫\\nネガティヴ・エナジー・コーン ― あなたがコントロールしている攻撃クリーチャーや対戦相手がコントロールしているブロック・クリーチャーのうち１つが死亡するたび、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{5}{B}：あなたの墓地にあるデス・タイラントをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビホルダー・スケルトン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0196528-3d07-491a-af46-fe433d43b937\', \'multiverseId\': 532198}, \'multiverseid\': 532198}, {\'name\': \'Tirano da Morte\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar\\nCone de energia negativa — Toda vez que uma criatura atacante que você controla ou uma criatura bloqueadora que um oponente controla morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2.\\n{5}{B}: Devolva Tirano da Morte de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Observador Esqueleto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12cbb065-4eaa-4fdb-9fb7-643e0472a64d\', \'multiverseId\': 532252}, \'multiverseid\': 532252}, {\'name\': \'Тиран Смерти\', \'text\': \'Угроза\\nКонус негативной энергии — Каждый раз, когда атакующее существо под вашим контролем или блокирующее существо под контролем оппонента умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\n{5}{B}: верните Тирана Смерти из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Злобоглаз Скелет\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e6f43fb-cadd-4ffe-9738-261a537d1283\', \'multiverseId\': 532306}, \'multiverseid\': 532306}, {\'name\': \'死亡暴君\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n负能量锥～每当一个由你操控且进行攻击的生物或一个由对手操控且进行阻挡的生物死去时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n{5}{B}：将死亡暴君从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～眼魔／骷髅妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'268780ce-ebce-4ed6-9e06-18eda23eb91d\', \'multiverseId\': 532360}, \'multiverseid\': 532360}, {\'name\': \'死亡暴君\', \'text\': \'威懾\\n負能量錐～每當一個由你操控且進行攻擊的生物或一個由對手操控且進行阻擋的生物死去時，派出一個2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\\n{5}{B}：將死亡暴君從你的墳墓場橫置移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～眼魔／骷髏妖\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616bd264-c97e-4cac-881b-5114a36ae075\', \'multiverseId\': 532414}, \'multiverseid\': 532414}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tote Flussmündung\', \'text\': \'Sowie die Tote Flussmündung ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Insel- oder Sumpf-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt die Tote Flussmündung getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2b674ce-b331-4e7d-8a17-dc9933ccc9a8\', \'multiverseId\': 532826}, \'multiverseid\': 532826}, {\'name\': \'Estuario angosto\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Estuario angosto entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Isla o Pantano de tu mano. Si no lo haces, el Estuario angosto entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f83399b1-05d7-4f07-a317-1d8d03fa9f02\', \'multiverseId\': 533037}, \'multiverseid\': 533037}, {\'name\': \'Estuaire asphyxié\', \'text\': "Au moment où l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'île ou de marais de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, l\'Estuaire asphyxié arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533248&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef872f96-8785-47f6-90e7-39be5bcb92fe\', \'multiverseId\': 533248}, \'multiverseid\': 533248}, {\'name\': \'Estuario Soffocato\', \'text\': "Mentre l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Isola o Palude dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, l\'Estuario Soffocato entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db2ed9dd-3ed5-4a21-acea-0d3fc5f5f896\', \'multiverseId\': 533459}, \'multiverseid\': 533459}, {\'name\': \'詰まった河口\', \'text\': \'詰まった河口が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり島か沼であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、詰まった河口はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5854fd7-af8c-4b0b-920b-09455a6bd5f3\', \'multiverseId\': 533670}, \'multiverseid\': 533670}, {\'name\': \'Estuário Estrangulado\', \'text\': \'Conforme Estuário Estrangulado entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Ilha ou Pântano de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Estuário Estrangulado entrará no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533881&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36401909-547d-4ae5-9e44-576dd61aa8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 533881}, \'multiverseid\': 533881}, {\'name\': \'Забитое Устье\', \'text\': \'При выходе Забитого Устья на поле битвы вы можете показать карту Острова или Болота из вашей руки. Если вы этого не делаете, Забитое Устье выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94bcac42-1f7b-4797-b6e2-7b51f67a9fdd\', \'multiverseId\': 534092}, \'multiverseid\': 534092}, {\'name\': \'阻滞河口\', \'text\': \'于阻滞河口进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张海岛或沼泽牌。如果你未如此作，则阻滞河口须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'498521c1-7070-475f-abd0-95eea1c5b420\', \'multiverseId\': 534303}, \'multiverseid\': 534303}, {\'name\': \'阻滯河口\', \'text\': \'於阻滯河口進戰場時，你可以從你手上展示一張海島或沼澤牌。如果你未如此作，則阻滯河口須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d368d1-400f-40ac-b02e-45aa850e96cc\', \'multiverseId\': 534514}, \'multiverseid\': 534514}]', "[{'name': 'Totenschlamm', 'text': 'Der Totenschlamm kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Totenschlamm ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof oben auf deine Bibliothek legen.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532847&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fcb75a71-32bd-4192-948b-57c5996e4432', 'multiverseId': 532847}, 'multiverseid': 532847}, {'name': 'Ciénaga mortuoria', 'text': 'La Ciénaga mortuoria entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga mortuoria entre al campo de batalla, puedes poner la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio en la parte superior de tu biblioteca.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533058&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6b3373b1-da8e-4451-a5cc-5bbb0404b095', 'multiverseId': 533058}, 'multiverseid': 533058}, {'name': 'Fondrière mortuaire', 'text': 'La Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Fondrière mortuaire arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez mettre une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière au-dessus de votre bibliothèque.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533269&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49f5e40a-5cdf-4fe9-bdbb-29f92dc5f302', 'multiverseId': 533269}, 'multiverseid': 533269}, {'name': 'Pantano Mortuario', 'text': 'Il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\nQuando il Pantano Mortuario entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi mettere una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero in cima al tuo grimorio.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533480&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0f2bb383-ef76-4159-aeb2-c5adc645b051', 'multiverseId': 533480}, 'multiverseid': 533480}, {'name': '亡骸のぬかるみ', 'text': '亡骸のぬかるみはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n亡骸のぬかるみが戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをあなたのライブラリーの一番上に置いてもよい。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533691&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a1e0238-34c5-484d-9eee-c4c7fad356d8', 'multiverseId': 533691}, 'multiverseid': 533691}, {'name': 'Lodaçal Mortuário', 'text': 'Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha virado.\\nQuando Lodaçal Mortuário entra no campo de batalha, você pode colocar o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério no topo de seu grimório.\\n{T}: Adicione {B}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533902&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a356d8f-c214-410e-995f-cfe45f236e0d', 'multiverseId': 533902}, 'multiverseid': 533902}, {'name': 'Трупная Трясина', 'text': 'Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\nКогда Трупная Трясина выходит на поле битвы, вы можете положить целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на верх вашей библиотеки.\\n{T}: добавьте {B}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534113&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb96ba79-0f61-45c2-9e0a-35bcabe14cc5', 'multiverseId': 534113}, 'multiverseid': 534113}, {'name': '丧葬泥沼', 'text': '丧葬泥沼须横置进战场。\\n当丧葬泥沼进战场时，你可以将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场置于你的牌库顶。\\n{T}：加{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534324&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '094df46f-1433-4e99-b55c-157f493c3588', 'multiverseId': 534324}, 'multiverseid': 534324}, {'name': '喪葬泥沼', 'text': '喪葬泥沼須橫置進戰場。\\n當喪葬泥沼進戰場時，你可以將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場置於你的牌庫頂。\\n{T}：加{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534535&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e832ed5-c6ef-4f00-aef1-b5629ea8e53c', 'multiverseId': 534535}, 'multiverseid': 534535}]", '[{\'name\': \'Traumbild\', \'text\': \'Du kannst das Traumbild als Kopie einer beliebigen Kreatur im Spiel ins Spiel kommen lassen, außer dass es zusätzlich zu seinen anderen Typen eine Illusion ist und „Wenn diese Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, opfere sie" hat.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532687&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59fc64a5-e62a-46af-baeb-9bd75c7a4cc2\', \'multiverseId\': 532687}, \'multiverseid\': 532687}, {\'name\': \'Imagen fantasmal\', \'text\': \'Puedes hacer que la Imagen fantasmal entre al campo de batalla como una copia de cualquier criatura en el campo de batalla, excepto que es una Ilusión además de sus otros tipos y tiene "Cuando esta criatura sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad, sacrifícala".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusión\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af05d959-2fd4-402e-b56a-b511e7afbef6\', \'multiverseId\': 532898}, \'multiverseid\': 532898}, {\'name\': \'Image phantasmatique\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez faire que l\'Image phantasmatique arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie de n\'importe quelle créature sur le champ de bataille, excepté que c\'est une illusion en plus de ses autres types et qu\'elle a « Quand cette créature devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité, sacrifiez-la. »", \'type\': \'Créature : illusion\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da0216f-1717-474f-b03e-cc6a188b980a\', \'multiverseId\': 533109}, \'multiverseid\': 533109}, {\'name\': \'Immagine Fantasma\', \'text\': \'Puoi far entrare l\\\'Immagine Fantasma nel campo di battaglia come una copia di qualsiasi creatura sul campo di battaglia, tranne che è un\\\'Illusione in aggiunta ai suoi altri tipi e ha "Quando questa creatura diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità, sacrificala".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Illusione\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8d3b3ad-c33c-4fec-99b9-8c241fa49093\', \'multiverseId\': 533320}, \'multiverseid\': 533320}, {\'name\': \'幻影の像\', \'text\': \'あなたは幻影の像を、他のタイプに加えてイリュージョンであり「このクリーチャーが呪文か能力の対象になったとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つことを除き、戦場にあるクリーチャー１体のコピーとして戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — イリュージョン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4644c21a-d44c-4439-b8bc-cec434a41f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 533531}, \'multiverseid\': 533531}, {\'name\': \'Imagem Fantasmal\', \'text\': \'Você pode fazer com que Imagem Fantasmal entre no campo de batalha como uma cópia de qualquer criatura no campo de batalha, exceto que ela ainda é uma Ilusão além de seus outros tipos e tem "Quando esta criatura se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade, sacrifique-a".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ilusão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea3e0125-3b15-404a-9cca-9029dc47ab21\', \'multiverseId\': 533742}, \'multiverseid\': 533742}, {\'name\': \'Призрачный Образ\', \'text\': \'Вы можете заставить Призрачный Образ выйти на поле битвы в качестве копии любого существа на поле битвы, но при этом он является Иллюзией в дополнение к своим другим типам и имеет способность «Когда это существо становится целью заклинания или способности, пожертвуйте его».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Иллюзия\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60d9e65-fe0d-4ca5-8471-a064a1891012\', \'multiverseId\': 533953}, \'multiverseid\': 533953}, {\'name\': \'幻象身影\', \'text\': \'你可以使幻象身影当成战场上任一生物的复制品来进入战场，但它额外具有虚影此类别，且具有「当此生物成为咒语或异能的目标时，将它牺牲。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～虚影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c8cc50-f674-47d9-9cf4-4573c1abdb4e\', \'multiverseId\': 534164}, \'multiverseid\': 534164}, {\'name\': \'幻象身影\', \'text\': \'你可以使幻象身影當成戰場上任一生物的複製品來進入戰場，但它額外具有虛影此類別，且具有「當此生物成為咒語或異能的目標時，將它犧牲。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～虛影\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1c2fa63-6b92-4f19-b275-a299cf5d912f\', \'multiverseId\': 534375}, \'multiverseid\': 534375}]', '[{\'name\': \'Traumplünderer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Traumplünderer einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke entsprechend viele Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du davon Zaubersprüche wirken, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die absorbierten Träume verleihen seinen Schwingen einen farbigen Schimmer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532723&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6df5b4f7-bb37-475f-a107-42d5c7fbd7e8\', \'multiverseId\': 532723}, \'multiverseid\': 532723}, {\'name\': \'Ladrón de sueños\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Ladrón de sueños haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia esa misma cantidad de cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar hechizos de entre esas cartas exiliadas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Sus alas refulgen con los sueños que absorbe de sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4462b4c-6346-479b-8273-83eafb0d7fc7\', \'multiverseId\': 532934}, \'multiverseid\': 532934}, {\'name\': \'Pilleur des rêves\', \'text\': "Vol\\n\\x81À chaque fois que le Pilleur des rêves inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez autant de cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer des sorts parmi ces cartes exilées.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': \'Ses ailes resplendissent des rêves volés à ses ennemis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533145&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a76d7ea1-02f1-4c53-a61d-781003e2bcf5\', \'multiverseId\': 533145}, \'multiverseid\': 533145}, {\'name\': \'Predasogni\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta il Predasogni infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, esilia altrettante carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del turno, puoi lanciare magie scelte tra quelle carte esiliate.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Le sue ali rifulgono dei sogni assimilati dai suoi nemici.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb5f4b7b-a7d8-4078-b01a-76f542657c21\', \'multiverseId\': 533356}, \'multiverseid\': 533356}, {\'name\': \'夢の略奪者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n夢の略奪者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にある、その点数に等しい枚数のカードを追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそれらの追放されているカードの中から望む数の呪文を唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'その翼は敵から吸収した夢で輝いている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533567&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2c2429-c57e-4b80-9270-4001ade386bf\', \'multiverseId\': 533567}, \'multiverseid\': 533567}, {\'name\': \'Saqueador de Sonhos\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Saqueador de Sonhos causar dano de combate a um jogador, exile uma quantidade equivalente de cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do turno, você pode conjurar mágicas dentre os cards exilados.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Suas asas cintilam com os sonhos que ele absorve de seus inimigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1511e9ae-ef61-4f8f-a705-32161bb6d368\', \'multiverseId\': 533778}, \'multiverseid\': 533778}, {\'name\': \'Грабитель Сновидений\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Грабитель Сновидений наносит боевые повреждения игроку, изгоните такое же количество карт с верха вашей библиотеки. До конца хода вы можете разыгрывать заклинания, находящиеся среди тех изгнанных карт.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Его крылья мерцают от грез, которые он забрал у врагов.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d56a560f-68d5-4c99-96e8-0d807dd3ad59\', \'multiverseId\': 533989}, \'multiverseid\': 533989}, {\'name\': \'掠梦巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当掠梦巨龙对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，从你的牌库顶放逐等量的牌。直到回合结束，你可以从所放逐的牌之中施放咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'攫自敌人的眠梦点缀双翼，闪烁光芒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5dfae777-3212-44c5-98d2-a100553ccabb\', \'multiverseId\': 534200}, \'multiverseid\': 534200}, {\'name\': \'掠夢巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當掠夢巨龍對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，從你的牌庫頂放逐等量的牌。直到回合結束，你可以從所放逐的牌之中施放咒語。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'攫自敵人的眠夢點綴雙翼，閃爍光芒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b2d387f-3de1-4eb9-8457-814a1ccbaa14\', \'multiverseId\': 534411}, \'multiverseid\': 534411}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trickbeutel\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Würfle einen W8. Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte mit einem Manabetrag aufdeckst, der dem Ergebnis entspricht. Bringe sie ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'In einem Augenblick von kuschlig zu bissig.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531996&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be464327-9bf9-4cde-b0f2-2da228402096\', \'multiverseId\': 531996}, \'multiverseid\': 531996}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa de trucos\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Tira 1d8. Muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura con valor de maná igual al resultado. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'De adorable a feroz en un segundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d769936-572a-47f4-90b4-ff1f3a39be38\', \'multiverseId\': 532050}, \'multiverseid\': 532050}, {\'name\': \'Sac à malices\', \'text\': "{4}{G}, {T} : Lancez un d8. Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana égale au résultat. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "De pelucheux à vicieux en un clin d\'œil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'116616bb-7d10-44c9-bd69-f1d4289bd693\', \'multiverseId\': 532104}, \'multiverseid\': 532104}, {\'name\': \'Borsa dei Trucchi\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Tira un d8. Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura con valore di mana pari al risultato. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Da soffice a feroce in un istante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efb9e134-2f85-4d24-a323-4707cde5ec3c\', \'multiverseId\': 532158}, \'multiverseid\': 532158}, {\'name\': \'バッグ・オヴ・トリックス\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}：１個のd8を振る。マナ総量がそれに等しいクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'一瞬でふわふわが獰猛になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d29529-ec93-47e5-8c3f-18a1c9666a7c\', \'multiverseId\': 532212}, \'multiverseid\': 532212}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa de Truques\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Role um d8. Revele cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura com valor de mana igual ao resultado. Coloque aquele card no campo de batalha e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'De felpudinho a feroz num instante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5260a93f-6ba5-4e09-9769-90f6c7301eb9\', \'multiverseId\': 532266}, \'multiverseid\': 532266}, {\'name\': \'Сумка Фокусов\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: бросьте d8. Показывайте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не покажете карту существа с мановой ценностью, равной результату броска. Положите ту карту на поле битвы, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Из симпатичного в свирепого за одно мгновение.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85681be1-3102-43a1-8636-419b6f7ba801\', \'multiverseId\': 532320}, \'multiverseid\': 532320}, {\'name\': \'魔术袋\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}，{T}：掷一颗d8。从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张法术力值等同于该掷骰结果的生物牌为止。将该牌放进战场，其余则以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'眨眼之间便从可爱变成可憎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532374&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc8f1167-25cd-4519-8325-9c049f115843\', \'multiverseId\': 532374}, \'multiverseid\': 532374}, {\'name\': \'魔術袋\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}，{T}：擲一顆d8。從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張魔法力值等同於該擲骰結果的生物牌為止。將該牌放進戰場，其餘則以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'眨眼之間便從可愛變成可憎。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08bf1659-2153-4459-ba09-7cbaa2a4d2f6\', \'multiverseId\': 532428}, \'multiverseid\': 532428}]', '[{\'name\': \'Trickbeutel\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Würfle einen W8. Decke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek auf, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte mit einem Manabetrag aufdeckst, der dem Ergebnis entspricht. Bringe sie ins Spiel und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531582&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6367b57c-8c5c-47a1-8f87-5f8c896138a7\', \'multiverseId\': 531582}, \'multiverseid\': 531582}, {\'name\': \'Bolsa de trucos\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Tira 1d8. Muestra las primeras cartas de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura con valor de maná igual al resultado. Pon esa carta en el campo de batalla y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2d8fd21-43a3-41d8-9eef-02df1aafd50c\', \'multiverseId\': 531638}, \'multiverseid\': 531638}, {\'name\': \'Sac à malices\', \'text\': "{4}{G}, {T} : Lancez un d8. Révélez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature avec une valeur de mana égale au résultat. Mettez cette carte sur le champ de bataille et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531694&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47cb65d-2c45-42ee-8e23-444c0cf5d907\', \'multiverseId\': 531694}, \'multiverseid\': 531694}, {\'name\': \'Borsa dei Trucchi\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}: Tira un d8. Rivela carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura con valore di mana pari al risultato. Metti quella carta sul campo di battaglia e le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'715b487c-4653-4acc-9c3d-9e9286b9f547\', \'multiverseId\': 531750}, \'multiverseid\': 531750}, {\'name\': \'バッグ・オヴ・トリックス\', \'text\': \'{4}{G}, {T}：d8を１回振る。マナ総量がそれに等しいクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードを戦場に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ccf8d55-e736-4c5f-9904-d3e6bd4b46ca\', \'multiverseId\': 531806}, \'multiverseid\': 531806}]', '[{\'name\': \'Truhe des Toten\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert\\nWenn die verzauberte Kreatur stirbt, schicke eine Anzahl Karten in Höhe ihrer Stärke oben von der Bibliothek ihres Besitzers ins Exil. Du kannst davon Zaubersprüche wirken, solange sie im Exil bleiben, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana eines beliebigen Typs.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532695&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83239c3a-b560-49d9-9556-6d86b70de8ed\', \'multiverseId\': 532695}, \'multiverseid\': 532695}, {\'name\': \'Cofre del muerto\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que controla un oponente.\\nCuando la criatura encantada muera, exilia una cantidad de cartas igual a su fuerza de la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario. Puedes lanzar hechizos de entre esas cartas mientras permanezcan exiliadas, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar esos hechizos.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'204bf120-4152-4fd1-9b41-769a9e093c3a\', \'multiverseId\': 532906}, \'multiverseid\': 532906}, {\'name\': \'Coffre du moribond\', \'text\': "Enchanter : une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle\\nQuand la créature enchantée meurt, exilez un nombre de cartes égal à sa force depuis le dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire. Vous pouvez lancer des sorts parmi ces cartes tant qu\'elles restent exilées, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quel type pour lancer ces sorts.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c06dc7d8-c7de-4e6f-b82b-76bc188eed30\', \'multiverseId\': 533117}, \'multiverseid\': 533117}, {\'name\': \'Cassa del Morto\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura controllata da un avversario\\nQuando la creatura incantata muore, esilia carte pari alla sua forza dalla cima del grimorio del suo proprietario. Puoi lanciare magie scelte tra quelle carte fintanto che rimangono esiliate e puoi spendere mana come se fosse mana di qualsiasi tipo per lanciare quelle magie.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533328&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca7a5b0-0de3-4d69-9209-9454837b2e75\', \'multiverseId\': 533328}, \'multiverseid\': 533328}, {\'name\': \'死者の宝箱\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが死亡したとき、それのオーナーのライブラリーの一番上にある、それのパワーに等しい枚数のカードを追放する。それらのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれらの中から呪文を唱えてもよい。あなたは、それらの呪文を唱えるためにマナを望むタイプのマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533539&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7757d5-c114-4bdc-8896-e2386d56f634\', \'multiverseId\': 533539}, \'multiverseid\': 533539}, {\'name\': \'Baú do Morto\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura que um oponente controla\\nQuando a criatura encantada morrer, exile do topo do grimório de seu dono uma quantidade de cards igual a seu poder. Você pode conjurar mágicas dentre eles enquanto eles permanecerem exilados, e você pode gastar mana como se fosse de qualquer tipo para conjurar aquelas mágicas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85f2098b-9940-40ac-afc0-78616504d9d4\', \'multiverseId\': 533750}, \'multiverseid\': 533750}, {\'name\': \'Сундук Мертвеца\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо под контролем оппонента\\nКогда зачарованное существо умирает, изгоните равное значению его силы количество карт с верха библиотеки его владельца. Вы можете разыгрывать находящиеся среди тех карт заклинания, пока они остаются в изгнании, и вы можете тратить ману на разыгрывание тех заклинаний, как если бы это была мана любого типа.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8f941ff-f8a7-4b99-94a2-ae24526fbe0b\', \'multiverseId\': 533961}, \'multiverseid\': 533961}, {\'name\': \'死魂棺\', \'text\': \'结附于由对手操控的生物\\n当所结附的生物死去时，放逐其拥有者牌库顶的若干牌，其数量等同于该生物的力量。于这些牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以从其中施放咒语，且你可以将法术力视同任意种类的法术力来支付施放这些咒语的费用。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534172&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a0da909-4a04-4cc5-9887-97a26274633d\', \'multiverseId\': 534172}, \'multiverseid\': 534172}, {\'name\': \'死魂棺\', \'text\': \'結附於由對手操控的生物\\n當所結附的生物死去時，放逐其擁有者牌庫頂的若干牌，其數量等同於該生物的力量。於這些牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以從其中施放咒語，且你可以將魔法力視同任意種類的魔法力來支付施放這些咒語的費用。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534383&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dda5eaa9-5164-4a4c-a15f-294673ca6758\', \'multiverseId\': 534383}, \'multiverseid\': 534383}]', "[{'name': 'Unbewegliches Zepter', 'text': 'Du kannst bestimmen, das Unbewegliche Zepter während deines Enttappsegments nicht zu enttappen.\\nImmer wenn das Unbewegliche Zepter enttappt wird, wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Solange das Unbewegliche Zepter getappt bleibt, verliert eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl alle Fähigkeiten und kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531552&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb9ce96d-5695-4037-bd8f-6945505aca80', 'multiverseId': 531552}, 'multiverseid': 531552}, {'name': 'Vara inamovible', 'text': 'Puedes elegir no enderezar la Vara inamovible durante tu paso de enderezar.\\nSiempre que la Vara inamovible se enderece, adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Mientras la Vara inamovible permanezca girada, otro permanente objetivo pierde todas las habilidades y no puede atacar ni bloquear.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531608&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '00e5daad-63bd-4f78-828f-b8b51c4becaf', 'multiverseId': 531608}, 'multiverseid': 531608}, {'name': 'Sceptre inamovible', 'text': 'Vous pouvez choisir de ne pas dégager le Sceptre inamovible pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sceptre inamovible devient dégagé, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\n{3}{W}, {T} : Tant que le Sceptre inamovible reste engagé, un autre permanent ciblé perd toutes ses capacités et ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531664&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cefd2987-7706-4458-892c-807fee02371a', 'multiverseId': 531664}, 'multiverseid': 531664}, {'name': 'Verga Inamovibile', 'text': 'Puoi scegliere di non STAPpare la Verga Inamovibile durante il tuo STAP.\\nOgniqualvolta la Verga Inamovibile viene STAPpata, esplora il dungeon.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Fintanto che la Verga Inamovibile rimane TAPpata, un altro permanente bersaglio perde tutte le abilità e non può attaccare o bloccare.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531720&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '008bcbf4-a27b-4773-9f5e-17bcf8066464', 'multiverseId': 531720}, 'multiverseid': 531720}, {'name': 'イムーヴァブル・ロッド', 'text': 'あなたは、あなたのアンタップ・ステップにイムーヴァブル・ロッドをアンタップしないことを選んでもよい。\\nイムーヴァブル・ロッドがアンタップ状態になるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。\\n{3}{W}, {T}：これ以外のパーマネント１つを対象とする。イムーヴァブル・ロッドがタップ状態であり続けているかぎり、それはすべての能力を失い、それでは攻撃もブロックもできない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531776&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0f4cd59-9a27-4341-b10e-57deae18a50e', 'multiverseId': 531776}, 'multiverseid': 531776}]", "[{'name': 'Unbewegliches Zepter', 'text': 'Du kannst bestimmen, das Unbewegliche Zepter während deines Enttappsegments nicht zu enttappen.\\nImmer wenn das Unbewegliche Zepter enttappt wird, wage dich ins Gewölbe.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Solange das Unbewegliche Zepter getappt bleibt, verliert eine andere bleibende Karte deiner Wahl alle Fähigkeiten und kann nicht angreifen oder blocken.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531966&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c13524cf-130b-4eba-97e6-abed2335a9f5', 'multiverseId': 531966}, 'multiverseid': 531966}, {'name': 'Vara inamovible', 'text': 'Puedes elegir no enderezar la Vara inamovible durante tu paso de enderezar.\\nSiempre que la Vara inamovible se enderece, adéntrate en la mazmorra.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Mientras la Vara inamovible permanezca girada, otro permanente objetivo pierde todas las habilidades y no puede atacar ni bloquear.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532020&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8c4488bf-0c41-4ec2-b5e0-c4d5921684d7', 'multiverseId': 532020}, 'multiverseid': 532020}, {'name': 'Sceptre inamovible', 'text': 'Vous pouvez choisir de ne pas dégager le Sceptre inamovible pendant votre étape de dégagement.\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sceptre inamovible devient dégagé, aventurez-vous dans le donjon.\\n{3}{W}, {T} : Tant que le Sceptre inamovible reste engagé, un autre permanent ciblé perd toutes ses capacités et ne peut ni attaquer ni bloquer.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532074&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b243ff8d-8d33-4a26-9aa6-2cb6c6377930', 'multiverseId': 532074}, 'multiverseid': 532074}, {'name': 'Verga Inamovibile', 'text': 'Puoi scegliere di non STAPpare la Verga Inamovibile durante il tuo STAP.\\nOgniqualvolta la Verga Inamovibile viene STAPpata, esplora il dungeon.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Fintanto che la Verga Inamovibile rimane TAPpata, un altro permanente bersaglio perde tutte le abilità e non può attaccare o bloccare.', 'type': 'Artefatto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532128&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ff9217c-1beb-4e22-8a44-c8950986f3b6', 'multiverseId': 532128}, 'multiverseid': 532128}, {'name': 'イムーヴァブル・ロッド', 'text': 'あなたは、あなたのアンタップ・ステップにイムーヴァブル・ロッドをアンタップしないことを選んでもよい。\\nイムーヴァブル・ロッドがアンタップ状態になるたび、ダンジョン探索をする。\\n{3}{W}, {T}：これ以外のパーマネント１つを対象とする。イムーヴァブル・ロッドがタップ状態であり続けているかぎり、それはすべての能力を失い、それでは攻撃もブロックもできない。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532182&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bba283fa-3648-4165-bc77-40988c207e3d', 'multiverseId': 532182}, 'multiverseid': 532182}, {'name': 'Bastão Imóvel', 'text': 'Você pode escolher não desvirar Bastão Imóvel durante sua etapa de desvirar.\\nToda vez que Bastão Imóvel se tornar desvirado, aventure-se na masmorra.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: Enquanto Bastão Imóvel permanecer virado, outra permanente alvo perderá todas as habilidades e não poderá atacar nem bloquear.', 'type': 'Artefato', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532236&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '33a26304-d313-4874-bb20-679eeb0d729c', 'multiverseId': 532236}, 'multiverseid': 532236}, {'name': 'Неподвижный Жезл', 'text': 'Вы можете решить не разворачивать Неподвижный Жезл во время вашего шага разворота.\\nКаждый раз, когда Неподвижный Жезл становится развернутым, углубитесь в подземелье.\\n{3}{W}, {T}: пока Неподвижный Жезл остается повернутым, другой целевой перманент теряет все способности и не может атаковать или блокировать.', 'type': 'Артефакт', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532290&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a171a25-1f9a-40f2-bc82-22844db4e45b', 'multiverseId': 532290}, 'multiverseid': 532290}, {'name': '不动权杖', 'text': '你可以选择于你的重置步骤中不重置不动权杖。\\n每当不动权杖成为未横置时，深入地城。\\n{3}{W}，{T}：于不动权杖持续横置的时段内，另一个目标永久物失去所有异能，且不能进行攻击或阻挡。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532344&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d721ead-b7af-46ed-a593-b451fc903ad4', 'multiverseId': 532344}, 'multiverseid': 532344}, {'name': '不動權杖', 'text': '你可以選擇於你的重置步驟中不重置不動權杖。\\n每當不動權杖成為未橫置時，深入地城。\\n{3}{W}，{T}：於不動權杖持續橫置的時段內，另一個目標永久物失去所有異能，且不能進行攻擊或阻擋。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532398&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a27f1305-335e-41ba-92b7-41fe6202acf8', 'multiverseId': 532398}, 'multiverseid': 532398}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unbändige Stärke\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\\nDer Beherrscher der verzauberten Kreatur kann sie ihren Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob sie nicht geblockt worden wäre.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531585&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3a5c8f4-e83b-450c-84ac-6bd620291bb4\', \'multiverseId\': 531585}, \'multiverseid\': 531585}, {\'name\': \'Poderío indómito\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3.\\nEl controlador de la criatura encantada puede elegir que haga su daño de combate como si no hubiera sido bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1341bb-2f93-4373-a370-d2c59eb372b1\', \'multiverseId\': 531641}, \'multiverseid\': 531641}, {\'name\': \'Puissance indomptable\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3.\\nLe contrôleur de la créature enchantée peut faire qu\'elle attribue ses blessures de combat comme si elle n\'était pas bloquée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531697&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb46c860-1b0d-40c7-9857-624f1b77d5ec\', \'multiverseId\': 531697}, \'multiverseid\': 531697}, {\'name\': \'Potenza Indomabile\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3.\\nIl controllore della creatura incantata può far assegnare da essa il suo danno da combattimento come se non fosse bloccata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d965812-bc84-4434-9bdf-e6d521e9a643\', \'multiverseId\': 531753}, \'multiverseid\': 531753}, {\'name\': \'大力無双\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれの戦闘ダメージを、それがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d909dbe-b45f-411c-abe7-e2283a42f634\', \'multiverseId\': 531809}, \'multiverseid\': 531809}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unbändige Stärke\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nVerzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\\nDer Beherrscher der verzauberten Kreatur kann sie ihren Kampfschaden zuweisen lassen, als ob sie nicht geblockt worden wäre.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531999&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf2ed2e6-effa-4c40-b519-95e359b4818e\', \'multiverseId\': 531999}, \'multiverseid\': 531999}, {\'name\': \'Poderío indómito\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEncantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3.\\nEl controlador de la criatura encantada puede elegir que haga su daño de combate como si no hubiera sido bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee256f67-130a-4fc0-969e-890631ec8e52\', \'multiverseId\': 532053}, \'multiverseid\': 532053}, {\'name\': \'Puissance indomptable\', \'text\': "Flash\\nEnchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3.\\nLe contrôleur de la créature enchantée peut faire qu\'elle attribue ses blessures de combat comme si elle n\'était pas bloquée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'486751fb-36a1-49fe-9258-fc7d5ced28e5\', \'multiverseId\': 532107}, \'multiverseid\': 532107}, {\'name\': \'Potenza Indomabile\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nIncanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3.\\nIl controllore della creatura incantata può far assegnare da essa il suo danno da combattimento come se non fosse bloccata.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbeeecef-bcd8-42f3-95f1-14aae43cc736\', \'multiverseId\': 532161}, \'multiverseid\': 532161}, {\'name\': \'大力無双\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nエンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーのコントローラーはそれの戦闘ダメージを、それがブロックされなかったかのように割り振ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532215&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea83828-e0d8-45a6-9ebc-2c14399fb2fb\', \'multiverseId\': 532215}, \'multiverseid\': 532215}, {\'name\': \'Força Indomável\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEncantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3.\\nO controlador da criatura encantada pode fazer com que ela atribua seu dano de combate como se não tivesse sido bloqueada.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a51a53-30a1-41ce-b00f-4abf35c4b9fe\', \'multiverseId\': 532269}, \'multiverseid\': 532269}, {\'name\': \'Неукротимая Мощь\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЗачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3.\\nКонтролирующий зачарованное существо игрок может заставить его распределить его боевые повреждения, как если бы оно не было заблокировано.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c33f0506-f4b3-460d-b4c4-23e69122557e\', \'multiverseId\': 532323}, \'multiverseid\': 532323}, {\'name\': \'不屈勇武\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3。\\n所结附之生物的操控者可以让此生物视同未受阻挡地分配战斗伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532377&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a758c9-c618-4c10-a72a-f55d1e6b4a02\', \'multiverseId\': 532377}, \'multiverseid\': 532377}, {\'name\': \'不屈勇武\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+3/+3。\\n所結附之生物的操控者可以讓此生物視同未受阻擋地分配戰鬥傷害。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532431&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b952721-ee28-409d-a873-7142f2fd5c88\', \'multiverseId\': 532431}, \'multiverseid\': 532431}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unheilskauz\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Todesberührung\\nWenn der Unheilskauz ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogel\', \'flavor\': \'Sein Schnabel zerreißt Fleisch und Knochen, bis er das zarte Innere der Träume freilegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532775&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee637867-213c-482c-b30d-3d5087b33387\', \'multiverseId\': 532775}, \'multiverseid\': 532775}, {\'name\': \'Strix maléfico\', \'text\': \'Vuela, toque mortal.\\nCuando el Strix maléfico entre al campo de batalla, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Su pico rasga carne y hueso, exponiendo el suave tuétano del sueño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e10528a2-4d59-4658-b112-3053e4cafefe\', \'multiverseId\': 532986}, \'multiverseid\': 532986}, {\'name\': \'Sinistre strix\', \'text\': \'Vol, contact mortel\\nQuand le Sinistre strix arrive sur le champ de bataille, piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : oiseau\', \'flavor\': "Son bec déchire la chair et taille l\'os exposant à l\'air libre la tendre moelle du rêve.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533197&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a46d4e-d694-4024-b5e9-da386cbc0c0e\', \'multiverseId\': 533197}, \'multiverseid\': 533197}, {\'name\': \'Strige Funesto\', \'text\': \'Volare, tocco letale\\nQuando lo Strige Funesto entra nel campo di battaglia, pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'Il suo becco squarcia carne e ossa, mettendo allo scoperto la tenera essenza dei sogni.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0d5aadf-43c6-4128-ac2b-0ff34047cc3c\', \'multiverseId\': 533408}, \'multiverseid\': 533408}, {\'name\': \'悪意の大梟\', \'text\': \'飛行、接死\\n悪意の大梟が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 鳥\', \'flavor\': \'その嘴は肉と骨を裂き、柔らかな夢の随を剥き出しにする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d68423-886e-46f2-bf5e-f98d9b40151e\', \'multiverseId\': 533619}, \'multiverseid\': 533619}, {\'name\': \'Estrige Maligna\', \'text\': \'Voar, toque mortífero\\nQuando Estrige Maligna entrar no campo de batalha, compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Ave\', \'flavor\': \'Seu bico separa a carne e os ossos, expondo a tenra medula do sonho.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f229dbc-c761-4d0c-a009-cf3b0a45bb85\', \'multiverseId\': 533830}, \'multiverseid\': 533830}, {\'name\': \'Гибельная Неясыть\', \'text\': \'Полет, Смертельное касание\\nКогда Гибельная Неясыть выходит на поле битвы, возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Птица\', \'flavor\': \'Ее клюв разрывает плоть и кости, обнажая нежный костный мозг мечты.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c57583f-c24c-42fc-8067-58aa6c47cdb7\', \'multiverseId\': 534041}, \'multiverseid\': 534041}, {\'name\': \'恶邪枭\', \'text\': \'飞行，死触\\n当恶邪枭进战场时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～鸟\', \'flavor\': \'它用喙扯碎骨肉，让梦想柔髓暴露于外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534252&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db0e9063-1325-4112-824b-263db7fa9d1e\', \'multiverseId\': 534252}, \'multiverseid\': 534252}, {\'name\': \'惡邪梟\', \'text\': \'飛行，死觸\\n當惡邪梟進戰場時，抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～鳥\', \'flavor\': \'它用喙扯碎骨肉，讓夢想柔髓暴露於外。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61791fd8-8e12-4dd9-a0c1-2596bae8ae83\', \'multiverseId\': 534463}, \'multiverseid\': 534463}]', "[{'name': 'Unheilvolle Ruinen', 'text': 'Sowie die Unheilvollen Ruinen ins Spiel kommen, kannst du eine Sumpf- oder Gebirge-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommen die Unheilvollen Ruinen getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532836&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c72ba1ba-95c7-415c-85c6-ab1adb200ed5', 'multiverseId': 532836}, 'multiverseid': 532836}, {'name': 'Ruinas premonitorias', 'text': 'En cuanto las Ruinas premonitorias entren al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Pantano o de Montaña de tu mano. Si no lo haces, las Ruinas premonitorias entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533047&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fac26dfe-2fc7-4360-8aef-f1f2c2f37980', 'multiverseId': 533047}, 'multiverseid': 533047}, {'name': 'Ruines angoissantes', 'text': 'Au moment où les Ruines angoissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de marais ou de montagne de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, les Ruines angoissantes arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533258&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'caec7cd2-4f17-498f-9a83-a95033fbf748', 'multiverseId': 533258}, 'multiverseid': 533258}, {'name': 'Rovine del Presagio', 'text': 'Mentre le Rovine del Presagio entrano nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Palude o Montagna dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, le Rovine del Presagio entrano nel campo di battaglia TAPpate.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533469&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75165707-b6d6-4092-ae7a-529c75333fdd', 'multiverseId': 533469}, 'multiverseid': 533469}, {'name': '凶兆の廃墟', 'text': '凶兆の廃墟が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり沼か山であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、凶兆の廃墟はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533680&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '169ae2fb-e342-4fec-b5cb-a13c88c0f97d', 'multiverseId': 533680}, 'multiverseid': 533680}, {'name': 'Ruínas Agourentas', 'text': 'Conforme Ruínas Agourentas entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Pântano ou Montanha de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Ruínas Agourentas entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533891&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd0a01fc-c9e8-40c2-a212-62b5a33687ac', 'multiverseId': 533891}, 'multiverseid': 533891}, {'name': 'Зловещие Руины', 'text': 'При выходе Зловещих Руин на поле битвы вы можете показать карту Болота или Горы из вашей руки. Если вы этого не делаете, Зловещие Руины выходят на поле битвы повернутыми.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534102&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '732fbfdb-0ed6-4a7a-bd1b-341e2d013605', 'multiverseId': 534102}, 'multiverseid': 534102}, {'name': '恶兆遗迹', 'text': '于恶兆遗迹进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张沼泽或山脉牌。如果你未如此作，则恶兆遗迹须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534313&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0af57c9-2179-40b6-9f21-05dd6cbb7f2b', 'multiverseId': 534313}, 'multiverseid': 534313}, {'name': '惡兆遺跡', 'text': '於惡兆遺跡進戰場時，你可以從你手上展示一張沼澤或山脈牌。如果你未如此作，則惡兆遺跡須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534524&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea7913f4-3be3-4339-83f1-ec899c6c70b4', 'multiverseId': 534524}, 'multiverseid': 534524}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unhold aus den Schatten\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Unhold aus den Schatten einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt der Spieler eine Karte aus seiner Hand ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt.\\nOpfere einen Menschen: Regeneriere den Unhold aus den Schatten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532697&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2bd254dc-3545-4fd2-ab1a-83f222f62aeb\', \'multiverseId\': 532697}, \'multiverseid\': 532697}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de las sombras\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Demonio de las sombras haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia una carta de su mano. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada.\\nSacrificar un Humano: Regenera el Demonio de las sombras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03d7739-aa53-480b-8451-58ed013adea0\', \'multiverseId\': 532908}, \'multiverseid\': 532908}, {\'name\': \'Fielleux des ombres\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Fielleux des ombres inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile une carte de sa main. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée.\\nSacrifiez un humain : Régénérez le Fielleux des ombres.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05405b1-58a8-47d6-8bec-9b136ac47fed\', \'multiverseId\': 533119}, \'multiverseid\': 533119}, {\'name\': \'Immonda delle Ombre\', \'text\': "Volare\\nOgniqualvolta l\'Immonda delle Ombre infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, quel giocatore esilia una carta dalla sua mano. Puoi giocare quella carta fintanto che rimane esiliata.\\nSacrifica un Umano: Rigenera l\'Immonda delle Ombre.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecc60ed9-8f34-49e6-9c3b-3d8bf97e30fb\', \'multiverseId\': 533330}, \'multiverseid\': 533330}, {\'name\': \'影の悪鬼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n影の悪鬼がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にあるカード１枚を追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよい。\\n人間１体を生け贄に捧げる：影の悪鬼を再生する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e30d2c5-60db-4294-bb97-75beaa6ea134\', \'multiverseId\': 533541}, \'multiverseid\': 533541}, {\'name\': \'Demônio Sombrio\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que Demônio Sombrio causa dano de combate a um jogador, aquele jogador exila um card da própria mão. Você poderá jogar aquele card enquanto ele permanecer exilado.\\nSacrifique um Humano: Regenere Demônio Sombrio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7456d3e-50ed-4dc8-bd93-420f2773425d\', \'multiverseId\': 533752}, \'multiverseid\': 533752}, {\'name\': \'Злодейка Теней\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Злодейка Теней наносит боевые повреждения игроку, тот игрок изгоняет одну карту из своей руки. Вы можете разыгрывать ту карту, пока она остается в изгнании.\\nПожертвуйте Человека: регенерируйте Злодейку Теней.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6d0340c-2e1f-4235-87f7-dafa7a5a4aa3\', \'multiverseId\': 533963}, \'multiverseid\': 533963}, {\'name\': \'阴影邪鬼\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当阴影邪鬼对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手从其手上放逐一张牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌。\\n牺牲一个人类：重生阴影邪鬼。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c8a3abb-02de-4c80-b033-af84e4a009a1\', \'multiverseId\': 534174}, \'multiverseid\': 534174}, {\'name\': \'陰影邪鬼\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當陰影邪鬼對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，該玩家從其手上放逐一張牌。於該牌持續放逐的時段內，你可以使用該牌。\\n犧牲一個人類：重生陰影邪鬼。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／魔法師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f635b0e-ab25-4451-9e12-be8bd1f00d81\', \'multiverseId\': 534385}, \'multiverseid\': 534385}]', '[{\'name\': \'Unholdpeitsche\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und hat Reichweite.\\nImmer wenn der ausgerüsteten Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\nAusrüsten {2}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Eine feurige Geißel für Leib und Seele.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e32e429d-1faf-4348-864d-97f458f01d41\', \'multiverseId\': 531990}, \'multiverseid\': 531990}, {\'name\': \'Látigo infernal\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de alcance.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada reciba daño, hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\nEquipar {2}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Una flagelación ardiente que azota la carne y el alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532044&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c21ced9-1d0d-474a-a24d-e67fba4d8d5f\', \'multiverseId\': 532044}, \'multiverseid\': 532044}, {\'name\': \'Fiellefouet\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et a la portée.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée subit des blessures, elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\nÉquipement {2}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': "Un fléau ardent pour le corps et l\'âme.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6d00f93-ee29-439a-a4ad-ad1d6544ec53\', \'multiverseId\': 532098}, \'multiverseid\': 532098}, {\'name\': \'Sferza Immonda\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 e ha raggiungere.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla creatura equipaggiata, essa infligge danno pari alla sua forza a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Una ferita bruciante per la carne e per l\'anima.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb6d9220-8087-469e-8bad-322aea697a27\', \'multiverseId\': 532152}, \'multiverseid\': 532152}, {\'name\': \'悪鬼の鞭\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け到達を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがダメージを受けるたび、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。装備しているクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n装備{2}{R}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'肉体と魂を合わせ焼く災禍。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532206&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4de9c28-4541-4bc9-9251-5ad7dd04eb51\', \'multiverseId\': 532206}, \'multiverseid\': 532206}, {\'name\': \'Açoite Demoníaco\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0 e tem alcance.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada sofre dano, ela causa dano igual ao próprio poder ao jogador ou planeswalker alvo.\\nEquipar {2}{R}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Um flagelo calcinante para o corpo e a alma.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e41a1e0-9d24-411b-8f56-732df9356b53\', \'multiverseId\': 532260}, \'multiverseid\': 532260}, {\'name\': \'Демоническая Плеть\', \'text\': "Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0 и имеет Захват.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженному существу наносятся повреждения, оно наносит повреждения, равные своей силе, целевому игроку или planeswalker\'у.\\nСнарядить {2}{R}", \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Огненная плеть и для тела, и для души.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8a42748-850f-431d-8906-659c62dec706\', \'multiverseId\': 532314}, \'multiverseid\': 532314}, {\'name\': \'魔鞭\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有延势异能。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物受到伤害时，它对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成等同于其力量的伤害。\\n佩带{2}{R}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'它的猛烈鞭笞不仅触及肉体，更深入心灵。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532368&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e024d57-e92f-4f79-b1a7-6db7f392e848\', \'multiverseId\': 532368}, \'multiverseid\': 532368}, {\'name\': \'魔鞭\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0且具有延勢異能。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物受到傷害時，它對目標玩家或鵬洛客造成等同於其力量的傷害。\\n佩帶{2}{R}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'它的猛烈鞭笞不僅觸及肉體，更深入心靈。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21d8cec7-d836-4553-b5fc-8f1b3084b749\', \'multiverseId\': 532422}, \'multiverseid\': 532422}]', "[{'name': 'Unholdpeitsche', 'text': 'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0 und hat Reichweite.\\nImmer wenn der ausgerüsteten Kreatur Schaden zugefügt wird, fügt sie einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\nAusrüsten {2}{R}', 'type': 'Artefakt — Ausrüstung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531576&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bb03bce7-9f83-4ea9-aac2-2c2cda73ee28', 'multiverseId': 531576}, 'multiverseid': 531576}, {'name': 'Látigo infernal', 'text': 'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0 y tiene la habilidad de alcance.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada reciba daño, hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\nEquipar {2}{R}.', 'type': 'Artefacto — Equipo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531632&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '42bba17b-96c1-46bd-a63b-6d9ffa5f972e', 'multiverseId': 531632}, 'multiverseid': 531632}, {'name': 'Fiellefouet', 'text': 'La créature équipée gagne +2/+0 et a la portée.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée subit des blessures, elle inflige un nombre de blessures égal à sa force à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\nÉquipement {2}{R}', 'type': 'Artefact : équipement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531688&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f8804fd-a3f5-4412-a459-27b2261d35c0', 'multiverseId': 531688}, 'multiverseid': 531688}, {'name': 'Sferza Immonda', 'text': 'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0 e ha raggiungere.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno alla creatura equipaggiata, essa infligge danno pari alla sua forza a un giocatore o a un planeswalker bersaglio.\\nEquipaggiare {2}{R}', 'type': 'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531744&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c08fc7af-c0d1-48cf-ba8d-f6c9e8e581f0', 'multiverseId': 531744}, 'multiverseid': 531744}, {'name': '悪鬼の鞭', 'text': '装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受け到達を持つ。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがダメージを受けるたび、プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。装備しているクリーチャーはそれに自身のパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n装備{2}{R}', 'type': 'アーティファクト — 装備品', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531800&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4a6c8f0b-4338-4ce8-95c6-09058660bbfd', 'multiverseId': 531800}, 'multiverseid': 531800}]", '[{\'name\': \'Unterreich-Spalte\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, schicke die Unterreich-Spalte ins Exil: Würfle einen W10. Lege ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur oder einen Planeswalker deiner Wahl unter die obersten X Karten der Bibliothek seines bzw. ihres Besitzers, wobei X gleich dem Ergebnis ist. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532017&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2903d72-6082-4e72-b1fc-2d89b062de52\', \'multiverseId\': 532017}, \'multiverseid\': 532017}, {\'name\': \'Sima de la Infraoscuridad\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, exiliar la Sima de la Infraoscuridad: Tira 1d10. Pon el artefacto, criatura o planeswalker objetivo en la biblioteca de su propietario, justo debajo de las X primeras cartas de esa biblioteca, donde X es el resultado. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8af886e-e6da-4189-9fa2-bc2e45fd3a40\', \'multiverseId\': 532071}, \'multiverseid\': 532071}, {\'name\': "Faille de l\'Outreterre", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, exilez la Faille de l\'Outreterre : Lancez un d10. Mettez une cible, artefact, créature ou planeswalker, dans la bibliothèque de son propriétaire juste au-dessous des X cartes du dessus de cette bibliothèque, X étant le résultat. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2866cc6c-af7d-48b5-9405-d5ee4efc4a7b\', \'multiverseId\': 532125}, \'multiverseid\': 532125}, {\'name\': "Crepa per l\'Underdark", \'text\': "{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, Esilia la Crepa per l\'Underdark: Tira un d10. Metti un artefatto, una creatura o un planeswalker bersaglio nel grimorio del suo proprietario subito sotto le prime X carte di quel grimorio, dove X è il risultato. Attiva solo come una stregoneria.", \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'148c65d5-04d5-4e8a-8c5a-28e870fa83df\', \'multiverseId\': 532179}, \'multiverseid\': 532179}, {\'name\': \'アンダーダークの裂け目\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{5}, {T}, アンダーダークの裂け目を追放する：１個のd10を振る。アーティファクトやクリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーのうち１つを対象とする。それをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードX枚の直下に置く。Ｘはその出目に等しい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e423d5a-3d2c-46b3-8942-290b7414573e\', \'multiverseId\': 532233}, \'multiverseid\': 532233}, {\'name\': \'Fenda do Subterrâneo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, exile Fenda do Subterrâneo: Role um d10. Coloque o artefato, a criatura ou o planeswalker alvo no grimório de seu dono logo abaixo dos X cards do topo daquele grimório, sendo X o resultado. Ative somente como um feitiço.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd35cdb-7a2f-4db8-8c7b-fdf8e95b2fdb\', \'multiverseId\': 532287}, \'multiverseid\': 532287}, {\'name\': \'Разлом Подземья\', \'text\': "{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{5}, {T}, изгоните Разлом Подземья: бросьте d10. Положите целевой артефакт, существо или planeswalker\'а в библиотеку его владельца непосредственно под X верхних карт той библиотеки, где X — результат броска. Активируйте только как волшебство.", \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47d941cd-7009-4582-a72e-1cdb9908ddf6\', \'multiverseId\': 532341}, \'multiverseid\': 532341}, {\'name\': \'幽暗地域裂缝\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{5}，{T}，放逐幽暗地域裂缝：掷一颗d10。将目标神器，生物或鹏洛客置于其拥有者的牌库顶第X张牌正下面，X为掷骰结果。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c97f73-a283-4514-b28a-3cd2e48f6c81\', \'multiverseId\': 532395}, \'multiverseid\': 532395}, {\'name\': \'幽暗地域裂縫\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{5}，{T}，放逐幽暗地域裂縫：擲一顆d10。將目標神器，生物或鵬洛客置於其擁有者的牌庫頂第X張牌正下面，X為擲骰結果。只能於巫術時機起動。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'afd04df5-d015-4203-8498-760d7a2360cc\', \'multiverseId\': 532449}, \'multiverseid\': 532449}]', '[{\'name\': \'Utopia-Ausbreitung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert einen Wald\\nSowie die Utopia-Ausbreitung ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Wald für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher ein zusätzliches Mana der bestimmten Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532770&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3b4be7e-f918-403c-8915-d2113007cbe0\', \'multiverseId\': 532770}, \'multiverseid\': 532770}, {\'name\': \'Expansión utópica\', \'text\': \'Encantar Bosque.\\nEn cuanto la Expansión utópica entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nSiempre que se gire el Bosque encantado para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un maná adicional del color elegido.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'394c1745-9eaf-4405-885f-16db6e52fc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 532981}, \'multiverseid\': 532981}, {\'name\': "Étendue de l\'utopie", \'text\': "Enchanter : forêt\\nAu moment où l\'Étendue de l\'utopie arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nÀ chaque fois que la forêt enchantée est engagée pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute un mana supplémentaire de la couleur choisie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533192&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'740759b7-c713-4c9f-b21e-c3c5c6bd933c\', \'multiverseId\': 533192}, \'multiverseid\': 533192}, {\'name\': "Propagazione dell\'Utopia", \'text\': "Incanta Foresta\\nMentre la Propagazione dell\'Utopia entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nOgniqualvolta la Foresta incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge un mana addizionale del colore scelto.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533403&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0c5b6dd-781a-4bdd-8bb8-63a8b28947a0\', \'multiverseId\': 533403}, \'multiverseid\': 533403}, {\'name\': \'楽園の拡散\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（森）\\n楽園の拡散が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nエンチャントしている森がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加でその選ばれた色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533614&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9448c0ac-b6d7-4f66-b629-f11f7b4a7f38\', \'multiverseId\': 533614}, \'multiverseid\': 533614}, {\'name\': \'Propagação da Utopia\', \'text\': \'Encantar Floresta\\nConforme Propagação da Utopia entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nToda vez que a Floresta encantada é virada para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona um mana extra da cor escolhida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87842827-6257-4a58-8250-8615b2f01013\', \'multiverseId\': 533825}, \'multiverseid\': 533825}, {\'name\': \'Утопический Рост\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать Лес\\nПри выходе Утопического Роста на поле битвы выберите цвет.\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованный Лес поворачивается для получения маны, контролирующий его игрок добавляет одну дополнительную ману выбранного цвета.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd55732c-ed21-4165-a810-551278ef1607\', \'multiverseId\': 534036}, \'multiverseid\': 534036}, {\'name\': \'理想境蔓生\', \'text\': \'结附于树林\\n于理想境蔓生进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n每当横置所结附的树林以产生法术力时，其操控者额外加一点所选颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3e6a41-2972-4f2d-9261-189780f96778\', \'multiverseId\': 534247}, \'multiverseid\': 534247}, {\'name\': \'理想境蔓生\', \'text\': \'結附於樹林\\n於理想境蔓生進戰場時，選擇一種顏色。\\n每當橫置所結附的樹林以產生魔法力時，其操控者額外加一點所選顏色的魔法力。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee83049d-9c0c-4813-b670-8cb7a321cf95\', \'multiverseId\': 534458}, \'multiverseid\': 534458}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vandalenrandale\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, das du nicht kontrollierst.\\nÜberlast {4}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, verändere seinen Text, indem du alle Vorkommen von „ein … deiner Wahl" durch „jedes …" ersetzt.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Was schön ist, entscheidet der Sprengmeister.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532746&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a82694d-b2e4-441b-93ff-2e29c472dc12\', \'multiverseId\': 532746}, \'multiverseid\': 532746}, {\'name\': \'Ráfaga vandálica\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo que no controlas.\\nSobrecarga {4}{R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia su texto reemplazando "el artefacto objetivo" por "cada artefacto".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La belleza está en los ojos del que mina.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90389878-ce7d-4272-a8ef-2023828d34ba\', \'multiverseId\': 532957}, \'multiverseid\': 532957}, {\'name\': \'Salve vandale\', \'text\': \'Détruisez un artefact ciblé que vous ne contrôlez pas.\\nSurcharge {4}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, modifiez son texte en remplaçant toutes les occurrences de « ciblé(e) » par « chaque ».)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La beauté est dans l\'œil du saboteur.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddf06637-6dd7-4cc6-a791-4d6f547672de\', \'multiverseId\': 533168}, \'multiverseid\': 533168}, {\'name\': \'Esplosione Vandalica\', \'text\': \'Distruggi un artefatto bersaglio che non controlli.\\nSovraccarico {4}{R} (Puoi lanciare questa magia per il suo costo di sovraccarico. Se lo fai, cambiane il testo sostituendo "un artefatto bersaglio" con "ogni artefatto".)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "La bellezza è nell\'occhio di chi piazza la bomba.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e629732-ce0c-4bc3-96f0-ab1499137c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 533379}, \'multiverseid\': 533379}, {\'name\': \'汚損破\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n超過{4}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのアーティファクトを破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'美は爆破者の目に宿る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a40f5c-1120-447b-bd5c-8732a0e1a50b\', \'multiverseId\': 533590}, \'multiverseid\': 533590}, {\'name\': \'Explosão Vandálica\', \'text\': \'Destrua o artefato alvo que você não controla.\\nSobrecarga {4}{R} (Você pode conjurar esta mágica pagando seu custo de sobrecarga. Se fizer isso, altere seu texto substituindo todas as ocorrências de "o artefato alvo" por "cada artefato".)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A beleza está nos olhos de quem detona a explosão.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b86feb64-8404-40f3-a080-51e5eea69ae9\', \'multiverseId\': 533801}, \'multiverseid\': 533801}, {\'name\': \'Вандальский Взрыв\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевой артефакт не под вашим контролем.\\nПерегрузка {4}{R} (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание за его стоимость Перегрузки. Если вы это делаете, измените в его тексте все слова «целевой» на «каждый».)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'С подрывниками не спорят.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6503be1-3e54-471a-a118-8f21bfc3a1ba\', \'multiverseId\': 534012}, \'multiverseid\': 534012}, {\'name\': \'蛮野冲击\', \'text\': \'消灭目标不由你操控的神器。\\n超载{4}{R}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。如果你如此作，将其中的「目标」字样全部更改为「每个」。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'爆破者的眼中尽是美景。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1faa278c-d2b9-4292-9890-359bbaf4ab74\', \'multiverseId\': 534223}, \'multiverseid\': 534223}, {\'name\': \'蠻野衝擊\', \'text\': \'消滅目標不由你操控的神器。\\n超載{4}{R}（你可以支付此咒語的超載費用來施放它。如果你如此作，將其中的「目標」字樣全部更改為「每個」。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'爆破者的眼中盡是美景。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15d7932c-4db6-4279-bac9-d465d2cc501d\', \'multiverseId\': 534434}, \'multiverseid\': 534434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verbotene Alchemie\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\\nRückblende {6}{B} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532682&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bd3a35-8db0-422a-9a72-501503c5a544\', \'multiverseId\': 532682}, \'multiverseid\': 532682}, {\'name\': \'Alquimia prohibida\', \'text\': \'Mira las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.\\nRetrospectiva {6}{B}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a07bcf9-5664-4458-9311-5152d4c74a90\', \'multiverseId\': 532893}, \'multiverseid\': 532893}, {\'name\': \'Alchimie interdite\', \'text\': "Regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533104&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce8e4c75-b1da-499e-9f39-3855b08acc4b\', \'multiverseId\': 533104}, \'multiverseid\': 533104}, {\'name\': \'Alchimia Proibita\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime quattro carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre nel tuo cimitero.\\nFlashback {6}{B} (Puoi lanciare questa carta dal tuo cimitero pagando il suo costo di flashback. Poi esiliala.)\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95dd6680-6337-41a2-ab93-18bd50e7e956\', \'multiverseId\': 533315}, \'multiverseid\': 533315}, {\'name\': \'禁忌の錬金術\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{B}（あなたはあなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533526&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8107b99-a54b-476b-9046-2e6a3e956c5e\', \'multiverseId\': 533526}, \'multiverseid\': 533526}, {\'name\': \'Alquimia Proibida\', \'text\': \'Olhe os quatro cards do topo do seu grimório. Coloque um deles em sua mão e o restante em seu cemitério.\\nRecapitular {6}{B} (Você pode conjurar este card de seu cemitério pagando seu custo de recapitular. Depois, exile-o.)\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f9be2c3-483c-427c-9f38-472d1ff69020\', \'multiverseId\': 533737}, \'multiverseid\': 533737}, {\'name\': \'Запретная Алхимия\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите четыре верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — на ваше кладбище.\\nВоспоминание {6}{B} (Вы можете разыграть эту карту из вашего кладбища за ее стоимость Воспоминания. Затем изгоните ее.)\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506d1752-cc19-4fb5-991a-36a2d4aa16a0\', \'multiverseId\': 533948}, \'multiverseid\': 533948}, {\'name\': \'炼金禁术\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的四张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则置入你的坟墓场。\\n返照{6}{B}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534159&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc1c12c-da0c-40bc-9c6a-e7eaa2e3c639\', \'multiverseId\': 534159}, \'multiverseid\': 534159}, {\'name\': \'鍊金禁術\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的四張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則置入你的墳墓場。\\n返照{6}{B}（你可以從你的墳墓場施放此牌，並支付其返照費用，然後將它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'820dbe23-cfbb-4d69-8724-77e401b2615e\', \'multiverseId\': 534370}, \'multiverseid\': 534370}]', "[{'name': 'Verdammter Geisterbeschwörer', 'text': '{B}, {T}, opfere den Verdammten Geisterbeschwörer: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Mensch, Kleriker, Söldner', 'flavor': 'Viele Geisterbeschwörer benutzen die gleichen letzten Worte — die letzten Worte des Rituals, mit dem sie sich selbst zu Untoten machen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532696&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ae3f5c7-0ce4-4061-96c0-c9e998d3dac2', 'multiverseId': 532696}, 'multiverseid': 532696}, {'name': 'Nigromante condenado', 'text': '{B}, {T}, sacrificar el Nigromante condenado: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Criatura — Clérigo mercenario humano', 'flavor': 'Muchos nigromantes comparten las mismas últimas palabras; las que concluyen el ritual de muerte viviente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532907&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5f30618-82d4-4106-a468-86b426bd370c', 'multiverseId': 532907}, 'multiverseid': 532907}, {'name': 'Nécromancien condamné', 'text': '{B}, {T}, sacrifiez le Nécromancien condamné : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature : humain et clerc et mercenaire', 'flavor': 'Bon nombre de nécromanciens périssent de la même manière — en prononçant les dernières incantations du rituel de la morte-vie.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533118&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01755b50-e426-44d9-b25b-f8f2f615ac4f', 'multiverseId': 533118}, 'multiverseid': 533118}, {'name': 'Negromante Condannato', 'text': '{B}, {T}, Sacrifica il Negromante Condannato: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Creatura — Mercenario Chierico Umano', 'flavor': 'Molti negromanti condividono le stesse ultime parole: quelle che concludono il rituale della non morte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533329&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '154048ee-176e-40a7-ad76-3e2e5a21d77b', 'multiverseId': 533329}, 'multiverseid': 533329}, {'name': '宿命のネクロマンサー', 'text': '{B}, {T}, 宿命のネクロマンサーを生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 人間・クレリック・傭兵', 'flavor': '多くの屍術士が同じ遺言を残す――不死の儀式の終了だ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533540&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e158e476-ac61-4eae-92e0-2973f09a7df4', 'multiverseId': 533540}, 'multiverseid': 533540}, {'name': 'Necromante Condenado', 'text': '{B}, {T}, sacrifique Necromante Condenado: Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Criatura — Humano Clérigo Mercenário', 'flavor': 'Muitos necromantes compartilham as mesmas últimas palavras: as que concluem o ritual dos mortos-vivos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533751&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cee5463b-f7b3-4889-b4e3-3fe0ea71f52a', 'multiverseId': 533751}, 'multiverseid': 533751}, {'name': 'Обреченный Некромант', 'text': '{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Обреченного Некроманта: верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Существо — Человек Священник Наемник', 'flavor': 'У многих некромантов последние слова были одни и те же — это слова, которыми заканчивается ритуал вызова нежити.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533962&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '052fdccb-84f4-462b-980b-a0bb3ea56ddc', 'multiverseId': 533962}, 'multiverseid': 533962}, {'name': '败亡死灵术士', 'text': '{B}，{T}，牺牲败亡死灵术士：将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '生物 ～人类／僧侣／佣兵', 'flavor': '许多死灵术士的遗言是同一句～用来结束亡物仪式的那句。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534173&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '71af10f3-4aa1-427b-92a0-7e02c59c2aa0', 'multiverseId': 534173}, 'multiverseid': 534173}, {'name': '敗亡死靈術士', 'text': '{B}，{T}：犧牲敗亡死靈術士：將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。', 'type': '生物 ～人類／僧侶／傭兵', 'flavor': '許多死靈術士的遺言是同一句～用來結束亡物儀式的那句。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534384&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '98b7882d-3b1f-4279-89f1-c8d0fe4fc648', 'multiverseId': 534384}, 'multiverseid': 534384}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verheerender Mechakoloss\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nWenn der Verheerende Mechakoloss ins Spiel kommt, bestimmt jeder Spieler ein Artefakt, eine Kreatur, eine Verzauberung und einen Planeswalker unter den bleibenden Karten, die keine Länder sind und die er kontrolliert, und opfert dann den Rest.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Konstrukt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532663&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9533087-cb5b-4a3b-9a6e-bf7402ca93d3\', \'multiverseId\': 532663}, \'multiverseid\': 532663}, {\'name\': \'Mecatitán cataclísmico\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nCuando el Mecatitán cataclísmico entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador elige un artefacto, una criatura, un encantamiento y un planeswalker de entre los permanentes que no sean tierra que controla, luego sacrifica el resto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38342c54-0ef4-46dc-b918-21c2814a9bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 532874}, \'multiverseid\': 532874}, {\'name\': \'Carcasse mécanique cataclysmique\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nQuand la Carcasse mécanique cataclysmique arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur choisit un artefact, une créature, un enchantement et un planeswalker parmi les permanents non-terrain qu\'il contrôle, puis sacrifie le reste.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : construction\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533085&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a61d9b86-4583-42ee-94f2-08b0ddb1fa68\', \'multiverseId\': 533085}, \'multiverseid\': 533085}, {\'name\': \'Meccatitano del Cataclisma\', \'text\': \'Cautela\\nQuando il Meccatitano del Cataclisma entra nel campo di battaglia, ogni giocatore sceglie un artefatto, una creatura, un incantesimo e un planeswalker tra i permanenti non terra che controlla, poi sacrifica gli altri.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Costrutto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15652ade-ce39-4f60-a29b-fa07741b3eec\', \'multiverseId\': 533296}, \'multiverseid\': 533296}, {\'name\': \'激変の機械巨人\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n激変の機械巨人が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネントの中から、アーティファクト１つとクリーチャー１体とエンチャント１つとプレインズウォーカー１体を選び、その後残りを生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 構築物\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05e7e615-59d6-4fbf-932f-69f803cf9e32\', \'multiverseId\': 533507}, \'multiverseid\': 533507}, {\'name\': \'Mecanotitã Cataclísmico\', \'text\': \'Vigilância\\nQuando Mecanotitã Cataclísmico entra no campo de batalha, cada jogador escolhe um artefato, uma criatura, um encantamento e um planeswalker dentre as permanentes não de terreno que este controla e, em seguida, sacrifica as restantes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Constructo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd1d376-9965-493a-80af-b6d87308e302\', \'multiverseId\': 533718}, \'multiverseid\': 533718}, {\'name\': \'Мехагигант Катаклизмов\', \'text\': "Бдительность\\nКогда Мехагигант Катаклизмов выходит на поле битвы, каждый игрок выбирает из не являющихся землями перманентов под своим контролем артефакт, существо, чары и planeswalker\'а, затем жертвует остальные.", \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Конструкция\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'210c850c-6527-4993-bc9b-ea9f98a06385\', \'multiverseId\': 533929}, \'multiverseid\': 533929}, {\'name\': \'灾变巨械\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n当灾变巨械进战场时，每位牌手各从由其操控的非地永久物中选择一个神器、一个生物、一个结界和一个鹏洛客，然后牺牲其余的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～组构体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1c5811a-b1a5-472d-8aac-664c621226e8\', \'multiverseId\': 534140}, \'multiverseid\': 534140}, {\'name\': \'災變巨械\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n當災變巨械進戰場時，每位玩家各從由其操控的非地永久物中選擇一個神器、一個生物、一個結界和一個鵬洛客，然後犧牲其餘的非地永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～組構體\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ef4dcb-263e-4087-9bc1-706a9a6ddd8a\', \'multiverseId\': 534351}, \'multiverseid\': 534351}]', "[{'name': 'Verhexen', 'text': 'Zerstöre sechs Kreaturen deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Manchmal sind sieben auf einen Streich zu viel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532699&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9dbfc855-a51b-4434-95c9-1f2fac5192db', 'multiverseId': 532699}, 'multiverseid': 532699}, {'name': 'Brujería', 'text': 'Destruye seis criaturas objetivo.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Cuando matar a cinco no es suficiente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532910&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0a78f154-ca0a-4aaa-b04a-43eed42d3dde', 'multiverseId': 532910}, 'multiverseid': 532910}, {'name': 'Maléfice hexagonal', 'text': 'Détruisez six créatures ciblées.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Si en tuer cinq ne vous suffit pas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533121&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd32d060c-170d-48ca-b2d4-80c8b89a7c60', 'multiverseId': 533121}, 'multiverseid': 533121}, {'name': 'Anatema', 'text': 'Distruggi sei creature bersaglio.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Quando ucciderne cinque non basta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533332&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26c9d4dd-d025-41a8-a3a0-4b249bf067c2', 'multiverseId': 533332}, 'multiverseid': 533332}, {'name': '呪詛', 'text': 'クリーチャー６体を対象とする。それらを破壊する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '片手で余る時のために。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533543&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dfcc9143-e6f2-4da3-923c-6edae0cc8a8f', 'multiverseId': 533543}, 'multiverseid': 533543}, {'name': 'Bruxaria', 'text': 'Destrua seis criaturas alvo.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'Quando matar cinco não basta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533754&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ee4cc59f-d6a4-461a-93a8-55882c4a8c7b', 'multiverseId': 533754}, 'multiverseid': 533754}, {'name': 'Сглаз', 'text': 'Уничтожьте шесть целевых существ.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Когда убить пять было бы просто недостаточно.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533965&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11f71527-d9e1-4949-b394-04d74784246c', 'multiverseId': 533965}, 'multiverseid': 533965}, {'name': '六方杀阵', 'text': '消灭六个目标生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '有时候杀五个还不够。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534176&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd2c1c716-a050-401b-bc22-f3cee1c9c464', 'multiverseId': 534176}, 'multiverseid': 534176}, {'name': '六方殺陣', 'text': '消滅六個目標生物。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '有時候殺五個還不夠。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534387&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca367c1e-05ed-450e-a05c-9e8650524f5e', 'multiverseId': 534387}, 'multiverseid': 534387}]", "[{'name': 'Verrücktmachende Verwünschung', 'text': 'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt, würfle einen W6. Die Verrücktmachende Verwünschung fügt dem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Ergebnisses zu. Lege die Verrücktmachende Verwünschung dann an einen anderen, per Zufall bestimmten Gegner an.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch', 'flavor': 'Viel schmerzhafter als bloße Reue.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531991&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b46fcd6-ddc7-4a93-bd44-a09e10012bda', 'multiverseId': 531991}, 'multiverseid': 531991}, {'name': 'Maldición enloquecedora', 'text': 'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo que no sea de criatura, tira 1d6. La Maldición enloquecedora hace una cantidad de daño a ese jugador igual al resultado. Luego anexa la Maldición enloquecedora a otro de tus oponentes elegido al azar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura maldición', 'flavor': 'Un dolor mucho más inconmensurable que el arrepentimiento.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532045&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8a6796bd-7fb7-4bb0-8efb-11da7b74a5bc', 'multiverseId': 532045}, 'multiverseid': 532045}, {'name': 'Maléfice accablant', 'text': 'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort non-créature, lancez un d6. Le Maléfice accablant inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au résultat. Puis attachez le Maléfice accablant à un autre de vos adversaires choisi au hasard.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura et malédiction', 'flavor': 'Beaucoup plus douloureux que de simples regrets.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532099&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e7263e6-13fb-48a6-bd6e-b95ec8eb6c83', 'multiverseId': 532099}, 'multiverseid': 532099}, {'name': 'Sortilegio Dissennante', 'text': 'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia non creatura, tira un d6. Il Sortilegio Dissennante infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al risultato. Poi assegna il Sortilegio Dissennante a un altro dei tuoi avversari scelto a caso.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema', 'flavor': 'Molto più doloroso del semplice rimpianto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532153&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1aca9b24-dd63-48e6-b04a-0cc3ecbce467', 'multiverseId': 532153}, 'multiverseid': 532153}, {'name': '狂乱の呪詛', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、d6を１回振る。狂乱の呪詛はそのプレイヤーにその出目に等しい点数のダメージを与える。その後、あなたの対戦相手のうち他の１人を無作為に選び、狂乱の呪詛をそのプレイヤーにつける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': '単なる後悔よりも激しい痛み。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532207&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5cba50e7-978c-454a-a65c-e109b37d139f', 'multiverseId': 532207}, 'multiverseid': 532207}, {'name': 'Bruxaria Enlouquecedora', 'text': 'Encantar jogador\\nToda vez que o jogador encantado conjurar uma mágica não de criatura, role um d6. Bruxaria Enlouquecedora causa àquele jogador um dano igual ao resultado. Em seguida, anexe Bruxaria Enlouquecedora a outro oponente aleatório.', 'type': 'Encantamento — Aura Maldição', 'flavor': 'Muito mais dolorosa que um mero arrependimento.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532261&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75b42d01-5e09-425d-940b-b675bbf1d2bb', 'multiverseId': 532261}, 'multiverseid': 532261}, {'name': 'Сводящий с Ума Сглаз', 'text': 'Зачаровать игрока\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованный игрок разыгрывает не являющееся существом заклинание, бросьте d6. Сводящий с Ума Сглаз наносит тому игроку повреждения, равные результату броска. Затем прикрепите Сводящий с Ума Сглаз к другому вашему оппоненту, выбранному случайным образом.', 'type': 'Чары — Аура Проклятие', 'flavor': 'Гораздо больнее, чем простое сожаление.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532315&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ece33bf0-d0b7-49a7-b3a5-1aa132a6994f', 'multiverseId': 532315}, 'multiverseid': 532315}, {'name': '癫狂巫咒', 'text': '结附于牌手\\n每当所结附的牌手施放非生物咒语时，你掷一颗d6。癫狂巫咒对该牌手造成等同于掷骰结果的伤害。然后你随机选择另一位对手并将癫狂巫咒贴附于其上。', 'type': '结界 ～灵气／诅咒', 'flavor': '比区区悔恨更痛苦万倍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532369&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b43a91d-463c-496d-8f19-55e5114b3fa8', 'multiverseId': 532369}, 'multiverseid': 532369}, {'name': '癲狂巫咒', 'text': '結附於玩家\\n每當所結附的玩家施放非生物咒語時，你擲一顆d6。癲狂巫咒對該玩家造成等同於擲骰結果的傷害。然後你隨機選擇另一位對手並將癲狂巫咒貼附於其上。', 'type': '結界 ～靈氣／詛咒', 'flavor': '比區區悔恨更痛苦萬倍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532423&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd7a8268-560f-445c-9996-28c777d0613c', 'multiverseId': 532423}, 'multiverseid': 532423}]", "[{'name': 'Verrücktmachende Verwünschung', 'text': 'Verzaubert einen Spieler\\nImmer wenn der verzauberte Spieler einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkt, würfle einen W6. Die Verrücktmachende Verwünschung fügt dem Spieler Schadenspunkte in Höhe des Ergebnisses zu. Lege die Verrücktmachende Verwünschung dann an einen anderen, per Zufall bestimmten Gegner an.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Aura, Fluch', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531577&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c60ac8f8-136c-4e2e-a6a6-10c17afd3913', 'multiverseId': 531577}, 'multiverseid': 531577}, {'name': 'Maldición enloquecedora', 'text': 'Encantar jugador.\\nSiempre que el jugador encantado lance un hechizo que no sea de criatura, tira 1d6. La Maldición enloquecedora hace una cantidad de daño a ese jugador igual al resultado. Luego anexa la Maldición enloquecedora a otro de tus oponentes elegido al azar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Aura maldición', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531633&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f599f6b-c106-4eb7-958d-f821e6c63df3', 'multiverseId': 531633}, 'multiverseid': 531633}, {'name': 'Maléfice accablant', 'text': 'Enchanter : joueur\\nÀ chaque fois que le joueur enchanté lance un sort non-créature, lancez un d6. Le Maléfice accablant inflige à ce joueur un nombre de blessures égal au résultat. Puis attachez le Maléfice accablant à un autre de vos adversaires choisi au hasard.', 'type': 'Enchantement : aura et malédiction', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531689&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '75b9b25a-84fd-4869-a1b1-ae1c9c52da08', 'multiverseId': 531689}, 'multiverseid': 531689}, {'name': 'Sortilegio Dissennante', 'text': 'Incanta giocatore\\nOgniqualvolta il giocatore incantato lancia una magia non creatura, tira un d6. Il Sortilegio Dissennante infligge a quel giocatore danno pari al risultato. Poi assegna il Sortilegio Dissennante a un altro dei tuoi avversari scelto a caso.', 'type': 'Incantesimo — Aura Anatema', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531745&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '15ede49c-bca1-40ba-90e3-b2e5dcbb5efe', 'multiverseId': 531745}, 'multiverseid': 531745}, {'name': '狂乱の呪詛', 'text': 'エンチャント（プレイヤー）\\nエンチャントしているプレイヤーがクリーチャーでない呪文を唱えるたび、d6を１回振る。狂乱の呪詛はそのプレイヤーにその出目に等しい点数のダメージを与える。その後、あなたの対戦相手のうち他の１人を無作為に選び、狂乱の呪詛をそのプレイヤーにつける。', 'type': 'エンチャント — オーラ・呪い', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531801&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b44cf402-48e7-43bd-9c46-e268c0a09fed', 'multiverseId': 531801}, 'multiverseid': 531801}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verseuchter Gipfel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du einen Sumpf kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7827ece-49fa-408b-b3a2-cfd1a215d23d\', \'multiverseId\': 532864}, \'multiverseid\': 532864}, {\'name\': \'Cumbre contaminada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}. Activa esto solo si controlas un Pantano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efbd2004-4332-4c21-9741-5d8019122bb2\', \'multiverseId\': 533075}, \'multiverseid\': 533075}, {\'name\': \'Pic souillé\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez un marais.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533286&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c19c3a9-abba-47fd-97a6-c3d7ac8a3bfa\', \'multiverseId\': 533286}, \'multiverseid\': 533286}, {\'name\': \'Picco Contaminato\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {R}. Attiva solo se controlli una Palude.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3c2c2c-79d2-4c33-ad39-e88578d80040\', \'multiverseId\': 533497}, \'multiverseid\': 533497}, {\'name\': \'汚れた峰\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。あなたが沼をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7effc32-ec2a-493c-8342-4b2785dda514\', \'multiverseId\': 533708}, \'multiverseid\': 533708}, {\'name\': \'Cume Contaminado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {R}. Ative somente se você controlar um Pântano.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'259e5d46-e303-456b-8aaa-3dcda99cfa46\', \'multiverseId\': 533919}, \'multiverseid\': 533919}, {\'name\': \'Оскверненный Пик\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {R}. Активируйте, только если вы контролируете Болото.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f50b410b-02cc-43ee-b73e-ce974e57a182\', \'multiverseId\': 534130}, \'multiverseid\': 534130}, {\'name\': \'败坏山峰\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。只能于你操控沼泽时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd00ce96-a0c0-4e36-992a-daacd8607b19\', \'multiverseId\': 534341}, \'multiverseid\': 534341}, {\'name\': \'敗壞山峰\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。只能於你操控沼澤時起動。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe73a586-8ff0-4696-bcfa-4dbbec8d0c54\', \'multiverseId\': 534552}, \'multiverseid\': 534552}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verstoß gegen die Etikette\', \'text\': \'Stachle alle Kreaturen an, die du nicht kontrollierst. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greifen jene Kreaturen in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greifen einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Und dabei hatte der Abend so gut angefangen …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532720&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e639f1ab-68b5-40d0-8ba9-f733ac4f02ce\', \'multiverseId\': 532720}, \'multiverseid\': 532720}, {\'name\': \'Perturbación del decoro\', \'text\': \'Incita a todas las criaturas que no controlas. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esas criaturas atacan cada combate si pueden y atacan a un jugador que no seas tú si pueden.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las cenas y la política no son una buena combinación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cc4cb0e-bf8c-46f8-b3f6-5021fa761239\', \'multiverseId\': 532931}, \'multiverseid\': 532931}, {\'name\': \'Bouleversement des convenances\', \'text\': "Incitez toutes les créatures que vous ne contrôlez pas. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, ces créatures attaquent à chaque combat si possible et attaquent un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les banquets et la politique ne font pas bon ménage.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d9388ea-2e34-4c23-a088-0b411a78c1c2\', \'multiverseId\': 533142}, \'multiverseid\': 533142}, {\'name\': \'Trasgredire al Galateo\', \'text\': \'Sprona tutte le creature che non controlli. (Fino al tuo prossimo turno, quelle creature attaccano in ogni combattimento un giocatore diverso da te, se possono farlo.)\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Mai portare a tavola la politica.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533353&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcb17998-f4f6-4ce8-92d1-bd2c6da98482\', \'multiverseId\': 533353}, \'multiverseid\': 533353}, {\'name\': \'礼儀妨害\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていないすべてのクリーチャーを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、それらのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'食事に政治を持ち込むべからず。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533564&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d474d97-b7cf-4443-afbe-35598b239dfe\', \'multiverseId\': 533564}, \'multiverseid\': 533564}, {\'name\': \'Quebrar o Decoro\', \'text\': \'Atice todas as criaturas que você não controla. (Até seu próximo turno, aquelas criaturas atacam a cada combate se estiverem aptas e atacam um jogador que não seja você se estiverem aptas.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Jantar e política não se misturam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a905a37b-f76c-49d8-ab45-b08b1c42c030\', \'multiverseId\': 533775}, \'multiverseid\': 533775}, {\'name\': \'Забыть про Приличия\', \'text\': \'Разъярите все существа не под вашим контролем. (До вашего следующего хода те существа атакуют в каждом бою, если могут, и атакуют не вас, а другого игрока, если могут.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Ужин и политика плохо сочетаются.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d7b907b-e549-4d78-89be-0336cd131fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 533986}, \'multiverseid\': 533986}, {\'name\': \'礼数不周\', \'text\': \'煽惑所有不由你操控的生物。（直到你的下一个回合，那些生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'餐宴议事难两全。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4df0d95c-f109-44c3-a68b-bfc0b002e71e\', \'multiverseId\': 534197}, \'multiverseid\': 534197}, {\'name\': \'禮數不周\', \'text\': \'煽惑所有不由你操控的生物。（直到你的下一個回合，那些生物每次戰鬥若能攻擊，則必須攻擊，且若能攻擊除你以外的玩家，則必須如此作。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'餐宴議事難兩全。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534408&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a76008-92ed-4094-becc-752d634778f3\', \'multiverseId\': 534408}, \'multiverseid\': 534408}]', "[{'name': 'Versunkener Talkessel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.)\\nDer Versunkene Talkessel kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Insel, Sumpf', 'flavor': 'Auf dem Kontinent Tazeem stürzen rauschende Ströme enge Schluchten hinab, in nebelverhangene Seen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532863&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6e5570e8-8a27-4a7d-8f27-ae9793122a28', 'multiverseId': 532863}, 'multiverseid': 532863}, {'name': 'Hondonada profunda', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Hondonada profunda entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Isla pantano', 'flavor': 'En el continente de Tazeem, los ríos se abren paso a través de estrechos cañones y terminan en lagos sumidos en la niebla.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533074&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9a367c29-4b89-48eb-b927-d5253b74368b', 'multiverseId': 533074}, 'multiverseid': 533074}, {'name': 'Dépression engloutie', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.)\\nLa Dépression engloutie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain : île et marais', 'flavor': 'Sur le continent de Tazeem, les eaux tumultueuses passent dans des gorges étroites et se jettent dans des lacs embrumés.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533285&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fafc8af2-1334-4d3d-b4be-67d96f10c463', 'multiverseId': 533285}, 'multiverseid': 533285}, {'name': 'Conca Infossata', 'text': '({T}: Aggiungi {U} o {B}.)\\nLa Conca Infossata entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.', 'type': 'Terra — Isola Palude', 'flavor': 'Sul continente di Tazeem, acque impetuose si tuffano attraverso strette gole in laghi ammantati di nebbia.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533496&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f078e6d1-43f7-4c48-9248-598591d572fc', 'multiverseId': 533496}, 'multiverseid': 533496}, {'name': '窪み渓谷', 'text': '（{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、窪み渓谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 島・沼', 'flavor': 'タジーム大陸の急流は、狭い渓谷を抜けると霧に覆われた湖へと流れ込む。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533707&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e7d7f62e-652c-4061-b415-a254d58070e3', 'multiverseId': 533707}, 'multiverseid': 533707}, {'name': 'Vale Afundado', 'text': '({T}: Adicione {U} ou {B}.)\\nVale Afundado entra no campo de batalha virado, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.', 'type': 'Terreno — Ilha Pântano', 'flavor': 'No continente de Tazeem, corredeiras velozes mergulham por cânions estreitos rumo a lagos ocultos nas brumas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533918&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '78a0c6a0-1da2-490e-b718-6b069ae942c7', 'multiverseId': 533918}, 'multiverseid': 533918}, {'name': 'Затопленная Лощина', 'text': '({T}: добавьте {U} или {B}.)\\nЗатопленная Лощина выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.', 'type': 'Земля — Остров Болото', 'flavor': 'На континенте Тазим бурные реки несутся по узким каньонам, впадая в укрытые туманом озера.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534129&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8dca1e4f-8dac-41bd-b5ec-413016a9da03', 'multiverseId': 534129}, 'multiverseid': 534129}, {'name': '沉落幽谷', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}或{B}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则沉落幽谷须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 ～海岛／沼泽', 'flavor': '塔晋大陆上，湍急河水涌经迫窄峡谷，奔腾激流直入雾漫湖泊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534340&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2e779e50-94af-478e-8dd5-7b2075a3b95a', 'multiverseId': 534340}, 'multiverseid': 534340}, {'name': '沉落幽谷', 'text': '（{T}：加{U}或{B}。）\\n除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則沉落幽谷須橫置進戰場。', 'type': '地 ～海島／沼澤', 'flavor': '塔晉大陸上，湍急河水湧經迫窄峽谷，奔騰激流直入霧漫湖泊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534551&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ba6a1d2c-1538-43a9-bf72-aab9fa5f3885', 'multiverseId': 534551}, 'multiverseid': 534551}]", '[{\'name\': \'Verwegenes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W12 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Das Verwegene Unterfangen fügt jeder Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe des ausgesuchten Ergebnisses zu. Erzeuge so viele Schatz-Spielsteine, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Was brennt stärker? Dein Ehrgeiz oder die Flamme?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86fe5236-18b3-4669-b266-ed9c731b12b2\', \'multiverseId\': 531992}, \'multiverseid\': 531992}, {\'name\': \'Reto temerario\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d12 y elige un resultado. El Reto temerario hace una cantidad de daño igual al resultado a cada criatura. Luego crea una cantidad de fichas de Tesoro igual al otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'¿Pondrías las manos en el fuego por el botín?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1cb3ef-60fb-49a3-8135-7ac145aef3d0\', \'multiverseId\': 532046}, \'multiverseid\': 532046}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre téméraire\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d12 et choisissez un résultat. La Manœuvre téméraire inflige à chaque créature un nombre de blessures égal à ce résultat. Puis, créez un nombre de jetons Trésor égal à l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'est-ce qui brûle le plus ? Votre ambition, ou la flamme ?", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532100&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e47c629d-c1d1-4bed-94c7-48cfada069fa\', \'multiverseId\': 532100}, \'multiverseid\': 532100}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Avventata\', \'text\': "Tira due d12 e scegli un risultato. L\'Impresa Avventata infligge a ogni creatura danno pari a quel risultato. Poi crea un numero di pedine Tesoro pari all\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Cosa brucia con più ardore? La tua ambizione o la fiamma?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dad517d-0dd8-410a-ab4e-32852c0f6002\', \'multiverseId\': 532154}, \'multiverseid\': 532154}, {\'name\': \'無謀な挑戦\', \'text\': \'２個のd12を振り、出目１つを選ぶ。無謀な挑戦は各クリーチャーにそれぞれその出目に等しい点数のダメージを与える。その後、もう１つの出目に等しい数の宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'どちらが激しく燃え上がるかな？お前の野心と、この炎では？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b67613b0-ba4d-4b03-8c3a-e9847fbea44e\', \'multiverseId\': 532208}, \'multiverseid\': 532208}, {\'name\': \'Empreitada Incauta\', \'text\': \'Role dois d12 e escolha um resultado. Empreitada Incauta causa dano igual àquele resultado a cada criatura. Em seguida, crie um número de fichas de Tesouro igual ao outro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'O que arde mais intensamente? Sua ambição ou a chama?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51f456e0-2a1f-4d32-a0af-b69d9266405e\', \'multiverseId\': 532262}, \'multiverseid\': 532262}, {\'name\': \'Безрассудное Предприятие\', \'text\': \'Бросьте два d12 и выберите один результат. Безрассудное Предприятие наносит каждому существу повреждения, равные тому результату. Затем создайте количество фишек Клада, равное другому результату.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Что горит жарче? Твои амбиции или пламя?\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532316&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b4ba977-bedb-4a9c-88b8-92a765161ee8\', \'multiverseId\': 532316}, \'multiverseid\': 532316}, {\'name\': \'鲁莽勇进\', \'text\': \'掷两颗d12并选择一个掷骰结果。鲁莽勇进对每个生物各造成伤害，其数量等同于该掷骰结果。然后派出若干珍宝衍生物，其数量等同于另一个掷骰结果。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'猜猜哪个烧得更旺，是你的野心，还是这团烈焰？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532370&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02a5d20b-bcf3-48f9-8b8e-0578bc871d09\', \'multiverseId\': 532370}, \'multiverseid\': 532370}, {\'name\': \'魯莽勇進\', \'text\': \'擲兩顆d12並選擇一個擲骰結果。魯莽勇進對每個生物各造成傷害，其數量等同於該擲骰結果。然後派出若干珍寶衍生物，其數量等同於另一個擲骰結果。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'猜猜哪個燒得更旺，是你的野心，還是這團烈焰？\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c93ae4f2-3918-43a3-9c87-860abb296f59\', \'multiverseId\': 532424}, \'multiverseid\': 532424}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verwegenes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W12 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Das Verwegene Unterfangen fügt jeder Kreatur Schadenspunkte in Höhe des ausgesuchten Ergebnisses zu. Erzeuge so viele Schatz-Spielsteine, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531578&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddc4684b-1e83-46d0-be36-f1a8ba2c482b\', \'multiverseId\': 531578}, \'multiverseid\': 531578}, {\'name\': \'Reto temerario\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d12 y elige un resultado. El Reto temerario hace una cantidad de daño igual al resultado a cada criatura. Luego crea una cantidad de fichas de Tesoro igual al otro resultado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531634&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2e9c2b3-c823-4642-8b6d-e18b225be647\', \'multiverseId\': 531634}, \'multiverseid\': 531634}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre téméraire\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d12 et choisissez un résultat. La Manœuvre téméraire inflige à chaque créature un nombre de blessures égal à ce résultat. Puis, créez un nombre de jetons Trésor égal à l\'autre résultat.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531690&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fa0ff96-d255-4710-9d93-63038b681744\', \'multiverseId\': 531690}, \'multiverseid\': 531690}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Avventata\', \'text\': "Tira due d12 e scegli un risultato. L\'Impresa Avventata infligge a ogni creatura danno pari a quel risultato. Poi crea un numero di pedine Tesoro pari all\'altro risultato.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a1c68d4-4cb2-4f1d-8423-5c063c668607\', \'multiverseId\': 531746}, \'multiverseid\': 531746}, {\'name\': \'無謀な挑戦\', \'text\': \'d12を２回振り、出目１つを選ぶ。無謀なる挑戦は各クリーチャーにそれぞれその出目に等しい点数のダメージを与える。その後、もう１つの出目に等しい数の宝物・トークンを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fb9f89a-9e4b-4de4-889e-0c66ba00c64e\', \'multiverseId\': 531802}, \'multiverseid\': 531802}]', '[{\'name\': \'Verzehrende Dämpfe\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl opfert eine Kreatur. Du erhältst Lebenspunkte in Höhe der Widerstandskraft der geopferten Kreatur dazu.\\nAbprall (Falls du diesen Zauberspruch aus deiner Hand wirkst, schicke ihn ins Exil, sowie er verrechnet wird. Zu Beginn deines nächsten Versorgungssegments kannst du diese Karte aus dem Exil wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532694&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1672ea2-5fa6-4ef6-b08d-e0eafa921e92\', \'multiverseId\': 532694}, \'multiverseid\': 532694}, {\'name\': \'Vapores consumidores\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo sacrifica una criatura. Ganas una cantidad de vidas igual a la resistencia de esa criatura.\\nRebote. (Si lanzas este hechizo desde tu mano, exílialo en cuanto se resuelva. Al comienzo de tu próximo mantenimiento, puedes lanzar esta carta desde el exilio sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532905&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ac26e5-7726-4a0d-9dc3-ca1db3b76b30\', \'multiverseId\': 532905}, \'multiverseid\': 532905}, {\'name\': \'Vapeurs dévorantes\', \'text\': "Un joueur ciblé sacrifie une créature. Vous gagnez un nombre de points de vie égal à l\'endurance de cette créature.\\nRebond (Si vous lancez ce sort depuis votre main, exilez-le au moment où il se résout. Au début de votre prochain entretien, vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis l\'exil sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e93bb8d1-e0f2-4e1f-b616-ae3b75afb98e\', \'multiverseId\': 533116}, \'multiverseid\': 533116}, {\'name\': \'Vapori Distruttivi\', \'text\': "Un giocatore bersaglio sacrifica una creatura. Guadagni punti vita pari alla costituzione di quella creatura.\\nRipresa (Se lanci questa magia dalla tua mano, esiliala mentre si risolve. All\'inizio del tuo prossimo mantenimento, puoi lanciare questa carta dall\'esilio senza pagare il suo costo di mana.)", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7fecef3-ef34-4ba5-801f-717628236fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 533327}, \'multiverseid\': 533327}, {\'name\': \'消耗の蒸気\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。あなたはそのクリーチャーのタフネスに等しい点数のライフを得る。\\n反復（この呪文をあなたの手札から唱えていたなら、これの解決に際し、これを追放する。次のあなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは追放領域にあるこのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533538&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a952d7b-8df6-4860-908a-98c8ef1b294a\', \'multiverseId\': 533538}, \'multiverseid\': 533538}, {\'name\': \'Vapores Devastantes\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo sacrifica uma criatura. Você ganha uma quantidade de pontos de vida igual à resistência daquela criatura.\\nRebote (Se você conjurar esta mágica da sua mão, exile-a conforme ela for resolvida. No início de sua próxima manutenção, você poderá conjurar este card do exílio sem pagar seu custo de mana.)\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2d7ebe9-38ac-4f6f-9983-ef55e35e5992\', \'multiverseId\': 533749}, \'multiverseid\': 533749}, {\'name\': \'Всепоглощающие Пары\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок приносит в жертву существо. Вы получаете количество жизней, равное выносливости того существа.\\nОтскок (Изгоните это заклинание в момент его разрешения, если вы разыгрываете его из вашей руки. В начале вашего следующего шага поддержки вы можете разыграть эту карту из изгнания без уплаты ее мана-стоимости.)\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f63a3f94-a6c2-44cf-8766-c53acfe8e989\', \'multiverseId\': 533960}, \'multiverseid\': 533960}, {\'name\': \'化骨毒气\', \'text\': \'目标牌手牺牲一个生物。你获得等同于该生物防御力的生命。\\n弹回（如果你从你手上施放此咒语，于它结算时将之放逐。在你的下一个维持开始时，你可以从放逐区施放此牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97dd0eed-a1a6-417d-a0d7-9f85385e2df4\', \'multiverseId\': 534171}, \'multiverseid\': 534171}, {\'name\': \'化骨毒氣\', \'text\': \'目標玩家犧牲一個生物。你獲得等同於該生物防禦力的生命。\\n彈回（如果你從你手上施放此咒語，於它結算時將之放逐。在你的下一個維持開始時，你可以從放逐區施放此牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。）\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4653dc51-bb37-4c99-bea7-095befb160e7\', \'multiverseId\': 534382}, \'multiverseid\': 534382}]', '[{\'name\': \'Viridischer Langbogen\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat „{T}: Diese Kreatur fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu."\\nAusrüsten {3} ({3}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e0ac398-c623-430b-83d8-d53a06fe7e27\', \'multiverseId\': 532819}, \'multiverseid\': 532819}, {\'name\': \'Arco largo viridiano\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene "{T}: Esta criatura hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo".\\nEquipar {3}. ({3}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7404fb1-82e0-47cd-9733-c89945c1a2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 533030}, \'multiverseid\': 533030}, {\'name\': \'Arc long viridian\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a « {T} : Cette créature inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible. »\\nÉquipement {3} ({3} : Attachez à une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533241&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c1e31c6-5b1d-4389-b8f9-f8a8d970ae2d\', \'multiverseId\': 533241}, \'multiverseid\': 533241}, {\'name\': \'Arco Lungo Viridiano\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata ha "{T}: Questa creatura infligge 1 danno a un qualsiasi bersaglio".\\nEquipaggiare {3} ({3}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo come una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533452&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66e0bb5f-959a-4504-81f2-dba3fb9ff85a\', \'multiverseId\': 533452}, \'multiverseid\': 533452}, {\'name\': \'ヴィリジアンの長弓\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは「{T}：クリーチャーやプレインズウォーカーやプレイヤーのうち１つを対象とする。このクリーチャーはそれに１点のダメージを与える。」を持つ。\\n装備{3}（{3}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf54bdf8-6302-45a3-8cba-eb98b738d73a\', \'multiverseId\': 533663}, \'multiverseid\': 533663}, {\'name\': \'Arco Longo Viridiano\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada tem "{T}: Ela causa 1 ponto de dano a qualquer alvo".\\nEquipar {3} ({3}: Anexe este equipamento à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'665fffcd-bb88-499b-863a-add8d06fdb5c\', \'multiverseId\': 533874}, \'multiverseid\': 533874}, {\'name\': \'Виридийский Лук\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо имеет способность «{T}: это существо наносит 1 повреждение любой цели».\\nСнарядить {3} ({3}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c97f89d-946b-49d1-b822-61c82fb5876e\', \'multiverseId\': 534085}, \'multiverseid\': 534085}, {\'name\': \'暗碧族长弓\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有「{T}：此生物对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。」\\n佩带{3}（{3}：贴附在目标由你操控的生物上。只能于法术时机佩带。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b4bfabd-d2b7-46f4-8650-2f4b322bd1ef\', \'multiverseId\': 534296}, \'multiverseid\': 534296}, {\'name\': \'暗碧族長弓\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物具有「{T}：此生物對任意一個目標造成1點傷害。」\\n佩帶{3}（{3}：貼附在目標由你操控的生物上。只能於巫術時機佩帶。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534507&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11739bd2-6a67-4bf8-b32c-41e4907c8dd0\', \'multiverseId\': 534507}, \'multiverseid\': 534507}]', '[{\'name\': \'Visionen nach Serumsgenuss\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte. Hellsicht 2.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Serum wurde einst aus Mirrodins Blinkmotten gewonnen und bot Visionen der Inspiration. Nun stammt es aus phyrexianischen Tintenmotten und bietet Visionen der Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532692&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a11713-89d7-4850-8749-f7a4743aa8bf\', \'multiverseId\': 532692}, \'multiverseid\': 532692}, {\'name\': \'Visiones del suero\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta. Adivina 2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El suero derivaba de las polillas titilantes de Mirrodin y ofrecía visiones inspiradoras. Ahora proviene de las polillas de tinta pirexianas y concede visiones de perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'760a60c8-3298-407f-96ec-41ff937dbe03\', \'multiverseId\': 532903}, \'multiverseid\': 532903}, {\'name\': \'Visions nées du sérum\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte. Regard 2.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Le sérum était autrefois dérivé des scintimites de Mirrodin, et il offrait des visions d\'inspiration. Désormais, il est extrait des encrimites phyrexians, imposant des visions de perfection.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533114&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c90a6e48-8ffd-4d77-a919-062d2cfe7008\', \'multiverseId\': 533114}, \'multiverseid\': 533114}, {\'name\': \'Visioni del Siero\', \'text\': \'Pesca una carta. Profetizza 2.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Il siero veniva un tempo ricavato dai lampidotteri di Mirrodin e induceva visioni ispiratrici. Ora viene estratto dagli atrodotteri di Phyrexia e produce visioni di perfezione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b113b398-af1c-422e-9323-f7ef31dab94c\', \'multiverseId\': 533325}, \'multiverseid\': 533325}, {\'name\': \'血清の幻視\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。占術２を行う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'かつて、血清はミラディンのちらつき蛾から採取されて霊感の幻視をもたらしていた。現在の血清はファイレクシアの墨蛾から採取されて完成の幻視をもたらす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fc7d0d9-28b7-4ba0-8abd-0e9616271d22\', \'multiverseId\': 533536}, \'multiverseid\': 533536}, {\'name\': \'Visões do Soro\', \'text\': \'Compre um card. Use vidência 2.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Houve um tempo em que o soro era extraído dos mosco-lumes de Mirrodin, oferecendo visões de inspiração. Agora, ele é extraído de mosco-tintas phyrexianos, e concede visões da perfeição.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86fdb658-c5d3-41d9-888e-2660edc61462\', \'multiverseId\': 533747}, \'multiverseid\': 533747}, {\'name\': \'Видения Сыворотки\', \'text\': \'Возьмите карту. Предскажите 2.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Когда-то сыворотку получали из мерцмолей Мирродина, и она давала вдохновляющие видения. Теперь ее вытягивают из фирексийских черномолей, и она несет видения совершенства.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a396f97b-e438-4888-8ba9-e116bacad443\', \'multiverseId\': 533958}, \'multiverseid\': 533958}, {\'name\': \'浆液预视\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'原本采自秘罗地光蛾的浆液，可让饮者眼中见得启悟。如今浆液萃自非瑞克西亚墨蛾，能令受者眼中得见完美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd8986f2-1ebc-47ca-a407-2988df7637cc\', \'multiverseId\': 534169}, \'multiverseid\': 534169}, {\'name\': \'漿液預視\', \'text\': \'抽一張牌。占卜2。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'原本採自秘羅地光蛾的漿液，可讓飲者眼中見得啟悟。如今漿液萃自非瑞克西亞墨蛾，能令受者眼中得見完美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7c9161a-27da-4a93-a0b8-79c7fa22d37d\', \'multiverseId\': 534380}, \'multiverseid\': 534380}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vitu-Ghazi, der Stadtbaum\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Saproling-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Im Herbst wirft er seine Samen nach unten auf die Straßen, und im Frühling sprießen seine Kinder, um dem Konklave zu dienen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eb15347-9809-457e-bba0-e0821d21fa2b\', \'multiverseId\': 532870}, \'multiverseid\': 532870}, {\'name\': \'Vitu-Ghazi, el árbol ciudad\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Crea una ficha de criatura Saprolín verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En otoño, ella esparce las semillas por las calles, y cuando llega la primavera, sus hijos se alzan al servicio del Cónclave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff9945c3-b14f-4ca6-a33d-135bf5f4dfe3\', \'multiverseId\': 533081}, \'multiverseid\': 533081}, {\'name\': \'Vitu-Ghazi, la Citarborescence\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W},{T} : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Saprobionte.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'En automne, elle sème ses graines dans les rues, et quand vient le printemps, ses enfants germent au service du Conclave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533292&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d0ba81-696a-4322-872c-629bd220a51d\', \'multiverseId\': 533292}, \'multiverseid\': 533292}, {\'name\': "Vitu-Ghazi, l\'Albero-Città", \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Crea una pedina creatura Saprolingio 1/1 verde.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'In autunno getta i propri semi nelle vie sottostanti, e quando giunge la primavera i suoi figli sorgono per servire il Conclave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7956b6b6-4dcb-4360-b478-f23ad8190fff\', \'multiverseId\': 533503}, \'multiverseid\': 533503}, {\'name\': \'都市の樹、ヴィトゥ＝ガジー\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}：緑の１/１の苗木・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'秋にはそれはすぐ下の通りに種を蒔く。春になると、そこから生まれた子供たちが議事会に仕えるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5463b9-02b0-47c6-b55a-22fd1b07c7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 533714}, \'multiverseid\': 533714}, {\'name\': \'Vitu-Ghazi, a Árvore-cidade\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: Crie uma ficha de criatura Saprófita verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'No outono, ela lança as próprias sementes pelas ruas abaixo e, na primavera, sua prole se ergue a serviço do Conclave.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52d4484b-3a1f-4aac-86fe-e8038e839f26\', \'multiverseId\': 533925}, \'multiverseid\': 533925}, {\'name\': \'Виту-Гази, Город-Дерево\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{2}{G}{W}, {T}: создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Сапролинг.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Осенью она разбрасывает свои семена по улицам внизу, а когда приходит весна, ее дети восходят, чтобы служить Конклаву.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfaa742e-db82-4f8e-b1fb-bfd6ec19c3f5\', \'multiverseId\': 534136}, \'multiverseid\': 534136}, {\'name\': \'树都维图加基\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}：派出一个1/1绿色腐生物衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在秋季，她将种子洒落在下方市街；到了春季，她的孩子将挺身卫护盟会。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534347&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b32e67d5-116a-4b9b-9240-fefadb221d62\', \'multiverseId\': 534347}, \'multiverseid\': 534347}, {\'name\': \'樹都維圖加基\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{G}{W}，{T}：派出一個1/1綠色腐生物衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在秋季，她將種子灑落在下方市街；到了春季，她的孩子將挺身衛護盟會。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d483ae78-a058-4212-b216-aaaae18acc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 534558}, \'multiverseid\': 534558}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vliesmähnen-Löwe\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}: Monstrum 1. (Falls diese Kreatur nicht monströs ist, lege eine +1/+1-Marke auf sie und sie wird monströs.)\\nSolange der Vliesmähnen-Löwe monströs ist, hat er Fluchsicherheit und Unzerstörbarkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532783&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6915e93-0f05-41eb-9c6b-156b008361fb\', \'multiverseId\': 532783}, \'multiverseid\': 532783}, {\'name\': \'León melena de lana\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}: Monstruosidad 1. (Si esta criatura no es monstruosa, pon un contador +1/+1 sobre ella y se convierte en monstruosa.)\\nMientras el León melena de lana sea monstruoso, tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio e indestructible.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc2f53c9-d402-48ca-998d-5d87e84e8c86\', \'multiverseId\': 532994}, \'multiverseid\': 532994}, {\'name\': \'Lion à crinière bouclée\', \'text\': "{3}{G}{W} : Monstruosité 1. (Si cette créature n\'est pas monstrueuse, mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur elle et elle devient monstrueuse.)\\nTant que le Lion à crinière bouclée est monstrueux, il a la défense talismanique et l\'indestructible.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdb1f080-81c4-4150-a291-8580c42f2770\', \'multiverseId\': 533205}, \'multiverseid\': 533205}, {\'name\': \'Leone Vellocriniera\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}: Mostruosità 1. (Se questa creatura non è mostruosa, metti un segnalino +1/+1 su di essa e diventa mostruosa.)\\nFintanto che il Leone Vellocriniera è mostruoso, ha anti-malocchio e indistruttibile.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7570ea2d-16e2-4458-89c0-d9a830379dee\', \'multiverseId\': 533416}, \'multiverseid\': 533416}, {\'name\': \'羊毛鬣のライオン\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}：怪物化１を行う。（このクリーチャーが怪物的でない場合、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター１個を置く。これは怪物的になる。）\\n羊毛鬣のライオンが怪物的であるかぎり、これは呪禁と破壊不能を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b0f48f-23a6-4240-82cd-3df4bd767f1d\', \'multiverseId\': 533627}, \'multiverseid\': 533627}, {\'name\': \'Leão da Juba Lanosa\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}: Monstruosidade 1. (Se esta criatura não for monstruosa, coloque um marcador +1/+1 nela e ela se tornará monstruosa.)\\nEnquanto Leão da Juba Lanosa for monstruoso, ele terá resistência a magia e será indestrutível.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533838&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53ac70ab-bbd8-44ef-9a60-76228c05ffcc\', \'multiverseId\': 533838}, \'multiverseid\': 533838}, {\'name\': \'Руногривый Лев\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}: Чудовищность 1. (Если это существо не является чудовищным, положите на него один жетон +1/+1, и оно становится чудовищным.)\\nПока Руногривый Лев является чудовищным, он имеет Порчеустойчивость и Неразрушимость.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c8a4345-074e-45db-a22d-1211cbba98a7\', \'multiverseId\': 534049}, \'multiverseid\': 534049}, {\'name\': \'绒毛狮\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}：蛮化1。（如果此生物未蛮化，则在其上放置一个+1/+1指示物且它已蛮化。）\\n只要绒毛狮已蛮化，它便具有辟邪与不灭异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56b856d2-1d66-4b09-9205-dd53a06faf5a\', \'multiverseId\': 534260}, \'multiverseid\': 534260}, {\'name\': \'絨毛獅\', \'text\': \'{3}{G}{W}：蠻化1。（如果此生物未蠻化，則在其上放置一個+1/+1指示物且它已蠻化。）\\n只要絨毛獅已蠻化，它便具有辟邪與不滅異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c0efc4-bb6b-4040-a25c-cf967e6d3ead\', \'multiverseId\': 534471}, \'multiverseid\': 534471}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Zorn der Vorfahren\', \'text\': \'Erzürnen — Immer wenn Vrondiss, Zorn der Vorfahren, Schaden zugefügt wird, kannst du einen 5/4 roten und grünen Drache-Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur Schaden zufügt, opfere sie" erzeugen.\\nImmer wenn du mit einem oder mehreren Würfeln würfelst, kannst du Vrondiss sich selbst 1 Schadenspunkt zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache Barbar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3ea27fc-d276-4356-97e1-ec5315ac187e\', \'multiverseId\': 531604}, \'multiverseid\': 531604}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Furia de los Antiguos\', \'text\': \'Enfurecer — Siempre que Vrondiss, Furia de los Antiguos reciba daño, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Espíritu Dragón roja y verde 5/4 con "Cuando esta criatura haga daño, sacrifícala".\\nSiempre que tires uno o más dados, puedes hacer que Vrondiss se haga 1 punto de daño a sí mismo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bárbaro dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21ba9de8-c8b4-4195-b439-4d5a5129975d\', \'multiverseId\': 531660}, \'multiverseid\': 531660}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, rage des anciens\', \'text\': "Rage — À chaque fois que Vrondiss, rage des anciens subit des blessures, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 5/4 rouge et verte Dragon et Esprit avec « Quand cette créature inflige des blessures, sacrifiez-la. »\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez au moins un dé, vous pouvez faire que Vrondiss s\'inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et barbare\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531716&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6fcfb68-e07d-496f-aa48-68a963a8706a\', \'multiverseId\': 531716}, \'multiverseid\': 531716}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Ira degli Antenati\', \'text\': \'Infuriare — Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a Vrondiss, Ira degli Antenati, puoi creare una pedina creatura Spirito Drago 5/4 rossa e verde con "Quando questa creatura infligge danno, sacrificala".\\nOgniqualvolta tiri uno o più dadi, puoi far infliggere a Vrondiss 1 danno a se stesso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Barbaro Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94c8ecd1-3745-4fae-997a-022514290657\', \'multiverseId\': 531772}, \'multiverseid\': 531772}, {\'name\': \'古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディス\', \'text\': \'激昂 ― 古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディスがダメージを受けるたび、あなたは「このクリーチャーがダメージを与えたとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ赤緑の５/４のドラゴン・スピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\\nあなたが１個以上のサイコロを振るたび、あなたは「古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディスはそれ自身に１点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b863ab9c-4e2d-4812-89fe-876ace7bbabb\', \'multiverseId\': 531828}, \'multiverseid\': 531828}]', '[{\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Zorn der Vorfahren\', \'text\': \'Erzürnen — Immer wenn Vrondiss, Zorn der Vorfahren, Schaden zugefügt wird, kannst du einen 5/4 roten und grünen Drache-Geist-Kreaturenspielstein mit „Wenn diese Kreatur Schaden zufügt, opfere sie" erzeugen.\\nImmer wenn du mit einem oder mehreren Würfeln würfelst, kannst du Vrondiss sich selbst 1 Schadenspunkt zufügen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache Barbar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0205770c-ce5f-4b16-83b0-52f95acc92ad\', \'multiverseId\': 531837}, \'multiverseid\': 531837}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Furia de los Antiguos\', \'text\': \'Enfurecer — Siempre que Vrondiss, Furia de los Antiguos reciba daño, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Espíritu Dragón roja y verde 5/4 con "Cuando esta criatura haga daño, sacrifícala".\\nSiempre que tires uno o más dados, puedes hacer que Vrondiss se haga 1 punto de daño a sí mismo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bárbaro dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c753797-4d20-44ff-afee-61f3cb3ffe73\', \'multiverseId\': 531841}, \'multiverseid\': 531841}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, rage des anciens\', \'text\': "Rage — À chaque fois que Vrondiss, rage des anciens subit des blessures, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 5/4 rouge et verte Dragon et Esprit avec « Quand cette créature inflige des blessures, sacrifiez-la. »\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez au moins un dé, vous pouvez faire que Vrondiss s\'inflige 1 blessure.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : dragon et barbare\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531845&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12558a77-079e-4333-8c0e-09d2b36a21ce\', \'multiverseId\': 531845}, \'multiverseid\': 531845}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Ira degli Antenati\', \'text\': \'Infuriare — Ogniqualvolta viene inflitto danno a Vrondiss, Ira degli Antenati, puoi creare una pedina creatura Spirito Drago 5/4 rossa e verde con "Quando questa creatura infligge danno, sacrificala".\\nOgniqualvolta tiri uno o più dadi, puoi far infliggere a Vrondiss 1 danno a se stesso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Barbaro Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f111cf6b-a386-4635-b761-98cd954dfb1b\', \'multiverseId\': 531849}, \'multiverseid\': 531849}, {\'name\': \'古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディス\', \'text\': \'激昂 ― 古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディスがダメージを受けるたび、あなたは「このクリーチャーがダメージを与えたとき、これを生け贄に捧げる。」を持つ赤緑の５/４のドラゴン・スピリット・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\\nあなたが１個以上のサイコロを振るたび、あなたは「古き者どもの激怒、ヴロンディスはそれ自身に１点のダメージを与える。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323c3cc9-cdaa-43a8-9376-5e31fc679819\', \'multiverseId\': 531853}, \'multiverseid\': 531853}, {\'name\': \'Vrondiss, Fúria dos Antigos\', \'text\': \'Enfurecer — Toda vez que Vrondiss, Fúria dos Antigos, sofre dano, você pode criar uma ficha de criatura Dragão Espírito vermelha e verde 5/4 com "Quando esta criatura causar dano, sacrifique-a".\\nToda vez que rola um ou mais dados, você pode fazer com que Vrondiss cause 1 ponto de dano a si mesmo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Bárbaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'737af57c-cea2-4a39-851c-e5b63ce3d29e\', \'multiverseId\': 531857}, \'multiverseid\': 531857}, {\'name\': \'Врондисс, Ярость Древних\', \'text\': \'Неистовство — Каждый раз, когда Врондиссу, Ярости Древних наносятся повреждения, вы можете создать одну фишку существа 5/4 красный и зеленый Дракон Дух со способностью «Когда это существо наносит повреждения, пожертвуйте его».\\nКаждый раз, когда вы бросаете один или несколько кубиков, вы можете заставить Врондисса нанести 1 повреждение самому себе.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Дракон Варвар\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66546a08-5c76-4e7b-872e-2f7b9aa55a73\', \'multiverseId\': 531861}, \'multiverseid\': 531861}, {\'name\': \'先祖之怒沃隆迪斯\', \'text\': \'激怒～每当先祖之怒沃隆迪斯受到伤害时，你可以派出一个5/4，红绿双色的龙／精怪衍生生物，且具有「当此生物造成伤害时，将它牺牲。」\\n每当你掷一颗或数颗骰子时，你可以使沃隆迪斯对本身造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～龙／野蛮人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ec0da91-31cc-44c0-9e62-f180b3f0cd74\', \'multiverseId\': 531865}, \'multiverseid\': 531865}, {\'name\': \'先祖之怒沃隆迪斯\', \'text\': \'激怒～每當先祖之怒沃隆迪斯受到傷害時，你可以派出一個5/4，紅綠雙色的龍／精靈衍生生物，且具有「當此生物造成傷害時，將它犧牲。」\\n每當你擲一顆或數顆骰子時，你可以使沃隆迪斯對本身造成1點傷害。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～龍／野蠻人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8a869e2-f9c0-45e6-88fe-043f1f4a57f3\', \'multiverseId\': 531869}, \'multiverseid\': 531869}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wieder aufstehendes Skelett\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Bringe das Wieder aufstehende Skelett aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Skelett, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Manchmal kommen sie mit einem falschen Schenkelknochen oder einem schiefen Kiefer daher, aber sie tauchen immer wieder auf."\\n—Zul Ashur, Lichfürst\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532707&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac85c433-1e95-4dd2-b593-0ad74f22ca50\', \'multiverseId\': 532707}, \'multiverseid\': 532707}, {\'name\': \'Esqueleto reconstruyéndose\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Regresa el Esqueleto reconstruyéndose de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero esqueleto\', \'flavor\': \'"Puede que aparezcan con un hueso mal puesto o sin la mandíbula, pero siempre aparecen".\\n—Zul Ashur, señor liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1859727e-b293-42c6-b945-0f1bbb2adacb\', \'multiverseId\': 532918}, \'multiverseid\': 532918}, {\'name\': \'Squelette réassemblable\', \'text\': \'{1}{B} : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagé, le Squelette réassemblable depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature : squelette et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'« Ils ont parfois le mauvais fémur ou la mauvaise mâchoire, mais ils viennent toujours. »\\n—Zul Ashur, seigneur liche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533129&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6959c1e9-4025-4a46-a6a6-1dbdee903d47\', \'multiverseId\': 533129}, \'multiverseid\': 533129}, {\'name\': \'Scheletro Riassemblato\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia lo Scheletro Riassemblato TAPpato dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Scheletro\', \'flavor\': \'"Possono farsi vivi con il femore o la mandibola sbagliati, ma si fanno sempre vivi."\\n—Zul Ashur, signore dei lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533340&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5254239d-4257-4d1a-840a-cc1c618a6377\', \'multiverseId\': 533340}, \'multiverseid\': 533340}, {\'name\': \'組み直しの骸骨\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：あなたの墓地にある組み直しの骸骨をタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スケルトン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「脚や顎の骨が違っていることもあるが、必ずこの場に現れる。」\\n――死者の王、ザル・アシュール\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533551&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b9ee067-dca5-4575-b9d0-233a94c3ec36\', \'multiverseId\': 533551}, \'multiverseid\': 533551}, {\'name\': \'Esqueleto Remontado\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: Devolva Esqueleto Remontado de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esqueleto Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Eles podem até vir com um fêmur ou uma mandíbula trocados, mas sempre vêm."\\n— Zul Ashur, senhor lich\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c0dcf9c-18b3-4248-a8b2-1a24abb7a6b4\', \'multiverseId\': 533762}, \'multiverseid\': 533762}, {\'name\': \'Пересобирающийся Скелет\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}: верните Пересобирающийся Скелет из вашего кладбища на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Скелет Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Они могут явиться с берцовой костью не на месте или с чужой челюстью, но они всегда являются».\\n— Зул Ашур, лорд-лич\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ea9144f-2c67-4881-bcb8-8de3db7c4a15\', \'multiverseId\': 533973}, \'multiverseid\': 533973}, {\'name\': \'重组骷髅妖\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：将重组骷髅妖从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～骷髅妖／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「他们现身时可能装错了大腿骨或颔骨，但他们总是会现身。」\\n～巫妖领主祝亚许\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96c81c8-b665-4973-a9f1-1d1e7df2bf8a\', \'multiverseId\': 534184}, \'multiverseid\': 534184}, {\'name\': \'重組骷髏妖\', \'text\': \'{1}{B}：將重組骷髏妖從你的墳墓場橫置移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～骷髏妖／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「他們現身時可能裝錯了大腿骨或頷骨，但他們總是會現身。」\\n～巫妖領主祝亞許\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2995867-2e2d-4a19-bbad-4aa3b2c37136\', \'multiverseId\': 534395}, \'multiverseid\': 534395}]', "[{'name': 'Wiederbeleben', 'text': 'Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Anzahl der Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurden.\\n1—14 | Bringe alle Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurden.\\n15+ | Bringe jene Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531555&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5c12fc2-7812-49ca-b5d5-43e1e3656ddd', 'multiverseId': 531555}, 'multiverseid': 531555}, {'name': 'Reanimación', 'text': 'Tira 1d20 y suma la cantidad de cartas de criatura de tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno.\\n1—14 | Regresa a tu mano todas las cartas de criatura de tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno.\\n15+ | Regresa esas cartas de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531611&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c0f9d082-03f7-4ede-b02d-d544706df0db', 'multiverseId': 531611}, 'multiverseid': 531611}, {'name': 'Sort de réanimation', 'text': 'Lancez un d20 et ajoutez au résultat le nombre de cartes de créature de votre cimetière qui y ont été mises ce tour-ci depuis le champ de bataille.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez dans votre main toutes les cartes de créature de votre cimetière qui y ont été mises ce tour-ci depuis le champ de bataille.\\n15+ | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille ces cartes de votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531667&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5f74c740-3f54-42d2-a7c6-c641f9a9e14a', 'multiverseId': 531667}, 'multiverseid': 531667}, {'name': 'Rivivificare', 'text': 'Tira un d20 e aggiungi il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero che vi sono state messe dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\\n1—14 | Riprendi in mano tutte le carte creatura nel tuo cimitero che vi sono state messe dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\\n15+ | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quelle carte dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531723&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9fc54d3b-5b0c-4aa9-b408-29a4afdc1c59', 'multiverseId': 531723}, 'multiverseid': 531723}, {'name': 'リヴィヴィファイ', 'text': 'd20を１回振り、このターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれてその領域にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数を加える。\\n1—14 | このターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれてその領域にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n15+ | それらのカードをあなたの墓地から戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531779&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fa9447d1-a113-4d7a-89b7-d3d98a6bd64d', 'multiverseId': 531779}, 'multiverseid': 531779}]", "[{'name': 'Wiederbeleben', 'text': 'Würfle einen W20 und addiere dazu die Anzahl der Kreaturenkarten in deinem Friedhof, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurden.\\n1—14 | Bringe alle Kreaturenkarten aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück, die in diesem Zug aus dem Spiel dorthin gelegt wurden.\\n15+ | Bringe jene Karten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531969&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72e4d1ed-5e4c-4345-a3f4-82576d088091', 'multiverseId': 531969}, 'multiverseid': 531969}, {'name': 'Reanimación', 'text': 'Tira 1d20 y suma la cantidad de cartas de criatura de tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno.\\n1—14 | Regresa a tu mano todas las cartas de criatura de tu cementerio que hayan ido allí desde el campo de batalla este turno.\\n15+ | Regresa esas cartas de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532023&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '273df381-6ce8-4ca9-911e-2a068f1da046', 'multiverseId': 532023}, 'multiverseid': 532023}, {'name': 'Sort de réanimation', 'text': 'Lancez un d20 et ajoutez au résultat le nombre de cartes de créature de votre cimetière qui y ont été mises ce tour-ci depuis le champ de bataille.\\n1-14 | Renvoyez dans votre main toutes les cartes de créature de votre cimetière qui y ont été mises ce tour-ci depuis le champ de bataille.\\n15+ | Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille ces cartes de votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532077&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '698f0aa2-af4d-4c96-9f2f-6672fe9f768d', 'multiverseId': 532077}, 'multiverseid': 532077}, {'name': 'Rivivificare', 'text': 'Tira un d20 e aggiungi il numero di carte creatura nel tuo cimitero che vi sono state messe dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\\n1—14 | Riprendi in mano tutte le carte creatura nel tuo cimitero che vi sono state messe dal campo di battaglia in questo turno.\\n15+ | Rimetti sul campo di battaglia quelle carte dal tuo cimitero.', 'type': 'Istantaneo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532131&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2b69233-ffd0-4300-b895-6bb6475c3dbc', 'multiverseId': 532131}, 'multiverseid': 532131}, {'name': 'リヴィヴィファイ', 'text': '１個のd20を振り、その出目とこのターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれてその領域にあるクリーチャー・カードの枚数を足す。\\n1—14 | このターンに戦場からあなたの墓地に置かれてその領域にあるすべてのクリーチャー・カードをあなたの手札に戻す。\\n15+ | それらのカードをあなたの墓地から戦場に戻す。', 'type': 'インスタント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532185&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a0d4d91-f75e-4b2e-a8c7-2525e963e517', 'multiverseId': 532185}, 'multiverseid': 532185}, {'name': 'Revivificar', 'text': 'Role um d20 e some ao resultado o número de cards de criatura em seu cemitério que foram colocados lá do campo de batalha neste turno.\\n1—14 | Devolva para sua mão todos os cards de criatura em seu cemitério colocados lá do campo de batalha neste turno.\\n15+ | Devolva aqueles cards de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.', 'type': 'Mágica Instantânea', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532239&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7a618899-c88c-43bd-b8df-36d4494d2950', 'multiverseId': 532239}, 'multiverseid': 532239}, {'name': 'Вдохнуть Жизнь', 'text': 'Бросьте d20 и прибавьте число карт существ на вашем кладбище, которые попали туда с поля битвы в этом ходу.\\n1—14 | Верните все карты существ на вашем кладбище, которые попали туда с поля битвы в этом ходу, в вашу руку.\\n15+ | Верните те карты из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.', 'type': 'Мгновенное заклинание', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532293&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc2b6de8-8f20-41ad-9291-029634f636c7', 'multiverseId': 532293}, 'multiverseid': 532293}, {'name': '回生神术', 'text': '掷一颗d20，然后将点数加上本回合中从战场进入你坟墓场的生物牌数量。\\n1～14 | 将本回合中从战场进入你坟墓场的生物牌从该处移回你手上。\\n15+ | 将这些牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532347&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a80ef567-559e-4264-bd4a-23f0e981b68c', 'multiverseId': 532347}, 'multiverseid': 532347}, {'name': '回生神術', 'text': '擲一顆d20，然後將點數加上本回合中從戰場進入你墳墓場的生物牌數量。\\n1～14 | 將本回合中從戰場進入你墳墓場的生物牌從該處移回你手上。\\n15+ | 將這些牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。', 'type': '瞬間', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532401&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5513925-d8a9-4b67-9e74-a743d776706f', 'multiverseId': 532401}, 'multiverseid': 532401}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wildes Dampfmaul\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn das Wilde Dampfmaul angreift, erzeuge {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c47fde39-9c23-4bf9-ba70-14c3478ca19e\', \'multiverseId\': 532789}, \'multiverseid\': 532789}, {\'name\': \'Bocahumareda salvaje\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Bocahumareda salvaje ataque, agrega {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04545d5-3572-444a-aa00-e1db5bc18fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 533000}, \'multiverseid\': 533000}, {\'name\': \'Ventegueule sauvage\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Ventegueule sauvage attaque, ajoutez {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a747da2-2f11-418d-b942-262c1d169b4e\', \'multiverseId\': 533211}, \'multiverseid\': 533211}, {\'name\': \'Sfiatofauce Selvaggia\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta la Sfiatofauce Selvaggia attacca, aggiungi {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Fino alla fine del turno, non perdi questo mana al termine di ogni fase o sottofase.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a64fe009-68ef-42db-a264-0c606466960c\', \'multiverseId\': 533422}, \'multiverseid\': 533422}, {\'name\': \'凶暴な熱口\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n凶暴な熱口が攻撃するたび、{R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}を加える。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86daaad4-6f86-4386-a93f-9c3e4859310a\', \'multiverseId\': 533633}, \'multiverseid\': 533633}, {\'name\': \'Boca-de-vento Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Boca-de-vento Selvagem atacar, adicione {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. Até o final do turno, você não perde esse mana quando as etapas e fases terminam.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dfcc62ff-b7ca-46d7-96ea-3e1249c6fc5a\', \'multiverseId\': 533844}, \'multiverseid\': 533844}, {\'name\': \'Свирепый Дымозев\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда Свирепый Дымозев атакует, добавьте {R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}. До конца хода вы не теряете эту ману по окончании шагов и фаз.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a005a1-e9b7-44e0-b445-03ac1c1b3055\', \'multiverseId\': 534055}, \'multiverseid\': 534055}, {\'name\': \'沸息蛮龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当沸息蛮龙攻击时，加{R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}。直到回合结束，你不会因步骤与阶段结束失去这份法术力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71c5ab97-0fa8-4b98-aa99-5269a333dd3f\', \'multiverseId\': 534266}, \'multiverseid\': 534266}, {\'name\': \'沸息蠻龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當沸息蠻龍攻擊時，加{R}{R}{R}{G}{G}{G}。直到回合結束，你不會因步驟與階段結束失去這份魔法力。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36dc3204-edf6-49cb-9ae1-fabc85b8f282\', \'multiverseId\': 534477}, \'multiverseid\': 534477}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W4 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Erzeuge so viele 3/3 grüne Bestie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis entspricht. Durchsuche dann deine Bibliothek nach so vielen Standardland-Karten, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wildnis verschlingt, aber sie erschafft auch.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d596b835-5c9a-4769-bdc2-edf119d6564a\', \'multiverseId\': 532002}, \'multiverseid\': 532002}, {\'name\': \'Reto salvaje\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d4 y elige un resultado. Crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Bestia verdes 3/3 igual a ese resultado. Luego busca en tu biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de tierra básica igual al otro resultado, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Las tierras salvajes destruyen, pero también crean.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a852ba16-9a91-4b55-a9dc-4a00ec50528a\', \'multiverseId\': 532056}, \'multiverseid\': 532056}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre sauvage\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d4 et choisissez un résultat. Créez un nombre de jetons de créature 3/3 verte Bête égal à ce résultat. Cherchez ensuite dans votre bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de terrain de base égal à l\'autre résultat, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les friches dévorent, mais elles créent aussi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54dc9ab3-3b19-4e03-bf2a-50b19be0cefe\', \'multiverseId\': 532110}, \'multiverseid\': 532110}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Selvaggia\', \'text\': "Tira due d4 e scegli un risultato. Crea un numero di pedine creatura Bestia 3/3 verdi pari a quel risultato. Poi passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un numero di carte terra base pari all\'altro risultato, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Le terre selvagge sono fonte di sventura, ma anche di rinascita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532164&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d590dadb-8306-45f8-bb47-f99f131d1267\', \'multiverseId\': 532164}, \'multiverseid\': 532164}, {\'name\': \'突飛な挑戦\', \'text\': \'２個のd4を振り、出目１つを選ぶ。その出目に等しい数の緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。その後、あなたのライブラリーからもう１つの出目に等しい枚数の基本土地・カードを探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'大地は奪うが生み出しもする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532218&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08039474-1b77-4ece-8a5c-b9234539772b\', \'multiverseId\': 532218}, \'multiverseid\': 532218}, {\'name\': \'Empreitada Selvagem\', \'text\': \'Role dois d4 e escolha um resultado. Crie um número de fichas de criatura Besta verde 3/3 igual àquele resultado. Em seguida, procure em seu grimório um número de cards de terreno básico igual ao outro resultado, coloque-os no campo de batalha virados e depois embaralhe.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'As terras selvagens consomem, mas também criam.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6625ed-3a43-4a81-b8c1-f7004c251b85\', \'multiverseId\': 532272}, \'multiverseid\': 532272}, {\'name\': \'Дикое Предприятие\', \'text\': \'Бросьте два d4 и выберите один результат. Создайте фишки существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь в количестве, равном тому результату. Затем найдите в вашей библиотеке карты базовых земель в количестве, равном другому результату, положите их на поле битвы повернутыми, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Дикие земли поглощают — но они же и создают.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf996123-a381-4995-92a6-77011ac269d3\', \'multiverseId\': 532326}, \'multiverseid\': 532326}, {\'name\': \'狂野勇进\', \'text\': \'掷两颗d4并选择一个掷骰结果。派出若干3/3绿色野兽衍生生物，其数量等同于该掷骰结果。然后从你的牌库中搜寻若干基本地牌，其数量等同于另一个掷骰结果，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'荒野虽吞噬万物，却也创造生机。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b96ec0-c7de-4ec3-a008-bcd72e527ecc\', \'multiverseId\': 532380}, \'multiverseid\': 532380}, {\'name\': \'狂野勇進\', \'text\': \'擲兩顆d4並選擇一個擲骰結果。派出若干3/3綠色野獸衍生生物，其數量等同於該擲骰結果。然後從你的牌庫中搜尋若干基本地牌，其數量等同於另一個擲骰結果，將它們橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'荒野雖吞噬萬物，卻也創造生機。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a95296b-07b1-48fc-9f15-3edc3a68219f\', \'multiverseId\': 532434}, \'multiverseid\': 532434}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wildes Unterfangen\', \'text\': \'Würfle zwei W4 und suche dir ein Ergebnis aus. Erzeuge so viele 3/3 grüne Bestie-Kreaturenspielsteine, wie dem ausgesuchten Ergebnis entspricht. Durchsuche dann deine Bibliothek nach so vielen Standardland-Karten, wie dem anderen Ergebnis entspricht, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e83be98a-c35a-4d5c-8d66-0f3700da365c\', \'multiverseId\': 531588}, \'multiverseid\': 531588}, {\'name\': \'Reto salvaje\', \'text\': \'Tira 2d4 y elige un resultado. Crea una cantidad de fichas de criatura Bestia verdes 3/3 igual a ese resultado. Luego busca en tu biblioteca una cantidad de cartas de tierra básica igual al otro resultado, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531644&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cb4be1f-3913-429c-96c5-16880aeb8e50\', \'multiverseId\': 531644}, \'multiverseid\': 531644}, {\'name\': \'Manœuvre sauvage\', \'text\': "Lancez deux d4 et choisissez un résultat. Créez un nombre de jetons de créature 3/3 verte Bête égal à ce résultat. Cherchez ensuite dans votre bibliothèque un nombre de cartes de terrain de base égal à l\'autre résultat, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531700&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a6ec990-a0e9-4038-889d-399204a52f28\', \'multiverseId\': 531700}, \'multiverseid\': 531700}, {\'name\': \'Impresa Selvaggia\', \'text\': "Tira due d4 e scegli un risultato. Crea un numero di pedine creatura Bestia 3/3 verdi pari a quel risultato. Poi passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per un numero di carte terra base pari all\'altro risultato, mettile sul campo di battaglia TAPpate, poi rimescola.", \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5241e46b-2440-4c23-9fdd-b2b092e78bef\', \'multiverseId\': 531756}, \'multiverseid\': 531756}, {\'name\': \'突飛な挑戦\', \'text\': \'d4を２回振り、出目１つを選ぶ。その出目に等しい数の緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。その後、あなたのライブラリーからもう１つの出目に等しい枚数の基本土地・カードを探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2d423e1-281c-45b0-b443-d25968e49aff\', \'multiverseId\': 531812}, \'multiverseid\': 531812}]', "[{'name': 'Wildpfad', 'text': 'Sowie der Wildpfad ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Gebirge- oder Wald-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Wildpfad getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532838&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '542112fb-0c6c-4666-bbbd-2cebd43a981a', 'multiverseId': 532838}, 'multiverseid': 532838}, {'name': 'Rastro de presas', 'text': 'En cuanto el Rastro de presas entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Montaña o Bosque de tu mano. Si no lo haces, el Rastro de presas entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533049&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0aaffe3c-96c6-43cd-99ce-0f329a3b7d41', 'multiverseId': 533049}, 'multiverseid': 533049}, {'name': 'Piste du gibier', 'text': 'Au moment où la Piste du gibier arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte de montagne ou de forêt de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, la Piste du gibier arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533260&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '08778ac8-c8b6-487e-b5b7-8a547206a5fd', 'multiverseId': 533260}, 'multiverseid': 533260}, {'name': 'Pista della Preda', 'text': 'Mentre la Pista della Preda entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi rivelare una carta Montagna o Foresta dalla tua mano. Se non lo fai, la Pista della Preda entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533471&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6ef7816f-1e5d-40c9-bbd0-c78447c2a237', 'multiverseId': 533471}, 'multiverseid': 533471}, {'name': '獲物道', 'text': '獲物道が戦場に出るに際し、あなたはあなたの手札にあり山か森であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、獲物道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9549a32e-07ad-433c-aa42-889bf9667525', 'multiverseId': 533682}, 'multiverseid': 533682}, {'name': 'Trilha de Caça', 'text': 'Conforme Trilha de Caça entra no campo de batalha, você pode revelar um card de Montanha ou Floresta de sua mão. Se não fizer isso, Trilha de Caça entrará no campo de batalha virada.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533893&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2344ed55-4f9a-442f-b74f-2e0e276aeacc', 'multiverseId': 533893}, 'multiverseid': 533893}, {'name': 'Звериная Тропа', 'text': 'При выходе Звериной Тропы на поле битвы вы можете показать карту Горы или Леса из вашей руки. Если вы этого не делаете, Звериная Тропа выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534104&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e95859d0-3b5a-420a-92eb-790cf656135c', 'multiverseId': 534104}, 'multiverseid': 534104}, {'name': '狩猎小径', 'text': '于狩猎小径进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张山脉或树林牌。如果你未如此作，则狩猎小径须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534315&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5e555be9-6570-4a9b-85a4-871f7349bb03', 'multiverseId': 534315}, 'multiverseid': 534315}, {'name': '狩獵小徑', 'text': '於狩獵小徑進戰場時，你可以從你手上展示一張山脈或樹林牌。如果你未如此作，則狩獵小徑須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534526&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6652489a-8b73-4e51-9a78-84c1d1afa0f3', 'multiverseId': 534526}, 'multiverseid': 534526}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wildwuchs\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert ein Land\\nImmer wenn das verzauberte Land für Mana getappt wird, erzeugt sein Beherrscher zusätzlich {G}.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du stehenbleibst, um zu lauschen, kannst du es wachsen hören.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532772&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0035409c-920e-4251-90c4-1a85fecbc59e\', \'multiverseId\': 532772}, \'multiverseid\': 532772}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento salvaje\', \'text\': \'Encantar tierra.\\nSiempre que se gire la tierra encantada para obtener maná, su controlador agrega un {G} adicional.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Si te detienes a escuchar, lo oirás crecer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5de8617a-79f5-46ed-b9b0-e758b21c6d17\', \'multiverseId\': 532983}, \'multiverseid\': 532983}, {\'name\': \'Végétation luxuriante\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : terrain\\nÀ chaque fois que le terrain enchanté est engagé pour du mana, son contrôleur ajoute {G} supplémentaire.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "Si vous vous arrêtez pour écouter, vous l\'entendrez grandir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'532f1725-1949-4021-ae51-27383c68154e\', \'multiverseId\': 533194}, \'multiverseid\': 533194}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Rigogliosa\', \'text\': \'Incanta terra\\nOgniqualvolta la terra incantata viene TAPpata per attingere mana, il suo controllore aggiunge {G} addizionale.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Se ti fermi ad ascoltare, puoi sentirlo crescere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba28abdf-ef22-424a-be23-2aa1dae0bdef\', \'multiverseId\': 533405}, \'multiverseid\': 533405}, {\'name\': \'繁茂\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（土地）\\nエンチャントしている土地がマナを引き出す目的でタップされるたび、それのコントローラーは追加で{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'耳をすましてよく聞けば、それが成長している音が聞こえるよ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50e6245b-98b5-4451-8e8f-d2745f569384\', \'multiverseId\': 533616}, \'multiverseid\': 533616}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Virente\', \'text\': \'Encantar terreno\\nToda vez que o terreno encantado é virado para gerar mana, seu controlador adiciona {G} extra.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Se você parar para escutar, dá para ouvi-la crescer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e84c1c0f-5f9c-4317-952e-4c728fdeacee\', \'multiverseId\': 533827}, \'multiverseid\': 533827}, {\'name\': \'Дикий Рост\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать землю\\nКаждый раз, когда зачарованная земля поворачивается для получения маны, контролирующий ее игрок добавляет дополнительно {G}.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Если ты остановишься послушать, то сможешь услышать, как она растет.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8ddf86e-411a-4d2f-867f-03c571d9387e\', \'multiverseId\': 534038}, \'multiverseid\': 534038}, {\'name\': \'野地丛生\', \'text\': \'结附于地\\n每当横置所结附的地以产生法术力时，其操控者额外加{G}。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'若你静心倾听，将听见它的成长。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ced73a66-05b3-4033-a5dd-349de5b54dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 534249}, \'multiverseid\': 534249}, {\'name\': \'野地叢生\', \'text\': \'結附於地\\n每當橫置所結附的地以產生魔法力時，其操控者額外加{G}。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'若你靜心傾聽，將聽見它的成長。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59e29cf8-3621-432b-a64e-0e81eadbb952\', \'multiverseId\': 534460}, \'multiverseid\': 534460}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wolken-Wegbereiterin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn die Wolken-Wegbereiterin ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 2 Lebenspunkte dazu und ziehst zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': \'Alle Äther-Karten der Welt können nicht mit dem geschulten Auge einer talentierten Späherin mithalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532780&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a680ec9d-6c4a-42c0-b9a3-785f0b726381\', \'multiverseId\': 532780}, \'multiverseid\': 532780}, {\'name\': \'Lustranimbos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando la Lustranimbos entre al campo de batalla, ganas 2 vidas y robas dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': \'Todas las cartografías de éter del mundo no pueden competir con el ojo entrenado de un explorador con talento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4794dc3d-8ad6-4c58-97f9-b8ede50421a8\', \'multiverseId\': 532991}, \'multiverseid\': 532991}, {\'name\': \'Défricheuse des nuages\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand la Défricheuse des nuages arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous gagnez 2 points de vie et vous piochez deux cartes.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': "Toutes les cartes éthériques du monde ne valent pas l\'œil expert d\'un éclaireur de talent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'286816b8-5c76-43ee-90be-c3e2a6740452\', \'multiverseId\': 533202}, \'multiverseid\': 533202}, {\'name\': \'Scrutanembi\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando la Scrutanembi entra nel campo di battaglia, guadagni 2 punti vita e peschi due carte.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Esploratore Umano\', \'flavor\': "Tutte le mappe eteriche del mondo non reggono il confronto con l\'occhio esperto di un abile esploratore.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3e4df83-12ac-4556-8f91-417c71b46e2d\', \'multiverseId\': 533413}, \'multiverseid\': 533413}, {\'name\': \'雲先案内人\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n雲先案内人が戦場に出たとき、あなたは２点のライフを得て、カード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': \'世界中の霊気図を集めても、才能ある案内人の熟練した目にはかなわない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6ab0cff-4d90-4338-a948-3e69b60b4f19\', \'multiverseId\': 533624}, \'multiverseid\': 533624}, {\'name\': \'Desbravadora das Nuvens\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Desbravadora das Nuvens entra no campo de batalha, você ganha 2 pontos de vida e compra dois cards.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Batedor\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhum mapa etéreo do mundo consegue superar o olho treinado de um batedor talentoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8bfef1d-23dc-4808-8388-7c7ca0938778\', \'multiverseId\': 533835}, \'multiverseid\': 533835}, {\'name\': \'Облачная Разведчица\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Облачная Разведчица выходит на поле битвы, вы получаете 2 жизни и берете две карты.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Разведчик\', \'flavor\': \'Ни одна эфирная карта в мире не сравнится с опытным глазом талантливой разведчицы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc7fc8f6-8881-4166-b61e-d6bd6f50139e\', \'multiverseId\': 534046}, \'multiverseid\': 534046}, {\'name\': \'云间辟道者\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当云间辟道者进战场时，你获得2点生命且抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'世上所有的乙太分布图都比不上高超斥候训练有素的眼力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10a5bbdb-1230-4ef5-9254-5f6df08ef232\', \'multiverseId\': 534257}, \'multiverseid\': 534257}, {\'name\': \'雲間闢道者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當雲間闢道者進戰場時，你獲得2點生命且抽兩張牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／斥候\', \'flavor\': \'世上所有的乙太分佈圖都比不上高超斥候訓練有素的眼力。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534468&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1d4905-7eec-4ae1-b486-6ed6b0cb7cdb\', \'multiverseId\': 534468}, \'multiverseid\': 534468}]', "[{'name': 'Wucherndes Wachstum', 'text': 'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Die Natur lässt die Lösungen für ihre Probleme einfach sprießen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532764&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '171da890-da31-4a4b-9c3c-cc0b671ba378', 'multiverseId': 532764}, 'multiverseid': 532764}, {'name': 'Crecimiento exuberante', 'text': 'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, pon esa carta en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'La naturaleza cultiva soluciones para sus problemas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532975&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4f6af42c-839d-4b97-af64-51aa7e9b92c2', 'multiverseId': 532975}, 'multiverseid': 532975}, {'name': 'Croissance luxuriante', 'text': 'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'La nature fait pousser les solutions de ses problèmes.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533186&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '998d14ff-f3f8-413a-9fd7-accd42aae2e5', 'multiverseId': 533186}, 'multiverseid': 533186}, {'name': 'Crescita Inarrestabile', 'text': 'Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta terra base, mettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata, poi rimescola.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'La natura genera soluzioni ai propri problemi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533397&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '077f5308-a33a-44f9-b861-e387b6c282cd', 'multiverseId': 533397}, 'multiverseid': 533397}, {'name': '不屈の自然', 'text': 'あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '自然は問題の解決法を自ら育て上げる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533608&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '421c4466-d8b0-4bb3-aa3d-3bf06a5442f5', 'multiverseId': 533608}, 'multiverseid': 533608}, {'name': 'Crescimento Exuberante', 'text': 'Procure um card de terreno básico em seu grimório, coloque aquele card no campo de batalha virado e depois embaralhe.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'A natureza cultiva as soluções aos seus próprios problemas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533819&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a2da76f3-5ea0-4ea0-b96c-d1060594ec9c', 'multiverseId': 533819}, 'multiverseid': 533819}, {'name': 'Буйный Рост', 'text': 'Найдите в вашей библиотеке карту базовой земли, положите ту карту на поле битвы повернутой, затем перетасуйте библиотеку.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'Решения проблем природы вырастают сами.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534030&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f867207-be9f-4d08-9953-e2dccbcc3918', 'multiverseId': 534030}, 'multiverseid': 534030}, {'name': '徒长', 'text': '从你的牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将该牌横置放进战场，然后洗牌。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '大自然为其问题栽培答案。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534241&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ee2dcdb-8bc3-4e6f-8ac6-6c8be0ba48dd', 'multiverseId': 534241}, 'multiverseid': 534241}, {'name': '徒長', 'text': '從你的牌庫中搜尋一張基本地牌，將該牌橫置放進戰場，然後洗牌。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '大自然為其問題栽培答案。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534452&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '937604df-ebe3-42e8-9519-07f4e57b849f', 'multiverseId': 534452}, 'multiverseid': 534452}]", '[{\'name\': \'Wulfgar aus dem Eiswindtal\', \'text\': \'Tumult (Immer wenn diese Kreatur angreift, erhält sie bis zum Ende des Zuges +1/+1 für jeden Gegner, den du in diesem Kampf angegriffen hast.)\\nFalls das Angreifen einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst, auslöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532011&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2de6f9a-bc04-49d4-9ca6-c98ea728e4bc\', \'multiverseId\': 532011}, \'multiverseid\': 532011}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar del Valle del Viento Helado\', \'text\': \'Reyerta. (Siempre que esta criatura ataque, obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno por cada oponente al que atacaste este combate.)\\nSi el ataque de una criatura que controlas hace que se dispare una habilidad disparada de un permanente que controlas, esa habilidad se dispara una vez más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bárbaro humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b255310e-fbb0-474a-9f8d-50ee7f621c4b\', \'multiverseId\': 532065}, \'multiverseid\': 532065}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar du Valbise\', \'text\': "Mêlée (À chaque fois que cette créature attaque, elle gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour pour chaque adversaire que vous avez attaqué pendant ce combat.)\\nSi une créature attaquante que vous contrôlez devait provoquer le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et barbare\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532119&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d542d0a8-c2eb-46db-99a0-a65d57736056\', \'multiverseId\': 532119}, \'multiverseid\': 532119}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar della Valle del Vento Gelido\', \'text\': "Mischia (Ogniqualvolta questa creatura attacca, prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno per ogni avversario che hai attaccato in questo combattimento.)\\nSe una creatura che controlli e che viene dichiarata attaccante sta per far innescare un\'abilità innescata di un permanente che controlli, quell\'abilità si innesca una volta in più.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Barbaro Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dee20be7-0714-46e4-9403-b7b379bf59ee\', \'multiverseId\': 532173}, \'multiverseid\': 532173}, {\'name\': \'アイスウィンド・デイルのウルフガル\', \'text\': \'会戦（このクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、これはこの戦闘であなたが攻撃した対戦相手１人につき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの攻撃によりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d414c7-bedb-4365-a34e-f73cbdf0ca23\', \'multiverseId\': 532227}, \'multiverseid\': 532227}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar do Vale do Vento Gélido\', \'text\': \'Embate (Toda vez que esta criatura ataca, ela recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno para cada oponente que você atacou neste combate.)\\nSe declarar como atacante uma criatura que você controla for desencadear uma habilidade desencadeada de uma permanente que você controla, aquela habilidade será desencadeada uma vez adicional.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Humano Bárbaro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16915a05-dc8f-4f53-b1bd-9a6a4cd3fd9e\', \'multiverseId\': 532281}, \'multiverseid\': 532281}, {\'name\': \'Вульфгар из Долины Ледяного Ветра\', \'text\': \'Потасовка (Каждый раз, когда это существо атакует, оно получает +1/+1 до конца хода за каждого оппонента, которого вы атаковали в этом бою.)\\nЕсли атака существом под вашим контролем должна вызвать срабатывание срабатывающей способности перманента под вашим контролем, та способность срабатывает один дополнительный раз.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Человек Варвар\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa8437d2-e1f3-46d6-b8ba-e0217d9e8b07\', \'multiverseId\': 532335}, \'multiverseid\': 532335}, {\'name\': \'冰风谷的沃夫加\', \'text\': \'乱斗（每当此生物攻击时，本次战斗中每有一位受你攻击的对手，此生物便得+1/+1直到回合结束。）\\n如果由你操控之永久物的触发式异能因由你操控的生物攻击而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～人类／野蛮人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35ea56e8-c75d-4296-b4aa-c6e5b6eaae53\', \'multiverseId\': 532389}, \'multiverseid\': 532389}, {\'name\': \'冰風谷的沃夫加\', \'text\': \'亂鬥（每當此生物攻擊時，本次戰鬥中每有一位受你攻擊的對手，此生物便得+1/+1直到回合結束。）\\n如果由你操控之永久物的觸發式異能因由你操控的生物攻擊而觸發，則該異能額外觸發一次。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～人類／野蠻人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51792d99-539a-47cc-90cc-40b9d908f2b2\', \'multiverseId\': 532443}, \'multiverseid\': 532443}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wulfgar aus dem Eiswindtal\', \'text\': \'Tumult\\nFalls das Angreifen einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit einer bleibenden Karte, die du kontrollierst, auslöst, wird die Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Barbar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531605&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e520c59f-9ccc-4862-a495-5ec226c10500\', \'multiverseId\': 531605}, \'multiverseid\': 531605}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar del Valle del Viento Helado\', \'text\': \'Reyerta.\\nSi el ataque de una criatura que controlas hace que se dispare una habilidad disparada de un permanente que controlas, esa habilidad se dispara una vez más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bárbaro humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7b57ba-656d-4540-957b-49d02d2b31a5\', \'multiverseId\': 531661}, \'multiverseid\': 531661}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar du Valbise\', \'text\': "Mêlée\\nSi une créature attaquante que vous contrôlez devait provoquer le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : humain et barbare\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531717&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78b88fca-5d4c-487f-b2f3-5b24dd58b85e\', \'multiverseId\': 531717}, \'multiverseid\': 531717}, {\'name\': \'Wulfgar della Valle del Vento Gelido\', \'text\': "Mischia\\nSe una creatura che controlli e che viene dichiarata attaccante sta per far innescare un\'abilità innescata di un permanente che controlli, quell\'abilità si innesca una volta in più.", \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Barbaro Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73cb1366-3e3e-4489-a09a-4609757d6841\', \'multiverseId\': 531773}, \'multiverseid\': 531773}, {\'name\': \'アイスウィンド・デイルのウルフガル\', \'text\': \'会戦\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーの攻撃によりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発するなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・バーバリアン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a97fbdac-a3e3-417e-a015-a8aa92b8ce38\', \'multiverseId\': 531829}, \'multiverseid\': 531829}]', '[{\'name\': \'Wüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Die Wüste fügt einer angreifenden Kreatur deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während des Ende-des-Kampfes-Segments.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532831&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6566a721-ff3b-47fc-ad3a-33b8fca58a50\', \'multiverseId\': 532831}, \'multiverseid\': 532831}, {\'name\': \'Desierto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: El Desierto hace 1 punto de daño a la criatura objetivo. Activa esto solo durante el paso de final del combate.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e138abd-6545-4543-8e2c-313605ba2626\', \'multiverseId\': 533042}, \'multiverseid\': 533042}, {\'name\': \'Désert\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Le Désert inflige 1 blessure à une créature attaquante ciblée. N\'activez que pendant l\'étape de fin de combat.", \'type\': \'Terrain : désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533253&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf7326d-5f86-4740-be96-206fec03cc6c\', \'multiverseId\': 533253}, \'multiverseid\': 533253}, {\'name\': \'Deserto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Il Deserto infligge 1 danno a una creatura attaccante bersaglio. Attiva solo durante la sottofase di fine combattimento.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08444d37-2c79-4b14-8db9-156d2f2ea357\', \'multiverseId\': 533464}, \'multiverseid\': 533464}, {\'name\': \'砂漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：攻撃クリーチャー１体を対象とする。砂漠はそれに１点のダメージを与える。戦闘終了ステップにしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89737101-2a19-4d68-b2f9-42982e08b883\', \'multiverseId\': 533675}, \'multiverseid\': 533675}, {\'name\': \'Deserto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Deserto causa 1 ponto de dano à criatura alvo atacante. Ative somente durante a etapa de final de combate.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Deserto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533886&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d0f6bfc-b411-4a32-aa9e-d577e9d24a90\', \'multiverseId\': 533886}, \'multiverseid\': 533886}, {\'name\': \'Пустыня\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: Пустыня наносит 1 повреждение целевому атакующему существу. Активируйте только во время шага завершения боя.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Пустыня\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c0f0b25-bf29-4da2-890d-a653744c763a\', \'multiverseId\': 534097}, \'multiverseid\': 534097}, {\'name\': \'沙漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：沙漠对目标进行攻击的生物造成1点伤害。只能于战斗结束步骤中起动。\', \'type\': \'地 ～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a25a96bb-9610-44fa-92e5-e6643bce27c2\', \'multiverseId\': 534308}, \'multiverseid\': 534308}, {\'name\': \'沙漠\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：沙漠對目標進行攻擊的生物造成1點傷害。只能於戰鬥結束步驟中起動。\', \'type\': \'地 ～沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3651a6-ea23-41fb-8711-ccd1b1a622fe\', \'multiverseId\': 534519}, \'multiverseid\': 534519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberer der Wilden Magie\', \'text\': \'Der erste Zauberspruch, den du pro Zug aus dem Exil wirkst, hat Kaskade. (Wenn du deinen ersten Zauberspruch aus dem Exil wirkst, schicke so lange die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531995&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8547f1be-c1a5-458f-ab03-8436d51974c8\', \'multiverseId\': 531995}, \'multiverseid\': 531995}, {\'name\': \'Hechicero de magia salvaje\', \'text\': \'El primer hechizo que lances desde el exilio cada turno tiene la habilidad de cascada. (Cuando lances tu primer hechizo desde el exilio, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'862ec62c-ae8d-4e00-a06c-bab0b732ee10\', \'multiverseId\': 532049}, \'multiverseid\': 532049}, {\'name\': \'Ensorceleur de magie sauvage\', \'text\': "Le premier sort que vous lancez depuis l\'exil à chaque tour a la cascade. (Quand vous lancez votre premier sort depuis l\'exil, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532103&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4285bc5-c8a6-451d-ac40-1ce2694c5566\', \'multiverseId\': 532103}, \'multiverseid\': 532103}, {\'name\': \'Stregone della Magia Selvaggia\', \'text\': "La prima magia che lanci dall\'esilio in ogni turno ha cascata. (Quando lanci la tua prima magia dall\'esilio, esilia carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non esili una carta non terra che costa meno. Puoi lanciarla senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Metti le carte esiliate in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b46edd8c-abf7-405a-84c2-0548c1eb834f\', \'multiverseId\': 532157}, \'multiverseid\': 532157}, {\'name\': \'暴走魔法のソーサラー\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターンで最初に追放領域から唱える呪文は続唱を持つ。（あなたが追放領域から最初の呪文を唱えたとき、コストがそれより低く土地でないカードが追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放されているカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d66cbac4-232e-4fe3-8beb-c75a6339104c\', \'multiverseId\': 532211}, \'multiverseid\': 532211}, {\'name\': \'Feiticeiro da Magia Selvagem\', \'text\': \'A primeira mágica que você conjura do exílio a cada turno tem cascata. (Quando conjurar sua primeira mágica do exílio, exile cards do topo de seu grimório até exilar um não de terreno com custo inferior. Você pode conjurá-lo sem pagar seu custo de mana. Coloque os cards exilados no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Orc Xamã\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef39c05c-66fc-42de-9fa2-8a486ec14e2c\', \'multiverseId\': 532265}, \'multiverseid\': 532265}, {\'name\': \'Волшебник Дикой Магии\', \'text\': \'Первое заклинание, которое вы разыгрываете из изгнания в каждом ходу, имеет Каскад. (Когда вы разыгрываете ваше первое заклинание из изгнания, изгоняйте карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока вы не изгоните не являющуюся землей и стоящую меньше карту. Вы можете разыграть ее без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Положите изгнанные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Орк Шаман\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11772abb-c585-4809-a7f5-ea0276001d02\', \'multiverseId\': 532319}, \'multiverseid\': 532319}, {\'name\': \'狂乱魔法术士\', \'text\': \'你每回合中从放逐区施放的第一个咒语具有倾曳异能。（当你从放逐区施放你的第一个咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比该咒语低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半兽人／祭师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532373&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5825c6e6-cf54-46a8-8990-042e38ccf6dd\', \'multiverseId\': 532373}, \'multiverseid\': 532373}, {\'name\': \'狂亂魔法術士\', \'text\': \'你每回合中從放逐區施放的第一個咒語具有傾曳異能。（當你從放逐區施放你的第一個咒語時，從你的牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張費用比該咒語低的非地牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。將所放逐的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～半獸人／祭師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3221775a-1771-49f7-9691-f83742c48cef\', \'multiverseId\': 532427}, \'multiverseid\': 532427}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberer der Wilden Magie\', \'text\': \'Der erste Zauberspruch, den du pro Zug aus dem Exil wirkst, hat Kaskade.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Schamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531581&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c224c7f-2da4-4f02-ba2f-e501ef2bb611\', \'multiverseId\': 531581}, \'multiverseid\': 531581}, {\'name\': \'Hechicero de magia salvaje\', \'text\': \'El primer hechizo que lances desde el exilio cada turno tiene la habilidad de cascada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d24cc1ab-7610-4a4c-8824-b62fe5ac953e\', \'multiverseId\': 531637}, \'multiverseid\': 531637}, {\'name\': \'Ensorceleur de magie sauvage\', \'text\': "Le premier sort que vous lancez depuis l\'exil à chaque tour a la cascade.", \'type\': \'Créature : orque et shamane\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531693&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c7f6e24-d818-4b1d-93e3-c765c95b1834\', \'multiverseId\': 531693}, \'multiverseid\': 531693}, {\'name\': \'Stregone della Magia Selvaggia\', \'text\': "La prima magia che lanci dall\'esilio in ogni turno ha cascata.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Orco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ba46299-3993-48f9-bf44-27f96f0fc75d\', \'multiverseId\': 531749}, \'multiverseid\': 531749}, {\'name\': \'暴走魔法のソーサラー\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターンで最初に追放領域から唱える呪文は続唱を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dd398cb-8cdd-4567-a448-ed277df6d08b\', \'multiverseId\': 531805}, \'multiverseid\': 531805}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberstab des Orcus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift oder blockt, erhalten sie und Zombies, die du kontrollierst, Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531573&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4421298a-5a3e-4c0f-b6b2-4edbdee0aa26\', \'multiverseId\': 531573}, \'multiverseid\': 531573}, {\'name\': \'Varita de Orcus\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque o bloquee, ella y los Zombies que controlas ganan la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc96ffae-24ee-4bd5-9c03-4f688d1c07d8\', \'multiverseId\': 531629}, \'multiverseid\': 531629}, {\'name\': "Baguette d\'Orcus", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque ou bloque, elle et les zombies que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez autant de jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531685&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d4bac5-c6ff-4254-85ee-5b75cc2bfc0f\', \'multiverseId\': 531685}, \'multiverseid\': 531685}, {\'name\': \'Bacchetta di Orcus\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca o blocca, quella creatura e gli Zombie che controlli hanno tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea altrettante pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca7f999-2c04-4186-bd05-d769a956bb36\', \'multiverseId\': 531741}, \'multiverseid\': 531741}, {\'name\': \'ワンド・オヴ・オルクス\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するかブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、それとあなたがコントロールしているすべてのゾンビは接死を得る。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50b465f8-5f67-40a8-a7fd-4ccdae7d3552\', \'multiverseId\': 531797}, \'multiverseid\': 531797}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zauberstab des Orcus\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur angreift oder blockt, erhalten sie und Zombies, die du kontrollierst, Todesberührung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, erzeuge entsprechend viele 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\\nAusrüsten {3}\', \'type\': \'Legendäres Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e03bbcc-7789-4cb6-a5c7-4142ef8469f6\', \'multiverseId\': 531987}, \'multiverseid\': 531987}, {\'name\': \'Varita de Orcus\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada ataque o bloquee, ella y los Zombies que controlas ganan la habilidad de toque mortal hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\\nEquipar {3}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto legendario — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0b8e3d4-4e3e-4781-8665-885986caac7f\', \'multiverseId\': 532041}, \'multiverseid\': 532041}, {\'name\': "Baguette d\'Orcus", \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée attaque ou bloque, elle et les zombies que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez autant de jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\\nÉquipement {3}", \'type\': \'Artefact légendaire : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532095&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'237fb845-f508-4a35-83f0-ade88a04801e\', \'multiverseId\': 532095}, \'multiverseid\': 532095}, {\'name\': \'Bacchetta di Orcus\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata attacca o blocca, quella creatura e gli Zombie che controlli hanno tocco letale fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata infligge danno da combattimento a un giocatore, crea altrettante pedine creatura Zombie 2/2 nere.\\nEquipaggiare {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto Leggendario — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'824ae818-4bb1-402f-9ddf-3e2fea94e083\', \'multiverseId\': 532149}, \'multiverseid\': 532149}, {\'name\': \'ワンド・オヴ・オルクス\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーが攻撃するかブロックするたび、ターン終了時まで、それとあなたがコントロールしているすべてのゾンビは接死を得る。\\n装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、その点数に等しい数の黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\n装備{3}\', \'type\': \'伝説のアーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6267ef5c-33f6-45ad-af08-1566de725667\', \'multiverseId\': 532203}, \'multiverseid\': 532203}, {\'name\': \'Varinha de Orcus\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que a criatura equipada ataca ou bloqueia, ela e os Zumbis que você controla ganham toque mortífero até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada causar dano de combate a um jogador, crie aquela quantidade de fichas de criatura Zumbi preta 2/2.\\nEquipar {3}\', \'type\': \'Artefato Lendário — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'856fdae7-7d5e-487f-9504-4945456606e1\', \'multiverseId\': 532257}, \'multiverseid\': 532257}, {\'name\': \'Палочка Оркуса\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда снаряженное существо атакует или блокирует, оно и все Зомби под вашим контролем получают Смертельное касание до конца хода.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо наносит боевые повреждения игроку, создайте такое же количество фишек существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\\nСнарядить {3}\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532311&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8c2dd6-5f9d-4ebe-862e-aab892e04f30\', \'multiverseId\': 532311}, \'multiverseid\': 532311}, {\'name\': \'欧库斯之杖\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物攻击或阻挡时，它和由你操控的灵俑均获得死触异能直到回合结束。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出等量的2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\\n佩带{3}\', \'type\': \'传奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a185022b-2d0a-4a39-a659-c962a59bf146\', \'multiverseId\': 532365}, \'multiverseid\': 532365}, {\'name\': \'歐庫斯之杖\', \'text\': \'每當佩帶此武具的生物攻擊或阻擋時，它和由你操控的殭屍均獲得死觸異能直到回合結束。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物對任一玩家造成戰鬥傷害時，派出等量的2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\\n佩帶{3}\', \'type\': \'傳奇神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56ceb16b-4276-4d98-8814-a3b147f818b3\', \'multiverseId\': 532419}, \'multiverseid\': 532419}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zepter der Absorption\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, schicke ihn bzw. sie ins Exil, anstatt ihn bzw. sie auf den Friedhof zu legen, sowie er bzw. sie verrechnet wird.\\n{X}, {T}, opfere das Zepter der Absorption: Du kannst von den Karten, die mit dem Zepter der Absorption ins Exil geschickten wurden, eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen mit Gesamt-Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86be697d-26e5-42e7-92a2-bce031665b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 531564}, \'multiverseid\': 531564}, {\'name\': \'Vara de la absorción\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en un cementerio en cuanto se resuelva.\\n{X}, {T}, sacrificar la Vara de la absorción: Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre las cartas exiliadas con la Vara de la absorción con un valor de maná total de X o menos sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2440ddeb-64ce-4dd8-924c-5ee133f49447\', \'multiverseId\': 531620}, \'multiverseid\': 531620}, {\'name\': "Sceptre d\'absorption", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans un cimetière au moment où il se résout.\\n{X}, {T}, sacrifiez le Sceptre d\'absorption : Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à X parmi les cartes exilées par le Sceptre d\'absorption sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531676&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f71b9a66-f975-4fd8-9a52-8641e7cb8af6\', \'multiverseId\': 531676}, \'multiverseid\': 531676}, {\'name\': "Verga dell\'Assorbimento", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, esiliala invece di metterla in un cimitero mentre si risolve.\\n{X}, {T}, Sacrifica la Verga dell\'Assorbimento: Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie con valore di mana totale pari o inferiore a X, scelte tra le carte esiliate con la Verga dell\'Assorbimento, senza pagare il loro costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58c56dcb-93fa-4477-b5c0-9083d55e6803\', \'multiverseId\': 531732}, \'multiverseid\': 531732}, {\'name\': \'ロッド・オヴ・アブソープション\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、それの解決に際し、それを墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\\n{X}, {T}, ロッド・オヴ・アブソープションを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは、ロッド・オヴ・アブソープションによって追放されているカードのうち望む数の呪文をマナ総量の合計がＸ以下になるように選び、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ace3378-6219-467c-8ef4-d8676fd302ba\', \'multiverseId\': 531788}, \'multiverseid\': 531788}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zepter der Absorption\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, schicke ihn bzw. sie ins Exil, anstatt ihn bzw. sie auf den Friedhof zu legen, sowie er bzw. sie verrechnet wird.\\n{X}, {T}, opfere das Zepter der Absorption: Du kannst von den Karten, die mit dem Zepter der Absorption ins Exil geschickten wurden, eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen mit Gesamt-Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=531978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e9e472f-9a8e-43c0-906e-69458656305a\', \'multiverseId\': 531978}, \'multiverseid\': 531978}, {\'name\': \'Vara de la absorción\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, exílialo en vez de ponerlo en un cementerio en cuanto se resuelva.\\n{X}, {T}, sacrificar la Vara de la absorción: Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre las cartas exiliadas con la Vara de la absorción con un valor de maná total de X o menos sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bd87609-201d-47ce-b8e7-784f95c9a46c\', \'multiverseId\': 532032}, \'multiverseid\': 532032}, {\'name\': "Sceptre d\'absorption", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, exilez-le à la place de le mettre dans un cimetière au moment où il se résout.\\n{X}, {T}, sacrifiez le Sceptre d\'absorption : Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts avec une valeur de mana totale inférieure ou égale à X parmi les cartes exilées par le Sceptre d\'absorption sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532086&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b93b1d-1fbe-46e3-b7e4-074863007899\', \'multiverseId\': 532086}, \'multiverseid\': 532086}, {\'name\': "Verga dell\'Assorbimento", \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta un giocatore lancia una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, esiliala invece di metterla in un cimitero mentre si risolve.\\n{X}, {T}, Sacrifica la Verga dell\'Assorbimento: Puoi lanciare un qualsiasi numero di magie con valore di mana totale pari o inferiore a X, scelte tra le carte esiliate con la Verga dell\'Assorbimento, senza pagare il loro costo di mana.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ecb1d45-c374-4305-9451-2b5a747529b0\', \'multiverseId\': 532140}, \'multiverseid\': 532140}, {\'name\': \'ロッド・オヴ・アブソープション\', \'text\': \'プレイヤーがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、それの解決に際し、それを墓地に置く代わりに追放する。\\n{X}, {T}, ロッド・オヴ・アブソープションを生け贄に捧げる：あなたは、ロッド・オヴ・アブソープションによって追放されているカードのうち望む数の呪文をマナ総量の合計がＸ以下になるように選び、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ecd0473-a901-4d3e-b94a-edfaf89be4d3\', \'multiverseId\': 532194}, \'multiverseid\': 532194}, {\'name\': \'Bastão da Absorção\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador conjurar uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, exile-a em vez de colocá-la em um cemitério conforme ela for resolvida.\\n{X}, {T}, sacrifique Bastão da Absorção: Você pode conjurar qualquer número de mágicas dentre aqueles cards exilados com Bastão da Absorção, com valor de mana total igual ou inferior a X, sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad2290f9-bd18-4f33-890b-943cb1decd7e\', \'multiverseId\': 532248}, \'multiverseid\': 532248}, {\'name\': \'Жезл Поглощения\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, изгоните его вместо того, чтобы положить на кладбище при его разрешении.\\n{X}, {T}, пожертвуйте Жезл Поглощения: вы можете разыграть без уплаты их мана-стоимости любое количество заклинаний, находящихся среди изгнанных Жезлом Поглощения карт, с суммарной мановой ценностью X или меньше.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d5cf69e-6065-48ce-8e13-131abf784bde\', \'multiverseId\': 532302}, \'multiverseid\': 532302}, {\'name\': \'吸收法力权杖\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手施放瞬间或法术咒语，于该咒语结算时，改为将它放逐，而非置入坟墓场。\\n{X}，{T}，牺牲吸收法力权杖：你可以从以吸收法力权杖放逐的牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用，但这些咒语的法术力值总和须等于或小于X。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00429538-2757-423e-af51-365562fec034\', \'multiverseId\': 532356}, \'multiverseid\': 532356}, {\'name\': \'吸收法力權杖\', \'text\': \'每當任一玩家施放瞬間或巫術咒語，於該咒語結算時，改為將它放逐，而非置入墳墓場。\\n{X}，{T}，犧牲吸收法力權杖：你可以從以吸收法力權杖放逐的牌之中施放任意數量的咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用，但這些咒語的魔法力值總和須等於或小於X。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532410&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68aac3cd-b2b4-4240-b871-af4422bd918a\', \'multiverseId\': 532410}, \'multiverseid\': 532410}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zhalfirinische Leere\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Zhalfirinische Leere ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Wind flüstert ‚Komm nach Hause\\\', doch ich kann nicht."\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532871&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33a17dd7-bf39-4970-b346-06bee6c13b5b\', \'multiverseId\': 532871}, \'multiverseid\': 532871}, {\'name\': \'Vacío zhalfirino\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Vacío zhalfirino entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo de tu biblioteca.)\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"El viento susurra: \\\'Vuelve a casa\\\'. Pero no puedo".\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8f5e74e-8d5d-4fda-95f8-b627438b41c2\', \'multiverseId\': 533082}, \'multiverseid\': 533082}, {\'name\': \'Vide zhalfirin\', \'text\': \'Quand le Vide zhalfirin arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez la mettre au-dessous de votre bibliothèque.)\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Le vent murmure "Rentre à la maison", mais je ne peux pas. »\\n—Téfeiri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cd9f9ab-d6c9-45da-8902-1b00831ae69a\', \'multiverseId\': 533293}, \'multiverseid\': 533293}, {\'name\': \'Vuoto di Zhalfir\', \'text\': \'Quando il Vuoto di Zhalfir entra nel campo di battaglia, profetizza 1. (Guarda la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere quella carta in fondo al tuo grimorio.)\\n{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Il vento sussurra \\\'Torna a casa\\\', ma non posso farlo."\\n—Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc78acfe-939a-453b-8522-b6f471227521\', \'multiverseId\': 533504}, \'multiverseid\': 533504}, {\'name\': \'ザルファーの虚空\', \'text\': \'ザルファーの虚空が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。あなたはそのカードをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置いてもよい。）\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「風は『故郷に帰ろう』とささやく。だが私には不可能だ。」\\n――テフェリー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd9878b7-3514-41f4-b764-6629184ee66c\', \'multiverseId\': 533715}, \'multiverseid\': 533715}, {\'name\': \'Vazio Zhalfiriano\', \'text\': \'Quando Vazio Zhalfiriano entrar no campo de batalha, use vidência 1. (Olhe o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar aquele card no fundo de seu grimório.)\\n{T}: Adicione {C}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"O vento sussurra: \\\'Volte para casa!\\\', mas não posso."\\n— Teferi\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87b006d7-a0b8-4e60-bef6-d1760915f904\', \'multiverseId\': 533926}, \'multiverseid\': 533926}, {\'name\': \'Жалфирская Пустота\', \'text\': \'Когда Жалфирская Пустота выходит на поле битвы, предскажите 1. (Посмотрите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить ту карту в низ вашей библиотеки.)\\n{T}: добавьте {C}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«"Возвращайся домой", — шепчет мне ветер, но я не могу».\\n— Тефери\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15e6269f-0881-4a77-845f-f7ae371ae2a7\', \'multiverseId\': 534137}, \'multiverseid\': 534137}, {\'name\': \'赛费尔虚境\', \'text\': \'当赛费尔虚境进战场时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「风低唤着『回来吧』，我却无家可回。」\\n～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534348&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7734cee6-7c7e-43f3-b956-b7423a3add4e\', \'multiverseId\': 534348}, \'multiverseid\': 534348}, {\'name\': \'賽費爾虛境\', \'text\': \'當賽費爾虛境進戰場時，占卜1。（檢視你牌庫頂的牌。你可以將該牌置於你的牌庫底。）\\n{T}：加{C}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「風低喚著『回來吧』，我卻無家可回。」\\n～泰菲力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66084a3-abbb-4cc1-b25c-08695dd363ac\', \'multiverseId\': 534559}, \'multiverseid\': 534559}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zuflucht des Geisterdrachen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe. Verwende dieses Mana nur, um einen Drache-Kreaturenzauber zu wirken.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Zuflucht des Geisterdrachen: Bringe eine Drache-Kreaturenkarte oder Ugin-Planeswalkerkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c0edd1-a000-499f-84a5-6bb4921e1de8\', \'multiverseId\': 532843}, \'multiverseid\': 532843}, {\'name\': \'Refugio del dragón espíritu\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color. Usa este maná solo para lanzar un hechizo de criatura Dragón.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Refugio del dragón espíritu: Regresa la carta de criatura Dragón objetivo o la carta de planeswalker Ugin de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d0a78c9-9578-46a1-9ed2-eaa5ba4adc32\', \'multiverseId\': 533054}, \'multiverseid\': 533054}, {\'name\': \'Havre du dragon-esprit\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer un sort de créature Dragon.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Havre du dragon-esprit : Renvoyez une carte de créature Dragon ciblée ou une carte de planeswalker Ugin depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533265&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52082eda-e144-4f2b-a877-0383687f7888\', \'multiverseId\': 533265}, \'multiverseid\': 533265}, {\'name\': \'Rifugio dello Spirito Drago\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {C}.\\n{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore. Spendi questo mana solo per lanciare una magia creatura Drago.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifica il Rifugio dello Spirito Drago: Riprendi in mano dal tuo cimitero una carta creatura Drago o una carta planeswalker Ugin bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65145ff3-4de7-4098-866e-e1d16d224542\', \'multiverseId\': 533476}, \'multiverseid\': 533476}, {\'name\': \'精霊龍の安息地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。このマナは、ドラゴン・クリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためにのみ使用できる。\\n{2}, {T}, 精霊龍の安息地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にありドラゴン・クリーチャーかウギン・プレインズウォーカーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76549ef3-fdc3-4bb8-8218-fe15ff9158ab\', \'multiverseId\': 533687}, \'multiverseid\': 533687}, {\'name\': \'Refúgio do Dragão Espírito\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {C}.\\n{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor. Gaste este mana apenas para conjurar uma mágica de criatura Dragão.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifique Refúgio do Dragão Espírito: Devolva o card de criatura Dragão ou de Planeswalker Ugin alvo do seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78cc0f6e-9d45-43ca-b392-1757acbc7488\', \'multiverseId\': 533898}, \'multiverseid\': 533898}, {\'name\': \'Убежище Духа Дракона\', \'text\': "{T}: добавьте {C}.\\n{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета. Тратьте эту ману только на разыгрывание заклинания существа-Дракона.\\n{2}, {T}, пожертвуйте Убежище Духа Дракона: верните целевую карту существа-Дракона или карту planeswalker\'а Уджина из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.", \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d609f97-7625-4fba-a9ae-f2e7d6f71ed8\', \'multiverseId\': 534109}, \'multiverseid\': 534109}, {\'name\': \'灵龙庇护地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。此法术力只能用来施放龙生物咒语。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲灵龙庇护地：将目标龙生物牌或乌金鹏洛客牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534320&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd601158-b16c-44f5-b07e-6f5fce7a1d2d\', \'multiverseId\': 534320}, \'multiverseid\': 534320}, {\'name\': \'靈龍庇護地\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。此魔法力只能用來施放龍生物咒語。\\n{2}，{T}，犧牲靈龍庇護地：將目標龍生物牌或烏金鵬洛客牌從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e6082a-b7d8-404a-9481-f1e2a8c75ba7\', \'multiverseId\': 534531}, \'multiverseid\': 534531}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zunderwald-Lichtung\', \'text\': \'({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDie Zunderwald-Lichtung kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.\', \'type\': \'Land — Gebirge, Wald\', \'flavor\': \'Auf dem vulkanischen Kontinent Akoum ragen bizarre Gewächse, Gasschlote und zerklüftete Berggipfel hoch in die Lüfte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532827&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cb34060-b4f9-4d94-9ca4-be67a7a9519c\', \'multiverseId\': 532827}, \'multiverseid\': 532827}, {\'name\': \'Claro de ceniza\', \'text\': \'({T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.)\\nEl Claro de ceniza entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Montaña bosque\', \'flavor\': \'En el continente volcánico de Akoum hay fumarolas con extrañas parcelas de hierba en torno a ellas, y las cumbres escarpadas de las montañas se alzan muy alto en el cielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a308ad1-3bb0-4b74-8c72-ca8f41c84012\', \'multiverseId\': 533038}, \'multiverseid\': 533038}, {\'name\': \'Clairière de scories\', \'text\': \'({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLa Clairière de scories arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.\', \'type\': \'Terrain : montagne et forêt\', \'flavor\': "Sur le continent volcanique d\'Akoum, d\'étranges végétaux s\'amassent autour des fissures de gaz et les pics irréguliers de la montagne se dressent haut dans le ciel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533249&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7043f399-eca8-4e1d-b4d3-bf190318333a\', \'multiverseId\': 533249}, \'multiverseid\': 533249}, {\'name\': \'Radura delle Braci\', \'text\': \'({T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.)\\nLa Radura delle Braci entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata a meno che tu non controlli due o più terre base.\', \'type\': \'Terra — Montagna Foresta\', \'flavor\': "Nel continente vulcanico di Akoum, la bizzarra vegetazione si ammassa attorno agli sfiatatoi di gas, mentre frastagliati picchi montuosi s\'innalzano verso il cielo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51833c6f-70b3-4f5a-b951-4718e834f852\', \'multiverseId\': 533460}, \'multiverseid\': 533460}, {\'name\': \'燃えがらの林間地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燃えがらの林間地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 山・森\', \'flavor\': \'火山の大陸アクームでは、噴気孔の周囲に奇妙な植生が見られる。空高くギザギザの山頂もそびえている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad98335-6ef3-4f57-80f2-6f14a0859175\', \'multiverseId\': 533671}, \'multiverseid\': 533671}, {\'name\': \'Clareira das Cinzas\', \'text\': \'({T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.)\\nClareira das Cinzas entra no campo de batalha virada, a menos que você controle dois ou mais terrenos básicos.\', \'type\': \'Terreno — Montanha Floresta\', \'flavor\': \'No continente vulcânico de Akoum, fissuras gasosas são circundadas por uma vegetação bizarra, enquanto os picos escarpados das montanhas flutuam nos céus.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e5fa539-339f-4205-90bb-b63ecad2b6f3\', \'multiverseId\': 533882}, \'multiverseid\': 533882}, {\'name\': \'Тлеющая Поляна\', \'text\': \'({T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.)\\nТлеющая Поляна выходит на поле битвы повернутой, если только под вашим контролем нет двух или более базовых земель.\', \'type\': \'Земля — Гора Лес\', \'flavor\': \'На вулканическом континенте Акум причудливые растения окружают газовые гейзеры, а изломанные горные пики поднимаются высоко в небо.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'362e42c6-ee53-48be-950d-8ebe277ef732\', \'multiverseId\': 534093}, \'multiverseid\': 534093}, {\'name\': \'烬火林地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{R}或{G}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则烬火林地须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'地 ～山脉／树林\', \'flavor\': \'阿库姆火山大陆上，奇异草木簇生喷气裂口，嶙峋尖峰直伸天际云霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090de7cd-902c-48ac-a19f-75c5f4732d5e\', \'multiverseId\': 534304}, \'multiverseid\': 534304}, {\'name\': \'燼火林地\', \'text\': \'（{T}：加{R}或{G}。）\\n除非你操控兩個或更多基本地，否則燼火林地須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'地 ～山脈／樹林\', \'flavor\': \'阿庫姆火山大陸上，奇異草木簇生噴氣裂口，嶙峋尖峰直伸天際雲霄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc6b96ff-8bad-4ec8-abdc-c1b01df81047\', \'multiverseId\': 534515}, \'multiverseid\': 534515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwanghafte Leichenflickerin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, opfere die Zwanghafte Leichenflickerin: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Niemand ist der Perfektion so sehr verpflichtet wie ein Leichenflicker, der an seinem neuesten Meisterwerk arbeitet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd4d24e-adc7-4274-9866-bd8ed56b422b\', \'multiverseId\': 532787}, \'multiverseid\': 532787}, {\'name\': \'Suturadora obsesionada\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta, luego descarta una carta.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrificar la Suturadora obsesionada: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Nadie es tan perfeccionista como quien da las puntadas a su última obra maestra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9adda62b-62c3-452c-b98d-cdcc53faa84c\', \'multiverseId\': 532998}, \'multiverseid\': 532998}, {\'name\': \'Raccommodeuse obsessionnelle\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrifiez la Raccommodeuse obsessionnelle : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Personne ne se soucie autant de la qualité qu\'une raccommodeuse travaillant sur son dernier chef d\'œuvre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa7d07d-1bfb-4412-ae07-7f9487ee7d94\', \'multiverseId\': 533209}, \'multiverseid\': 533209}, {\'name\': \'Cucitrice Ossessiva\', \'text\': \'{T}: Pesca una carta, poi scarta una carta.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, Sacrifica la Cucitrice Ossessiva: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Umano\', \'flavor\': "Nessuno è più votato alla perfezione di una cucitrice all\'opera sul suo ultimo capolavoro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b91ad66d-1933-4607-bb80-8ce357e39039\', \'multiverseId\': 533420}, \'multiverseid\': 533420}, {\'name\': \'偏執的な縫い師\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, 偏執的な縫い師を生け贄に捧げる：あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'完璧を目指す熱意にかけては、最新の傑作に取り組む縫い師に敵う者はいない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266f47c3-44a8-4d31-81f4-bf99705dd4c8\', \'multiverseId\': 533631}, \'multiverseid\': 533631}, {\'name\': \'Suturadora Obsessiva\', \'text\': \'{T}: Compre um card e depois descarte um card.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, sacrifique Suturadora Obsessiva: Devolva o card de criatura alvo de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Mago\', \'flavor\': \'Ninguém se dedica tanto à perfeição quanto um suturador trabalhando na última obra-prima.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651e7070-65e5-4413-ab0b-6e671686990a\', \'multiverseId\': 533842}, \'multiverseid\': 533842}, {\'name\': \'Помешанная Сшивательница\', \'text\': \'{T}: возьмите карту, затем сбросьте карту.\\n{2}{U}{B}, {T}, пожертвуйте Помешанную Сшивательницу: верните целевую карту существа из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'Никто так не стремится достигнуть совершенства, как сшиватель, работающий над очередным шедевром.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2aec1bd-e320-49e8-b467-23952c39629c\', \'multiverseId\': 534053}, \'multiverseid\': 534053}, {\'name\': \'偏执拼接师\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌，然后弃一张牌。\\n{2}{U}{B}，{T}，牺牲偏执拼接师：将目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'拼接师在打造最新杰作时对完美的执著，这世上无人能及。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01d1ee64-cd2f-41ad-ac6a-3c4a4c159543\', \'multiverseId\': 534264}, \'multiverseid\': 534264}, {\'name\': \'偏執拼接師\', \'text\': \'{T}：抽一張牌，然後棄一張牌。\\n{2}{U}{B}，{T}，犧牲偏執拼接師：將目標生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'拼接師在打造最新傑作時對完美的執著，這世上無人能及。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b07aa0e-0d0d-43a8-ae9b-1ae8b9754438\', \'multiverseId\': 534475}, \'multiverseid\': 534475}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zweischneidiges Erbstück\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +3/+1.\\nImmer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur stirbt, kannst du Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek aufdecken, bis du eine Kreaturenkarte aufdeckst, die mit ihr einen Kreaturentyp gemeinsam hat. Nimm jene Karte auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532806&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f90bbc-7f46-46cd-9b4f-ab4a60e7cb75\', \'multiverseId\': 532806}, \'multiverseid\': 532806}, {\'name\': \'Espada familiar\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +3/+1.\\nSiempre que la criatura equipada muera, puedes mostrar cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que muestres una carta de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con ella. Pon esa carta en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cb50bb2-28a3-4828-90e6-803fff3867a8\', \'multiverseId\': 533017}, \'multiverseid\': 533017}, {\'name\': "Lame d\'héritage", \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +3/+1.\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature équipée meurt, vous pouvez révéler les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous révéliez une carte de créature qui partage un type de créature avec elle. Mettez cette carte dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8b258b4-267c-4690-9bf7-7d972295088c\', \'multiverseId\': 533228}, \'multiverseid\': 533228}, {\'name\': \'Cimelio Affilato\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +3/+1.\\nOgniqualvolta la creatura equipaggiata muore, puoi rivelare carte dalla cima del tuo grimorio finché non riveli una carta creatura che condivide un tipo di creatura con essa. Aggiungi quella carta alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\\nEquipaggiare {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a7edad7-e2cb-46df-8a9f-e9d64df03075\', \'multiverseId\': 533439}, \'multiverseid\': 533439}, {\'name\': \'先祖伝来の宝刀\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋３/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n装備しているクリーチャーが死亡するたび、あなたは「それと共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・カードが公開されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ公開していく。そのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。」を選んでもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52699eda-2ffa-4bc2-96ec-de6519d23748\', \'multiverseId\': 533650}, \'multiverseid\': 533650}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Herança\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +3/+1.\\nToda vez que a criatura equipada morre, você pode revelar cards do topo de seu grimório até revelar um card de criatura que compartilhe um tipo de criatura com ela. Coloque aquele card na sua mão e o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\\nEquipar {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4c354dc-3066-4ea1-9f9f-cf6532d26cda\', \'multiverseId\': 533861}, \'multiverseid\': 533861}, {\'name\': \'Фамильный Клинок\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +3/+1.\\nКаждый раз, когда снаряженное существо умирает, вы можете показывать карты с верха вашей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не покажете карту существа, у которого есть такой же тип существа, как у него. Положите ту карту в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\\nСнарядить {1}\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd1a019e-6c0a-42f6-b609-16274e4e8ff8\', \'multiverseId\': 534072}, \'multiverseid\': 534072}, {\'name\': \'家传宝剑\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+3/+1。\\n每当佩带此武具的生物死去时，你可以从你的牌库顶开始展示牌，直到展示出一张与之具共通生物类别的生物牌为止。将该牌置于你手上，并将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534283&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'057528f8-3d13-4ba8-be8c-e703478dbb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 534283}, \'multiverseid\': 534283}, {\'name\': \'家傳寶劍\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+3/+1。\\n每當佩帶此武具的生物死去時，你可以從你的牌庫頂開始展示牌，直到展示出一張與之具共通生物類別的生物牌為止。將該牌置於你手上，並將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\\n佩帶{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49695b34-1aed-4a63-b24e-7adfffd66014\', \'multiverseId\': 534494}, \'multiverseid\': 534494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Zwiesprache mit der Lava\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka eroberte vor langer Zeit das Feuergebirge Qadat, indem sie die dortigen Ifrite mit dem Versprechen lockte, den Ruhm des Feuers in der ganzen Welt zu verbreiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532716&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75088d4d-ad10-4c64-959e-550bf249f0fb\', \'multiverseId\': 532716}, \'multiverseid\': 532716}, {\'name\': \'En comunión con la lava\', \'text\': \'Exilia las primeras X cartas de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esas cartas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka conquistó hace tiempo Qadat, el Borde Ígneo, y ganó a los efrit para su causa con la promesa de que expandiría la gloria del fuego por el mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61d5f413-e89f-4b35-a1cf-39ecc6f893f8\', \'multiverseId\': 532927}, \'multiverseid\': 532927}, {\'name\': \'Communion avec la lave\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Jadis, Atarka conquit Qadat, la Frange ardente, ralliant les éfrits à sa cause en leur promettant de répandre la gloire du feu dans le monde entier.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e98bf6c7-deab-4030-b6ba-fd99b0a2dcf1\', \'multiverseId\': 533138}, \'multiverseid\': 533138}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con la Lava\', \'text\': \'Esilia le prime X carte del tuo grimorio. Fino alla fine del tuo prossimo turno, puoi giocare quelle carte.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "Atarka conquistò Qadat, l\'Orlo Infuocato, molto tempo fa, convincendo i suoi efreet con la promessa di diffondere la gloria della fiamma in tutto il mondo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533349&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2540d84-93e5-464e-ac65-548400bef9f2\', \'multiverseId\': 533349}, \'multiverseid\': 533349}, {\'name\': \'溶岩との融和\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'アタルカは遠い昔に炎の縁カダットをその支配下に置いた。イフリートたちには炎の栄光を全世界に広めると約束し、彼らの心をつかみ取った。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23d33d87-22d2-42da-b9be-11ea10fd04aa\', \'multiverseId\': 533560}, \'multiverseid\': 533560}, {\'name\': \'Comungar com a Lava\', \'text\': \'Exile os X cards do topo de seu grimório. Até o final do seu próximo turno, você pode jogar esses cards.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Atarka conquistou Qadat, o Círculo de Fogo, há muito tempo, convencendo os efrites com a promessa de espalhar sua glória ígnea por todo o mundo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4d9459-8d06-48b1-a60f-9c9e48b348ba\', \'multiverseId\': 533771}, \'multiverseid\': 533771}, {\'name\': \'Причащение Лавой\', \'text\': \'Изгоните X верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть те карты до конца вашего следующего хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Атарка уже давно захватила Кадат, Огненный Разлом. Она пообещала его ифритам распространить славу огня по всему миру.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b21f2a4f-f3de-4b1a-8dab-2b34a9fa45aa\', \'multiverseId\': 533982}, \'multiverseid\': 533982}, {\'name\': \'熔岩通贯\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的X张牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用这些牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'很久以前，安塔卡征服了圜焰克达，凭借将火焰荣光传扬世界的许诺赢得了魔神的支持。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67aaafc1-bb73-4540-b7c1-5da280513bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 534193}, \'multiverseid\': 534193}, {\'name\': \'熔岩通貫\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌庫頂的X張牌。直到你下一個回合的回合結束，你可以使用這些牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'很久以前，安塔卡征服了圜焰克達，憑借將火焰榮光傳揚世界的許諾贏得了魔神的支持。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534404&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4adde41f-cbc3-4c7f-ac7c-d5e98ebe0950\', \'multiverseId\': 534404}, \'multiverseid\': 534404}]', "[{'name': 'Ätzender Schleim', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Ätzende Schleim ins Spiel kommt, zerstöre ein Artefakt, eine Verzauberung oder ein Land deiner Wahl.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Schlammwesen', 'flavor': 'Es fürchtet keine Klinge und lässt nicht einmal Knochen zurück.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532749&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1263fa9-07e9-42f0-9773-9e188c41af90', 'multiverseId': 532749}, 'multiverseid': 532749}, {'name': 'Fango ácido', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Fango ácido entre al campo de batalla, destruye el artefacto, encantamiento o tierra objetivo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Cieno', 'flavor': 'No teme al acero y no deja ni huesos a su paso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=532960&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e8ef9d2f-1823-4bb8-9485-5b86bbf724a4', 'multiverseId': 532960}, 'multiverseid': 532960}, {'name': 'Boue acide', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nQuand la Boue acide arrive sur le champ de bataille, détruisez un artefact ciblé, un enchantement ciblé ou un terrain ciblé.', 'type': 'Créature : limon', 'flavor': 'Elle ne craint aucune épée et ne laisse aucun corps derrière elle.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533171&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f2ab1bfa-9362-4501-9a92-3eee5d9ca58e', 'multiverseId': 533171}, 'multiverseid': 533171}, {'name': 'Melma Acida', 'text': 'Tocco letale\\nQuando la Melma Acida entra nel campo di battaglia, distruggi un artefatto, un incantesimo o una terra bersaglio.', 'type': 'Creatura — Melma', 'flavor': 'Non teme la spada e non lascia traccia alcuna.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533382&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5d5fde2-017a-4e4a-a058-d54e6969e0da', 'multiverseId': 533382}, 'multiverseid': 533382}, {'name': '酸のスライム', 'text': '接死\\n酸のスライムが戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントや土地のうち１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ウーズ', 'flavor': 'それは如何なる刃も恐れず、如何なる骨も残さない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533593&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e4536f08-340b-45d1-b2ea-a954f8777bba', 'multiverseId': 533593}, 'multiverseid': 533593}, {'name': 'Limo Ácido', 'text': 'Toque mortífero\\nQuando Limo Ácido entrar no campo de batalha, destrua o artefato, encantamento ou terreno alvo.', 'type': 'Criatura — Lodo', 'flavor': 'Ele não teme nenhuma espada, e não deixa nenhum osso para trás.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=533804&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5c148a89-6ad4-4b70-b44a-9d7371c81cb9', 'multiverseId': 533804}, 'multiverseid': 533804}, {'name': 'Кислотная Слизь', 'text': 'Смертельное касание\\nКогда Кислотная Слизь выходит на поле битвы, уничтожьте целевой артефакт, чары или землю.', 'type': 'Существо — Тина', 'flavor': 'Она не боится мечей и не оставляет после себя ни косточки.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534015&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4c223afb-f1fe-4182-8da2-d82350170d68', 'multiverseId': 534015}, 'multiverseid': 534015}, {'name': '酸液黏菌', 'text': '死触\\n当酸液黏菌进战场时，消灭目标神器，结界或地。', 'type': '生物 ～流浆', 'flavor': '它迎刀剑而上，身后尸骨无存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534226&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '411b3dc4-06bc-48b4-b8dd-df52851e6940', 'multiverseId': 534226}, 'multiverseid': 534226}, {'name': '酸液黏菌', 'text': '死觸\\n當酸液黏菌進戰場時，消滅目標神器，結界或地。', 'type': '生物 ～流漿', 'flavor': '它迎刀劍而上，身後屍骨無存。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=534437&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b37174c9-a788-44fd-a77f-a106abf74ef6', 'multiverseId': 534437}, 'multiverseid': 534437}]"]
